INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 1, 1, 1, 'Chapter 0 Introduction');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 1, 2, 1, 'This book contains extracts from emails that I wrote to my four sons');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 1, 3, 1, 'when they were single and away from home. They were studying in colleges');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 1, 4, 1, 'at first and then working. They were in their late teens and in their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 1, 5, 1, 'twenties at that time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 1, 6, 1, 'Fathers are told to bring up their children " in the instruction of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 1, 7, 1, 'Lord". So, most of what I wrote was instruction from the Word of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 1, 8, 1, 'that would lead them to be devoted to the Lord Jesus. I wanted them to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 1, 9, 1, 'be established from a young age in the truths of God''s Word, since I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 1, 10, 1, 'knew that, that alone would preserve them as young men in the midst of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 1, 11, 1, '"an evil and adulterous generation" (Matthew 16:4). I also wanted them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 1, 12, 1, 'to be able to share God''s truth accurately with others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 1, 13, 1, 'I emphasised and repeated some matters many times in my mails, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 1, 14, 1, 'of their paramount importance. Some matters are repeated numerous times');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 1, 15, 1, 'in the New Testament too, for the same reason. I emphasised holiness,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 1, 16, 1, 'taking up the cross and the overcoming life primarily - because these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 1, 17, 1, 'important truths were not being emphasised in Christendom in general.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 1, 18, 1, 'I exhorted my sons in those days to listen regularly to cassettetapes of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 1, 19, 1, 'my messages. Today, you can watch my messages on YouTube and on the CFC');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 1, 20, 1, 'website - www.cfcindia.com');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 1, 21, 1, 'One chapter in this book contains the advice I gave them on choosing a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 1, 22, 1, 'life-partner and getting married. All four of them followed my advice');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 1, 23, 1, 'and married godly young women, as described in that chapter. For this I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 1, 24, 1, 'am deeply thankful to the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 1, 25, 1, 'I only planted the seeds that God gave me. God watered the seeds,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 1, 26, 1, 'nurtured the plants and brought forth fruit in their lives. I give God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 1, 27, 1, 'all the glory for His working in their lives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 1, 28, 1, 'It is more than 25 years now since I wrote some of these letters. My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 2, 1, 1, 'views remain the same and I stand by everything that I wrote then.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 2, 2, 1, 'I have combined all the emails together here, removing headings, dates,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 2, 3, 1, 'greetings, names and signature lines, since these would serve no purpose');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 2, 4, 1, 'in this book.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 2, 5, 1, 'This book has been divided into chapters only to make it easier to read.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 2, 6, 1, 'The chapters have not been divided subject-wise or in any order of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 2, 7, 1, 'priority.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 2, 8, 1, '90% of what I wrote to my sons would be equally applicable to young');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 2, 9, 1, 'girls as well. So they too can read this book.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 2, 10, 1, 'This book should be read slowly, for it contains the substance of many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 2, 11, 1, 'mails on different topics. There is "strong meat" here, and not just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 2, 12, 1, '"milk". So my recommendation would be that you read only one chapter a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 2, 13, 1, 'day and stop and think about what you have read and absorb the truths in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 2, 14, 1, 'that chapter, before moving on. And let me urge you to look up all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 2, 15, 1, 'Scriptures quoted herein and meditate on them. In that way, your life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 2, 16, 1, 'can be radically changed for the better - in a very short time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 2, 17, 1, 'I pray that this book will be a blessing to all young people who read');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 2, 18, 1, 'it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 2, 19, 1, 'Bangalore January 2017');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 2, 20, 1, 'Zac Poonen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 2, 21, 2, 'Chapter 1 Chapter 1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 2, 22, 2, 'God''s Plan for Your Life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 2, 23, 2, 'Even though you are a disciple of Jesus, there will continue to be ups');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 2, 24, 2, 'and downs in your life, as with all of us. However, the decision you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 2, 25, 2, 'took to be a disciple will remain unchanged. You have chosen to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 2, 26, 2, 'married spiritually to the Lord Jesus and to follow Him forever. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 2, 27, 2, 'will never go back on that decision. And you made that decision not for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 2, 28, 2, 'any personal gain or profit, but only because you felt a tremendous debt');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 3, 1, 2, 'of gratitude to the Lord for what He had done for you. You love Him now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 3, 2, 2, 'because He first loved you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 3, 3, 2, 'God''s will for you now is that your path (the path of the righteous)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 3, 4, 2, 'should go from one degree of glory to another (Prov.4:18). So each year');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 3, 5, 2, 'should be a more glorious one for you than the years gone by - with a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 3, 6, 2, 'greater degree of purity and humility and love than you had before. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 3, 7, 2, 'should be your goal.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 3, 8, 2, 'God also has a ministry for you in His church in the days to come. So,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 3, 9, 2, 'make purity and humility and love, your goals all the days of your life,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 3, 10, 2, 'because the Lord cannot use vessels that are unclean or proud. May the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 3, 11, 2, 'Lord make you flaming, Spirit-filled witnesses for Him. Seek God for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 3, 12, 2, 'power of the Holy Spirit, and always remain rooted and grounded in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 3, 13, 2, 'fear of God and in humility (Prov.22:4). God preserves those who fear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 3, 14, 2, 'Him, and He gives His grace to the humble.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 3, 15, 2, 'Your feelings will fluctuate and are therefore always undependable. True');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 3, 16, 2, 'spirituality however lies in your decision to set your will on God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 3, 17, 2, 'side. So train your will to refuse to get discouraged. Overcome Satan''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 3, 18, 2, 'accusations by the blood of Jesus that cleanses you from sin as soon as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 3, 19, 2, 'you confess it (Rev.12:11).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 3, 20, 2, 'Those Whom Jesus Accepted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 3, 21, 2, 'Honesty is the main thing that God requires from all of us. In Psalm 51');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 3, 22, 2, '(read this in the Living Bible), we see the attitude of heart that David');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 3, 23, 2, 'had, that made God accept him (even though he had committed adultery');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 3, 24, 2, 'with a woman and then killed her husband). In contrast, we see the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 3, 25, 2, 'honour-seeking attitude of Saul (1 Sam.15:30), that made God reject him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 3, 26, 2, 'for what was apparently a small mistake. Dishonesty and hypocrisy are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 3, 27, 2, 'like a little bit of yeast in dough. They can''t be hidden for long.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 3, 28, 2, 'Their effects will become manifest sooner or later. You must fear these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 4, 1, 2, 'evils more than anything else.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 4, 2, 2, 'Consider why some people could not come to Jesus when He was on earth:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 4, 3, 2, '- The Pharisees - because they were self-righteous, despised others, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 4, 4, 2, 'justified themselves;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 4, 5, 2, '- The scribes and the doctors of the Law - because they were proud of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 4, 6, 2, 'their intellect and their Bible-knowledge;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 4, 7, 2, '- The rich young ruler - because he loved his money too much and was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 4, 8, 2, 'unwilling to give up the one thing that Jesus told him to give up.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 4, 9, 2, '- The two would-be disciples (mentioned in Luke 9:59-62) - because they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 4, 10, 2, 'were too attached to their relatives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 4, 11, 2, 'Now look at the people who could freely come to the Lord:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 4, 12, 2, '- an outcast leper (Matt.8:1-4);');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 4, 13, 2, '- a woman caught in adultery (Jn.8:1-11);');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 4, 14, 2, '- Peter, even after he had denied the Lord thrice (Jn.21:15-17); \');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 4, 15, 2, '- a Roman military man (Matt.8:5-13);');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 4, 16, 2, '- a Canaanite woman (Matt.15:21-28).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 4, 17, 2, 'The last two in this list were non-Israelis. Yet in the gospels, these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 4, 18, 2, 'arethe only two whom the Lord publicly praised for their great faith.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 4, 19, 2, 'Read those passages and you will see their deep humility, in their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 4, 20, 2, 'attitude towards the Lord. Great faith is always linked closely with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 4, 21, 2, 'great humility . Only the poor in spirit can come to the Lord; and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 4, 22, 2, 'kingdom of heaven belongs to such people. Remember this all your life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 4, 23, 2, 'Justification');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 4, 24, 2, 'Many of God''s children do not have boldness to come before God, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 4, 25, 2, 'they are constantly weighed down with feelings of condemnation. It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 4, 26, 2, 'important for you to know for certain that you have been justified');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 4, 27, 2, '(declared righteous) by God, because you have repented of your sin and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 4, 28, 2, 'trusted in Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 5, 1, 2, 'To be "in Christ" (an expression that is often used in `Ephesians'') is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 5, 2, 2, 'to have Christ clothe you. Now you can approach God as freely as Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 5, 3, 2, 'Himself can. Your past sins - however many, and however serious and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 5, 4, 2, 'great - have not only been forgiven, they have also been cleansed away.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 5, 5, 2, 'They are no longer remembered by God against you (Heb.8:12). You have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 5, 6, 2, 'now become " the righteousness of God in Christ" (2 Cor.5:21).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 5, 7, 2, 'God has not only placed your sins on Christ, He has also clothed you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 5, 8, 2, 'with Christ''s righteousness. Otherwise it would have been impossible for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 5, 9, 2, 'you to stand in His holy presence, where even angels have to cover their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 5, 10, 2, 'faces. Now having been declared righteous, you are to keep your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 5, 11, 2, 'conscience clean at all times, by immediate confession of sin to God and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 5, 12, 2, 'man (Acts 24:16), so that you can always have boldness of access to God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 5, 13, 2, '(1 John 3:21). You must never lose that boldness, because it brings a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 5, 14, 2, 'great reward (Heb.10:35).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 5, 15, 2, 'You must never be fearful when approaching your Heavenly Father. Always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 5, 16, 2, 'go to Him with boldness; because feelings of condemnation are never from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 5, 17, 2, 'God. He doesn''t give His children the crumbs that fall from the table,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 5, 18, 2, 'but the children''s bread. He wants even prodigal sons who have only just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 5, 19, 2, 'come back from the far country, to sit at His right hand, immediately.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 5, 20, 2, 'Forgiveness and Justification');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 5, 21, 2, 'It is very important that you overcome Satan''s accusations by confessing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 5, 22, 2, 'that the blood of Jesus has justified you (declared you not just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 5, 23, 2, 'forgiven but righteous) (Rev.12:11). There is a vast difference between');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 5, 24, 2, 'forgiveness and justification. If a person is charged in a court and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 5, 25, 2, 'charges are proved against him, but the judge lets him off because the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 5, 26, 2, 'man is repentant, he can walk out of the court happy butwith his head');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 5, 27, 2, 'hanging down - for he is a forgiven criminal. If on the other hand, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 5, 28, 2, 'judge, after carefully examining all the charges against him, finds all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 6, 1, 2, 'the charges to be false and declares the man to be 100% righteous, then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 6, 2, 2, 'he can walk out of the court with his head held high - because no guilt');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 6, 3, 2, 'was found in him and he has been declared righteous. That is how God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 6, 4, 2, 'justifies us (declares us righteous). God is called the " Lifter of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 6, 5, 2, 'head" (Psa.3:3-KJV).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 6, 6, 2, 'Many believers have their heads hanging down because they have not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 6, 7, 2, 'understood the power of the blood of Christ to justify them. They have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 6, 8, 2, 'only heard of its power to forgive them. Hebrews 8:12 says that God will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 6, 9, 2, 'not remember our sins any more. That means that he looks on usjust as if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 6, 10, 2, 'we had never sinned in our entire life. " His mercies are new every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 6, 11, 2, 'morning" (Lament.3:23) means that God looks at us each morning just as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 6, 12, 2, 'if He had never forgiven us even once before. This is why you must never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 6, 13, 2, 'allow feelings of condemnation to come upon you at any time - for that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 6, 14, 2, 'is unbelief in the goodness and the mercy of God. " His goodness and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 6, 15, 2, 'mercy will follow you all the days of our life and you will dwell in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 6, 16, 2, 'house of the Lord forever " (Psa.23:6).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 6, 17, 2, 'Satan gets power over us whenever he can get us discouraged or feeling');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 6, 18, 2, 'condemned. We don''t become devoted to the Lord by fear of judgment, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 6, 19, 2, 'by responding to His tremendous kindness and goodness in repeatedly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 6, 20, 2, 'forgiving us so much. "He who is forgiven much loves much", Jesus said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 6, 21, 2, '(Lk.7:47). I have an obligation to love the Lord greatly today because I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 6, 22, 2, 'have been forgiven much. I cannot but live the rest of my life for Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 6, 23, 2, 'And in eternity I do not expect a reward for my labours. His having');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 6, 24, 2, 'forgiven me so much is by itself enough reward. As someone has said:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 6, 25, 2, '"I cannot work my soul to save');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 6, 26, 2, 'For that my Lord has done.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 6, 27, 2, 'But I will work like any slave');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 6, 28, 2, 'For love of God''s dear Son".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 7, 1, 2, 'May that be your song too - all the days of your life, and then you will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 7, 2, 2, 'be a happy man, whether you have much or little of this world''s goods.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 7, 3, 2, 'Whom God Justifies');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 7, 4, 2, 'Consider an Old Testament picture of justification. Leviticus 13 deals');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 7, 5, 2, 'with instructions concerning those who had contracted leprosy (a picture');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 7, 6, 2, 'of sin). Verses 9 to 17 are most instructive. A small, white patch was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 7, 7, 2, 'called ''chronic leprosy'' (v.10, 11). But when the leprosy had spread and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 7, 8, 2, 'covered the entire body, the man was declared ''Clean'' (v.12, 13)! But if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 7, 9, 2, 'even a small spot of raw flesh came up again somewhere in his body, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 7, 10, 2, 'was categorised as leprous again (v.14, 15). If it again became totally');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 7, 11, 2, 'white, then he was clean once again (v.16, 17).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 7, 12, 2, 'Consider the application of this for us today. As long as you think that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 7, 13, 2, 'there is something good in you (just a small patch of goodness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 7, 14, 2, 'somewhere), you will be unclean in God''s sight. But the moment you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 7, 15, 2, 'acknowledge that you are totally corrupt ("Nothing good dwells in my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 7, 16, 2, 'flesh" - Rom.7:18), without even the smallest patch of goodness, then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 7, 17, 2, 'God will declare you clean!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 7, 18, 2, 'If some action of yours has brought confusion or hurt to others, and you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 7, 19, 2, 'justify it by saying that your intentions were good, then you still have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 7, 20, 2, 'leprosy. But if you confess that your flesh is totally evil, and that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 7, 21, 2, 'nothing good could possibly be found in it (Rom.7:18), then God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 7, 22, 2, 'justifies you. You are clean.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 7, 23, 2, 'The principle is this: God justifies those who do not justify');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 7, 24, 2, 'themselves.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 7, 25, 2, 'The Pharisee in the temple, who saw some good in himself went away');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 7, 26, 2, 'condemned by God. But the tax-collector who saw nothing good in himself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 7, 27, 2, 'went away justified (Lk.18:14). Be quick then to acknowledge your total');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 7, 28, 2, 'corruption and sin at all times, so that God can justify you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 8, 1, 2, 'immediately.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 8, 2, 2, 'Facing the Accuser');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 8, 3, 2, 'In the early part of your Christian life you will have many ups and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 8, 4, 2, 'downs. The graph of your life will have many deep dips. But as you go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 8, 5, 2, 'on, those dips will become shallower. So don''t get discouraged by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 8, 6, 2, 'failures. Get up and keep going.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 8, 7, 2, 'Those who are tormented by some terrible failure in their past life must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 8, 8, 2, 'stop listening to the accusations of Satan. Believe that the blood of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 8, 9, 2, 'Christ has cleansed you from all your sins (Rev.12:11). Then give Satan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 8, 10, 2, 'the word of your testimony from Hebrews 8:12 that God has promised never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 8, 11, 2, 'to remember your past sins any more. Demons and evil men may remember');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 8, 12, 2, 'your past and hold it against you, and may seek to even torture you with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 8, 13, 2, 'those memories. But God will never do that. If you are in doubt about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 8, 14, 2, 'God''s forgiveness, because you are overwhelmed by the memory of some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 8, 15, 2, 'past sin, then confess that sin one last time to God right now, and ask');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 8, 16, 2, 'the Lord to forgive you, believing that God is faithful and righteous to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 8, 17, 2, 'forgive you. Thereafter never ever think about that sin again. Thus we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 8, 18, 2, 'glorify the power of the blood of Jesus and the great mercy of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 8, 19, 2, 'We must overcome the accusations of Satan and put Satan to flight at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 8, 20, 2, 'speed of lightning (Lk.10:18). We must know that the Lord " does not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 8, 21, 2, 'remember the sins of our youth...and He does not allow the enemy to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 8, 22, 2, 'triumph over us. So we are not ashamed " (Psa.25:1, 7). That verse in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 8, 23, 2, 'Psalm 25 tells us that even David had " sins of his youth" although he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 8, 24, 2, 'is wise not to tell us what those sins were. Even in Psalm 51, he only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 8, 25, 2, 'refers to sin in general and never makes any reference to any specific');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 8, 26, 2, 'sin. This is wisdom, and this is how we must acknowledge our sin before');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 8, 27, 2, 'men always - never be specific about sin, unless we have sinned against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 8, 28, 2, 'them. We must be specific with God, but never with man. This is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 9, 1, 2, 'folly of the Roman Catholic confessional, which principle is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 9, 2, 2, 'unfortunately practised by many charismatic and cult-groups as well.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 9, 3, 2, 'Ephesians 2:7 tells us that in the ages of eternity, God is going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 9, 4, 2, 'take us and show us forth as trophies of His grace - not trophies of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 9, 5, 2, 'faithfulness, but of His grace. Think how Satan''s mouth will be shut in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 9, 6, 2, 'that day, when God holds forth the vilest of sinners and shows everyone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 9, 7, 2, 'what His grace made of them. He will also show forth believers who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 9, 8, 2, 'failed (like Peter) and how they too were transformed. The angels will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 9, 9, 2, 'be amazed at what God was able to do in the lives of sinful wretches and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 9, 10, 2, 'failing believers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 9, 11, 3, 'Chapter 2 Chapter 2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 9, 12, 3, 'The Baptism of the Holy Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 9, 13, 3, 'Acts 2:38 makes it clear that to receive the Holy Spirit, all that Peter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 9, 14, 3, 'required from those who were convicted of their sins was this: " Repent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 9, 15, 3, 'and be baptized for the forgiveness of your sins - and you shall receive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 9, 16, 3, 'the gift of the Holy Spirit ." Receiving the Holy Spirit is the same as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 9, 17, 3, 'receiving Christ into your heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 9, 18, 3, 'Romans 8:9 says: " If anyone does not have the Spirit of Christ (the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 9, 19, 3, 'Holy Spirit), he doesn''t belong to Him ". In other words, such a person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 9, 20, 3, 'is not even born again. When we ask Jesus to come into our hearts, it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 9, 21, 3, 'His Spirit (the Spirit of Christ, the Holy Spirit) Who comes in, for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 9, 22, 3, 'Jesus Himself is in heaven. Then we are born again (or born of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 9, 23, 3, 'Spirit).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 9, 24, 3, 'The baptism (immersion) of the Spirit however refers to being filled');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 9, 25, 3, 'with the Spirit. Only those who thirst to be filled will be filled, as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 9, 26, 3, 'Jesus said in John 7:37. You must yield every area of your heart to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 9, 27, 3, 'Lord and ask Him in faith to fill you. The fire of the Holy Spirit comes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 9, 28, 3, 'from heaven and not from any man. You don''t have to go to any meeting to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 10, 1, 3, 'get that heavenly fire. God meets with sincere hearts wherever they are.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 10, 2, 3, 'You can seek the Lord in your own room and He will meet with you there.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 10, 3, 3, 'Some of the greatest men of God received the baptism (fullness) of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 10, 4, 3, 'Spirit when they were alone in a room. God is a rewarder of all who seek');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 10, 5, 3, 'Him diligently.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 10, 6, 3, 'God''s promise (through Joel) that Peter quoted on the day of Pentecost');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 10, 7, 3, 'was: "Upon My bond-slaves I will pour out My Spirit" (Acts 2:18). A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 10, 8, 3, 'bond-slave is one who has no rights. To be a bond-slave is to let God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 10, 9, 3, 'have total sway over your life. It means that henceforth, you allow God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 10, 10, 3, 'to deal with you exactly as He wishes, without any complaints from your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 10, 11, 3, 'side.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 10, 12, 3, 'Being filled with the Spirit, Jesus said, was very similar to drinking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 10, 13, 3, 'water (John 7:37-39). Paul uses the same picture in 1 Cor.10:4 and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 10, 14, 3, '12:13. But just as in drinking water, you have to open your mouth and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 10, 15, 3, 'swallow, even so in being filled with the Spirit, you have to open every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 10, 16, 3, 'part of your heart and receive - in simple faith. Whenever you ask God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 10, 17, 3, 'for anything according to His will, you must believe that you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 10, 18, 3, 'received what you have asked for (Mark 11:24). So surrender every area');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 10, 19, 3, 'of your life to the Lord and then ask Him in faith to fill you with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 10, 20, 3, 'Holy Spirit. Then thank God that He has heard your prayer. The mouth is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 10, 21, 3, 'the overflow-valve of the heart through which we express our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 10, 22, 3, 'thanksgiving (Matt.12:34). So keep thanking God and ask Him to give you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 10, 23, 3, 'an assurance that He has filled you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 10, 24, 3, 'The Gifts of the Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 10, 25, 3, 'The fullness of the Spirit is not a matter of mere emotional excitement.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 10, 26, 3, 'Unfortunately many are satisfied with just that. But what you need is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 10, 27, 3, 'power to live in victory and to be a bold witness for Christ. Seek for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 10, 28, 3, 'that continuously. Jesus said, " You shall receive power when the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 11, 1, 3, 'Spirit has come upon you and you shall be My witnesses " (Acts 1:8). The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 11, 2, 3, 'evidence of the fullness of the Spirit, Jesus said would be power. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 11, 3, 3, 'purpose of the fullness of the Spirit, Jesus said here, was that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 11, 4, 3, 'might be His witnesses - not just bear witness to Him but BE His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 11, 5, 3, 'witnesses - by our life and our words.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 11, 6, 3, 'So be bold to seek the Lord for the gift of prophecy (obeying the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 11, 7, 3, 'commands in 1 Cor.14:1 and 39). Then you will be able to share God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 11, 8, 3, 'Word powerfully to others, according to the spiritual need of each');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 11, 9, 3, 'person - both privately as well as in church-meetings. To prophesy is to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 11, 10, 3, 'speak to people (privately or publicly) with words that will encourage');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 11, 11, 3, 'them, comfort them and build them up (1 Cor.14:3). This is the most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 11, 12, 3, 'important gift of the Spirit that you must seek for. God wants you to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 11, 13, 3, 'bold. So drive the spirit of timidity away from you - for that is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 11, 14, 3, 'from God. (2 Tim.1:7).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 11, 15, 3, 'In Luke 11:5-13 we see how it was a concern for his friend that made');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 11, 16, 3, 'that man to go to his neighbour''s house at midnight to get food for his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 11, 17, 3, 'guest. Jesus went on to say that it was thus that we are to seek for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 11, 18, 3, 'gifts of the Spirit (Lk.11:13). God will give this gift of prophecy to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 11, 19, 3, 'those who have a care and a concern for the spiritual needs of those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 11, 20, 3, 'whom they know and meet.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 11, 21, 3, 'You need to be filled with the Spirit again and again, for this is not a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 11, 22, 3, 'once-for-all experience. Thirst and faith are the only two conditions');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 11, 23, 3, 'for that. Claim John 7:37-39, in the Name of Jesus, as your birthright.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 11, 24, 3, 'It is good to have a promise to claim when you go to God in prayer. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 11, 25, 3, 'will make you bold, and will also prove that you are not coming to God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 11, 26, 3, 'as a beggar, but as a son who is entitled to the "children''s bread" -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 11, 27, 3, 'and not to the crumbs that fall from the table.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 11, 28, 3, 'Speaking in Tongues');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 12, 1, 3, 'And now a word about the gift of speaking in unknown tongues (languages)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 12, 2, 3, '- since this is often associated with the fullness of the Spirit. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 12, 3, 3, 'does not give this gift to everyone - because He sees that everyone does');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 12, 4, 3, 'not need it. 1 Cor.12:30 is very clear that " all do not speak in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 12, 5, 3, 'tongues". So be open to God and leave it to Him to decide whether He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 12, 6, 3, 'wants you to have it or not.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 12, 7, 3, 'Seek God first of all, to give you the power of the Spirit to control');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 12, 8, 3, 'your tongue in your normal speech, from sins like anger, lying, etc.,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 12, 9, 3, 'That is far more important than having the gift of speaking in unknown');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 12, 10, 3, 'tongues. James 3:2 days that one who does not sin in his speech is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 12, 11, 3, 'perfect man. Speaking in unknown tongues however has not made anyone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 12, 12, 3, 'perfect.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 12, 13, 3, 'What is the purpose of speaking in tongues? When we praise God, we find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 12, 14, 3, 'that the English language is limited. Our heart is full, but what is in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 12, 15, 3, 'our heart has to pass through the narrow pipe of the English language in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 12, 16, 3, 'our mind before it comes out of our mouth. But if the mind is bypassed,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 12, 17, 3, 'then the abundance in our heart can go straight from our heart to our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 12, 18, 3, 'mouth. We can then express whatever is filling our heart (abundance of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 12, 19, 3, 'thanksgiving or pressure caused by grief) to God, in syllables that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 12, 20, 3, 'don''t understand, but that God understands very well, for He listens to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 12, 21, 3, 'the heart. Thus the pressure on the heart is relieved through being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 12, 22, 3, 'expressed. 1 Cor.14:14 says that our mind cannot understand what we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 12, 23, 3, 'saying, when we speak in tongues. So we don''t try to analyse our speech');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 12, 24, 3, 'when we speak in tongues.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 12, 25, 3, 'Faith is not against reason, but it is far beyond reason - just like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 12, 26, 3, 'calculus is far ahead of simple addition. We live in a world where so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 12, 27, 3, 'much emphasis is placed on the mind and the reason. But the human spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 12, 28, 3, 'that God has placed within us is greater than our mind. That is why our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 13, 1, 3, 'mind cannot understand the language of our spirit. We do not destroy our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 13, 2, 3, 'intellect, for it is a wonderful gift of God, but we do have to dethrone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 13, 3, 3, 'it. Paul said that he spoke in tongues more than everyone else - perhaps');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 13, 4, 3, 'because he faced more pressure in his ministry than all the others and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 13, 5, 3, 'therefore needed it more than the others (1 Cor.14:18).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 13, 6, 3, 'The gift of speaking in tongues can help us when we are discouraged,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 13, 7, 3, 'when we are under pressure, when we can''t think of anything particular');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 13, 8, 3, 'to pray about, when we don''t know how to pray about a complicated');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 13, 9, 3, 'situation, or when we are just too tired to concentrate and want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 13, 10, 3, 'relax. We can lie down in our bed and pray in tongues. With the gift of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 13, 11, 3, 'tongues, you can pour out your heart to your heavenly Father, in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 13, 12, 3, 'syllables that you don''t understand yourself, but that expresses your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 13, 13, 3, 'heart''s deepest longings.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 13, 14, 3, 'I got an encouraging letter from a young brother who could not come for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 13, 15, 3, 'our Discipleship Seminar last December. But he was eager to listen to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 13, 16, 3, 'the tapes of the Seminar. When he listened to the tape of the meeting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 13, 17, 3, 'where we had spoken about being filled with the Holy Spirit, he got a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 13, 18, 3, 'great thirst for this himself. He decided to seek God like Jacob who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 13, 19, 3, 'said to the Lord, " I will not let You go, until You bless me"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 13, 20, 3, '(Gen.32:26). He went to his room and prayed but found that there was no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 13, 21, 3, 'burden in his prayer and no longing. As he searched his heart, he saw');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 13, 22, 3, 'that there was one thing in his life that he had not surrendered to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 13, 23, 3, 'Lord. That one thing was not something sinful. But it still took the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 13, 24, 3, 'place that the Lord should have in his life. Immediately he surrendered');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 13, 25, 3, 'it to the Lord - and God poured out His Spirit on him and he began to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 13, 26, 3, 'speak in tongues and he wept with tears of joy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 13, 27, 3, 'It was really encouraging to hear how God met with someone who could not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 13, 28, 3, 'come for the seminar. I was reminded of Numbers 11:25-29 which says: "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 14, 1, 3, 'The Lord came down in the cloud and took of the Spirit Who was upon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 14, 2, 3, 'Moses and placed Him upon the seventy elders. And it came about that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 14, 3, 3, 'when the Spirit rested upon them, they prophesied. But two men had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 14, 4, 3, 'remained in the camp; the name of one was Eldad and the name of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 14, 5, 3, 'other Medad. And the Spirit rested upon them and they prophesied in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 14, 6, 3, 'camp. So a young man ran and told Moses and said, `Eldad and Medad are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 14, 7, 3, 'prophesying in the camp''. Then Joshua said, `Moses, my lord, restrain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 14, 8, 3, 'them.'' But Moses said to him, `Are you jealous for my sake? Would that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 14, 9, 3, 'ALL the Lord''s people were prophets, that the Lord would put His Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 14, 10, 3, 'upon them! ''"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 14, 11, 3, 'The God Who worked like that in Moses'' time is just the same today.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 14, 12, 3, 'There is no partiality with God. He is a rewarder of all who diligently');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 14, 13, 3, 'seek Him in humility. The clever and the intelligent usually get left');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 14, 14, 3, 'out - not because of their intelligence, but because of their pride.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 14, 15, 3, 'It is important to notice what it says in Acts 2:4 about the disciples');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 14, 16, 3, 'speaking in tongues on the day of Pentecost. Read that verse carefully.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 14, 17, 3, 'It was the disciples themselves who opened their mouth and used their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 14, 18, 3, 'tongues, when they spoke in tongues. The Holy Spirit did not move their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 14, 19, 3, 'tongues. He does not move anybody''s tongue. It is only evil spirits who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 14, 20, 3, 'control people in such a way that they move people''s tongues. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 14, 21, 3, 'casting out demons, I have heard evil spirits speak through people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 14, 22, 3, 'Those people had no control over their tongue at such times, because the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 14, 23, 3, 'evil spirit moved it. The Holy Spirit however does not operate like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 14, 24, 3, 'that. He only gives us the gift. He expects us to move our tongues');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 14, 25, 3, 'ourselves to exercise the gift He gives us - exactly as we do, when He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 14, 26, 3, 'gives us the gift of preaching (prophecy). So, " open your mouth wide -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 14, 27, 3, 'and God will fill it" (Psa.81:10).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 14, 28, 3, 'When you receive the gift of tongues, use it only in your private prayer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 15, 1, 3, '- especially when you don''t know what to say to God. This gift is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 15, 2, 3, 'essentially for our private communion with God and not primarily for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 15, 3, 3, 'public use. It can be exercised in a church-meeting only if there is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 15, 4, 3, 'someone there with the gift of interpreting tongues (1 Cor.14:28). Since');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 15, 5, 3, 'we won''t often know whether anyone has the gift of interpretation, it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 15, 6, 3, 'safest to use the gift in private only - as Paul did (1 Corinthians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 15, 7, 3, '14:18,19). But, as I said earlier, seek more earnestly for purity in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 15, 8, 3, 'your normal speech.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 15, 9, 3, 'Don''t discuss this subject with Christians who don''t believe in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 15, 10, 3, 'gifts of the Spirit - because it will lead to unnecessary arguments.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 15, 11, 3, 'Some Christians despise this gift of the Spirit - and it is easy when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 15, 12, 3, 'mingling with such believers to slowly devalue this gift yourself. Don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 15, 13, 3, 'ever allow the Christendom around you to mould you into its way of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 15, 14, 3, 'thinking. Stick to the teaching of God''s Word.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 15, 15, 3, 'Jesus never needed to speak in tongues, because His mind had no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 15, 16, 3, 'limitations and was perfectly pure and because His fellowship with His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 15, 17, 3, 'Father was also perfect at all times. That is why speaking in tongues');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 15, 18, 3, 'will disappear when we get to heaven - when "the perfect has come" and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 15, 19, 3, '"we put away childish things" and " we see the Lord face to face" (1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 15, 20, 3, 'Cor.13:8-12). So the gift of tongues is only for temporary use in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 15, 21, 3, 'imperfect state here on earth. But prophesying is 2000 times superior to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 15, 22, 3, 'tongues in church-meetings (10,000/5; see 1 Cor.14:19) - because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 15, 23, 3, 'prophesying is proclaiming God''s Word to encourage and build up others');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 15, 24, 3, '(1 Cor.14:3).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 15, 25, 3, 'The Holy Spirit says that if everyone in a church speaks in tongues at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 15, 26, 3, 'the same time it will rightly be called "a mad church " (1 Cor.14:23)!!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 15, 27, 3, 'So avoid such churches. But He also tells churches: " Do not forbid to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 15, 28, 3, 'speak in tongues" (1 Cor.14:39). That is the right balance.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 16, 1, 3, 'The Purpose of the Baptism in the Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 16, 2, 3, 'After I was filled with the Holy Spirit afresh in January1975, I decided');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 16, 3, 3, 'to read the New Testament all over again, from Matthew chapter 1. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 16, 4, 3, 'very first day, what I got from the Word was an assurance of my being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 16, 5, 3, 'filled with the Spirit. I read of how Mary conceived through the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 16, 6, 3, 'Spirit. The Spirit came upon her just like He came upon me. And I learnt');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 16, 7, 3, 'the following truths from Matthew 1:18-23 that day:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 16, 8, 3, '- Even as only Mary (and no-one else) knew what the Spirit had done for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 16, 9, 3, 'her - so will it be for me too;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 16, 10, 3, '- For many months, Mary and others had no external proof in her body');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 16, 11, 3, 'that she was pregnant. I too may have no external consciousness of what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 16, 12, 3, 'the Spirit has done in me for a long time. I will have to live by faith.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 16, 13, 3, 'But as time went on, Mary and others could see. And as time goes on, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 16, 14, 3, 'will become more and more manifest to me and to others also as to what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 16, 15, 3, 'God has done;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 16, 16, 3, '- Others misunderstood Mary and spoke ill of her. I will face this too;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 16, 17, 3, '- The Spirit came upon Mary to bring forth the body of Jesus through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 16, 18, 3, 'her. With me too, the Spirit has come upon me first of all, to bring');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 16, 19, 3, 'forth the life of Christ through me; and secondly, that the body of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 16, 20, 3, 'Christ may be built through my labours.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 16, 21, 3, 'The baptism (filling) of the Spirit brings us into the realm of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 16, 22, 3, 'spiritual battle. God allows us to face conflict in our spirit, so that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 16, 23, 3, 'we may know the mighty authority that we have been given over Satan and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 16, 24, 3, 'all evil spirits. In Luke 10:19 Jesus said, "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 16, 25, 3, '." God permitted the disciples of Jesus to face a storm on the lake of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 16, 26, 3, 'Galilee so that they could experience the mighty power of the Lord to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 16, 27, 3, 'still it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 16, 28, 4, 'Chapter 3 Chapter 3');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 17, 1, 4, 'Temptation and Sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 17, 2, 4, 'Since life is so short, you must make full use of every temptation that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 17, 3, 4, 'you face in your lives to be an overcomer and thus acquire the heart of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 17, 4, 4, 'wisdom that you should present to God at the end of your earthly days');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 17, 5, 4, '(Psa.90:12). You must not leave this earth with any sins still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 17, 6, 4, 'unconquered in our lives. To be wholehearted is to have a burning desire');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 17, 7, 4, 'to present yourself to God without any spot (Heb.9:14).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 17, 8, 4, 'There is a difference between temptation and sin. If an evil thought');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 17, 9, 4, 'flashes into your mind, that is temptation. If you dwell on it, or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 17, 10, 4, 'accept it, then it becomes sin. When you see a girl and you are tempted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 17, 11, 4, 'to lust after her, that is temptation. If you continue to look at her,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 17, 12, 4, 'or to think about her, you sin. The first look was temptation and is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 17, 13, 4, 'unavoidable. The second look is sin - and is avoidable. You don''t have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 17, 14, 4, 'to feel condemned when some temptation comes to our mind. Even Jesus was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 17, 15, 4, 'tempted in His mind. You can say "No" with your will. Then you will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 17, 16, 4, 'an overcomer. It is for strength to say "No" that Jesus cried and prayed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 17, 17, 4, 'for help (Heb.5:7). You must also cry out in the same way for help.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 17, 18, 4, 'Satan Has Been Defeated');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 17, 19, 4, 'Satan was defeated by Jesus on the cross, nearly 2000 years ago - and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 17, 20, 4, 'that is something that you must never forget. Today, we stand on that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 17, 21, 4, 'victory; we don''t fight to win the victory. Satan is too powerful and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 17, 22, 4, 'too clever for human beings. He has fooled and overcome billions of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 17, 23, 4, 'people through the centuries. But he will flee from you if your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 17, 24, 4, 'conscience is clear (when the blood of the Lamb has cleansed your heart)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 17, 25, 4, 'and when you speak to him and resist him in the Name of Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 17, 26, 4, '(Rev.12:11; James 4:7). Remember this always. I have believed and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 17, 27, 4, 'practised and preached this - and this is what Satan hates to hear.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 17, 28, 4, 'You must be rooted and grounded in the knowledge that Satan and all his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 18, 1, 4, 'demons were thoroughly defeated on the cross of Calvary, once and for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 18, 2, 4, 'all (Heb.2:14; Col.2:15). Then Satan won''t be able to put any fear of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 18, 3, 4, 'him, into you at any time. Remember thatGod is always on your side');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 18, 4, 4, 'against the Devil. "As Jesus is, so are you in the world" (1 Jn.4:17).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 18, 5, 4, 'It was in dreams that the Lord first encouraged me to believe in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 18, 6, 4, 'resisting Satan. I had dreams where I saw the devil running away from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 18, 7, 4, 'me. When I awoke in the night hours, I would resist Satan in Jesus''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 18, 8, 4, 'Name.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 18, 9, 4, 'Such conflict with Satan and his evil spirits will also help you to grow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 18, 10, 4, 'in discernment to distinguish between what is truly Divine and what is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 18, 11, 4, 'counterfeit. That which is Divine will always be characterized by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 18, 12, 4, 'Spirit of Christ - the spirit of honesty, humility, purity and love.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 18, 13, 4, 'Many are deceived because they think that all manifestations of power');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 18, 14, 4, 'are from God. But many such supernatural manifestations are from Satan.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 18, 15, 4, 'Be alert at all times to obey the little promptings of the Spirit - when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 18, 16, 4, 'He prompts you for example, to pray a quick prayer at some time, or to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 18, 17, 4, 'read a verse of Scripture, or to pray for someone, or to visit someone,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 18, 18, 4, 'or to speak to someone, or to apologize to someone, or to forgive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 18, 19, 4, 'someone, or to turn your eyes away from something evil, or to stop');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 18, 20, 4, 'listening to evil conversation, or to leave the presence of your friends');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 18, 21, 4, 'when the conversation is moving in an unedifying direction, or to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 18, 22, 4, 'bold to introduce a new direction in the conversation etc., By obeying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 18, 23, 4, 'such promptings of the Spirit, you can learn to live in the Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 18, 24, 4, 'The Importance of Discernment');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 18, 25, 4, 'As we approach the end of time there will be more and more of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 18, 26, 4, 'operation of the Holy Spirit in the church. Deceiving spirits also will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 18, 27, 4, 'operate more and more in the world. So you must watch out for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 18, 28, 4, 'following, if you are to avoid being deceived: (1) Emotional');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 19, 1, 4, 'counterfeits, (2) Extremism, (3) Phariseeism, and (4) Cultistic');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 19, 2, 4, 'attitudes. The enemy always works where the Spirit works. So don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 19, 3, 4, 'swallow everything that you see and hear. Be discerning.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 19, 4, 4, 'Noise and emotion may accompany the moving of the Spirit - and that does');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 19, 5, 4, 'help some people to be free from their human inhibitions and their fear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 19, 6, 4, 'of men. We don''t devalue our emotions, for they are a God-given part of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 19, 7, 4, 'our personality. But at the same time, we must not overvalue them, for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 19, 8, 4, 'God sees the heart and not the emotions. It is good to raise your voice');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 19, 9, 4, 'when you pray, because that will help you to be less conscious of others');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 19, 10, 4, 'around you. That is just like your closing your eyes when you pray, so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 19, 11, 4, 'that you can concentrate better, and not be distracted by others around');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 19, 12, 4, 'you. Such actions won''t make your prayers more spiritual, but they help');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 19, 13, 4, 'you to be free from your surroundings. The power of the Holy Spirit is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 19, 14, 4, 'not manifested by shouting, but by a holy life, a powerful ministry in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 19, 15, 4, 'the church, and an unashamed witness for the Lord in your place of work.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 19, 16, 4, 'There is tremendous power in the human soul (intellectual power,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 19, 17, 4, 'emotional power and will-power). And many exploit this (as in yoga) and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 19, 18, 4, 'imagine it to be the Spirit''s power. You must not be deceived by such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 19, 19, 4, 'power. The Holy Spirit will always glorify Christ - not men or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 19, 20, 4, 'experiences. So that is one sure way by which you can detect');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 19, 21, 4, 'counterfeits.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 19, 22, 4, 'Discipline');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 19, 23, 4, '" God has not given us the spirit of timidity but of power, love and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 19, 24, 4, 'discipline " (2 Tim.1:7). The Holy Spirit will eliminate all fear and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 19, 25, 4, 'timidity from your life and replace this with power, love and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 19, 26, 4, 'discipline.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 19, 27, 4, 'No one can become truly spiritual, without discipline. The fruit of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 19, 28, 4, 'Spirit is self-control (Gal.5:23). An undisciplined life is like a leaky');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 20, 1, 4, 'vessel. No matter how many times it is filled, it will become empty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 20, 2, 4, 'again. It will have to be filled repeatedly. Three areas in which you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 20, 3, 4, 'must seek to be more and more disciplined are: In the use of (1) your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 20, 4, 4, 'body, (2) your time, and (3) your money.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 20, 5, 4, 'Romans 8:13 states that we must put the deeds of the body to death');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 20, 6, 4, 'through the Spirit. These are not deeds done from the heart - for such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 20, 7, 4, 'deeds would be deliberate sins. These are deeds that come forth from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 20, 8, 4, 'body, because we allow the body to be undisciplined - for example, in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 20, 9, 4, 'the areas of overeating, oversleeping, laziness, or talkativeness etc.,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 20, 10, 4, 'The Holy Spirit wants to help us control our tongue especially.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 20, 11, 4, 'Ephesians 5:16 tells us to make the most of our time. So much of time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 20, 12, 4, 'that is wasted can be saved and used to study the Scriptures, if you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 20, 13, 4, 'disciplined. I don''t mean that you should not relax or play games, etc.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 20, 14, 4, 'You must not become an ascetic, for asceticism will bring you into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 20, 15, 4, 'bondage. But consider where you can "gather up the fragments" of time,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 20, 16, 4, 'as the disciples gathered up the fragments of the loaves, so that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 20, 17, 4, '"nothing is lost" (John 6:12). Be disciplined to make the most of your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 20, 18, 4, 'time, but don''t become a fanatic about it! Relax.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 20, 19, 4, 'In Luke 16:11, Jesus said that God would not give true spiritual riches');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 20, 20, 4, 'to those who were unfaithful with money. To be righteous with money is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 20, 21, 4, 'the first step - no cheating, clear all debts, etc. The next step is to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 20, 22, 4, 'be faithful - avoid wastage, extravagant living, useless luxuries, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 20, 23, 4, 'all unnecessary expenditure. Remember that the ones who get God''s best');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 20, 24, 4, 'in the Christian life are those who allow the Holy Spirit to discipline');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 20, 25, 4, 'their lives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 20, 26, 4, 'Devotion to Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 20, 27, 4, 'The Spirit has come into your heart - not to give you experiences, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 20, 28, 4, 'to glorify Jesus. So allow Him to draw you into a greater devotion to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 21, 1, 4, 'the Lord, and to show you the glory of Jesus more and more. The Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 21, 2, 4, 'seeks to fill your heart with the love of Jesus (a love that gave itself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 21, 3, 4, 'to save those who hated Him) so that you can love all of God''s people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 21, 4, 4, '(Rom.5:5).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 21, 5, 4, 'Preserve yourself always in the simplicity of devotion to Jesus (2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 21, 6, 4, 'Cor.11:3). This is the most important thing in the Christian life. Don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 21, 7, 4, 'ever get so complicated in your mind, thinking about various doctrines');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 21, 8, 4, 'and their explanations, that you lose your simple love for the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 21, 9, 4, 'When you are devoted to Jesus you will be devoted to the members of His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 21, 10, 4, 'Body in your local church as well. The Holy Spirit is not narrow-minded');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 21, 11, 4, 'like some of God''s children are, and He doesn''t split hairs over');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 21, 12, 4, 'peripheral doctrines, like some of them do! He sees the heart and not a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 21, 13, 4, 'person''s theological understanding. And wherever He sees sincere hearts,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 21, 14, 4, 'He works, even if their understanding of doctrine is imperfect. Peter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 21, 15, 4, 'recognized this when he went to Cornelius''s house, and said; "God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 21, 16, 4, 'doesn''t show partiality, but receives all those who fear Him and who do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 21, 17, 4, 'what is right" (Acts 10:34, 35). You must always be as large-hearted as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 21, 18, 4, 'the Holy Spirit is - towards all those who are genuinely God''s people in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 21, 19, 4, 'every group.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 21, 20, 4, 'The Danger of Being Exclusive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 21, 21, 4, 'Beware of exclusivism. Never cut off any of God''s children from your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 21, 22, 4, 'fellowship. This is what many cultistically-minded believers are doing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 21, 23, 4, 'today. Nehemiah built the walls of Jerusalem to protect the city from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 21, 24, 4, 'being attacked by enemies - but not to exclude any of the genuine sons');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 21, 25, 4, 'of Israel from entering the city. Satan and the world are what we must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 21, 26, 4, 'keep outside those walls, not the children of God who happen to disagree');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 21, 27, 4, 'with us! We may not be able to work with some believers, because of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 21, 28, 4, 'differences in doctrine etc. But we can fellowship with all believers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 22, 1, 4, 'In Zechariah 2:4, 5 God says that Jerusalem will be built"without any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 22, 2, 4, 'walls", because God Himself will be "a wall of fire" around the city. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 22, 3, 4, 'is the fire of the Holy Spirit that constitutes the church''s protecting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 22, 4, 4, 'wall today. If we allow this fire to burn in the church, the Holy Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 22, 5, 4, 'will keep it pure from all worldly influences. If God Himself is going');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 22, 6, 4, 'to be a wall of fire around us, then it is foolish for us to build');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 22, 7, 4, 'another " wall of rules and regulations", in order to keep our group');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 22, 8, 4, 'pure!! Such man-made walls always lead to exclusivism, Phariseeism and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 22, 9, 4, 'cultism (however apparently `Scriptural'' the names given to these walls');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 22, 10, 4, 'may be). Beware of being influenced by such extremists. Our duty is to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 22, 11, 4, 'proclaim the narrow gate of discipleship, as narrow as Jesus made it -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 22, 12, 4, 'but not more narrow!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 22, 13, 4, 'Even if other believers shut you out from their exclusive fellowship,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 22, 14, 4, 'you must still love them and be open and large-hearted towards them. As');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 22, 15, 4, 'this poem of Edwin Markham says:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 22, 16, 4, '"They drew a circle that shut me out - `Heretic'', `Rebel'' - a thing to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 22, 17, 4, 'flout.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 22, 18, 4, 'But love and I had the wit to win -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 22, 19, 4, 'We drew a circle that took them in!!"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 22, 20, 4, 'That''s the way to win - the way of love.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 22, 21, 4, 'When you know that you have been forgiven much, you will love the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 22, 22, 4, 'much (Lk.7:47). And you will love other believers too, even if they hold');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 22, 23, 4, 'different views from you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 22, 24, 5, 'Chapter 4 Chapter 4');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 22, 25, 5, 'The Lord Alone in Front of Us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 22, 26, 5, 'It is written about Jesus that He kept His Father always before Him, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 22, 27, 5, 'therefore His heart was always glad. He had " fullness of joy", and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 22, 28, 5, 'Father was always at Jesus'' right hand to support Him (Acts 2:25, 26,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 23, 1, 5, 'quoting Psa.16:10,11). So keep the Lord in front of you at all times and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 23, 2, 5, 'then fullness of joy will be your constant portion, and the Lord will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 23, 3, 5, 'at your right hand to support you always. So don''t allow people or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 23, 4, 5, 'circumstances to come between you and the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 23, 5, 5, 'Blessed are the pure in heart for they will see God (Matt.5:8) - and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 23, 6, 5, 'they will see only God in all situations, and not people and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 23, 7, 5, 'circumstances. When you are gripped by the beauty of Jesus, the pull of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 23, 8, 5, 'temptation will become less strong. And when you see people and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 23, 9, 5, 'circumstances through the Lord, you will be "at rest" in the assurance');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 23, 10, 5, 'that God will work in all those circumstances and through all those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 23, 11, 5, 'people, for your very best (Rom.8:28). You must develop the habit of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 23, 12, 5, 'being at rest in all situations, in the little trials of daily life that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 23, 13, 5, 'come to you now, so that you can overcome the greater ones that will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 23, 14, 5, 'come in the future.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 23, 15, 5, 'Never idolize any man or any man''s writings. Truly godly men and truly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 23, 16, 5, 'spiritual books will always point you to Jesus (The Living Word) and to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 23, 17, 5, 'the Bible (The Written Word). Follow only such men and read only such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 23, 18, 5, 'books.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 23, 19, 5, 'God''s Sovereignty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 23, 20, 5, 'The greatest manifestation of God''s power was not in creation but in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 23, 21, 5, 'death and resurrection of the Lord Jesus, when Satan was defeated');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 23, 22, 5, '(Eph.1:19, 20). The crucifixion of Jesus was the worst evil ever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 23, 23, 5, 'committed in man''s history. It was also the very best thing that ever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 23, 24, 5, 'happened on this earth. If God is powerful enough to convert the worst');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 23, 25, 5, 'event of history into the very best, then you can be certain that He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 23, 26, 5, 'will turn everything that happens in your life also into something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 23, 27, 5, 'glorious for you (Rom.8:28).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 23, 28, 5, 'God prefers to work in an unseen way, without pomp or show or trumpet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 24, 1, 5, 'blast. As a result, you may imagine at times, that some things happened');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 24, 2, 5, 'by coincidence or by chance, when actually they were specific answers to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 24, 3, 5, 'prayer - your own prayers and the prayers of others who were praying for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 24, 4, 5, 'you. "He is a God Who hides Himself" in the way He works (Isa.45:15). "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 24, 5, 5, 'How impossible it is for us to understand His methods" (Rom.11:33 -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 24, 6, 5, 'Living).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 24, 7, 5, 'Do the best you can - and leave the rest to God. He will sovereignly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 24, 8, 5, 'overrule in every matter that concerns you. Even your mistakes and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 24, 9, 5, 'failures will be turned to spiritual profit by the Lord. This is the God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 24, 10, 5, 'we worship - One Who rules over all matters on this earth. So you don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 24, 11, 5, 'have to live in regret over any mistakes you may have made. Don''t let');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 24, 12, 5, 'Satan rob you of your joy by such regret. God is so Sovereign that He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 24, 13, 5, 'makes even our mistakes to work for His glory and for our good. The only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 24, 14, 5, 'thing that you need ever sorrow over is pride and unconfessed sin. Satan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 24, 15, 5, 'however will keep reminding you about your past mistakes - to knock you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 24, 16, 5, 'down with discouragement. But if you keep getting discouraged over your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 24, 17, 5, 'past failures, it will be easier for Satan to trip you up again.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 24, 18, 5, 'When the waves are in turmoil, it is important that your vision is fixed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 24, 19, 5, 'on Jesus Himself, and not on the waves around you, as Peter did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 24, 20, 5, '(Matt.14:30). There may be turmoil in your place of work or around you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 24, 21, 5, 'But if you look at Jesus alone, you will walk in triumph over the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 24, 22, 5, 'troubled sea.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 24, 23, 5, 'Protection from Dangers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 24, 24, 5, 'Jesus faced wild beasts after He was anointed with the Spirit (Mark');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 24, 25, 5, '1:13) and then wild men (Luke 4:13-16, 28-30). But none of them could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 24, 26, 5, 'kill Him, because God''s hour had not yet come for Him. We read that in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 24, 27, 5, 'John 7:30 also. That is an amazing verse that is true for us also,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 24, 28, 5, 'because God loves us as much as He loved Jesus - John 17:23.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 25, 1, 5, 'Dangers that God saves you from are an indication of God''s protecting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 25, 2, 5, 'care over your life - which you may otherwise tend to forget. There is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 25, 3, 5, '" hedge around you" (Job 1:10-12), which Satan cannot get through, until');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 25, 4, 5, 'God permits Him to do so. Greater is He Who is in you than he who is in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 25, 5, 5, 'the world (1 Jn.4:4). Events in your past life, when you were saved from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 25, 6, 5, 'death, will help you to recognize that you owe your life to God totally.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 25, 7, 5, 'So it is good for you to remember such instances, so that you recognize');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 25, 8, 5, 'your debt to Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 25, 9, 5, 'Paul faced "death again and again and again" (2 Cor.11:23-Living), and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 25, 10, 5, 'experienced God''s mighty delivering hand again and again and again. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 25, 11, 5, 'is how he became the mighty apostle that he became. He describes in 2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 25, 12, 5, 'Corinthians 11:24-28, how he was afloat in the sea for 24 hours once,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 25, 13, 5, 'shipwrecked thrice, and often faced with dangers from robbers etc. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 25, 14, 5, 'will face only a small part of what Paul faced. But God will prepare you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 25, 15, 5, 'through all those trials for a ministry for Him in the days to come.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 25, 16, 5, 'Unbelief can limit God from doing miracles for you, in the different');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 25, 17, 5, 'situations that you face. Galatians 3:5 (Living) states, " Does God give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 25, 18, 5, 'you the power of the Holy Spirit and work miracles among you as a result');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 25, 19, 5, 'of your trying to obey the Law? No, of course not. It is when you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 25, 20, 5, 'believe in Christ and fully trust Him ."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 25, 21, 5, 'The promise of God in Isaiah 54:17 is that no weapon formed against you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 25, 22, 5, 'will ever prosper. That is something you can claim. God Himself will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 25, 23, 5, 'vindicate and justify you in all situations (Rom.8:33). It is only when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 25, 24, 5, 'you recognize your own weakness that you can be really strong. Jesus was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 25, 25, 5, 'crucified because He chose to be weak (See 2 Cor.12:9 and 13:4). As we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 25, 26, 5, 'sing in a hymn:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 25, 27, 5, '"Make me a captive, Lord and then I shall be free;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 25, 28, 5, 'Force me to render up my sword and I shall conqueror be."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 26, 1, 5, 'Praising God for Everything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 26, 2, 5, 'Life will become wretched for you, if you constantly keep feeling that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 26, 3, 5, 'you are not good enough to be accepted by God. You must never moan like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 26, 4, 5, 'that, but instead thank God that He has accepted you just as you are -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 26, 5, 5, 'in Christ. Thank and praise the Lord every time you think of all that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 26, 6, 5, 'God has taken you through. All thoughts of complaining and grumbling');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 26, 7, 5, 'must be equated with dirty, sexual thoughts - to be avoided completely.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 26, 8, 5, 'Nothing coming from outside you can ever contaminate you if your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 26, 9, 5, '`elimination system'' is working properly (Mark 7:18-23). You have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 26, 10, 5, 'develop the habit of being blind and deaf to many external things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 26, 11, 5, '(Isa.42:19, 20). All that you see and hear must be sorted out in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 26, 12, 5, 'mind first. Many of those things must be eliminated from your mind');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 26, 13, 5, 'immediately - for example, the evils that others have done to you,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 26, 14, 5, 'anxious thoughts about the future etc. Only then will you be able to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 26, 15, 5, 'remain at rest in all circumstances and praise the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 26, 16, 5, 'Jesus has come to give us the spirit of praise and gladness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 26, 17, 5, '(Isa.61:1-3). He Himself sang a hymn before going to Calvary');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 26, 18, 5, '(Matt.26:30). And He is now the song-leader in the church (Heb.2:12).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 26, 19, 5, 'When we praise God, we make a throne for Him in our hearts (Psa.22:3).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 26, 20, 5, 'The proof of our faith is that we sing His praise (Psa.106:12). Thus you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 26, 21, 5, 'prove that you believe that God sits on the throne of the universe and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 26, 22, 5, 'that all the things that are happening in your life are with His express');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 26, 23, 5, 'permission. (" He knows every detail of what is happening to me" - Job');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 26, 24, 5, '23:10 Living). The most absolute statement about the sovereignty of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 26, 25, 5, 'in the Bible was made by Nebuchadnezzar after he was disciplined by God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 26, 26, 5, 'He said, " God looks on the people of the earth as nothing. Angels in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 26, 27, 5, 'heaven and people on earth are all under his control. No-one can oppose');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 26, 28, 5, 'his will or question what he does " (Dan.4:35-Good News Bible). That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 27, 1, 5, 'when Nebuchadnezzar "became sane" (Dan.4:36). And that is what every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 27, 2, 5, 'sane believer will believe. That is the faith God wants us to have. Such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 27, 3, 5, 'believers will be praising God at all times and in every situation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 27, 4, 5, 'When the scribes and rulers complained that the infants were making a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 27, 5, 5, 'lot of noise shouting praises in the temple, Jesus said that praise was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 27, 6, 5, 'actually perfectly offered only by babes (Matt.21:16, quoting Psalm 8:2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 27, 7, 5, '- " You have taught the little children to praise You perfectly" -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 27, 8, 5, 'Living Bible). That teaches us that what makes our praise acceptable to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 27, 9, 5, 'God are not the words we use, but humility and purity of heart (for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 27, 10, 5, 'those are what all babes have). Babes also never murmur or complain -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 27, 11, 5, 'and that is another thing that makes our praise acceptable to God. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 27, 12, 5, 'there is not even a smell of a murmur or complaint in our lives,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 27, 13, 5, 'morning, noon or night, seven days of the week, every week of every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 27, 14, 5, 'year, then our praise is no longer a ritual performed on Sunday');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 27, 15, 5, 'mornings, but part of our daily lives. And God is delighted with such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 27, 16, 5, 'praise - even if we sing out of tune!!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 27, 17, 5, 'The New Covenant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 27, 18, 5, 'Our righteousness must exceed the righteousness of the Pharisees if we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 27, 19, 5, 'are to enter God''s kingdom (Mt.5:20) - and that relates especially to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 27, 20, 5, 'keeping the 10th commandment. The righteousness of the Pharisees');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 27, 21, 5, 'involved keeping the first 9 of the 10 commandments. Paul says in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 27, 22, 5, 'Philippians 3:6 that he was blameless as far as these 9 were concerned.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 27, 23, 5, 'But when it came to the 10th commandment, " You shall not covet (lust)",');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 27, 24, 5, 'Paul says in Romans 7:7 he could not keep it. He found coveting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 27, 25, 5, '(lusting) of every kind in his heart. He longed for deliverance');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 27, 26, 5, '(Rom.7:24). But he found it impossible to keep his heart from the sin of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 27, 27, 5, 'lusting. He knew that in the new covenant, God desired purity of heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 27, 28, 5, 'He did not have that purity, but longed for it. God saw Paul''s hunger');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 28, 1, 5, 'and opened his eyes to see the way that had been made under the new');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 28, 2, 5, 'covenant, for him to have a pure heart that would be free from such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 28, 3, 5, 'lusts.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 28, 4, 5, 'This is what Paul describes in Romans 8. There he speaks of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 28, 5, 5, 'provision that God has made for us. Through the Holy Spirit, He gives us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 28, 6, 5, 'the life of Christ (v.2), so that the requirement of the law (which is,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 28, 7, 5, '"You shalllove" (Rom.13:9, 10) - the positive side of "You shall not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 28, 8, 5, 'lust") can be fulfilled inside us now (Rom.8:4). If we have the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 28, 9, 5, 'honesty and hunger that Paul had, God will lead us also into the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 28, 10, 5, 'life that he experienced - for there is no partiality with God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 28, 11, 5, 'Here is an illustration of the difference between the law and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 28, 12, 5, 'gospel: A man can take a pig for a walk through a filthy street, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 28, 13, 5, 'keep it from wallowing in the muck, by holding it firmly with a strong');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 28, 14, 5, 'chain round its neck. This is what it means to be "under law" - where we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 28, 15, 5, 'are kept clean by the restraint of the commandments - the fear of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 28, 16, 5, 'judgment and the hope of reward. But now God does for us what the Law');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 28, 17, 5, 'could not do. He puts a cat''s nature within the pig. And this new nature');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 28, 18, 5, 'wants to remain clean at all times and no longer desires the filth. So');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 28, 19, 5, 'the chain (the law) is no longer necessary. This is God''s way of making');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 28, 20, 5, 'us righteous - not by restraining us from the outside with a chain of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 28, 21, 5, 'commandments, but by making us inwardly partake of His nature that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 28, 22, 5, 'delights in holiness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 28, 23, 5, 'Victory over Sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 28, 24, 5, 'Seek wholeheartedly for total victory over conscious sin (what you know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 28, 25, 5, 'to be sin) - no matter how long that may take you. God will definitely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 28, 26, 5, 'give it to you. If you mourn each time you fall into any sin, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 28, 27, 5, 'indicates to God that you are really thirsting for a life of victory');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 28, 28, 5, 'over sin. Being filled with the Holy Spirit does not guarantee that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 29, 1, 5, 'will automatically get victory over sin. The battle for victory has to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 29, 2, 5, 'be fought by taking up the cross daily, and by filling your mind with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 29, 3, 5, 'God''s Word. The Holy Spirit helps us in these two matters.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 29, 4, 5, 'Getting victory over sin, testifying in the meetings, and witnessing to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 29, 5, 5, 'your colleagues, etc., are all similar to learning how to swim. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 29, 6, 5, 'early stage is the most difficult. Afterwards you will find that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 29, 7, 5, 'enjoy doing them. So in all these matters, don''t hesitate to " jump into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 29, 8, 5, 'the water". You won''t drown. That is how you will learn "to swim". If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 29, 9, 5, 'you keep hesitating, you will find that you get more and more scared of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 29, 10, 5, 'the "water" (people). Ask God to free you from the fear of men. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 29, 11, 5, 'one of the greatest freedoms that we all need.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 29, 12, 5, 'Temptations and mistakes will be a constant part of your life until the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 29, 13, 5, 'end of your life. But you can come to victory over conscious sin, after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 29, 14, 5, 'a while - and then falling will become rare thereafter.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 29, 15, 5, 'The greatest lust that you must conquer (as with all young men) is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 29, 16, 5, 'sexual lust. That stands like a Goliath before all men and says, " If I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 29, 17, 5, 'conquer you, you will serve us Philistines (all the lusts); but if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 29, 18, 5, 'conquer me, then all of us will serve you " (1 Samuel 17:9). When David');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 29, 19, 5, 'killed Goliath, through the power of God, all the Philistines ran away');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 29, 20, 5, 'and were killed by the Israelites (1 Samuel 17:51,52). So also, you will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 29, 21, 5, 'find that when you conquer sexual lust, many of your other lusts become');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 29, 22, 5, 'easy to conquer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 29, 23, 5, 'Flee from too close a friendship with any girl. Flee from literature');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 29, 24, 5, '(and in 2016, I would also add "Internet sites") that provokes and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 29, 25, 5, 'stimulates your lusts. Flee even from the waste of time that there is in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 29, 26, 5, 'watching useless TV programs. Flee from listening to gossip. Listening');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 29, 27, 5, 'to evil, reading evil, and watching evil, will only make you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 29, 28, 5, 'knowledgeable about evil. But why do you need that filthy information?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 30, 1, 5, 'It will only pollute you and destroy you. You must shut your ears and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 30, 2, 5, 'your eyes, from now onwards, to all such information. To know the evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 30, 3, 5, 'that others do, will never make you wise.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 30, 4, 5, 'The Bible exhorts us to be "like infants, in matters of evil" (1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 30, 5, 5, 'Cor.14:20). The mind of a child is pure from all evil. And the good news');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 30, 6, 5, 'of the gospel is that even though we have spent so many years polluting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 30, 7, 5, 'our minds with evil information, if we really long to be free from it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 30, 8, 5, 'now, the Holy Spirit can help us to have the pure mind of a child once');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 30, 9, 5, 'again. This is what the grace of God can do for us. Praise the Lord!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 30, 10, 5, 'We are called to be "innocent concerning what is evil and wise in what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 30, 11, 5, 'is good" (Rom.16:19). So ask the Holy Spirit to show you how Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 30, 12, 5, 'lived. Then you will know what it is to be " wise in what is good ".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 30, 13, 6, 'Chapter 5 Chapter 5');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 30, 14, 6, 'Jesus was Tempted but Always Overcame');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 30, 15, 6, 'Remember that Jesus faced exactly the same temptations that we all face');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 30, 16, 6, 'every day (Heb.4:15). He had all our limitations, and yet He overcame -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 30, 17, 6, 'because He loved righteousness and hated sin and cried out to the Father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 30, 18, 6, 'for help whenever He was tempted (Heb.1:9; 5:7). The Holy Spirit helped');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 30, 19, 6, 'Jesus as a Man - and the Holy Spirit will help you also in the same way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 30, 20, 6, 'Think often of how Jesus faced temptation as a young man. He felt the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 30, 21, 6, 'pull of the same temptations that all young men face. Overcoming');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 30, 22, 6, 'temptation was not any easier for Him. In fact, it must have been more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 30, 23, 6, 'difficult, for His nature was totally pure and so temptation was more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 30, 24, 6, 'repulsive to Him - and so its pull must have been stronger than it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 30, 25, 6, 'for us. And yet He overcame.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 30, 26, 6, 'And now Jesus is on your side of the rope in the tug of war against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 30, 27, 6, 'temptation - and He stands ready to help you. The anchor-man on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 30, 28, 6, 'enemy''s side is the big heavyweight called Pride. Next to him is another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 31, 1, 6, 'heavyweight called Selfishness. But God will help you to pull them both');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 31, 2, 6, 'over, along with all the other sins - and you will overcome. Praise the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 31, 3, 6, 'Lord!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 31, 4, 6, 'Here is a promise that you can hold on to in faith: " Jesus is able to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 31, 5, 6, 'keep you from falling (stumbling)" (Jude 24). Walking by faith has to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 31, 6, 6, 'learnt just like physical walking. There will be a number of falls');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 31, 7, 6, 'initially, as for a baby. But the falls will become less and less as you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 31, 8, 6, 'press on. Finally, falling will become rare, although a time will never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 31, 9, 6, 'come, when even the greatest saint can say that he will never fall.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 31, 10, 6, 'When you fall, you may be tempted to call your fall by some other name');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 31, 11, 6, 'than ''sin''. That is dangerous. There are many who call their sins as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 31, 12, 6, '''mistakes'', ''blunders'', etc., in order to evade personal responsibility');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 31, 13, 6, 'for their sins. They even misquote Romans 7:17, " It is no longer I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 31, 14, 6, 'doing it, but sin that dwells in me....", in order to excuse their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 31, 15, 6, 'obvious sins. This is a dangerous way to go. Avoid it - because you will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 31, 16, 6, 'then live in self-deception, as those other people are living. If we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 31, 17, 6, 'confess our sins God will be faithful to forgive us and cleanse us (1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 31, 18, 6, 'John 1:9). But there is no promise of cleansing if we call our sins');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 31, 19, 6, '"mistakes". The blood of Jesus cleanses onlysins. So, always be honest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 31, 20, 6, 'whenever you fall into sin. Call it " sin", turn from it, hate it,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 31, 21, 6, 'forsake it, confess it to God - and then forget about it, for it has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 31, 22, 6, 'been blotted out.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 31, 23, 6, 'Some Sins are More Serious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 31, 24, 6, 'Sins of attitude are more serious than sins of action, because they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 31, 25, 6, 'less easily recognized. Here are some sins of attitude: pride, critical');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 31, 26, 6, 'attitudes, bitterness, jealousy, inward judgment of others (by what you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 31, 27, 6, 'have heard or seen - Isa.11:3), seeking your own, selfishness,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 31, 28, 6, 'Phariseeism, etc.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 32, 1, 6, 'If a believer who preaches victory over sin, looks down on others, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 32, 2, 6, 'doesn''t realize that he does not have victory over the greatest sin of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 32, 3, 6, 'all - spiritual pride. To despise others is the equivalent of constantly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 32, 4, 6, 'committing adultery. And for such a believer to be talking about victory');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 32, 5, 6, 'over sin is ridiculous! The more you grow spiritually, the more holy you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 32, 6, 6, 'become, and the more victory over sin you get, the more humble you will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 32, 7, 6, 'become. This is the primary proof of genuine holiness. In a fruit tree,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 32, 8, 6, 'the branches with the most fruit bow down the most!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 32, 9, 6, 'Many confuse human self-control for ''partaking of the Divine nature''.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 32, 10, 6, 'Human self-control can produce an outward reformation. But it will leave');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 32, 11, 6, 'the inner man haughty and proud and Pharisaical in its attitude. We are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 32, 12, 6, 'called to receive grace from God to overcome sin - and we can never be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 32, 13, 6, 'proud of what we received freely. We can be proud only of what we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 32, 14, 6, 'produced ourselves - and the holiness we produce by our own efforts will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 32, 15, 6, 'always be a false holiness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 32, 16, 6, 'The Divine nature that you are called to partake of is love. God is kind');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 32, 17, 6, 'and good to unthankful and evil people, and makes the sun to shine on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 32, 18, 6, 'the evil and the good alike (Matt.5:46-48). This is the example that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 32, 19, 6, 'must follow too. Love everyone - whether they agree with you or not.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 32, 20, 6, 'Avoid all controversial discussions and arguments - like you would avoid');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 32, 21, 6, 'a deadly disease. If others around you want to argue about something,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 32, 22, 6, 'tell them lovingly that you would like to avoid all controversy. Pursue');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 32, 23, 6, 'after being made perfect in love with all your heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 32, 24, 6, 'The Way to Overcome');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 32, 25, 6, 'The fear of God is the foundation for a holy life. The secret of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 32, 26, 6, 'godliness lies in seeing that Jesus came in the flesh and was tempted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 32, 27, 6, 'like us in all points and overcame. But many know this truth only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 32, 28, 6, 'intellectually - and remain arrogant and proud. We can say that such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 33, 1, 6, 'people may have understood the doctrine of godliness, but not the secret');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 33, 2, 6, 'of godliness (1 Tim.3:16). The secret is not in a doctrine but in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 33, 3, 6, 'Person. Those who do not genuinely fear God will only understand the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 33, 4, 6, 'doctrine intellectually and have a "holiness which is an illusion"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 33, 5, 6, '(Eph.4:22 - JB Phillips). " Holiness can be perfected only in the fear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 33, 6, 6, 'of God" (2 Cor.7:1).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 33, 7, 6, 'And so, whenever there is the slightest unrest in your conscience about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 33, 8, 6, 'something or the other, settle the matter immediately. Confess the sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 33, 9, 6, 'to God at once, even if it has been only a failure in your thoughts.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 33, 10, 6, 'Mourn, mourn and mourn over each failure. Apologise to whomever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 33, 11, 6, 'necessary. And you will then see how God strengthens you mightily. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 33, 12, 6, 'best way to overcome temptation is to avoid it and flee from it - as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 33, 13, 6, 'Joseph did (Gen.39:7-12). Avoid all places and people that tempt you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 33, 14, 6, 'strongly and that make you weak. Jesus taught us to pray, "Lead us not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 33, 15, 6, 'into temptation".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 33, 16, 6, 'Avoid, avoid, avoid. Flee, flee, flee. In eternity you will be thankful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 33, 17, 6, 'that you did that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 33, 18, 6, 'Even on earth, in a few years from now, you will be thankful that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 33, 19, 6, 'avoided places and people that could have caused you to be tempted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 33, 20, 6, 'beyond your ability to overcome. Your avoiding such places and people is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 33, 21, 6, 'the way that you prove to the Lord that you are really eager to please');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 33, 22, 6, 'Him alone. (Read Proverbs 7 in this connection. That is a good chapter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 33, 23, 6, 'for all young men to read every now and then).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 33, 24, 6, 'These youthful years are a very important period of your life to lay a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 33, 25, 6, 'foundation for your future - and so the Lord must have His way with you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 33, 26, 6, 'totally in these years. Tell the Lord that you want that. Never mind how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 33, 27, 6, 'many times you fall. Get up, mourn, seek God for victory and give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 33, 28, 6, 'yourself wholly to the Lord all over again.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 34, 1, 6, 'Persistence');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 34, 2, 6, 'Persistence, persistence, persistence.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 34, 3, 6, 'That is the secret of victory. Keep at it - like you (as a computer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 34, 4, 6, 'student) keep working at a computer problem until it is solved. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 34, 5, 6, 'temptation to be discouraged is universal; but don''t give up. God made a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 34, 6, 6, 'perfect plan for your life before you were born (Psa.139:16). Don''t let');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 34, 7, 6, 'Satan ruin it. Whatever the cost, take a stand for the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 34, 8, 6, 'Jesus said in John 14:30 that when the prince of the world came, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 34, 9, 6, 'could find nothing in Him. We are now called to walk as Jesus walked.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 34, 10, 6, 'When Satan comes to you, he must find nothing in you. This is why you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 34, 11, 6, 'must " always do your best to maintain a conscience that is without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 34, 12, 6, 'offence towards God and towards men " (Acts 24:16). You must seek God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 34, 13, 6, 'with all your heart for His help to live without sinning consciously.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 34, 14, 6, 'Yielding to your lusts will give a foothold to Satan in your life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 34, 15, 6, 'Romans 6:1 asks the question, "Shall we continue in sin?" Then Romans');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 34, 16, 6, '6:15 asks the question, " Shall we sin even once?" To both questions the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 34, 17, 6, 'answer is a resounding, "No, may it never be."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 34, 18, 6, 'If you do fall into sin, you must immediately mourn and seek for pardon;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 34, 19, 6, 'otherwise you will begin to take sin lightly, and then victory will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 34, 20, 6, 'become more and more difficult. So, you must learn to keep short');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 34, 21, 6, 'accounts with God, confessing sin, and forsaking it and repenting from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 34, 22, 6, 'it, as soon as you are conscious of having come short of God''s standards');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 34, 23, 6, 'anywhere.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 34, 24, 6, 'Unreality');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 34, 25, 6, 'Unreality is one of the greatest dangers in the pursuit of the life of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 34, 26, 6, 'victory. Because many don''t face up to reality, they lose faith in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 34, 27, 6, 'possibility of living victoriously and say, "It just doesn''t work". But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 34, 28, 6, 'the promises of God do work - if you get your faith from God''s Word and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 35, 1, 6, 'not from the sermons of unbelieving Christians. " Faith comes by hearing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 35, 2, 6, 'and hearing by the Word of Christ" (Rom.10:17) - and not from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 35, 3, 6, 'testimonies of sinful men. Remember that!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 35, 4, 6, 'At the same time, don''t seek after unrealistic heights of holiness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 35, 5, 6, 'Stick to the balance found in God''s Word. Some soulish preachers can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 35, 6, 6, 'proclaim unattainable standards of holiness. Be careful that you are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 35, 7, 6, 'deceived by them. You must ask the Holy Spirit to give you discernment');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 35, 8, 6, 'between soul-power and spiritual power. True spirituality is always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 35, 9, 6, 'manifested in humility, graciousness and love. Listen only to those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 35, 10, 6, 'preachers in whom you see these characteristics. There are followers of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 35, 11, 6, 'Jesus as well as followers of the Pharisees in the best of churches -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 35, 12, 6, 'and you must be discerning, so that you don''t mingle with the wrong');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 35, 13, 6, 'crowd. Don''t judge them - but discern, and avoid them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 35, 14, 7, 'Chapter 6 Chapter 6');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 35, 15, 7, 'Humility and Rest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 35, 16, 7, 'Humility should be your outstanding virtue as a disciple of Jesus. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 35, 17, 7, 'best I have ever read on this subject is what Andrew Murray has written.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 35, 18, 7, 'In his book titled, Humility, he says, "The chief mark by which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 35, 19, 7, 'counterfeit holiness can be identified is by its lack of humility. There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 35, 20, 7, 'are three great motives that drive us to humility. First, the fact that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 35, 21, 7, 'we are created beings, second, that we are sinners and third, that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 35, 22, 7, 'are saints. In most teaching on this subject, it is the fact that we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 35, 23, 7, 'sinners that has been emphasised, so that many have thought that one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 35, 24, 7, 'must keep on sinning in order to remain humble. Others have thought that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 35, 25, 7, 'constantly judging oneself is the secret of humility. But it is not sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 35, 26, 7, 'that humbles us most, but grace. It is the one who is occupied with God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 35, 27, 7, 'and His glory who will take the lowest place before Him, not the one who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 35, 28, 7, 'is occupied with his own sinfulness. Every failure in our life is caused');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 36, 1, 7, 'by a lack of humility. In Jesus'' earthly life, He constantly sought to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 36, 2, 7, 'be nothing, so that God might be everything. He gave up His will and His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 36, 3, 7, 'abilities entirely to the Father, so that the Father could work in Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 36, 4, 7, 'And because Jesus had humbled Himself before God thus, He found it easy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 36, 5, 7, 'to humble Himself before men too, and to be the servant of all. To deny');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 36, 6, 7, 'ourselves means to acknowledge that Self has nothing good in it and so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 36, 7, 7, 'to become nothing before God and men, so that God alone may be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 36, 8, 7, 'everything."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 36, 9, 7, 'Read that paragraph again. There is a wealth of meaning in it. Be rooted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 36, 10, 7, 'and grounded in humility at all times.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 36, 11, 7, 'Always live in fear of becoming a Pharisee, and then you will never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 36, 12, 7, 'become one. Always esteem others as more important than yourself - not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 36, 13, 7, 'as more spiritual, but as more important (Read Phi.2:3 carefully). This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 36, 14, 7, 'does not mean that we should wallow in low self-esteem. No. We are sons');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 36, 15, 7, 'of the living God - sons of the King of Kings - chosen by God from all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 36, 16, 7, 'eternity past. So we are extremely important to God. And we are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 36, 17, 7, 'slaves to any man and will never live in fear of any man. But we respect');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 36, 18, 7, 'all people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 36, 19, 7, 'The Lord wants your heart to be at rest at all times (Matt.11:28), even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 36, 20, 7, 'if your mind and body are active throughout the day. Unrest in the heart');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 36, 21, 7, 'is very often due to narrowness of heart - towards God and towards');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 36, 22, 7, 'others (2 Cor.6:11-13). To be large-hearted towards God is to give Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 36, 23, 7, 'all that you have and are, for Him to use as it pleases Him (John');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 36, 24, 7, '17:10). To be large-hearted towards people is to have a forgiving heart');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 36, 25, 7, 'that quickly releases others, without holding any grudges. You must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 36, 26, 7, 'never, never hold a grudge against any human being at any time. Only if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 36, 27, 7, 'you are faithful in this matter will you be able to live in God''s rest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 36, 28, 7, 'at all times.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 37, 1, 7, 'Preserve a spirit of thankfulness in your life at all times (towards God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 37, 2, 7, 'and towards man). This will be easy if you are humble. It is pride and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 37, 3, 7, 'the silent, inward demands that we make on others that rob us of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 37, 4, 7, 'spirit of thankfulness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 37, 5, 7, 'Meditate On God''s Word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 37, 6, 7, 'It is good to be rooted and grounded in God''s Word, so that you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 37, 7, 7, 'never deceived. In a few minutes every day, you can read something that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 37, 8, 7, 'will bless you as you meditate on it during the rest of the day. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 37, 9, 7, 'addition, if you have the time, you should try and read 1 chapter of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 37, 10, 7, 'New Testament (in the NASB) and 3 chapters of the Old Testament (in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 37, 11, 7, 'Living Bible) every day. That way, you will be able to finish reading');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 37, 12, 7, 'the whole Bible in 300 days.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 37, 13, 7, 'Remember that the very first recorded words of Jesus, after His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 37, 14, 7, 'anointing with the Spirit, were: " Man shall not live by bread alone but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 37, 15, 7, 'by every word that proceeds from the mouth of God " (Matt. 4:4). James');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 37, 16, 7, '1:22-25 exhorts us to look intently into God''s Word. The new covenant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 37, 17, 7, 'law is called there (a) the perfect law and (b) the law of liberty.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 37, 18, 7, 'Unlike the Law of Moses, the new covenant is meant to lead us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 37, 19, 7, 'perfection and to liberty from all bondage -from bondage to sin and from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 37, 20, 7, 'bondage to people''s opinions.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 37, 21, 7, 'In your single days, you must make the most of every opportunity to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 37, 22, 7, 'study God''s Word. You will never get such opportunities again. Seek to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 37, 23, 7, 'live a disciplined life, so that you can make the most of your time to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 37, 24, 7, 'study the Word of God. This is what I did in my single days - and it has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 37, 25, 7, 'brought me immense spiritual rewards throughout my life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 37, 26, 7, 'It is important that you go to the church-meetings with a positive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 37, 27, 7, 'attitude. Any negative attitude will block your ears from hearing what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 37, 28, 7, 'God wants to say to you. Satan is so subtle that he will try to bring');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 38, 1, 7, 'something or the other to hinder you from receiving what God wants you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 38, 2, 7, 'to hear. The principle that Mary mentioned in Luke 1:53 is eternally');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 38, 3, 7, 'true: " He has filled the hungry with good things; and the rich He has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 38, 4, 7, 'sent away empty-handed ". So go to every church-meeting as a hungry,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 38, 5, 7, 'needy person, so that God will be able to fill you with good things.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 38, 6, 7, 'God''s Perfect Plan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 38, 7, 7, 'There is nothing greater that you can accomplish on earth than to fulfil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 38, 8, 7, 'God''s perfect plan for your life. My prayer is that God will one day use');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 38, 9, 7, 'you as an instrument in His Hand to build His church in some part of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 38, 10, 7, 'world through your life and labours. Your education is only a means of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 38, 11, 7, 'earning a living - so that you don''t have to be dependent on others for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 38, 12, 7, 'your earthly needs. But your calling in life is to live for God. So');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 38, 13, 7, 'don''t make your profession an idol.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 38, 14, 7, 'God has planned every detail of your earthly life already. That includes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 38, 15, 7, 'your education - the school and college that you were to join, and even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 38, 16, 7, 'the courses that you would take in college. He sovereignly overrules in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 38, 17, 7, 'all of these and ensures that you are finally guided into the right');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 38, 18, 7, 'profession. So in some situation, if you didn''t get the courses or the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 38, 19, 7, 'openings that you expected or wanted, despite your best efforts, just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 38, 20, 7, 'praise the Lord. Years later you will discover that God was watching');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 38, 21, 7, 'over you and sovereignly overruling the details of your life (although');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 38, 22, 7, 'you were unaware of it), and that the way it worked out for you was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 38, 23, 7, 'indeed God''s best for you (Rom.8:28). Live by faith in this word of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 38, 24, 7, 'God''s main purpose for you is that you might be His witness - by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 38, 25, 7, 'manifesting the life of Jesus - here on earth. So don''t let your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 38, 26, 7, 'ambitions ever become earthly. Take life seriously. Seek God''s perfect');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 38, 27, 7, 'will. Live life in such a way that, you won''t regret the way you lived,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 38, 28, 7, 'when you finally stand before the Lord in the day of judgment. The GPA');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 39, 1, 7, 'that will be important in that final day will not be your`Grade Point');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 39, 2, 7, 'Average'' (in college), but`God''s Praise & Approval'' (1 Cor.4:5). Your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 39, 3, 7, 'score in that will be the only thing that will matter then.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 39, 4, 7, 'God plans our lives in such a wonderful way. This is what I have found');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 39, 5, 7, 'again and again in my own life, which makes me want to give my life more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 39, 6, 7, 'wholeheartedly to His service in the coming days, " to win for the Lamb');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 39, 7, 7, 'that was slain the reward of His sufferings". That was the motto of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 39, 8, 7, '18th-century Moravian Christians (now Czechoslovakia), whose leader was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 39, 9, 7, 'Count Zinzendorf.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 39, 10, 7, 'The perfect plan that God has for your life cannot be hindered by any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 39, 11, 7, 'lack of earthly qualifications. Its fulfilment depends only on your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 39, 12, 7, 'having a humble attitude of mind and faith. So may you always have those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 39, 13, 7, 'virtues.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 39, 14, 7, 'None of us have managed to live our lives without making foolish');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 39, 15, 7, 'mistakes. But I can testify from my own life that God overlooks many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 39, 16, 7, 'foolish things that we have done, when we are humble enough to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 39, 17, 7, 'acknowledge our sin, not blame others, and say in faith, "Lord, in spite');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 39, 18, 7, 'of what I have done, I trust in Your mercy that You will fulfil Your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 39, 19, 7, 'plan for my life". Many believers never say those words to the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 39, 20, 7, 'because they are so discouraged by their failures, and don''t trust in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 39, 21, 7, 'God''s mercy. Thus they dishonour God by exalting their failures over His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 39, 22, 7, 'sovereign power and mercy. You must trust in God and glorify His great');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 39, 23, 7, 'mercy. Then it will go really well with you - with each year being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 39, 24, 7, 'better than the previous one.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 39, 25, 7, 'Dealing with Misunderstanding');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 39, 26, 7, 'Whenever you face misunderstanding or suspicion, you should rejoice that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 39, 27, 7, 'the Lord has counted you worthy at such a young age to face such things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 39, 28, 7, 'and to get a spiritual education through them. You have to learn to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 40, 1, 7, 'large-hearted towards those who view you with suspicion. In such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 40, 2, 7, 'situations, you have the opportunity to complete another subject in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 40, 3, 7, 'syllabus that God has planned for you. You can then grow in Divine love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 40, 4, 7, 'for those who look at you in that way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 40, 5, 7, 'You must also develop a thick skin towards misunderstanding and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 40, 6, 7, 'reproach. You don''t realize perhaps how such situations can enable you,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 40, 7, 7, 'not only to grow in a personal knowledge of the Lord, but also to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 40, 8, 7, 'free from the opinions of men. This is what I have found - and so I now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 40, 9, 7, 'know what it is to "leap for joy", as Jesus said (Lk.6:23).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 40, 10, 7, 'You have to be deaf to many things that you hear around you, as it says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 40, 11, 7, 'about the Lord''s servants in Isaiah 42:19, 20. Remember that you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 40, 12, 7, 'answerable only to the Lord finally for your life and for your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 40, 13, 7, 'attitudes. Only if you realize this fact can you be a true servant of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 40, 14, 7, 'Christ. If you seek to please men, you can never be a servant of Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 40, 15, 7, '(Gal.1:10). Many young people are bound by the opinions of others. Be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 40, 16, 7, 'free from this slavery, or you will never grow as you should.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 40, 17, 7, 'Don''t be a clone - who imitates others (whether in the world or in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 40, 18, 7, 'church) - behaving and speaking and praying like them, because you want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 40, 19, 7, 'their honour and their approval. Dare to be yourself. God wants you to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 40, 20, 7, 'be your natural self at all times. He never wants you to be artificial.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 40, 21, 7, 'In every Christian group, you will find pressure from others to conform');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 40, 22, 7, 'to their pattern. It is good that you face such pressures, for only then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 40, 23, 7, 'can you resist that pressure and develop your spiritual muscles and be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 40, 24, 7, 'an overcomer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 40, 25, 7, 'In Communist countries, the children of Christian leaders are persecuted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 40, 26, 7, 'and hounded in school and elsewhere. What you face from others will only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 40, 27, 7, 'be like ant-bites in comparison to that. Be bold and fearless then, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 40, 28, 7, 'be an overcomer even in this area. Everything is planned by God for your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 41, 1, 7, 'very best, to give you an eternal education - to make you a man of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 41, 2, 8, 'Chapter 7 Chapter 7');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 41, 3, 8, 'Becoming a Blessing to Others');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 41, 4, 8, 'In Matthew 14:19, we see the three steps to becoming a blessing to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 41, 5, 8, 'others: (1) Jesus took ALL the loaves and fish; (2) He blessed them; and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 41, 6, 8, '(3) He broke them. Then the multitude was fed. This is how the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 41, 7, 8, 'wants to make you a blessing to others too. You have to give Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 41, 8, 8, 'everything first, as the little lad there did. Then He will bless you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 41, 9, 8, 'with the power of the Holy Spirit. Then He will break you through many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 41, 10, 8, 'trials, frustrations, disappointed hopes, failures, sicknesses,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 41, 11, 8, 'betrayals, etc, and humble you, and reduce you to nothing in the eyes of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 41, 12, 8, 'men. Then, He will bless others through you. So submit to His breaking.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 41, 13, 8, 'The Bible says that Jesus was first crushed and then the Father''s work');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 41, 14, 8, 'prospered in His hand (See Isa.53:10-12).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 41, 15, 8, 'Jesus allowed His human self-will to be broken in the different');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 41, 16, 8, 'situations in His life. Only thus was He able to offer Himself without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 41, 17, 8, 'spot to His Father. It was for this purpose that the Spirit strengthened');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 41, 18, 8, 'Him (Heb.9:14). It is only as you also allow the Holy Spirit to break');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 41, 19, 8, 'the strength of your own will that you will become spiritual. Your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 41, 20, 8, 'self-will must be broken at the times when you are tempted to do what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 41, 21, 8, 'your own strong self-life would like to do, instead of doing what God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 41, 22, 8, 'wants you to do.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 41, 23, 8, 'Your cross will be found in those places where the will of God crosses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 41, 24, 8, 'your self-will. There your own will must be crucified. There the Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 41, 25, 8, 'will tell you to die. If you obey the Spirit''s voice consistently, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 41, 26, 8, 'will remain constantly broken; and God has promised to give continuous');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 41, 27, 8, 'revival to those who remain continuously broken in spirit. The Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 41, 28, 8, 'says, " I dwell on a high and holy place, and also with the contrite and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 42, 1, 8, 'lowly of spirit in order to revive the spirit of the lowly and to revive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 42, 2, 8, 'the heart of the contrite ." (Isa.57:15).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 42, 3, 8, 'It is good to remain at all times with a sense of your own need - "poor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 42, 4, 8, 'in spirit". But you must also believe that God mightily rewards all who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 42, 5, 8, 'diligently seek Him. All the value of being poor in spirit will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 42, 6, 8, 'worthless, if you don''t also believe that God will bless you and fill');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 42, 7, 8, 'you with His power.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 42, 8, 8, 'Seek fellowship with the poor and the weak, in every church, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 42, 9, 8, 'encourage them. Talk to the children and encourage them, because most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 42, 10, 8, 'people neglect the children. Always seek for the low, unnoticed place,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 42, 11, 8, 'and for the unseen ministries in a church. Don''t ever seek prominence in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 42, 12, 8, 'any church, and don''t seek to impress anyone in any way, with your gifts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 42, 13, 8, 'or your talents. Beware especially of trying to impress the young');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 42, 14, 8, 'sisters! But be bold always to testify in every meeting, and to serve in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 42, 15, 8, 'every way possible in the church - whether cleaning the floor or playing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 42, 16, 8, 'the piano. Don''t ever get into any competition with anyone, for any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 42, 17, 8, 'ministry. God Himself will open up the ministry that He has planned for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 42, 18, 8, 'you, at the right time, if you are faithful.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 42, 19, 8, 'You need to be very wise when trying to help any young person who has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 42, 20, 8, 'had a history of alcoholism or drugs. Seek God for wisdom in such cases,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 42, 21, 8, 'as to how you can help them - and God will give you the wisdom you need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 42, 22, 8, 'readily (Jas.1:5). In fact, he has promised to give you " as much wisdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 42, 23, 8, 'as you need" to help such people (See Luke 11:5-8).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 42, 24, 8, 'Your Calling');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 42, 25, 8, 'There are very, very few people in the world who are God''s children. By');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 42, 26, 8, 'God''s grace, you happen to be among those very, very few. How grateful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 42, 27, 8, 'you should be that God allowed you to hear the gospel from your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 42, 28, 8, 'childhood. You have a heavenly birthright. Don''t ever give it up for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 43, 1, 8, 'anything of this evil world. If you admire anything that is great and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 43, 2, 8, 'grand in this world, you will end up bowing down to it. Jesus too was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 43, 3, 8, 'tempted in the wilderness to bow down to Satan to get the glory of this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 43, 4, 8, 'world. But He overcame. And you can overcome too. I believe you will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 43, 5, 8, 'an overcomer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 43, 6, 8, 'When you overcome in the times of temptation, you prove to Satan that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 43, 7, 8, 'the Lord is more precious to you than any lust. God is trusting you for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 43, 8, 8, 'such a testimony, for He has very few witnesses to this truth on earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 43, 9, 8, 'There is a calling of God upon your life. I pray that the Lord will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 43, 10, 8, 'prepare you even now to be His servant in the days to come. So keep your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 43, 11, 8, 'life pure, and seek to be filled with the Holy Spirit always. Discipline');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 43, 12, 8, 'your time and your life, and don''t waste your money. Remember that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 43, 13, 8, 'cannot allow your days to go to waste like many other young people of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 43, 14, 8, 'your age do, who have no calling of God upon their lives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 43, 15, 8, 'May the Lord bless you and keep you, so that you can have a glorious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 43, 16, 8, 'life and ministry here on earth and an abundant entrance into His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 43, 17, 8, 'kingdom one day. May you enter His presence with joy on that final day.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 43, 18, 8, 'That is my constant prayer for you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 43, 19, 8, 'Controversy and Competition');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 43, 20, 8, 'Love all men. But be free from all men, at the same time. That is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 43, 21, 8, 'way to spiritual growth. Steer clear of all discussions on controversial');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 43, 22, 8, 'subjects. Steer around them, as you would around the potholes on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 43, 23, 8, 'roads in India. Otherwise those potholes can give you a nasty jolt. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 43, 24, 8, 'wants you to keep a watch over your tongue. Much leakage of power takes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 43, 25, 8, 'place through the tongue. Ask God to continually fill you with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 43, 26, 8, 'Spirit every day - and then make sure there is no leakage!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 43, 27, 8, 'Be steadfast in refusing to discuss matters relating to other churches');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 43, 28, 8, 'in other places. A person has to have extremely high thoughts to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 44, 1, 8, 'consider himself capable of passing a judgment on things happening in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 44, 2, 8, 'other churches. The events that take place in different churches have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 44, 3, 8, 'way of exposing the curiosity of people and thus making " the evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 44, 4, 8, 'thoughts of their hearts manifest" (Lk.2:34, 35). Thus God tests all His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 44, 5, 8, 'children to see how many of them have learnt to mind their own business.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 44, 6, 8, 'Make sure you pass the test. Keep your heart free from unnecessary');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 44, 7, 8, 'opinions. Pious gossip is often passed around in many Christian circles,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 44, 8, 8, 'under the guise of prayer-requests. Avoid all such gossip.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 44, 9, 8, 'As young men, it is good for you all to recognize your boundaries. What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 44, 10, 8, 'may be proper for an elder brother to discuss may not be proper for you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 44, 11, 8, '- for you may not have the wisdom to talk about it in the right way. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 44, 12, 8, 'should certainly hold firmly to your convictions, never compromise, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 44, 13, 8, 'never allow anyone to brainwash you. But you should also pursue peace');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 44, 14, 8, 'and seek fellowship in all humility, as far as possible. It is that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 44, 15, 8, 'delicate balance that sometimes youthful zeal is not able to maintain.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 44, 16, 8, 'But you must strive to find that balance.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 44, 17, 8, 'Respect the brothers and sisters in every church that you go to. Don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 44, 18, 8, 'ever despise anyone; and don''t ever get into arguments with anyone - for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 44, 19, 8, 'that will only destroy you. Receive what is good from every believer and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 44, 20, 8, 'from every church that you fellowship with. But be discerning always. "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 44, 21, 8, 'Be wise as serpents and harmless as doves." Let me repeat: Don''t swallow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 44, 22, 8, 'everything that you see and hear, without evaluating everything by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 44, 23, 8, 'Word of God. Be like the Bereans (Acts 17:11).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 44, 24, 8, 'Conscience and Righteousness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 44, 25, 8, 'You will never know how much we appreciate you as our sons, for so many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 44, 26, 8, 'things that I can think of right now - and many more things that I can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 44, 27, 8, 'think of, if I give the matter a little more thought!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 44, 28, 8, 'I have an important exhortation for you first of all: "Live in the fear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 45, 1, 8, 'of the Lord the whole day long" - (Pro. 23:17).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 45, 2, 8, 'Never forget that Jesus said that our righteousness must exceed the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 45, 3, 8, 'righteousness of the Pharisees, if we are to enter God''s kingdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 45, 4, 8, '(Matt.5:20). Immediately after that verse, Jesus explained what he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 45, 5, 8, 'meant: He said that we should not be angry (5:22), or lust after women');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 45, 6, 8, '(5:28), or be untruthful (5:37), or revengeful (5:38-44), or seek the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 45, 7, 8, 'honour of men (Mt.6:1-18), etc. In other words, He was saying that our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 45, 8, 8, 'inner life must correspond with our outer life. The Law could not enable');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 45, 9, 8, 'anyone to live like this. But Jesus has now opened a way for us to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 45, 10, 8, 'able to live like this. This is what you must strive for with all your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 45, 11, 8, 'heart, and you must ask God to help you. And He will help you, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 45, 12, 8, 'He is a Rewarder of all who diligently seek Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 45, 13, 8, 'To lose a sensitive conscience is like losing sensitivity in the skin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 45, 14, 8, 'when contracting leprosy. This is a very serious thing. It will tend to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 45, 15, 8, 'spread and finally destroy you altogether. So you must break your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 45, 16, 8, 'connection with anyone who is dragging you away from the Lord. In your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 45, 17, 8, 'contacts with worldly people and carnal believers, you are engaged in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 45, 18, 8, 'tug-of-war. If you find that they are gradually pulling you over to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 45, 19, 8, 'world, through your contact with them, and you don''t have the power to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 45, 20, 8, 'pull them over to the Lord, then drop such friendships immediately. Hold');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 45, 21, 8, 'on to them only if you are gradually pulling them over towards the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 45, 22, 8, 'Otherwise, your loss will be very great finally.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 45, 23, 8, 'The Crown of Life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 45, 24, 8, 'James 1:12 says, "Blessed is the man who perseveres under (keeps');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 45, 25, 8, 'overcoming in) temptation - because when he has been approved, he will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 45, 26, 8, 'receive the crown of life, which the Lord has promised to those who love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 45, 27, 8, 'Him ". According to this verse, the one who gets the crown of life is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 45, 28, 8, 'one who loves the Lord, and is also consistently faithful in temptation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 46, 1, 8, 'So, only those who are consistently faithful in temptation can say that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 46, 2, 8, 'they love the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 46, 3, 8, 'So, it is in the moments of temptation that your love for the Lord is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 46, 4, 8, 'tested. We also read there that we will get the crown of life only when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 46, 5, 8, 'we are approved. Since no man has got the crown of life as yet, we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 46, 6, 8, 'be sure that God''s approval is not given to anyone until He has finished');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 46, 7, 8, 'his life''s course faithfully. So we are all under probation, and we will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 46, 8, 8, 'be so, until the end of our life. It is easy to be enthusiastic for a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 46, 9, 8, 'short while and then to backslide or to become lukewarm.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 46, 10, 8, 'Be faithful day by day. And keep crying out for help. Even if you can''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 46, 11, 8, 'cry aloud to the Lord in your room, let there be a cry in your heart at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 46, 12, 8, 'all times. To be continually filled with the Spirit, you must keep a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 46, 13, 8, 'clear conscience always and humble yourself in every situation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 46, 14, 8, 'We must never call down judgment (fire from heaven) on those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 46, 15, 8, 'disagree with us. When James and John once suggested that, Jesus rebuked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 46, 16, 8, 'them saying, " You don''t know what spirit you have - for the Son of Man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 46, 17, 8, 'has not come to destroy men''s lives but to save them " (Luke 9:51-56 -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 46, 18, 8, 'KJV, and margin of NASB). The spirit that hopes that it will go badly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 46, 19, 8, 'with those who disagree with us is the spirit of Satan.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 46, 20, 8, 'Read that passage - Luke 9:49 to 56. You see there that the first group');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 46, 21, 8, 'of people disagreed with the disciples (they had a different ministry).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 46, 22, 8, 'The second group did not receive Jesus and His disciples. Meditate on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 46, 23, 8, 'how Jesus rebuked His disciples for their wrong spirit - and you will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 46, 24, 8, 'saved from the wrong spirit that there is among many carnal believers in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 46, 25, 8, 'Christendom today. Always ask yourself, "Am I seeking to save someone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 46, 26, 8, 'here or to destroy him?"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 46, 27, 8, 'God gave Adam only one commandment. He disobeyed that. God gives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 46, 28, 8, 'children only one commandment - " Honour (i.e. obey and respect) your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 47, 1, 8, 'parents" - and they disobey that. Jesus gave His disciples only one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 47, 2, 8, 'commandment - to love one another exactly as he loved us - and most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 47, 3, 8, 'Christians disobey that!!!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 47, 4, 8, 'It is only when we love others that we prove that we really love the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 47, 5, 8, 'Lord. Otherwise, John says that we are liars (1 Jn.4:20).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 47, 6, 8, 'Concerning Satan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 47, 7, 8, 'It is good for you to know some facts about Satan. In any battle, a good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 47, 8, 8, 'knowledge of the enemy and of his tactics makes the battle easier to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 47, 9, 8, 'win. Here are some important facts about the enemy of our souls:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 47, 10, 8, '(1) Origin of Satan: The highest of the angels became proud of his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 47, 11, 8, 'beauty, intelligence and position, and was dissatisfied with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 47, 12, 8, 'boundaries and limits that God had drawn around him, and rebelled');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 47, 13, 8, 'against the authority of God and thus became Satan (Isa.14:12-15;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 47, 14, 8, 'Ezek.28:12-19).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 47, 15, 8, '(2) Deception of Satan: He deceived Eve, by making her question God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 47, 16, 8, 'Word, and doubt God''s love, and finally destroyed her and made her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 47, 17, 8, 'destroy her husband too (Gen.3:4-7). Beware of the smooth speech of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 47, 18, 8, 'gliding, attractive serpent.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 47, 19, 8, '(3) Methods of Satan: Satan tempted Jesus (i) to give more importance to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 47, 20, 8, 'his bodily needs (bread) than to God''s Word, (ii) to do something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 47, 21, 8, 'spectacular in the name of God to get honour, and finally (iii) offered');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 47, 22, 8, 'Him all the glory of the world if he would bow the knee to Satan. Satan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 47, 23, 8, 'offers us also many of the things of this world, if we will only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 47, 24, 8, 'compromise our convictions (Matt.4:1-10).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 47, 25, 8, '(4) Defeat of Satan: He has been rendered powerless through Jesus'' death');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 47, 26, 8, 'on the cross, and now he will flee from us if we resist him in Jesus''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 47, 27, 8, 'Name (Heb.2:14; Col.2:15; James 4:7).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 47, 28, 8, '(5) Why God hasn''t destroyed Satan: Because God wants to use Satan to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 48, 1, 8, 'test us and thus strengthen our spiritual muscles, as in the case of Job');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 48, 2, 8, '(Job Chapters 1 and 2).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 48, 3, 8, 'So we see that Satan''s testing of the churches and of believers, is all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 48, 4, 8, 'part of God''s perfect plan. When we are tempted to sin, or when Satan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 48, 5, 8, 'tries to deceive us, if we live in the fear of God, and hate sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 48, 6, 8, 'radically, God will make us wise, giving us discernment between good and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 48, 7, 8, 'evil. Thus we will grow in wisdom and become both holy and wise, as God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 48, 8, 8, 'wants us to be.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 48, 9, 9, 'Chapter 8 Chapter 8');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 48, 10, 9, 'Freedom from the Opinions of Men');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 48, 11, 9, 'One of the things I have discovered is that Christian growth is to a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 48, 12, 9, 'large extent dependent on being free from the opinions of other people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 48, 13, 9, 'The chapter in the New Testament that speaks of " entering into God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 48, 14, 9, 'rest" (Hebrews 4) is also the one that has this important phrase in it:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 48, 15, 9, '" All things are naked and open to the eyes of Him with Whom we have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 48, 16, 9, 'do " (v.13). There is no way we can enter God''s rest, unless we learn to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 48, 17, 9, 'live only before the face of "the One with Whom we have to do" in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 48, 18, 9, 'final analysis. If you can break free from the opinions of men at this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 48, 19, 9, 'young age - and yet never despise or feel superior to anyone, then you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 48, 20, 9, 'will really do well.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 48, 21, 9, 'Things around us are going to crumble - in every denomination of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 48, 22, 9, 'Christianity. In that day, you should be able to stand strong in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 48, 23, 9, 'Lord. So get prepared for that now. All the opposition that I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 48, 24, 9, 'faced, from religious Christians, has only freed me even more from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 48, 25, 9, 'opinions of all men. And I have never had so much rest and peace in God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 48, 26, 9, 'as I have had in these past few years! I long that you will have the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 48, 27, 9, 'same rest and peace.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 48, 28, 9, 'Once we have seen the great "mystery of godliness" - that Jesus came in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 49, 1, 9, 'the flesh and was tempted like us but did not sin (Heb.4:15; 1 Tim.3:16)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 49, 2, 9, '- we have to be careful that we don''t get so taken with explaining that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 49, 3, 9, 'doctrine that we miss out on actually living as Jesus lived in our daily');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 49, 4, 9, 'life and partaking of His life. As the old saying goes, " We can miss');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 49, 5, 9, 'the wood (forest) for the trees". In other words, we can get so taken up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 49, 6, 9, 'with the minute details that we miss the main thing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 49, 7, 9, 'We see many today who have preached holiness for years, but blaming one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 49, 8, 9, 'another and having complaints against each other. This shows that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 49, 9, 9, 'were not walking the way of the cross all these years at all. They had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 49, 10, 9, 'only known the theory of it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 49, 11, 9, 'Redeeming the Time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 49, 12, 9, 'Time that is lost in carelessness and sin can never be recovered. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 49, 13, 9, 'can forgive us a wasted life and still take us into His kingdom. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 49, 14, 9, 'even God cannot give us back our wasted years. Time wasted is time lost');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 49, 15, 9, 'forever. It can never be recovered. That is why it is so good to start');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 49, 16, 9, 'following the Lord from your youth itself. Our life on earth is very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 49, 17, 9, 'short. So it is essential that you redeem the time, and make use of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 49, 18, 9, 'every opportunity you get to overcome temptation, and to do good to all.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 49, 19, 9, 'Be rooted in humility, purity and love, at any cost.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 49, 20, 9, 'One of these days, when Jesus returns, and we see Him face to face, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 49, 21, 9, 'should not have any regret over the way you lived after God gave you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 49, 22, 9, 'light. When many believers see Jesus and discover in that day how much');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 49, 23, 9, 'He loved them, they will be crushed with sorrow and regret, that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 49, 24, 9, 'were so half-hearted during their earthly lifetime, even though they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 49, 25, 9, 'enter heaven. May God save you from such regret. Now is the time to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 49, 26, 9, 'think about that and to be wise. Never sell your birthright (spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 49, 27, 9, 'blessing) for a bowl of porridge (pleasure for the body), like Esau did.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 49, 28, 9, '" Pursue peace with all men and sanctification, without which no-one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 50, 1, 9, 'will see the Lord " (Heb.12:14).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 50, 2, 9, '"By and by, when we look on His face, we''ll wish we had given Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 50, 3, 9, 'more....."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 50, 4, 9, 'Fear of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 50, 5, 9, 'We read that Jesus grew in wisdom from His childhood (Lk.2:40, 52). Even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 50, 6, 9, 'though we expect young people to do foolish things, because they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 50, 7, 9, 'young, yet Jesus never did anything foolish, when he was young. Make Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 50, 8, 9, 'your example therefore, and you will be saved from doing many foolish');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 50, 9, 9, 'things in your youthful days. The fear of the Lord is the beginning of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 50, 10, 9, 'wisdom. Jesus prayed for help to be saved from spiritual death - and He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 50, 11, 9, '" was heard because of His godly fear" (Heb.5:7- NKJV). God loves us as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 50, 12, 9, 'He loved Jesus. So your prayers also will be heard, if you fear God as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 50, 13, 9, 'Jesus did.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 50, 14, 9, 'God gave Abraham a certificate (in Genesis 22:12) saying, " Now I know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 50, 15, 9, 'you are a fearer of God", when he was ready to sacrifice his only son.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 50, 16, 9, 'Abraham obeyed God all by himself on that mountain-top that day. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 50, 17, 9, 'wanted God alone to see his obedience. God had spoken to Abraham one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 50, 18, 9, 'night, when he was alone (Gen.22:1). No-one else knew what God had told');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 50, 19, 9, 'him. And Abraham obeyed God in secret. It is in the things that you do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 50, 20, 9, 'in secret (where no-one else knows what you do) that you will discover');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 50, 21, 9, 'whether you fear God or not.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 50, 22, 9, 'God gave Job a certificate (Job 1:8) before Satan, that Job feared God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 50, 23, 9, 'It is good if God can boast about you also to Satan like that - since');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 50, 24, 9, 'Satan goes roaming around the world even today, and knows all about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 50, 25, 9, 'everyone''s private life. Job made a covenant with his eyes never to look');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 50, 26, 9, 'with lust on a woman (Job 31:1). It is amazing that someone who lived');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 50, 27, 9, 'even before the Law was given, and centuries before the new covenant was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 50, 28, 9, 'established, could make such a decision, without a Bible, without the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 51, 1, 9, 'Holy Spirit, and without other brothers to encourage or challenge him!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 51, 2, 9, 'Job will rise up in the day of judgment and condemn this generation for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 51, 3, 9, 'its lustfulness and its sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 51, 4, 9, 'Joseph is another great example for you to follow. He was a young man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 51, 5, 9, 'living far away from his parents. And yet when he was tempted by a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 51, 6, 9, 'sinful woman day after day, he resisted her constantly and ran away from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 51, 7, 9, 'her, because he feared God (Gen.39:9).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 51, 8, 9, 'The examples of Job and Joseph show us that the fear of God alone is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 51, 9, 9, 'sufficient to keep us from this terrible sin of sexual lust and adultery');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 51, 10, 9, '. The fear of the Lord is the alphabet (ABC) of wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 51, 11, 9, 'If you "take heed to yourself", then "your progress will become evident');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 51, 12, 9, 'for all to see" (1 Tim. 4:15, 16).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 51, 13, 9, 'We are to offer to God a sacrifice of praise (Heb.13:15). Our praise of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 51, 14, 9, 'God becomes a sacrifice, when we give Him thanks in difficult');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 51, 15, 9, 'circumstances. The `good news'' of the gospel is that " Your God reigns"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 51, 16, 9, '(compare Isa. 52:7 with Rom. 10:15). And we can give God thanks in all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 51, 17, 9, 'circumstances, because He is always reigning, no matter what may be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 51, 18, 9, 'happening to us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 51, 19, 9, 'If the last days are going to be like the days of Noah (as Jesus said in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 51, 20, 9, 'Matt.24), then God must have men like Noah also in these last days too,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 51, 21, 9, 'who take a stand against sin and unrighteousness and who stand true and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 51, 22, 9, 'pure for God in this evil time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 51, 23, 9, 'You must continually fight the battle in the sexual area, until you come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 51, 24, 9, 'to total purity. There can be impurity even in the way you speak to a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 51, 25, 9, 'girl that can defile you. You must press on to be as pure as Jesus was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 51, 26, 9, 'in this area. It is written that the disciples were surprised when they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 51, 27, 9, 'saw Jesus once talking to a woman (Jn.4:27). That was His testimony. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 51, 28, 9, 'you are light-hearted and frivolous in your conversation with girls, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 52, 1, 9, 'cannot expect to win in the sexual area. So be careful.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 52, 2, 9, 'Going the Way Jesus Went');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 52, 3, 9, 'The "end of your life must be better than your beginning" (Eccl.7:8). We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 52, 4, 9, 'all began our life as innocent babies. To end up as better than that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 52, 5, 9, 'means not only being innocent as babies, but also being wise in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 52, 6, 9, 'understanding (1 Cor.14:20). But to get there you must be faithful in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 52, 7, 9, 'temptation. Wisdom in all matters is the goal that you must pursue');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 52, 8, 9, 'wholeheartedly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 52, 9, 9, 'On the cross, a number of things happened: (1) Jesus took the punishment');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 52, 10, 9, 'for our sins (1 Cor.15:3). (2) Our old man (the strong ''I'') was put to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 52, 11, 9, 'death. Therefore we consider it as dead every day and follow Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 52, 12, 9, '(Rom.6:6,11). (3) The world was put to death, so that money and all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 52, 13, 9, 'glory of the world is something that we are detached from (Gal.6:14).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 52, 14, 9, '(4) Satan was defeated, so that he can never harm us again. And we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 52, 15, 9, 'no longer afraid of him or anything that he can do to us (Col.2:14, 15;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 52, 16, 9, 'Heb.2:14). (5) Jesus became a curse for us there, so that we might never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 52, 17, 9, 'again be under the curse of the Law, but be blessed by God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 52, 18, 9, '(Gal.3:13,14).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 52, 19, 9, 'Many will be offended and fall away in the last days, because they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 52, 20, 9, 'not gripped by the way that Jesus went. You must be gripped by the truth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 52, 21, 9, 'of Jesus humbling Himself (coming down from the place of equality with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 52, 22, 9, 'God and becoming a servant of all men) if you are to endure unto the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 52, 23, 9, 'end. If you keep your face in the dust before the Lord always (as John');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 52, 24, 9, 'did on Patmos - Rev.1:17), then you will end your life triumphantly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 52, 25, 9, 'Increasing in the Virtues of Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 52, 26, 9, 'The only way to preserve ourselves from backsliding is by constantly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 52, 27, 9, 'pressing on and increasing in the virtues of Christ (See 2 Pet.1:5-10).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 52, 28, 9, 'I want to encourage you to have frequent "full-dress rehearsals" of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 53, 1, 9, 'Judgment-seat of Christ. In other words, present yourself before the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 53, 2, 9, 'Lord frequently and ask Him to judge you now. The promise is that " If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 53, 3, 9, 'we judge ourselves rightly, we will not be judged" (1 Cor.11:31). So ask');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 53, 4, 9, 'yourself the type of questions that you think Jesus will ask you on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 53, 5, 9, 'judgment-day. He certainly won''t be checking your doctrinal accuracy on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 53, 6, 9, 'that day! He will however ask you whether you fought against pride and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 53, 7, 9, 'selfishness and the love of money and dirty thoughts and whether you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 53, 8, 9, 'sought to love others. So concentrate on the subjects that are in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 53, 9, 9, 'syllabus for the final examination, and don''t waste your time on other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 53, 10, 9, 'subjects!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 53, 11, 9, 'Jesus was both a Lion and a Lamb (Rev.5:5, 6). When it came to matters');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 53, 12, 9, 'related to God''s glory and the purity of God''s house, He was like a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 53, 13, 9, 'fierce lion - as when He drove out the moneychangers in the temple, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 53, 14, 9, 'when He rebuked the Pharisees who were exploiting the poor in the name');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 53, 15, 9, 'of religion. But when it came to matters relating to Himself (when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 53, 16, 9, 'people spat on Him and called Him the prince of demons and falsely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 53, 17, 9, 'accused Him), He was like a lamb - silent. This is the example for us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 53, 18, 9, 'follow. Most believers however, are exactly the opposite - they are like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 53, 19, 9, 'lambs when God''s Name is dishonoured and when there is compromise in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 53, 20, 9, 'church, but they are like lions when anyone irritates them or insults');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 53, 21, 9, 'them. This is why we need to be converted - turned around, RIGHT SIDE');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 53, 22, 9, 'UP!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 53, 23, 10, 'Chapter 9 Chapter 9');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 53, 24, 10, 'Conscience and Faith');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 53, 25, 10, 'The fruit of righteousness is always sown in peace (Jas.3:18). If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 53, 26, 10, 'don''t have peace and rest in your hearts then you cannot sow any seed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 53, 27, 10, 'that will produce righteousness. This is why any unrest that comes into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 53, 28, 10, 'our hearts is always an indication that something is wrong - perhaps');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 54, 1, 10, 'some unconfessed sin, or a wrong attitude towards someone, or some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 54, 2, 10, 'anxiety about an earthly matter. Then you must seek God immediately;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 54, 3, 10, 'refuse to live by your feelings, put your will on God''s side, confess');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 54, 4, 10, 'your sin, forgive whomever you have to forgive, commit the cause of your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 54, 5, 10, 'anxiety to God, and come to rest. You must never allow any unrest to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 54, 6, 10, 'remain in your heart at any time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 54, 7, 10, 'Remember that "the anger of man will never accomplish the righteousness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 54, 8, 10, 'of God" (Jas.1:20).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 54, 9, 10, 'A good conscience and a sincere faith are the two buoys that mark the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 54, 10, 10, 'two sides of the safe channel in which the ship of your life should go.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 54, 11, 10, 'Those who ignore either of these buoys make shipwreck of their lives (1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 54, 12, 10, 'Tim.1:19, 20).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 54, 13, 10, 'So be careful to preserve the sensitivity of your conscience, at all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 54, 14, 10, 'times. Whenever your conscience is disturbed, you can be sure that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 54, 15, 10, 'have left the safe channel and are in dangerous waters. If you keep');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 54, 16, 10, 'going that way, ignoring the warning-bells of conscience, you will be in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 54, 17, 10, 'great danger of shipwrecking your life. So be very, very careful in this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 54, 18, 10, 'matter.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 54, 19, 10, 'Faith is the other buoy that shows the safe channel. Faith is the total');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 54, 20, 10, 'leaning of our personality on God, in absolute confidence in His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 54, 21, 10, 'unchanging love, His almighty power and His perfect wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 54, 22, 10, 'God''s unchanging love determines everything that He allows into our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 54, 23, 10, 'lives. Even prayer-requests that are refused, are refused by that same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 54, 24, 10, 'perfect Divine love.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 54, 25, 10, 'God''s almighty power will prevent any temptation that is too much for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 54, 26, 10, 'us, from ever coming to us (1 Cor.10:13); and it will help us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 54, 27, 10, 'overcome every temptation that does come to us (Heb.4:16); and it will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 54, 28, 10, 'make everything that comes our way to work for our very best (Rom.8:28).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 55, 1, 10, 'God''s perfect wisdom will never make a mistake in anything that He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 55, 2, 10, 'allows into our life - and He alone knows what is for our eternal good.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 55, 3, 10, 'You must never lose your total confidence in these three attributes of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 55, 4, 10, 'God. That is what it means to live by faith. Unfortunately, the phrase');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 55, 5, 10, '"living by faith" has been changed by full-time workers to refer to God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 55, 6, 10, 'providing money for their needs. But that is a wrong use of the word.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 55, 7, 10, 'The Bible says that all "the righteous shall live by faith" (Romans');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 55, 8, 10, '1:17). We must use Biblical words in the same way that the Bible uses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 55, 9, 10, 'them always.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 55, 10, 10, 'If we are careless in the matters of faith and a good conscience, we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 55, 11, 10, 'gradually develop an evil heart (a bad conscience) and an unbelieving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 55, 12, 10, 'heart (one that has lost faith). These can make us fall away from God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 55, 13, 10, '(Hebrews 3:12).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 55, 14, 10, 'To preserve us from such a falling away, we are told to exhort and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 55, 15, 10, 'encourage one another every day (see the next verse, Heb.3:13). So it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 55, 16, 10, 'good for you to listen to some exhortation from Scripture every day - by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 55, 17, 10, 'reading and meditating on the Scriptures, or by reading good Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 55, 18, 10, 'books, or by listening to messages, both in church-meetings and on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 55, 19, 10, 'cassette-tapes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 55, 20, 10, 'Reigning Over Our Thoughts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 55, 21, 10, 'In 1 Cor.15:24, we read that Christ will deliver up the kingdom to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 55, 22, 10, 'Father after He has subdued all rebellion and put everything under His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 55, 23, 10, 'feet. This is how He will do it in our case also. He wants to offer us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 55, 24, 10, 'up to the Father after He has subdued all rebellion within us and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 55, 25, 10, 'defeated all the lusts that ruled our bodies. The thoughts and opinions');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 55, 26, 10, 'that run riot within our minds must all be brought into subjection by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 55, 27, 10, 'the mighty weapon of the death of Christ that has been placed at our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 55, 28, 10, 'disposal (the power of the cross), before we are fit to be presented to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 56, 1, 10, 'the Father (2 Cor.10:4,5).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 56, 2, 10, 'The giants that roar like Goliath in our minds, in times of temptation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 56, 3, 10, 'have to be hammered and beaten until their voice gets reduced to a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 56, 4, 10, 'whisper and finally to nothing. God will encircle us with people and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 56, 5, 10, 'situations that bring us down and crush our self-will (if we cooperate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 56, 6, 10, 'with Him), until He triumphs over us inwardly. Then all our enemies are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 56, 7, 10, 'defeated. When you are weak in yourself, then you will be truly strong');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 56, 8, 10, 'in the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 56, 9, 10, 'It is good to spend a few minutes with God as soon as you wake up. A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 56, 10, 10, 'small amount of time like that can make a world of difference to your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 56, 11, 10, 'day. Cut out all other thoughts at that time. If there are cares and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 56, 12, 10, 'worries that come crowding into your mind at such times, then convert');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 56, 13, 10, 'those worries into prayers and leave them with God, and press on.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 56, 14, 10, 'Knowing God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 56, 15, 10, 'The greatest thing in the world is to know God. Because when we know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 56, 16, 10, 'God, we will know what to do in every situation that we face. We will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 56, 17, 10, 'also be bold to face life, even if the whole world is against us,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 56, 18, 10, 'because we know that we stand on firm ground. It takes time to know God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 56, 19, 10, 'So it is good for you to start now when you are young. In order to know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 56, 20, 10, 'God, you must be willing to consider everything in this world as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 56, 21, 10, 'rubbish, relatively. That means that the things that worldly people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 56, 22, 10, 'consider great must not only have no attraction for you, but seen as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 56, 23, 10, 'garbage! That is how it was for Paul (See Philippians 3:8). If we pursue');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 56, 24, 10, 'after money or pleasure or honour or greatness in this world, we will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 56, 25, 10, 'discover one day, in the clearer light of eternity, that our hands are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 56, 26, 10, 'filled with rubbish. We will discover then that we spent our earthly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 56, 27, 10, 'lives clinging on to rubbish, when God was all the time calling us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 56, 28, 10, 'possess His riches. So be wise - and only use the things of earth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 57, 1, 10, '(because we need them to live here) but never be taken up with any of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 57, 2, 10, 'them, lest you sell your birthright for a bowl of porridge.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 57, 3, 10, 'If God sees that you are serious about your Christian life, He will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 57, 4, 10, 'shake all that can be shaken in your life , so that you are not deceived');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 57, 5, 10, 'about your relationship with Him. He is jealous for your spirit. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 57, 6, 10, 'wants you to know Him personally and not in a book (the Bible) or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 57, 7, 10, 'through another person.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 57, 8, 10, 'Praise God for His love, that shows us our true condition, so that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 57, 9, 10, 'can rectify whatever is necessary, now itself. It is not enough that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 57, 10, 10, 'hate sin and keep ourselves pure. No. We must come into a deep personal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 57, 11, 10, 'relationship with the Lord Jesus. Otherwise all of our cleansing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 57, 12, 10, 'ourselves can become merely a ''Moral Self-Improvement Program''. To build');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 57, 13, 10, 'a close relationship with the Lord, first of all, you must be very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 57, 14, 10, 'careful to keep your conscience clear, by mourning for, and confessing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 57, 15, 10, 'any known sin, as soon as you are aware of it. Then you must cultivate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 57, 16, 10, 'the habit of talking to the Lord often during the day. Thus alone will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 57, 17, 10, 'you be able to stand, when everything around you crumbles and falls one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 57, 18, 10, 'day.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 57, 19, 10, 'This is my greatest longing for all of you, my sons - that you may know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 57, 20, 10, 'the Lord, for this alone is eternal life (Jn.17:3). It is this knowledge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 57, 21, 10, 'of the Lord alone that has helped me to stand undisturbed, and at rest,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 57, 22, 10, 'and above all, in love, when opposed and maligned by Christian groups');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 57, 23, 10, 'and pastors, both in India and abroad. I long that each of you will know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 57, 24, 10, 'the Lord in the same way - and in an even better way than I have known');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 57, 25, 10, 'Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 57, 26, 10, 'Tremble at God''s Word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 57, 27, 10, 'I am burdened to ask you to read and meditate on Proverbs 7 (in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 57, 28, 10, 'Living Bible) to keep you from girls who will lead you astray. There is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 58, 1, 10, 'a strong warning there - "The way to Hell lies through her house"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 58, 2, 10, '(v.27). It is a good habit to read some of those early chapters of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 58, 3, 10, 'Proverbs now and then (particularly chapters 1 to 9).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 58, 4, 10, 'Satan''s first scheme was to tell Eve that God would not do as He had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 58, 5, 10, 'said (Gen.3:1-6). He told her, " You shall surely not die". It was thus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 58, 6, 10, 'that he was able to lead Eve into sin. He tries the same method today');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 58, 7, 10, 'also. God''s Word says that believers who " live after the flesh shall');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 58, 8, 10, 'surely die" (Rom.8:13). But Satan says, " You shall surely not die". And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 58, 9, 10, 'most believers believe him and continue in sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 58, 10, 10, 'How many really believe that it is better to lose one''s eye, and be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 58, 11, 10, 'blind, than to lust after a woman; and that it is better to lose one''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 58, 12, 10, 'right hand than to commit sexual sin with it. How many really believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 58, 13, 10, 'that those who don''t take anger and sexual sin seriously will finally go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 58, 14, 10, 'to Hell (Matt.5:22-30)? How many believe that it is equivalent to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 58, 15, 10, 'shaking one''s fist at God to disobey His Word and to marry an unbeliever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 58, 16, 10, '(2 Cor.6:14)? How many believe that only the pure in heart will see God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 58, 17, 10, '(Matt.5:8)? How many believe that those who do not pursue peace with all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 58, 18, 10, 'men and sanctification will not see the Lord (Heb.12:14). How many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 58, 19, 10, 'believe that every careless word that they speak, they will have to give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 58, 20, 10, 'an account for, in the day of judgment (Matt.12:37). There are very few');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 58, 21, 10, 'believers in the world who believe these words of God. Such is the work');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 58, 22, 10, 'of deception that Satan has done in Christendom. As a result, most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 58, 23, 10, 'believers have lost the fear of God and the fear of His warnings. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 58, 24, 10, 'play the fool with sin until Satan has destroyed them thoroughly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 58, 25, 10, 'God looks at those who are broken in spirit and who tremble at His Word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 58, 26, 10, '(Isa.66:1, 2). We must tremble at every warning in God''s Word. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 58, 27, 10, 'the proof that we really fear God. It is only those who are perfecting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 58, 28, 10, 'holiness in the fear of God who will become a part of Christ''s Body');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 59, 1, 10, 'finally. Only those who overcome will be saved from the second death');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 59, 2, 10, '(the lake of fire) and will have the right to partake of the tree of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 59, 3, 10, 'life (Rev.2:7, 11). This is what the Spirit is saying to all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 59, 4, 10, 'churches. But those who have ears to hear are very, very few.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 59, 5, 11, 'Chapter 10 Chapter 10');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 59, 6, 11, 'Daily Renewal of Our Inner Man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 59, 7, 11, 'Our outer man decays every day. That happens automatically. It is God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 59, 8, 11, 'will however that our inner man should be renewed every day too (2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 59, 9, 11, 'Cor.4:16). But that does not happen automatically.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 59, 10, 11, 'Most believers are not being renewed every day, because they donot do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 59, 11, 11, 'the one thing that Jesus said we should do every day - take up the cross');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 59, 12, 11, '(Lk.9:23). To be renewed in the inner man is to partake increasingly of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 59, 13, 11, 'the life of Jesus within. This can come only as we bear in our body the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 59, 14, 11, 'dying of Jesus daily (2 Cor.4:10). Every single day has its allotted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 59, 15, 11, 'quota of troubles, trials and temptations (as Jesus said in Matt.6:34).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 59, 16, 11, 'It is in these trials that we are to bear the cross and die to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 59, 17, 11, 'ourselves, so that each temptation is made to yield some glory for us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 59, 18, 11, 'It is not the will of God that we live an up-and-down life (sometimes on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 59, 19, 11, 'the mountain-top, and sometimes in the dumps). He desires that our lives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 59, 20, 11, 'move consistently only upwards - the inner man being constantly renewed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 59, 21, 11, 'So we must steadfastly set our face to bear the dying of Jesus at every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 59, 22, 11, 'opportunity that we get every day. We cannot get Divine life from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 59, 23, 11, '''excitement'' of meetings and conferences. Many deceive themselves that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 59, 24, 11, 'they have become spiritual, because they were emotionally stirred at a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 59, 25, 11, 'meeting or a conference. But growth does not come from merely attending');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 59, 26, 11, 'meetings and conferences. Growth comes through faithfully bearing the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 59, 27, 11, 'cross in the ordinary grind of daily life. We cannot go to meetings');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 59, 28, 11, 'every day. But because we have temptations every day, we have the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 60, 1, 11, 'opportunity to be renewed every day.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 60, 2, 11, 'We must seek to live each day then without complaining and grumbling, in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 60, 3, 11, 'simple faithfulness to the Lord, in the daily temptations, recognizing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 60, 4, 11, 'that our lives do not belong to us (for us to do what we like with it),');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 60, 5, 11, 'but that our lives belong to the Lord, because He created us and He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 60, 6, 11, 'purchased us. Then we shall experience daily renewal. But just like the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 60, 7, 11, 'decay of our body is not noticeable every day, but only after some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 60, 8, 11, 'length of time, even so the renewal of the inner man also will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 60, 9, 11, 'noticeable only after a few years. But the renewal itself will take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 60, 10, 11, 'place every day, if we are faithful (2 Cor.4:16). So be faithful in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 60, 11, 11, 'little things and the big. You will realize in the end that it was worth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 60, 12, 11, 'it all, to have crucified your flesh (Gal.5:24), put God first, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 60, 13, 11, 'lived totally for Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 60, 14, 11, 'No Eternal Regret');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 60, 15, 11, 'Let me tell you the truth before God: I have never wanted any of you, my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 60, 16, 11, 'sons, to be great or prosperous in this world - for I see clearly that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 60, 17, 11, 'all that is garbage. I have only wanted you all to live godly lives and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 60, 18, 11, 'to build the church, and to fulfil His perfect plan for your lives -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 60, 19, 11, 'whether that be in India or anywhere else. I pray that God will enable');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 60, 20, 11, 'me to see my heart''s longing fulfilled.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 60, 21, 11, 'I see so clearly what it will be like in eternity for those who miss');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 60, 22, 11, 'God''s best in their earthly life. They will have millions of years of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 60, 23, 11, 'regret because they did not give the Lord their hearts, their bodies and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 60, 24, 11, 'their will completely - because they will see clearly in heaven how much');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 60, 25, 11, 'the Lord had loved them and all that He suffered for them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 60, 26, 11, 'Never forget your "purification from your former sins" (2 Pet.1:9), for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 60, 27, 11, 'it is only when you recognize that " you have been forgiven much, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 60, 28, 11, 'you can love much" (Lk.7:47). It will be easy to become a Pharisee, if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 61, 1, 11, 'you ever forget how much God has forgiven you, both before and after you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 61, 2, 11, 'were converted. Like Paul, I also see myself in God''s eyes as "the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 61, 3, 11, 'foremost of sinners" (1 Tim.1:15). I feel I was the most undeserving and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 61, 4, 11, 'the worst of the lot, when God picked me up and decided to give me a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 61, 5, 11, 'ministry. And I still haven''t done enough yet to repay Him for what He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 61, 6, 11, 'did for me.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 61, 7, 11, 'Here is a lovely poem of how it will be at the judgment seat of Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 61, 8, 11, 'for many:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 61, 9, 11, '"When I stand at the judgment-seat of Christ,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 61, 10, 11, 'And He shows me His plan for me,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 61, 11, 11, 'The plan of my life as it might have been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 61, 12, 11, 'Had He had His way, and I see -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 61, 13, 11, 'How I blocked Him here and I checked Him there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 61, 14, 11, 'And I would not yield my will.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 61, 15, 11, 'Will there be grief in my Saviour''s eyes -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 61, 16, 11, 'Grief, though He loves me still?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 61, 17, 11, 'He would have me rich, and I stand there poor,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 61, 18, 11, 'Stripped of all but His grace,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 61, 19, 11, 'While memory runs like a hunted thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 61, 20, 11, 'Down the paths I cannot retrace.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 61, 21, 11, 'Then my desolate heart will well-nigh break');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 61, 22, 11, 'With the tears I cannot shed;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 61, 23, 11, 'I shall cover my face with my empty hands,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 61, 24, 11, 'I shall bow my uncrowned head.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 61, 25, 11, 'Lord of the years that are left to me,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 61, 26, 11, 'I give them to Thy Hand;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 61, 27, 11, 'Take me and break me and mould me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 61, 28, 11, 'To the pattern Thou hast planned." (Annie Johnson Flint)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 62, 1, 11, 'Prayer and God''s Word - Weapons of Our Warfare ­­­­');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 62, 2, 11, 'You can change things that happen around you by prayer. Try it - and see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 62, 3, 11, 'what God will do for you. God is not going to restrain others from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 62, 4, 11, 'sinning - for He has given everyone a free will. But He will certainly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 62, 5, 11, 'prevent us from being tempted beyond our ability to overcome, through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 62, 6, 11, 'any of the actions of those others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 62, 7, 11, 'The hope that God has given us through the gospel is that we will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 62, 8, 11, 'completely saved from this wretched nature of Adam in our flesh that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 62, 9, 11, 'makes us serve the law of sin (Rom.7:25). When we mourn each time we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 62, 10, 11, 'fall into sin, that is a cry that God hears from us that we are sick and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 62, 11, 11, 'tired of serving the law of sin. Then a righteous God will one day');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 62, 12, 11, 'answer our cry and deliver us completely - as He delivered the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 62, 13, 11, 'Israelites from Egypt, when they sighed and cried out to Him (See');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 62, 14, 11, 'Exod.2:23-25).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 62, 15, 11, 'This hope is the anchor that our soul has "inside the veil" (in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 62, 16, 11, 'immediate presence of God), where Jesus has gone ahead of us as our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 62, 17, 11, 'Forerunner (Heb.6:19, 20). So we refuse to get discouraged. In all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 62, 18, 11, 'storms and ups and downs of life, our anchor holds in God''s presence. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 62, 19, 11, 'pray that you will have this anchor of hope to hold your life steady,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 62, 20, 11, 'when Satan attacks you in subtle ways.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 62, 21, 11, 'Whenever tempted by any fear or anxiety, it is good to quote some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 62, 22, 11, 'Scripture like, "The Lord has said, ''I will never leave you nor forsake');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 62, 23, 11, 'you ''"(Heb.13:5), or " When I walk in darkness, the Lord will be a light');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 62, 24, 11, 'unto me" (Micah 7:8). Jesus Himself overcame Satan by quoting the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 62, 25, 11, 'Scriptures. God allows us to be tempted in the area of fear exactly like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 62, 26, 11, 'He allows us to be tempted in the area of sex - so that we can overcome');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 62, 27, 11, 'it. Rejoice when you are tempted, for then you can get credit for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 62, 28, 11, 'passing one more course! And thus you will be able to be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 63, 1, 11, 'mini-forerunner for others in that area, in the days to come. Everything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 63, 2, 11, 'that God allows in our lives today is to prepare us for a ministry to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 63, 3, 11, 'others in the future.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 63, 4, 11, 'Think of the example of Eleazar, one of David''s mighty soldiers (2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 63, 5, 11, 'Sam.23:9,10). He defied the Philistines, when all the other Israelites');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 63, 6, 11, 'had run away. At the end of the battle, he could not open his fingers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 63, 7, 11, 'from the sword because he had been holding it for so many hours - " his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 63, 8, 11, 'hand clung to the sword" (v.10). When the other Israelites saw his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 63, 9, 11, 'victory, they came back. That is a good example for you to follow - to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 63, 10, 11, 'have God''s Word so stuck in your mind that you can''t lose it, and to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 63, 11, 11, 'stand with Jesus and hold on to territory (in your body) that was won');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 63, 12, 11, 'for God on Calvary. Thus you will challenge backsliders also to come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 63, 13, 11, 'back to God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 63, 14, 11, 'Partaking of God''s Glory');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 63, 15, 11, 'Satan has blinded even the minds of believers so that they are unable to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 63, 16, 11, 'see ALL that there is in the wonderful "gospel of the glory of Christ"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 63, 17, 11, '(2 Thess.2:14) - the good news that every part of our personality can be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 63, 18, 11, 'transformed into the likeness of Christ. The phrase, "the salvation of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 63, 19, 11, 'our soul" (1 Pet.1:9) actually means the transformation of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 63, 20, 11, 'personality (our soul) from its Adamic attitudes and traits to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 63, 21, 11, 'Christ-like character - not merely to external Christ-like conduct, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 63, 22, 11, 'to character that flows from deep within one''s personality - a genuine');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 63, 23, 11, 'change.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 63, 24, 11, 'We can hear challenging messages and be temporarily stirred. But it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 63, 25, 11, 'only when our eyes are opened to see the glory of becoming like Christ,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 63, 26, 11, 'that we will begin to take things seriously. There is a glory that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 63, 27, 11, 'can partake of, if we are faithful in temptation, as Jesus was. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 63, 28, 11, 'proof that we have seen this glory is that we will be quick to obey God,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 64, 1, 11, 'quick to humble ourselves, quick to apologise to people we have hurt,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 64, 2, 11, 'quick to flee from temptation and eager to seek for fellowship with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 64, 3, 11, 'godly. Believers who are slow and sluggish in these areas haven''t seen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 64, 4, 11, 'this glory as yet.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 64, 5, 11, 'All sin begins in the thoughts. Only much later does it become manifest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 64, 6, 11, 'externally. So, if we are unfaithful in our thoughts, one day we will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 64, 7, 11, 'slip up externally too. We can''t keep sin hidden inside our hearts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 64, 8, 11, 'forever. In the same way, the glory also becomes ours in our inner');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 64, 9, 11, 'thought-life first. It may take years before it becomes manifest in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 64, 10, 11, 'external life. This challenges us to live before God''s face at all times');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 64, 11, 11, '- and not to seek to impress human beings. But we must always be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 64, 12, 11, 'careful, for the Lord''s sake, to keep a good testimony before all men.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 64, 13, 11, 'You may often be in the place where you have to choose between the pearl');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 64, 14, 11, 'of greatest price and a pearl of lesser price. Satan may offer you a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 64, 15, 11, 'certain glory of this world if you will bow the knee to him just a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 64, 16, 11, 'little. Jesus too was tempted like that. There will certainly be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 64, 17, 11, 'something attractive to the flesh about the things that Satan offers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 64, 18, 11, 'you. But that is where the Lord will test you to see whether you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 64, 19, 11, 'willing to give up something earthly for His Name''s sake. It is easy for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 64, 20, 11, 'any activity to become an idol, if it takes you away from God. What you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 64, 21, 11, 'offer to the Lord must cost you something - and must never be something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 64, 22, 11, 'cheap. It is when you give Him something very precious that you prove');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 64, 23, 11, 'that you really love the Lord more than anything else in this world.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 64, 24, 11, 'Often, we don''t realize what a wonderful gift of God, good health is -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 64, 25, 11, 'until we see others who don''t have it. There are thousands of things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 64, 26, 11, 'that can go wrong with our bodies. And yet, in God''s marvellous grace,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 64, 27, 11, 'they haven''t gone wrong. Always be thankful to God for His grace in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 64, 28, 11, 'having given you a healthy body - one with which we can do God''s will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 65, 1, 11, 'and glorify Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 65, 2, 12, 'Chapter 11 Chapter 11');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 65, 3, 12, 'Seeking Our Own - The Root of All Evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 65, 4, 12, 'The crux of true Christianity is to deny our own will and to do the will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 65, 5, 12, 'of God. Where your own will crosses the will of God is where you will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 65, 6, 12, 'find the cross on which you have to die. That is the point at which your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 65, 7, 12, 'faith in God and your love for Him will be tested. Many believers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 65, 8, 12, 'satisfy themselves with attending meetings and with living a decent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 65, 9, 12, 'external life. But the crucial point, at which they can really discover');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 65, 10, 12, 'whether they are following Jesus or just being religious, is the point');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 65, 11, 12, 'of the daily cross. May the Lord help you in every situation to die to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 65, 12, 12, 'yourself. That is the way of joy and happiness and blessing and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 65, 13, 12, 'fulfilment and eternal life. Jesus Himself has demonstrated that to us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 65, 14, 12, 'by His life on earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 65, 15, 12, 'Paul said that he did not seek his own profit, but the profit of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 65, 16, 12, 'many that they may be saved, and then asked us to follow His example, as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 65, 17, 12, 'He was following Christ''s (Read 1 Cor.10:33 and 11:1 together). This, by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 65, 18, 12, 'the way, is one of the many places in the New Testament where the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 65, 19, 12, 'division between the two chapters is misleading and makes us miss a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 65, 20, 12, 'truth. (Some other examples of this are John 7:53 and 8:1; Rom.7:25 and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 65, 21, 12, '8:1; Heb.11:40 and 12:1-4; 1 Cor.9:27 and 10:1-5).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 65, 22, 12, 'It is possible for us to follow Jesus in certain specific areas, such as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 65, 23, 12, 'overcoming lusting, anger, bitterness, love of money etc., and yet not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 65, 24, 12, 'hit the root of sin in the flesh. Lucifer and Adam sinned - not by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 65, 25, 12, 'committing adultery or murder, or by backbiting or gossiping, or by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 65, 26, 12, 'lusting with their eyes. They both sinned by seeking their own profit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 65, 27, 12, 'and gain. This is the root of all sin - seeking our own.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 65, 28, 12, 'Only when the axe is laid to this evil root, will the fundamental');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 66, 1, 12, 'direction of our lives be altered. Until then, we can have victory in so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 66, 2, 12, 'many areas and still be seeking our own gain and profit and honour. This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 66, 3, 12, 'is why even many of those who preach victory over sin end up as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 66, 4, 12, 'Pharisees.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 66, 5, 12, 'But those who are serious about finishing with seeking their own, will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 66, 6, 12, 'find, like Paul, that they begin to seek " the profit of the many that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 66, 7, 12, 'they may be saved" (1 Cor.10:33). Paul speaks in the previous verse (1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 66, 8, 12, 'Cor.10:32) of three categories of people "Jews, Gentiles and the church"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 66, 9, 12, '- that is, those under theold Covenant, those under no covenant and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 66, 10, 12, 'those under the new covenant. He longed that they all might be saved. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 66, 11, 12, 'have the same three categories of people around us today - believers who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 66, 12, 12, 'don''t have victory over sin (old covenant), unbelievers (no covenant)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 66, 13, 12, 'and disciples of Jesus who are living in victory (new covenant). Towards');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 66, 14, 12, 'all these three groups of people, our attitude must be: " I don''t seek');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 66, 15, 12, 'my own profit, but their profit, so that they might be saved from all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 66, 16, 12, 'the sin that dwells in their flesh ." This was the attitude of Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 66, 17, 12, 'Himself, when He came from heaven.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 66, 18, 12, 'It is only when believers have this attitude : " I do not seek my own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 66, 19, 12, 'profit, but the profit of the many that they might be saved " - that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 66, 20, 12, 'they will be able to build the church as the Body of Christ. Otherwise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 66, 21, 12, 'even their sharing of profound subjects in the meetings will only be for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 66, 22, 12, 'their own honour.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 66, 23, 12, 'Jesus never sought His own. He always sought His Father''s glory. This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 66, 24, 12, 'alone is true spirituality - and nothing less than this. The ultimate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 66, 25, 12, 'purpose for which a person is living determines whether he is a godly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 66, 26, 12, 'person or a sinner - and not just the little victories that he gets here');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 66, 27, 12, 'and there over lust and anger etc. - although these are also important,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 66, 28, 12, 'because they also prove that one is not seeking his own pleasure. As');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 67, 1, 12, 'Jesus said, in another context, " These ought you to have done and not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 67, 2, 12, 'leave the other undone."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 67, 3, 12, 'Focus on God''s Grace');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 67, 4, 12, 'It is very easy for a believer to be ignorant of his true spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 67, 5, 12, 'condition, if he does not live before God''s face. This is clear from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 67, 6, 12, 'rebukes that the Lord gave to the leaders of the seven churches in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 67, 7, 12, 'Revelation. To the messenger (elder) of the church in Laodicea, he said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 67, 8, 12, '"You do not know that you are wretched, miserable, poor, blind and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 67, 9, 12, 'naked."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 67, 10, 12, 'God allows different situations to arise in our lives that will expose');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 67, 11, 12, 'what lies hidden in our hearts. Through the years we have stored many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 67, 12, 12, 'unpleasant memories in our hearts as a result of the difficult');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 67, 13, 12, 'experiences we have had with different people. They lie hidden at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 67, 14, 12, 'bottom of our hearts - and we imagine that our hearts are clean. Then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 67, 15, 12, 'God allows some small thing to happen, that stirs up all this rotten');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 67, 16, 12, 'stuff and brings them all into our minds. That is the time we must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 67, 17, 12, 'cleanse ourselves and forgive the people involved and decide to love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 67, 18, 12, 'them. If we don''t use such an opportunity to cleanse these things from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 67, 19, 12, 'our hearts, they will sink to the bottom again after the turmoil is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 67, 20, 12, 'over, and remain in our hearts. We can then imagine that all is well.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 67, 21, 12, 'But it isn''t so. Another small event can bring them all up to our mind');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 67, 22, 12, 'again. So we must cleanse ourselves every time something surfaces.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 67, 23, 12, 'We see in the case of the elder brother of the prodigal son, how he had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 67, 24, 12, 'a wrong attitude towards his younger brother. Yet this surfaced only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 67, 25, 12, 'when his brother came back and a feast was made for him. Then we see how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 67, 26, 12, 'he accused his brother with accusations that he imagined, without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 67, 27, 12, 'verifying whether his statements were true or not (for example, that his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 67, 28, 12, 'younger brother had "wasted his money on harlots"). When we don''t have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 68, 1, 12, 'good relationship with someone, we will always believe the worst things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 68, 2, 12, 'about him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 68, 3, 12, 'The father told his older son "All that I have is yours". Instead of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 68, 4, 12, 'being occupied with what his father gave him, the elder brother was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 68, 5, 12, 'occupied with his own accomplishments: " I never disobeyed any of your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 68, 6, 12, 'commands. I have served you all these years ". He was also occupied with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 68, 7, 12, 'the shortcomings of his brother, " This son of yours has wasted your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 68, 8, 12, 'money" (Lk.15:29-32). Like that father, God also tells us, "All that I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 68, 9, 12, 'have is yours". Everything that is in Jesus is ours - all His purity,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 68, 10, 12, 'all His goodness, all His patience, all His humility etc.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 68, 11, 12, 'The lesson we have to learn from this story is just this: Be occupied');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 68, 12, 12, 'always with the riches of God''s grace - and not with your own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 68, 13, 12, 'accomplishments, or with the failures of your fellow-believers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 68, 14, 12, 'Grow in Humility and Wisdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 68, 15, 12, 'We are so glad the Lord has opened your eyes to see the way that Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 68, 16, 12, 'walked all through His earthly life - the way of death to Self. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 68, 17, 12, 'can hold on to that vision until the end of your life, no-one can take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 68, 18, 12, 'away your crown (Rev.3:11). How I wish that all believers could see this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 68, 19, 12, 'glorious way that Jesus has opened for us. It would deliver them from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 68, 20, 12, 'complaints, criticisms, fears, tensions and every other evil. Satan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 68, 21, 12, 'would then no longer have any power over them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 68, 22, 12, 'I see Jesus as One Who always dwelt in lowly thoughts, right from his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 68, 23, 12, 'earliest days. He did not have to grow in humility - for He was always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 68, 24, 12, 'perfectly humble. He was just as willing to be classified with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 68, 25, 12, 'criminals at the age of 15 as He was at the age of 33, on Calvary');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 68, 26, 12, '(Isa.53:12). But there were newer and newer occasions for Him, as He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 68, 27, 12, 'grew up, to humble Himself, in the different situations that He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 68, 28, 12, 'encountered. That is what it means when it says that He grew in wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 69, 1, 12, 'He faced new temptations at each stage of His growth that He could not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 69, 2, 12, 'have faced at an earlier age. And as He overcame, He grew in wisdom -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 69, 3, 12, 'without ever sinning or doing anything foolish at any stage. We, on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 69, 4, 12, 'other hand, have to grow in humility as well as in wisdom, for we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 69, 5, 12, 'start-off as very proud people, having lived for ourselves for so many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 69, 6, 12, 'years. But we can now finish with all that folly of pride and high');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 69, 7, 12, 'thoughts, and grow in true wisdom - the wisdom that comes from humility.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 69, 8, 13, 'Chapter 12 Chapter 12');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 69, 9, 13, 'Power over Satan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 69, 10, 13, 'If the Lord Himself is not most precious to you, then a veil will come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 69, 11, 13, 'between Him and you, blocking your view of Him (2 Cor.3:14-16). This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 69, 12, 13, 'veil is basically "the flesh" (Heb.10:20). But in practical terms, it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 69, 13, 13, 'the attachment of the flesh to something of earth - some human being, or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 69, 14, 13, 'some material possession, or your profession etc. It could even be the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 69, 15, 13, 'Bible itself that can become a hindrance to your knowledge of the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 69, 16, 13, '(See 2 Cor.3:14). Bible-knowledge that does not lead to a growing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 69, 17, 13, 'devotion to Christ is a deception. It will foster pride and Phariseeism.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 69, 18, 13, 'God is jealous for your spirit (James 4:5) and seeks to preserve you in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 69, 19, 13, 'an exclusive love for Himself alone ("You must love the Lord your God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 69, 20, 13, 'with all your heart"), for only then can you love others in a pure way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 69, 21, 13, 'Otherwise even your love for others will be selfish.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 69, 22, 13, 'When we break bread together as Jesus commanded, we remember that it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 69, 23, 13, 'pleased the Father to crush Jesus (Isa.53:10). Because Jesus submitted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 69, 24, 13, 'completely to that crushing, He crushed Satan completely. That is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 69, 25, 13, 'way for us to go as well. So if you allow God to crush your self-will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 69, 26, 13, 'completely ( not your personality, for God will never crush that ), then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 69, 27, 13, 'you will have power over Satan, so that he is crushed underneath your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 69, 28, 13, 'feet (Rom.16:20). The reason why many do not grow in the Christian life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 70, 1, 13, 'or become overcomers over Satan, is because they do not allow God to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 70, 2, 13, 'break their strong self-will, at the times when they are tempted through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 70, 3, 13, 'people and through circumstances. Satan blinds them at such times, to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 70, 4, 13, 'the glorious fact that God''s will for their lives is as much better than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 70, 5, 13, 'their own choice, as light is better than darkness. You must always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 70, 6, 13, 'remember that you have been called to live on earth as those seated in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 70, 7, 13, 'the heavenly places with the Lord Jesus. That is how you will have Satan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 70, 8, 13, 'and all things under your feet.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 70, 9, 13, 'Whenever you drink the cup at the ''breaking of bread'', remember that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 70, 10, 13, 'have unconscious sins that need to be cleansed by the blood of Jesus -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 70, 11, 13, 'and for that, you must forgive all others first. You must walk in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 70, 12, 13, 'light God gives you, and confess whatever sins you are aware of. Then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 70, 13, 13, 'you will be cleansed completely (1 John 1:7,9).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 70, 14, 13, 'Remember also that Jesus shed His blood, resisting sin unto death');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 70, 15, 13, '(Heb.12:4). So when you drink that cup you are testifying that you also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 70, 16, 13, 'want to have the same attitude towards sin that He had.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 70, 17, 13, 'What we believe in our hearts must be confessed with our mouths');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 70, 18, 13, '(Rom.10:9, 10). The words you speak to others (whether in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 70, 19, 13, 'church-meeting or in private conversation) must always be words of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 70, 20, 13, 'faith, and never words of discouragement or unbelief. You must confess');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 70, 21, 13, 'your faith (and not your sins) in the meetings of the church. Many are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 70, 22, 13, 'unwise and confess their sins in the meetings. This is often done only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 70, 23, 13, 'to show that they are humble brothers. That is honour-seeking.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 70, 24, 13, 'Confession of your defeats in public will only glorify Satan! The words');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 70, 25, 13, 'you speak must always be words of faith and hope - that God will make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 70, 26, 13, 'things go better with you, even if things are not going well with you at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 70, 27, 13, 'the time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 70, 28, 13, 'By the word of your testimony you can overcome Satan, just like Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 71, 1, 13, 'did (See Rev.12:11). And so open your mouth and tell Satan boldly and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 71, 2, 13, 'confidently:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 71, 3, 13, '- that sin will not rule over you (Rom.6:14);');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 71, 4, 13, '- that God will never allow you to be tested or tempted beyond your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 71, 5, 13, 'ability (1 Cor.10:13);');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 71, 6, 13, '- that God will make ALL things work for your very best (Rom.8:28);');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 71, 7, 13, '- that God will never leave you nor forsake you at any time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 71, 8, 13, '(Heb.13:5,6);');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 71, 9, 13, '- that even if you fall, you will certainly rise (Micah 7:,8);');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 71, 10, 13, '- that Satan is a liar (Jn.8:44) who was defeated by the Lord Jesus on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 71, 11, 13, 'the cross (Heb.2:14),');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 71, 12, 13, '- other such words of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 71, 13, 13, 'Sons - Not Servants');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 71, 14, 13, 'God wants you to be a son and not a servant. A servant only thinks of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 71, 15, 13, 'the minimum that he has to do for his master. A son however thinks of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 71, 16, 13, 'the maximum that he can do for his Father. That is one of the main');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 71, 17, 13, 'differences between the spirit of the old covenant and the spirit of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 71, 18, 13, 'new (See Gal.4:7).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 71, 19, 13, 'In the Christian world, unfortunately, a ''servant of God'' is understood');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 71, 20, 13, 'as a greater person than a ''son of God''. This is ridiculous - for in no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 71, 21, 13, 'house does a servant hold a greater position than a son! Under the old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 71, 22, 13, 'covenant, the Israelites were servants, but now we are sons (Jn.15:15;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 71, 23, 13, 'Gal.4:7). All of us can now be true servants of the Lord, as His sons.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 71, 24, 13, 'God''s promise in the Old Testament was: " Those who honour Me I will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 71, 25, 13, 'honour" (1 Sam.2:30). Jesus expanded that to say, "If anyone serves Me,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 71, 26, 13, 'the Father will honour him" (Jn.12:26). And there Jesus explained what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 71, 27, 13, 'it meant to serve Him. He said that those who serve Him have to follow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 71, 28, 13, 'Him - and this meant falling into the ground and dying as He did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 72, 1, 13, '(Jn.12:24), and hating our life in this world as He did (v.25). Such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 72, 2, 13, 'believers become true sons who serve the Lord, and will be honoured by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 72, 3, 13, 'the Father (v.26). If we are really keen on being honoured by God, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 72, 4, 13, 'will gladly go this way. When Jesus spoke there of hating our ''life'', He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 72, 5, 13, 'was referring to our Self-life and our Self-will. Jesus also had a will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 72, 6, 13, 'of His own - but He hated it and never did it (See John 6:38). It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 72, 7, 13, 'impossible to follow Jesus if we don''t hate and deny this self-will of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 72, 8, 13, 'ours, exactly as He did. If we seek to preserve our Self-life and its');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 72, 9, 13, 'worldly interests, then we will certainly lose it one day. But if we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 72, 10, 13, 'willing to give it up completely now, we''ll get eternal life in its');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 72, 11, 13, 'place (v.25). Those who choose this way are the ones the Father honours.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 72, 12, 13, 'Humility and Maturity');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 72, 13, 13, 'I want to explain to you the difference between ''evil speaking'' and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 72, 14, 13, '''disagreeing''. Paul, not only disagreed with Peter, but also wrote about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 72, 15, 13, 'his disagreement to some immature Galatian Christians (Gal.2:11-21). If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 72, 16, 13, 'either Paul''s disagreement or his writing about the disagreement were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 72, 17, 13, 'sin, then one would have to accuse the Holy Spirit Himself of sin, in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 72, 18, 13, 'inspiring Paul to write such a passage of Scripture! On the contrary,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 72, 19, 13, 'that passage teaches us that God does not want any of us to be mindless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 72, 20, 13, 'zombies or cowardly compromisers, when it comes to the truths of His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 72, 21, 13, 'Word. My prayer is that none of you, my sons, will ever be a zombie or a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 72, 22, 13, 'coward. At the same time you must never be unloving to any human being,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 72, 23, 13, 'or rebellious to any God-appointed authority. God can never approve of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 72, 24, 13, 'those who judge His children or of those who rebel against His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 72, 25, 13, 'representatives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 72, 26, 13, 'I have left a number of Christian groups in my lifetime - because I felt');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 72, 27, 13, 'that they were limiting God and not preaching the whole purpose of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 72, 28, 13, 'But I was careful not to have an unloving attitude towards any of them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 73, 1, 13, 'That is the only thing you must be careful about. If I had not acted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 73, 2, 13, 'according to my convictions, just think what our fate as a family would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 73, 3, 13, 'have been. We would all have been in some dead denomination today! But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 73, 4, 13, 'disagreement must never bring disrespect. That is the teaching of Romans');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 73, 5, 13, '14 - which must become a reality in our lives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 73, 6, 13, 'I hope you can go to the meetings in the churches you are attending');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 73, 7, 13, 'there, with a spirit of humility, and ignore the probing questions that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 73, 8, 13, 'busybodies there may ask you to satisfy their curiosity. Don''t reply to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 73, 9, 13, 'any of those questions. We go to meetings primarily to meet with God;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 73, 10, 13, 'and if we go with humble, receptive hearts, God will certainly meet with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 73, 11, 13, 'us, and speak to us. But it is impossible to avoid meeting up with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 73, 12, 13, 'immature believers with their Pharisaic curiosity. Such people are found');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 73, 13, 13, 'everywhere. We must develop a mature attitude, and overcome the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 73, 14, 13, 'irritation that their words may cause, by ignoring them. There are some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 73, 15, 13, 'immature believers who are always eager to give you a spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 73, 16, 13, 'check-up, every time they meet you! You must ignore their questions and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 73, 17, 13, 'respond with wisdom and humility. The world is full of busybodies. To');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 73, 18, 13, 'escape them, you will have to leave this world and go to heaven! But you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 73, 19, 13, 'can be undisturbed by them, ignore their comments, and love them. Then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 73, 20, 13, 'you will be an overcomer. You must always find your security in God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 73, 21, 13, 'alone.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 73, 22, 13, 'Remember also that being honest doesn''t mean that you have to tell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 73, 23, 13, 'others about your failures or about the problems you are facing. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 73, 24, 13, 'would be as foolish as giving someone your detailed medical history,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 73, 25, 13, 'when he asks a simple question like, "How are you?" You can keep quiet.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 73, 26, 13, 'You have heard me say many times that the opinions of men are only fit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 73, 27, 13, 'for the garbage-bin. So don''t ever live to please men.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 73, 28, 13, 'Fighting a Good Fight');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 74, 1, 13, 'It was good to hear of your battles. A war consists of many battles. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 74, 2, 13, 'even if a few battles are lost here and there, that means nothing. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 74, 3, 13, 'war can still be won. In fact you will win. You must confess that hope.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 74, 4, 13, 'Those who honour God will be honoured by Him. People who are immoral and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 74, 5, 13, 'who live in sin around you will be agitated with you, because your stand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 74, 6, 13, 'for God and purity shows up their sin. Thus you become the light of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 74, 7, 13, 'world (Matt.5:16) exposing the darkness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 74, 8, 13, 'Both Mom (when she was a student in the medical college) and I (while I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 74, 9, 13, 'was in the Navy) had to take a stand for the Lord, when it came to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 74, 10, 13, 'attending parties - and we have both lived, not only to see God honour');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 74, 11, 13, 'us for the stand we took then, but also to thank God for preserving us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 74, 12, 13, 'in our youthful days from much sin, foolishness and backsliding.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 74, 13, 13, 'When our soulish feelings fluctuate up and down, we must develop the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 74, 14, 13, 'habit of speaking the word of our testimony to our soulish feelings and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 74, 15, 13, 'to our lusts and to Satan, confessing God''s Word, something like this: "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 74, 16, 13, 'God is still on the throne. My sins are all forgiven and cleansed. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 74, 17, 13, 'sees me now as if I have never sinned. The things that are visible are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 74, 18, 13, 'all temporal. All things will work together for my good. Satan has been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 74, 19, 13, 'defeated permanently on the cross. I will come out triumphant, no matter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 74, 20, 13, 'how many ups and downs I may face - because God is on my side."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 74, 21, 13, 'As Paul says, " We may be knocked down, but we are not knocked out" (2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 74, 22, 13, 'Cor. 4:9 - J.B. Phillips translation). We get up before the count of 10,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 74, 23, 13, 'and go on to win the war against Satan. We can lose one or two battles');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 74, 24, 13, 'and still win the war finally! Such an attitude makes our spirit to have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 74, 25, 13, 'a steady upward course, even though our feelings may go up and down. May');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 74, 26, 13, 'it be so with you at all times. Live in your will (in your decision to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 74, 27, 13, 'follow Jesus) always and never in your feelings. The direction in which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 74, 28, 13, 'your will is set, determines what you will become.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 75, 1, 14, 'Chapter 13 Chapter 13');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 75, 2, 14, 'An Adequate Response to God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 75, 3, 14, 'What is an adequate response to God in view of all that He has done for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 75, 4, 14, 'you? It is not enough that you just speak words of gratitude to Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 75, 5, 14, 'Romans 12 (the entire chapter) is the answer to that question. In view');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 75, 6, 14, 'of " the mercies of God", here is what you should do:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 75, 7, 14, '1. First of all, present your body to Him as a living sacrifice (v.1).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 75, 8, 14, 'That word `sacrifice'' indicates that it is going to cost you something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 75, 9, 14, 'to give your body to the Lord. Something has to be sacrificed - and that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 75, 10, 14, 'will be your strong self-will which wants to use your body - your eyes,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 75, 11, 14, 'hands, tongue and your senses and passions etc - to please yourself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 75, 12, 14, '2. Present your mind (v.2), to be renewed - that is, to look at people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 75, 13, 14, 'and circumstances the way God looks at them. Here is where you will have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 75, 14, 14, 'to cleanse yourself, from impurity in the way you look at girls, from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 75, 15, 14, 'bitterness in the way that you look at people who have harmed you, from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 75, 16, 14, 'partiality in the way you look at those whom you like and don''t like,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 75, 17, 14, 'and from unbelief, worry and fear in the way you look at circumstances');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 75, 18, 14, 'or the future. Always ask yourself, "How does God look at this person or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 75, 19, 14, 'this situation?" And cleanse yourself from every other way of looking at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 75, 20, 14, 'them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 75, 21, 14, '3. Don''t think too highly of yourself (v.3). It is the measure of your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 75, 22, 14, 'faith - and not the measure of your knowledge or your zeal - that is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 75, 23, 14, 'real gauge of your spirituality.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 75, 24, 14, '4. Fulfil your ministry with whatever gifts and talents God has given');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 75, 25, 14, 'you, to build the Body of Christ (v.4-8). Don''t bury it in the ground');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 75, 26, 14, '(in the world), as the man with one talent did. Be zealous in serving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 75, 27, 14, 'the Lord (v.11), and pray (=listen to God and talk to Him) frequently');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 75, 28, 14, '(v.12).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 76, 1, 14, '5. Hate what is evil, and cling to what is good (v.9). Doing the latter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 76, 2, 14, 'will help you to do the former more easily.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 76, 3, 14, '6. Love and honour all the brothers - for they are the younger brothers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 76, 4, 14, 'of Jesus (v.9, 10). Be good to them (v.13). Rejoice when it goes well');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 76, 5, 14, 'with any of them and grieve with those who are in sorrow (v.15). Have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 76, 6, 14, 'humble attitude towards all - especially towards the poor and the less');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 76, 7, 14, 'gifted ones in Christ''s Body (v.16).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 76, 8, 14, '7. Love and bless all men, especially those who do evil to you (v.14,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 76, 9, 14, '17-21). Live at peace with all, as far as possible. Never take vengeance');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 76, 10, 14, 'or desire anything bad for those who have been bad to you. Do good to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 76, 11, 14, 'them and thus overcome evil with good. The whole world is full of people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 76, 12, 14, 'who try to overcome evil with more evil. But evil can never conquer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 76, 13, 14, 'evil. Only good can conquer evil, because good is more powerful than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 76, 14, 14, 'evil. This is what Jesus demonstrated on Calvary . Persevere in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 76, 15, 14, 'tribulations that God sends your way and rejoice in the hope that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 76, 16, 14, 'are all designed to make you more like Jesus (v.12).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 76, 17, 14, 'It is in these ways that we prove to God that we are indeed grateful to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 76, 18, 14, 'Him for all that He has done for us, and for the richness of His mercy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 76, 19, 14, 'towards us in forgiving us again and again.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 76, 20, 14, 'Fullness of the Holy Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 76, 21, 14, 'If we were to draw a graph of our Christian life, it will have ups and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 76, 22, 14, 'downs in it. That is how everybody''s experience is. But the general');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 76, 23, 14, 'direction should be upward as the years pass by. We move slowly upwards,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 76, 24, 14, 'with ups and downs and with plateaus in between. Our falls become less');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 76, 25, 14, 'frequent, and the plateaus gradually become longer. The climbs are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 76, 26, 14, 'necessarily sudden and steep - although it could be so occasionally. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 76, 27, 14, 'generally the climbs are more gradual. But with those who don''t believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 76, 28, 14, 'in, or seek after victory, the graph will keep going downwards - because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 77, 1, 14, 'they do not fear God or believe His promises. However, it is impossible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 77, 2, 14, 'to depict our growth in God perfectly by any graph. Every graph is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 77, 3, 14, 'deficient at some point.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 77, 4, 14, 'Take sin seriously and mourn after every single failure. That way you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 77, 5, 14, 'will know that you do indeed fear God. As you have often heard me say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 77, 6, 14, 'the fact that we fall into sin is not as serious as the fact that we do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 77, 7, 14, 'not mourn after we fall into sin. If I have taught you to repent and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 77, 8, 14, 'mourn immediately after you fall into sin (or grieve God in any way)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 77, 9, 14, 'then I have done my duty to you as a father. I hope I have taught you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 77, 10, 14, 'that properly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 77, 11, 14, 'The widow who came to Elisha in her need (2 Kings 4) was told to borrow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 77, 12, 14, 'vessels from her neighbours and to pour out her small can of oil into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 77, 13, 14, 'them and fill them up. Thus she could clear her debt. She did that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 77, 14, 14, 'Finally her sons said, "There are no more vessels to be filled". Then we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 77, 15, 14, 'read the words: "Then the oil stopped flowing".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 77, 16, 14, 'The oil here is a picture of the Holy Spirit. And this is exactly what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 77, 17, 14, 'happens to many who experience the baptism (infilling) of the Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 77, 18, 14, 'They are genuinely filled initially. But then a time comes in the lives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 77, 19, 14, 'of many of them, when there is no more sense of need (no more vessels to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 77, 20, 14, 'be filled). Then the Spirit stops flowing through their lives. The empty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 77, 21, 14, 'vessels could represent the areas in our life where we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 77, 22, 14, 'un-Christ-like. There are many, many areas like that in all of our lives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 77, 23, 14, 'that need to be filled right up to the brim - and not just partially.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 77, 24, 14, 'In some areas, where you may have got victory over sin, the vessels are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 77, 25, 14, 'only partially full - for Christlikeness (or partaking of the Divine');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 77, 26, 14, 'nature) is far more than victory over sin. For example, there is a lot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 77, 27, 14, 'of difference between not having any bitterness against someone and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 77, 28, 14, 'loving him. The former is merely negative (victory over sin). The latter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 78, 1, 14, 'is positive (the Divine nature). In the same way, there is a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 78, 2, 14, 'difference between not getting angry and speaking good words that bless.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 78, 3, 14, 'Even so in many other areas. If we are satisfied that we have overcome');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 78, 4, 14, 'sin in some area, then we rest content imagining that " There are no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 78, 5, 14, 'more vessels left". Then the oil stops flowing - and we begin to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 78, 6, 14, 'backslide.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 78, 7, 14, 'We must live a life of constant repentance ourselves, and not judge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 78, 8, 14, 'others. Our duty is only to see that we always have empty vessels ready');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 78, 9, 14, 'to be filled. Only thus can we clear our debt (like that widow). Our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 78, 10, 14, 'debt is described in Romans 13:8 - "You owe a debt of love to all men".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 78, 11, 14, 'It is thus that we can be a blessing to others. Every situation is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 78, 12, 14, 'designed to save us from some area of Self and to make us a blessing to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 78, 13, 14, 'others. Others cannot be blessed through us, if our own empty vessels');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 78, 14, 14, 'are not filled first.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 78, 15, 14, 'Confidence before God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 78, 16, 14, 'God is a better Father than the best father on earth. So we insult God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 78, 17, 14, 'if we don''t believe that He will give us the Holy Spirit and all other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 78, 18, 14, 'good things when we ask Him (Luke 11:13; Matt.7:11). This is why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 78, 19, 14, 'unbelief is a terrible sin. Unbelief in prayer amounts to accusing God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 78, 20, 14, 'of being more evil than our earthly fathers. Many who pray to God don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 78, 21, 14, 'receive what they ask for, because they don''t believe. They are so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 78, 22, 14, 'occupied with condemnation over their past failures, that they feel that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 78, 23, 14, 'God cannot possibly give them anything. But the mercies of God are new');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 78, 24, 14, 'every morning (Lam. 3:22, 23). Each day God looks at us with no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 78, 25, 14, 'remembrance at all of even the sins that we committed the previous day,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 78, 26, 14, 'if we have confessed those sins. When we believe this fact, we will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 78, 27, 14, 'approach God with great boldness. There will always be those who take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 78, 28, 14, 'advantage of this goodness of God. But we don''t have to be in that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 79, 1, 14, 'number. We can be among those who are so grateful for God''s forgiveness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 79, 2, 14, 'that we want to live the rest of our lives to please Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 79, 3, 14, 'The greatest danger that we face is that of having a form of godliness,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 79, 4, 14, 'without the power for godliness (2 Tim.3:5). We face this danger more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 79, 5, 14, 'when we seek man''s honour. The power of godliness is the power to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 79, 6, 14, 'preserve our hearts in purity and love, in times of temptation and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 79, 7, 14, 'provocation. It is possible for us to cover up our inner failures with a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 79, 8, 14, 'veneer of speaking the right language and singing the right songs etc.,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 79, 9, 14, 'so that no-one even suspects that things are really bad in our hearts.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 79, 10, 14, 'We must hate this thoroughly. Although we don''t have to confess our sins');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 79, 11, 14, 'and failures to others, we must be careful that we don''t give others an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 79, 12, 14, 'impression of our spirituality that is not true.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 79, 13, 14, 'Perplexity in Prayer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 79, 14, 14, 'When we cannot understand why things happen the way they do, or when we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 79, 15, 14, 'do not get an answer to our prayers, we must do what Jesus did on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 79, 16, 14, 'cross. After He had prayed asking the Father, " My God, My God, why have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 79, 17, 14, 'You forsaken Me?", and did not get an answer from heaven, Jesus said, "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 79, 18, 14, 'Father into Thy hands I commit My spirit". This is what we should do too');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 79, 19, 14, '- commit our cause to Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 79, 20, 14, 'The widow, who kept on persistently asking the judge for justice against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 79, 21, 14, 'her enemy, finally got what she wanted due to her persistence (Luke 18).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 79, 22, 14, 'This is the evidence of faith. Jesus said, that when we ask God for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 79, 23, 14, 'something that we know is His will (e.g. forgiveness of our sins,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 79, 24, 14, 'victory over sin, the fullness of the Spirit, and the other things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 79, 25, 14, 'promised us in the Scriptures), we must keep on asking until we get it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 79, 26, 14, 'If we don''t get an answer immediately, we commit our cause to our Father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 79, 27, 14, 'in faith.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 79, 28, 14, 'Here is a lovely poem that I read:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 80, 1, 14, '"Games can''t be won unless they are played,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 80, 2, 14, 'And prayers can''t be answered unless they are prayed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 80, 3, 14, 'So no matter how busy or crowded your day,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 80, 4, 14, 'Make it a practice to take time to pray.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 80, 5, 14, 'And never start wondering if God heard your prayer,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 80, 6, 14, 'Or if He is able to take care of your care.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 80, 7, 14, 'Just tell Him your problem and be not dismayed,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 80, 8, 14, 'If His answer is sometimes deferred or delayed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 80, 9, 14, 'For God never hurries, yet He''s never too late,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 80, 10, 14, 'But He often tests us when He asks us to wait.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 80, 11, 14, 'And there is no problem too great or too small -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 80, 12, 14, 'God has the wisdom to take care of them all.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 80, 13, 14, 'Not always the way that we most want Him to,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 80, 14, 14, 'But always the way that will prove best for you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 80, 15, 14, 'We ask Him for pleasure, enjoyment and health,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 80, 16, 14, 'Laurel and honours and prestige and wealth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 80, 17, 14, 'But instead of a crown He sends us a cross,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 80, 18, 14, 'And instead of rich gains, we are made poor by loss.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 80, 19, 14, 'But great is our gladness and rich our reward,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 80, 20, 14, 'If we trust in the judgment and will of the Lord." (Helen Steiner Rice)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 80, 21, 14, 'Secure in the Love of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 80, 22, 14, 'We must find our security in the Fatherhood of God. When we pray to God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 80, 23, 14, 'for something that is for our spiritual growth or welfare - such as for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 80, 24, 14, 'grace or for wisdom or the fullness of the Spirit - and then feel that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 80, 25, 14, 'God may be reluctant to give it to us, because we are not worthy enough');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 80, 26, 14, 'to receive it, since we have failed so much in the past, we make one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 80, 27, 14, 'mistake and commit two evils:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 80, 28, 14, '(1) Mistake: We think that we can get God''s gifts by being worthy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 81, 1, 14, 'enough. We must be rooted and grounded in the knowledge of this fact');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 81, 2, 14, 'that even in a million years we will never be worthy enough to get even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 81, 3, 14, 'the least of God''s gifts. This is why we approach God on the basis of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 81, 4, 14, 'Jesus'' worthiness and not our own. This is the meaning of praying in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 81, 5, 14, 'Jesus'' Name. All the promises of God are Yes and Amen only in Him (2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 81, 6, 14, 'Cor.1:20).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 81, 7, 14, '(2) Evil No.1: Accusing God of remembering our former sins against us,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 81, 8, 14, 'when we pray to Him, and of not having done a good-enough job of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 81, 9, 14, 'cleansing our hearts, even though we have confessed our sins. This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 81, 10, 14, 'amounts to despising the power of Christ''s blood to blot out every trace');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 81, 11, 14, 'of every sin we have committed in our past life. It makes the guilt of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 81, 12, 14, 'our sin greater than the power of Christ''s blood. It implies that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 81, 13, 14, 'have been faithful to do our part (confessing our sins), but that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 81, 14, 14, 'Lord has not been faithful to do His part in cleansing them away. This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 81, 15, 14, 'is a terrible evil - so terrible that we must repent of it, and make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 81, 16, 14, 'sure that we never again accuse God of not being true to His Word.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 81, 17, 14, '(3) Evil No2: Accusing God of being less forgiving and less considerate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 81, 18, 14, 'than earthly fathers who know how to overlook many failures in their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 81, 19, 14, 'children and to give them good things despite their failures');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 81, 20, 14, '(Matt.7:7-11).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 81, 21, 14, 'Unbelief is such a great evil (Heb.3:12) that unless we see it clearly,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 81, 22, 14, 'we will go astray. Until we see unbelief as an evil, we won''t learn to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 81, 23, 14, 'hate it sufficiently. We must always see ourselves as having been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 81, 24, 14, 'accepted by God in Christ and as children securely sitting on our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 81, 25, 14, 'heavenly Father''s lap without a care in the world, because our Father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 81, 26, 14, 'has all our cares.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 81, 27, 15, 'Chapter 14 Chapter 14');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 81, 28, 15, 'Perfect in Mercy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 82, 1, 15, 'Jesus commanded us " to be perfect even as our Heavenly Father is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 82, 2, 15, 'perfect" (Matt.5:48). The context shows that He was referring to being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 82, 3, 15, 'loving and good to those who hurt us, or harm us, or speak evil of us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 82, 4, 15, 'The parallel passage in Luke shows that Jesus was referring to being "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 82, 5, 15, 'perfect in mercy as our Father is" (Luke 6:36). It is in this area of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 82, 6, 15, 'mercy towards others that we must strive for perfection.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 82, 7, 15, 'There are many things that we see at the cross where Jesus died, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 82, 8, 15, 'are a picture of how we also must react inwardly, when we take up our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 82, 9, 15, 'cross.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 82, 10, 15, 'The bread that we break symbolises a fellowship with Jesus in being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 82, 11, 15, 'willing to be broken quickly (like bread is), when we see that the will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 82, 12, 15, 'of God is opposed to our own will. The cup speaks of a fellowship with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 82, 13, 15, 'Jesus'' blood of the new covenant (which cries out to forgive others),');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 82, 14, 15, 'unlike the blood of Abel (that cried out for revenge) (Heb.12:24).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 82, 15, 15, 'The greatest sin ever committed on earth was the crucifixion of Jesus.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 82, 16, 15, 'It is clear to everyone that those who killed Jesus knew what they were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 82, 17, 15, 'doing. Yet Jesus assumed that they did not know Who He really was, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 82, 18, 15, 'so He prayed that they might be forgiven for they were ignorant. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 82, 19, 15, 'what it means to be merciful to others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 82, 20, 15, 'Jesus bowed his head and died on the cross. Then the soldiers came and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 82, 21, 15, 'tested him with a thrust of the spear to see whether he was really dead.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 82, 22, 15, 'This is how God allows us also to be tested - as to whether we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 82, 23, 15, 'really died with Jesus. God is the One who determines who crucifies us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 82, 24, 15, 'and who thrusts their spears into our side. Jesus not only never reacted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 82, 25, 15, 'to that spear-thrust, for He was really dead, but we also see that His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 82, 26, 15, 'blood - the blood of the new-covenant - immediately covered the spear.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 82, 27, 15, 'This is the way for us too. We immediately forgive the spear-thrusts of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 82, 28, 15, 'others, release them, and respond with the love of God. That is what it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 83, 1, 15, 'means to follow Jesus.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 83, 2, 15, 'Righteousness and Goodness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 83, 3, 15, 'If our righteousness is to surpass the righteousness of the Pharisees,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 83, 4, 15, 'our righteousness must be like God''s - full of goodness (Mt.5:20,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 83, 5, 15, '44-48). Goodness is more than righteousness (See Rom.5:7: " One will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 83, 6, 15, 'hardly be willing to die for a righteous man; although for a good man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 83, 7, 15, 'some may be willing to die "). Righteousness is like the bones in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 83, 8, 15, 'body and goodness is like the flesh that covers the bones. We must have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 83, 9, 15, 'all our bones - total obedience to all of God''s commandments. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 83, 10, 15, 'without goodness, we shall be like skeletons. Our inward obedience to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 83, 11, 15, 'God''s commands must be hidden, just as the bones are hidden in our body.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 83, 12, 15, 'It is our goodness alone that others must see. Jesus said in Matthew 6:1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 83, 13, 15, 'that we should not allow men to see our righteousness, but He said at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 83, 14, 15, 'the same time, that men must see our good works (Matt.5:16). Our aim');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 83, 15, 15, 'must be to manifest goodness to those outside the church, so that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 83, 16, 15, 'are drawn to Christ through us, and not repelled by our skeleton-like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 83, 17, 15, '"righteousness". Jesus manifested the glory of God " full of grace and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 83, 18, 15, 'truth" - flesh covering the bones. Sinners were repelled by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 83, 19, 15, 'skeleton-like righteousness of the Pharisees. Yet they were drawn to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 83, 20, 15, 'Jesus who had more bones (righteousness) than the Pharisees. There is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 83, 21, 15, 'something for all of us to learn from that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 83, 22, 15, 'Divine Power and Human Ability');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 83, 23, 15, 'Temptation comes to us as a thought in the mind. We must resist it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 83, 24, 15, 'immediately. But when we start out seeking for victory, we don''t usually');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 83, 25, 15, 'succeed in resisting it until we have indulged in it for a few seconds');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 83, 26, 15, 'at least. This is because of the way of life that we have been used to,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 83, 27, 15, 'for so many years. We must keep on battling until we get this initial');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 83, 28, 15, 'time-delay in resisting, down to zero! Where we have sinned, we must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 84, 1, 15, 'confess immediately and repent and mourn.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 84, 2, 15, 'It is not necessary to discern whether we are resisting sin in our own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 84, 3, 15, 'strength or God''s. So long as we are resisting sin, we are doing the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 84, 4, 15, 'right thing. It is difficult in such situations to determine whether we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 84, 5, 15, 'are using Divine power or our own human power. It is something like when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 84, 6, 15, 'we ask God to help us in an examination. At what point does supernatural');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 84, 7, 15, 'help come to assist us in that exam? It is difficult to determine that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 84, 8, 15, 'But it is not necessary to determine it. God''s power blends with our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 84, 9, 15, 'personality in such a quiet way that we are not even conscious of it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 84, 10, 15, 'It is the same when we seek to minister the Word in the power of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 84, 11, 15, 'Spirit. It is difficult to determine whether we are speaking with our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 84, 12, 15, 'natural ability or with Divine power. We should not waste time trying to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 84, 13, 15, 'analyse that, for it is impossible and unprofitable. So too in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 84, 14, 15, 'matter of victory over sin: The important thing is that we fight against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 84, 15, 15, 'sin and resist it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 84, 16, 15, 'Overcoming Sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 84, 17, 15, 'We cannot drive sin away from our flesh in Jesus'' Name. It is only the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 84, 18, 15, 'Devil whom we can resist in Jesus'' Name - and he will then flee from us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 84, 19, 15, 'But it is only for that moment that Satan flees (James 4:7). He will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 84, 20, 15, 'come back again later, as he did to Jesus (See Luke 4:13). Then we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 84, 21, 15, 'to resist him again.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 84, 22, 15, 'Sin however is different. Sin dwells within our flesh and we will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 84, 23, 15, 'tempted by it all the time, until the day we die.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 84, 24, 15, 'To avoid sin is also a way to overcome it. The Bible tells us to flee');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 84, 25, 15, 'from youthful lusts (2 Tim.2:22) and from immorality (1 Cor.6:18) - not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 84, 26, 15, 'to confront them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 84, 27, 15, 'When we find the pressure of temptation too much at any time and fear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 84, 28, 15, 'that we may yield to it, we must cry out for help immediately, just as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 85, 1, 15, 'Peter cried out for help when he was beginning to sink in the sea');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 85, 2, 15, '(Matt.14:30). This is what it means to run to the throne of grace for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 85, 3, 15, 'help. Your fleeing from sin and your struggling against sin are both a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 85, 4, 15, 'proof to God that you are determined to overcome sin in your life. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 85, 5, 15, 'God will help you mightily.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 85, 6, 15, 'Satan is always walking about like a roaring lion seeking whom to devour');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 85, 7, 15, 'next (1 Pet.5:8). He has already devoured so many. He is looking for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 85, 8, 15, 'those who are careless enough to lust with their eyes, and who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 85, 9, 15, 'bitter against others, and who are unrighteous. He marks such believers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 85, 10, 15, 'as targets to be devoured slowly. So we must always live in a healthy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 85, 11, 15, 'fear lest we fall.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 85, 12, 15, 'An athlete disciplines himself in so many areas. Even so, you must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 85, 13, 15, 'discipline your bodily desires, if you want to overcome against Satan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 85, 14, 15, 'and your lusts and finally win in this heavenly race. Paul said, " I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 85, 15, 15, 'discipline my body and make it to do what it should do, and not what it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 85, 16, 15, 'wants to . Otherwise after having preached to others I myself will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 85, 17, 15, 'disqualified " (1 Cor.9:27 - Living).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 85, 18, 15, 'In the sermon on the mount, when Jesus said that our righteousness must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 85, 19, 15, 'be more than that of the Pharisees (Matt.5:20), He spoke of three parts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 85, 20, 15, 'of our body that we had to be especially careful with - our eyes, our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 85, 21, 15, 'tongue, and our hands (Matt.5: 29, 22, 37, 30; See also Matt.12:36, 37).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 85, 22, 15, 'So be very, very careful to avoid sin with these three members');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 85, 23, 15, 'especially. These three members of the body are the ones that young men');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 85, 24, 15, 'sin with the most - and usually in the order that I have mentioned');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 85, 25, 15, 'above.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 85, 26, 15, 'These are the three bodily members that we must yield to God as a living');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 85, 27, 15, 'sacrifice, every day (Rom.12:1). That is the least that we can do in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 85, 28, 15, 'return for all that God has done for us. "Is that too much to ask?", the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 86, 1, 15, 'Holy Spirit asks (Rom.12:1 - Living).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 86, 2, 15, 'God has allowed Satan and our lusts to be so strong, so that we don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 86, 3, 15, 'ever imagine that we can conquer them with our own strength. We are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 86, 4, 15, 'compelled to seek for God''s power. The Israeli spies saw themselves as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 86, 5, 15, 'grasshoppers when they saw the size of the inhabitants of Canaan. Yet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 86, 6, 15, 'Joshua and Caleb trusted in God''s power and entered the land and slew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 86, 7, 15, 'those giants. We need that spirit to conquer ALL our lusts. So keep');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 86, 8, 15, 'saying, in faith, " I can and I WILL conquer Satan and all my lusts,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 86, 9, 15, 'through the power of God ".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 86, 10, 15, 'In every temptation, two roads are open to you - (i) the way of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 86, 11, 15, 'pleasure, and (ii) the way of suffering, where you deny the flesh the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 86, 12, 15, 'pleasure it is craving for. The latter way is the way of " suffering in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 86, 13, 15, 'the flesh " (1 Pet.4:1). As you keep on resisting and suffering, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 86, 14, 15, 'will finally become willing even to die rather than to sin. Then you "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 86, 15, 15, 'resist sin unto blood " (Heb.12:4). May the Lord encourage you to go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 86, 16, 15, 'this way until the very end.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 86, 17, 16, 'Chapter 15 Chapter 15');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 86, 18, 16, 'Balancing the Spiritual with the Academic');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 86, 19, 16, 'I am concerned that you should be level-headed and balanced as you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 86, 20, 16, 'mingle and fellowship with various Christian groups, for there can be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 86, 21, 16, 'Pharisaical tendencies among some of them. You must distinguish between');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 86, 22, 16, 'the soulish and the spiritual in Christians, or you will be carried away');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 86, 23, 16, 'and become Pharisaical yourself, like many of them. Learn to value ALL');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 86, 24, 16, 'of God''s children - including those in other groups than your own. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 86, 25, 16, 'way you will be saved from Phariseeism.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 86, 26, 16, 'In college, you must try and find the right balance between the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 86, 27, 16, 'spiritual and the academic - for God is the One Who has ordained both.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 86, 28, 16, 'He has not ordained that we spend all our time reading the Bible and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 87, 1, 16, 'attending meetings, but that we spend the major part of our time in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 87, 2, 16, 'secular, earthly occupations - whether working in an office, or studying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 87, 3, 16, 'in a college, or looking after home-needs as parents.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 87, 4, 16, 'So you can''t glorify God by merely going to many Christian meetings - if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 87, 5, 16, 'that is going to lead to your neglecting your studies and getting poor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 87, 6, 16, 'grades. To put God first is correct. But to put numerous meetings first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 87, 7, 16, 'is not necessarily correct. We should not equate God with meetings. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 87, 8, 16, 'must be realistic.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 87, 9, 16, 'Do your best (I don''t say "Do well", but "Do your best") in your courses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 87, 10, 16, '- for that is the best way you can glorify God for the amount of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 87, 11, 16, 'Lord''s money that has been invested in your education there. You cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 87, 12, 16, 'expect results beyond the level of your intelligence - and God Himself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 87, 13, 16, 'does not expect that either. But He certainly does expect you to work');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 87, 14, 16, 'hard at your studies - and in order to do this, there may be many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 87, 15, 16, 'meetings and even conferences that you may have to miss. Don''t think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 87, 16, 16, 'that you have to attend every single Christian meeting and every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 87, 17, 16, 'conference of your church there. Be balanced in your approach to all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 87, 18, 16, 'this.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 87, 19, 16, 'The Lord is dishonoured when any Christian does not put his heart and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 87, 20, 16, 'soul into getting good grades at college. If in spite of doing his best,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 87, 21, 16, 'a person gets poor grades, that is all right, for that depends on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 87, 22, 16, 'level of intelligence that God has given him. But laziness is different.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 87, 23, 16, 'God told Adam that he was to earn his living by the sweat of his brow.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 87, 24, 16, 'That is God''s appointed way for all of us - through hard work.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 87, 25, 16, 'Cultists teach people to neglect their studies, in order to be involved');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 87, 26, 16, 'in the activities of their cult. Stay clear of such cultism. It is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 87, 27, 16, 'kingdom of God and His righteousness that you must seek first, at all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 87, 28, 16, 'times, throughout your life. You must always be heavenly-minded and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 88, 1, 16, 'never earthly-minded. But remember that Jesus did a secular job for 30');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 88, 2, 16, 'years at home and in a carpenter-shop, and He was not going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 88, 3, 16, 'synagogue-meetings every day.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 88, 4, 16, 'If however, you are making too much of your studies and neglecting the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 88, 5, 16, 'spiritual, then I would give you exhortations in the opposite direction.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 88, 6, 16, 'The Holy Spirit speaks to us to turn right or left, according to which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 88, 7, 16, 'direction we are going off the straight path that Jesus walked in. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 88, 8, 16, 'Isaiah 30:21, we read, " With your own eyes you will see your Teacher');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 88, 9, 16, '(Jesus). And if you leave God''s paths and go astray, you will hear a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 88, 10, 16, 'voice behind you (of the Holy Spirit) saying, ''No, this is the way; walk');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 88, 11, 16, 'here .''" (Living Bible). We all need to hear that voice constantly to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 88, 12, 16, 'keep us balanced. Wisdom is to be balanced in all things.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 88, 13, 16, 'We are deeply thankful to God, as your parents, to see the wholehearted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 88, 14, 16, 'desire that you have for God and we want that fire to increase even more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 88, 15, 16, 'in the days to come. So everything that I have said above is only to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 88, 16, 16, 'enable you to be balanced, so that your zeal can be coupled with wisdom,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 88, 17, 16, 'so that you don''t shoot off on a tangent like some shooting-star that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 88, 18, 16, 'appears for a short while and disappears. We want you to be a star that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 88, 19, 16, 'keeps shining forever. For that, you must grow in a balanced way that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 88, 20, 16, 'will glorify God. We pray to that end and we believe God will help you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 88, 21, 16, 'There is no way to do well in college except by working extra-time,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 88, 22, 16, 'doing more than is necessary. This is where you should make full use of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 88, 23, 16, 'your off-days, including Saturdays. Studying just what is taught will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 88, 24, 16, 'not be enough. You need to do extra reading, solve extra problems and do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 88, 25, 16, 'extra computer-programming. And never hesitate to ask others (professors');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 88, 26, 16, 'or students) when you do not understand something. Remember also that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 88, 27, 16, 'all have a tendency to overestimate our understanding of a subject. So');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 88, 28, 16, 'it is quite possible that a lot of things you think you have understood,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 89, 1, 16, 'you really haven''t. You will never know until you work out some problems');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 89, 2, 16, 'in that subject, whether you have really understood it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 89, 3, 16, 'Protection from Media Influence');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 89, 4, 16, 'Let me give you a warning about watching TV programs. There is nothing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 89, 5, 16, 'wrong with watching news-programs and some sports events, in order to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 89, 6, 16, 'relax and to keep in touch with what is happening in the world. But most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 89, 7, 16, 'other TV programs are not only polluting to the mind, but also a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 89, 8, 16, 'tremendous waste of time that can hinder you from reading the Scriptures');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 89, 9, 16, 'and from spending time with God. So be careful not to be polluted or to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 89, 10, 16, 'waste your time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 89, 11, 16, 'Whenever you plan to watch TV, ask yourself first whether you have spent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 89, 12, 16, 'some time reading the Bible that day. And also ask yourself who is going');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 89, 13, 16, 'to run your life - the God of heaven or the god of this world?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 89, 14, 16, 'I read in The Cross and the Switchblade that David Wilkerson as a young');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 89, 15, 16, 'pastor once took a decision to cut out the two hours a day he spent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 89, 16, 16, 'watching TV and to spend that time in prayer, It was after one of those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 89, 17, 16, 'times of prayer that he saw a picture of some gang-members in New York');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 89, 18, 16, 'in a newspaper. The Lord gave him a burden to help them and thus led him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 89, 19, 16, 'step by step to have a worldwide ministry of bringing drug-addicts to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 89, 20, 16, 'Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 89, 21, 16, 'Only one who has been tested and found faithful in the little things of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 89, 22, 16, 'life will be faithful in the big things. I know this will be a battle');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 89, 23, 16, 'for you. But it is always a battle to possess ground that the enemy has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 89, 24, 16, 'conquered. However, in the long run, you will find that it is a battle');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 89, 25, 16, 'well worth fighting. And when you enter the presence of your Lord, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 89, 26, 16, 'will be glad that you fought this battle wholeheartedly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 89, 27, 16, 'May you be kept in this coming new year from worldly and polluting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 89, 28, 16, 'influences, and may it be a year in which you will have the grace and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 90, 1, 16, 'strength to say "No" where you have to, no matter what the consequences,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 90, 2, 16, 'and no matter who is going to be offended thereby. God will allow you to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 90, 3, 16, 'be tested in situations where it will become evident whether you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 90, 4, 16, 'seeking the praise of men or of God. May you come out with flying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 90, 5, 16, 'colours in every such test.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 90, 6, 16, 'Free From Guile');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 90, 7, 16, 'You wrote that someone told you that there would be only 144,000 people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 90, 8, 16, 'altogether in the Bride of Christ. Remember that the book of Revelation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 90, 9, 16, 'is full of signs and symbols (indicated by the word "signified" in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 90, 10, 16, 'Rev.1:1). So the number 144,000 in Revelation 14:1, is symbolic and not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 90, 11, 16, 'actual. The 144,000 refers to a relatively small number who "follow the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 90, 12, 16, 'Lamb wherever He goes" and "inwhose mouth there is no guile"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 90, 13, 16, '(Rev.14:1-5), compared to " the great innumerable multitude" who have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 90, 14, 16, 'washed their robes in the blood of the Lamb (Rev.7:9, 14). It is a great');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 90, 15, 16, 'testimony that we read about the 144,000 that they were "without guile"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 90, 16, 16, '(Rev.14:5-KJV). Guile is what fills our lives from childhood onwards. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 90, 17, 16, 'have deceived our parents in so many ways, we do sneaky things, and we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 90, 18, 16, 'give others an impression of our spirituality which is not true. All');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 90, 19, 16, 'this is evil and must be cleansed out of our lives altogether. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 90, 20, 16, 'why we must judge ourselves constantly. Otherwise we will never come to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 90, 21, 16, 'the place where we are totally free from guile, to be in that remnant.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 90, 22, 16, 'We must have a constant cry in our hearts to God day and night, as Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 90, 23, 16, 'said in the parable of the widow (See Luke 18:7 - " God''s elect cry to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 90, 24, 16, 'Him day and night "). We must have a cry like that widow for freedom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 90, 25, 16, 'from our enemy''s (lust''s) power, and for a life of purity and power');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 90, 26, 16, 'where we never lose the fire of the Spirit. We must fear even a single');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 90, 27, 16, 'sinful thought (whether of impurity, or hatred, or worldliness, or the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 90, 28, 16, 'love of money), more than we fear the disease of AIDS. God said at one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 91, 1, 16, 'time in Israel that there was no-one who " stirred himself to lay hold');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 91, 2, 16, 'of God " (Isa.64:7). Even Timothy had to " kindle afresh " the fire of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 91, 3, 16, 'the Spirit that was within him (2 Tim.1:6). God does nothing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 91, 4, 16, 'automatically in us, for that would rob us of our free will. But He is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 91, 5, 16, 'mighty to help us, when He sees the slightest desire within us, for Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 91, 6, 16, 'and for His best in our lives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 91, 7, 17, 'Chapter 16 Chapter 16');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 91, 8, 17, 'God Has a Perfect Plan for You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 91, 9, 17, 'We must trust in the Lord at all times as the One Who will help us: (1)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 91, 10, 17, 'to conquer every lust in our flesh, (2) to fulfil His purpose for us in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 91, 11, 17, 'every trial, (3) to be overcomers in every situation, and (4) to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 91, 12, 17, 'manifest the virtues of Christ in the face of every evil. Then we will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 91, 13, 17, 'never get discouraged.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 91, 14, 17, 'We are to be a living testimony to an unbelieving generation and to a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 91, 15, 17, 'compromising Christendom that we have a loving Father in heaven Who does');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 91, 16, 17, 'miracles for us. God has a plan for your life. As you honour Him, day by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 91, 17, 17, 'day, you will find that plan. At the right time, He will open the right');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 91, 18, 17, 'doors for you, in every area - for fellowship, for employment, for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 91, 19, 17, 'housing, and for marriage (when the time comes for these). Those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 91, 20, 17, 'honour Him get the best in every area, no matter what their grades in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 91, 21, 17, 'college are, no matter what influence or financial resources they lack,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 91, 22, 17, 'and no matter how much of a recession there is in any country.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 91, 23, 17, 'We are praying that you will have wisdom in everything you do. Folly is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 91, 24, 17, 'very prevalent among those in their teens and twenties. God''s grace');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 91, 25, 17, 'alone can keep you from making serious mistakes that can have lifelong');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 91, 26, 17, 'consequences. So you must live in the fear of God and with great caution');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 91, 27, 17, 'at all times.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 91, 28, 17, 'Don''t miss out on God''s plan for your life. I gave my own life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 92, 1, 17, 'wholeheartedly to the Lord when I was 19½ years of age. Now, many years');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 92, 2, 17, 'later, I can look back with joy that God could do something far better');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 92, 3, 17, 'with my life than I could have made of it myself, if I had done what "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 92, 4, 17, 'seemed right in my own eyes". It''s not that I have never sinned, or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 92, 5, 17, 'never done any foolish things, or never made any mistakes in all these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 92, 6, 17, 'years. I have done all of them - and I am thoroughly ashamed of my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 92, 7, 17, 'follies and blunders, as I look back over my life now. But God was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 92, 8, 17, 'merciful to me and He blotted all that out and led me on. I think He saw');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 92, 9, 17, 'that despite my blunders, I sincerely sought to do His will. He is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 92, 10, 17, 'rewarder of all who diligently seek Him, even if they make numerous');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 92, 11, 17, 'mistakes. I am sure the same goodness and mercy of God will follow you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 92, 12, 17, 'also, all your days (Psa.23:6).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 92, 13, 17, 'There are pleasant surprises waiting for you, as you seek to honour God,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 92, 14, 17, 'for "He is always silently planning for you in love"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 92, 15, 17, '(Zeph.3:17-paraphrase). That includes every detail of your future - both');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 92, 16, 17, 'earthly and spiritual. You can have God''s very best, if you determine to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 92, 17, 17, 'honour God every day of your life. We don''t plan our future as worldly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 92, 18, 17, 'people do. We have God working on our side and giving us special bonuses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 92, 19, 17, 'for us that we don''t deserve, even in earthly matters like employment');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 92, 20, 17, 'etc. So we are not anxious about the future at all. Like Jesus taught');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 92, 21, 17, 'us, we live one day at a time, free from anxiety and tension, just like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 92, 22, 17, 'the birds of the air. Praise the Lord!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 92, 23, 17, 'Paul did not even count his life as valuable, if only he could finish');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 92, 24, 17, 'his course with joy (Acts 20:24 - KJV). When parents put their little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 92, 25, 17, 'child into school, they look forward to the day when he will graduate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 92, 26, 17, 'from school. It is the same with God. He has planned a course for us in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 92, 27, 17, 'life. We must finish the course that God has allotted for us on earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 92, 28, 17, 'During our earthly lives, we may make mistakes and blunders and even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 93, 1, 17, 'waste time foolishly. But thankfully, they will only be like the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 93, 2, 17, 'mistakes that all of us have made in mathematics, where we got some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 93, 3, 17, 'problems wrong in school. God has a perfect plan for us - in major');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 93, 4, 17, 'matters like employment, marriage etc. But all of these can be fulfilled');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 93, 5, 17, 'only as we seek to fulfil His will in the area of holiness. If we pursue');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 93, 6, 17, 'holiness wholeheartedly, God will ensure that in all other earthly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 93, 7, 17, 'matters, His plan for our lives will be fulfilled.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 93, 8, 17, 'What is Revival');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 93, 9, 17, 'In the midst of much talk about revival in Christian circles, you must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 93, 10, 17, 'remember that:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 93, 11, 17, 'Revival is NOT noise and emotions.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 93, 12, 17, 'Revival is NOT zeal in religious activity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 93, 13, 17, 'Revival is NOT fervency or fluency in preaching.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 93, 14, 17, 'Revival is NOT exactness in doctrine.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 93, 15, 17, 'BUT');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 93, 16, 17, 'Revival IS giving up everything sinful and worldly for Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 93, 17, 17, 'Revival IS freedom from seeking our own.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 93, 18, 17, 'Revival IS humility that takes the lowest place.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 93, 19, 17, 'Revival IS freedom from Phariseeism.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 93, 20, 17, 'Revival IS power to overcome sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 93, 21, 17, 'Revival IS love for ALL of God''s children (Rom.5:5).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 93, 22, 17, 'Revival IS graciousness in speech.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 93, 23, 17, 'Revival IS a passion to live as a witness for Christ (Acts 1:8).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 93, 24, 17, 'Any so-called "revival" that does not make a person count this world and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 93, 25, 17, 'its glory and its greatness as rubbish, and that does not inflame him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 93, 26, 17, 'with a fervent devotion to Jesus, is a counterfeit revival.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 93, 27, 17, 'Wait for God''s Best');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 93, 28, 17, 'You are now a target of Satan, because he fears that you could be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 94, 1, 17, 'threat to his kingdom on earth in the days to come. I want to give you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 94, 2, 17, 'three bits of advice that can save you from Satan''s snares:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 94, 3, 17, '(1) Always remain humble. Keep your face in the dust before God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 94, 4, 17, '(2) Always remain in love. Keep your heart wide open to all of God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 94, 5, 17, 'children.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 94, 6, 17, '(3) Always remain in purity. Be careful in your relationships with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 94, 7, 17, 'girls.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 94, 8, 17, 'The third area is particularly important, because through the years,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 94, 9, 17, 'Satan has succeeded in tempting and trapping multitudes of young people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 94, 10, 17, 'into making the biggest blunder that any believer can make - marrying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 94, 11, 17, 'the wrong person. This is a blunder that God can certainly forgive, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 94, 12, 17, 'which even He can never undo or rectify. God may be merciful to such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 94, 13, 17, 'believers. But things can never be as good for them as they might have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 94, 14, 17, 'been if they had waited for God''s best. So it is good for you to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 94, 15, 17, 'recognize your lack of wisdom and to humbly depend on God. I cannot warn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 94, 16, 17, 'you strongly enough on this matter. Satan is after you. So stay close to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 94, 17, 17, 'God. God has wonderful ways of reserving the girl He has chosen for you,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 94, 18, 17, 'and of bringing her across your path at the right time. But He will also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 94, 19, 17, 'allow you to be tempted by others, before that time comes, so as to see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 94, 20, 17, 'what you choose.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 94, 21, 17, 'Adam had two trees to choose from, and he chose the wrong one, even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 94, 22, 17, 'though the other tree was also freely accessible. God tests us too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 94, 23, 17, 'Don''t make the same mistake that Adam made of going by what his eyes and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 94, 24, 17, 'his reason told him. Listen to God''s Word. That would have saved Adam');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 94, 25, 17, 'and that is what will save you. Esau sold his birthright for a petty (or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 94, 26, 17, '''pretty''!!) bowl of porridge that temporarily satisfied his sensual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 94, 27, 17, 'appetite. Years later when he saw things in a clearer light, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 94, 28, 17, 'regretted his decision, and tried to make amends for it, but it was too');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 95, 1, 17, 'late. We are warned in Hebrews 12:16, 17 that we should not be godless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 95, 2, 17, 'as Esau was.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 95, 3, 17, 'Some Godly Missionaries Whom We Will Meet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 95, 4, 17, 'Henry Martyn came as a 25-year old missionary to India in 1806 and died');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 95, 5, 17, '6 years later. But he made an impact on people in that short period and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 95, 6, 17, 'is remembered even today. When he was tempted to lust after the beauty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 95, 7, 17, 'of any girl, he would pray for her that she would be a pure and holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 95, 8, 17, 'temple of the Holy Spirit. He found it impossible to lust for her, after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 95, 9, 17, 'praying for her like that. Follow his example.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 95, 10, 17, 'Dan Crawford went to the interior of Congo in Africa as a missionary at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 95, 11, 17, 'the age of 18 (in 1888), and stayed there for 22 years. His father had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 95, 12, 17, 'died when he was just 4 years old, and so he had to leave school at an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 95, 13, 17, 'early age, to go to work in order to help his widowed mother and his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 95, 14, 17, 'younger sister. He used to share his lunch at the work-spot with poor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 95, 15, 17, 'labourers who were unemployed, and then share the gospel with them. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 95, 16, 17, 'saw his faithfulness in little things and gave him a great ministry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 95, 17, 17, 'later on in Africa.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 95, 18, 17, 'Robert Moffat went as a missionary to Africa in 1817 (at the age of 22)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 95, 19, 17, 'and laboured among the tribes there for 50 years and led many people to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 95, 20, 17, 'the Lord. He once wrote in an autograph-book:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 95, 21, 17, '"My album is the heathen breast,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 95, 22, 17, 'Where tempests brood and shadows rest,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 95, 23, 17, 'Without one ray of light.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 95, 24, 17, 'To write the Name of Jesus there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 95, 25, 17, 'And see that heathen bow in prayer -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 95, 26, 17, 'This is my soul''s delight."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 95, 27, 17, 'James Calvert left England in 1838 (at the age of 25) with his wife, to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 95, 28, 17, 'be a missionary to the cannibals in Fiji. When they reached Fiji, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 96, 1, 17, 'captain of the ship he was travelling in, tried to prevent him and his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 96, 2, 17, 'wife from going ashore, saying, "You will die if you go among those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 96, 3, 17, 'savages". Calvert replied, "We died before we came here!"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 96, 4, 17, 'One day we will meet these and other men of God like them, in heaven. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 96, 5, 17, 'that day, we should have no regret about what we lived for, during our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 96, 6, 17, 'earthly days. All are not called to be missionaries or full-time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 96, 7, 17, 'workers. And we don''t have to go to Africa to prove that we love the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 96, 8, 17, 'Lord with all our hearts. But we are all called to fulfil the perfect');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 96, 9, 17, 'will of God for our lives - whatever that may be and wherever that may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 96, 10, 17, 'lead us. " Obedience is better than sacrifice" (1 Sam.15:22).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 96, 11, 17, 'We must constantly preserve our devotion to Jesus, so that whenever we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 96, 12, 17, 'sing about His love for us on Calvary''s cross, it is never a stale');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 96, 13, 17, 'message, but always a new song (as it is for the dwellers in heaven -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 96, 14, 17, 'Rev.5:9). It is easy for familiarity with that message to make us lose');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 96, 15, 17, 'the wonder of "the love that sought us and the grace that brought us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 96, 16, 17, 'back to the fold" . When we begin to lose that wonder, we must recognize');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 96, 17, 17, 'that backsliding has begun, even though the external evidences of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 96, 18, 17, 'backsliding may become manifest only years later. The Holy Spirit alone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 96, 19, 17, 'can keep our devotion to Christ ever fresh. So keep " kindling afresh "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 96, 20, 17, 'the flame that God has put within you (2 Tim.1:6).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 96, 21, 18, 'Chapter 17 Chapter 17');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 96, 22, 18, 'Wisdom for a Balanced Life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 96, 23, 18, 'To find the right balance between spending time with God and doing our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 96, 24, 18, 'earthly tasks is the education in wisdom that Jesus had to get as a man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 96, 25, 18, 'in Nazareth, both while helping Mary as a young boy at home, and while');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 96, 26, 18, 'working in the carpenter shop. This is obviously something that no-one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 96, 27, 18, 'else can teach us. Otherwise, Jesus need not have spent 30 years');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 96, 28, 18, 'learning it. We can learn it only by denying our own preferences. One of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 97, 1, 18, 'the temptations Jesus must have had to face during His first thirty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 97, 2, 18, 'years must have been the temptation to go for prayer-meetings, or for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 97, 3, 18, 'spiritual meetings, when work needed to be done at home or in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 97, 4, 18, 'carpenter-shop. He overcame that temptation and learned wisdom - the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 97, 5, 18, 'right balance. Now you have to learn the same wisdom. And so God will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 97, 6, 18, 'allow you also to be tempted in the same way, so that you can learn the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 97, 7, 18, 'right balance too. Only thus will you be able to present to God a heart');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 97, 8, 18, 'of wisdom at the end of your earthly days (Psa.90:12).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 97, 9, 18, 'God watches over His obedient children with a jealous love and so He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 97, 10, 18, 'does not allow them to have an easy way through life. You will get God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 97, 11, 18, 'best every single day of your earthly life if you decide to honour God -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 97, 12, 18, 'for He honours all who honour Him. To honour Him does not mean attending');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 97, 13, 18, 'lots of meetings. It means keeping your heart pure, being loving and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 97, 14, 18, 'humble, and putting God first in every area of your daily life. You will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 97, 15, 18, 'then have the best future, of all the students in your college - both');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 97, 16, 18, 'here on earth and in eternity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 97, 17, 18, 'And finally, here is a word of the Lord to encourage you: " Your eyes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 97, 18, 18, 'have not seen nor have your ears heard, neither has it entered into your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 97, 19, 18, 'hearts the wonderful things that God has prepared for you if you love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 97, 20, 18, 'Him " (1 Cor.2:9).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 97, 21, 18, 'Living in the Light');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 97, 22, 18, '" He who is born of God keeps himself so that the Evil One cannot touch');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 97, 23, 18, 'him " (1 Jn.5:18). There is only one place where Satan cannot touch the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 97, 24, 18, 'child of God - and that is in the light. Satan is the prince of darkness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 97, 25, 18, 'and has been given all areas of darkness by God. If a believer moves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 97, 26, 18, 'into areas of darkness, Satan immediately gets power over him. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 97, 27, 18, 'why it is dangerous to have guile, to do sneaky things (that cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 97, 28, 18, 'stand the light), or to read, or say, or do anything that we would be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 98, 1, 18, 'ashamed of doing in the light, where other believers can see it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 98, 2, 18, 'Just as Satan is the prince of darkness, he is also the " father of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 98, 3, 18, 'liars" . And he is looking for "mothers" who will unite with him to give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 98, 4, 18, 'birth to lies! All who tell lies give room to Satan in their lives. All');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 98, 5, 18, 'children "go astray from birth telling lies" (Psa.58:3). We become');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 98, 6, 18, 'experts at telling lies, deceiving both parents and teachers by the time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 98, 7, 18, 'we reach our teenage years. By the time we get converted, our life is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 98, 8, 18, 'filled with guile and lying. These evils are what need to be cleansed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 98, 9, 18, 'out.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 98, 10, 18, 'If we don''t hate all lying and all guile, we will never stand with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 98, 11, 18, 'Lord on Mount Zion, for it is written of that number that " no lie or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 98, 12, 18, 'guile was found in their mouth" (Rev.14:1, 5). People are so foolish to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 98, 13, 18, 'give Satan power over their lives in this way. So be radical in this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 98, 14, 18, 'area.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 98, 15, 18, 'To be truthful does not mean however, that you have to reveal all your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 98, 16, 18, 'secrets to others. No. Even God has secrets that He does not reveal to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 98, 17, 18, 'everyone; and you are not better than God. So you can keep your secrets.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 98, 18, 18, 'But what you speak must always be the truth. And you must never seek to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 98, 19, 18, 'give others the impression that you are more spiritual than you really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 98, 20, 18, 'are. If others get that impression, on their own, you can''t help it. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 98, 21, 18, 'you must never do or say anything that gives others that impression.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 98, 22, 18, 'Remember however to be honest with us, your parents always, for we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 98, 23, 18, 'here to help you and to guide you aright. And you know that we love you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 98, 24, 18, 'and will always be loyal to you and keep your secrets.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 98, 25, 18, 'Proverbs for Young Men');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 98, 26, 18, 'Here are some verses from Proverbs (in the Living Bible) that are really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 98, 27, 18, 'good for all young men to bear in mind always:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 98, 28, 18, 'Proverbs 2:16-20: Only wisdom from the Lord can save a man from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 99, 1, 18, 'flattery of immoral girls; these girls have abandoned their husbands and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 99, 2, 18, 'flouted God''s laws. Their houses lie along the road to hell and death.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 99, 3, 18, 'The men who enter them are doomed. None of these will ever be the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 99, 4, 18, 'again. Follow the steps of a godly man instead and stay on the right');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 99, 5, 18, 'path.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 99, 6, 18, 'Proverbs 3:3-6: Never forget to be truthful and kind. Hold these virtues');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 99, 7, 18, 'tightly. Write them deep within your heart. If you want favour with both');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 99, 8, 18, 'God and man and a reputation for good judgment and common sense, then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 99, 9, 18, 'trust the Lord completely. Don''t ever trust yourself. In everything you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 99, 10, 18, 'do, put God first and He will direct you and crown your efforts with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 99, 11, 18, 'success.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 99, 12, 18, 'Proverbs 4:23-27: Above all guard your affections. For they influence');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 99, 13, 18, 'everything else in your life. Spurn the careless kiss of an immoral');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 99, 14, 18, 'girl. Stay far away from her. Look straight ahead. Don''t even turn your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 99, 15, 18, 'head to look. Watch your step. Stick to the straight path and be safe.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 99, 16, 18, 'Don''t be side-tracked. Pull back your foot from danger.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 99, 17, 18, 'Proverbs 5:3-14: The lips of an immoral girl are as sweet as honey; and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 99, 18, 18, 'smooth flattery is her stock in trade. But afterwards only a bitter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 99, 19, 18, 'conscience will be left to you, sharp as a double-edged sword. She will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 99, 20, 18, 'lead you down to death and hell - for she does not know the path of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 99, 21, 18, 'life. She staggers down a crooked trail and doesn''t even realize where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 99, 22, 18, 'it leads. Never forget what I say, young men: run from her. Don''t go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 99, 23, 18, 'near her house, lest you fall to her temptation and lose your honour and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 99, 24, 18, 'give the remainder of your life to the cruel and merciless; lest you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 99, 25, 18, 'groan in anguish and shame when sexually transmitted diseases consume');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 99, 26, 18, 'your body, and you say, "Oh, if only I had listened! If only I had not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 99, 27, 18, 'demanded my own way. Oh, why wouldn''t I take advice? Why was I so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 99, 28, 18, 'stupid? For now I must face public disgrace."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 100, 1, 18, 'Proverbs 6:20-29: Young man, obey your father and your mother. Tie their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 100, 2, 18, 'instructions around your finger so you won''t forget. Take heed to their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 100, 3, 18, 'advice. Every day and all night long their counsel will lead you and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 100, 4, 18, 'save you from harm; when you wake up in the morning, let their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 100, 5, 18, 'instruction guide you into the new day. For their advice is a beam of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 100, 6, 18, 'light directed into the dark corners of your mind, to warn you of danger');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 100, 7, 18, 'and to give you a good life. Their counsel will keep you away from cheap');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 100, 8, 18, 'girls, with all their flatteries. Don''t lust for their beauty. Don''t let');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 100, 9, 18, 'their coyness seduce you; for such girls will bring a man to poverty and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 100, 10, 18, 'it may cost him his very life. Can a man hold fire in his chest and not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 100, 11, 18, 'be burned? Can he walk on hot coals and not blister his feet? So it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 100, 12, 18, 'with the man who commits adultery. He shall not go unpunished for his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 100, 13, 18, 'sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 100, 14, 18, 'Proverbs 6:32-35: The man who commits adultery is an utter fool, for he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 100, 15, 18, 'destroys his own soul. Wounds and constant disgrace will be the lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 100, 16, 18, 'such a man.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 100, 17, 18, 'Proverbs 7:1-27: Follow my advice, my son; always keep it in mind and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 100, 18, 18, 'stick to it. Guard my words as your most precious possession. Write them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 100, 19, 18, 'down and also keep them deep within your heart. Love wisdom like a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 100, 20, 18, 'sweetheart. Let it hold you back from having affairs with girls - from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 100, 21, 18, 'listening to their flattery. One day I saw a simple-minded lad, a young');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 100, 22, 18, 'man lacking common sense, walking at twilight down the street to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 100, 23, 18, 'house of this wayward girl. She approached him, saucy and pert, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 100, 24, 18, 'dressed seductively. She put her arms around him and kissed him, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 100, 25, 18, 'with a saucy look she said, "I was just coming to look for you and here');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 100, 26, 18, 'you are! Come home with me and I''ll fix you a wonderful dinner, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 100, 27, 18, 'after that - let''s take our fill of love." So she seduced him with her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 100, 28, 18, 'pretty speech, her coaxing and her wheedling, until he yielded to her.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 101, 1, 18, 'He couldn''t resist her flattery. He followed her as an ox going to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 101, 2, 18, 'butcher, or as a stag that is trapped, waiting to be killed with an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 101, 3, 18, 'arrow through its heart. He was as a bird flying into a snare, not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 101, 4, 18, 'knowing the fate awaiting it there. Listen to me, young men, and not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 101, 5, 18, 'only listen but obey. Don''t let your desires get out of hand. Don''t let');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 101, 6, 18, 'yourself think about her. Don''t go near her. Stay away from where she');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 101, 7, 18, 'walks, lest she tempt you and seduce you. If you want to find the road');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 101, 8, 18, 'to hell, look for her house.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 101, 9, 19, 'Chapter 18 Chapter 18');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 101, 10, 19, 'The Flesh and the Old Man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 101, 11, 19, 'Jesus had a will of His own as a Man. but He never did His own will. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 101, 12, 19, 'crucified His self-will at all times, and so the Divine nature ruled His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 101, 13, 19, 'life. We are given the Divine nature when we are born again. But whether');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 101, 14, 19, 'that Divine nature within us is expressed or suppressed, depends on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 101, 15, 19, 'whether we crucify the flesh or not. This is the conflict between the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 101, 16, 19, 'Holy Spirit and the flesh, referred to in Galatians 5:17.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 101, 17, 19, 'Many confuse the flesh with the old man. The old man and the new man are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 101, 18, 19, 'the natures - the first is human (Adamic) and the second is Divine. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 101, 19, 19, 'flesh however is a storehouse of desires that tempts us. These desires');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 101, 20, 19, 'are like burglars coming and knocking (temptation) at your door (your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 101, 21, 19, 'will) in order to enter your house (your heart). The old, unfaithful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 101, 22, 19, 'servant (old man, Adamic nature) used to open the door for them. God has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 101, 23, 19, 'now put that servant to death (Romans 6:6), and put a new servant within');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 101, 24, 19, '(the new man, the Divine nature). The burglars (flesh) however remain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 101, 25, 19, 'the same. But if the new man doesn''t eat properly, he won''t be strong');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 101, 26, 19, 'enough to keep the door shut. Then the believer falls into sin, even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 101, 27, 19, 'when he doesn''t want to.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 101, 28, 19, 'Jesus "learnt obedience" as a Man (Heb.5:8), because He could not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 102, 1, 19, 'possibly learn obedience as God in heaven - just like kings cannot learn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 102, 2, 19, 'obedience. But Jesus did not have to acquire the Divine nature like we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 102, 3, 19, 'have to. He had that nature from birth. But because He faithfully');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 102, 4, 19, 'crucified the flesh, He grew in wisdom - that is in the knowledge of how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 102, 5, 19, 'to handle various situations and overcome various temptations as a Man.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 102, 6, 19, 'This is what is meant when it says: " Jesus learnt obedience". For');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 102, 7, 19, 'example: Jesus was not tempted in the sexual area until He was about 12');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 102, 8, 19, 'or 13 years old. So He could not possibly have learnt obedience or put');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 102, 9, 19, 'His self-will to death in that area until that age. But that doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 102, 10, 19, 'mean that He was impure in that area until then. No. He was always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 102, 11, 19, 'perfectly pure. A student may not pass in calculus until he reaches the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 102, 12, 19, '11th grade. But that does not mean that he failed in calculus. No. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 102, 13, 19, 'had not studied calculus until he reached the 11 th grade.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 102, 14, 19, 'Looking at Jesus'' life and comparing ourselves with Him and with Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 102, 15, 19, 'alone, is the only way to remain humble at all times.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 102, 16, 19, 'But we must also bear in mind that Jesus in His Person was always God on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 102, 17, 19, 'earth. That is why He accepted worship, which we cannot. For example: If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 102, 18, 19, 'you became an ant in order to help the ants, you would still be yourself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 102, 19, 19, 'as a person. But you would have all the limitations, temptations,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 102, 20, 19, 'resources and abilities of an ant. Your person would not change, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 102, 21, 19, 'your capabilities would.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 102, 22, 19, 'It is best not to analyse the nature of Jesus. It is enough to know that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 102, 23, 19, 'He was tempted like us and overcame - and we can follow in His steps and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 102, 24, 19, 'overcome too. We can digest our food even if we cannot explain how our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 102, 25, 19, 'digestive system works. Those who analyse these matters go astray into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 102, 26, 19, 'error. All you need to do is flee from temptation and obey God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 102, 27, 19, 'commandments.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 102, 28, 19, 'Humility and the Fear Of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 103, 1, 19, 'Humility and the fear of God always go together (See Prov.22:4). The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 103, 2, 19, 'mark of a genuinely humble person is that he fears God as well. And the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 103, 3, 19, 'proof that we genuinely fear God is that we will have low thoughts about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 103, 4, 19, 'ourselves.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 103, 5, 19, 'Jesus was filled with the Spirit of the fear of God, and this made Him "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 103, 6, 19, 'quick of scent in the fear of God, so that He never judged by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 103, 7, 19, 'impressions that He received through what He saw and heard " (Isa.11:2,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 103, 8, 19, '3). When we are not humble and do not fear God, we will be quick to form');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 103, 9, 19, '(and even to express) opinions about other people and about various');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 103, 10, 19, 'situations, which we have either heard of, or seen. One mark of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 103, 11, 19, 'godliness is that we are "quick to hear and slow to speak" (Jas.1:19),');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 103, 12, 19, 'and even slower to form an opinion, and almost totally unwilling to give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 103, 13, 19, 'an opinion, until we have first heard what God has to say to us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 103, 14, 19, 'If you are very keen on doing something, you can easily deceive yourself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 103, 15, 19, 'that it is the will of God, by praying about it briefly just to ease');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 103, 16, 19, 'your conscience, and then saying to yourself that you feel "at peace in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 103, 17, 19, 'your heart" about doing it - and go ahead and do it! That way you can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 103, 18, 19, 'miss the will of God completely. Remember: The more important the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 103, 19, 19, 'decision you have to make, the more you must wait on God before you act.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 103, 20, 19, 'And do consult us, your parents, before you finally decide.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 103, 21, 19, 'Discipline of Listening to God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 103, 22, 19, 'The flesh is basically lazy and pleasure-loving and comfort-loving.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 103, 23, 19, 'Don''t be deceived by it. You must refuse the impressions that come to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 103, 24, 19, 'you through your senses, when seeking to find God''s will. There is as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 103, 25, 19, 'much difference between your way of thinking and God''s thoughts as there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 103, 26, 19, 'is between earth and heaven (Isa.55:8, 9). God''s way of doing things is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 103, 27, 19, 'far higher than yours. That is why God wants you to submit to Him - to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 103, 28, 19, 'get his best.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 104, 1, 19, 'As a student at college, you may not have much time to spend in prayer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 104, 2, 19, 'But you must have the attitude of waiting on the Lord in making your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 104, 3, 19, 'decisions. And so discipline yourself to spend a few minutes with God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 104, 4, 19, 'every day - preferably first thing in the morning. If that is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 104, 5, 19, 'possible in the morning, then at some time during the day. Otherwise,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 104, 6, 19, 'the impressions that you get can lead you astray from God''s will for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 104, 7, 19, 'your life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 104, 8, 19, 'God wants to communicate with you every day. This is the message that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 104, 9, 19, 'comes across from the first page of the Bible, where it says: " On the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 104, 10, 19, 'first day, God spoke.... On the second day, God spoke.......On the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 104, 11, 19, 'third,........fourth,........fifth and sixth days, God spoke ".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 104, 12, 19, 'Something happened each day when God spoke and the final result was "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 104, 13, 19, 'Very Good". So can it be with your life too, if you listen to God every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 104, 14, 19, 'day. Jesus said, " Man shall live by every word that proceeds from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 104, 15, 19, 'mouth of God" (Matt.4:3). If you do not put God first in your life every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 104, 16, 19, 'day, it will be very easy to backslide.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 104, 17, 19, 'By "hearing God", I don''t mean reading the Bible, but rather listening');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 104, 18, 19, 'to the voice of the Holy Spirit within your conscience throughout the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 104, 19, 19, 'day, so that you do what pleases Him and avoid anything that displeases');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 104, 20, 19, 'Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 104, 21, 19, 'God always wants to answer our prayers. But we must earnestly wait on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 104, 22, 19, 'Him for an answer. Sometimes his answer may be ''''No." Sometimes it may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 104, 23, 19, 'be "Wait". Like the red, yellow and green traffic lights, God''s answer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 104, 24, 19, 'may be "No", "Wait" or "Yes".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 104, 25, 19, 'Our spiritual ears can also become deaf if we " lay heavy burdens on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 104, 26, 19, 'others (make demands on them), or point accusing fingers at others, or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 104, 27, 19, 'speak evil of others " (See Isa.58:9). We must avoid these evils. Then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 104, 28, 19, 'we will be able to hear God clearly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 105, 1, 19, 'Prayer is not only speaking to God but listening to Him as well. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 105, 2, 19, 'listening is more important than speaking to Him. Consider: If you were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 105, 3, 19, 'speaking with an older and more godly person on the phone, you would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 105, 4, 19, 'listen much more than you speak. So must it be in true prayer - you must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 105, 5, 19, 'listen to God much more than you speak to Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 105, 6, 20, 'Chapter 19 Chapter 19');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 105, 7, 20, 'Friendship, Counselling and Conversations');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 105, 8, 20, 'When moving with your friends you must have the courage to break away');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 105, 9, 20, 'from them if you discover that they are going to questionable places.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 105, 10, 20, 'Even if that means having to be alone in your room, break away from such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 105, 11, 20, 'friends at the right time. Ask God for the courage to say "No" to them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 105, 12, 20, 'Most young people have no restraint when they are on their own. So be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 105, 13, 20, 'careful of the company you keep.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 105, 14, 20, 'In Titus 2:6 (Living Bible), we read two exhortations given to young');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 105, 15, 20, 'men: "(1) Behave wisely and (2) Take life seriously". Keep those two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 105, 16, 20, 'exhortations in your mind at all times. The shallow, jovial life that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 105, 17, 20, 'most "Christian" young people live nowadays, with a superficial dash of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 105, 18, 20, 'religiosity, is going to bring them a lot of regret in eternity. Don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 105, 19, 20, 'be influenced by the standards of the Christians around you. You must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 105, 20, 20, 'influence them to greater seriousness, greater sacrifice, and greater');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 105, 21, 20, 'godliness. Take this seriously.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 105, 22, 20, 'Don''t waste your time trying to convince people who do not want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 105, 23, 20, 'accept the standards of God''s Word. Those who want to do their own will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 105, 24, 20, 'and seek their own happiness are doomed to a life of misery on earth and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 105, 25, 20, 'to hell thereafter. We cannot force such people to give up their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 105, 26, 20, 'self-willed ways. What they are seeking for is sanction for their sinful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 105, 27, 20, 'ways. Their unwillingness to accept what God''s Word teaches is due to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 105, 28, 20, 'the low standards in the churches, which has resulted in people growing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 106, 1, 20, 'up without any fear of God. Unless disobedience to God''s Word is seen as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 106, 2, 20, 'utterly evil and Satanic, people will play around with sin forever.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 106, 3, 20, 'Those who are sincere however will be delivered by God from the clutches');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 106, 4, 20, 'of the Evil One. The others will be destroyed by Satan.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 106, 5, 20, 'Be wise in your conversations with people - especially with Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 106, 6, 20, 'Pharisees! Steer clear of all useless conversation. Some people may be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 106, 7, 20, 'eager to know private details about you and your family. Don''t satisfy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 106, 8, 20, 'their curiosity. Just tell them, "I would rather not talk about those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 106, 9, 20, 'things". Jesus told us to be " harmless as doves as well as wise as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 106, 10, 20, 'serpents".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 106, 11, 20, 'And never counsel girls . Seek fellowship with brothers more than with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 106, 12, 20, 'sisters.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 106, 13, 20, 'Beware of those who may try to trap you in some way. Be careful what you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 106, 14, 20, 'write in your letters. People can preserve your letters and even accuse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 106, 15, 20, 'you with them one day, if they fall out with you. Don''t be gullible. Be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 106, 16, 20, 'careful in every matter.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 106, 17, 20, 'I am concerned that in your pursuit of your degree, you should not miss');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 106, 18, 20, 'out spiritually. Your Christian faith must never be relegated to a mere');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 106, 19, 20, 'appendix in your life. It must always be central to everything that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 106, 20, 20, 'do. Most believers today do their own thing most of the time and attach');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 106, 21, 20, 'a little bit of religion to their lives on Sundays, to ease their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 106, 22, 20, 'conscience. Thus they feel that they have given God His due. What an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 106, 23, 20, 'insult that is to the One Who gave everything for us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 106, 24, 20, 'You must live each day remembering that you will one day have either joy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 106, 25, 20, 'or regret over the decisions that you made that day, the priorities that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 106, 26, 20, 'you set for your life that day, and the information that you allowed to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 106, 27, 20, 'enter into your mind that day (particularly through your eyes, through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 106, 28, 20, 'TV etc.). Read your Bible every day, and let your room-mates in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 107, 1, 20, 'hostel see that you are different from them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 107, 2, 20, '"Live in the fear of the Lord the whole day long" (Prov.23:17-KJV).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 107, 3, 20, 'Don''t have lifelong regrets because of one careless slip-up somewhere.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 107, 4, 20, 'We, as your parents, want to see you wholehearted for the Lord always.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 107, 5, 20, 'That is our only desire and longing and we pray for that constantly. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 107, 6, 20, 'believe that God will hear our prayers and answer us. We have no desire');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 107, 7, 20, 'to see any of you rich or famous or accomplishing anything great in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 107, 8, 20, 'eyes of this world. We only want to see you as flaming witnesses for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 107, 9, 20, 'Jesus always.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 107, 10, 20, 'Another Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 107, 11, 20, 'Paul said that he gained Christ only after he had given up everything in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 107, 12, 20, 'this world and counted it all as "rubbish" (Phil.3:8). Jesus said that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 107, 13, 20, 'in order to buy the pearl of great price, the merchant had to sell all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 107, 14, 20, 'that he had (Mt.13:46). How then have many "Christians" today managed to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 107, 15, 20, 'gain Christ without giving up their attachment to everything worldly?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 107, 16, 20, 'Many "believers" today retain their worldly ambitions and their love for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 107, 17, 20, 'pleasure and ease and comfort and still claim to have gained Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 107, 18, 20, 'That must then be " another Jesus" that they gained (2 Cor. 11:4) - and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 107, 19, 20, 'not the One that Paul gained. All the great things that this world');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 107, 20, 20, 'offers are rubbish compared to Christ. My prayer for you is that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 107, 21, 20, 'will see this clearly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 107, 22, 20, 'Never esteem any of the following as great in God''s eyes: Your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 107, 23, 20, 'intelligence, your health, your good looks, your gifts and abilities,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 107, 24, 20, 'your studying in a good college, your academic accomplishments, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 107, 25, 20, 'esteem in which others hold you etc. Think of the people who are not as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 107, 26, 20, 'clever or smart as you or who have not had the opportunities you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 107, 27, 20, 'had. Remember that you are no better in God''s eyes than any of them. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 107, 28, 20, 'only thing of value that you have is the measure in which you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 108, 1, 20, 'partaken of the Divine nature. I pray that you will be gripped by this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 108, 2, 20, 'truth all your days.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 108, 3, 20, 'Enduring Faith');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 108, 4, 20, 'Without faith it is impossible to please God, no matter what else you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 108, 5, 20, 'may have (Heb.11:6). Eve''s failure in the garden was a failure of faith.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 108, 6, 20, 'If she had only trusted in the perfect love and wisdom of God, when she');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 108, 7, 20, 'was tempted by the attractiveness of that tree, even if she could not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 108, 8, 20, 'understand why a loving God would forbid her from eating it, then she');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 108, 9, 20, 'would not have sinned. But once Satan had made her doubt God''s love, she');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 108, 10, 20, 'fell very quickly. There are many things that God has forbidden for us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 108, 11, 20, 'too, and many prayers of ours that He does not see fit to grant. At such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 108, 12, 20, 'times we must trust in His perfect love and wisdom. Jesus trusted the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 108, 13, 20, 'Father on the cross even when He was forsaken. He did not say, "O God,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 108, 14, 20, 'why have You forsaken Me?" He said, "MY God.....", meaning thereby,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 108, 15, 20, '"Even if I can''t understand why You have forsaken Me, You are still my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 108, 16, 20, 'God". There was no reply from heaven to Jesus'' query. But He died');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 108, 17, 20, 'trusting. He said, "Father I commit My spirit into Your hands". That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 108, 18, 20, 'what it means to endure in faith until the end.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 108, 19, 20, 'Jesus told Peter that Satan had requested for permission to sift him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 108, 20, 20, 'This was similar to the way Satan asked God for permission to sift Job');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 108, 21, 20, '(in the Old Testament). Satan cannot do anything to us (even tempt us),');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 108, 22, 20, 'without God''s permission. But when Peter was going to be sifted, Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 108, 23, 20, 'assured him that He would pray for him that his faith would not fail');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 108, 24, 20, '(Lk.22:31, 32). That is all that matters. Jesus does not pray that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 108, 25, 20, 'should not be tempted, or that our health or wealth or job should not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 108, 26, 20, 'fail, but only that our FAITH should not fail.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 108, 27, 20, 'Faith is therefore our most important treasure, in Jesus'' eyes. If we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 108, 28, 20, 'have faith, then we will never be discouraged, even if we fail');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 109, 1, 20, 'miserably, like Peter did. We will jump up (not just get up but jump up)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 109, 2, 20, 'and overcome Satan by the word of our testimony concerning the blood of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 109, 3, 20, 'the Lamb that cleanses us thoroughly when we turn from our sin and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 109, 4, 20, 'confess it to God (Rev.12:11). We must tell Satan that we have been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 109, 5, 20, 'cleansed by the blood of Jesus and that God does not remember any of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 109, 6, 20, 'past sins any more (Heb.8:12). We have to tell that to Satan with our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 109, 7, 20, 'mouths, since he cannot hear our thoughts. Thus we overcome him and he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 109, 8, 20, 'will flee from us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 109, 9, 20, '"Do not rejoice over me, O my enemy. Though I fall I will rise. Though I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 109, 10, 20, 'dwell in darkness, the Lord is a light for me. He will bring me out to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 109, 11, 20, 'the light. Then my enemy will see, and shame will cover him who said to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 109, 12, 20, 'me, `Where is the Lord your God?'' At that time he will be trampled down');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 109, 13, 20, 'like the mire of the streets (under our feet)." (Micah 7:8-10).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 109, 14, 20, 'We must boldly say at all times, " The Lord is my helper. I will never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 109, 15, 20, 'be afraid (of any man or demon or circumstance or anything) , for God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 109, 16, 20, 'has promised never to leave me nor forsake me" (Heb.13:6,5). That is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 109, 17, 20, 'bold confession of our faith.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 109, 18, 20, 'Guard Your Mind');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 109, 19, 20, 'You must be alert about temptations wherever you go. Provocative');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 109, 20, 20, 'television-images and pictures and articles in books and magazines can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 109, 21, 20, 'be a great snare. Remember that whatever you once choose to place into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 109, 22, 20, 'your mind will remain there forever. You can be forgiven if you repent.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 109, 23, 20, 'But you can never erase what you absorb into our memory. You can only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 109, 24, 20, 'hope to have it pushed down to the bottom of your memory''s storehouse,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 109, 25, 20, 'so that it doesn''t come back to harass you in your dreams and thoughts.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 109, 26, 20, 'And that pushing down can take place only as you fill up the top levels');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 109, 27, 20, 'of your memory''s storehouse with God''s Word.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 109, 28, 20, 'I would suggest that you discipline yourself to read at least one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 110, 1, 20, 'chapter from a good Christian book (you can start with my books) every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 110, 2, 20, 'week and listen to at least one message of mine (on tape) every week,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 110, 3, 20, 'and seek fellowship with at least one believer once or twice a week.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 110, 4, 20, 'Don''t ever be enslaved to anyone in your thinking. To glorify God, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 110, 5, 20, 'must do well in your studies. Let me repeat that there is no virtue in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 110, 6, 20, 'going to church-meetings if you neglect your studies. Fellowship however');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 110, 7, 20, 'is important - but that is best obtained informally with one or two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 110, 8, 20, 'believers, and not necessarily by attending a meeting.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 110, 9, 21, 'Chapter 20 Chapter 20');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 110, 10, 21, 'Faith');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 110, 11, 21, 'Can `victory'' be claimed by faith like ''salvation''?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 110, 12, 21, '1 John 5:4 says, " This is the victory that has overcome the world, even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 110, 13, 21, 'our faith" - and "the world" is defined by the Word as " the lust of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 110, 14, 21, 'flesh, the lust of the eyes and the pride of life" (1 Jn.2:16). So that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 110, 15, 21, 'teaches us that victory over all these is by faith. But what does this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 110, 16, 21, 'faith mean? It is the total leaning of our personality upon God in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 110, 17, 21, 'absolute confidence in His perfect love, wisdom and power. Believing is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 110, 18, 21, 'the same as receiving - as John 1:12 makes plain. It is not intellectual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 110, 19, 21, 'faith. So to trust God means that we receive (accept) His will as the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 110, 20, 21, 'best for us. That means we choose to deny our own will. That is what is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 110, 21, 21, 'meant by "crucifying the flesh" (Gal.5:24). To do this (denying our own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 110, 22, 21, 'will), we need grace to help us. But it all originates from faith. If we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 110, 23, 21, 'don''t believe that God''s will is the best, we will not even want to put');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 110, 24, 21, 'our own will to death. This applies, for example when watching TV. Do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 110, 25, 21, 'you believe that what Jesus would do in such situations is the best -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 110, 26, 21, 'that is, not watch useless or sexually suggestive programs and movies?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 110, 27, 21, 'Or do you believe that what pleases your lusts is the best? That depends');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 110, 28, 21, 'on whether you believe that God''s will is the best for you. Without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 111, 1, 21, 'faith there can be no victory.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 111, 2, 21, 'Think always of Jesus Whom you have to follow. Never forget that your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 111, 3, 21, 'flesh is weak. Jesus cried out for help constantly from His Father. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 111, 4, 21, 'must do the same. Remember that the Name of Jesus is a tower into which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 111, 5, 21, 'you can always retreat when attacked (Prov.18:10). And in that Name you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 111, 6, 21, 'can ask your Father for anything, if ever you are in any difficulty in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 111, 7, 21, 'any place on the face of the earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 111, 8, 21, 'Press on to Perfection');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 111, 9, 21, 'Romans 7:14-25 is an important passage for those seeking to press on to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 111, 10, 21, 'perfection. Paul is speaking there about his experience as a born-again');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 111, 11, 21, 'Christian, for an unconverted man does not say, " I joyfully concur with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 111, 12, 21, 'the Law of God in the inner man" (Rom.7:22).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 111, 13, 21, 'Paul''s letter to the Romans is written in a sequence describing " the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 111, 14, 21, 'gospel as the power of God for salvation" (Rom.1:16), beginning from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 111, 15, 21, 'Chapter 1. After speaking about justification by faith in chapters 3, 4');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 111, 16, 21, 'and 5, Paul speaks about victory over sin in Romans 6. Then Paul goes on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 111, 17, 21, 'to the next stage in chapter. 7. He is not going back at that point to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 111, 18, 21, 'an unconverted period in his life. No. He is continuing his description');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 111, 19, 21, 'of the gospel. Now he talks about the struggle that a person who is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 111, 20, 21, 'interested in pressing on to perfection finds in his inner life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 111, 21, 21, 'Consciously he has chosen to do only God''s will hereafter. He desires');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 111, 22, 21, 'victory and has found grace to help him in time of need. Yet he finds');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 111, 23, 21, 'two things: (i) that in an unwatchful moment he still falls in an area');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 111, 24, 21, 'over which he already has light (conscious sin); and (ii) that sometimes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 111, 25, 21, 'he has fallen short of the Christian standard and realized it only after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 111, 26, 21, 'he has fallen (a new area where he did not have light before falling -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 111, 27, 21, 'unconscious sin).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 111, 28, 21, 'The one who is not interested in total perfection does not have such a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 112, 1, 21, 'struggle, for he has stopped at Romans 5. It is the one who is seeking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 112, 2, 21, 'total victory over sin (Rom.6:14), who finds this struggle and says to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 112, 3, 21, 'himself, " Oh wretched man that I am, who shall deliver me from this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 112, 4, 21, 'sinful body that brings me into spiritual death again and again ?"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 112, 5, 21, '(Rom.7:24)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 112, 6, 21, 'Those who do not acknowledge such a struggle are being dishonest about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 112, 7, 21, 'their inner lives. This is what gives us great hope that even when we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 112, 8, 21, 'have fallen in a moment of weakness, although that is a sin that we must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 112, 9, 21, 'repent of, and forsake, and ask Christ to cleanse in His blood, yet it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 112, 10, 21, 'is not something that we would have consciously chosen. Our subsequent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 112, 11, 21, 'regret over it shows that very clearly. Because we continue to hate such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 112, 12, 21, 'acts of sin and mourn over them, one day we will get victory over them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 112, 13, 21, 'as well.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 112, 14, 21, 'Read Romans 7 carefully and ask God to give you light on it. Romans');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 112, 15, 21, '7:1-13 speaks about being free from the Law as our guide. Now we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 112, 16, 21, 'married to Christ, so that we live by a higher standard than the Law,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 112, 17, 21, 'but not with a legalistic attitude towards God''s commandments. We "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 112, 18, 21, 'serve in newness of Spirit and not in the oldness of the letter"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 112, 19, 21, '(Rom.7:6).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 112, 20, 21, 'There is no victory for those who are dishonest about their struggles.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 112, 21, 21, 'It is not primarily a question about understanding Romans 7 correctly,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 112, 22, 21, 'but rather a question of being absolutely honest about one''s struggles.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 112, 23, 21, 'I would urge you to avoid all those who are not honest about their inner');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 112, 24, 21, 'struggles - for they are hypocrites. You must be discerning. Be wise as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 112, 25, 21, 'serpents and harmless as doves. Remember that the most important thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 112, 26, 21, 'that God requires from you is honesty. That is the first step to purity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 112, 27, 21, 'Fear of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 112, 28, 21, 'It is very easy when you are young to think that you know what is best');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 113, 1, 21, 'for yourself. When any young person loses the fear of doing foolish');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 113, 2, 21, 'things, he will do many foolish things. The only way to be saved from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 113, 3, 21, 'that is: (1) By preserving yourself at all times in the fear of God, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 113, 4, 21, '(2) by being humble enough to acknowledge your weakness and crying out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 113, 5, 21, 'to God for help.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 113, 6, 21, 'Think of Joseph as an example of a young 18-year old who was faithful to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 113, 7, 21, 'God in a strange land, He was armed with the fear of God - and that kept');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 113, 8, 21, 'him from Satan''s snare. May God preserve you also in the same way,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 113, 9, 21, 'everywhere you go. Joseph''s example shows us that it is possible for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 113, 10, 21, 'even a young 18 year old boy to stand true to the Lord, even when:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 113, 11, 21, '(a) He was living in the midst of an immoral society that has no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 113, 12, 21, 'standards;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 113, 13, 21, '(b) He was tempted by a woman day after day;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 113, 14, 21, '(c) His parents were hundreds of miles away, and thought he was dead;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 113, 15, 21, '(d) He did not have a Bible or any godly literature to encourage him;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 113, 16, 21, '(e) He had not received the power of the Holy Spirit;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 113, 17, 21, '(f) He did not have any believers to fellowship with;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 113, 18, 21, '(g) He did not have any spiritual meetings that he could go to.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 113, 19, 21, 'But what he did have was the fear of God that had been planted in him by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 113, 20, 21, 'his father Jacob, during the first 17 years of his life that he spent at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 113, 21, 21, 'home. And the fear of God is enough to keep any young man from sin, even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 113, 22, 21, 'today.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 113, 23, 21, 'Complacency and Misplaced Priority');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 113, 24, 21, 'The atmosphere in colleges today is so evil that unless you are radical');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 113, 25, 21, 'against sin, you will go astray. After a year or so of not falling into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 113, 26, 21, 'any serious sin, one can begin to imagine that one has become an expert');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 113, 27, 21, 'overcomer. It is then, when one becomes self-confident, that failure');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 113, 28, 21, 'comes. There can be two distractions to your studies: (1) Girls and (2)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 114, 1, 21, 'An unbalanced interest in extra-curricular activities, which may even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 114, 2, 21, 'include attending Christian meetings.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 114, 3, 21, 'The first danger is an obvious one. Yet there have been hundreds of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 114, 4, 21, 'thousands of young men through the ages, who have ruined their whole');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 114, 5, 21, 'lives and careers through being careless with girls. One careless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 114, 6, 21, 'mistake is often enough to put an end to your entire career. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 114, 7, 21, 'recognize this, you will be extremely cautious at all times, in this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 114, 8, 21, 'area.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 114, 9, 21, 'The second danger is not such an obvious one, because it can appear as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 114, 10, 21, 'though you are honouring God when you attend many meetings; and you can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 114, 11, 21, 'assume that if you honour God, He will honour you too. It is true that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 114, 12, 21, 'God always honours those who honour Him. But if you neglect your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 114, 13, 21, 'studies, because you attend too many meetings, and then expect God to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 114, 14, 21, 'help you in your examinations, because you claim some promise of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 114, 15, 21, 'Scripture, that would be as foolish as claiming Psalm 91:12 (which Satan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 114, 16, 21, 'suggested that Jesus claim) and jumping off the roof of the temple. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 114, 17, 21, 'is tempting God. It is the same type of folly as practised by those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 114, 18, 21, 'don''t take medicines when they are sick, and want God to heal them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 114, 19, 21, 'without medicine. No farmer can expect a harvest through prayer alone,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 114, 20, 21, 'if he has not laboured to sow seed at sowing time!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 114, 21, 21, 'To put God first is always right. But to put multitudes of Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 114, 22, 21, 'meetings first is not the same as putting God first. For example, if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 114, 23, 21, 'Jesus had some work to finish in the carpenter shop at Nazareth, in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 114, 24, 21, 'order to fulfil a customer''s order, I am sure He would have even missed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 114, 25, 21, 'a synagogue-meeting, in order to have the item ready for the customer on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 114, 26, 21, 'time. That is what it means to be faithful in little things - and that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 114, 27, 21, 'is true spirituality. Yet we also know that Jesus always put His Father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 114, 28, 21, 'first. So we can learn spirituality from Jesus'' example. If we follow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 115, 1, 21, 'our own reasoning however, we will end up being religious and not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 115, 2, 21, 'spiritual.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 115, 3, 21, 'The mistakes that other young men make should be a warning to you to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 115, 4, 21, 'careful, so that you don''t end up doing the same foolish things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 115, 5, 21, 'yourself. The wise man learns from the mistakes of others and does not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 115, 6, 21, 'make the same mistakes himself. May the Lord preserve you for Himself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 115, 7, 21, 'alone and may He make you a blessing to others around you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 115, 8, 22, 'Chapter 21 Chapter 21');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 115, 9, 22, 'Faith and Reason');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 115, 10, 22, 'Prayer is easiest for those who are like little children, for prayer is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 115, 11, 22, 'an acknowledgement of our helplessness and our impotence to God. Clever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 115, 12, 22, 'adults find it difficult to acknowledge that. That is why Jesus said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 115, 13, 22, 'that we must be like little children. The more we depend on our reason');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 115, 14, 22, 'and our intellect, the less we will pray, and the more we will question');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 115, 15, 22, 'why God does things in a way that our reason cannot understand.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 115, 16, 22, 'The obedience that God asks of us is not "the obedience of reason", but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 115, 17, 22, '" the obedience of faith" (Rom.1:5). God gave no reasons to Adam as to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 115, 18, 22, 'why He did not want Adam to eat of the tree of knowledge of good and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 115, 19, 22, 'evil. It was enough for Adam to know that God loved him and that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 115, 20, 22, 'therefore God''s commands (even when unexplainable by reason) were the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 115, 21, 22, 'very best for him. "Trust in the Lord with all your heart and do not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 115, 22, 22, 'lean on your own understanding " (Prov.3:5). So when Adam failed, it was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 115, 23, 22, 'primarily a failure of faith in God''s love and God''s wisdom. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 115, 24, 22, 'where we fail too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 115, 25, 22, 'If we believe that God loves us intensely, and that He knows what is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 115, 26, 22, 'best for us - better than we can ever know - and that He is almighty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 115, 27, 22, 'enough to order all events on earth, then we will joyfullyobey all His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 115, 28, 22, 'commands, yield everything to Him to do His will alone hereafter in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 116, 1, 22, 'lives, pray even when we don''t seem to get any immediate answers, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 116, 2, 22, 'submit to everything He ordains for us, without any questions. If we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 116, 3, 22, 'don''t have faith in God''s wisdom, love and power, then we will do none');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 116, 4, 22, 'of these.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 116, 5, 22, 'If we are like little children, we can come to God in simple faith and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 116, 6, 22, 'receive the fullness of His Spirit into our hearts easily (Lk.11:13).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 116, 7, 22, 'All we need is a clear conscience (with all known sin confessed to God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 116, 8, 22, 'and man), a hunger and thirst for the fullness of the Spirit, a total');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 116, 9, 22, 'surrender of every known area of our lives to Him, and faith that our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 116, 10, 22, 'Loving Father will certainly give us what we ask for. Then we can ask -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 116, 11, 22, 'and believe that God has granted us what we asked for, even if we don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 116, 12, 22, 'have any immediate feelings or sensations. The external manifestations');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 116, 13, 22, 'will come later. So be like a little child.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 116, 14, 22, 'Faith - Steadfast Confidence in God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 116, 15, 22, 'When we are baptized, we have confidence that the person who immerses us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 116, 16, 22, 'into the water will not drown us but will raise us up from the water');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 116, 17, 22, 'too. This is how we must have faith (confidence) in God too in all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 116, 18, 22, 'situations of life. When He arranges a situation, in which we have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 116, 19, 22, 'die to self, or in which we are being "crucified" by others, we must see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 116, 20, 22, 'God Himself beyond the human instruments that He uses. The pure in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 116, 21, 22, 'heart, Jesus said, would see only God (Matt.5:8) - and not any human');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 116, 22, 22, 'instruments. When we see only the people who crucify us, that would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 116, 23, 22, 'indicate that our hearts are not pure. Then we will have complaints');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 116, 24, 22, 'against those people. But when our hearts are pure, we will see God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 116, 25, 22, 'alone, and then we can have the confidence (just as in water-baptism)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 116, 26, 22, 'that He Who allows us to be immersed into death will raise us up too. "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 116, 27, 22, 'If we die with Christ we will be raised up by God as Christ was raised');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 116, 28, 22, 'up " (2 Tim.2:11). Then we die in faith (in confidence in God). Then we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 117, 1, 22, 'can enter into a glorious resurrection-life. Otherwise we will always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 117, 2, 22, 'live the same old defeated Adamic life that we have always lived. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 117, 3, 22, 'we refuse to die to Self, it indicates that we don''t have faith');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 117, 4, 22, '(confidence) in God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 117, 5, 22, 'The man of faith is the single-minded man, as we read in James 1:6-8.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 117, 6, 22, 'Such a man has only one goal in life - to please God and to glorify Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 117, 7, 22, 'Only such a man can be said to live by faith - for he lives recognizing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 117, 8, 22, 'the fact that the things that are unseen alone have eternal value. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 117, 9, 22, 'other words, He believes what God''s Word says. Many "believers" believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 117, 10, 22, 'in Jesus only because they don''t want to go to Hell. But they don''t LIVE');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 117, 11, 22, 'by faith. They are not convinced that what God says in His Word is true.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 117, 12, 22, 'They don''t believe that they will have to give an account to God for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 117, 13, 22, 'everything that they have done and spoken in their lives. They don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 117, 14, 22, 'believe that if they live to please themselves, and to enjoy the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 117, 15, 22, 'pleasures of this world and to pursue after money, they will have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 117, 16, 22, 'regrets for all eternity after they leave this world. The rich man (that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 117, 17, 22, 'Jesus spoke of) who died and went to Hell, had regrets as soon as he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 117, 18, 22, 'died, and wanted someone to go and tell his brothers not to make the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 117, 19, 22, 'same mistake that he had made in his earthly life of not living in daily');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 117, 20, 22, 'repentance (Lk.16:28,30). We are all on probation here on earth and God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 117, 21, 22, 'is testing us to see whether, like the animals, we will live for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 117, 22, 22, 'dust of earth, or whether as sons of God, we will live for the things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 117, 23, 22, 'that have eternal value - a life characterised by goodness, love,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 117, 24, 22, 'absolute purity and humility, etc. May the Lord give you grace to live');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 117, 25, 22, 'for the things that have eternal value.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 117, 26, 22, 'God is on the Side of Underdogs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 117, 27, 22, 'Those who can''t seem to attain to the high standards preached in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 117, 28, 22, 'church, despite their best efforts, need never feel discouraged, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 118, 1, 22, 'Jesus came to help the sick ones and not the healthy ones. Throughout');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 118, 2, 22, 'the Bible, we see that God has a care for the weak and the helpless, for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 118, 3, 22, 'strangers, widows and the fatherless. Jesus cared especially for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 118, 4, 22, 'adulteresses, thieves (the tax-collectors and the thief on the cross),');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 118, 5, 22, 'lepers, the demon-possessed, and the outcasts of Jewish society like the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 118, 6, 22, 'Gentiles (e.g. the Roman centurion and the Syrophenician woman). Today');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 118, 7, 22, 'also, He cares for those who have repeatedly failed, and who sit in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 118, 8, 22, 'back-row in the meetings of the church (because they are ashamed of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 118, 9, 22, 'themselves).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 118, 10, 22, 'In 1 Samuel 16 we read that Jesse thought so little of his youngest son');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 118, 11, 22, 'David, that he did not even call him, when Samuel came to select one of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 118, 12, 22, 'his sons to be king. But God had His eye on David and chose him. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 118, 13, 22, 'even after David fell so deeply into sin (adultery and murder), the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 118, 14, 22, 'still did not forsake him, because David repented in deep sorrow. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 118, 15, 22, 'fact, God used even his failure, for there would have been no Psalm 51');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 118, 16, 22, '(that has blessed so many millions) if it had not been for David''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 118, 17, 22, 'failure.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 118, 18, 22, 'Jesus aligns Himself with the ones who are despised and considered');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 118, 19, 22, 'unspiritual by others, and with those who have failed in their spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 118, 20, 22, 'life, if they repent. Peter could become a compassionate apostle only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 118, 21, 22, 'because he failed so badly - denying the Lord thrice. Therefore he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 118, 22, 22, 'always looked on other sinners ever afterwards with compassion and not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 118, 23, 22, 'with hardness like the Pharisees did. Only such men can qualify to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 118, 24, 22, 'apostles. All this is so that it might be made evident that Jesus came');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 118, 25, 22, 'not to call the righteous but sinners to repentance, He has chosen some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 118, 26, 22, 'of the world''s greatest sinners to be His greatest apostles, in these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 118, 27, 22, 'past twenty centuries. So there is hope for all.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 118, 28, 22, 'God is Faithful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 119, 1, 22, 'Ever since I made a transaction with the Lord many years ago saying,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 119, 2, 22, '"Lord, I will look after Your family and You look after mine", He has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 119, 3, 22, 'been utterly faithful to care for all of us. So I believe that the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 119, 4, 22, 'will take care of all four of you, my sons - spiritually, physically,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 119, 5, 22, 'financially, in the matters of employment and marriage also (when that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 119, 6, 22, 'time comes), and in all other matters as well, till the end of your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 119, 7, 22, 'lives. God honours those who honour Him (1 Sam.2:30); and the children');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 119, 8, 22, 'of the godly are blessed (Prov.20:7)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 119, 9, 22, 'Many years ago, God gave Mom and me (separately) the same promise that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 119, 10, 22, '"all our children will be discipled by the Lord and their wellbeing will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 119, 11, 22, 'be great" (Isa.54:13). And I say, as Paul once did: "I believe God that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 119, 12, 22, 'it will turn out exactly as I have been told" (Acts 27:25). So I have no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 119, 13, 22, 'fear for any of you, because I know the Lord will keep His Word. As');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 119, 14, 22, 'parents, we have done our part. The Lord will certainly do His.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 119, 15, 22, 'God''s Word promises that He " will supply all our needs according to His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 119, 16, 22, 'riches in glory in Christ Jesus " (Phil.4:19). There is not a single');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 119, 17, 22, 'need that we can ever have - physical, material, financial, emotional,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 119, 18, 22, 'intellectual or spiritual - that is excluded from that promise. Every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 119, 19, 22, 'need will be supplied by God. God does not give us everything that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 119, 20, 22, 'want , but only everything that we need. The only condition for this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 119, 21, 22, 'promise to be fulfilled is mentioned in Matthew 6:33 - " seek God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 119, 22, 22, 'kingdom and His righteousness first". Our Heavenly Father knows what we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 119, 23, 22, 'need even before we ask Him (Matt.6:8, 32). So, if we put God''s kingdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 119, 24, 22, 'and holiness above everything else as first priority in our lives, then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 119, 25, 22, 'all that we need will automatically be provided for us, even without our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 119, 26, 22, 'asking.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 119, 27, 23, 'Chapter 22 Chapter 22');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 119, 28, 23, 'Living by the Word of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 120, 1, 23, 'Don''t lose the discipline of beginning each day with a few minutes of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 120, 2, 23, 'talking to God in prayer and listening to Him. You will find the day');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 120, 3, 23, 'goes much better, when you start it like that. Maintain that discipline.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 120, 4, 23, 'If you miss doing it first thing in the morning, then find time for it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 120, 5, 23, 'some time later in the day. Carry a small New Testament with you in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 120, 6, 23, 'pocket. You can then read portions from it now and then. And if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 120, 7, 23, 'possible, try and listen to at least one tape of my message every week.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 120, 8, 23, 'There is an answer and a solution to every one of our problems found');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 120, 9, 23, 'somewhere in God''s Word. Jesus said that man must live byevery Word of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 120, 10, 23, 'God. So if we don''t know the word of God, we won''t live - we will die');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 120, 11, 23, 'spiritually. It doesn''t take much time to shoot a 10-second prayer to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 120, 12, 23, 'God for a word according to our need. But sometimes that can save us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 120, 13, 23, 'much futility and despair. The children of Adam live only by what their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 120, 14, 23, 'five senses tell them. We live however by the Word of God primarily.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 120, 15, 23, 'In every situation we must be " quick to hear (God) and slow to (open');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 120, 16, 23, 'our mouth and) speak, slow to anger... " (James 1:19). Jesus saw the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 120, 17, 23, 'money changers in the temple every year for 18 years (from the age of 12');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 120, 18, 23, 'to 30). But He never got agitated by them. He waited until the Father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 120, 19, 23, 'told Him to do something about it. Then He acted. He restrained Himself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 120, 20, 23, 'until then.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 120, 21, 23, 'We read in the Bible that, "God sent His Word and healed them" (Psa.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 120, 22, 23, '107:20). Healing too comes from God''s Word. God sent His Word and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 120, 23, 23, 'released Joseph from prison (Psa. 105:20) and Jonah from the fish''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 120, 24, 23, 'belly (Jon.2:10). God''s Word brought order into chaos at the beginning');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 120, 25, 23, 'of creation (Gen.1:1-3). It can do the same for us too. So never be so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 120, 26, 23, 'busy that you have no time to meditate on God''s Word. We do not always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 120, 27, 23, 'receive something new each time we read the Bible. But reading it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 120, 28, 23, 'like storing data in a computer. At our time of need the Spirit of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 121, 1, 23, 'will dip into that stored-up data and bring to our memory the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 121, 2, 23, 'appropriate word for our situation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 121, 3, 23, 'May the words of this lovely hymn be your daily prayer:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 121, 4, 23, '"Fill Thou my life O Lord my God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 121, 5, 23, 'In every part with praise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 121, 6, 23, 'That my whole being may proclaim');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 121, 7, 23, 'Thy being and Thy ways."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 121, 8, 23, 'The Lord told the leader at Philadelphia (Rev.3:11) to hold fast what he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 121, 9, 23, 'had, lest he lose his crown. We must be alert at all times, so that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 121, 10, 23, 'don''t lose ground spiritually, and lose what the Lord has worked in us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 121, 11, 23, 'When we are busy (with our study or our work), it is not possible for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 121, 12, 23, 'our minds to think about the Lord or the Scriptures. But that does not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 121, 13, 23, 'matter - our hearts can still be alert to hear the Lord''s voice. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 121, 14, 23, 'bride says, " I slept, but my heart was awake, and my beloved spoke to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 121, 15, 23, 'me" (Song of Sol.5:2). You must be constantly alert to hear what the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 121, 16, 23, 'Lord has to say to you, especially when He wants to warn you in advance');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 121, 17, 23, 'of any dangers along the way. God allows our earthly lives to be busy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 121, 18, 23, 'from morning to night with a purpose - for thus we are kept from many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 121, 19, 23, 'temptations. It is when people are idle that they are tempted more to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 121, 20, 23, 'sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 121, 21, 23, 'New Covenant Perfection');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 121, 22, 23, '"Perfection" in the New Testament means " having the same attitude that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 121, 23, 23, 'Christ had" (Phil.2:5). This is the goal towards which we are to strive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 121, 24, 23, 'daily: To have the same attitude as Jesus had to sin, to His disciples,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 121, 25, 23, 'to His enemies, to sinners, to women, to material things, to His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 121, 26, 23, 'profession, to the cares of this world, to pleasure, to sport, to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 121, 27, 23, 'everything.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 121, 28, 23, 'Basically we seek our own gain and comfort and pleasure in everything.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 122, 1, 23, 'This is the way to a miserable existence, where we do not grow in grace.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 122, 2, 23, 'There is only one way to grow in grace into the perfection of having the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 122, 3, 23, 'mind of Christ, and that is by putting to death these natural tendencies');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 122, 4, 23, 'of the flesh that we have inherited. This is why the cross has to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 122, 5, 23, 'central at all times in our lives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 122, 6, 23, 'Here are 6 ways in which Satan tries to make us seek our own:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 122, 7, 23, '(1) Pride - in our abilities or our accomplishments');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 122, 8, 23, '(2) Sexual impurity - beginning in our thoughts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 122, 9, 23, '(3) Hatred - bitterness, revengeful thoughts, etc.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 122, 10, 23, '(4) Compromise - worldliness (love of money) and dishonesty for material');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 122, 11, 23, 'gain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 122, 12, 23, '(5) Fear, anxiety and tension - concerning the future etc.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 122, 13, 23, '(6) Legalism - Phariseeism. Jesus never fell in any of these areas, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 122, 14, 23, 'neither need we. ­');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 122, 15, 23, 'But God did allow Satan to attack Jesus'' physical body on the cross -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 122, 16, 23, 'and in the process Satan was defeated. Jesus'' heel was bruised by Satan,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 122, 17, 23, 'but Satan''s head was crushed (Gen.3:15). God likewise allowed Satan to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 122, 18, 23, 'afflict Paul''s body with a physical ailment (a thorn in the flesh). But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 122, 19, 23, 'God used that to crush Satan''s head (pride) in Paul''s heart (2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 122, 20, 23, 'Cor.12:7). God is always on our side against Satan, and the Lord will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 122, 21, 23, 'always lead us in triumph, if we humbly submit to Him in all our ways.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 122, 22, 23, 'Attitude of Gratitude');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 122, 23, 23, 'God preserved my life when I was tossed from my moped onto the railway');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 122, 24, 23, 'track the other day (August 13, 1993). The person operating the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 122, 25, 23, 'railway-gate was a novice and lowered the second bar before I had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 122, 26, 23, 'crossed it and so it hit me on the chest and knocked me down. I lay on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 122, 27, 23, 'the railway track, unconscious for a while - I don''t know for how long.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 122, 28, 23, 'Someone picked me up before any train came along. I now feel like one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 123, 1, 23, 'who has come back from the dead (for my fall could have been fatal). It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 123, 2, 23, 'was a fresh reminder to me that I owe my life to God for the rest of my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 123, 3, 23, 'days. I cannot spend my time or energy or money as I like. I cannot read');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 123, 4, 23, 'what I like. I cannot speak whatever I like. Everything has to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 123, 5, 23, 'determined by what will glorify God. Such a life will not be a strain to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 123, 6, 23, 'live (as Satan would have us believe), but will be the most glorious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 123, 7, 23, 'life anyone could ever live - for that is how our Lord lived. You also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 123, 8, 23, 'have had experiences on the roads there when you could have had fatal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 123, 9, 23, 'accidents. But the angels of God protected you. So your debt to God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 123, 10, 23, 'similar. Praise the Lord for preserving our lives. May we live as those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 123, 11, 23, 'who have been raised from the dead.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 123, 12, 23, 'My hand and shoulder that were sprained after the accident, came 95%');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 123, 13, 23, 'back to normal, within 3 weeks after the accident. That was a miracle,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 123, 14, 23, 'for which I thank God. One of the things that I learnt during those 3');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 123, 15, 23, 'weeks was not to take the ordinary things of life for granted - even the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 123, 16, 23, 'ability to raise my hands when praising God, which I could not do during');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 123, 17, 23, 'those 3 weeks. For the first time in 54 years, I thanked God for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 123, 18, 23, 'privilege of being able to raise both my hands when praising Him. Until');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 123, 19, 23, 'then I had taken that action for granted. That made me thankful for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 123, 20, 23, 'use of many other parts of my body as well - like my eyes, ears and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 123, 21, 23, 'tongue etc.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 123, 22, 23, 'We must learn to be thankful to God for everything. Jonah''s prayer while');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 123, 23, 23, 'inside the fish''s belly is most instructive (Jonah 2). Even though that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 123, 24, 23, 'was a cramped place, with the fish''s stomach-acids falling on him, yet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 123, 25, 23, 'Jonah thanked the Lord for allowing him to be there. It was only when he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 123, 26, 23, 'began to thank the Lord, that the Lord commanded the fish to vomit Jonah');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 123, 27, 23, 'out on to dry land (Read Jonah 2:9,10 carefully). So don''t ever complain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 123, 28, 23, 'about your house or food or circumstances. Be thankful. Many children');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 124, 1, 23, 'are not thankful for their parents and their home, until they go out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 124, 2, 23, 'into the wide world and discover how tough life is. A spirit of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 124, 3, 23, 'thankfulness can deliver you from many prisons - as Jonah was delivered.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 124, 4, 23, 'New Covenant Applications of Old Covenant Sacrifices');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 124, 5, 23, 'There were five offerings that God commanded the Israelites to bring.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 124, 6, 23, 'These are described in the first five chapters of Leviticus (one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 124, 7, 23, 'offering in each chapter). They are:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 124, 8, 23, '(1) The burnt offering: symbolising Jesus giving His body completely to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 124, 9, 23, 'the Father, in the same way as we are told to give our bodies to God in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 124, 10, 23, 'Romans 12:1.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 124, 11, 23, '(2) The grain offering: the only bloodless offering, symbolising Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 124, 12, 23, 'giving Himself to us as the Bread of life that we are to feed on.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 124, 13, 23, '(3) The peace offering: symbolising Jesus bringing peace between God and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 124, 14, 23, 'men and between man and man in the church, through giving Himself. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 124, 15, 23, 'too must be willing to sacrifice ourselves for the sake of peace between');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 124, 16, 23, 'ourselves and others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 124, 17, 23, '(4) The sin offering: symbolising Jesus dying for our sins. (Sin is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 124, 18, 23, 'coming short of God''s standards, missing the mark - see Rom.3:23).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 124, 19, 23, '(5) The guilt offering: symbolising Jesus bearing our guilt. Sin is so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 124, 20, 23, 'serious a thing that God designated two offerings under the old covenant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 124, 21, 23, 'for it - one for sin and one for guilt (even though we would think that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 124, 22, 23, 'they both refer to the same thing).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 124, 23, 23, 'If you read Leviticus 4:2, 13, 22, 27 and 5:4, 15, 17, you will notice');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 124, 24, 23, 'that the provisions made by God were only for unintentional sin under');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 124, 25, 23, 'the Old Testament Law. Unintentional sin was sin that was done either');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 124, 26, 23, 'unconsciously or under the provocation of the moment (like a sudden');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 124, 27, 23, 'slip-up in lusting with the eyes or in an angry word spoken), that was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 124, 28, 23, 'not pre-planned or pre-meditated. Sins committed that were planned were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 125, 1, 23, 'much more serious. There was no provision under the Law for intentional');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 125, 2, 23, 'sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 125, 3, 23, 'But now under grace, there IS provision for forgiveness for intentional');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 125, 4, 23, 'sin as well. Otherwise we would all be guilty. But many have taken');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 125, 5, 23, 'advantage of this provision, and that is why 90% of Christians do not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 125, 6, 23, 'live even at the level of holiness that the old-covenant Jews had.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 125, 7, 23, 'Even bitter words are often premeditated. God sees the intention more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 125, 8, 23, 'than the action. In Hebrews 10:26-29 it says that if we keep on sinning');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 125, 9, 23, 'intentionally , there will be no more sacrifice available for our sin,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 125, 10, 23, 'because we will then be treating the blood of Christ as a cheap thing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 125, 11, 23, 'So we must take every sin seriously, and perfect holiness in the fear of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 125, 12, 23, 'God (2 Cor.7:1).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 125, 13, 24, 'Chapter 23 Chapter 23');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 125, 14, 24, 'Glory Belongs to the Lord Alone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 125, 15, 24, 'If you want to follow the Lord, you must be willing to be " of no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 125, 16, 24, 'reputation" in the eyes of men, as Jesus was (Phil.2:7 - KJV). From a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 125, 17, 24, 'human point of view, there was nothing attractive in Jesus that would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 125, 18, 24, 'draw men to Him (Isa.53:2). All that this world considers great is an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 125, 19, 24, 'abomination before God (Lk.16:15). When we are proud of what we are as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 125, 20, 24, 'human beings, with our natural gifts and talents, God cannot manifest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 125, 21, 24, 'His power through us. Paul said, " I am glad to be a living');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 125, 22, 24, 'demonstration of Christ''s power, instead of showing off my own power and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 125, 23, 24, 'abilities " (2 Cor.12:9 - Living). That is our calling. Never show off');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 125, 24, 24, 'or be proud of your own talents and gifts and abilities. Instead let');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 125, 25, 24, 'others see you as a weak human being (as a lamb), but bold and powerful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 125, 26, 24, 'as a disciple of Jesus (as a lion).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 125, 27, 24, 'There is a constant covering of reproach over the true church also - so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 125, 28, 24, 'that we are misunderstood and criticised even by other Christians. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 126, 1, 24, 'underneath that covering, there is a glory - we live a life that pleases');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 126, 2, 24, 'God, in which we overcome our lusts and put Satan under our feet. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 126, 3, 24, 'should never desire the praise of men (or be moved by it), for that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 126, 4, 24, 'rubbish.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 126, 5, 24, 'Jesus told His seventy disciples, "Do not rejoice in this that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 126, 6, 24, 'spirits are subject to you, but rejoice that your names are written in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 126, 7, 24, 'heaven" (Lk.10:20). We should not rejoice in: (a) what we are; (b) what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 126, 8, 24, 'we have done; or (c) what we can do. But we should rejoice in: (a) Who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 126, 9, 24, 'the Lord is; (b) what the Lord has done; and (c) what the Lord will do.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 126, 10, 24, 'When we rejoice in what we are capable of, we ourselves get the glory');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 126, 11, 24, 'and that makes us look superior to other believers. This is Phariseeism.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 126, 12, 24, 'We are then "rejoicing in the works of our hands" (Acts 7:41) - whether');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 126, 13, 24, 'that work be casting out demons, healing the sick, preaching the Word,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 126, 14, 24, 'writing an article, being hospitable, cooking a good meal, driving a car');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 126, 15, 24, 'well, or doing some earthly task in an excellent way etc., There are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 126, 16, 24, 'numerous ways to get glory for ourselves. But it is all idolatry. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 126, 17, 24, 'we rejoice only in what God has done, however, that keeps us humble, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 126, 18, 24, 'we are on an equal level with all other believers, and thus the Body of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 126, 19, 24, 'Christ can be built.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 126, 20, 24, 'Humility and Grace');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 126, 21, 24, 'No-one can obey the New Testament commandments without getting grace');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 126, 22, 24, 'from God. Some may be able to keep the first nine of the ten');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 126, 23, 24, 'commandments in the Law without grace. But the tenth commandment - "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 126, 24, 24, 'never to lust after what is not yours" - no-one can keep without God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 126, 25, 24, 'grace. And no-one can rise to the heights of new-covenant life (as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 126, 26, 24, 'described in Matthew 5 to 7) without grace. And God gives His grace only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 126, 27, 24, 'to the humble (1 Pet.5:5).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 126, 28, 24, 'Humility is one of the virtues that is most easily counterfeited. True');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 127, 1, 24, 'humility is not something that others see in us. It is what God sees in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 127, 2, 24, 'us - and it is inward. It is exemplified in Jesus'' life. Philippians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 127, 3, 24, '2:5-8 tells us that Jesus renounced His privileges and rights as God and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 127, 4, 24, 'became a servant, and was willing to accept even crucifixion from men''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 127, 5, 24, 'hands. We are to follow Him in that path of humility.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 127, 6, 24, 'Jesus humbled himself in 3 steps.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 127, 7, 24, '1. He became a Man.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 127, 8, 24, '2. He became a servant.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 127, 9, 24, '3. On the cross, He was willing to be treated like a criminal.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 127, 10, 24, 'There we see the three secrets of the Christian life: HUMILITY, HUMILITY');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 127, 11, 24, 'and HUMILITY.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 127, 12, 24, 'The angels must have looked on in wonder when Jesus lived for 33 years');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 127, 13, 24, 'on earth and when they saw Him serving others so humbly, and patiently');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 127, 14, 24, 'enduring suffering, insult and injury. They had been used to worshipping');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 127, 15, 24, 'Him for years in heaven. But when they saw His conduct on earth, they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 127, 16, 24, 'learnt something more about the nature of God - His lowliness and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 127, 17, 24, 'humility - that they had never seen or understood all the time that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 127, 18, 24, 'Jesus was in heaven. Now God wants to show the angels in heaven that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 127, 19, 24, 'same spirit of Christ through us in the church (as it says in Eph.3:10).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 127, 20, 24, 'What do the angels see in us and in our conduct now? Does our conduct');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 127, 21, 24, 'bring glory to God?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 127, 22, 24, 'Remember that humility is the greatest virtue of all. Humility');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 127, 23, 24, 'acknowledges that all that we are and have are the gifts of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 127, 24, 24, 'Humility makes us value and esteem all human beings, especially the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 127, 25, 24, 'weak, the uncultured, the retarded and the poor. Only on that soil of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 127, 26, 24, 'humility can the fruit of the Spirit and the virtues of Christ grow. So');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 127, 27, 24, 'you must live in a constant judgment of yourself, to ensure that no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 127, 28, 24, 'poison of high thoughts or honour-seeking or taking the glory that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 128, 1, 24, 'should be given to God, ever enters into your heart at any time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 128, 2, 24, 'Meditate much on the humility of Jesus. That is my most important');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 128, 3, 24, 'exhortation to you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 128, 4, 24, 'Preaching the Word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 128, 5, 24, 'We are thankful that the Lord has been giving you the opportunity to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 128, 6, 24, 'serve others at your place, and to encourage them to follow Him. Live in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 128, 7, 24, 'humility, with your face in the dust before God''s face, and then it can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 128, 8, 24, 'only go better and better in your life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 128, 9, 24, 'Whenever you get an opportunity to share God''s Word there, prepare your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 128, 10, 24, 'message beforehand, writing down the main points of what you are going');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 128, 11, 24, 'to speak on and the Bible-references. Be bold and forthright in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 128, 12, 24, 'presenting the Word. Never preach God''s Word in an apologetic way, as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 128, 13, 24, 'though you were unsure of what you are saying. There is much that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 128, 14, 24, 'have learnt and that God has done in your lives during the years that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 128, 15, 24, 'you were in Bangalore, and it is your duty now to share that with others');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 128, 16, 24, 'as you get opportunity, because most Christians have little or no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 128, 17, 24, 'understanding of the new covenant.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 128, 18, 24, 'When the Lord gives you the opportunity to encourage other young people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 128, 19, 24, 'around you, you must live in fear of these three things:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 128, 20, 24, '(1) Spiritual pride (because of your gifts, talents, position, salary or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 128, 21, 24, 'Bible-knowledge)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 128, 22, 24, '(2) Hypocrisy (preaching anything that you are not even attempting to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 128, 23, 24, 'practise)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 128, 24, 24, '(3) Seeking to impress people - especially any girls!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 128, 25, 24, 'The only way to be free from these is by constant self-judgment, after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 128, 26, 24, 'you have finished your ministry. This is where the vast majority of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 128, 27, 24, 'preachers have failed. Many pray before preaching a sermon. But they do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 128, 28, 24, 'not get alone with the Lord and examine themselves after they have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 129, 1, 24, 'finished preaching.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 129, 2, 24, 'The more you stand before others in public (when speaking or playing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 129, 3, 24, 'music), the more you must fall down before the Lord in private. Satan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 129, 4, 24, 'would very much like to puff you up with pride, or make you act a part');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 129, 5, 24, 'without being genuine, or try to trap you in some other way. So be wary.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 129, 6, 24, 'All Goes Well With the Godly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 129, 7, 24, 'Every step of your future life will be guided by God - if you decide to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 129, 8, 24, 'be a godly man. It is the man who honours God who gets the best in life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 129, 9, 24, '- not the clever man, or the rich man, or the genius, or the man who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 129, 10, 24, 'gets lucky breaks in life. All insecurity regarding the future comes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 129, 11, 24, 'when we do not choose godliness as a way of life. So decide to honour');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 129, 12, 24, 'God at all times. He will then give you the best spiritually, and at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 129, 13, 24, 'same time, all that is necessary materially and physically in this world');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 129, 14, 24, 'too. I have found this to be true during the last 30 years of my life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 129, 15, 24, '(*and in the past 50 years now - upto 2016). God will guide you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 129, 16, 24, 'concerning your college courses and in the profession that you should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 129, 17, 24, 'choose, and in employment and in marriage later on, and in everything,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 129, 18, 24, 'if you just make one decision now, and stand by it always - that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 129, 19, 24, 'will honour God in all things and be a godly man.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 129, 20, 24, 'That means to be faithful in the little things. It doesn''t mean that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 129, 21, 24, 'never fall or fail. But it does mean that you mourn each time you fail.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 129, 22, 24, 'Never take anything that doesn''t belong to you - from a person or a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 129, 23, 24, 'house or a college or an office or from anywhere - not even a cheap pen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 129, 24, 24, 'or a pencil. Never cheat anyone even in the smallest of matters. And as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 129, 25, 24, 'we have taught you in your schooldays, never cheat even in the smallest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 129, 26, 24, 'way in your examinations. It is better to fail than to cheat and pass.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 129, 27, 24, 'It is better to be poor than to cheat and be rich. Stop reading');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 129, 28, 24, 'literature and looking at TV programs that pollute your mind. Keep your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 130, 1, 24, 'conscience absolutely clear in all matters. Those who live like this get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 130, 2, 24, 'God''s best in life - in every generation - even in times of high');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 130, 3, 24, 'inflation and recession.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 130, 4, 24, 'I long that all of you my sons, will be such men, for I know then that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 130, 5, 24, 'it will go exceptionally well with you, and that God will bless even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 130, 6, 24, 'your children, as you yourself have been blessed! Thus you can be living');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 130, 7, 24, 'demonstrations to an unbelieving generation that it goes well with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 130, 8, 24, 'righteous and that God honours those who honour Him. Yearn with all your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 130, 9, 24, 'heart that you will be such a living testimony for God in this world');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 130, 10, 24, 'rather than impressing this world with your cleverness or your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 130, 11, 24, 'accomplishments. Be careful also that outdoor activities never take such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 130, 12, 24, 'a place in your life that they become your god!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 130, 13, 24, 'I also pray that all four of you, my sons, will proclaim the gospel of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 130, 14, 24, 'victory over sin and death to Self (by having experienced the reality of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 130, 15, 24, 'this yourself), and that you will fulfil your God-appointed ministry in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 130, 16, 24, 'the Body of Christ (whatever that may be), while earning your own living');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 130, 17, 24, 'with a secular job - serving the Lord like Paul did, at your own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 130, 18, 24, 'expense, without being dependent on anyone. This is what the world needs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 130, 19, 24, 'to see and this is my greatest longing for all of you. I know that only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 130, 20, 24, 'those who consistently seek the kingdom of God first and His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 130, 21, 24, 'righteousness first, will have no regrets when Jesus returns.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 130, 22, 24, 'There are strong spirits of immorality and sexual perversion in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 130, 23, 24, 'world today that seek to attack young college students. So I want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 130, 24, 24, 'warn you to be careful to resist Satan in this area constantly. Don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 130, 25, 24, 'allow Satan to get a foothold in your life at any time in the sexual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 130, 26, 24, 'area, through TV, literature or anything else. Satan selects his targets');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 130, 27, 24, 'from those who are likely to do the greatest damage to his work. So it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 130, 28, 24, 'is an honour to be attacked by Satan, as Jesus was throughout His life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 131, 1, 24, 'But we are not afraid of Satan at all - because he has been stripped of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 131, 2, 24, 'his power over us, defeated thoroughly by our Saviour, and made an open');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 131, 3, 24, 'show of, at Calvary''s cross (Col.2:14,15).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 131, 4, 24, 'Ezekiel 16:49 gives four reasons for lack of self-control in the sexual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 131, 5, 24, 'area (as in the case of Sodom) - pride, gluttony, idleness and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 131, 6, 24, 'selfishness. If you work faithfully in these four areas, you will find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 131, 7, 24, 'that you become strong to overcome in the sexual area as well.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 131, 8, 24, 'The fear of failure is a haunting fear that you must shake off. Even if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 131, 9, 24, 'you fail for the 1000th time in any area (whether spiritual or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 131, 10, 24, 'academic), you must just get up and continue running. You must not allow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 131, 11, 24, 'your past failures to haunt you. All you have to do is exercise your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 131, 12, 24, 'will and reject every thought of past failures, whenever they come to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 131, 13, 24, 'your mind. If you are faithful in doing this, you will find after some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 131, 14, 24, 'time, that such thoughts will occur only rarely - and finally stop');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 131, 15, 24, 'altogether. This is what it means to bring every thought into captivity');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 131, 16, 24, 'to the obedience of Christ (2 Cor.10:5).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 131, 17, 25, 'Chapter 24 Chapter 24');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 131, 18, 25, 'The Spirit as Water');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 131, 19, 25, 'When Jesus spoke of "being born of water and the Spirit", He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 131, 20, 25, 'referring to water as a symbol of the Spirit. Notice His three uses of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 131, 21, 25, '`water'' in John''s gospel, showing the three stages of spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 131, 22, 25, 'development:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 131, 23, 25, '(1) Born of water - the beginning (like a cup of water) (Jn.3:5; " the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 131, 24, 25, 'cup of salvation" - Psa.116:13).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 131, 25, 25, '(2) A well of water - fully satisfied with Christ oneself (Jn.4:14).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 131, 26, 25, '(3) Rivers of water - communicating God''s life to many others (Jn.7:38).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 131, 27, 25, 'John the Baptist spoke of "being baptized in the Holy Spirit and fire".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 131, 28, 25, 'Again, the "fire" there is not a literal fire, but a symbol of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 132, 1, 25, 'Spirit''sinward work of purification, just like water is a symbol of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 132, 2, 25, 'Hisexternal work of cleansing (" having our bodies washed with pure');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 132, 3, 25, 'water" - Heb.10:22). (Numbers 31:22, 23 speaks in symbols of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 132, 4, 25, 'cleansing of water first, and then the deeper purification by fire).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 132, 5, 25, 'A Life of Triumph');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 132, 6, 25, '"Without faith it is impossible to please God" - no matter what else we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 132, 7, 25, 'may have (Heb.11:6). And when we do have faith, nothing will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 132, 8, 25, 'impossible for us (Mark 9:23). What that means is that nothing that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 132, 9, 25, 'within God''s plan for our lives will be impossible for us. The man of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 132, 10, 25, 'faith is one who believes that God''s plan alone is perfect and the very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 132, 11, 25, 'best for his life, even in the smallest of details. And so he desires');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 132, 12, 25, 'nothing for himself outside of that plan, and so he asks God for nothing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 132, 13, 25, 'outside of that. And so, within that plan of God, everything is possible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 132, 14, 25, 'for him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 132, 15, 25, 'The man of faith is the one who believes that God is always on his side');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 132, 16, 25, 'against the devil, that Jesus is always his Advocate in the heavenly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 132, 17, 25, 'court, even when he has fallen into sin (if he confesses it). He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 132, 18, 25, 'believes that God is ready to help him overcome every sin and keep every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 132, 19, 25, 'commandment, and that God has not left him alone to fend for himself in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 132, 20, 25, 'this world. Such a man is a constant overcomer in all of life''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 132, 21, 25, 'situations.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 132, 22, 25, 'Imagine living a life where nothing that you have to do in your life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 132, 23, 25, 'will be impossible for you! What a sense of triumph and fulfilment such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 132, 24, 25, 'a life can bring to you! That is how God wants you to live. And that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 132, 25, 25, 'how you can live, if you have faith. So you should wholeheartedly and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 132, 26, 25, 'willingly choose God''s plan and His commands as the very best for you,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 132, 27, 25, 'no matter what the price you have to pay.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 132, 28, 25, 'For faith to grow within you, you must hear what the Spirit is seeking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 133, 1, 25, 'to say to your hearts during each day. For this, we must begin our day');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 133, 2, 25, 'by thinking of God. And then, we must be quick to obey the little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 133, 3, 25, 'promptings of the Spirit, during the day, when He tells us, "Don''t do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 133, 4, 25, 'that. Don''t look at that. Don''t read that", or "It is good for you to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 133, 5, 25, 'meditate a little on the Scriptures now. Speak a word for the Lord now"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 133, 6, 25, 'etc.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 133, 7, 25, 'Never be ashamed to own the Name of Jesus, and to be known as a totally');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 133, 8, 25, 'committed disciple of the Lord Jesus, even if others think you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 133, 9, 25, 'fanatical. Don''t ever let Satan get you to bow the knee to him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 133, 10, 25, '(compromise your convictions), just for the sake of the honour of some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 133, 11, 25, 'mortal man.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 133, 12, 25, 'Faith is as essential to our Christian lives, as the breath we breathe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 133, 13, 25, 'is essential to our physical lives. So be faithful to the inner voice of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 133, 14, 25, 'the Spirit in the little things. And you will grow up to be a man of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 133, 15, 25, 'faith who lives with spiritual dignity and in constant triumph at all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 133, 16, 25, 'times.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 133, 17, 25, 'Radical Attitude towards Sexual Lust');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 133, 18, 25, 'Jesus told His disciples in the sermon on the mount that any man, who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 133, 19, 25, 'looked on a woman to lust after her, was committing adultery with her.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 133, 20, 25, 'He went on to say that it was better for such a man to pluck out his eye');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 133, 21, 25, 'than to go to Hell with both eyes. He taught thereby that constantly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 133, 22, 25, 'lusting after women sexually with one''s eyes was enough to finally send');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 133, 23, 25, 'a man to Hell.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 133, 24, 25, 'The fire of lust in a man''s heart today is the same hell-fire that has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 133, 25, 25, 'burned in every man''s heart, since the time of Adam. Only the fire of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 133, 26, 25, 'the Holy Spirit can destroy it. Your heart will either burn with lust to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 133, 27, 25, 'sin, or burn with love for Jesus. Your choice has to be one of these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 133, 28, 25, 'two: Either the refiner''s fire now or hell-fire in the future. There is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 134, 1, 25, 'no third alternative.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 134, 2, 25, 'The Jewish people, to whom the Lord spoke, already had a very high moral');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 134, 3, 25, 'standard through the Law. They lived by a strict moral code, where sex');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 134, 4, 25, 'outside of marriage was always punished by death. There were no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 134, 5, 25, 'pornographic books or magazines or television programmes in that day, to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 134, 6, 25, 'tempt people to immorality. Every woman in that society was decently');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 134, 7, 25, 'dressed, and men and women hardly ever spoke to each other. Yet, even in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 134, 8, 25, 'such a society, with all its restrictions, the Lord knew that men lusted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 134, 9, 25, 'after women, and He had to warn His disciples against it. If it was so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 134, 10, 25, 'in such a strict society, how much more He would warn young men about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 134, 11, 25, 'this in the lewd society that we live in today.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 134, 12, 25, 'Today''s society throws fuel into our minds through every possible means,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 134, 13, 25, 'to feed our sexual passions. This is why we all have to be more careful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 134, 14, 25, 'in our day. If you are serious about putting out this fire of lust, then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 134, 15, 25, 'you must be serious about cutting off the supply of fuel. And you must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 134, 16, 25, 'cut off the source of that fuel, fiercely and radically, without any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 134, 17, 25, 'mercy. This is what it means to pluck out the eye and to cut off the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 134, 18, 25, 'hand. Jesus was commanding us to destroy the thing that causes us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 134, 19, 25, 'sin. Jesus was more aware than anyone else of the danger of sin and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 134, 20, 25, 'reality of hell-fire - and that was why He urged such radical spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 134, 21, 25, 'surgery, in order to be saved from sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 134, 22, 25, 'The application of the Lord''s command to us today is, "If your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 134, 23, 25, 'television-set causes you to sin in your mind, get rid of it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 134, 24, 25, 'immediately." It is better to go to Heaven, having missed out on TV,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 134, 25, 25, 'than to go to Hell along with the TV stars whom you have watched on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 134, 26, 25, 'screen. Or if it is some magazine, or a particular type of music that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 134, 27, 25, 'stimulates you and causes you to sin, do the same thing with those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 134, 28, 25, 'magazines and cassette-tapes. Surely there can be nothing on earth that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 135, 1, 25, 'is so precious to you, that you must keep holding on to it, even if as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 135, 2, 25, 'result, you finally miss Heaven and go to Hell.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 135, 3, 25, 'Even as you read this, Satan will be quick to whisper to you, "You will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 135, 4, 25, 'surely not die (go to Hell) for something so small as that." And he will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 135, 5, 25, 'cleverly tell you that lusting after a picture in a magazine or after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 135, 6, 25, 'someone you see on the TV is not really adultery. Don''t listen to him -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 135, 7, 25, 'for Jesus has warned us that Satan has been a liar from the beginning.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 135, 8, 25, 'Don''t just say concerning this sin, "I''ll try to do it better in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 135, 9, 25, 'future", or "I''ll try to give it up". The Bible warns us to abstain from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 135, 10, 25, 'even the appearance of evil. Believe that God will help you in every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 135, 11, 25, 'possible way to give up this sin immediately and permanently. Take up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 135, 12, 25, 'the battle from today, and don''t give up until you have cut off the head');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 135, 13, 25, 'of this Goliath that has defied you who are a soldier in the army of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 135, 14, 25, 'living God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 135, 15, 25, 'The Lord is cleansing His temple once again. His temple now is your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 135, 16, 25, 'physical body. Allow Him to do a thorough job in it at once.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 135, 17, 25, '1 Corinthians 7:1 warns us to avoid physical contact with girls. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 135, 18, 25, 'the Holy Spirit says something is "not good" (as He says there), that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 135, 19, 25, 'should be enough for any disciple to avoid it altogether. Legalists live');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 135, 20, 25, 'by the letter, whereas disciples live by the spirit of the commandment.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 135, 21, 25, 'For example: Jesus knew that it was adultery to lust after a woman in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 135, 22, 25, 'one''s heart, because He sought to understand the spirit of the seventh');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 135, 23, 25, 'commandment. In the same way, if you are wholehearted, you will see what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 135, 24, 25, 'lies at the root of all of God''s commandments. See what Paul tells');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 135, 25, 25, 'Timothy: "Flee from anything that will give you the temptations that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 135, 26, 25, 'young men often have" (2 Timothy 2:22-Living). You must flee from all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 135, 27, 25, 'such possibilities of temptation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 135, 28, 25, 'A Chosen Vessel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 136, 1, 25, 'I just read this lovely poem');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 136, 2, 25, 'The Master was searching for a vessel to use;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 136, 3, 25, 'Before Him were many - which one would He choose?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 136, 4, 25, '"Take me", cried the gold one, "I''m shiny and bright.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 136, 5, 25, '"I am of great value and I do things just right.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 136, 6, 25, '"My beauty and lustre will outshine the rest;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 136, 7, 25, '"And for someone like You, Master, gold would be best."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 136, 8, 25, 'The Master passed on with no word at all,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 136, 9, 25, 'And looked at a silver urn, narrow and tall.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 136, 10, 25, '"I''ll serve You, dear Master, I''ll pour out Your wine,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 136, 11, 25, '"I''ll be on Your table, whenever You dine.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 136, 12, 25, '"My lines are so graceful, my carvings so true,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 136, 13, 25, '"And silver will certainly compliment You."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 136, 14, 25, 'Unheeding, the Master passed on to the vessel of brass ,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 136, 15, 25, 'Wide-mouthed and shallow and polished like glass.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 136, 16, 25, '"Here, here", cried the vessel, "I know I will do;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 136, 17, 25, '"Place me on Your table for all men to view.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 136, 18, 25, '"Look at me", called the goblet of crystal so clear,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 136, 19, 25, '"Though fragile am I, I will serve You with fear."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 136, 20, 25, 'The Master came next to the vessel of wood -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 136, 21, 25, 'Polished and carved, it solidly stood.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 136, 22, 25, '"You may use me, dear Master", the wooden bowl said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 136, 23, 25, '"But I''d rather You used me for fruit, not for bread."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 136, 24, 25, 'Then the Master looked down on a vessel of clay,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 136, 25, 25, 'Empty and broken it helplessly lay.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 136, 26, 25, 'No hope had the vessel that the Master might choose');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 136, 27, 25, 'To cleanse and make whole, to fill and to use.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 136, 28, 25, '"Oh, this is the vessel I''ve been hoping to find.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 137, 1, 25, '"I''ll mend it and use it and make it all Mine.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 137, 2, 25, '"I need not the vessel with the pride of itself,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 137, 3, 25, '"Nor one that is narrow, to sit on the shelf,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 137, 4, 25, '"Nor one that is big-mouthed and shallow and loud,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 137, 5, 25, '"Nor one that displays its contents so proud."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 137, 6, 25, 'Then gently He lifted the vessel of clay,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 137, 7, 25, 'Mended and cleansed it and filled it that day;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 137, 8, 25, 'Spoke to it kindly, "There''s work you must do -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 137, 9, 25, '"Just pour out to others as I pour in to you." (Author unknown)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 137, 10, 25, 'Knocked Down but Not Knocked Out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 137, 11, 25, 'God''s ways are not ours. He has to break you first - through many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 137, 12, 25, 'frustrations and failures - and so He sends you where you can get that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 137, 13, 25, 'spiritual education that He has planned for you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 137, 14, 25, 'None of us would ever have thought of sending Moses for 40 years into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 137, 15, 25, 'the wilderness to look after sheep and to face the humiliation of having');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 137, 16, 25, 'to stay with his father-in-law and work under him, all those 40 years,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 137, 17, 25, 'in order to prepare him to be the greatest leader of Israel. But that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 137, 18, 25, 'God''s way. God did something similar with Jacob before changing him into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 137, 19, 25, 'a prince of God (Israel). The most difficult task that God has is to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 137, 20, 25, 'break a man. But when God succeeds in doing that, the power released');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 137, 21, 25, 'through such a man will far exceed that released when the atom is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 137, 22, 25, 'broken!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 137, 23, 25, 'God protected me when I was knocked off my moped at the railway crossing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 137, 24, 25, 'and enabled me to recover fairly soon. That was yet another indication');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 137, 25, 25, 'to me that His angels watch over me. Paul said about his experience, "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 137, 26, 25, 'We are knocked down, but we get up and keep going " (2 Cor.4:9 -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 137, 27, 25, 'Living). That was my experience too that day. God allows us to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 137, 28, 25, 'knocked down now and then. But we don''t stay down like others. We get up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 138, 1, 25, 'and keep going . And that is what infuriates Satan even more. God also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 138, 2, 25, 'gives us an education in sanctification through being knocked down, so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 138, 3, 25, 'that it turns out for our very best. So I continue to proclaim the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 138, 4, 25, 'victory of Jesus and the defeat of Satan even more since that day,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 138, 5, 25, 'everywhere I go. Hallelujah!!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 138, 6, 26, 'Chapter 25 Chapter 25');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 138, 7, 26, 'Coming to an End of Ourselves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 138, 8, 26, 'It is only when we have come to a thorough end of ourselves, that we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 138, 9, 26, 'ready to come to the Lord. Jesus invited people saying, " Come to Me,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 138, 10, 26, 'all you who are weary and heavy-laden" (Matt.11:28). Jesus does not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 138, 11, 26, 'invite everyone to come to Him. Here we see Him inviting only those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 138, 12, 26, 'are sick and tired of their sin-defeated lives. The prodigal son came');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 138, 13, 26, 'back to his father only when he had "spent everything" and "no man gave');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 138, 14, 26, 'him anything". Then only did he " come to his senses" (Lk.15:16-18). We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 138, 15, 26, 'can grow spiritually only when we come to that point in our lives where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 138, 16, 26, 'we don''t care for the honour of men, and have stopped complaining about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 138, 17, 26, 'people and circumstances - and are now sick and tired only of our own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 138, 18, 26, 'defeated lives. That is true repentance.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 138, 19, 26, 'Otherwise we will be like premature babies, who need to be kept inside');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 138, 20, 26, 'the incubator constantly (constantly warmed and encouraged by others).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 138, 21, 26, 'We must not find our security even in the church, but only in the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 138, 22, 26, 'Ezekiel 36:25-30 prophesies about the abundant life that Jesus would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 138, 23, 26, 'give us under the new covenant. It goes on to say in verse 31 that when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 138, 24, 26, 'we come into that life, we will " loathe ourselves for all the evil that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 138, 25, 26, 'we had done in our previous days ". One of the primary marks of a man of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 138, 26, 26, 'God is that he has a cry within himself at all times saying, " O');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 138, 27, 26, 'wretched man that I am. How shall I be totally delivered from all sin? "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 138, 28, 26, '(Rom.7:24 - paraphrase). He constantly longs to be free from all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 139, 1, 26, 'defilement and even the smell of sin in the flesh.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 139, 2, 26, 'God wants you to be strong in the day of adversity (Prov.24:10). But you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 139, 3, 26, 'must build up your knowledge of the Lord in this time of peace, if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 139, 4, 26, 'want to be strong in that day of adversity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 139, 5, 26, 'Spiritual Power');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 139, 6, 26, 'One great danger of the last days is that of having "a form of godliness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 139, 7, 26, 'without the power" (2 Tim.3:5). It is very easy to be satisfied with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 139, 8, 26, 'power that we have because of our gifts and talents. Soul power is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 139, 9, 26, 'manifested in intellectual power, emotional power and will power. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 139, 10, 26, 'none of these is the Divine power that Christ and the Holy Spirit have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 139, 11, 26, 'come to give us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 139, 12, 26, 'Intellectual power is seen in great scientists, scholars and clever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 139, 13, 26, 'preachers. Emotional power is seen in rock musicians - and in many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 139, 14, 26, 'preachers too. Will power is seen among yoga experts and other ascetics');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 139, 15, 26, '- and also among preachers who seek to dominate others through their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 139, 16, 26, 'personality. We must not mistake any of these three for spiritual power.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 139, 17, 26, 'Spiritual power primarily makes us obey God in everything. Consider the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 139, 18, 26, 'power of God displayed in the planets and stars that have moved within');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 139, 19, 26, 'their orbits in perfect timing, for millenniums. The reason for that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 139, 20, 26, 'perfection is that they have obeyed God''s laws implicitly. These');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 139, 21, 26, 'heavenly bodies are a mute testimony to the fact that the best thing to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 139, 22, 26, 'do is to obey God totally.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 139, 23, 26, 'Jesus did not overcome Satan with brute physical power, but with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 139, 24, 26, 'spiritual power. When tempted by Satan, Jesus refused to turn stones');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 139, 25, 26, 'into bread, even though He could have done that; and this, in spite of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 139, 26, 26, 'the fact that His body longed for food, after 40 days of fasting. What a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 139, 27, 26, 'contrast that was to what Eve did, who satisfied her bodily longing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 139, 28, 26, 'immediately in the paradise of Eden, even though she was not hungry. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 140, 1, 26, 'desire for sex is another desire that resides within our bodies, like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 140, 2, 26, 'the desire for food. That also craves for gratification constantly. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 140, 3, 26, 'we have spiritual power we will be like Jesus Who said He would live by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 140, 4, 26, '"every Word of God" rather than satisfy the cravings of His body.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 140, 5, 26, 'Samson had great physical power to tear physical lions apart. But the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 140, 6, 26, 'lion of sexual lust within him tore him apart repeatedly. This proves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 140, 7, 26, 'that sexual lust is far stronger than any lion. Joseph however was a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 140, 8, 26, 'stronger man than Samson, for he could tear the lion of lust in pieces,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 140, 9, 26, 'again and again, day after day (Gen.39:7-13).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 140, 10, 26, 'Our motives determine whether God will give us spiritual power or not.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 140, 11, 26, 'If your goal and ambition in life is only to please and glorify God, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 140, 12, 26, 'will give you His power readily. " You ask and do not receive, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 140, 13, 26, 'you ask with wrong motives" (James 4:3).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 140, 14, 26, 'A job or a profession is only to be a means of earning our living. Our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 140, 15, 26, 'ambition in life must however be only to please God - and not to live');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 140, 16, 26, 'for ourselves or to be great in this world. Satan tried to tempt even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 140, 17, 26, 'Jesus with the glory of this world. So, he will certainly offer this to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 140, 18, 26, 'us too. But we must constantly refuse it (like Jesus did), because we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 140, 19, 26, 'can get that glory only by bowing down to Satan in some way. We have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 140, 20, 26, 'be especially careful that the love of money does not lure us away from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 140, 21, 26, 'fulfilling God''s plan for our lives. We must have no regrets over our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 140, 22, 26, 'choices, 2000 years from now.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 140, 23, 26, 'Dying With Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 140, 24, 26, 'Although there were at least two who were raised from the dead in Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 140, 25, 26, 'Testament times, and at least three in Jesus'' ministry, yet Jesus was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 140, 26, 26, 'the first to conquer death - because the others who were raised from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 140, 27, 26, 'dead, died again. In Hebrews 2:14 we are told that through death, Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 140, 28, 26, 'rendered powerless Satan who had the power of death and thus delivered');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 141, 1, 26, 'those who through fear of death were subject to slavery all their lives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 141, 2, 26, 'When we choose to die with Jesus once and for all, we will no longer be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 141, 3, 26, 'afraid of physical death. The death of a believer is always called "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 141, 4, 26, 'sleep" in the New Testament (e.g. Stephen in Acts 7:60). In 1 Thess.4:13');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 141, 5, 26, '14, we read of those who are "asleep in Jesus" being raised up when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 141, 6, 26, 'Jesus returns. However in the case of Jesus, it is never written that He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 141, 7, 26, 'fell asleep on the cross. His was death- because He took the punishment');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 141, 8, 26, 'for our sins.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 141, 9, 26, 'When we choose to accept our death with Christ, we will find that these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 141, 10, 26, 'words that Job spoke about death are fulfilled (spiritually speaking) in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 141, 11, 26, 'our lives: " In death: (1) wicked people can''t bother us anymore; (2)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 141, 12, 26, 'weary people enter into rest; (3) prisoners are free from their jailers;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 141, 13, 26, 'and (4) the slave is free from his master " (Job 3:17-19).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 141, 14, 26, 'When John saw Jesus at Patmos, he fell at His feet, "as a dead man "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 141, 15, 26, '(Rev.1:17, 18). We too must die with Jesus and fall down at His feet and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 141, 16, 26, 'lie there as dead men, all our lives. Then Jesus will lay His hand on us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 141, 17, 26, 'and strengthen us, as He did John. The Lord told John at that time that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 141, 18, 26, 'He held the key of death. It is for such people that Jesus holds the key');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 141, 19, 26, 'of death (v.18). They are immortal until their life''s work is done. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 141, 20, 26, 'those who do not accept their death with Christ, will allow Satan still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 141, 21, 26, 'to hold the key of their death. Thus they may die before their appointed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 141, 22, 26, 'time. How blessed it is then to accept death with Jesus once and for all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 141, 23, 26, '- so that we will never taste death again.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 141, 24, 26, 'Romans 6:11 tells us to " consider ourselves dead to sin but alive to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 141, 25, 26, 'God" at all times. Whenever we are provoked by others or tempted to lust');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 141, 26, 26, 'sexually, ask yourself two questions: "How will a dead man react in this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 141, 27, 26, 'situation?" and "How would Jesus react?" You will get the answer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 141, 28, 26, 'immediately. Then act accordingly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 142, 1, 26, 'Aging Gracefully');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 142, 2, 26, 'I hope your working long hours every day to earn some money to pay for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 142, 3, 26, 'your tuition, doesn''t get to be too much for you. Just make sure that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 142, 4, 26, 'your studies don''t suffer. There is of course the other side, that if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 142, 5, 26, 'you are busy the whole day, it will save you from many temptations and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 142, 6, 26, 'give you a good sleep at night too. " The student who works hard sleeps');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 142, 7, 26, 'well whether he eats little or much, but the rich student will worry and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 142, 8, 26, 'suffer from insomnia " (Eccl.5:12 - Living)!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 142, 9, 26, 'I read something in Ecclesiastes the other day: " It is a wonderful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 142, 10, 26, 'thing to be alive! If a person lives to be very old, let him rejoice in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 142, 11, 26, 'every day of life, but let him also remember that eternity is far longer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 142, 12, 26, 'and that everything down here is futile in comparison. Young man it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 142, 13, 26, 'wonderful to be young! Enjoy every minute of it! You can, if you like,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 142, 14, 26, 'do all you want to, and take in everything. But remember that you must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 142, 15, 26, 'account to God finally for everything you do. So banish the things that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 142, 16, 26, 'will ultimately cause you grief and pain. And remember that youth, with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 142, 17, 26, 'a whole life before it, can make serious mistakes. So don''t let the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 142, 18, 26, 'excitement of being young cause you to forget your Creator. Honour Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 142, 19, 26, 'in your youth before the evil years come. It will be too late then to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 142, 20, 26, 'remember Him " (Eccl.11:7-12:1 - Living).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 142, 21, 26, 'The time of old age is mentioned here as "the evil years" - when a man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 142, 22, 26, 'becomes " a white-haired old man, dragging himself along, without sexual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 142, 23, 26, 'desire " (Eccl.12:5). But old age can be glorious years, if one has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 142, 24, 26, 'overcome sin in one''s youth. Otherwise those years can be miserably');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 142, 25, 26, 'evil. I have seen old people grumpy, sour and bitter, and living');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 142, 26, 26, 'uselessly. That was because they did not take God''s Laws seriously in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 142, 27, 26, 'their younger days, and deal with sin radically.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 142, 28, 26, 'All men since Adam - except Jesus - must have sinned in their youth in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 143, 1, 26, 'many foolish ways. But those who repent radically and determine to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 143, 2, 26, 'honour God, after having failed, come into a glorious life and end their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 143, 3, 26, 'lives with glory. The others end their lives in shame, just like some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 143, 4, 26, 'modern-day preachers who at the fag-end of their lives, (when they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 143, 5, 26, 'in their 50s and 60s, and old enough to be grandfathers) fall into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 143, 6, 26, 'adultery! This happens because they were not faithful to overcome');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 143, 7, 26, 'sexually dirty thoughts in their youthful days.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 143, 8, 26, 'The other interesting thing I noticed in the above verse (Eccl.12:5) was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 143, 9, 26, 'that being "without sexual desire" is described as a bad state to be in!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 143, 10, 26, 'Yoga teaches people to overcome sexual desire by killing it. But that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 143, 11, 26, 'not God''s way. That is evil - because it is as bad as killing the desire');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 143, 12, 26, 'for food and sleep. We should not long that sexual desire be taken away');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 143, 13, 26, 'from us permanently. The three powerful desires in the human body - for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 143, 14, 26, 'food, sleep and sex - were all created by an all-wise God. Anyone who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 143, 15, 26, 'does not have a desire for any of these three, is sick. So the fact that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 143, 16, 26, 'you have strong sexual desire is not an indication that you need a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 143, 17, 26, 'spiritual check-up. It is as perfectly normal as being hungry and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 143, 18, 26, 'wanting to eat, or being tired and wanting to sleep. We are not ashamed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 143, 19, 26, 'of those two desires and we don''t have to be ashamed of the third desire');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 143, 20, 26, 'either. In fact, if you don''t have a strong sexual desire at your age,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 143, 21, 26, 'it may indicate that you need a medical check-up! The important thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 143, 22, 26, 'however is to keep all these three desires under control, so that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 143, 23, 26, 'serve us and our bodies, instead of ruling our bodies, and thus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 143, 24, 26, 'destroying our lives. Disciplining all these three desires is very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 143, 25, 26, 'important. So, ask God to help you to control your appetite for food so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 143, 26, 26, 'that it doesn''t become gluttony; and to control your desire for sleep so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 143, 27, 26, 'that it doesn''t become laziness. Then you will find controlling sexual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 143, 28, 26, 'desire easier as well.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 144, 1, 26, 'Soulish or Spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 144, 2, 26, 'In 1 Corinthians 2:14, 15, we read of "the natural (soulish) man" and "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 144, 3, 26, 'he who is spiritual". There is a vast difference between a soulish');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 144, 4, 26, 'Christian and a spiritual Christian. Human cleverness cannot understand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 144, 5, 26, 'this, as it says there: " A natural man does not accept the things of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 144, 6, 26, 'the Spirit of God, for they are foolishness to him; and he cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 144, 7, 26, 'understand them, because they are spiritually appraised. But he who is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 144, 8, 26, 'spiritual appraises all things, yet he himself is appraised by no one ."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 144, 9, 26, 'The mind and the spirit are as different as the eye and the ear. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 144, 10, 26, 'just as it is possible for someone to have good hearing and yet be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 144, 11, 26, 'blind, it is also possible for someone to have a brilliant intellect and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 144, 12, 26, 'a '' dead'' spirit - or vice versa. For our work in this world, we need a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 144, 13, 26, 'good mind. But when it comes to the things of God, it is the state of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 144, 14, 26, 'our spirit that matters. To understand the things of God we need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 144, 15, 26, 'revelation from the Holy Spirit, and that is given only to the humble');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 144, 16, 26, '("infants" who have a spirit of humility - Matt.11:25), and not to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 144, 17, 26, 'clever (unless they are also humble). It is difficult for a clever man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 144, 18, 26, 'to be humble, although it is not impossible. That is just like it being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 144, 19, 26, 'difficult for a self-righteous Pharisee to acknowledge that he is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 144, 20, 26, 'sinner, although not impossible. It is easier for prostitutes and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 144, 21, 26, 'thieves to acknowledge that they are sinners. So also in the matter of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 144, 22, 26, 'Divine revelation: It is easier for an unlearned man to acknowledge that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 144, 23, 26, 'he is not clever - and so he can receive Divine revelation quicker. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 144, 24, 26, 'was why Jesus spent most of His time with three unlearned fishermen -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 144, 25, 26, 'Peter, James and John - because He found them to be the most responsive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 144, 26, 26, 'to spiritual things. And this was also why the Pharisees found it so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 144, 27, 26, 'difficult to accept Christ - because their pride in their intellects');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 144, 28, 26, 'hindered them from acknowledging that they were spiritually foolish.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 145, 1, 26, 'This is something that you must bear in mind when constantly mingling');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 145, 2, 26, 'with college-students who are intellectual and clever.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 145, 3, 26, 'Human cleverness has no value before God. It is as unimportant to God as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 145, 4, 26, 'the colour of our skin - for both of these are what people are born');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 145, 5, 26, 'with, and whatever people are born with, gives them no advantage before');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 145, 6, 26, 'God. Cleverness, like human righteousness, is like filthy rags in God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 145, 7, 26, 'sight (Isa.64:6). Christ has become not only our righteousness, but also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 145, 8, 26, 'our wisdom (See 1 Cor.1:30).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 145, 9, 26, 'We are encouraged however, by the fact that a man like Paul, who was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 145, 10, 26, 'both a self-righteous Pharisee and a brilliant intellectual (both');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 145, 11, 26, 'handicaps), could not only be saved, but also become a great apostle of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 145, 12, 26, 'Christ. But that was because he humbled himself constantly. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 145, 13, 26, 'speaking to the Corinthians, he says he feared lest he would depend on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 145, 14, 26, 'his intellectual ability, and that was why he was "in fear and trembling');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 145, 15, 26, 'among them " (1 Cor.2:3). He feared lest he preach to them with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 145, 16, 26, 'power of his mind (soul) rather than in the power of God''s Spirit. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 145, 17, 26, 'must all have that fear whenever we speak. This is why we must pray');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 145, 18, 26, 'constantly for the power of the Holy Spirit - for we need this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 145, 19, 26, 'continuously.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 145, 20, 26, 'So, we must not mistake a clever intellectual presentation of Biblical');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 145, 21, 26, 'truth for a spiritual one. Neither must we mistake a very emotional');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 145, 22, 26, 'message for a spiritual one. Both the intellect and the emotions are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 145, 23, 26, 'parts of our soul. These are good servants but bad masters. The Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 145, 24, 26, 'Spirit alone must be Lord in our lives. Ultimately, the way to become');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 145, 25, 26, 'spiritual lies in the three secrets of the Christian life that I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 145, 26, 26, 'mentioned earlier: Humility, Humility and Humility! If you have that,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 145, 27, 26, 'you will be all right.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 145, 28, 27, 'Chapter 26 Chapter 26');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 146, 1, 27, 'The Way of the Cross');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 146, 2, 27, 'The only two times that Jesus ever said, "Get behind Me, Satan" were in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 146, 3, 27, 'Matthew 4:10 and 16:23. It is an interesting fact that on both occasions');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 146, 4, 27, 'Satan tried to prevent Jesus from going to the cross - once directly and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 146, 5, 27, 'on the second occasion through Peter. First, Satan offered Jesus the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 146, 6, 27, 'whole world (which Jesus had come to win back to God), without Jesus''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 146, 7, 27, 'having to go to the cross - by a short cut, the short-cut of compromise.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 146, 8, 27, 'When he didn''t succeed there, he tried to provoke Him to self-pity');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 146, 9, 27, 'through Peter. On both occasions Jesus recognized Satan''s voice. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 146, 10, 27, 'where many don''t recognize Satan''s voice. You must remember that in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 146, 11, 27, 'every situation, the voice that tells you to avoid the way of the cross');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 146, 12, 27, 'is the voice of the Devil.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 146, 13, 27, 'Some Christians have the crazy habit of fanatically rebuking Satan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 146, 14, 27, 'often, when what they really need to do is to crucify their flesh. A bad');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 146, 15, 27, 'thought comes to our mind from the desires in our flesh. It may be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 146, 16, 27, 'provoked by something Satan and his demons bring within our vision,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 146, 17, 27, 'outside of us. But we must not forget that it is our self-will that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 146, 18, 27, 'causes the temptation. And what we need to do at that time is to ask God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 146, 19, 27, 'for grace to resist our own will and to crucify it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 146, 20, 27, 'Satan was not defeated when Jesus cast out demons or healed the sick or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 146, 21, 27, 'preached sermons. Hebrews 2:14 clearly states that Satan was defeated');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 146, 22, 27, 'when Jesus died on the cross. That is how you can defeat Satan too -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 146, 23, 27, 'when you take our place with Christ on the cross. So, that is what Satan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 146, 24, 27, 'will try to prevent you from doing. But if you constantly choose the way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 146, 25, 27, 'of the cross, Satan will never have any power over you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 146, 26, 27, 'This is why Satan has prevented the vast majority of evangelical');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 146, 27, 27, 'Christian churches from preaching about " always bearing about in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 146, 28, 27, 'body the dying of Jesus" (2 Cor.4:10). The only thing that Jesus ever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 147, 1, 27, 'said that we must do daily is to bear the cross (Lk.9:23). Beware then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 147, 2, 27, 'of churches that do not preach taking up the cross daily. Any preaching');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 147, 3, 27, 'that only tells unbelievers about Jesus dying for their sins but does');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 147, 4, 27, 'not tell believers about their being crucified with Christ and their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 147, 5, 27, 'need to die daily, is an incomplete gospel. These are the two sides of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 147, 6, 27, 'the gospel - just like the two sides of a coin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 147, 7, 27, 'We cannot have the power of God, if we do not take up the cross every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 147, 8, 27, 'day. In Christian preaching these days, we find many good things being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 147, 9, 27, 'preached; but the message of the daily cross is missing completely. This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 147, 10, 27, 'is Satan''s master-work - hiding the message of dying with Jesus daily.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 147, 11, 27, 'So determine that wherever you get a chance to speak, you will help');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 147, 12, 27, 'restore the balance and preach the daily cross. That will make you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 147, 13, 27, 'unpopular with men, but great in heaven.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 147, 14, 27, 'When I was 23 years old, I began seeking God for the power of the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 147, 15, 27, 'Spirit. The Lord showed me then how it was when He chose the way of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 147, 16, 27, 'death (symbolically, in His baptism), that He was anointed with the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 147, 17, 27, 'Spirit (Matt.3:16). And the Lord told me then that as long as I chose');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 147, 18, 27, 'the way of the cross - the way of death to Self - I too would have His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 147, 19, 27, 'power. But if I ever decided to leave that pathway, I would lose His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 147, 20, 27, 'power as well. I have chosen that way permanently, and it has made me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 147, 21, 27, 'supremely happy. I would recommend that way wholeheartedly, to all of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 147, 22, 27, 'you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 147, 23, 27, 'The Way of Life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 147, 24, 27, 'The gospel of the new covenant is essentially this: that we can partake');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 147, 25, 27, 'of the Divine nature. God''s nature is LOVE - and the most important');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 147, 26, 27, 'characteristic of love is that it does not seek its own. It was because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 147, 27, 27, 'Jesus did not seek His own that He came down from heaven to earth to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 147, 28, 27, 'save us. God compares His love for us to that of a mother for her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 148, 1, 27, 'nursing babe (Isa.49:15). A mother''s love for her newborn baby is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 148, 2, 27, 'greatest demonstration of love that one can see on earth - for a good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 148, 3, 27, 'mother does everything unselfishly for her child, expecting nothing in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 148, 4, 27, 'return. This is how the love of God is too - and this is the nature that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 148, 5, 27, 'we are to partake of. Then we will be able to serve God''s people like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 148, 6, 27, 'Jesus Himself did.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 148, 7, 27, 'Love is the fuel that runs the Christian life. A car has to be pushed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 148, 8, 27, 'when the gas-tank is empty. Even so, where fervent love for the Lord has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 148, 9, 27, 'dried up, our labour for Him will become heavy and burdensome, like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 148, 10, 27, 'pushing a car. Then it will also become difficult to bear with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 148, 11, 27, 'weaknesses and follies of others around us. So we need to keep going');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 148, 12, 27, 'back to the petrol-bunk (gas-station) again and again to fill-up. " Be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 148, 13, 27, 'filled with the Spirit continuously".(Eph 5:18)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 148, 14, 27, 'Victory over anger and lusting with the eyes are by themselves only a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 148, 15, 27, 'preparation for the ultimate goal of partaking of the Divine nature');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 148, 16, 27, 'itself. Our flesh is utterly selfish, and it is this selfish nature that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 148, 17, 27, 'has to be put to death daily. We are not to seek our own gain or honour');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 148, 18, 27, 'or comfort, or anything that is our own - for that is the way of eternal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 148, 19, 27, 'death. The way of life is the way of giving ourselves utterly to do the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 148, 20, 27, 'will of God alone for our lives, whatever that may cost us. We must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 148, 21, 27, 'judge ourselves every day, and many times each day - not by looking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 148, 22, 27, 'inward, but by looking up at Jesus - and thus discover the areas where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 148, 23, 27, 'we are seeking our own and not the glory of God. Then we can cleanse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 148, 24, 27, 'ourselves from that self-seeking. This is the pathway to perfection.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 148, 25, 27, 'Very few are interested in cleansing themselves so faithfully from ALL');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 148, 26, 27, 'filthiness of the flesh and the spirit (2 Cor.7:1) - and that is why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 148, 27, 27, 'very few grow up to a genuine godly life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 148, 28, 27, 'Jesus said that only "men of violence" will possess the kingdom of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 149, 1, 27, '(Matt.11:12). What that means is that we must do violence to everything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 149, 2, 27, 'within us that stands in the way of obedience to God''s commandments. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 149, 3, 27, 'is not by our obedience to the big commandments that we prove our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 149, 4, 27, 'obedience. No. Jesus said that he who obeys and teaches others to obey');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 149, 5, 27, 'the least of the commandments will be called great in God''s kingdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 149, 6, 27, '(Matt.5:19). A little child''s obedience is not tested by his not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 149, 7, 27, 'murdering anyone or by not committing adultery in school. No. It is by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 149, 8, 27, 'his obeying his mother when she calls him to help her, when he himself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 149, 9, 27, 'wants to play. So it is in our relationship with God as well. It is in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 149, 10, 27, 'the little things of daily life that we are to be faithful. Otherwise we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 149, 11, 27, 'are disobedient.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 149, 12, 27, 'God or Mammon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 149, 13, 27, 'Mammon (earthly wealth) is the great power that constantly opposes the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 149, 14, 27, 'rule of God in our lives. That is the alternative master who is always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 149, 15, 27, 'craving for our allegiance and service. Luke 16:13 teaches us that if we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 149, 16, 27, 'don''t conquer the power of money and put it under our feet, we will not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 149, 17, 27, 'be able to love God as we should or to hold on to God. We can earn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 149, 18, 27, 'money, but we must never sacrifice spiritual things for material gain.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 149, 19, 27, 'God must always be FIRST in our lives. Christ must be Lord of ALL - or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 149, 20, 27, 'He will not be Lord at all.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 149, 21, 27, 'Many believers, who are zealous to follow the Lord when they have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 149, 22, 27, 'difficulties and trials and poverty in their lives, drift away from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 149, 23, 27, 'Lord when their lives become prosperous, comfortable and luxurious. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 149, 24, 27, 'must always remember that your job is only a means of earning your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 149, 25, 27, 'living. Since it is getting more and more expensive to live in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 149, 26, 27, 'world, and since jobs for Christians (where no unrighteousness is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 149, 27, 27, 'involved) are becoming more and more difficult to obtain, it is good for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 149, 28, 27, 'you when you are young to get all the technical education you can get,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 150, 1, 27, 'so that it will be easier for you later to find a well-paying job. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 150, 2, 27, 'you must never forget that your goal at all times must be to seek the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 150, 3, 27, 'kingdom of God and His righteousness first. Everything else must be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 150, 4, 27, 'secondary. Otherwise Mammon will get a hold on your life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 150, 5, 27, 'The rich young ruler who came to Jesus had so many good qualities. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 150, 6, 27, 'he lacked ONE thing. He loved money more than he loved God. And that one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 150, 7, 27, 'disqualification made him miss the kingdom of God. Just think how he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 150, 8, 27, 'must be regretting his decision today.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 150, 9, 27, 'Being exact in money matters is not because money has any value to us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 150, 10, 27, 'We really believe that money will be under our feet in heaven - because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 150, 11, 27, 'the roads there are made of pure gold, and we will be walking on them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 150, 12, 27, '(Rev.21:21). But it is to those who are faithful in the use of money');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 150, 13, 27, 'here on earth that God commits the true riches of heaven, as Jesus said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 150, 14, 27, '(Lk.16:11). That is why we must be careful in our use of money. We don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 150, 15, 27, 'want to miss the true riches. Yet God is not a taskmaster. Where we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 150, 16, 27, 'blundered in the past in the use of money (and we all have), God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 150, 17, 27, 'merciful and forgives. But in our own interest it is good to be faithful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 150, 18, 27, 'in the future.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 150, 19, 27, 'Becoming Like Children and Being on Fire');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 150, 20, 27, 'Jesus told His disciples that in order to enter God''s kingdom, they had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 150, 21, 27, 'to be converted and become like little children (Matt.18:3). Jesus''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 150, 22, 27, 'definition of being converted therefore is to become like little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 150, 23, 27, 'children. That involves unlearning the ways of grown-ups that we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 150, 24, 27, 'learnt from the age of one onwards. The spirit of the world has taught');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 150, 25, 27, 'us that we must " seek our own", because that''s what pays. We have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 150, 26, 27, 'get rid of this attitude. Then we can become like little children once');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 150, 27, 27, 'again. This is the wonderful message of the gospel that we can be free');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 150, 28, 27, 'from malice, bitterness, grudges, complaints and impurity etc.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 151, 1, 27, 'In Matthew 13:43, Jesus said that " the righteous will shine forth as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 151, 2, 27, 'the sun ". The sun is constantly on fire at millions of degrees. No');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 151, 3, 27, 'germs or bacteria can therefore survive on it. That is how the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 151, 4, 27, 'wants us to be too - always on fire for Him, always zealous and fervent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 151, 5, 27, 'for purity, to serve others and to bless them, to humble ourselves, to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 151, 6, 27, 'testify in the meetings, and always on fire to build the church. Young');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 151, 7, 27, 'men like you should be in the forefront in this matter. In the next');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 151, 8, 27, 'three verses (Matt.13:44 to 46), Jesus explains how we can be on fire');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 151, 9, 27, 'always, through two parables (one about the treasure in the field and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 151, 10, 27, 'the other about the pearl of great price). In both of them, we find this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 151, 11, 27, 'one phrase repeated - " He sold all that he had ". That is the secret.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 151, 12, 27, 'We have to give up our self-will, our rights, our honour, our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 151, 13, 27, 'privileges, everything. Only then can we be like the sun - always on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 151, 14, 27, 'fire.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 151, 15, 28, 'Chapter 27 Chapter 27');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 151, 16, 28, 'Spirit of Babylon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 151, 17, 28, 'God has to give all of us a tour of Babylonian Christianity as part of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 151, 18, 28, 'our education. I had my tour for 16 years - from the time I was born');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 151, 19, 28, 'again, upto 1975. You are getting that tour right now in the different');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 151, 20, 28, 'compromising churches that you have visited there. Many of God''s people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 151, 21, 28, 'are in Babylon today - as Revelation 18:4 makes plain. God says to them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 151, 22, 28, 'in that verse, "Come out of her, My people". The problem is with their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 151, 23, 28, 'leaders and pastors who lead the flock astray. As in Jesus'' time, many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 151, 24, 28, 'of God''s people today are like " sheep without true shepherds"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 151, 25, 28, '(Matt.9:36). Think of all that Jesus must have seen in the temple at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 151, 26, 28, 'Jerusalem three times every year and at the synagogue in Nazareth every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 151, 27, 28, 'week, that dishonoured God, when He went to these places from the age of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 151, 28, 28, '12 to age 30. But He did not say or do anything about all that, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 152, 1, 28, 'it was not yet God''s time. But those years and those experiences were an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 152, 2, 28, 'important part of His education at Nazareth for His ministry later. So');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 152, 3, 28, 'will it be for you also now.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 152, 4, 28, 'The essence of the spirit of Babylon is seen in the words of Peter to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 152, 5, 28, 'Jesus in Matthew 19:27 (Living): " What will we get out of it?" We too');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 152, 6, 28, 'can wonder, if we have given up many things for the Lord, how He will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 152, 7, 28, 'reward us - here on earth and later in heaven. That would prove that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 152, 8, 28, 'are thinking of godliness as a means of gain for ourselves and that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 152, 9, 28, 'are self-centred in our thinking. Some may seek money or honour here on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 152, 10, 28, 'earth through their preaching and their service for the Lord. Others may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 152, 11, 28, 'seek a reward or a place in the Bride of Christ in heaven. Whatever it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 152, 12, 28, 'be, as long as we are seeking something for ourselves, we still have the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 152, 13, 28, 'spirit of Babylon within us. This is the filthiness of the spirit that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 152, 14, 28, 'we must cleanse ourselves from.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 152, 15, 28, 'When Peter asked what he would get out of ser ving the Lord, Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 152, 16, 28, 'replied with a parable in Matthew 20:1-16. There he spoke of two types');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 152, 17, 28, 'of labourers: (1) those who worked for a reward (salary) - some for one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 152, 18, 28, 'denarius (v.2) and some for "whatever is a lawful hourly wage" (v.4) -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 152, 19, 28, 'but both for wages; (2) those who went to work with no promise of a wage');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 152, 20, 28, '(v.7). This second category of workers got the highest wage - one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 152, 21, 28, 'denarius per hour. All the others got less - the first ones getting only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 152, 22, 28, '0.08 denarius per hour, for they worked for 12 hours for one denarius.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 152, 23, 28, 'Thus, as Jesus said there, many who are last now will be first in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 152, 24, 28, 'eternity - because the Lord " will test the quality and motive of each');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 152, 25, 28, 'man''s service " (1 Cor.3:13 and 4:5) and not the quantity of their work.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 152, 26, 28, 'Jesus never drove out those who were making money for themselves in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 152, 27, 28, 'marketplace in Jerusalem. No. Because the marketplace is the right place');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 152, 28, 28, 'to make money. John Wesley said that Christians should earn all that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 153, 1, 28, 'they can through hard work. I agree with that. Jesus drove out only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 153, 2, 28, 'those who were trying to get profit for themselves in God''s house. Even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 153, 3, 28, 'so today; Jesus will cleanse out from the church those who seek honour');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 153, 4, 28, 'or fame or money or any other type of gain for themselves in the church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 153, 5, 28, 'The church is to be a place of sacrifice. The last verse of Zechariah');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 153, 6, 28, 'states that when the Lord returns, " There will be no more grasping');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 153, 7, 28, 'traders in the house of the Lord" (Zech.14:21 - Living Bible). We must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 153, 8, 28, 'never seek anything for ourselves in the service that we do for our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 153, 9, 28, 'Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 153, 10, 28, 'Even though the Lord has rewards for those who serve Him faithfully, as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 153, 11, 28, 'is promised in the New Testament from Matthew to Revelation, yet we must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 153, 12, 28, 'not work for reward. We work as an expression of our gratitude to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 153, 13, 28, 'Lord for what He did for us on Calvary. Those who work for a reward');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 153, 14, 28, 'won''t get any!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 153, 15, 28, 'This was how I felt after I had that road-accident at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 153, 16, 28, 'railway-crossing, when I could have died: (1) I felt that there were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 153, 17, 28, 'many more areas in which I would like to be transformed into the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 153, 18, 28, 'likeness of Christ before I leave this earth. So I am thankful that I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 153, 19, 28, 'have some more time to "look unto Jesus" and see my lack and judge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 153, 20, 28, 'myself and be an overcomer in the areas where God gives me light. (2) I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 153, 21, 28, 'also felt at that time, that 34 years (from the age of 19 to 53) were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 153, 22, 28, 'not enough to show my gratitude to the Lord for what He had done for me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 153, 23, 28, 'on Calvary. And so I was thankful that God spared my life and has now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 153, 24, 28, 'given me some more years to show my gratitude to Him by serving Him in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 153, 25, 28, 'this needy world. The Full Gospel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 153, 26, 28, 'I am happy that the Lord is giving you opportunities to share the Word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 153, 27, 28, 'and serve God in other ways there. Such activities themselves will save');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 153, 28, 28, 'you from the pressure of many temptations.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 154, 1, 28, 'Jesus spoke with spiritual authority unlike the Pharisees (Matt.7:29).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 154, 2, 28, 'This was because He had overcome all temptation in His daily life during');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 154, 3, 28, 'the previous thirty years before preaching. There is no substitute for a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 154, 4, 28, 'life that backs up what we preach. That is the only way to have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 154, 5, 28, 'spiritual authority.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 154, 6, 28, 'The full gospel is found in Jesus'' two words to the woman caught in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 154, 7, 28, 'adultery: "I do not condemn you (for your past sins)" and "From now on,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 154, 8, 28, 'do not sin any more" (John 8:11). These two words from the Lord are like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 154, 9, 28, 'the two sides of a coin. A coin (or a gospel) having only one side is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 154, 10, 28, 'counterfeit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 154, 11, 28, 'Jesus was crucified not because He preached about being good and humble,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 154, 12, 28, 'but because He denounced the traditions of the elders that contradicted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 154, 13, 28, 'God''s Word (Mark 7:6-13). Today also, it is the traditions of men that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 154, 14, 28, 'hinder people from developing into the fullness of the stature of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 154, 15, 28, 'Christ. If we seek popularity with Christians, we will keep quiet about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 154, 16, 28, 'human traditions that are contrary to the Word of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 154, 17, 28, 'The distinctive mark of the members of Christ''s Body is that they keep');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 154, 18, 28, 'resisting sin at all times ("The Spirit fights the flesh" - Gal.5:17).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 154, 19, 28, 'Jesus died not only to forgive our sins (1 Cor.15:3), but also that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 154, 20, 28, 'might die with Him (Gal.2:20), and thus live no longer for ourselves,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 154, 21, 28, 'but only for Him (2 Cor.5:14, 15).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 154, 22, 28, 'The Lord does not find pleasure in any who are half-hearted (lukewarm -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 154, 23, 28, 'that is, neither worldly (cold) nor on fire for Him (hot)). He vomits');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 154, 24, 28, 'out such people (Rev.3:16) - just like we would vomit out any food that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 154, 25, 28, 'refused to become a part of our body, after entering our stomach. So,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 154, 26, 28, 'you must always be on fire, with the fire of the Holy Spirit - to live a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 154, 27, 28, 'holy life, to be a witness for Christ, and to build His church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 154, 28, 28, 'Mercy and Grace');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 155, 1, 28, 'Many have misunderstood the meaning of "grace" today. There are many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 155, 2, 28, 'definitions of "grace" that clever Christians have invented. But here is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 155, 3, 28, 'the definition that the Lord Himself gave Paul: " My grace is sufficient');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 155, 4, 28, 'for you - for Mypower is made perfect in your weakness " (2 Cor.12:9).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 155, 5, 28, 'So "grace" means " God''s power for our weakness" - whatever that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 155, 6, 28, 'weakness may be. For every weakness that we have - whether due to our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 155, 7, 28, 'temperament or our past failures or whatever - God''s grace can give us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 155, 8, 28, 'the power to overcome.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 155, 9, 28, 'Grace is also called "help in time of need" in Hebrews 4:16 (where the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 155, 10, 28, 'time of need is the time of temptation, in the context - see verse 15).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 155, 11, 28, 'We are all extremely weak people. But very few realize that they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 155, 12, 28, 'weak - and that is why they don''t seek for grace from God. We are so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 155, 13, 28, 'weak that one pretty face or one tempting picture in a magazine is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 155, 14, 28, 'enough to knock us down with sexual lust. One compliment on our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 155, 15, 28, 'abilities or our performance is enough to knock us down with pride. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 155, 16, 28, 'one unexpected financial gain is enough to knock us down with the love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 155, 17, 28, 'of money. Satan knows our weakness in these areas, but very often we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 155, 18, 28, 'don''t. If we realize our weakness, we will constantly cry out to God for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 155, 19, 28, 'grace.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 155, 20, 28, 'Our time of need is when we are tempted - before we fall into sin, not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 155, 21, 28, 'after. We are like people climbing a mountain, who in the moment of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 155, 22, 28, 'temptation are slipping down a cliff, hanging on by our fingers. But we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 155, 23, 28, 'are often too proud to ask for help. We usually wait until we fall and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 155, 24, 28, 'break our bones before we ask for help. Then the ambulance of mercy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 155, 25, 28, 'comes and takes us to the hospital.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 155, 26, 28, 'But Hebrews 4:16 tells us that we should ask for grace to help us in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 155, 27, 28, 'time of need - and our time of need is before we fall, not after. If we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 155, 28, 28, 'ask for grace then, we will experience God lifting us up from the cliff.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 156, 1, 28, 'Most Christians live lives of repeatedly falling and repeatedly being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 156, 2, 28, 'taken to the hospital in the ambulance. God offers us a better life -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 156, 3, 28, 'where we can be helped, at the moment of temptation. Ask for this help.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 156, 4, 28, 'The good news of the new covenant is that Jesus offers us both mercy and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 156, 5, 28, 'grace.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 156, 6, 28, 'The secret of receiving grace (power) from God is first of all to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 156, 7, 28, 'acknowledge our need, our failures, our hypocrisy and our powerlessness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 156, 8, 28, 'honestly, and then to thirst for God''s power believing that God will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 156, 9, 28, 'certainly give it to us. Here is my definition of faith: Faith is to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 156, 10, 28, 'believe that God is more eager to give us whatever He has promised, than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 156, 11, 28, 'we are eager to receive it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 156, 12, 28, 'But " God gives His grace only to the humble " (1 Pet.5:5). And only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 156, 13, 28, 'humble people can build the church as the Body of Christ. Jesus became a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 156, 14, 28, 'servant first before He laid the foundation of the church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 156, 15, 29, 'Chapter 28 Chapter 28');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 156, 16, 29, 'Grace is Superior to the Law');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 156, 17, 29, 'Grace is as much superior to the Law as Jesus is superior to Moses. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 156, 18, 29, 'the Law could bring forgiveness of sins (Psa.103:3; and Psa.32:1), then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 156, 19, 29, 'grace can certainly lead us further - to victory over sin (Rom.6:14 and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 156, 20, 29, '8:3; and Matt.1:21).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 156, 21, 29, 'Grace is what helped Jesus to be an Overcomer from His childhood days');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 156, 22, 29, '(See Luke 2:40), until the time He died on the cross (See Heb.2:9). Now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 156, 23, 29, 'He sits with the Father on His throne, because He overcame (See');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 156, 24, 29, 'Rev.3:21). In that same verse, He also tells us how we can sit with Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 156, 25, 29, 'on His throne - by overcoming temptation exactly as He Himself overcame.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 156, 26, 29, 'This is the place of honour that James and John asked for, and that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 156, 27, 29, 'Jesus said only the Father could give them. Now Jesus tells us how all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 156, 28, 29, 'of us can reach that place of honour - on the throne, on the left hand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 157, 1, 29, 'and right hand of Jesus - by overcoming.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 157, 2, 29, 'Discipleship and Partnership');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 157, 3, 29, 'The conditions of discipleship mentioned in Luke 14:26, 27, 33 are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 157, 4, 29, 'required of all who are to be used by the Lord to build His church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 157, 5, 29, 'These are: (i) Giving the supreme place to the Lord in our hearts and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 157, 6, 29, 'lives; (ii) Hating our own Adamic Self-life; (iii) Being detached from a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 157, 7, 29, 'possessive attitude to earthly things (money, job etc.).We are permitted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 157, 8, 29, 'by God to have many things, but we must not possess any of them as if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 157, 9, 29, 'they were ours. We are to be stewards, holding everything for the Lord''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 157, 10, 29, 'use, to glorify Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 157, 11, 29, 'The Christian life is a partnership with Jesus. He said, " Take my yoke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 157, 12, 29, 'upon you and learn from Me" - Matt.11:29. The picture here is of two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 157, 13, 29, 'bullocks under the same yoke - with the novice bullock learning from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 157, 14, 29, 'experienced bullock how to plough a straight furrow. So the Lord does');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 157, 15, 29, 'not expect us to do anything on our own. So, wherever you go or whatever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 157, 16, 29, 'you do (even watching a TV program) make sure you are doing it along');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 157, 17, 29, 'with Jesus and under His yoke. If ever you feel uneasy about doing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 157, 18, 29, 'something, because you sense that Jesus would not approve of it, then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 157, 19, 29, 'give it up immediately.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 157, 20, 29, 'Give No Place to Satan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 157, 21, 29, 'Satan has, once and for all, been defeated by Jesus on the cross');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 157, 22, 29, '(Heb.2:14 and Col.2:14, 15). So you need never be afraid of Him. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 157, 23, 29, 'first submit to God and then resist Satan, he will certainly flee from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 157, 24, 29, 'you (James.4:7).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 157, 25, 29, 'I want to encourage you with the words of the song, " Take the Name of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 157, 26, 29, 'Jesus with you - as a shield against every foe". The righteous man runs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 157, 27, 29, 'into this Name as unto a strong tower and is safe (Prov.18:10). Resist');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 157, 28, 29, 'Satan in that Name. Call upon the Lord and He will deliver you from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 158, 1, 29, 'everything that bothers you at any time. Don''t ever give any place to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 158, 2, 29, 'Satan. It says in Rev.12:8 that no place was found for Satan in heaven.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 158, 3, 29, 'There must be no place for him in your hearts either. A constant spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 158, 4, 29, 'of praise to God will be a great help in ensuring that Satan gets no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 158, 5, 29, 'foothold anywhere in your life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 158, 6, 29, 'Learning From Israel''s Conceit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 158, 7, 29, 'We can learn many lessons from the failures of the nation of Israel. One');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 158, 8, 29, 'of their biggest mistakes was thinking that they were the only people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 158, 9, 29, 'whom God would be interested in. But God had told them through the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 158, 10, 29, 'prophets Hosea and Isaiah, that He would call others as well (this is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 158, 11, 29, 'quoted by Paul in Rom. 9:24-32).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 158, 12, 29, 'We read of two reactions to Jesus'' first sermon at Nazareth. First those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 158, 13, 29, 'Jewish people appreciated Him because He said that the prophecy of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 158, 14, 29, 'Isaiah was being fulfilled in their midst and that God had sent Him to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 158, 15, 29, 'set them free and to proclaim His favour on them (Luke 4:22). People');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 158, 16, 29, 'always appreciate hearing things like that. But then Jesus went on to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 158, 17, 29, 'say that when God wanted to support Elijah, He bypassed all the widows');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 158, 18, 29, 'in Israel and chose a non-Israeli widow (in Zarephath) to do that; and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 158, 19, 29, 'that God ignored all the lepers in Israel and healed a non-Israeli');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 158, 20, 29, '(Naaman) in the time of Elisha. As soon as they heard that God blesses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 158, 21, 29, 'non-Israelis, their reaction changed. They became so furious that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 158, 22, 29, 'caught hold of Jesus and tried to kill Him (Luke 4:28, 29). Read that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 158, 23, 29, 'passage.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 158, 24, 29, 'It has been the same in Christendom too, throughout the centuries.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 158, 25, 29, 'Whenever God moves through an instrument of His and starts a new');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 158, 26, 29, 'movement, the people in that movement begin to think that they alone are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 158, 27, 29, 'the privileged elect of God and that God has no place or blessing for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 158, 28, 29, 'anyone else.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 159, 1, 29, 'The only way to escape this is by judging ourselves constantly and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 159, 2, 29, 'refusing to judge others. We must certainly be discerning about people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 159, 3, 29, 'But we don''t have to judge or condemn anyone. Jesus clearly had a very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 159, 4, 29, 'negative opinion about Judas Iscariot, and Paul had a clear opinion');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 159, 5, 29, 'about the carnality of the Corinthians. So, having such opinions about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 159, 6, 29, 'others is not wrong. In fact it is necessary if we are to avoid being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 159, 7, 29, 'deceived or manipulated by others. But we must not judge anyone or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 159, 8, 29, 'condemn anyone.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 159, 9, 29, 'Ministry and Reproach');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 159, 10, 29, 'All prophetic ministry is "to disturb those who are comfortable, and to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 159, 11, 29, 'comfort those who are disturbed". That was how Jesus preached -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 159, 12, 29, 'disturbing the Pharisees and comforting repentant sinners. The Pharisees');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 159, 13, 29, 'got furious at Jesus'' preaching and hated Him. But repentant sinners');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 159, 14, 29, 'were encouraged and loved Him. Every prophet today also will be greatly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 159, 15, 29, 'loved by repentant sinners seeking holiness and intensely hated by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 159, 16, 29, 'hypocrites and self-righteous Pharisees.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 159, 17, 29, 'Simeon told Mary (Luke 2:34, 35) that Jesus'' ministry would result in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 159, 18, 29, 'the thoughts of many hearts being exposed, and thus inmany falling lower');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 159, 19, 29, 'and a few rising higher. This is what happens even today, wherever the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 159, 20, 29, 'Lord ministers in prophetic power through His servants.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 159, 21, 29, 'Hebrews 13:11-13 tells us three things about being rejected by religious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 159, 22, 29, 'Christendom:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 159, 23, 29, '(1) Under the law, the bodies of the slain animals were treated as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 159, 24, 29, 'unclean and had to be burnt outside the camp.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 159, 25, 29, '(2) Thus even Jesus'' body was treated as unclean by the Jews and He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 159, 26, 29, 'killed outside Jerusalem.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 159, 27, 29, '(3) Now it is our turn to be considered unclean by the religious world');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 159, 28, 29, '(if we stand uncompromisingly for the Lord).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 160, 1, 29, 'We must be willing to go outside worldly Christendom to Jesus. Reproach');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 160, 2, 29, 'is the covering that every true disciple and every true local church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 160, 3, 29, 'will have to face, perpetually - not a reproach because of any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 160, 4, 29, 'foolishness or Phariseeism, but a reproach for standing true to God and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 160, 5, 29, 'His Word and for proclaiming His full purpose.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 160, 6, 29, 'Grace - The New Covenant Blessing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 160, 7, 29, 'The main difference between the old and the new covenants is that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 160, 8, 29, 'old covenant was an earthly one and the new covenant is a heavenly one.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 160, 9, 29, 'Moses could promise the Israelites only lots of money, prosperous farms,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 160, 10, 29, 'many children, many cattle and physical health, if they kept the law.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 160, 11, 29, 'But Jesus did not come with such promises. He promises us victory over');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 160, 12, 29, 'the lusts that enslave us. So we can choose what we want - the blessings');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 160, 13, 29, 'of the old covenant or of the new. Most believers are quite content with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 160, 14, 29, 'the blessings of the old. Jesus said that most people would say, " The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 160, 15, 29, 'old is good enough" - Luke 5:39).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 160, 16, 30, 'Chapter 29 Chapter 29');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 160, 17, 30, 'Isaac and Jacob');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 160, 18, 30, 'In the Old Testament, we see a vast difference between the way Isaac and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 160, 19, 30, 'Jacob ended their lives. And there was a reason for this. Isaac never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 160, 20, 30, 'had any struggles in his life. He received his riches from a wealthy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 160, 21, 30, 'father (Abraham) and enjoyed everything freely at home. His marriage');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 160, 22, 30, 'also was arranged by his father. Jacob, on the other hand, had to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 160, 23, 30, 'struggle for everything. He had to run away from home, because his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 160, 24, 30, 'brother tried to kill him. He was cheated by his father-in-law, Laban,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 160, 25, 30, 'before he got his wealth and his two wives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 160, 26, 30, 'What was the final result in the case of these two men? At the end of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 160, 27, 30, 'Isaac''s life, we see him as a lover of good food and without spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 160, 28, 30, 'discernment as to which of his two children had been chosen by God. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 161, 1, 30, 'decided to give the birthright to Esau, just because Esau could make the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 161, 2, 30, 'venison curry that he loved (Gen.27:2-4)!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 161, 3, 30, 'Jacob however was very different at the end of his life. Broken by God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 161, 4, 30, 'at Peniel, he became Israel. And when Joseph brought his two sons');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 161, 5, 30, 'Manasseh and Ephraim to be blessed, Jacob knew who would be more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 161, 6, 30, 'blessed. So he crossed his hands and gave the younger Ephraim the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 161, 7, 30, 'greater blessing. Jacob also prophesied about the future of all his sons');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 161, 8, 30, '(Gen.48:8 to 49:27). God had broken Jacob and so he had spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 161, 9, 30, 'discernment and became a prophet.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 161, 10, 30, 'Many believers, like Isaac, live only on what they have received');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 161, 11, 30, 'spiritually from other believers. They can pass on to others only what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 161, 12, 30, 'they have received from their spiritual fathers. This is good, but it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 161, 13, 30, 'the second-best. But then there are other believers (and these are very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 161, 14, 30, 'few) who have come to know God personally through the trials they have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 161, 15, 30, 'gone through in their lives. And like Jacob, they have received');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 161, 16, 30, 'spiritual wealth (revelation) from God, understood His ways and His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 161, 17, 30, 'mind, and thus got spiritual discernment. This is how it must be with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 161, 18, 30, 'you. So learn to give thanks to the Lord for all that He allows you to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 161, 19, 30, 'face. Let Him shape you as the potter shapes his vessel of clay.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 161, 20, 30, 'Make Jesus Lord of All');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 161, 21, 30, 'Paul says in 2 Corinthians 2:14, " Thanks be to God Who leads us always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 161, 22, 30, 'in His triumph". The Living Bible paraphrases that as , "Thanks be to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 161, 23, 30, 'God! For through what Christ has done, He has triumphed over us". So God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 161, 24, 30, 'must triumph over us in every area of our lives, for us to live in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 161, 25, 30, 'triumph.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 161, 26, 30, 'One day every knee will bow and acknowledge that Jesus is Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 161, 27, 30, '(Phil.2:10, 11). But right now, the knee of every desire within your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 161, 28, 30, 'flesh must bow and acknowledge that Jesus is Lord. Those lusts that rule');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 162, 1, 30, 'you must bow and acknowledge that Jesus is Lord of your body.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 162, 2, 30, '" The Lord''s sword will go forth against all flesh from head (north) to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 162, 3, 30, 'foot (south) and all flesh will know that the Lord has drawn forth His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 162, 4, 30, 'sword against it " (Ezek.21:4,5).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 162, 5, 30, 'The goal towards which God is working is that " Jesus Christ might have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 162, 6, 30, 'the first place in everything " (Col.1:18). If you make that your goal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 162, 7, 30, 'too, then you can count on receiving God''s help at all times - both in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 162, 8, 30, 'your life and in your witnessing for Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 162, 9, 30, 'Christ must have first place in the way you spend your time and your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 162, 10, 30, 'money, in the books you read, in the music you listen to, in the TV');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 162, 11, 30, 'programs you watch, in the friends you keep company with, in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 162, 12, 30, 'speech, in everything. This is what it means to make Jesus Lord of all.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 162, 13, 30, 'Only then can you say that God has triumphed over you in every area.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 162, 14, 30, 'This is not something that can happen overnight. But make this your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 162, 15, 30, 'long-term goal, and keep working toward it. Then you will draw nearer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 162, 16, 30, 'and nearer to that goal day by day, and year by year.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 162, 17, 30, 'Jesus was the Lamb of God Who bore the sins of the world. We are now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 162, 18, 30, 'called to be "sheep for the slaughter (Rom.8:36), bearing with the sins');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 162, 19, 30, 'that others commit against us. The wood and the fire (the circumstances');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 162, 20, 30, 'of our life) are all ready, as on Mount Moriah. But the question (like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 162, 21, 30, 'Isaac asked his father) is, "Where is the lamb" (Gen.22:7)? The answer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 162, 22, 30, 'is "You are to be the lamb".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 162, 23, 30, 'What the Holy Spirit Seeks to Do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 162, 24, 30, 'John the Baptist said that God had sent him to do four things in order');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 162, 25, 30, 'to prepare the way of the Lord (Lk.3:5): (1) To raise up the valleys;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 162, 26, 30, '(2) To bring down the mountains and hills; (3) To straighten the crooked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 162, 27, 30, 'paths; and (4) To smoothen the rough places.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 162, 28, 30, 'This is what the Holy Spirit seeks to do in our lives too:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 163, 1, 30, '(1) He has to raise up the low-lying areas - the areas where we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 163, 2, 30, 'ruled by earthly things - like sex, money, human honour and reputation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 163, 3, 30, 'etc.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 163, 4, 30, '(2) He has to bring down the mountains of pride, arrogance and conceit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 163, 5, 30, '(due to our abilities), and even the little hills of feelings of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 163, 6, 30, 'superiority (for example, when we do a job well).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 163, 7, 30, '(3) He has to get rid of all the crookedness and guile that there is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 163, 8, 30, 'within us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 163, 9, 30, '(4) He has to soften our hardness, harshness and roughness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 163, 10, 30, 'Then the promise is, that everyone will see the salvation that God has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 163, 11, 30, 'wrought in our lives (Lk.3:6); and every part of our flesh will manifest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 163, 12, 30, 'the glory of God (Compare Isa.40:3-5). Like a prairie fire, God wants');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 163, 13, 30, 'His glory to sweep across our flesh, little by little, area by area,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 163, 14, 30, 'destroying every bit of it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 163, 15, 30, 'Eliminating Dregs from Our Lives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 163, 16, 30, 'In Jeremiah 48:10, it says, " Cursed be the one who does the Lord''s work');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 163, 17, 30, '(the work of making Jesus Lord in every area of our flesh) negligently,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 163, 18, 30, 'and cursed be the one who restrains his sword from blood (that is, one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 163, 19, 30, 'who deals gently (instead of ruthlessly) with the lusts in his flesh)."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 163, 20, 30, 'It goes on to say in the next verse that because Moab has not been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 163, 21, 30, 'emptied from vessel to vessel, his aroma has not changed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 163, 22, 30, 'In an article titled Emptied From Vessel To Vessel, John Follette speaks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 163, 23, 30, 'of various vessels into which God pours us in order to get rid of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 163, 24, 30, 'dregs - vessels of misunderstanding, ridicule, false accusation and dark');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 163, 25, 30, 'trial etc. All these vessels have an amazing way of eliminating the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 163, 26, 30, 'dregs from our lives, if only the wine will remain still ("at rest"), so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 163, 27, 30, 'that the dregs can settle quickly. Once the dregs settle at the bottom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 163, 28, 30, 'of one vessel, God will pour us into another vessel. Thus our aroma gets');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 164, 1, 30, 'sweeter and sweeter. But we must learn to be at rest - never justifying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 164, 2, 30, 'ourselves or defending ourselves. Otherwise, through constant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 164, 3, 30, 'disturbance, the wine will not be free from its dregs. There is a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 164, 4, 30, 'wasted suffering among God''s people, because they justify themselves and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 164, 5, 30, 'don''t just commit their cause to God and leave it with Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 164, 6, 30, 'In Zechariah 2:13, we read that "all flesh must be silent (at rest)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 164, 7, 30, 'before the Lord, since He has come from heaven to dwell in our midst ''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 164, 8, 30, '(see verse 10). This is how it must be within us at all times.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 164, 9, 30, 'Glory Only In the Cross of Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 164, 10, 30, 'I want to encourage you to meditate much on Calvary - and never to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 164, 11, 30, 'ashamed to stand up for Jesus Who was not ashamed to hang almost naked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 164, 12, 30, 'on a cross for you. One thing that will help keep you from backsliding');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 164, 13, 30, 'is making your Christian position known clearly to your fellow-students.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 164, 14, 30, 'Don''t ever bow the knee to Satan by doing what others do around you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 164, 15, 30, 'Stand unbent and upright. The Lord has said, " I brought you out of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 164, 16, 30, 'land of Egypt (the dominion of sin) so that you would not be their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 164, 17, 30, 'slave, and I broke the bars of your yoke so that you might walk erect');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 164, 18, 30, 'and upright " (Lev.26:13).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 164, 19, 30, 'In Philippians 3:17-19, Paul speaks of two categories of believers:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 164, 20, 30, 'First, those like himself who were constantly pressing on to perfection.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 164, 21, 30, 'Paul encouraged others to follow him in the one thing that he did -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 164, 22, 30, 'pressing on to perfection. In most denominations, the preachers say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 164, 23, 30, '(with false humility), "Don''t look at me or follow me. Follow only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 164, 24, 30, 'Christ." That sounds very humble, but it is not Biblical. We have to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 164, 25, 30, 'living examples of what we preach. The second category of believers are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 164, 26, 30, 'called " enemies of the cross of Christ" here. These were believers: (i)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 164, 27, 30, 'whose appetite (their lusts for various things) was their god; and (ii)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 164, 28, 30, 'who gloried in the things that they should have been ashamed of.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 165, 1, 30, 'We should never glory in our skin-colour, beauty, intelligence,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 165, 2, 30, 'capabilities, education, wealth or any other thing in which worldly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 165, 3, 30, 'people also glory. We must glory like Paul did, only in the cross of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 165, 4, 30, 'Christ whereby " the world''s interest in us is dead and so is our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 165, 5, 30, 'interest in the attractive things of this world " (Gal.6:14- Living).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 165, 6, 30, 'When you take a stand for the Lord, many worldly people (and even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 165, 7, 30, 'worldly believers) will consider you to be an odd-ball. But don''t let');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 165, 8, 30, 'that disturb you. Stand up for the Lord before your worldly friends, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 165, 9, 30, 'be unashamed in your witness for Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 165, 10, 30, 'We should be ashamed and mourn before God whenever there is no anointing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 165, 11, 30, 'on our lives, or if we are constantly defeated by sin, or if we don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 165, 12, 30, 'have a hunger after God, and if we cannot challenge others to a godly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 165, 13, 30, 'life by our example. Such mourning is good for us. God takes note of it,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 165, 14, 30, 'and He will answer us by giving us grace and victory speedily.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 165, 15, 30, 'We need not however be ashamed of our human frailties that are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 165, 16, 30, 'related to sin - like sickness, awkward mannerisms, lack of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 165, 17, 30, 'intelligence, ugliness or poverty. God doesn''t choose film-stars and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 165, 18, 30, 'scientists to do his work, but those who have no human attractiveness in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 165, 19, 30, 'the eyes of men.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 165, 20, 30, 'If you want to progress spiritually, you must place value on the things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 165, 21, 30, 'that God places value on, and place no value on the things that God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 165, 22, 30, 'places no value on.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 165, 23, 30, 'It''s a Good Life - God Has Blessed Us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 165, 24, 30, 'Here is a poem that blessed me recently:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 165, 25, 30, '"We''ve faced our share of storms');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 165, 26, 30, 'But days bright with the sun');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 165, 27, 30, 'Outnumber stormy days');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 165, 28, 30, 'At least fifty to one.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 166, 1, 30, 'We''ve walked a few rough paths');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 166, 2, 30, 'But the smooth paths God has sent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 166, 3, 30, 'Outnumber the rough paths');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 166, 4, 30, 'At least three thousand percent,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 166, 5, 30, 'A hundred cups of joy -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 166, 6, 30, 'A half a cup of strife -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 166, 7, 30, 'That''s how God blesses us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 166, 8, 30, 'Through the seasons of life." (Author unknown)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 166, 9, 30, 'Some Important Points to Remember');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 166, 10, 30, 'During our recent conference in Bangalore, we thought about the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 166, 11, 30, 'following matters:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 166, 12, 30, '- The Lord says that we must " be enthusiastic about the things of God"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 166, 13, 30, '(Rev.3:19-Living). God wants us to be always on fire - against sin and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 166, 14, 30, 'for righteousness, and when praising God etc. Lukewarm people are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 166, 15, 30, 'vomited out finally.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 166, 16, 30, '- God looks primarily for faithfulness. We must be faithful: (a) in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 166, 17, 30, 'little things; (b) in the use of money; (c) in acting with consideration');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 166, 18, 30, 'for others (Luke 16:10-12).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 166, 19, 30, '- Envy is a terrible evil, as we see in the cases of Cain, King Saul,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 166, 20, 30, 'the elder son (in the story of the prodigal son) and the Pharisees who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 166, 21, 30, 'were against Jesus because of envy. The words "envy" and "jealous" are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 166, 22, 30, 'words that we should study with the help of a concordance. We must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 166, 23, 30, 'cleanse ourselves totally from this evil.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 166, 24, 30, '- Isaiah 53 is the pathway for us also to walk - for it is only when God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 166, 25, 30, 'crushes us that "God''s program will flourish through us" (Isa.53:10 -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 166, 26, 30, 'Living).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 166, 27, 30, '- We must seek for the power of the Holy Spirit and to be filled with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 166, 28, 30, 'Him continuously, since we cannot live the Christian life without God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 167, 1, 30, 'power.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 167, 2, 30, '- A good conscience enables us to exercise faith against the mountains');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 167, 3, 30, 'that stand in our way. We must not sit back and accept the things that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 167, 4, 30, 'hinder us in our walk with God. We must stand against them and remove');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 167, 5, 30, 'them in Jesus'' Name.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 167, 6, 30, 'We must have discernment in these days as to what is merely human');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 167, 7, 30, 'excitement and what is the moving of the Holy Spirit. God alone can give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 167, 8, 30, 'us this discernment, and we receive more and more of it as we grow up to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 167, 9, 30, 'maturity in our walk with God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 167, 10, 31, 'Chapter 30 Chapter 30');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 167, 11, 31, 'Some Aspects of Prayer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 167, 12, 31, 'Jesus told us that we must keep on praying and never give up - like the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 167, 13, 31, 'widow who kept going to the judge for justice again and again (Luke 18:1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 167, 14, 31, 'ff).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 167, 15, 31, 'Our hearts must be both pure (our vertical relationship with God) and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 167, 16, 31, 'good (our horizontal relationship with others) - if God is to listen to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 167, 17, 31, 'our prayers (that is, if He is to pick up the telephone when we call -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 167, 18, 31, 'for prayer is like a two-way telephone-conversation - Psa.66:18). Then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 167, 19, 31, 'our praise will mingle with the praises of the angels in heaven, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 167, 20, 31, 'ascend to God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 167, 21, 31, 'Seeing Our Own Need : Blind Bartimaeus crying out for sight is a good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 167, 22, 31, 'illustration of how we also should cry out to the Lord to give us the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 167, 23, 31, 'ability to see our own need, in the areas where we don''t have light');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 167, 24, 31, '(Mk.10:47). Jesus is as willing to give us sight as He was to give sight');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 167, 25, 31, 'to Bartimaeus. One of God''s greatest gifts to us is sight - showing us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 167, 26, 31, 'our areas of need. That is one of the main things that we should pray');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 167, 27, 31, 'about. Concentrating on the faults in other people is like rubbing sand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 167, 28, 31, 'in our eyes - that will make us blind.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 168, 1, 31, 'Seeing the Needs of Others : Proverbs 11:24, 25 tells us that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 168, 2, 31, 'generous man will prosper and that the one who waters others will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 168, 3, 31, 'watered by God Himself. When we care for the burdens and needs of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 168, 4, 31, 'others, God will help us mightily. So we must seek to be delivered from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 168, 5, 31, 'a self-centred life where we think only in terms of our own needs. Job');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 168, 6, 31, 'was healed of his sicknesses when he prayed for others (Job 42:10).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 168, 7, 31, 'Abraham had undoubtedly prayed for a child for all the years of his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 168, 8, 31, 'married life. But Sarah was still barren. Then one day Abraham prayed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 168, 9, 31, 'for some other barren women that they might bear children (Gen.20:17,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 168, 10, 31, '18). Then God not only answered Abraham''s prayer for those women, but it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 168, 11, 31, 'says in the very next verse that "then the Lord opened Sarah''s womb" as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 168, 12, 31, 'well (Gen.21:1).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 168, 13, 31, 'We should pray even when we cannot understand the logic behind prayer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 168, 14, 31, 'We are not to lean on our own understanding in the matter of prayer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 168, 15, 31, 'Jesus prayed for Peter and so he came through that difficult time when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 168, 16, 31, 'Satan shook him hard and sifted him. Just imagine what might have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 168, 17, 31, 'happened if Jesus had not prayed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 168, 18, 31, 'Jesus was also humble enough in Gethsemane to ask Peter, James and John');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 168, 19, 31, 'to pray with Him, in His time of pressure. It is pride that prevents us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 168, 20, 31, 'from asking others to pray with us and for us. We don''t have to tell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 168, 21, 31, 'others what pressures we are going through, if we don''t want to - Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 168, 22, 31, 'didn''t. But He still asked for prayer-support, and was disappointed when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 168, 23, 31, 'He didn''t get it from those three disciples.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 168, 24, 31, 'Gentleness and Humility - Taking the Yoke of Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 168, 25, 31, 'Eternal life is to know God as our Father and Jesus Christ as our Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 168, 26, 31, 'Saviour and Forerunner (Jn.17:3). You must develop an intimacy with your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 168, 27, 31, 'heavenly Father and with Jesus, if you are to live a steady Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 168, 28, 31, 'life. That is the greatest safeguard against backsliding. It is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 169, 1, 31, 'enough to hear stirring messages, even if they are anointed words from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 169, 2, 31, 'God. Even the manna that fell from heaven began to breed worms and to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 169, 3, 31, 'stink within 24 hours (Exod.16:20). It is easy to lose the freshness of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 169, 4, 31, 'your Christian life and to become stale in 24 hours!! But when the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 169, 5, 31, 'manna was kept inside the ark (in the most holy place of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 169, 6, 31, 'tabernacle), in the presence of God, it did not breed worms or stink for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 169, 7, 31, 'all the 40 years that the Israelites wandered in the wilderness, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 169, 8, 31, 'even for the hundreds of years thereafter in Canaan (Exod.16:33;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 169, 9, 31, 'Heb.9:4). That is the power of the presence of God to keep everything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 169, 10, 31, 'fresh in our lives. So everything that you hear second-hand about the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 169, 11, 31, 'Lord, from others (in meetings and on tapes) must be taken before the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 169, 12, 31, 'Lord and converted into first-hand knowledge that you get from the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 169, 13, 31, 'through his Word directly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 169, 14, 31, 'In Matthew 11:27-29 Jesus tells us that we cannot know the Father unless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 169, 15, 31, 'Jesus reveals the Father to us. In order to get that revelation, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 169, 16, 31, 'invites us to come to Him and to take His yoke (the cross) upon us and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 169, 17, 31, 'to learn gentleness and humility from Him (read all those 3 verses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 169, 18, 31, 'together). These are the only two things that Jesus asked us to learn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 169, 19, 31, 'from Him. So you must look into the Word to see the glory of Jesus in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 169, 20, 31, 'these areas especially.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 169, 21, 31, '(1) Gentleness. First of all, Jesus'' gentleness is seen in the fact that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 169, 22, 31, 'He always took the side of sinful people against the Pharisees. We see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 169, 23, 31, 'this in the case of the woman caught in adultery (Jn.8:1-12). And also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 169, 24, 31, 'in the case of the sinful woman who anointed His feet in Simon the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 169, 25, 31, 'Pharisee''s house (Lk.7:36-50). As long as Simon did not have a critical');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 169, 26, 31, 'attitude towards that sinful woman, Jesus never said anything. But the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 169, 27, 31, 'moment Jesus saw that Simon despised her, He rebuked him for his lack of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 169, 28, 31, 'courtesy and love for God (Lk.7:40-47). Jesus was very severe on those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 170, 1, 31, 'who were critical of repentant sinners. He always takes the side of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 170, 2, 31, 'repentant sinner against Bible-thumping Pharisees. This is a great');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 170, 3, 31, 'comfort to us to know. We must learn this gentleness from Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 170, 4, 31, 'The second aspect of Jesus'' gentleness is seen in his forgiving attitude');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 170, 5, 31, 'towards those who harmed him. When people called Him the prince of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 170, 6, 31, 'demons, He immediately said that they were forgiven (Mt.12:24, 32). When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 170, 7, 31, 'they ill-treated Him, He never threatened them. He just kept quiet (1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 170, 8, 31, 'Pet.2:23). This is the second aspect of Jesus'' gentleness that we must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 170, 9, 31, 'learn. We must shake off the slightest thought of bitterness, revenge, a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 170, 10, 31, 'grudge, or an unforgiving spirit, like we would immediately shake off a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 170, 11, 31, 'lizard or a cockroach that falls on our hand.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 170, 12, 31, '(2) Humility. The first six verses in Matthew''s gospel show us something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 170, 13, 31, 'of the humility of Jesus in the family-line that He chose to be born');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 170, 14, 31, 'through. Jewish genealogies do not normally mention the names of women.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 170, 15, 31, 'But there arefour women mentioned here - Tamar, Rahab, Ruth and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 170, 16, 31, 'Bathsheba. Tamar was the one who had a child by committing adultery with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 170, 17, 31, 'her father-in-law Judah (Gen.38). Rahab was a well-known prostitute in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 170, 18, 31, 'Jericho (Josh.2). Ruth was a Moabite - a descendant of Moab who was born');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 170, 19, 31, 'through incest - Lot''s daughter making her father commit adultery with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 170, 20, 31, 'her (Gen.19). And Bathsheba was the one who committed adultery with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 170, 21, 31, 'David. Why have the names of these four women (who were all connected in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 170, 22, 31, 'some way with sexual sin) been mentioned in the very first paragraph of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 170, 23, 31, 'the New Testament? In order to show that Jesus came into the world to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 170, 24, 31, 'identify with sinners and to save them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 170, 25, 31, 'Jesus'' humility is seen in the lowly job (of a carpenter) that He took');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 170, 26, 31, 'on earth and in the servant-attitude that He had all through His earthly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 170, 27, 31, 'life. A servant-attitude is one that is constantly on the alert, looking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 170, 28, 31, 'out for the needs of others and that quickly moves in to meet such needs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 171, 1, 31, 'as soon as they are observed (e.g. Jesus washing the disciples'' feet).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 171, 2, 31, 'Andrew Murray''s book on `Humility'' defines humility as: " Being willing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 171, 3, 31, 'to be nothing, so that God might be all in all". This is what Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 171, 4, 31, 'delighted to be. This is what we must learn from Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 171, 5, 31, 'So take the yoke of Jesus always on your neck and learn gentleness and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 171, 6, 31, 'humility from Him. Thus He will be able to reveal the Father more and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 171, 7, 31, 'more to you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 171, 8, 32, 'Chapter 31 Chapter 31');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 171, 9, 32, 'Heart Attitude Determines Divine Nature');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 171, 10, 32, 'We need to constantly remember the word in Romans 12:2 that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 171, 11, 32, 'transformation of our character begins with a change in our way of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 171, 12, 32, 'thinking (the renewal of our minds). God''s thoughts are not like our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 171, 13, 32, 'thoughts - either about people or about circumstances. You must never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 171, 14, 32, 'look at anyone or at any circumstance the way the children of Adam look');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 171, 15, 32, 'at them. You must always ask yourself, " How does God view this person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 171, 16, 32, 'or this situation?" - and then align your thoughts with God''s.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 171, 17, 32, 'You should also not think (like human beings think) that just like it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 171, 18, 32, 'takes 25 years to get a Ph.D. (from the kindergarten), it has to take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 171, 19, 32, 'that many years to partake of the Divine nature as well. Think of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 171, 20, 32, 'young man like Stephen (Acts 6, 7) who in just 4 or 5 years as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 171, 21, 32, 'born-again Christian became so Christlike. Do you think that those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 171, 22, 32, 'have been Christians for 40 years are going to be ahead of him in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 171, 23, 32, 'eternity? No, not necessarily. It is not time that determines whether we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 171, 24, 32, 'partake of the Divine nature - but our heart-attitude. David Brainerd');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 171, 25, 32, '(1718-1747) partook so much of God''s compassion for the American Indians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 171, 26, 32, '(in America), that he did a great work among them before he died at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 171, 27, 32, 'age of 29. He did more for God in 10 years than others have done in 100');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 171, 28, 32, 'years. So you should not wait until you are old before you start serving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 172, 1, 32, 'the Lord. The Devil will tell you that since you are not mature, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 172, 2, 32, 'must wait until you are 50 years old before you start serving the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 172, 3, 32, 'Don''t listen to that liar.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 172, 4, 32, 'The Fire of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 172, 5, 32, 'When Elijah was on top of Carmel, he told the 850 false prophets that "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 172, 6, 32, 'the God Who answers by fire is the true God" (1 Kings 18:24). Fire');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 172, 7, 32, 'speaks of purity. Even heathen people recognize that. The fire is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 172, 8, 32, 'emotional excitement or good singing. When Moses was in the wilderness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 172, 9, 32, 'shepherding Jethro''s sheep, he saw a bush on fire among many other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 172, 10, 32, 'bushes. God dwelt in that bush. This is also the mark of the true church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 172, 11, 32, 'today: It will be aflame with purity. God is a consuming fire. The God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 172, 12, 32, 'Who answers by fire is the true God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 172, 13, 32, 'The fire always falls on the altar where the sacrifice has been placed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 172, 14, 32, 'in totality. This is why we keep preaching crucifixion with Christ in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 172, 15, 32, 'the church - so that God can always send the fire upon us. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 172, 16, 32, 'purified the temple of all who were seeking their own (their own honour');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 172, 17, 32, 'and their own financial gain). This is what He does today as well. As');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 172, 18, 32, 'they sold doves in the temple in that day, today preachers are selling "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 172, 19, 32, 'counterfeit gifts of the Spirit" in healing meetings, where they collect');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 172, 20, 32, 'money from poor people in the Name of the Lord. One day, Jesus will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 172, 21, 32, 'drive out all these preachers who made money and sought honour for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 172, 22, 32, 'themselves through exercising God''s gifts.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 172, 23, 32, 'God has a plan and a pattern for building the church. If we are willing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 172, 24, 32, 'to acknowledge that what we are building is not according to that plan,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 172, 25, 32, 'and if we tremble at God''s Word, and are humble and broken in spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 172, 26, 32, '(Isa.66:1,2), then the Lord will look at us and help us to build His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 172, 27, 32, 'church aright.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 172, 28, 32, 'In Ezekiel chapters 40 to 48 we see a plan given for the temple of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 173, 1, 32, 'Lord. This is a picture of building the church. The servants of the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 173, 2, 32, 'are described there ("the sons of Zadok" - Ezek.44:15-27) as those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 173, 3, 32, 'minister to the Lord Himself (and not to the people). The rivers of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 173, 4, 32, 'living water (that Jesus spoke of in John 7:37-39) are mentioned here in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 173, 5, 32, 'Ezekiel 47, flowing out from such a church. God tells Ezekiel to show');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 173, 6, 32, 'His plan only to those who are ashamed of the way they have been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 173, 7, 32, 'building their churches, outside of God''s plan (Ezek.43:10,11). The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 173, 8, 32, 'fundamental law of God''s house is mentioned here as holiness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 173, 9, 32, '(Ezek.43:12).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 173, 10, 32, 'That which is soulish, human and Pharisaical can look very similar to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 173, 11, 32, 'what is spiritual, Divine and Christlike. In Ezekiel 43:8, God says that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 173, 12, 32, 'the counterfeit temple is built right next-door to His true temple - so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 173, 13, 32, 'that undiscerning people will be confused as to which door to enter by.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 173, 14, 32, 'This is why you must distinguish between what is merely intellectual and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 173, 15, 32, 'emotional fervour and the fire that is truly from the Holy Spirit. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 173, 16, 32, 'must distinguish between Pharisaical righteousness and Christlike');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 173, 17, 32, 'righteousness. You must distinguish between what is merely human');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 173, 18, 32, 'goodness and what is the result of a person having partaken of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 173, 19, 32, 'Divine nature.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 173, 20, 32, 'Divine Love and Human Love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 173, 21, 32, 'One distinguishing mark of God''s love is expressed in Luke 6:35 as "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 173, 22, 32, 'expecting nothing in return". Human love always expects respect, love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 173, 23, 32, 'and gifts in return. But Divine love expects nothing. It has no inward');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 173, 24, 32, 'demands on those it loves. God makes the sun to rise equally on the good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 173, 25, 32, 'and the evil, and is kind and merciful to the evil and the ungrateful.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 173, 26, 32, 'Only if we live in this Divine love can we be saved from all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 173, 27, 32, 'Phariseeism.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 173, 28, 32, 'Pharisees and cultists cannot love those who are not one with them in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 174, 1, 32, 'every way. This proves that their love is human and not Divine. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 174, 2, 32, 'the root cause of their hardness and arrogance. Jesus said, " If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 174, 3, 32, 'love and do good only to those who love you, you are no better than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 174, 4, 32, 'sinners ". Even the Communists love one another. The race of Adam just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 174, 5, 32, 'does not know how to love, expecting nothing in return.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 174, 6, 32, 'Your "expectation must be from God alone" (Psa.62:5). Then you will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 174, 7, 32, 'never be disappointed. All bad moods, discouragement and murmuring are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 174, 8, 32, 'the result of expecting consideration, respect or gifts etc., from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 174, 9, 32, 'others. Your life will become glorious once you stop expecting others');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 174, 10, 32, 'around you to change, or behave better, or to be considerate toward you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 174, 11, 32, 'A Narrow Gate into a Large Kingdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 174, 12, 32, 'Jesus said that it was as difficult to enter God''s kingdom as it was for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 174, 13, 32, 'a camel to go through a needle''s eye. However, what is impossible for a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 174, 14, 32, 'camel is the easiest thing in the world for an amoeba. It is all a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 174, 15, 32, 'question of size. The smaller we are (in our own eyes), the easier it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 174, 16, 32, 'for us to get "an abundant entrance into God''s kingdom" (2 Pet.1:11).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 174, 17, 32, 'The kingdom of God is very, very large. But the gate into it is as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 174, 18, 32, 'narrow as a needle''s eye. To be proud and self-sufficient in ourselves,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 174, 19, 32, 'because of our gifts, talents, abilities, Bible-knowledge, or service');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 174, 20, 32, 'for the Lord or our supposed "spirituality", etc., is what makes us big.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 174, 21, 32, 'All of you boys are good-looking, intelligent, gifted and accomplished,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 174, 22, 32, 'as well as knowledgeable in the Scriptures and spiritually-minded. My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 174, 23, 32, 'prayer is that you will never become big in your own eyes because of all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 174, 24, 32, 'that. Always remain small in your own eyes, and never despise any human');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 174, 25, 32, 'being - whatever his denomination, his religion, or his lack of light');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 174, 26, 32, 'may be. And when you see the worst of human beings, say to yourself: "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 174, 27, 32, 'There go I but for the grace of God".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 174, 28, 32, 'Jesus always referred to himself as "the son of man" - or in other words');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 175, 1, 32, '"an ordinary man". This is what you must be too, towards everyone, at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 175, 2, 32, 'all times - an ordinary man. Never allow yourself to be puffed up, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 175, 3, 32, 'never ever meditate on your own abilities or accomplishments. Always be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 175, 4, 32, 'thankful to God for His mercy that has made you what you are.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 175, 5, 32, 'Acknowledging Salvation as the Work of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 175, 6, 32, 'Jesus said that it was impossible for man to save himself. Only God can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 175, 7, 32, 'give us salvation - from the penalty of sin (past), the power of sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 175, 8, 32, '(present), and the presence of sin (future). (See Mark 10:26, 27). Jonah');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 175, 9, 32, 'was delivered from the fish''s belly when he finally acknowledged "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 175, 10, 32, 'Salvation (deliverance) can come only from the Lord" (Jonah 2:9). The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 175, 11, 32, 'next verse states, "Then the Lord commanded the fish to vomit Jonah out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 175, 12, 32, 'on dry land".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 175, 13, 32, 'Salvation is not a self-improvement program. That will only change you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 175, 14, 32, 'on the outside. But the work of God changes you on the inside. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 175, 15, 32, 'Romans, you can see the development of the gospel message chapter by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 175, 16, 32, 'chapter:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 175, 17, 32, 'Ch.1 to 3 - The guilt of man made plain.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 175, 18, 32, 'Ch.4 - Justified (declared righteous by God) by faith.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 175, 19, 32, 'Ch.5 - Freedom of access to God now through Christ''s blood.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 175, 20, 32, 'Ch.6 - Our old man crucified with Christ. So no need to be a slave to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 175, 21, 32, 'sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 175, 22, 32, 'Ch.7 - Free from the Law and from legalistic attitudes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 175, 23, 32, 'Ch.8 - Live in the Spirit now, putting the lusts of the flesh to death');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 175, 24, 32, 'daily.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 175, 25, 32, 'Then the conclusion of such a life is that " we are more than conquerors');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 175, 26, 32, 'in Christ" (Rom.8:37). But the danger now is that you can begin to think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 175, 27, 32, 'that you achieved all this yourself - and become proud. So we move to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 175, 28, 32, 'Chapters 9 to 11.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 176, 1, 32, 'Ch.9 - God''s sovereignty. He chose only one of Abraham''s many children');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 176, 2, 32, '(Isaac). He chose only one of Isaac''s two boys (Jacob). And God chose');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 176, 3, 32, 'Jacob even before the twins were born, " before either of them had done');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 176, 4, 32, 'anything good or bad" (Rom.9:11). Thus God chose you, " not because you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 176, 5, 32, 'ran or determined, but only because of His mercy" (Rom.9:16). This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 176, 6, 32, 'something that you must never forget.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 176, 7, 32, 'Ch.10 - God''s righteousness. Your own righteousness is like filthy rags');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 176, 8, 32, 'in God''s eyes (Isa.64:6). God wants to make you righteous inside, within');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 176, 9, 32, 'your heart. Israel never attained to this righteousness, because " they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 176, 10, 32, 'sought to establish their own righteousness" (Rom.10:3)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 176, 11, 32, 'Ch.11 - God''s faithfulness. Even though Israel failed, God was faithful.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 176, 12, 32, 'God''s Word has promises as well as warnings - and He is faithful to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 176, 13, 32, 'fulfil both.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 176, 14, 32, 'Ch.12:1, 2 - What shall we say then? In view of God''s mercies, you must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 176, 15, 32, 'present your body and your mind entirely to Him to fulfil His perfect');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 176, 16, 32, 'will.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 176, 17, 32, 'You are to give your all to God not because He threatens you with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 176, 18, 32, 'hellfire, but because He has been so merciful to you:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 176, 19, 32, '- forgiving all your past sins, including those you committed after you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 176, 20, 32, 'were baptized;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 176, 21, 32, '- not remembering your past against you;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 176, 22, 32, '- covering your nakedness and your failures from the eyes of others;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 176, 23, 32, '- blessing you again and again when you did not deserve it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 176, 24, 32, 'How can you ever take advantage of such a God? The man who buried his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 176, 25, 32, 'one talent did so because He thought his master was " a hard and austere');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 176, 26, 32, 'man". Those who think that God is hard and austere will make their own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 176, 27, 32, 'lives miserable and will bury their lives and waste them. Thank God that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 176, 28, 32, 'you all have seen that God is a good God Who desires to give you the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 177, 1, 32, 'very best in every area.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 177, 2, 32, 'Ch.13 - Submission to God-appointed authorities is one of the marks of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 177, 3, 32, 'God-fearing people who have submitted to the gospel.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 177, 4, 32, 'Ch.14, 15 - You must receive other believers (even those in other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 177, 5, 32, 'groups), irrespective of your difference of opinion with them, just as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 177, 6, 32, 'Christ received you. Pharisees and arrogant Christians are exposed by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 177, 7, 32, 'Romans 14 and 15, which has no place in their teaching. You may not be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 177, 8, 32, 'able to work together with many believers. But you must receive all of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 177, 9, 32, 'them, just as Christ received you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 177, 10, 32, 'Ch.16 - The gospel message finally ends with verse 20 here which says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 177, 11, 32, 'that Satan will be crushed under our feet.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 177, 12, 32, 'If you allow the Holy Spirit to take you all the way through to Romans');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 177, 13, 32, '16:20, you will indeed be blessed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 177, 14, 33, 'Chapter 32 Chapter 32');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 177, 15, 33, 'God''s Blessings are Not Merited');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 177, 16, 33, 'Many of the parables that Jesus spoke and many of the incidents of His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 177, 17, 33, 'life described in the gospels, are meant to teach us one truth: That God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 177, 18, 33, 'gives us what we do not deserve to get. His blessings are not based on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 177, 19, 33, 'our merit. Unless we understand this clearly, we will not have faith to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 177, 20, 33, 'ask Him in the Name of Jesus, to bless us - because we may feel that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 177, 21, 33, 'are unworthy to get something from the Lord - especially on some day');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 177, 22, 33, 'when we did not read the Bible or fell into some sin! Here are some of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 177, 23, 33, 'examples:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 177, 24, 33, '- The prodigal son was blessed beyond what he deserved when he came back');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 177, 25, 33, '(Lk15).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 177, 26, 33, '- The beggars who were invited in from the streets to attend the king''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 177, 27, 33, 'son''s wedding were each given a free wedding suit and were blessed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 177, 28, 33, 'beyond what they deserved (Mt.22).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 178, 1, 33, '- The labourers who came to work last were paid first (Mt.20).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 178, 2, 33, '- The dying thief (who had lived continually in gross sin) and Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 178, 3, 33, '(Who had never sinned) entered paradise on the same day.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 178, 4, 33, '- Mary Magdalene (an ex-demoniac and probably an ex-prostitute) was the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 178, 5, 33, 'first to be given the privilege to see the risen Lord (Jn.20).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 178, 6, 33, '- " The Lord is merciful and tender toward those who don''t deserve it"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 178, 7, 33, '(Psa.103:8-Living).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 178, 8, 33, 'Work Out Your Salvation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 178, 9, 33, 'In James 1:19-25, we read that we must be " quick to hear, slow to speak');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 178, 10, 33, 'and slow to get angry" in our dealings with everyone (v.19) - because we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 178, 11, 33, 'can never achieve God''s righteousness through our anger (v.20). Beware');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 178, 12, 33, 'of the " outgrowth of evil", just like grass growing between cracks in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 178, 13, 33, 'concrete pavement (v.21). We must ensure that the roots of wrong');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 178, 14, 33, 'attitudes are pulled out. Then there will be no outgrowth of evil.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 178, 15, 33, 'After listening to the Word, we can become either forgetful hearers or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 178, 16, 33, 'active workers (working out our own salvation) (v.25). It is easy to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 178, 17, 33, 'quickly forget something that God showed us in the mirror of His Word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 178, 18, 33, '(through what we read or heard). We must preserve what God speaks to us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 178, 19, 33, 'carefully in our hearts and work on it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 178, 20, 33, 'In 1 Corinthians 13, we read some things that we must read and meditate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 178, 21, 33, 'on again and again, if we are to save ourselves from being deceived. All');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 178, 22, 33, 'our knowledge, zeal, sacrifice and gifts get us zero in God''s eyes, if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 178, 23, 33, 'we don''t have the type of love described in this chapter. We must look');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 178, 24, 33, 'at this mirror and see ourselves, and work on where we lack, until our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 178, 25, 33, 'love is perfect - without partiality, and full of goodness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 178, 26, 33, 'Power of Christ''s Blood');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 178, 27, 33, 'We must be bold in going before God, assured of our being accepted by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 178, 28, 33, 'Him, glorifying the power of Christ''s Blood to declare us righteous even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 179, 1, 33, 'in the presence of a Holy God, overcoming the accusations of the Accuser');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 179, 2, 33, 'of the brothers (Rev.12:10,11).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 179, 3, 33, 'Such is the power of Christ''s blood that on the day that Jesus died, two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 179, 4, 33, 'men walked into paradise - one who had never sinned even once in 33');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 179, 5, 33, 'years (Jesus), and another who had sinned all his life, right until his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 179, 6, 33, 'last moment on earth (the repentant thief). And both walked hand in hand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 179, 7, 33, 'in paradise as righteous men. This is the gospel. Many who hear this may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 179, 8, 33, 'take advantage of God''s grace. Let them do so. They will destroy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 179, 9, 33, 'themselves thereby. But for us who are sincere, such a message makes us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 179, 10, 33, 'want to dedicate our lives even more to such a forgiving and gracious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 179, 11, 33, 'Lord, that we never want to sin even once any more. " The kindness of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 179, 12, 33, 'God leads us to repentance" (Rom.2:4). We must trust God to do miracles');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 179, 13, 33, 'in our lives, and not limit Him by our unbelief, or by any sense of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 179, 14, 33, 'own unworthiness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 179, 15, 33, 'I feel sorry when I meet believers who are quick to criticize others who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 179, 16, 33, 'are not in their group. Such believers have obviously forgotten their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 179, 17, 33, 'purification from their own former sins. The Lord showed me that if in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 179, 18, 33, 'John 8, they had begun to throw stones at the woman, Jesus would have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 179, 19, 33, 'stood in front of her and received the stones Himself, saying, "Kill Me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 179, 20, 33, 'first". That is what He did at Calvary. To stone another child of God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 179, 21, 33, 'to stone Jesus Himself. Avoid it at all times.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 179, 22, 33, 'Forgetting That Which is Behind');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 179, 23, 33, 'Every day of our life we must do as Paul did: " Forgetting the things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 179, 24, 33, 'that are behind (that is, everything right up until the previous day),');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 179, 25, 33, 'and reaching forth unto the things that are ahead, I press toward the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 179, 26, 33, 'mark for the prize of the high calling of God in Christ Jesus "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 179, 27, 33, '(Phil.3:13,14). That means you must forget all your achievements and all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 179, 28, 33, 'your failures right up until that day. Then you must think only of one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 180, 1, 33, 'thing: How much more you have to grow in order to become like Jesus.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 180, 2, 33, 'Paul says that, that is the mark of a mature Christian (Phil.3:15).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 180, 3, 33, 'May the new year be such a blessed year for all of you that the Devil is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 180, 4, 33, 'put to shame. It may be a year of reproach or ostracism from others. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 180, 5, 33, 'it should be a year of closer fellowship with the Lord, where you live');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 180, 6, 33, 'in the fear of the Lord each day, and where you forgive all those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 180, 7, 33, 'harm you, and bless them in return. May it also be a year in which you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 180, 8, 33, 'walk in wisdom in all your dealings with others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 180, 9, 33, 'I mention reproach and ostracism, because that is going to be more and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 180, 10, 33, 'more our portion, as we approach the end of time. Jesus said, " If they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 180, 11, 33, 'have called the Master of the house Beelzebub, how much more the members');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 180, 12, 33, 'of His household " (Matt.10:25). The habit of calling believers (who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 180, 13, 33, 'not in their group) by all types of evil names is found in every group');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 180, 14, 33, 'in Christianity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 180, 15, 33, 'I want you, my sons, to know that I am proud of you - every bit. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 180, 16, 33, 'have faced a lot of pressure and opposition from Christians who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 180, 17, 33, 'criticize me (because of my stand for the Lord) - because you are my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 180, 18, 33, 'sons. But God has given you grace to overcome that pressure and to love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 180, 19, 33, 'those who hate me and hate you. I praise the Lord for that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 180, 20, 33, 'I look at all of you in the same way that God looks at you - "justified');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 180, 21, 33, 'in Christ - just as if you had never sinned in your whole lives" - which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 180, 22, 33, 'is the way I seek to look at all sincere, wholehearted believers. Just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 180, 23, 33, 'as we rejoice in our own acceptance by our Father, we must rejoice over');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 180, 24, 33, 'other believers too whom our Father has accepted.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 180, 25, 33, 'Only Jesus would walk hand in hand in Paradise with a murderer who had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 180, 26, 33, 'sinned all his life right until his crucifixion!! That is grace. Where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 180, 27, 33, 'man''s sin abounded, God''s grace abounded all the more.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 180, 28, 33, 'Justification');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 181, 1, 33, 'Recently, we got a wall-text printed for everyone in CFC that reads:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 181, 2, 33, '"Lord, point out anything You find in me that makes You sad" - (Psalm');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 181, 3, 33, '139:24-Living)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 181, 4, 33, 'That prayer is not referring to the past, but to the present. Our past');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 181, 5, 33, 'has been forgiven and blotted out by our Lord - even if Satan and evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 181, 6, 33, 'men don''t forget it. Now, we are to deal only with the present. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 181, 7, 33, 'Lord''s Name is "I AM" (Exod.3:14) - not "I was"! So the Lord deals with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 181, 8, 33, 'us only in relation to the present - and never in relation to our past.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 181, 9, 33, 'We must be grounded firmly on the truth that we have been justified');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 181, 10, 33, '(just as if I''d never sinned) by the blood of Christ (Rom.5:9). We have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 181, 11, 33, 'been declared righteous by God - not just acquitted! Think of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 181, 12, 33, 'difference between the two. To be acquitted means that even though God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 181, 13, 33, 'declares us to be criminals, He declares us forgiven. That by itself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 181, 14, 33, 'would have been good news. But to be justified means that God declares');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 181, 15, 33, 'that we are not criminals at all, but righteous and pure and holy as He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 181, 16, 33, 'is. This is what it means to be clothed with Christ''s righteousness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 181, 17, 33, 'Many are afraid to preach this, because it can be taken advantage of by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 181, 18, 33, 'insincere believers as license to sin. But, as a result many sincere');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 181, 19, 33, 'believers have been deprived of this good news. If we are not rooted in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 181, 20, 33, 'the truth of our being justified, we will never make progress in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 181, 21, 33, 'Christian life. We will always be "weary and heavy-laden".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 181, 22, 33, 'Think of Peter''s example. Just seven weeks after Peter himself had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 181, 23, 33, 'denied the Lord so badly, and that too thrice, he could stand up and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 181, 24, 33, 'tell others twice, "YOU denied Jesus....YOU denied Jesus" (Acts 3:13 and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 181, 25, 33, '14 - KJV). What boldness to preach against the very sin that he himself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 181, 26, 33, 'had committed less than two months earlier! Yes, Peter knew what it was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 181, 27, 33, 'to put the past behind him and to be "just-as-if-he''d never sinned",');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 181, 28, 33, 'because he believed in the power of Christ''s blood. He did not believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 182, 1, 33, 'that his sin was greater than God''s grace. He believed that " where sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 182, 2, 33, 'increased, grace abounded even more" (Rom.5:20). This is the message');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 182, 3, 33, 'with which we are to start the new year.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 182, 4, 33, 'Transitioning to a New Year - Settle All Accounts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 182, 5, 33, 'James 4:14, 15 tells us that we cannot predict what will happen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 182, 6, 33, 'tomorrow, whether we will even live. So we should be thankful for all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 182, 7, 33, 'the days that the Lord enabled us to live during the year that is over.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 182, 8, 33, 'Now in the new year, we are to live one day at a time. If we are to make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 182, 9, 33, 'progress this year, beyond what we have done last year, then we must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 182, 10, 33, 'liveeach day, obeying the exhortation: " Live in the fear of the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 182, 11, 33, 'the whole day long" (Prov.23:17). That is the only way to make progress.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 182, 12, 33, 'We are not to be anxious about even tomorrow, even though we may make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 182, 13, 33, 'plans for the whole year or more.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 182, 14, 33, 'We must close all our accounts with the Lord and with man before the end');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 182, 15, 33, 'of the year. We must make sure that we ourselves owe no-one anything and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 182, 16, 33, 'that we have made all necessary restitution. And also that we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 182, 17, 33, 'forgiven all who have done us any harm.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 182, 18, 33, 'Paul''s letter to Philemon has a beautiful message in it. There Paul');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 182, 19, 33, 'pleads for Onesimus before Philemon. He says that whatever Onesimus had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 182, 20, 33, 'stolen from Philemon, Paul would repay himself. " Charge that to my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 182, 21, 33, 'account. I will repay it myself", Paul says (v.18). That is what the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 182, 22, 33, 'Lord says to us too: " If any of the brothers or sisters in My Body have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 182, 23, 33, 'done you some harm and thus owe you something, charge that to My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 182, 24, 33, 'account. I will repay you Myself ." So we should release every single');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 182, 25, 33, 'one who has done us any harm. Don''t "carry forward" anything into the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 182, 26, 33, 'new year.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 182, 27, 33, 'We can serve the Lord and obey His commandments either through (1) the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 182, 28, 33, 'power of threats of judgment; or (2) the power of gratitude for what God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 183, 1, 33, 'has done for us. Under the old covenant it was the former. Under the new');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 183, 2, 33, 'covenant it is to be the latter. For example, we must forgive others not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 183, 3, 33, 'because otherwise God will punish us by not forgiving us. No. We must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 183, 4, 33, 'forgive them because God has forgiven us so much and so freely.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 183, 5, 33, 'It says about Hezekiah that " he did not render in return according to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 183, 6, 33, 'the benefit he had received " (2 Chron.32:25). It is good for us to ask');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 183, 7, 33, 'ourselves whether we have rendered to the Lord according to the benefit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 183, 8, 33, 'that we have received from Him through the years.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 183, 9, 33, 'Whereas the Israelites had Sabbath-days only once a week, we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 183, 10, 33, 'Sabbath days every day. Whereas they had a year of jubilee only once');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 183, 11, 33, 'every fifty years (after seven Sabbaths of years - 7x7 years -Leviticus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 183, 12, 33, '25), we have every year as a year of jubilee! In the year of jubilee God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 183, 13, 33, 'had ordained that every debt must be forgiven and every slave released.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 183, 14, 33, 'The Living Bible says, "What a happy year it will be!" (Lev.25:11) - for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 183, 15, 33, 'that is the meaning of jubilee (happiness). This is how the new year');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 183, 16, 33, 'must be for you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 183, 17, 34, 'Chapter 33 Chapter 33');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 183, 18, 34, 'Humility and Faith');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 183, 19, 34, 'God will be able to back you mightily, if you remain in humility always.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 183, 20, 34, 'A humble man will not bring to mind the evil that others have done to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 183, 21, 34, 'him, but will always remember the good that others have done for him. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 183, 22, 34, 'will also not bring to mind the good that he has done for others; A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 183, 23, 34, 'humble man is one who never glories in his human abilities or his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 183, 24, 34, 'earthly qualifications or accomplishments and who never makes anyone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 183, 25, 34, 'else feel small.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 183, 26, 34, 'God can back you only if you have faith. You must believe that God will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 183, 27, 34, 'give you what you do not deserve. That is faith. None of us would ever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 183, 28, 34, 'have thought of giving the privilege of being the first person to see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 184, 1, 34, 'the risen Lord to an ex-demon-possessed Mary Magdalene. Only God would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 184, 2, 34, 'think of something like that. To believe that God will give you only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 184, 3, 34, 'what you deserve because you have been faithful is to limit God. God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 184, 4, 34, 'a good God. That doesn''t make us take advantage of Him. No. On the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 184, 5, 34, 'contrary it makes us serve Him even more.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 184, 6, 34, 'Faith will strengthen you to command even mountains that stand in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 184, 7, 34, 'way to move aside. Your motto for the new year should be " I can do all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 184, 8, 34, 'things through Christ Who strengthens me" (Phil.4:13).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 184, 9, 34, 'God Has a Plan for Every Believer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 184, 10, 34, 'You must never forget in the midst of all your work and your studies');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 184, 11, 34, 'that the Lord is also training you through all that you go through for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 184, 12, 34, 'future service in His vineyard somewhere. This is one of the greatest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 184, 13, 34, 'realizations that a young person of your age needs to have. I was about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 184, 14, 34, 'your age, when I realized that God had a plan for my life, and that, in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 184, 15, 34, 'spite of my failures and backsliding prior to that time (even after I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 184, 16, 34, 'was born again), God could yet make something out of my life. Now when I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 184, 17, 34, 'look back, so many years after that time, I am thankful for all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 184, 18, 34, 'training that He gave me - even through my failures and mistakes. One of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 184, 19, 34, 'the greatest things that I learnt through my own failures was never to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 184, 20, 34, 'look down on any sinner in the world. It is impossible for me now to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 184, 21, 34, 'despise a sinner or a backslider. I thank God for that work of grace');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 184, 22, 34, 'that He has done in me.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 184, 23, 34, 'Since God has a ministry for you in the days to come, prepare yourself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 184, 24, 34, 'for it, by always remaining humble, never justifying yourself in any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 184, 25, 34, 'situation, crying out to God for help constantly, and hating all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 184, 26, 34, 'artificiality in your life. Let Psalm 73:25 be your constant testimony -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 184, 27, 34, 'a total devotion to Jesus Himself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 184, 28, 34, 'You must also learn from Jesus Who at the age of 12 said, " I must be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 185, 1, 34, 'about My Father''s business" (Lk.2:49). He had a sense of responsibility');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 185, 2, 34, 'towards God''s work, and put that first always. If he could do that at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 185, 3, 34, 'age 12, how much more you should be doing it at our age - putting God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 185, 4, 34, 'kingdom and His righteousness first, not necessarily in terms of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 185, 5, 34, 'time you spend reading the Bible or in prayer or at meetings, but in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 185, 6, 34, 'your attitude towards sin and earthly things.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 185, 7, 34, 'May the Lord give you grace for your heavy academic and work schedule.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 185, 8, 34, 'Pray and expect God to help you supernaturally when you are stuck');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 185, 9, 34, 'somewhere in the midst of your computer-programming, etc. Those are the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 185, 10, 34, 'times when you can prove that your God is a Living God Who is interested');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 185, 11, 34, 'in every detail of your life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 185, 12, 34, 'Sanctification - A Lifelong Process');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 185, 13, 34, 'Phariseeism and spiritual pride lie very close at hand to all who pursue');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 185, 14, 34, 'righteousness. So these twin evils are not the prerogatives of any one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 185, 15, 34, 'group. These evils are not far from any of us. I find that it is easy to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 185, 16, 34, 'see these evils in others, but far more difficult to see them in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 185, 17, 34, 'ourselves. Artificiality is one of the things that religiously minded');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 185, 18, 34, 'young people tend towards easily, and it kills spirituality.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 185, 19, 34, 'You must work towards entering into a "perfect" death to sin in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 185, 20, 34, 'different areas that you are battling in. You must not be happy with a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 185, 21, 34, 'superficial victory. Every desire is like an onion. There are layers and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 185, 22, 34, 'layers underneath the top one that you can see right now. Unless you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 185, 23, 34, 'deal radically with the layer that you see, you will never get to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 185, 24, 34, 'layer underneath. Sanctification is a lifelong process of becoming like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 185, 25, 34, 'Jesus - for example, looking at girls the way He looked at them, looking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 185, 26, 34, 'at money and material things the way He looked at them, looking at your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 185, 27, 34, 'enemies the way He looked at His enemies, etc. That is a goal that will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 185, 28, 34, 'take a lifetime to reach. But you must work towards it. This is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 186, 1, 34, 'meaning of verses like "Let us press on to perfection" (Heb.6:1), and "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 186, 2, 34, 'He who has the hope of becoming like Jesus, will purify himself even as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 186, 3, 34, 'He is pure " (1 Jn.3:3), and " Forgetting the things that are behind, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 186, 4, 34, 'press towards the mark for the prize of the high calling of God in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 186, 5, 34, 'Christ Jesus " (Phil.3:13, 14). If you give up, in this battle, then the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 186, 6, 34, 'enemy will get the upper hand. On the other hand, if you keep on "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 186, 7, 34, 'suffering in the flesh" (putting your Self-life to death) in secret, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 186, 8, 34, 'will stop sinning, as 1 Peter 4:1,2 says.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 186, 9, 34, 'Never imagine that that you are being tempted in ways that others are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 186, 10, 34, 'not being tempted. Don''t let the devil fool you with that lie, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 186, 11, 34, 'that will discourage you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 186, 12, 34, '1 Corinthians 10:13 says: "Every temptation that you experience is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 186, 13, 34, 'kind that normally comes to all people. But God keeps His promise, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 186, 14, 34, 'He will not allow you to be tempted beyond your power to overcome; but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 186, 15, 34, 'at the time you are tempted, He will give you the strength (grace) to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 186, 16, 34, 'overcome and thus help you to escape. No temptation is irresistible."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 186, 17, 34, '(Good News Bible and Living Bible).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 186, 18, 34, 'All human beings are basically tempted in the same way - to do their own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 186, 19, 34, 'will. Sin is a large circle with many different sectors. But EVERY');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 186, 20, 34, 'temptation is basically the same - to do one''s own will and not the will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 186, 21, 34, 'of God - whether it be telling a lie, getting angry, hating someone,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 186, 22, 34, 'murmuring, committing fornication, or any other sin. Jesus also was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 186, 23, 34, 'tempted to do His own will. But He resisted that temptation asking for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 186, 24, 34, 'God''s help (Hebrews 5:7) and so He never sinned (John 6:38). We can all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 186, 25, 34, 'now follow His example.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 186, 26, 34, 'So don''t look at the different sins as separate matters that are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 186, 27, 34, 'independent of each other. Some people are more tempted in one area and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 186, 28, 34, 'others in another. But in every case, to sin is to do one''s own will.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 187, 1, 34, 'Ask God to help you - and the Holy Spirit will help you to put your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 187, 2, 34, 'flesh (Self-will) to death (See Rom.8:13 and Gal.5:24).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 187, 3, 34, 'A fervent devotion to Jesus is what will help you to overcome and to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 187, 4, 34, 'preserved along the right track at all times. At all times you should be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 187, 5, 34, 'able to say, " There is nothing (and no-one) that I desire on earth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 187, 6, 34, 'beside you" (Psa.73:25). Love for Jesus has the power to expel other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 187, 7, 34, 'loves (and lusts) from your heart. You should say, " I have set the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 187, 8, 34, 'always before me (so that I fear to sin - like Joseph said); and He is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 187, 9, 34, 'always at my right hand (to give me grace not to sin)" (Psa.16:8). That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 187, 10, 34, 'is the secret of living in constant victory.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 187, 11, 34, 'Taking a Stand for God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 187, 12, 34, 'God is always looking for at least one man in a place, to take a stand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 187, 13, 34, 'for Him (as we read in Ezekiel 22:30). He found an Enoch at one time,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 187, 14, 34, 'then a Noah, then an Abraham, and later on an Elijah and a John the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 187, 15, 34, 'Baptist etc.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 187, 16, 34, 'In Babylon, he found a Daniel. Although the Bible mentions Daniel''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 187, 17, 34, 'three friends Hananiah, Mishael and Azariah (who were later renamed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 187, 18, 34, 'Shadrach, Meshach and Abednego) in Daniel 1:7, yet it says in Dan.1:8');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 187, 19, 34, 'that it was Daniel alone " who determined in his heart that he would not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 187, 20, 34, 'defile himself". It was only then that the other three also had the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 187, 21, 34, 'courage to take a stand. There are many Hananiahs, Mishaels and Azariahs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 187, 22, 34, 'among believers in many places in the world, who do not have the courage');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 187, 23, 34, 'to take a stand for the Lord on their own, but who will take a stand, if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 187, 24, 34, 'a Daniel arises in their midst and takes a stand for the Lord. So');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 187, 25, 34, 'determine to be a ''Daniel'' for the Lord, wherever you are.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 187, 26, 34, 'We see something similar - but evil - on the opposite side as well.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 187, 27, 34, 'There were many angels in heaven initially who probably had some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 187, 28, 34, 'simmering discontent within them about something or the other. But they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 188, 1, 34, 'did not have the courage to start a rebellion until a Lucifer arose in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 188, 2, 34, 'their midst. When Lucifer (the head of the angels) expressed his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 188, 3, 34, 'rebellion, immediately one-third of the angels joined him (Rev.12:4).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 188, 4, 34, 'Those millions of angels were all cast out by God along with Lucifer -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 188, 5, 34, 'and they are the demons who possess people today. It is an eternal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 188, 6, 34, 'principle with God that he " removes the proud, exulting ones and leaves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 188, 7, 34, 'behind a humble, lowly people everywhere " (Zeph.3:11, 12). This was how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 188, 8, 34, 'He cleansed the heavens long ages ago - and this is how He cleanses the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 188, 9, 34, 'church today as well..');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 188, 10, 34, 'There are two movements going on simultaneously in the world now: The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 188, 11, 34, 'Daniels are gathering the twos and the threes to take a stand for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 188, 12, 34, 'Lord; and the Lucifers are gathering their millions to lead people to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 188, 13, 34, 'impurity, to rebellion against authority and to disobedience to God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 188, 14, 34, 'commandments. But it is the two or three with the Daniels who will win');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 188, 15, 34, 'finally - because even one person with God is always a majority. If God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 188, 16, 34, 'does not get a Daniel in a locality, then the Devil will get someone to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 188, 17, 34, 'lead the people in his way. So it is essential that you become a Daniel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 188, 18, 34, 'in your place for God - one who begins by determining in your heart that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 188, 19, 34, 'you will not defile yourself by disobeying even the smallest of God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 188, 20, 34, 'commandments, and that you will take a stand for Him, even if you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 188, 21, 34, 'cast into a lion''s den.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 188, 22, 34, 'We pray that the Lord will give you grace and strength and wisdom. Here');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 188, 23, 34, 'is a slight modification of a prayer that you may have seen: " Lord give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 188, 24, 34, 'me the courage to say NO to the things that you want me to refuse; the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 188, 25, 34, 'strength to DO the things that you want me to do; and the wisdom to know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 188, 26, 34, 'the difference ."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 188, 27, 35, 'Chapter 34 Chapter 34');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 188, 28, 35, 'One Thing Is Needful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 189, 1, 35, '"Selection - selection - selection" - is the secret of a useful life. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 189, 2, 35, 'pray that in all the pressure of your studies, you will be saved from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 189, 3, 35, 'what someone has called "The Tyranny Of The Urgent" and will learn one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 189, 4, 35, 'of life''s greatest lessons - how to select the precious from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 189, 5, 35, 'worthless, as the Lord told Jeremiah (Jer. 15:19). That will make you a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 189, 6, 35, 'spiritual man, and will enable you to live a truly fruitful life. Many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 189, 7, 35, 'things are lawful, but not all of them are profitable or edifying (See 1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 189, 8, 35, 'Cor.6:12; 10:23). Many things that press on us as urgent are not as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 189, 9, 35, 'urgent as they appear. Jesus said that only " one thing is needful"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 189, 10, 35, '(Lk.10:42). None of us have ever done this matter of selection perfectly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 189, 11, 35, 'in our youth, because our own desires and own reason have proved to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 189, 12, 35, 'too strong for us. (I find that I am not doing things as perfectly as I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 189, 13, 35, 'should, even now, much less in my younger days).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 189, 14, 35, 'But even our failures are part of the education that God allows us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 189, 15, 35, 'have, so that we realize our helplessness and our foolishness, and cast');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 189, 16, 35, 'ourselves on Him for His mercy (for our past failures) and on His grace');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 189, 17, 35, '(for strength for the future). You have the opportunity to advance ahead');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 189, 18, 35, 'of even your parents - not just academically, but spiritually as well,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 189, 19, 35, 'because in both the academic as well as the spiritual, you have access');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 189, 20, 35, 'to teaching that we never had access to in our younger days. Remain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 189, 21, 35, 'humble and broken and trembling at God''s Word - always. God looks with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 189, 22, 35, 'favour upon such people (See Isaiah 66:1,2).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 189, 23, 35, 'A Burning Desire to Be Like Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 189, 24, 35, 'We must have a burning desire at all times to be changed increasingly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 189, 25, 35, 'into Christ''s likeness - because God will not change us if we ourselves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 189, 26, 35, 'do not desire it. But if we have an eager longing to become like Jesus,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 189, 27, 35, 'and prove that by judging ourselves and purifying ourselves daily (1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 189, 28, 35, 'Jn.3:2,3), then God will be delighted, even if our progress is slow. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 190, 1, 35, 'we have a willing mind, God accepts that (2 Cor.8:12) - because God sees');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 190, 2, 35, 'in the seed (the desire) the potential for the full-grown tree (likeness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 190, 3, 35, 'to Christ). So we must have a strong desire to change in every area');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 190, 4, 35, 'where we see ourselves as un-Christlike. Thousands of believers pray');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 190, 5, 35, 'that they might be like Jesus; but very few mourn in secret over their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 190, 6, 35, 'failures in their thoughts and attitudes, where they see they are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 190, 7, 35, 'like Jesus. These latter few alone are the ones who really desire to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 190, 8, 35, 'change - and they alone will be the ones whom God changes progressively');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 190, 9, 35, 'into the likeness of Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 190, 10, 35, 'We must always remember that we are all zeroes in God''s eyes. It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 190, 11, 35, 'Christ as a "1" in front of us Who gives us our worth. Be willing to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 190, 12, 35, 'a nothing and nobody in man''s eyes as well. Let all your spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 190, 13, 35, 'development be in secret before God alone. You don''t need a certificate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 190, 14, 35, 'of approval from any man. Your righteousness (like your bones) must be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 190, 15, 35, 'hidden from the sight of men (Matt.6:1). Your goodness alone (like the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 190, 16, 35, 'flesh that covers your bones) should be seen by others - so that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 190, 17, 35, 'may glorify your heavenly Father (Matt.5:16). A skeleton is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 190, 18, 35, 'attractive if it is not covered with flesh.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 190, 19, 35, 'Be good to those who are evil to you. Learn a lesson from Abraham who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 190, 20, 35, 'gave up his rights to Lot. We read there that Lot chose for himself but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 190, 21, 35, 'God chose for Abraham - and God blessed Abraham (Gen.13:7-18). Isaac');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 190, 22, 35, 'learned this from his father and so he also did not fight for the wells');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 190, 23, 35, 'that he had dug. He gave up his rights. Then God blessed him too');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 190, 24, 35, '(Gen.26:18-25). It is such people that God blesses even today - those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 190, 25, 35, 'who pursue peace with all men. Be a man of peace then - at all times and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 190, 26, 35, 'with all people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 190, 27, 35, 'Growing in Grace');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 190, 28, 35, 'Our aim must be to grow in grace and in the knowledge of Jesus Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 191, 1, 35, 'our Lord (2 Pet.3:18). We must therefore pray like Moses prayed in Psalm');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 191, 2, 35, '90:12, " Lord, teach me to number my days that I may apply my heart to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 191, 3, 35, 'wisdom " - to make the most of our earthly life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 191, 4, 35, 'Here is another definition of grace from 2 Cor.8:9: " Grace made Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 191, 5, 35, 'Who was rich, poor for our sakes, so that we might be blessed ". This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 191, 6, 35, 'what grace will do in our lives too. We will be willing to be small,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 191, 7, 35, 'unrecognized and even despised by others and poor in the eyes of others,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 191, 8, 35, 'if only we can be a blessing to a needy world. Jesus went around doing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 191, 9, 35, 'good, because He received grace from His Father (Acts 10:38). This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 191, 10, 35, 'what grace can do for you also - make you a blessing to others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 191, 11, 35, 'When Jesus was facing a difficult situation, He did not pray `Father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 191, 12, 35, 'save Me from this hour'', but rather, "Father glorify Thy Name" (John');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 191, 13, 35, '12:27). This is what you must pray too in difficult situations. You must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 191, 14, 35, 'not seek for a life of ease, but for a life in which God is glorified,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 191, 15, 35, 'whatever the cost to you. Don''t ask God to change the difficult people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 191, 16, 35, 'or circumstances that God has placed you with/in. Ask Him to changeyou');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 191, 17, 35, 'in those situations. Those who keep praying like that will grow in grace');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 191, 18, 35, '- to be real saints, despite all their past failures.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 191, 19, 35, 'Sins of attitude (like pride, selfishness, jealousy, love of money,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 191, 20, 35, 'bitterness, self-righteousness etc.) are less recognized than sins of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 191, 21, 35, 'action (like telling a lie, lusting with the eyes, theft, etc.) - and so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 191, 22, 35, 'they can destroy our souls more easily. Both groups of sins must be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 191, 23, 35, 'avoided. But you must be careful that you don''t deceive yourselves with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 191, 24, 35, 'a false holiness (like the cults) by keeping the externals of religion');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 191, 25, 35, '(praying, Bible-reading, going to meetings etc.) and missing out on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 191, 26, 35, 'most important thing - being pure (inwardly in God''s sight) and good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 191, 27, 35, '(towards others). We are to grow in grace, not in activity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 191, 28, 35, 'I hope you are experiencing the Lord''s grace in all your work and study');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 192, 1, 35, 'there. Think of that promise "My grace IS sufficient for you"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 192, 2, 35, '(2Cor.12:9). God''s grace is sufficient for every single task that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 192, 3, 35, 'have to do (academic or otherwise), and it is sufficient for every trial');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 192, 4, 35, 'and problem that you may ever have to face at any time. Develop the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 192, 5, 35, 'habit of making 5-second-prayers for help in the middle of your work, or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 192, 6, 35, 'in the middle of the pressure of your studies, and especially when you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 192, 7, 35, 'are facing temptation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 192, 8, 35, 'The Spirit of the Antichrist');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 192, 9, 35, 'The temptation that Adam and Eve fell for was not just to eat an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 192, 10, 35, 'attractive fruit. It was the temptation to be like God. This is what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 192, 11, 35, 'Satan told them: "If you eat of this fruit you will be like God"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 192, 12, 35, '(Gen.3:5). This was the same temptation to which Satan himself had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 192, 13, 35, 'fallen, many years earlier. Now he sought to pollute others in the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 192, 14, 35, 'way. Satan tempted Jesus also in the same way, " If you are the Son of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 192, 15, 35, 'God, use your power as God to turn these stones to bread ". But Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 192, 16, 35, 'replied that he was here on earth as aman, and so said, that "Man shall');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 192, 17, 35, 'not live by bread alone but by every word of God" (Matt.4:3,4). It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 192, 18, 35, 'amazing to see there how Jesus humbled Himself and referred to himself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 192, 19, 35, 'as a man (an ordinary man), who had to obey every word that God had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 192, 20, 35, 'given!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 192, 21, 35, 'If we don''t take God''s laws seriously (for example, in sexual matters),');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 192, 22, 35, 'because we don''t fear Him sufficiently, that is an indication that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 192, 23, 35, 'feel that we ourselves are like God, and can modify the laws that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 192, 24, 35, 'Almighty God has made, and make laws to suit the circumstances that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 192, 25, 35, 'are in - which becomes just an excuse to satisfy our own lusts and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 192, 26, 35, 'passions.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 192, 27, 35, 'It says about the antichrist that he will sit in God''s house showing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 192, 28, 35, 'himself as God (2 Thess.2:4). This is the spirit of the antichrist - to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 193, 1, 35, 'behave like God towards other people, even in the church. If we seek');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 193, 2, 35, 'recognition in the church, or if we are offended when others behave');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 193, 3, 35, 'rudely towards us, these would indicate that we want to be like God -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 193, 4, 35, 'which is the same desire that made the highest angel into the Devil.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 193, 5, 35, 'John Milton in his poem "Paradise Lost" puts these words into the mouth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 193, 6, 35, 'of Lucifer, " It is better to reign in hell than to serve in heaven".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 193, 7, 35, 'That is the spirit of the antichrist - wanting to lord over others. This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 193, 8, 35, 'is how cult-leaders rule over their cult-members.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 193, 9, 35, 'Jesus Christ overcame that spirit totally, because he refused to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 193, 10, 35, 'anything other than a servant all through His earthly life. He never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 193, 11, 35, 'sought to lord it over others, even though He was God. He had given up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 193, 12, 35, 'the right to equality with God. To grasp at equality with God is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 193, 13, 35, 'very essence of the spirit of Satan. This is why salvation comes by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 193, 14, 35, 'going down at all times. In the high places of the world there is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 193, 15, 35, 'constant turmoil. In the low places there is perfect peace. There can be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 193, 16, 35, 'only one God in our hearts - either Self or the Lord Jesus Christ. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 193, 17, 35, 'have to make the choice as to who will be Lord in our hearts.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 193, 18, 35, 'It is good to ensure that you have given your whole heart to the Lord to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 193, 19, 35, 'love him with all your heart, soul, strength and mind. I remember');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 193, 20, 35, 'drawing a picture of a heart in my first Bible, when I gave my life to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 193, 21, 35, 'the Lord in 1959, and writing the Lord''s name and my name inside it and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 193, 22, 35, 'these words beneath it: "His forever, only His". And after these many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 193, 23, 35, 'years of walking with my Lord, my relationship with Him has become');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 193, 24, 35, 'sweeter and sweeter; and my attitude to everything around me has become');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 193, 25, 35, 'more and more one of detachment. I pray that you will walk the way of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 193, 26, 35, 'fervent love for the Lord Jesus, such that there is not a cloud between');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 193, 27, 35, 'you and Him at any time. Keep short accounts with God - meaning, confess');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 193, 28, 35, 'sin as soon as you slip up. Don''t delay even a moment. And don''t ever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 194, 1, 35, 'get discouraged, because our Father rules over every circumstance in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 194, 2, 35, 'this world.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 194, 3, 36, 'Chapter 35 Chapter 35');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 194, 4, 36, 'The Two Invitations of Jesus - Come and Follow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 194, 5, 36, 'The Christian life can be summed up in the two invitations of Jesus:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 194, 6, 36, '"COME TO ME" and "FOLLOW ME". We have to keep coming to Jesus, and not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 194, 7, 36, 'just once at the beginning of our Christian walk, because we tend to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 194, 8, 36, 'keep backsliding (slipping back) in small ways.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 194, 9, 36, 'Come to Me : Many could not accept this invitation of Jesus, when He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 194, 10, 36, 'on earth, because of just one reason: They were unwilling to acknowledge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 194, 11, 36, 'their sin. So Jesus said to them sarcastically, " I did not come for you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 194, 12, 36, '"righteous" people. I came to call sinners - for only sick people need a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 194, 13, 36, 'physician " (Mark 2:17). We need to be constantly willing to acknowledge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 194, 14, 36, 'our shortcomings and sins and failings, if we are to keep coming to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 194, 15, 36, 'Jesus. Where we have sinned against men, we must be constantly willing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 194, 16, 36, 'to apologise to them. Where we are unwilling to apologise to men, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 194, 17, 36, 'shows that we have pride still within us that needs to be cleansed away.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 194, 18, 36, 'Then we cannot come to Jesus. When we only see faults in others and no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 194, 19, 36, 'fault in ourselves, then we become like the Pharisee in the temple. Then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 194, 20, 36, 'we cannot come to Jesus (Lk.18:10-14). The tax-collector however said, "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 194, 21, 36, 'I am the sinner" (Literal). He felt he was the greatest sinner on earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 194, 22, 36, 'Paul felt like that too (" I am the foremost of sinners" - 1 Tim.1:15).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 194, 23, 36, 'Such people can come to Jesus easily. This does not mean that we keep on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 194, 24, 36, 'sinning, for Paul didn''t. Neither does it mean that we fool ourselves to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 194, 25, 36, 'imagine that everyone around us is more spiritual than us. That is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 194, 26, 36, 'humility, because Paul never felt like that. He knew that he was more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 194, 27, 36, 'spiritual than the carnal Corinthian Christians. But the closer we get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 194, 28, 36, 'to God, the more we will be conscious of the corruption of sin within');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 195, 1, 36, 'our flesh.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 195, 2, 36, 'Follow me : Even the disciples could not grasp the way of following');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 195, 3, 36, 'Jesus until the Holy Spirit came on the day of Pentecost - because of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 195, 4, 36, 'one reason: they were unwilling to suffer unjustly and endlessly. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 195, 5, 36, 'Jesus told them that He would have to " suffer many things", Peter said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 195, 6, 36, 'that Jesus should not go that way. Jesus immediately identified that as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 195, 7, 36, 'the voice of Satan and told him to get behind Him (Matt.16:23). If we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 195, 8, 36, 'are to follow Jesus, we must be willing to suffer misunderstanding,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 195, 9, 36, 'abuse, false accusation, ridicule, mockery, insults, injustice and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 195, 10, 36, 'perhaps even physical sufferings. One who is unwilling to go this way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 195, 11, 36, 'all his life cannot follow Jesus.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 195, 12, 36, 'So listen to these two invitations of Jesus constantly: "Come to Me" and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 195, 13, 36, '"Follow Me".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 195, 14, 36, 'Grace According to the Measure of Faith');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 195, 15, 36, 'The Christian life is not a life of following rules and regulations.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 195, 16, 36, 'Moses brought the Law. Jesus, however, did not come with a stricter law');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 195, 17, 36, 'but with grace (John 1:17).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 195, 18, 36, 'Grace is the spiritual equivalent in God''s kingdom of what money is on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 195, 19, 36, 'this earth. As important as money is for living on this earth, even so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 195, 20, 36, 'is grace for living a godly life. The more grace you have received from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 195, 21, 36, 'God, the richer you are. Faith is like presenting a cheque in the bank');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 195, 22, 36, 'to draw out the grace that you need for each day. The cheques are God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 195, 23, 36, 'promises - and like cheques, they are of no use to you, if you don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 195, 24, 36, 'encash them by faith. So you can get as much from the bank of heaven as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 195, 25, 36, 'you have faith for (that is, as much as you write your cheque for).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 195, 26, 36, 'God told Paul, "My grace is sufficient for you" (2 Cor.12:9). There is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 195, 27, 36, 'no situation that you can ever face in life for which God''s grace is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 195, 28, 36, 'insufficient. Whether it is overcoming a persistent sinful habit, or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 196, 1, 36, 'facing a trial in the world, or facing misunderstanding from other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 196, 2, 36, 'believers - God''s grace is always sufficient. But if you doubt that and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 196, 3, 36, 'write a check for a small amount of grace, then that is all that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 196, 4, 36, 'will get. Ask boldly and you will receive grace to be an overcomer in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 196, 5, 36, 'all situations.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 196, 6, 36, 'When a man of God was once facing a trial, he kept asking God to remove');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 196, 7, 36, 'it. But God answered him with a dream in which he saw himself in a boat');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 196, 8, 36, 'trying to cross a river and constantly hitting against a submerged rock');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 196, 9, 36, 'that was in the way and blocking his passage. God told him that He would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 196, 10, 36, 'not remove the rock (the trial), but would raise the level of the water');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 196, 11, 36, '(grace) so that he could go over it. He could then be an overcomer. This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 196, 12, 36, 'is why God allows us to face many trials and difficulties in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 196, 13, 36, 'Christian life, so that we can experience more of His grace and become');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 196, 14, 36, 'overcomers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 196, 15, 36, 'Resting in the Will of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 196, 16, 36, 'When seeking to find God''s will concerning anything, tell the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 196, 17, 36, 'sincerely that you are willing to accept anything. Lay your all on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 196, 18, 36, 'altar, examine your motives to ensure that you desire the glory of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 196, 19, 36, 'alone in everything. Then you will find that He opens the right door for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 196, 20, 36, 'you. There may still be some uncertainty in your mind as you move');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 196, 21, 36, 'forward. But God allows that, because He wants you to walk by faith -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 196, 22, 36, 'and certainty can at times be the equivalent of walking by sight.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 196, 23, 36, 'Once you have decided, don''t bother if things seem to go wrong somewhere');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 196, 24, 36, 'or the other. Read Acts 16 and see how when Paul obeyed the ''Macedonian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 196, 25, 36, 'call'' to go to Philippi, and went there, he was very soon locked up in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 196, 26, 36, 'jail! But that was God''s perfect will - because there was a jailer there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 196, 27, 36, 'who needed to be saved!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 196, 28, 36, 'When we seek the kingdom of God first, all the other things we need will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 197, 1, 36, 'be given to us by the Lord. I have seen that ever since I left the Navy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 197, 2, 36, 'in May 1966.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 197, 3, 36, 'God plans everything perfectly - even through your failures. In all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 197, 4, 36, 'situations He wants you to get to know Him. That is His aim. I want you,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 197, 5, 36, 'my sons, to know God even better than I have known Him. \');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 197, 6, 36, 'Wherever you go, during your summer vacation, retain a spirit of prayer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 197, 7, 36, 'Let prayer become like breathing for you - as you talk to the Lord about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 197, 8, 36, 'the little things and the big things in life. This is what it means to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 197, 9, 36, '"pray at all times" (Luke 18:1) and to " pray without ceasing" (1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 197, 10, 36, 'Thess.5:17).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 197, 11, 36, 'All Things Work Together for Good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 197, 12, 36, 'Use every difficult situation that you face as one more challenge to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 197, 13, 36, 'your faith and to develop your character. Everything that happens in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 197, 14, 36, 'life is designed by God to train you for eternity. 2000 years from now,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 197, 15, 36, 'how you reacted to the opposition of people and circumstances that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 197, 16, 36, 'encountered will be more important than the small frustrations that loom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 197, 17, 36, 'so large before your eyes right now. Jesus completed His education by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 197, 18, 36, 'enduring firmly against the constant contradiction of sinners -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 197, 19, 36, 'especially religious sinners (Heb.12:3).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 197, 20, 36, 'You must be firmly rooted in Romans 8:28 at all times - concerning the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 197, 21, 36, 'smallest matters - if you are to be overcomers. "All things" in Romans');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 197, 22, 36, '8:28 means "ALL things" - because we believe that God is sovereign');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 197, 23, 36, 'enough to control the smallest of details of our daily life. So don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 197, 24, 36, 'let your faith ever fail - that is most important. You mustnever get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 197, 25, 36, 'discouraged - no matter what happens. The mark of your faith is that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 197, 26, 36, 'praise God. In Psalm 106:12, we read that the Israelites believed God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 197, 27, 36, 'and praised Him only after they saw the Egyptians drowned. But now we,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 197, 28, 36, 'who walk by faith and not by sight, can praise God even before we see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 198, 1, 36, 'the answers to our prayers, because we live by faith.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 198, 2, 36, 'God will arrange many things to strengthen your faith. You may wish at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 198, 3, 36, 'times that your life was smooth and problem-free. But that way you would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 198, 4, 36, 'become a fat, flabby Christian, with no experience of God. But when you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 198, 5, 36, 'canbelieve in God in the face of the impossible, and when you can love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 198, 6, 36, 'others in the face of bitter hatred and evil, then you can have an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 198, 7, 36, 'experience of God''s power that not only develops your character but also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 198, 8, 36, 'gives you a ministry to others. So God is planning and arranging your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 198, 9, 36, 'circumstances perfectly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 198, 10, 36, 'Remember always that " He knows every detail of what is happening to you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 198, 11, 36, '" (Job.23:10-Living).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 198, 12, 36, 'Debt of Love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 198, 13, 36, 'The "oil in the flask" (that Jesus spoke of in the parable of the wise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 198, 14, 36, 'virgins in Matthew 25) refers not only to our hidden life, but to more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 198, 15, 36, 'than that. Consider the cases of the two widows in the Old Testament.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 198, 16, 36, 'One poured out the oil from her flask to make food for Elijah - and her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 198, 17, 36, 'flask was always full of oil (1 Kings 17). The other widow poured out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 198, 18, 36, 'the oil from her flask into the vessels of her neighbours (as per');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 198, 19, 36, 'Elisha''s command) and her vessel also remained full (2 Kings 4). So the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 198, 20, 36, 'secret of a full flask of oil is to live life serving others and not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 198, 21, 36, 'live selfishly for ourselves. Those who keep serving others like that in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 198, 22, 36, 'the Name of the Lord will be ready (like the wise virgins) for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 198, 23, 36, 'coming of the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 198, 24, 36, 'You have a debt of love (Rom.13:8) to pay back to every human being you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 198, 25, 36, 'meet. If you keep blessing the others with whatever God gives you of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 198, 26, 36, 'truth and blessing, instead of hoarding all that knowledge yourself, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 198, 27, 36, 'will find that God waters you Himself (Prov.11:24,25). Then your life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 198, 28, 36, 'will always be fresh - and never stale.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 199, 1, 36, 'When people "hate you without a cause" (Jn.15:25), what should you do?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 199, 2, 36, 'The answer is clear: You should "love them without a cause" ( without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 199, 3, 36, 'any reason for your love)!! Thus you will overcome evil with good. Thus,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 199, 4, 36, 'you will endure in love until the end towards everyone, so that you can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 199, 5, 36, 'be like your heavenly Father Who makes His sun to rise on the good and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 199, 6, 36, 'the evil. "He who endures in love until the end will be saved."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 199, 7, 36, '(Matt.24:10).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 199, 8, 36, 'Abide in Love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 199, 9, 36, 'Everything that happens to you is a test of whether you can abide in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 199, 10, 36, 'love. This world is the training ground for us to reign one day in God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 199, 11, 36, 'kingdom, where everything will be run by the law of love. If we qualify');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 199, 12, 36, 'during this probation period, we will reign with Christ. If however we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 199, 13, 36, 'react badly to those who treat us badly, we will have failed in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 199, 14, 36, 'probation. Always keep the eternal perspective in mind. And always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 199, 15, 36, 'remember that everything that is big and great in the eyes of men -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 199, 16, 36, 'including big jobs and earthly fame - are an abomination in God''s eyes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 199, 17, 36, '(Lk.16:15). The only thing of eternal worth is abiding in love and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 199, 18, 36, 'goodness and mercy. By the way, mercy, in the Bible, means ''acts of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 199, 19, 36, 'kindness'' also - and not just forgiving others - as we see in the story');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 199, 20, 36, 'of the Good Samaritan where the word ''mercy'' is used to refer to his act');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 199, 21, 36, 'of kindness (Lk.10:37).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 199, 22, 36, 'If God wanted He could have made all His children themost intelligent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 199, 23, 36, 'people on earth - like Einstein - or the richest - like Bill Gates. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 199, 24, 36, 'He didn''t do that, because intelligence and wealth have no value in His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 199, 25, 36, 'kingdom. So while we thank God for whatever intelligence and wealth it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 199, 26, 36, 'has pleased Him to give us during our short stay on earth, we must never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 199, 27, 36, 'glory in those things. The only thing that matters is how much we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 199, 28, 36, 'love.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 200, 1, 36, 'All transformation begins in our thoughts - as we see in Romans 12:2: "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 200, 2, 36, 'Be not conformed...but be transformed by the renewing of your mind');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 200, 3, 36, '(thoughts)...". It is in our thoughts that we become worldly or holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 200, 4, 36, 'first of all; and it is in our thoughts that we are either selfish or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 200, 5, 36, 'unselfish.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 200, 6, 36, 'In Hebrew 10:19-25, we read of the new and living way into the Most Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 200, 7, 36, 'Place that Jesus has opened through the veil of His flesh. But what do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 200, 8, 36, 'people do when they get into the Most Holy Place? Verse 25 tells us:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 200, 9, 36, 'They think about others, as to how they can bless them ('' Consider how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 200, 10, 36, 'you can stir others to love...'').');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 200, 11, 36, 'Jesus told us who would be at His right hand in His kingdom - those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 200, 12, 36, 'fed the hungry, clothed the naked, and visited the sick and those in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 200, 13, 36, 'prison. All these actions began in their thoughts. They thought of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 200, 14, 36, 'needs of others and decided to do something about it. Others just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 200, 15, 36, 'thought about the needs of others and did nothing .');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 200, 16, 37, 'Chapter 36 Chapter 36');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 200, 17, 37, 'Thinking About the Needs of Others');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 200, 18, 37, 'We are told in Philippians 2:5 to have the same attitude that Jesus had.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 200, 19, 37, 'We have often thought of that chapter as the great chapter onhumility.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 200, 20, 37, 'But it is also the great chapter on thinking about the needs of others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 200, 21, 37, 'Jesus thought about us in heaven and that was what made Him come down.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 200, 22, 37, 'His humbling Himself came out of His thinking about others. We are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 200, 23, 37, 'commanded to have the same attitude. There we have this tremendous');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 200, 24, 37, 'exhortation: " Do nothing from selfishness..." (Phil.2:3). It is amazing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 200, 25, 37, 'that we can come to such a life here on earth, where we do absolutely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 200, 26, 37, 'nothing from selfishness. The gospel (good news) is the power of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 200, 27, 37, 'unto salvation from all selfishness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 200, 28, 37, 'All the great missionaries in history thought much. They thought about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 201, 1, 37, 'the needs of others - and they did something about it, exactly as Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 201, 2, 37, 'did in heaven.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 201, 3, 37, 'May the Lord enable you to have the same attitude of mind that Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 201, 4, 37, 'had. The promise in Hebrews 10:16 is that God Himself will write His law');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 201, 5, 37, 'of love and unselfishness in our minds (thoughts). Let us allow Him to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 201, 6, 37, 'do that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 201, 7, 37, 'True Holiness is to Seek God''s Glory Alone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 201, 8, 37, 'What does it mean to be righteous and unrighteous? According to our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 201, 9, 37, 'human understanding (which usually tends towards Phariseeism),');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 201, 10, 37, 'righteousness means to do a lot of good things and unrighteousness means');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 201, 11, 37, 'to do a lot of bad things.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 201, 12, 37, 'But Jesus gave us God''s definition of it in John 7:18b, which I would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 201, 13, 37, 'paraphrase like this: " The one who seeks the glory of God is true, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 201, 14, 37, 'there is no unrighteousness in him ". In the first part of that verse,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 201, 15, 37, 'Jesus speaks of one who seeks his own glory. So we see that the only way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 201, 16, 37, 'to be cleansed from all unrighteousness is to be cleansed from all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 201, 17, 37, 'seeking of our own glory, and to seek the glory of God alone.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 201, 18, 37, 'The definition of `sin'' in Romans 3:23 is " to come short of the glory');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 201, 19, 37, 'of God". Whatever we do that does not glorify God is sin. Our praying,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 201, 20, 37, 'preaching, singing and doing kind acts can all be sin, if these are done');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 201, 21, 37, 'for our own honour. It is the motive that determines whether we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 201, 22, 37, 'righteous or unrighteous. That is why it is so utterly foolish to judge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 201, 23, 37, 'others, because we don''t know the motives in their hearts. And in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 201, 24, 37, 'same way it is totally wise to judge ourselves, because we do know the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 201, 25, 37, 'motives in our own hearts (See 1 Cor.4:5: " Judge nothing until the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 201, 26, 37, 'comes Who will bring to light the hidden motives of men''s hearts ").');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 201, 27, 37, 'When our motive is the glory of God, then even if we make a mistake in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 201, 28, 37, 'what we do, God will still give us 100% marks. But if we do an external');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 202, 1, 37, 'action perfectly, but sought our own honour in it, God will give us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 202, 2, 37, 'zero. So we can never determine whether another person is righteous or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 202, 3, 37, 'unrighteous. Only God knows that. But we must be careful to preserve our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 202, 4, 37, 'own hearts in humility and purity, seeking the glory of God alone in all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 202, 5, 37, 'that we do. We should ask God to give us light in the darkness of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 202, 6, 37, 'hearts, so that we don''t touch His glory in any service that we do for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 202, 7, 37, 'Him. " Unto the upright, there arises light in the darkness"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 202, 8, 37, '(Psa.112:4). That verse has been ringing in my ear, again and again of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 202, 9, 37, 'late.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 202, 10, 37, 'Make the glory of God your main aim in life. True holiness is to seek');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 202, 11, 37, 'the glory of God in everything that you do. That way you will also get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 202, 12, 37, 'the best from God in every area - even if you make a mistake in finding');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 202, 13, 37, 'God''s will in some area. When you are seeking the glory of God, you will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 202, 14, 37, 'not judge others, but only yourself. Leave the judgment of others to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 202, 15, 37, 'God. He can do that very well, without our help!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 202, 16, 37, 'Some Points to Ponder');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 202, 17, 37, 'Here are some of the subjects that we shared at a recent conference here');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 202, 18, 37, 'in Bangalore.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 202, 19, 37, '- The secret of Jesus'' life was this that He took every Word of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 202, 20, 37, 'seriously and trembled at it and obeyed it. Isaiah 66:1, 2 tells us that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 202, 21, 37, 'God looks at such people with favour.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 202, 22, 37, '- The four gospels clearly teach that Jesus was never against sinners.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 202, 23, 37, 'He was only against hypocrites. Jesus loves sinners and wants to save');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 202, 24, 37, 'them. He blots out their past.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 202, 25, 37, '- If we see people as God sees them, we will value every single person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 202, 26, 37, 'as a person for whom Christ died. We won''t despise any of them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 202, 27, 37, '- God does not want us to live by a lot of rules and regulations as to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 202, 28, 37, 'what is right and what is wrong. That is to live by the tree of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 203, 1, 37, 'knowledge of good and evil - and it always brings death. God wants us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 203, 2, 37, 'live by faith - in constant dependence on God for guidance as to what we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 203, 3, 37, 'should do (right) and what we should not do (wrong).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 203, 4, 37, '- We must never be satisfied until "rivers of living water" flow out of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 203, 5, 37, 'us in every direction. For this we must seek to be filled with the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 203, 6, 37, 'Spirit constantly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 203, 7, 37, '- "Christ manifest in the flesh" means " Love manifest in the flesh".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 203, 8, 37, 'God keeps us on earth to train us in love, so that we can reign with Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 203, 9, 37, 'one day. Revelation 20:4 says that those who were beheaded for Christ''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 203, 10, 37, 'sake will reign with him. We must be beheaded (spiritually) - our Adamic');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 203, 11, 37, 'reasoning must be cut off. Then we can be grafted into Christ as our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 203, 12, 37, 'Head and become part of His body. That is how we can function as His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 203, 13, 37, 'body under His headship.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 203, 14, 37, '- God sends revival (according to Isaiah 57:15) only to those who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 203, 15, 37, 'lowly and contrite in spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 203, 16, 37, '- We must cleanse ourselves if we are to be valuable vessels of gold and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 203, 17, 37, 'silver in God''s house (2 Tim.2:20, 21). Thus we can present ourselves to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 203, 18, 37, 'God alone as servants who win His approval.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 203, 19, 37, '- If God gave us His Son so freely, He will certainly give us all things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 203, 20, 37, 'freely along with Him. He will give us mercy (forgiveness of sins) and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 203, 21, 37, 'also grace (power to overcome sin and to live a Christlike life).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 203, 22, 37, 'Mercy and Judgment');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 203, 23, 37, 'Here is a fresh revelation that God gave me recently:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 203, 24, 37, '"God uses the sufferings of godly people and even the sins that godly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 203, 25, 37, 'and ungodly people fall into, to expose the wickedness of the hearts of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 203, 26, 37, 'those who sit in judgment on them and accuse them."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 203, 27, 37, 'Mark 3:5 (Living Bible) reads like this: " Jesus looked around at them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 203, 28, 37, '(the Pharisees) angrily, deeply disturbed by their indifference to human');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 204, 1, 37, 'need ". Even today Jesus is deeply disturbed whenever He sees in us an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 204, 2, 37, 'indifference to the spiritual or physical need of those around us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 204, 3, 37, 'The story of the rich man and Lazarus illustrates this. The rich man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 204, 4, 37, 'went to hell because he was indifferent to the need of Lazarus.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 204, 5, 37, 'The parable of the Good Samaritan also illustrates the same truth. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 204, 6, 37, 'priest and the Levite were indifferent to Satan having beaten up a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 204, 7, 37, 'fellow-believer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 204, 8, 37, 'The book of Job illustrates this truth. Even though Job said many wrong');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 204, 9, 37, 'things about God, God blotted them all out, because with one word of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 204, 10, 37, 'repentance Job retracted all his words (Job 42:6). It was like bad');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 204, 11, 37, 'sections of a tape being erased, while the good sections are retained.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 204, 12, 37, 'And so, all the complaints that Job made against God (recorded in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 204, 13, 37, 'book of Job) are not recorded in God''s book in heaven - for they have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 204, 14, 37, 'been blotted out. Only the good statements that Job made are retained');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 204, 15, 37, 'there! How wonderful is God''s forgiveness and justification! But the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 204, 16, 37, 'three self-righteous preachers, Eliphaz, Bildad and Zophar, who told Job');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 204, 17, 37, 'that his sickness was the result of some sin in his life, were condemned');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 204, 18, 37, 'by God, for judging Job without knowing Job''s heart (Job 42:7). The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 204, 19, 37, 'wickedness of their hearts was exposed by the sickness of Job.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 204, 20, 37, 'Similarly, God used the woman caught in adultery to show up the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 204, 21, 37, 'wickedness of the hearts of the Pharisees who condemned her.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 204, 22, 37, 'So it is best for us to be merciful to everyone, and to judge no-one.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 204, 23, 37, 'Then God will be abundantly merciful to us. The primary characteristic');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 204, 24, 37, 'of Pharisees is a lack of mercy. We must beware of this.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 204, 25, 37, 'Jerusalem and Babylon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 204, 26, 37, 'It is foolish to despise true believers in other groups, just because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 204, 27, 37, 'they differ from us in some small point of doctrine. That is the way to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 204, 28, 37, 'become a Pharisee. Those others may be seeking the glory of God much');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 205, 1, 37, 'more than us - and that is what God looks at ultimately. This is what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 205, 2, 37, 'all cultists don''t have the humility to recognize. They consider');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 205, 3, 37, 'themselves alone to be the true church. Beware of such Pharisees.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 205, 4, 37, 'There are really only two groups among believers (whatever their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 205, 5, 37, 'doctrines may be). One is Babylon and the other is Jerusalem. One is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 205, 6, 37, 'harlot (Satan''s counterfeit church), and the other is the Bride of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 205, 7, 37, 'Christ. The two groups are:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 205, 8, 37, 'Those who seek their own glory & those who seek the glory of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 205, 9, 37, '(Jn.7:18; Phil.2:19-21)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 205, 10, 37, 'Those who humble themselves & those who exalt themselves (1 Pet.5:5).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 205, 11, 37, 'Those who seek earthly things & those who seek heavenly things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 205, 12, 37, '(Col.3:2).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 205, 13, 37, 'Those who seek to please men & those who seek to please God (Gal.1:10).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 205, 14, 37, 'Those who seek only God''s blessings & those who also seek God''s approval');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 205, 15, 37, '(2 Cor.5:9).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 205, 16, 37, 'Each of us decides which group we want to join. Our joy or regret in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 205, 17, 37, 'eternity will be dependent on the decisions that we make in our daily');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 205, 18, 37, 'life today. So be wise - and take the long-term view.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 205, 19, 38, 'Chapter 37 Chapter 37');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 205, 20, 38, 'Love is the Greatest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 205, 21, 38, 'Never " forget your purification from your former sins, lest you become');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 205, 22, 38, 'blind " (2 Pet.1:9). Never allow Satan or man to make you feel guilty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 205, 23, 38, 'about what the Lord has forgiven and said He will not remember anymore.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 205, 24, 38, 'But, at the same time, never forget how many sins the Lord has forgiven');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 205, 25, 38, 'you, so that you "love the Lord much" (Lk.7:47), and forgive everyone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 205, 26, 38, 'readily (Eph.4:32), and thus are saved from that worst of all sins -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 205, 27, 38, 'Phariseeism.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 205, 28, 38, 'Remember one thing: The greater the ministry that the Lord has planned');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 206, 1, 38, 'for a person, the more the trials and testings that the Lord will take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 206, 2, 38, 'him through in his younger days - until he is at least 30 years old.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 206, 3, 38, 'That was the way that Jesus Himself was taken by the Father. God will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 206, 4, 38, 'take each of you the same way, for I believe that He has a ministry for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 206, 5, 38, 'each of you too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 206, 6, 38, 'And in all your testings, make sure that you remain rooted and grounded');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 206, 7, 38, 'in love. Even if you never speak in tongues, or prophesy, or move');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 206, 8, 38, 'mountains, or heal the sick, or give all your money to the poor, or die');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 206, 9, 38, 'as a martyr, yet if you love God with all your heart (and therefore keep');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 206, 10, 38, 'yourself pure), and love others with the love described in 1 Corinthians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 206, 11, 38, '13, you will qualify to be among the greatest of people that lived on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 206, 12, 38, 'this earth, for love is the greatest. Just like a regular medical');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 206, 13, 38, 'check-up is good to see if everything is well with our physical bodies,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 206, 14, 38, 'it is good to have a spiritual check-up regularly too. 1 Corinthians 13');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 206, 15, 38, 'is a good chapter to use for such a check-up: The greatest is love.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 206, 16, 38, 'Satan comes as an angel of darkness and tells people that money is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 206, 17, 38, 'greatest or sexual pleasure or some other physical thrill is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 206, 18, 38, 'greatest, or fame and position are the greatest. He also comes as an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 206, 19, 38, 'angel of light and tells believers that speaking in tongues is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 206, 20, 38, 'greatest (1 Cor.13:1), or that spiritual gifts like preaching and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 206, 21, 38, 'miracle-working ability are the greatest (v.2), or that being generous');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 206, 22, 38, 'or dying as a martyr are the greatest (v.3). But all that Satan says are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 206, 23, 38, 'lies. Love is the greatest. And our lives must be living demonstrations');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 206, 24, 38, 'of this fact. Thus we will expose the lies of Satan.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 206, 25, 38, 'The qualities of love described in 1 Cor.13:4-7 are mostly related to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 206, 26, 38, 'our reactions and attitudes towards others in the way they behave or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 206, 27, 38, 'treat us. Through such circumstances, God gives us a spiritual check-up.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 206, 28, 38, 'To love God and others like this, you need to have a good foundation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 207, 1, 38, 'Love is like a two-storey building. The foundation is God''s love for us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 207, 2, 38, 'The first storey is our love for God, and the second storey is our love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 207, 3, 38, 'for others. Your foundation can be strong if you meditate first of all,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 207, 4, 38, 'on how much God has loved you ("We love Him because He first loved us" -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 207, 5, 38, '1 John 4:19); and secondly on how much God has forgiven you (" He who is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 207, 6, 38, 'forgiven much loves much" - Luke 7:47). Then it will become easy to love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 207, 7, 38, 'God and others. So you should never forget your " purification from your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 207, 8, 38, 'former sins, lest you become blind" (2 Pet.1:9).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 207, 9, 38, 'Enduring Love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 207, 10, 38, 'Jesus loved His own unto the end (Jn.13:1). That is how the chapter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 207, 11, 38, 'describing the first `breaking of bread'' meeting begins. And that must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 207, 12, 38, 'be true of us too at every `breaking of bread''. His love was manifested');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 207, 13, 38, 'in His washing His disciples'' feet - which speaks first of all,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 207, 14, 38, 'physically, of doing a dirty task for those who needed that done, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 207, 15, 38, 'spiritually, of washing away the specks of sin that we see in the lives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 207, 16, 38, 'of others (instead of blaming them and condemning them).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 207, 17, 38, 'In contrast to the spirit of Jesus, we see Judas Iscariot, remaining');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 207, 18, 38, 'hard-hearted, even after Jesus had washed his feet, and even after Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 207, 19, 38, 'had "honoured him by giving him the first morsel of the meal" (Jn.13:26');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 207, 20, 38, '- Living Bible).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 207, 21, 38, 'In that contrast, we see the spirit of heaven and hell that can be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 207, 22, 38, 'present among those who come to the breaking of bread even today. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 207, 23, 38, 'will either follow Jesus in humble, lowly, loving service, with a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 207, 24, 38, 'forgiving spirit to our betrayers - or - we will follow Judas in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 207, 25, 38, 'hardheartedness and bitterness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 207, 26, 38, 'Satan was quick to enter Judas'' heart (v.27), and then " Judas went out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 207, 27, 38, 'and it was night" (V.30). It is always night when Satan enters any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 207, 28, 38, 'heart. When a person keeps on resisting the Spirit''s call to repentance,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 208, 1, 38, 'it is like keeping on stretching a rubber-band. After a while it will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 208, 2, 38, 'snap. Then that person loses his salvation and his heart''s door becomes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 208, 3, 38, 'open for Satan and his evil spirits to enter. It is terrible to think of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 208, 4, 38, 'such an eventuality. But it has happened to many people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 208, 5, 38, 'There is nothing wrong in leaving a local church-fellowship and joining');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 208, 6, 38, 'another church, if one disagrees with the first church. Satan can''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 208, 7, 38, 'enter a person''s heart because of that. But there is everything wrong in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 208, 8, 38, 'having bitterness when one leaves one group and joins another. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 208, 9, 38, 'when Satan enters a person''s heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 208, 10, 38, 'The only way of salvation is to " love the Lord and all people until the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 208, 11, 38, 'end", like Jesus did.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 208, 12, 38, 'Being Faithful With Money');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 208, 13, 38, 'You must be careful in the use of money, in these days, when you are a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 208, 14, 38, 'student. That will train you to be careful in later years and also bring');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 208, 15, 38, 'you spiritual wealth - for God rewards those who are faithful in the use');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 208, 16, 38, 'of material things.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 208, 17, 38, 'Life is too short to waste on things that have no eternal value. So you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 208, 18, 38, 'must be very careful in the way you spend your money there. The way you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 208, 19, 38, 'use the money God gives you to live with on earth, is one test of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 208, 20, 38, 'depth of your devotion to Him. You cannot afford to waste it on anything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 208, 21, 38, 'unnecessary. You must learn to be frugal in all your expenditure.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 208, 22, 38, 'It is good to learn to be frugal with all expenses in your student days.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 208, 23, 38, 'It is good to keep a careful account of your expenditure - so that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 208, 24, 38, 'can know where you are spending your money, and where you have spent too');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 208, 25, 38, 'much, so that you can reduce your expenses in the next semester. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 208, 26, 38, 'should also be careful to plan ahead in paying college bills, so that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 208, 27, 38, 'you can make payments on time, to avoid penalties for late payment; and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 208, 28, 38, 'always ensure that there is enough in the bank before writing a check,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 209, 1, 38, 'to avoid penalties for checks that are returned. It will also be good if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 209, 2, 38, 'you total up your expenses during the academic year, so that you can see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 209, 3, 38, 'whether you are keeping within the limits that the college expected you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 209, 4, 38, 'to spend, when they gave you the scholarship at the beginning of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 209, 5, 38, 'year.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 209, 6, 38, 'Later on when you get a job and start working, seek to make a good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 209, 7, 38, 'impression on your superiors - by respect, courtesy and absolute');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 209, 8, 38, 'honesty. And be willing to work overtime and doubly hard so that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 209, 9, 38, 'see that you can turn out good work.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 209, 10, 38, 'Discernment about Music and Television');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 209, 11, 38, 'I want to remind you again of the great need of discernment in these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 209, 12, 38, 'days, if you want to avoid being deceived by Satan with things that can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 209, 13, 38, 'be explained by your reason as not being evil, but which at the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 209, 14, 38, 'time do not glorify God. Music, for example, is one of those very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 209, 15, 38, 'dangerous areas in these days It is an area in which you must tread with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 209, 16, 38, 'extreme caution, for Satan is using it to lead millions away from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 209, 17, 38, 'Lord. Every talent you have is the gift of God - and must be used for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 209, 18, 38, 'Him alone. God will honour you and answer your prayers, only if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 209, 19, 38, 'honour Him in every area. So be radical in the type of music that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 209, 20, 38, 'listen to. Classical and semi-classical music are all right for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 209, 21, 38, 'relaxation. But much of what goes by the name of ''modern music'' these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 209, 22, 38, 'days is demonic - and dangerous. And as per the rule that we have had at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 209, 23, 38, 'home, we must not listen to the words of secular love songs, for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 209, 24, 38, 'words of such pop-songs are very suggestive and can lead you into sinful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 209, 25, 38, 'patterns of thought. You should never keep any tapes or CDs of such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 209, 26, 38, 'music with you at any time. If you do have any, you must destroy them,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 209, 27, 38, 'just like the Christians in Ephesus did with their books of magic (Acts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 209, 28, 38, '19:19).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 210, 1, 38, 'In the same way, be quick to turn away from TV programs that are subtly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 210, 2, 38, 'suggestive, for they can form impressions on your mind that will torment');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 210, 3, 38, 'you with dirty dreams for decades. If you are careful in such matters,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 210, 4, 38, 'you will have no regrets in eternity. Keep your spiritual senses sharp');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 210, 5, 38, 'for the Lord at all times. Don''t let them ever be blunted with anything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 210, 6, 38, 'of the spirit of this world. Do a thorough spring-cleaning of your heart');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 210, 7, 38, 'and of your possessions.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 210, 8, 38, 'Keep Your Heart Pure');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 210, 9, 38, 'Remember the principles of God''s Word for which you have seen us your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 210, 10, 38, 'parents stand, for many years. May the Lord give you grace to stand for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 210, 11, 38, 'those principles too, in your generation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 210, 12, 38, 'God is going to divide Christians into two groups when Jesus returns -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 210, 13, 38, 'those who feared God and those who did not (Malachi 3:18). Or in other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 210, 14, 38, 'words those who concentrated on cleaning the inside of their cup and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 210, 15, 38, 'those who kept only the outside clean (Matt.23:25,26). Those who fear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 210, 16, 38, 'God will be more interested in keeping their hearts pure before God than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 210, 17, 38, 'in having a good testimony before men. The only way to enter into a life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 210, 18, 38, 'of victory is by mourning over each sin, every time we fall.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 210, 19, 38, 'There is a difference between having a clean conscience and a pure');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 210, 20, 38, 'heart. A clean conscience is one that is free from all known sin. A pure');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 210, 21, 38, 'heart however is one that is taken up with God alone and nothing and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 210, 22, 38, 'no-one else. " Blessed are the pure in heart for they will see God". The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 210, 23, 38, 'pure in heart will see only God in every situation (Matt.5:8). Then you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 210, 24, 38, 'will not be taken up with evil people and difficult circumstances, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 210, 25, 38, 'only with God. So if you have complaints and criticisms against people,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 210, 26, 38, 'it would indicate that your heart is not taken up with God alone - it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 210, 27, 38, 'not pure. When your heart is pure and you see God alone, you will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 210, 28, 38, 'believe that He works everything for your very best - and you will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 211, 1, 38, 'praise Him continually. Even if all the people in the world and all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 211, 2, 38, 'millions of demons in the universe, gang-up against you, they will still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 211, 3, 38, 'not be able to hinder God''s plan for your life - for when God is with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 211, 4, 38, 'you, you will be an overcomer in every situation and you will fulfil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 211, 5, 38, 'God''s perfect will for your life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 211, 6, 38, '"As in water, face reflects face, so the heart of man reflects man "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 211, 7, 38, '(Prov.27:19). One meaning of that verse is that when we impute bad');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 211, 8, 38, 'motives to others for something they do, we are actually revealing the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 211, 9, 38, 'condition of our own hearts - for we imagine that they are doing things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 211, 10, 38, 'with the same bad motive that we would have had, if we were doing the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 211, 11, 38, 'same things. But when we live in a continual cleansing, we judge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 211, 12, 38, 'ourselves and do not judge others. Jesus told us to judge only the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 211, 13, 38, 'external actions of others (" By their fruit you shall know them"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 211, 14, 38, '(Matt.7:16) - and not their roots (motives), which we cannot see!).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 211, 15, 38, 'Juniper was a disciple of Francis of Assisi who lived in the 13th');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 211, 16, 38, 'century. He always wore the simplest of clothes. One day he saw another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 211, 17, 38, 'of his brothers dressed in fancy clothes. He then said to himself,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 211, 18, 38, '"Perhaps under those fancy clothes, that brother has a humbler heart');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 211, 19, 38, 'than I have under these simple clothes." With such a pure attitude, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 211, 20, 38, 'preserved himself from judging his brother. That is a good example for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 211, 21, 38, 'all of us to follow.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 211, 22, 38, 'Put Away All Grumbling and Murmuring');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 211, 23, 38, 'When we look at the world around us, we see that believers and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 211, 24, 38, 'unbelievers both face the same problems - as Solomon says in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 211, 25, 38, 'Ecclesiastes 2:14. Why is it like that? Why doesn''t God protect His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 211, 26, 38, 'children from such problems? Because God wants to show in the final day,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 211, 27, 38, '` the exceeding riches of his grace'' that made His children more than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 211, 28, 38, 'conquerors in the very same situations in which others grumbled and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 212, 1, 38, 'complained and were defeated. That will shut the mouths of all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 212, 2, 38, 'unbelievers who complained against God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 212, 3, 38, 'The world is full of people who grumble and murmur and complain against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 212, 4, 38, 'God and against people. The only way we can stand as a light for God in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 212, 5, 38, 'such a "crooked and perverse generation", is by eliminating grumbling');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 212, 6, 38, 'and murmuring from our lives completely (Phil.2:14,15).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 212, 7, 38, 'Many great saints and missionaries (and even those who have been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 212, 8, 38, 'tortured for Christ in Communist lands in recent decades) have suffered');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 212, 9, 38, 'immensely for their faith in Christ and did so, without grumbling or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 212, 10, 38, 'complaining. When we see the video-record of their lives in the Day of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 212, 11, 38, 'Judgment, we will be ashamed that we complained and grumbled about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 212, 12, 38, 'trivial things in our lives! Anything that will not have any value 2000');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 212, 13, 38, 'years from now is not worth complaining about.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 212, 14, 38, 'And further, God has promised to make all things work together for our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 212, 15, 38, 'good, if we love Him and seek to fulfil His purpose for our lives. Then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 212, 16, 38, 'what reason can there be for complaining?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 212, 17, 38, 'God will not immediately punish those who harm us. That would turn God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 212, 18, 38, 'into a bully - which He is not. Instead of punishing them, God will give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 212, 19, 38, 'us grace to be overcomers, and enable us to " give thanks for all things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 212, 20, 38, '" (Eph.5:20) and " for all men " (1 Tim.2:1), and to love them from our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 212, 21, 38, 'hearts. That will make the angels wonder far more than if God subdued');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 212, 22, 38, 'all our enemies into silence with brute force.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 212, 23, 39, 'Chapter 38 Chapter 38');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 212, 24, 39, 'The Mystery of Suffering');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 212, 25, 39, 'However thick the battle, just hold on there for the Lord. As the hymn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 212, 26, 39, 'says, "It will be worth it all when we see Jesus". May the Lord give you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 212, 27, 39, 'grace and strength to face every situation, so that you come out of them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 212, 28, 39, 'all as a more godly man.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 213, 1, 39, 'It is indeed a mystery as to why God allows His people to go through so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 213, 2, 39, 'much suffering when He can deliver them speedily without any difficulty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 213, 3, 39, 'at all. It was a similar situation that John the Baptist faced when he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 213, 4, 39, 'was so long in prison, without anything happening, that he wondered');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 213, 5, 39, 'whether Jesus was really the Messiah (Matt.11:3), even though he had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 213, 6, 39, 'been a witness to all that happened at Jesus'' baptism. Even today, many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 213, 7, 39, 'believers in prisons in China and other places (for the gospel''s sake)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 213, 8, 39, 'must be wondering why God allows them to suffer for so long without any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 213, 9, 39, 'answer from heaven. " How long, O Lord...?" is their cry.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 213, 10, 39, 'I was thinking of the family members of believers who were imprisoned in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 213, 11, 39, 'Russia and Romania etc., in the past, at times for 14 years at a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 213, 12, 39, 'stretch, without any relief. How difficult it must have been for those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 213, 13, 39, 'family-members to know that their loved one was being tortured and was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 213, 14, 39, 'suffering in prison, and there was no answer from heaven. Some of those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 213, 15, 39, 'believers were in solitary confinement for many, many years. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 213, 16, 39, 'followed in the footsteps of the apostle Paul. I admire such men');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 213, 17, 39, 'greatly. We can sympathize with suffering believers better when we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 213, 18, 39, 'ourselves face some suffering for Christ''s sake.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 213, 19, 39, 'God has some special ministry for you all in the future. I believe that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 213, 20, 39, 'with all my heart. God has His Hand on your lives. Your spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 213, 21, 39, 'education therefore will be special.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 213, 22, 39, 'The 6-year period from November 1969 (when the Bakht-Singh assemblies');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 213, 23, 39, 'rejected me) to August 1975 (when CFC started) was quite a confusing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 213, 24, 39, 'time for me, because I did not know what God wanted me to do. And I had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 213, 25, 39, 'a wife and three children (at that time) to look after as well. It was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 213, 26, 39, 'like pitch darkness, with no word from heaven. But now when I look back,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 213, 27, 39, 'I see that it pleased the Lord to crush me and break me thoroughly in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 213, 28, 39, 'those years to prepare me for the ministry He had in store for me. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 214, 1, 39, 'you love Him, He will crush you as well, until nothing of Adam is left');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 214, 2, 39, 'in you. The greatest thing in the world is not the education that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 214, 3, 39, 'are getting in college or the experience that you will get when working');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 214, 4, 39, 'in some company. The greatest thing is the education that God Himself is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 214, 5, 39, 'giving you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 214, 6, 39, 'So never lose faith in these two facts:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 214, 7, 39, '(1) That God makes all things work together for good to those who love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 214, 8, 39, 'him (Rom. 8:28).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 214, 9, 39, '(2) That God will never allow you to be tested beyond your ability, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 214, 10, 39, 'will give you the necessary grace with each testing (1 Cor. 10:13).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 214, 11, 39, 'God''s word is true and everything else is a lie. Trust in God with all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 214, 12, 39, 'your heart and do not ever lean on your own understanding.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 214, 13, 39, 'May the Lord encourage you and make His face to shine upon you and grant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 214, 14, 39, 'you His mercy in all of life''s situations. God has been tremendously');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 214, 15, 39, 'merciful to us and so we are grateful for whatever He gives us - even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 214, 16, 39, 'for small mercies. Everything we get is far better than the hellfire');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 214, 17, 39, 'that we deserve!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 214, 18, 39, 'Trusting God in Adversity');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 214, 19, 39, 'We must read 1 Timothy 3:16 (" The mystery of godliness is great -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 214, 20, 39, 'Christ was manifest in the flesh and declared righteous in his spirit ")');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 214, 21, 39, 'along with the next verse, 1 Tim.4:1 (" But the Spirit says that some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 214, 22, 39, 'will fall away from the faith"). In the last days, believers will not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 214, 23, 39, 'take seriously the calling to follow Jesus Who walked on earth in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 214, 24, 39, 'purity, humility and love - as a Man just like the rest of us. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 214, 25, 39, 'walked the way of suffering all through His life, and that way is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 214, 26, 39, 'attractive to modern Christianity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 214, 27, 39, 'Here are three examples of how the Father allowed Jesus to suffer and to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 214, 28, 39, 'walk by faith, without any evidence that would satisfy His earthly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 215, 1, 39, 'senses:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 215, 2, 39, '(1) The last request that Jesus made to His Father, after having lived a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 215, 3, 39, 'life of perfect obedience to His Father for 33 years on earth (" Let');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 215, 4, 39, 'this cup pass from Me"), was not granted.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 215, 5, 39, '(2) The last question that Jesus asked His Father (" Why have You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 215, 6, 39, 'forsaken Me") was not answered.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 215, 7, 39, '(3) The last that this world saw of Jesus was when He was stripped to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 215, 8, 39, 'His underwear, and publicly humiliated, and misunderstood as a criminal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 215, 9, 39, '- when He hung on the cross.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 215, 10, 39, 'How many are willing to follow the Lord, when He says "No" to their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 215, 11, 39, 'prayer-requests, and does not answer their questions, and allows them to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 215, 12, 39, 'be publicly humiliated - even when they have lived a life of obedience');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 215, 13, 39, 'to Him. That is the life of faith - a life of perfect trust in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 215, 14, 39, 'all-wise ordering of our Heavenly Father of all our circumstances, and a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 215, 15, 39, 'perfect submission to all those circumstances, without a question.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 215, 16, 39, 'Respecting the Boundaries That God Has Set');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 215, 17, 39, 'Jesus prayed that Peter would not lose his faith when being sifted by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 215, 18, 39, 'Satan (Lk.22:31, 32). It is when we are in the midst of worldly company');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 215, 19, 39, '(as Peter was) that Satan tries to sift us and to lead us astray.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 215, 20, 39, 'Since you are seeking to live for the Lord wholeheartedly, I am sure');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 215, 21, 39, 'that you will be a target of Satan, and especially since we your parents');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 215, 22, 39, 'are serving the Lord. But that is an honour to be high-up on Satan''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 215, 23, 39, 'hit-list. But it also means that we must be wise and careful. We don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 215, 24, 39, 'have to be afraid - for we don''t fear Satan any more. Satan was defeated');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 215, 25, 39, 'once-for-all on the cross, and is like a paralyzed cobra now - not dead,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 215, 26, 39, 'but powerless over us, as long as we stay crucified with Christ. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 215, 27, 39, 'Satan is deceitful and cunning and can draw us away from the Lord -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 215, 28, 39, 'especially through worldly-minded friends.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 216, 1, 39, 'Adam''s and Eve''s failure in Eden came because they did not respect the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 216, 2, 39, 'boundaries that God had drawn around them . God is the only One Who has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 216, 3, 39, 'no boundaries. As created beings, all of us have boundaries drawn around');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 216, 4, 39, 'us by God. We must respect those boundaries at all times. There are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 216, 5, 39, 'certain things that are forbidden. It is in our own interests that God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 216, 6, 39, 'has forbidden them. But those forbidden things can look very attractive.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 216, 7, 39, 'Therein lies their temptation and drawing power to our flesh.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 216, 8, 39, '"A serpent will bite him who breaks through a wall" (the boundary that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 216, 9, 39, 'God has set around him) (Eccl.10:8).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 216, 10, 39, 'To live by faith in God is to believe that God''s opinion of the things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 216, 11, 39, 'He has forbidden is correct and that Satan''s and our friends'' opinions');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 216, 12, 39, 'of them are all wrong. We say, "Let God be true and every man a liar"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 216, 13, 39, '(Rom.3:4).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 216, 14, 39, 'Curiosity also is a dangerous thing. Adam and Eve were curious to know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 216, 15, 39, 'how that forbidden fruit tasted. This is how many are drawn into sin -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 216, 16, 39, 'to pornographic books and movies and to drugs etc. Adam by himself may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 216, 17, 39, 'not have eaten from that tree - we don''t know. But he was led to it by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 216, 18, 39, 'Eve. And that is how it is with many young people. By themselves, they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 216, 19, 39, 'may not do many forbidden things. But they are led to those things by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 216, 20, 39, 'their friends. So you must learn to say `NO'' to your friends - and be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 216, 21, 39, 'willing to be unpopular with them, because you want God''s approval');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 216, 22, 39, 'alone. Like Daniel, you must determine in your heart, " not to defile');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 216, 23, 39, 'yourself " (Dan.1:8).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 216, 24, 40, 'Chapter 39 Chapter 39');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 216, 25, 40, 'Purpose of Grace');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 216, 26, 40, 'I read a lovely word this morning: " Asleep? Get up! Pray to God that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 216, 27, 40, 'you will not fall when you are tempted " (Lk.22:46 - Living).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 216, 28, 40, 'To avoid sin, because we will be punished if we sin, is the old-covenant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 217, 1, 40, 'way of avoiding sin (fear of judgment - the threats of the Law). Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 217, 2, 40, 'has come and shown us a better way under the new covenant - to avoid sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 217, 3, 40, 'because it dishonours God and is also harmful to us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 217, 4, 40, 'Every time you sin, you must say, "I did not get grace there". Because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 217, 5, 40, 'if you were under grace at that moment, no sin could have had power over');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 217, 6, 40, 'you (as Rom.6:14 makes plain). And then, you must go to the next step');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 217, 7, 40, 'and say to yourself, " I did not receive grace, because I was proud');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 217, 8, 40, 'somewhere or the other - for God always gives grace to the humble ". So');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 217, 9, 40, 'what you should pray whenever you fall into sin is, "Lord, show me where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 217, 10, 40, 'I was proud, that you could not give me grace ". Pride alone hinders us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 217, 11, 40, 'from receiving God''s grace. Perhaps your pride may have been in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 217, 12, 40, 'self-confidence that made you feel that you don''t need to cry out to God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 217, 13, 40, 'for help "in your time of need". Perhaps that is why you fell. If so,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 217, 14, 40, 'you can learn a lesson for the future.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 217, 15, 40, 'Eternal life is the life of eternity - the life that places more value');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 217, 16, 40, 'on eternal things than temporal things - and that sees all earthly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 217, 17, 40, 'things in the light of eternity. This is the life that we are told to "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 217, 18, 40, 'lay hold of" (1 Tim.6:12) - like a man in a pit laying hold of a rope,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 217, 19, 40, 'so that he can be lifted out of the pit. Lay hold of eternal life with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 217, 20, 40, 'all your heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 217, 21, 40, 'The first thing that we all need to work out our salvation from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 217, 22, 40, '(Phil.2:12, 13) is mentioned in the very next verse (v.14) - grumbling,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 217, 23, 40, 'arguing, disputing, complaining, quarrelling, murmuring. In other words,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 217, 24, 40, 'never be discontent. Godliness with contentment is great gain (1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 217, 25, 40, 'Tim.6:6).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 217, 26, 40, 'A slave is one who has no rights, and who can never complain no matter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 217, 27, 40, 'how he is treated. In the first century, a slave had as much rights as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 217, 28, 40, 'piece of furniture in the house. Jesus became a slave. That is our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 218, 1, 40, 'calling too. Then we shall never have any complaints as to how others');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 218, 2, 40, 'treat us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 218, 3, 40, 'Live for the things that Jesus lived for.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 218, 4, 40, 'Heart of Goodness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 218, 5, 40, 'Jesus said that only One Person was "good" and that was God Himself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 218, 6, 40, 'What we call ''good'' on earth is a relative statement that falls far');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 218, 7, 40, 'short of the goodness found in God. God''s goodness is found in the fact');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 218, 8, 40, 'that He always desires the very best for every man. To a rebellious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 218, 9, 40, 'Israel, God said through Jeremiah, "I know the plans I have for you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 218, 10, 40, 'They are plans for good, to give you a future and a hope" (Jer.29:11).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 218, 11, 40, 'This goodness is what God says, He will " write on our hearts"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 218, 12, 40, '(Heb.8:10). To partake of God''s nature is to have a heart of goodness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 218, 13, 40, 'towards all human beings - wishing only the very best for them, at all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 218, 14, 40, 'times, irrespective of how they treat us. Only God can write such a good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 218, 15, 40, 'nature into our hearts. Any goodness that we produce ourselves will only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 218, 16, 40, 'be superficial, that morally improves our exterior. We need a change in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 218, 17, 40, 'our hearts. And God will do that for all who mourn whenever they see a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 218, 18, 40, 'wrong attitude towards someone in their hearts.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 218, 19, 40, '"The glory of God is His goodness" (Exod.33:18, 19). This is what God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 218, 20, 40, 'told Moses when Moses asked to see the glory of God. This is the glory');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 218, 21, 40, 'that "all men have fallen short of" (Rom.3:23). And this is the glory');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 218, 22, 40, 'that Jesus has come to restore to us. So let us mourn each time we find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 218, 23, 40, 'ourselves coming short of goodness to others. Let us fight the battle');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 218, 24, 40, 'here and be good to one and all.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 218, 25, 40, 'But the Holy Spirit warns us that in the last days, " evil men will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 218, 26, 40, 'become worse and worse" (2 Tim.3:13). And on the last page of the Bible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 218, 27, 40, 'we read, "Let the one who does wrong, still do wrong; and the one who is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 218, 28, 40, 'filthy, still be filthy" (Rev.22:11 - Living). Why is there such an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 219, 1, 40, 'exhortation in Bible that urges evildoers to continue doing evil and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 219, 2, 40, 'remain in sin? Because, if, a person, after reading the whole Bible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 219, 3, 40, '(that urges holy living) comes to its last page and still wants to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 219, 4, 40, 'continue in evil, then there is no hope for him. God has given up on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 219, 5, 40, 'him. So let him continue doing evil and destroy himself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 219, 6, 40, 'Turning Failures into Blessings');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 219, 7, 40, 'My own experience has been that the more I have seen how much I grieved');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 219, 8, 40, 'the Lord in my younger days, the more zealous I have been to do more for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 219, 9, 40, 'the Lord in the days to come. The one who has been forgiven more always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 219, 10, 40, 'loves the Lord more. Thus, even my failures have turned out to be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 219, 11, 40, 'blessing to me - because they have made me love the Lord more for having');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 219, 12, 40, 'forgiven me so much. This is why I have felt constantly that I have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 219, 13, 40, 'do so much more for him - for I have been forgiven very, very much.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 219, 14, 40, 'Because of that I have never despised any brother in any CFC church, no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 219, 15, 40, 'matter how deeply he may have fallen. This has also saved me from being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 219, 16, 40, 'puffed up when I get victory. It is Jesus Who keeps me from falling. How');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 219, 17, 40, 'wonderful that God is to be able to turn even our failures into glory');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 219, 18, 40, 'for His Name.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 219, 19, 40, 'There is a first century writing (written between 70 and 132 AD), called');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 219, 20, 40, '" The Epistle of Barnabas" in which the author writes, " When the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 219, 21, 40, 'chose His apostles who were to proclaim His gospel, He chose those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 219, 22, 40, 'were sinners above every sin, in order that He might show that He came');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 219, 23, 40, 'not to call the righteous but sinners" . God does this so that no man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 219, 24, 40, 'can boast. This is what has kept me from boasting all these years, for I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 219, 25, 40, 'know it was " amazing grace that saved a wretch like me".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 219, 26, 40, 'Be faithful now in the little things - and then the Lord will commit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 219, 27, 40, 'much more to you in the days to come. God has a special plan for your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 219, 28, 40, 'life. Make sure that it is fulfilled. All that you have experienced in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 220, 1, 40, 'your life and in your encounters with other Christian groups so far, are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 220, 2, 40, 'preparing you to fulfil God''s perfect plan.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 220, 3, 40, 'Some Insights from ''THE SCREWTAPE LETTERS'' by C.S.Lewis');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 220, 4, 40, 'I read something from `THE SCREWTAPE LETTERS'' the other day about sex,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 220, 5, 40, 'love and marriage that I am sure will bless you. C. S. Lewis who wrote');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 220, 6, 40, 'it had amazing insight. If you can get a hold of that book there, get it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 220, 7, 40, 'and read it. It is all about how Satan trains his demons to tempt men to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 220, 8, 40, 'sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 220, 9, 40, 'Screwtape (the senior devil) tells Wormwood (the junior devil) that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 220, 10, 40, 'demons have succeeded in convincing most men that "a curious and usually');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 220, 11, 40, 'short-lived, experience which they call ''being in love'' is the only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 220, 12, 40, 'respectable ground for marriage" and that "the very idea of marrying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 220, 13, 40, 'with any other motive is ridiculous".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 220, 14, 40, 'He goes on to say that demons have also influenced artists to draw the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 220, 15, 40, 'female figure falsely - "pinched in and propped up to make them appear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 220, 16, 40, 'firmer, more slender and shapelier than nature allows any of them to be,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 220, 17, 40, 'in real life" . This results in men desiring a type of female that does');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 220, 18, 40, 'not exist - which leads them to frustration!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 220, 19, 40, 'In another chapter, C. S. Lewis talks about the up and down experiences');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 220, 20, 40, 'that all human beings have in their feelings and how Satan seeks to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 220, 21, 40, 'exploit this for his evil purposes. Lewis emphasises that the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 220, 22, 40, '"relies on our troughs even more than on our peaks". In other words, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 220, 23, 40, 'is when we are feeling "down" that the Lord seeks to draw near to us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 220, 24, 40, 'The Lord allows such feelings to come to us, in order to strengthen our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 220, 25, 40, 'wills so that we obey the Lord even when we have no sense of His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 220, 26, 40, 'presence. It is in the "trough" periods that we can be tempted with many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 220, 27, 40, 'sensual temptations, particularly those of sex.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 220, 28, 40, 'Justified to Justify Others');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 221, 1, 40, 'The secret of remaining in humility at all times is to look at Jesus all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 221, 2, 40, 'the time and compare our lives with His alone. This is the theme of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 221, 3, 40, 'letter to the Hebrews - to look at the earthly life of Jesus. As long as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 221, 4, 40, 'we meditate on the selfless way in which He came from heaven and lived');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 221, 5, 40, 'here on earth to serve and save others, we can never become proud, for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 221, 6, 40, 'we will see our own selfishness. And we will put our mouth in the dust');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 221, 7, 40, 'constantly in repentance. We will then be able to treat others in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 221, 8, 40, 'same way as the Lord treats us. As He justifies us, we will justify');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 221, 9, 40, 'others too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 221, 10, 40, 'When we see that God has been so good to us as to cover the filthiness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 221, 11, 40, 'of our flesh, we too should be ready to cover the filthiness of others,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 221, 12, 40, 'instead of criticizing them and condemning them. In Zechariah 3, we read');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 221, 13, 40, 'how Joshua stood with filthy garments before God the Judge. Satan was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 221, 14, 40, 'there to accuse him and Jesus was there as his Advocate. Zechariah was a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 221, 15, 40, 'bystander in the court. Satan''s accusations were nullified, because God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 221, 16, 40, 'clothed Joshua with clean garments (the righteousness of Jesus).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 221, 17, 40, 'Zechariah was so excited by this that he added, " Let them put a clean');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 221, 18, 40, 'turban on his head also". Thus he became a co-worker with Jesus to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 221, 19, 40, 'justify his brother. This is what we must do too. There are only two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 221, 20, 40, 'ministries possible when we see evil in others - accusation or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 221, 21, 40, 'intercession. We can choose which we want. Satan accuses. Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 221, 22, 40, 'intercedes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 221, 23, 40, 'True and Counterfeit Holiness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 221, 24, 40, 'Any holiness or zeal that is not coupled with a deep humility, is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 221, 25, 40, 'counterfeit. It is a holiness produced by the law, by human effort.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 221, 26, 40, 'There are many who, by practising yoga, have conquered some of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 221, 27, 40, 'external manifestations of anger and sexual lust (but these sins still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 221, 28, 40, 'remain in their hearts). Such `holiness'' is counterfeit. Jesus always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 222, 1, 40, 'delivers us from sin within our hearts. True holiness is partaken of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 222, 2, 40, 'through grace - and God gives His grace only to the humble. So that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 222, 3, 40, 'the way to identify true holiness - by its being accompanied by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 222, 4, 40, 'humility of Christ. And as for zeal, many Communist youth have more zeal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 222, 5, 40, 'than others, but it is a human zeal.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 222, 6, 40, 'Jesus told us to learn only two things from Him - humility and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 222, 7, 40, 'gentleness (Matt.11:29). Where these two lessons have not been learnt,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 222, 8, 40, 'everything else is in vain.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 222, 9, 40, 'Love - The Mark of Jesus'' Disciples');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 222, 10, 40, 'Jesus did not say that people would recognize us as His disciples when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 222, 11, 40, 'we agreed with each other or when we work together in one group, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 222, 12, 40, 'when we love one another (John 13:35). When Paul and Barnabas disagreed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 222, 13, 40, 'sharply about John Mark (Acts 15:39), they did not fight with each');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 222, 14, 40, 'other, but separated from each other in peace, and continued to love one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 222, 15, 40, 'another. As a result, God blessed the labours of both of them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 222, 16, 40, 'If however either Paul or Barnabas had called the other brother a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 222, 17, 40, '`harlot'' or `antichrist'', then God''s blessing would certainly have been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 222, 18, 40, 'withheld from the one who had a wrong attitude towards his brother. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 222, 19, 40, 'is best therefore to leave others alone who disagree with us or leave');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 222, 20, 40, 'us, and to concentrate on the work that God has given us to do. It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 222, 21, 40, 'important that the platform for our ministry in the church is always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 222, 22, 40, 'positive and never negative - not anti-anyone, but pro-Jesus Christ . We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 222, 23, 40, 'will continue to expose error and false doctrine and un-Christlike');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 222, 24, 40, 'practices among preachers. But we are not against them. We are only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 222, 25, 40, 'against the Devil.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 222, 26, 41, 'Chapter 40 Chapter 40');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 222, 27, 41, 'The New Covenant Life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 222, 28, 41, 'The new covenant is an agreement that God has made with man, " signed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 223, 1, 41, 'with Jesus'' blood" (Heb.13:20 - Living). Now we have to put our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 223, 2, 41, 'signature on it with the blood of our Self-life. There is no other way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 223, 3, 41, 'to enter into that agreement with God. It is because many do not sign on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 223, 4, 41, 'the dotted line with the blood of their Self-life that they never enter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 223, 5, 41, 'into a satisfying Christian life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 223, 6, 41, 'Jesus'' covenant with His Father throughout His life was that He would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 223, 7, 41, 'never once use His body to do His own will (Heb.10:5ff). He would put');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 223, 8, 41, 'his own will to death and thus He signed that covenant with the "blood"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 223, 9, 41, '(crucifixion) of His own will. We are now called to fellowship with Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 223, 10, 41, 'in the same way. This way is not a strain to walk in at all. On the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 223, 11, 41, 'contrary it will lead you to the happiest life (free from strain) that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 223, 12, 41, 'you can ever live. It is to this covenant that we testify when we get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 223, 13, 41, 'baptized and also when we break bread together.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 223, 14, 41, 'The new wine that Jesus spoke of in Luke 5:38, refers to the life of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 223, 15, 41, 'that we can partake of under the new covenant. The old wine refers to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 223, 16, 41, 'the life under the Law - a life of rules and regulations. The two trees');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 223, 17, 41, 'in the Garden of Eden also symbolize life under these two covenants. A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 223, 18, 41, 'life held back from sin (and looking apparently upright) by many rules');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 223, 19, 41, 'and regulations (as found in cult-groups) leads to death, as God warned');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 223, 20, 41, 'Adam about the tree of knowledge of good and evil. True Christianity is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 223, 21, 41, 'a life that springs from partaking of the life of Jesus within, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 223, 22, 41, 'warns us that certain things are dirty and certain other things are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 223, 23, 41, 'clean. We have freedom of choice, but we don''t avoid things because we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 223, 24, 41, 'are bound by any rules ("Touch not, taste not" - Col.2:21), or to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 223, 25, 41, 'impress other people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 223, 26, 41, 'The new wineskin speaks of the Body of Christ, which is built, when we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 223, 27, 41, 'present our body to Him as a living sacrifice every day, and ask Him to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 223, 28, 41, 'fill us with the Holy Spirit, so that the same work that the Spirit did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 224, 1, 41, 'in Jesus'' body in His earthly days can be done in us too. This makes us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 224, 2, 41, 'one with others who are walking the same way. Thus we are made into one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 224, 3, 41, 'body in Christ, the church, in which He equips us with gifts necessary');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 224, 4, 41, 'to build one another up.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 224, 5, 41, 'Thus Satan is crushed under our feet (Rom.16:20). When we give room to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 224, 6, 41, 'Satan to accuse us or to make us feel guilty, then he sits on our head.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 224, 7, 41, 'But his place is under our feet.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 224, 8, 41, 'Sin is defined (in Rom.3:23) as coming short of God''s glory - and God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 224, 9, 41, 'glory was seen in the life of Jesus. So remember that anything that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 224, 10, 41, 'cannot do in fellowship with Jesus is sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 224, 11, 41, 'Under the old covenant, sin could only be covered (by the blood of bulls');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 224, 12, 41, 'and goats), and not removed (Psa.32:1, 2). It could not be cleansed or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 224, 13, 41, 'blotted out. There was a constant remembrance of it year after year');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 224, 14, 41, '(Heb.10:3, 4). Under the new covenant however all our sin is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 224, 15, 41, 'onlycleansed by Jesus'' blood, but God promises that He will never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 224, 16, 41, 'remember them any more (Heb.8:12). You must understand this difference');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 224, 17, 41, 'between the two covenants clearly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 224, 18, 41, 'Living in The Presence of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 224, 19, 41, 'The Holy Spirit reveals to us in Acts 2:25, 26 as to why in the days of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 224, 20, 41, 'His flesh, Jesus was never shaken by any trial or temptation, and why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 224, 21, 41, 'His heart was always full of joy: He always set the Father before Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 224, 22, 41, 'He lived conscious of the fact that His Father was always in front of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 224, 23, 41, 'Him. Therefore the Father was also at His right hand to support and help');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 224, 24, 41, 'Him (as it says in the same verse).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 224, 25, 41, 'We know how much we are kept from sinning even when a godly brother is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 224, 26, 41, 'with us. How many sins we would have avoided, if even an ordinary');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 224, 27, 41, 'brother had been with us at the time when we were tempted. How much more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 224, 28, 41, 'we would have been saved from sin if we had recognized the presence of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 225, 1, 41, 'the Lord with us at that time. We would have been saved from anger and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 225, 2, 41, 'filthy reading and filthy TV viewing in the past if we had recognized');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 225, 3, 41, 'the presence of the Lord in front of us always. How easy it would have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 225, 4, 41, 'been to stand up for the Lord in the midst of unbelievers, if we had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 225, 5, 41, 'only sensed the presence of the Lord with us on such occasions. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 225, 6, 41, 'why you must now seek to develop the consciousness of the presence of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 225, 7, 41, 'the Lord with you. This is not imagining something that is untrue - but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 225, 8, 41, 'rather recognizing something that is true.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 225, 9, 41, 'Because we live so much in the flesh, unfortunately we sense only what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 225, 10, 41, 'our body senses. We need to develop our spiritual sense to recognize the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 225, 11, 41, 'presence of the Lord with us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 225, 12, 41, 'Faith - In the Head or In the Heart?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 225, 13, 41, 'God asked Jeremiah a question in Jer.32:27: " Is anything too difficult');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 225, 14, 41, 'for Me?" If we were asked that question, we would all answer correctly:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 225, 15, 41, '" No. Nothing is too difficult for God." But if, in the moments of trial');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 225, 16, 41, 'and testing, we don''t actually trust God with our hearts, then we will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 225, 17, 41, 'act as though many things were difficult for God. Faith in the head is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 225, 18, 41, 'quite different from faith in the heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 225, 19, 41, 'To understand the background in which Jeremiah prophesied, let me tell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 225, 20, 41, 'you of Israel''s history up to that time. The nation of Israel had left');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 225, 21, 41, 'Egypt around 1490 B.C. and entered Canaan around 1450 B.C. But about 500');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 225, 22, 41, 'years later, in 975 B.C., in the time of Rehoboam (Solomon''s son) they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 225, 23, 41, 'split into two nations. The northern nation called itself Israel and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 225, 24, 41, 'comprised of 10 tribes. The southern nation called itself Judah and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 225, 25, 41, 'comprised of the tribes of Judah and Benjamin. Israel (the northern');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 225, 26, 41, 'nation) soon became terribly idolatrous and was sent by God into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 225, 27, 41, 'captivity around 730 B.C. - after existing for 250 years as a nation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 225, 28, 41, 'They were enslaved by Assyria who were the world rulers of that time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 226, 1, 41, '100 years later (around 640 B.C.), God sent His prophet Jeremiah to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 226, 2, 41, 'southern nation of Judah, and told Judah to take a lesson from what had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 226, 3, 41, 'happened to the northern kingdom (Israel), lest God punish them also in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 226, 4, 41, 'the same way. But Judah did not listen to Jeremiah, imagining that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 226, 5, 41, 'would never be punished by God - just like many believers think today.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 226, 6, 41, 'But after Jeremiah had prophesied to Judah for over 40 years, God sent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 226, 7, 41, 'Nebuchadnezzar, the king of Babylon, to attack Jerusalem (around 600');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 226, 8, 41, 'B.C.). Babylon had replaced Assyria by then as the world''s only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 226, 9, 41, 'superpower. It was at this time that the events of Jeremiah chapter 32');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 226, 10, 41, 'take place.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 226, 11, 41, 'God had already told Jeremiah that after 70 years of captivity in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 226, 12, 41, 'Babylon, the nation of Judah would come back to Jerusalem (Jer.29:10).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 226, 13, 41, 'But no-one believed that. Then God told Jeremiah to demonstrate his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 226, 14, 41, 'faith in God''s promise by a significant action. He asked him to buy a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 226, 15, 41, 'plot of land in his hometown of Anathoth and to register the sale and to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 226, 16, 41, 'preserve the sale document in an earthen vessel (Jer.32:14). Humanly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 226, 17, 41, 'speaking that was the most foolish thing to do, at a time when everyone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 226, 18, 41, 'was selling property, because the enemy was plundering the land.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 226, 19, 41, 'Jeremiah however did that to prove that he believed what he preached');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 226, 20, 41, 'that God''s people would come back and occupy the land once more. His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 226, 21, 41, 'response to God at that time was: " Lord, nothing is too difficult for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 226, 22, 41, 'you" (Jer.32:17). (It is good for you to read that whole chapter -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 226, 23, 41, 'Jeremiah 32). Jeremiah''s relatives returned, seventy years later, along');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 226, 24, 41, 'with Zerubbabel (Neh.7:27) and lived in Anathoth - undoubtedly in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 226, 25, 41, 'plot that Jeremiah had purchased 70 years earlier (Neh.11:32).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 226, 26, 41, 'God expects us to act in faith like that, on any matter that He has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 226, 27, 41, 'spoken about, clearly in His Word. But you must act in faith only on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 226, 28, 41, 'basis of some clear promise from God in Scripture - as in Jeremiah''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 227, 1, 41, 'case. You cannot imitate what others do. Here is a warning: Hebrews');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 227, 2, 41, '11:29 says that the Israelites went through the Red Sea acting in faith');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 227, 3, 41, 'on a specific word from God; but when the Egyptians tried to imitate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 227, 4, 41, 'that they were drowned. That is a warning to everyone not to imitate the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 227, 5, 41, 'faith of others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 227, 6, 41, 'When God took the Israelites through the Red Sea, the waters opened up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 227, 7, 41, 'before them and a way was made in front of them, before He asked them to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 227, 8, 41, 'walk through it. That was not walking by faith, but by sight. But the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 227, 9, 41, 'Israelites had had no experience of God up to that time. So God did a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 227, 10, 41, 'miracle for them even before they took a step. He only asked Moses to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 227, 11, 41, 'stretch out his rod over the sea (Exod.14:16, 21).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 227, 12, 41, 'But 40 years later, when God told the Israelites to cross the River');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 227, 13, 41, 'Jordan, it was different. This time, He told the priests to put their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 227, 14, 41, 'feet into the waters, while the river was still flowing. Only when they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 227, 15, 41, 'took that step of faith did the waters part and a way open up for them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 227, 16, 41, '(Josh.3:8, 15). So the priests'' feet had to get wet this time. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 227, 17, 41, 'expected more from the Israelites by then, because they had seen His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 227, 18, 41, 'miracles for 40 years in the wilderness. More is required from those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 227, 19, 41, 'have received more from God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 227, 20, 41, 'We see another illustration of this principle when the Lord told Peter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 227, 21, 41, 'to come out of the boat and to walk on the water. Peter had to step out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 227, 22, 41, 'in faith. As he did so, he found the waters as solid as rock underneath');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 227, 23, 41, 'his feet.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 227, 24, 41, 'Remember always that there is no problem that you can ever face that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 227, 25, 41, 'too hard for God to solve. He has wisdom and power to handle every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 227, 26, 41, 'difficult situation. So trust Him to act on your behalf always. He will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 227, 27, 41, 'never scold you for lacking in wisdom -for not knowing what to do in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 227, 28, 41, 'some difficult situation (See James 1:5b). He is your loving,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 228, 1, 41, 'understanding, compassionate Father.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 228, 2, 41, 'But you must never step out in presumption. Some Christians don''t take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 228, 3, 41, 'any medicines when they are sick, even when there is no Scripture to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 228, 4, 41, 'support their position. That is foolishness and tempting God. Paul');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 228, 5, 41, '(inspired by the Holy Spirit) told Timothy to take some wine (as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 228, 6, 41, 'medicine) for his frequent stomach-ailments (1 Tim.5:23). The Septuagint');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 228, 7, 41, '(which is a Greek translation of the Old Testament) says in Proverbs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 228, 8, 41, '18:9: "He who is loose and slack in his work is brother to him who is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 228, 9, 41, 'destroyer and he who does not use his endeavors to heal himself is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 228, 10, 41, 'brother to him who commits suicide " (Amplified Bible-Classic Edition).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 228, 11, 41, '[That, by the way, is the only place in the Bible, where the word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 228, 12, 41, '"suicide" is mentioned.]');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 228, 13, 41, 'We must act only on the basis of a specific Word of God. The priests put');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 228, 14, 41, 'their feet into the River Jordan only because God had specifically told');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 228, 15, 41, 'them to do so. Peter stepped out into the sea only because the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 228, 16, 41, 'specifically told him to come out of the boat. Faith is vastly different');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 228, 17, 41, 'from presumption.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 228, 18, 41, 'A Higher Call');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 228, 19, 41, 'The Lord''s call to John from heaven was "come up here" (Rev.4:1). In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 228, 20, 41, 'Rev.1:9, we read that John was on earth - on the island of Patmos - and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 228, 21, 41, 'the Lord showed him many things about the conditions of the churches');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 228, 22, 41, '(Rev.2 & 3). Then the Lord invited John to come up higher, into the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 228, 23, 41, 'heavenly places. Then he saw many other things that he would never have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 228, 24, 41, 'seen if he had stayed at the earth-level. The Lord did not take him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 228, 25, 41, 'higher. He had to respond to the Lord''s invitation and choose to go up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 228, 26, 41, 'higher himself. If he had not responded to that invitation, the book of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 228, 27, 41, 'Revelation would have ended with three chapters! It is the same with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 228, 28, 41, 'many believers. When the Lord invites them to come up higher to a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 229, 1, 41, 'heavenly way of thinking, they don''t respond, and so they remain earthly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 229, 2, 41, 'all their days. Only those who are willing to be spiritually violent to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 229, 3, 41, 'their lazy and slack attitudes towards spiritual things and to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 229, 4, 41, 'opposition and traditions of men will ever be able to possess the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 229, 5, 41, 'kingdom of heaven (Matt.11:12).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 229, 6, 41, '"Light arises in the darkness for the upright" (Psa.112:4). This whole');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 229, 7, 41, 'psalm (Psa.112) is a wonderful one that tells of the blessings of being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 229, 8, 41, 'absolutely upright and righteous in all areas of our life. Then it says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 229, 9, 41, 'that those who hate us (especially the Devil, and anyone who is in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 229, 10, 41, 'fellowship with him) will be vexed when they see how well it is going');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 229, 11, 41, 'with us (last few verses).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 229, 12, 41, 'So, even though our past failures may have been many and so great that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 229, 13, 41, 'we would have to hang our heads in shame, yet we lift up our heads,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 229, 14, 41, 'because we have been " accepted in the beloved (Son)" (Eph.1:6-KJV), and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 229, 15, 41, 'our past has been " blotted out " forever (Hebrews 8:12 - " I will not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 229, 16, 41, 'remember their sins any more " and especially Isaiah 44:22 - " I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 229, 17, 41, 'blotted out as a thick cloud your transgressions. Return to Me for I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 229, 18, 41, 'have redeemed you ". Remember these two verses by heart).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 229, 19, 42, 'Chapter 41 Chapter 41');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 229, 20, 42, 'Life Attested By God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 229, 21, 42, 'Peter referred to Jesus as a Man attested by God (Acts 2:22). Since we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 229, 22, 42, 'know that God loves us as He loved Jesus (John 17:23) we can be sure');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 229, 23, 42, 'that He will do for us all that He did for Jesus too ( if we fulfil the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 229, 24, 42, 'same conditions that Jesus did). We can expect God to attest our lives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 229, 25, 42, 'also - not necessarily with miracles, but in whichever way He chooses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 229, 26, 42, 'best. John the Baptist (whom Jesus called the greatest prophet of all -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 229, 27, 42, 'Matt.11:11) never did a single miracle (John 10:41) and He never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 229, 28, 42, 'prophesied about the future. Yet God attested his life and ministry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 230, 1, 42, 'amazingly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 230, 2, 42, 'We must be a living demonstration to the world around us of the fact');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 230, 3, 42, 'that our God rules in the heavens and cares for us and that He is always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 230, 4, 42, 'on our side against Satan, and that He desires to " supply all our needs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 230, 5, 42, 'by His riches in glory in Christ Jesus" (Phil.4:19), and that He will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 230, 6, 42, 'crush Satan under our feet (Rom.16:20).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 230, 7, 42, 'God may allow us to face many trials and testings. But He will never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 230, 8, 42, 'allow them to become more than what we can bear at each stage of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 230, 9, 42, 'spiritual development (1 Cor.10:13). But in every trial, He will make us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 230, 10, 42, 'come out triumphant (2 Cor.2:14). We are not promised clear skies at all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 230, 11, 42, 'times. But we are promised victory at all times.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 230, 12, 42, 'Here is a lovely poem that I read on those lines:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 230, 13, 42, 'WHAT GOD HAS PROMISED');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 230, 14, 42, '"God has not promised skies always blue,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 230, 15, 42, 'Flower-strewn pathways, all our lives through;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 230, 16, 42, 'God has not promised sun without rain,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 230, 17, 42, 'Joy without sorrow, peace without pain.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 230, 18, 42, 'God has not promised we shall not know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 230, 19, 42, 'Toil and temptation, trouble and woe;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 230, 20, 42, 'He has not told us we shall not bear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 230, 21, 42, 'Many a burden, many a care.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 230, 22, 42, 'God has not promised smooth roads and wide,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 230, 23, 42, 'Swift, easy travels, needing no guide;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 230, 24, 42, 'Never a mountain, rocky and steep,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 230, 25, 42, 'Never a river, turbid and deep.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 230, 26, 42, 'But God has promised strength for the day,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 230, 27, 42, 'Rest for the labour, light for the way,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 230, 28, 42, 'Grace for the trials, help from above,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 231, 1, 42, 'Unfailing sympathy, undying love." (Annie Johnson Flint)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 231, 2, 42, 'Faith to Receive Physical Healing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 231, 3, 42, '1 Corinthians 6 tells us four things about our bodies.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 231, 4, 42, '(1) Our body is a member of Christ (v.15).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 231, 5, 42, '(2) Our body is the temple of the Holy Spirit (v.19).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 231, 6, 42, '(3) Our body is to be for the Lord alone (v.13).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 231, 7, 42, '(4) Then the Lord is for our body (v.13).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 231, 8, 42, 'Therefore, on the basis of those Scriptures, we can claim a measure of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 231, 9, 42, 'the life of Jesus for our body as well - because we need health in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 231, 10, 42, 'body to serve the Lord. We can claim ataste of the resurrection-life of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 231, 11, 42, 'Jesus for our bodies - " a foretaste of the powers of the future age" as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 231, 12, 42, 'it says in Hebrews 6:5. We can ask for health for our bodies - unless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 231, 13, 42, 'God delays or denies that healing for a higher spiritual purpose (as in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 231, 14, 42, 'the case of Paul''s thorn in the flesh - 2 Cor.12:7-9). So whenever we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 231, 15, 42, 'are sick, we must ask God to heal us in Jesus'' Name - or give us His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 231, 16, 42, 'grace to handle our sickness - whichever He thinks is best for us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 231, 17, 42, 'spiritually.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 231, 18, 42, 'Regarding Temperaments');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 231, 19, 42, 'In my younger days, I used to wish that I could be an outgoing,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 231, 20, 42, 'extrovert like others around me, and not the shy, introvert that I was.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 231, 21, 42, 'But I discovered gradually that every temperament has its own unique');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 231, 22, 42, 'strengths as well as weaknesses. I then realized that if I had been an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 231, 23, 42, 'extrovert I may have had certain advantages in reaching out to others as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 231, 24, 42, 'an evangelist, but I would not have been methodical (as introverts are)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 231, 25, 42, 'and thus been able to teach the Bible and write books. God has made each');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 231, 26, 42, 'of us different, with a purpose. He made us in our mother''s womb, to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 231, 27, 42, 'temperamentally suited for the specific task that He had designed for us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 231, 28, 42, 'in Christ''s Body. So we don''t have to envy another person''s temperament,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 232, 1, 42, 'intelligence, or gifts. Even the drive to work hard and to get things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 232, 2, 42, 'done is part of the temperament of the choleric extrovert. So we don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 232, 3, 42, 'have to be discouraged if we don''t have the same drive that another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 232, 4, 42, 'person has. God made no mistake in making us exactly what we are. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 232, 5, 42, 'must accept ourselves as God made us, in relation to our basic');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 232, 6, 42, 'temperament and our physical features, without any complaints and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 232, 7, 42, 'without wishing that we were like someone else. But we must seek for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 232, 8, 42, 'God''s help to overcome the specific weaknesses of our temperament.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 232, 9, 42, 'Here is a brief overview of the strengths and weaknesses of the four');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 232, 10, 42, 'basic temperaments:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 232, 11, 42, 'EXTROVERTS:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 232, 12, 42, '1. CHOLERIC. Strong-willed, determined, independent, decisive and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 232, 13, 42, 'confident. But they get angry easily and are domineering. inconsiderate,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 232, 14, 42, 'self-sufficient and unemotional.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 232, 15, 42, '2. SANGUINE. Outgoing, warm, friendly, talkative and carefree. But they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 232, 16, 42, 'are weak-willed, undisciplined and undependable.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 232, 17, 42, 'INTROVERTS');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 232, 18, 42, '1. MELANCHOLIC. Analytical, sensitive, perfectionist, aesthetic and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 232, 19, 42, 'idealistic. But they are moody, critical, impractical, unsociable and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 232, 20, 42, 'easily discouraged.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 232, 21, 42, '2. PHLEGMATIC. Calm, easy-going, laid-back, diplomatic and humorous. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 232, 22, 42, 'they are stingy, fearful, indecisive, procrastinators and sluggish.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 232, 23, 42, 'So which would you choose?? Praise God that the Holy Spirit has come to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 232, 24, 42, 'help us overcome the weaknesses of our temperament and to make us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 232, 25, 42, 'balanced and Christlike. So if you submit to the Holy Spirit each day,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 232, 26, 42, 'He will gradually change you into the likeness of Christ and you will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 232, 27, 42, 'gradually overcome every temperamental weakness that you have.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 232, 28, 42, 'We must never forget that the body we have is called " the body of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 233, 1, 42, 'humble state" (Phil.3:21). It is improper for us therefore, as long as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 233, 2, 42, 'we are in this body, to exalt ourselves over even a single other human');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 233, 3, 42, 'being in any way, or to make anyone else feel small by anything that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 233, 4, 42, 'do or say. Jesus " being made in the likeness of men became a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 233, 5, 42, 'bondservant" (Phil.2:7). That means that He realized that the only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 233, 6, 42, 'proper position for a man to take is that of a servant.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 233, 7, 42, 'It is not godliness by itself that brings great spiritual gain into our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 233, 8, 42, 'lives, but godliness with frugality and contentment (1 Tim.6:6 -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 233, 9, 42, 'Paraphrase). Godliness without frugality and contentment is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 233, 10, 42, 'counterfeit. When we have learnt to be content with our financial');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 233, 11, 42, 'circumstances and never compare our lot with that of others who have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 233, 12, 42, 'more, and if we have learnt to live frugally with what we have, then we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 233, 13, 42, 'have learnt two of life''s most important lessons. God keeps us on earth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 233, 14, 42, 'to teach us to live simply and to give thanks for all things. Let us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 233, 15, 42, 'learn those two lessons quickly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 233, 16, 42, 'Spirit of Thankfulness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 233, 17, 42, 'The Lord''s earnest desire and longing on the last night before His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 233, 18, 42, 'crucifixion was to break bread with His disciples (Luke 22:15). We too');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 233, 19, 42, 'must have a similar longing for fellowship with the Lord and with all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 233, 20, 42, 'His children. Only then will the breaking of bread become meaningful to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 233, 21, 42, 'us. Jesus took the bread and gave thanks (1 Cor.11:24). The one bread');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 233, 22, 42, 'symbolizes that we are one Body with the others whom we break it with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 233, 23, 42, '(1Cor.10:17). Jesus giving thanks teaches us to give thanks for all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 233, 24, 42, 'members of the Body of Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 233, 25, 42, 'When we have complaints against one another, Satan sits on top of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 233, 26, 42, 'heads. But his place is under our feet. A spirit of thankfulness to God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 233, 27, 42, 'and for all the brothers and sisters in the church at all times ensures');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 233, 28, 42, 'that Satan will always be under our feet.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 234, 1, 42, 'It is also by a spirit of thankfulness for our brothers and sisters that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 234, 2, 42, 'we know that we are growing in fellowship with one another. An apparent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 234, 3, 42, 'growth in holiness without corresponding growth in fellowship with other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 234, 4, 42, 'believers is a deceptive growth . It is a spirit of thankfulness that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 234, 5, 42, 'indicates that we are actually rooted in humility, which is the only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 234, 6, 42, 'ground on which true holiness grows.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 234, 7, 42, 'The Balanced Gospel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 234, 8, 42, 'The balanced message of the gospel is found in Paul''s letter to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 234, 9, 42, 'Ephesians. In Chapters 1 to 3, there is not a single exhortation. Those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 234, 10, 42, 'chapters only describe what God has done for us. The next three chapters');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 234, 11, 42, 'are then full of exhortations of what we must do for God. These are the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 234, 12, 42, 'two sides of the gospel coin. If either side is absent, the coin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 234, 13, 42, '(gospel) is a counterfeit one. There is a curse pronounced in Galatians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 234, 14, 42, '1 on those who preach "another gospel". So we must be careful to preach');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 234, 15, 42, 'the full gospel - and the correct one - to others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 234, 16, 42, 'God has blessed us with every spiritual blessing in heavenly places in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 234, 17, 42, 'Christ (Eph.1:3). Our Christian life must begin with what God has done.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 234, 18, 42, 'We love Him because He first loved us. We serve Him, because He first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 234, 19, 42, 'served us. God knew us before the creation of the world (Eph.1:4). We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 234, 20, 42, 'can''t understand that because we have past, present and future, whereas');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 234, 21, 42, 'God''s Name is "I AM" (Exod.3:14). God lives in an eternal present. So He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 234, 22, 42, 'knew each of us by name long before He created anything. He placed us in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 234, 23, 42, 'Christ even before the worlds were created.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 234, 24, 42, 'Here is an illustration of what it means to be "in Christ". If you take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 234, 25, 42, 'a piece of paper and put it inside a book, and then burn the book, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 234, 26, 42, 'paper will be burnt too. If you bury the book in the ground the paper');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 234, 27, 42, 'will be buried too. If you send the book up in a rocket to the moon, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 234, 28, 42, 'paper will go to the moon too. In the same way, we were placed in Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 235, 1, 42, '( from all eternity past, in God''s mind). So when Christ was crucified');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 235, 2, 42, 'in A.D. 29, we were crucified with Him. When He was buried, we were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 235, 3, 42, 'buried. When He was raised from the dead and ascended up to heaven, "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 235, 4, 42, 'God raised us up with Christ, and seated us with Him in the heavenly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 235, 5, 42, 'places in Christ Jesus " too (Eph.2:6). This is an amazing truth. But we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 235, 6, 42, 'can experience the reality of it, only if we believe God''s Word - not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 235, 7, 42, 'otherwise. " According to your faith it will be done for you"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 235, 8, 42, '(Matt.9:29), is a law of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 235, 9, 42, 'We must be established in what God has done for us in Christ. Only when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 235, 10, 42, 'that foundation is laid, can we build our house, with the exhortations');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 235, 11, 42, 'found in Ephesians 4 to 6 about walking in a new way and resisting and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 235, 12, 42, 'overcoming Satan etc. Otherwise we will wallow in the mire of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 235, 13, 42, 'discouragement and self-condemnation frequently. So meditate much on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 235, 14, 42, 'Ephesians chapters 1 to 3 first.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 235, 15, 42, 'Many Christians lay the foundation in one place and then build the house');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 235, 16, 42, 'in another! So the house collapses. Every exhortation found in the last');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 235, 17, 42, '3 chapters of Ephesians is based on God''s love for us and His perfect');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 235, 18, 42, 'acceptance of us (mentioned in the first 3 chapters). This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 235, 19, 42, 'elementary. But we still tend to forget it. One day, we think that God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 235, 20, 42, 'will accept us more because we read the Bible for 45 minutes, and on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 235, 21, 42, 'another day, we think that He is frowning on us and won''t listen to our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 235, 22, 42, 'prayers because we did not get even one minute to read the Scriptures.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 235, 23, 42, 'And if something goes wrong, we feel that it was because we didn''t read');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 235, 24, 42, 'the Bible that day! That is superstition, and believing that God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 235, 25, 42, 'acceptance of us is based on our Bible-reading and not on what Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 235, 26, 42, 'has done for us. Bible-reading is no doubt very, very important. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 235, 27, 42, 'that is not the foundation of our acceptance. That is part of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 235, 28, 42, 'superstructure. It is very, very, very important for you to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 236, 1, 42, 'established in this truth. Otherwise the gospel becomes man-centred -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 236, 2, 42, 'and you will be putting doors and windows into the foundation! Those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 236, 3, 42, 'ignore or devalue these truths (found in Ephesians 1 to 3) invariably');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 236, 4, 42, 'end up as Pharisees.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 236, 5, 42, 'But of course, the whole purpose of laying a foundation is to build the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 236, 6, 42, 'house. So we don''t stop with the foundation. We must keep building the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 236, 7, 42, 'superstructure.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 236, 8, 42, '"Grace" is God stretching out His Hand and offering us every heavenly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 236, 9, 42, 'blessing. " Faith " is our hand stretched out to take those blessings');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 236, 10, 42, 'from God''s hand. So we can get only as much as we claim in faith in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 236, 11, 42, 'Jesus'' Name. God has put millions of blessings in our heavenly bank');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 236, 12, 42, 'account and given us numerous blank checks signed with Jesus'' Name. All');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 236, 13, 42, 'we have to do now is fill in the amount and go to the bank and claim our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 236, 14, 42, 'inheritance.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 236, 15, 43, 'Chapter 42 Chapter 42');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 236, 16, 43, 'The Divine Exchange');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 236, 17, 43, 'Let me now share something with you concerning: The divine exchange that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 236, 18, 43, 'took place on Calvary''s cross in three areas - What Jesus became for us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 236, 19, 43, 'and what we can now become in Him as a result.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 236, 20, 43, '(1) Christ became sin for us that we might become the righteousness of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 236, 21, 43, 'God in Him (2 Cor.5:21). This is the glorious truth of justification by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 236, 22, 43, 'faith - a free gift of God for those who are humble enough to realize');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 236, 23, 43, 'that they can never become righteous enough to meet God''s standards.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 236, 24, 43, 'Jesus not only bore the punishment for our sins. He also actually became');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 236, 25, 43, 'sin. We can''t fully understand how awful an experience that was for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 236, 26, 43, 'Jesus, because we have unfortunately become as familiar with sin as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 236, 27, 43, 'pig is with filth. To understand even faintly the revulsion that Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 236, 28, 43, 'had for sin, think of jumping into a full septic tank and becoming');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 237, 1, 43, 'assimilated permanently with the filth and dung in it. That gives us a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 237, 2, 43, 'faint picture of the depth of His love for us, that made Him become what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 237, 3, 43, 'He hated, in order that we might become the righteousness of God in Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 237, 4, 43, 'God''s righteousness is as high above the righteousness of the holiest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 237, 5, 43, 'man on earth as heaven is above the earth. The sinless angels cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 237, 6, 43, 'look at God''s face (Isa.6:2, 3). But we can, because we are in Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 237, 7, 43, 'When we see the awfulness of sin, we will begin to hate that which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 237, 8, 43, 'crucified Jesus. And when we see what we have become in Christ, we will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 237, 9, 43, 'rejoice in our perfect acceptance before God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 237, 10, 43, '(2) Christ became poor for us, that we might become rich (2 Cor.8:9).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 237, 11, 43, 'The context of that verse shows that it is speaking of material poverty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 237, 12, 43, 'and material riches. Christ was once rich, the verse tells us. What does');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 237, 13, 43, 'it mean "to be rich"? To be rich does not mean having lots of money and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 237, 14, 43, 'property, but rather having enough for our needs and some extra to help');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 237, 15, 43, 'and bless others with. This is what God wants all of us to have. Being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 237, 16, 43, 'rich is described in Rev.3:17 as "having need of nothing". That is how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 237, 17, 43, 'God is rich. God does not have silver or gold or a bank account or even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 237, 18, 43, 'a wallet. But He has need of nothing. Jesus, when He was on earth was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 237, 19, 43, 'also rich in this way. He could feed 5000 men besides women and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 237, 20, 43, 'children. Only a rich man could do such a thing today. He had money to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 237, 21, 43, 'pay His taxes. The only difference was that whereas men take money out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 237, 22, 43, 'of their banks to pay their taxes, He took it from the mouth of a fish.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 237, 23, 43, 'He had enough money to give to the poor (John 13:29). He was not poor on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 237, 24, 43, 'earth, for He had "need of nothing". But He did become poor on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 237, 25, 43, 'cross. The poorest beggar we have seen has at least a rag around His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 237, 26, 43, 'body. Jesus did not have even that when He was crucified. He was really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 237, 27, 43, 'poor when he died. Why did He become poor on the cross? That we might');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 237, 28, 43, 'become rich - that we might have " need of nothing" at any time in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 238, 1, 43, 'lives. God has not promised to give us all that we want. Even wise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 238, 2, 43, 'parents don''t give their children all that they want. But He has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 238, 3, 43, 'promised to supply all our needs (Phil.4:19). If we seek God''s kingdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 238, 4, 43, 'first and His righteousness, we will always have everything we need for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 238, 5, 43, 'life on this earth (2 Pet.1:4).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 238, 6, 43, '(3) Christ became a curse for us that we might receive the blessing of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 238, 7, 43, 'Abraham (the promise of the Holy Spirit) (Gal.3:13, 14). The curse for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 238, 8, 43, 'not keeping the Law is described in Deut.28:15-68 - confusion, incurable');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 238, 9, 43, 'sicknesses, plagues, constant failure, blindness, madness, being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 238, 10, 43, 'exploited by others, children lost to the enemy (Satan), stark poverty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 238, 11, 43, 'etc. None of this is for us, because Jesus became a curse for us. Note');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 238, 12, 43, 'however, that the blessing we are promised in lieu is not the blessing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 238, 13, 43, 'of the Law (described in Deut.28:1-14), consisting of much money and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 238, 14, 43, 'many children, but rather the blessing of Abraham (described in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 238, 15, 43, 'Gen.12:2, 3), which is basically: The Lord blessing us and making us a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 238, 16, 43, 'blessing to every person that we come across. This is the blessing that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 238, 17, 43, 'comes through being filled with the Holy Spirit - a well of water');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 238, 18, 43, 'springing up within us and blessing us (John 4:14), and rivers of water');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 238, 19, 43, 'flowing through us and blessing others (John 7:37-39). The Lord''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 238, 20, 43, 'promise to even the worst sinner is that " as he has been a curse in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 238, 21, 43, 'times past, he can be a blessing in the times to come " (Memorize this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 238, 22, 43, 'wonderful promise in Zech.8:13).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 238, 23, 43, 'I believe that it is God''s will to make you a blessing to every person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 238, 24, 43, 'you come across wherever you are living. However, you must believe God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 238, 25, 43, 'for this to take place. Believe that no part of the curse can touch you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 238, 26, 43, 'Satan has been defeated on the cross. So he has no right on any part of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 238, 27, 43, 'your life. Confess these truths with your mouth and be an overcomer all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 238, 28, 43, 'your days.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 239, 1, 43, 'Every blessing of God can become ours only as we actually believe and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 239, 2, 43, 'claim it by faith. We must also confess with our mouths that God''s Word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 239, 3, 43, 'is true. With the heart man believes. But with the mouth, we confess');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 239, 4, 43, 'unto salvation and deliverance (Rom.10:10). That way (" by the word of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 239, 5, 43, 'our testimony"), we overcome Satan''s accusations against us too');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 239, 6, 43, '(Rev.12:11).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 239, 7, 43, 'Hope');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 239, 8, 43, '"Hope" is a new covenant word, just like "grace", " gentleness", "poor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 239, 9, 43, 'in spirit" and "overcome" etc. Very few believers have thought much');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 239, 10, 43, 'about hope. But it is a good word to study in a concordance.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 239, 11, 43, 'Rom.5:2-4 tells us that we exult in hope of the glory of God. We rejoice');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 239, 12, 43, 'in tribulations because if we are patient in those tribulations we will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 239, 13, 43, 'get proven character. That in turn gives us hope. That means that since');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 239, 14, 43, 'we have seen from our past life how God has changed us, we have hope');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 239, 15, 43, 'that the work will be completed by God in us in the days to come.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 239, 16, 43, 'God wants to fill us with hope for the future. We are not to face the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 239, 17, 43, 'future with dismay and gloom, like the people around us. We look forward');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 239, 18, 43, 'with tremendous hope, believing fully that He Who has begun a good work');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 239, 19, 43, 'in us will definitely complete it and bring it to perfection in us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 239, 20, 43, '(Phil.1:6). Hope is the certain antidote for discouragement and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 239, 21, 43, 'moodiness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 239, 22, 43, 'We must hold fast the confession of our hope (Heb.10:23). In other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 239, 23, 43, 'words, we must be bold to confess with our mouths, even if we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 239, 24, 43, 'defeated right now, that God will give us victory and do what He has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 239, 25, 43, 'promised to do within us. We must rejoice in hope. It is normal for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 239, 26, 43, 'believers to thank God for what God has done for them. But we must also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 239, 27, 43, 'rejoice in the hope of what God will do for us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 239, 28, 43, '"Whatever he does will prosper" is the promise in Psalm 1:3. This is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 240, 1, 43, 'will of God for our lives, and we must claim it as our birthright in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 240, 2, 43, 'Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 240, 3, 43, 'Joy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 240, 4, 43, 'Overflowing joy is one of the ways by which we can know that we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 240, 5, 43, 'living in the presence of God - because "in His presence there is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 240, 6, 43, 'fullness of joy" (Psa.16:11). It is also thus that we know that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 240, 7, 43, 'kingdom of God has indeed come into our hearts - for " the kingdom of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 240, 8, 43, 'God is righteousness, peace and joy in the Holy Spirit " (Rom.14:17).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 240, 9, 43, 'This joy can be ours only as we hate sin and love righteousness - for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 240, 10, 43, 'the anointing of the oil of gladness is given to those "who love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 240, 11, 43, 'righteousness and hate iniquity" (Heb.1:9). May the joy of the Lord be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 240, 12, 43, 'your strength at all times (Neh.8:10). Joy will make your battle against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 240, 13, 43, 'temptation much easier.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 240, 14, 43, 'James says that we should rejoice even in the trials that we face');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 240, 15, 43, 'because of two reasons (Jas.1:1-4): (1) we discover whether our faith is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 240, 16, 43, 'genuine or not (That is something like finding out whether the gold we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 240, 17, 43, 'have is genuine or not - so that we don''t fool ourselves that we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 240, 18, 43, 'rich when we are actually poor). (2) Our patience grows to perfection -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 240, 19, 43, 'and then we become perfect and complete, lacking nothing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 240, 20, 43, 'It is amazing what results can come forth from our trials - if we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 240, 21, 43, 'rejoice in them. There is a lot of wasted suffering among believers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 240, 22, 43, 'They don''t get any wealth out of their suffering, because they complain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 240, 23, 43, 'and murmur instead of rejoicing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 240, 24, 43, 'Faith and Patience');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 240, 25, 43, 'In Hebrews 6:12 we read that it is only through faith and patience that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 240, 26, 43, 'we can inherit the promises. So faith alone is not enough. Hebrews 10:36');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 240, 27, 43, 'also says the same thing that you need patience after having done the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 240, 28, 43, 'will of God to inherit the promises of God. The NASB translates the word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 241, 1, 43, '`patience'' as `endurance'' in the above verses - and that''s what it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 241, 2, 43, 'really is.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 241, 3, 43, 'We never have a complaint against anyone who causes us problems, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 241, 4, 43, 'God makes all that others do to us to work for our good (Rom.8:28).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 241, 5, 43, 'Romans 8:28 is like a water-filter. Whatever dirty water people may pour');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 241, 6, 43, 'into it, the water that comes out is perfectly clean and pure at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 241, 7, 43, 'outlet. Whatever people may do to us, good or bad - whether they praise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 241, 8, 43, 'us or curse us, whether they help us or harm us - if we believe in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 241, 9, 43, 'Romans 8:28, what we get out of it will always be good! But we must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 241, 10, 43, 'believe. Faith is like putting on the switch for an electronic');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 241, 11, 43, 'water-filter. It won''t work without the current of faith passing through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 241, 12, 43, 'it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 241, 13, 43, 'So whatever trial comes our way - whether caused by the mistakes of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 241, 14, 43, 'others or by the deliberate wickedness of evil men, or by what appears');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 241, 15, 43, 'to be accidental - we can rejoice in all of them, because God will make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 241, 16, 43, 'those also all work for our good - that is, to make us more Christlike');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 241, 17, 43, '(as Romans 8:29 says).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 241, 18, 43, 'Faith is a total confidence in God''s wisdom, power and love - that not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 241, 19, 43, 'only allows such circumstances in our lives, but actually arranges and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 241, 20, 43, 'engineers them for our very best.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 241, 21, 43, 'Bible Study Tools');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 241, 22, 43, 'I have never studied Greek. But if you want to understand the Hebrew and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 241, 23, 43, 'Greek original words in the Bible, the best way is to use a Young''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 241, 24, 43, 'Concordance - because it gives all the English words that any Hebrew or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 241, 25, 43, 'Greek word is translated by (in the KJV). It is very handy tool for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 241, 26, 43, 'Bible study, and I have used it constantly since 1961, to study the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 241, 27, 43, 'Bible.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 241, 28, 43, 'Let me give you one example of what I saw once in Young''s concordance:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 242, 1, 43, 'The Hebrew word `revayyah'' (meaning `fullness'') occurs only twice in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 242, 2, 43, 'Old Testament:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 242, 3, 43, '(1) Psa. 23:5 - "runneth over" (KJV), "overflows" (NASB)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 242, 4, 43, '(2) Psa. 66:12 - "wealthy place" (KJV), "abundance" (NASB)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 242, 5, 43, 'Putting the two passages together, we get the following spiritual truth:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 242, 6, 43, 'After God anoints our heads with oil (Psa.23:5), He brings us into the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 242, 7, 43, 'net (tight circumstances), lays an oppressive burden upon us (but not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 242, 8, 43, 'more than we can bear), makes men to ride over our heads, and takes us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 242, 9, 43, 'through fire and water (Psa.66:11, 12), and thus brings us to a place');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 242, 10, 43, 'where our cups overflow (Psa.66:12 with Psa.23:5). So between the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 242, 11, 43, 'anointing and the overflowing, there are many trials that we have to go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 242, 12, 43, 'through. Only then do we come to an overflowing life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 242, 13, 44, 'Chapter 43 Chapter 43');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 242, 14, 44, 'What Have You Got That Is Not From God?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 242, 15, 44, '1 Corinthians 4:7 says that there is nothing we have that we did not get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 242, 16, 44, 'from God - whether in our body, our soul (mind and emotions), or our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 242, 17, 44, 'spirit. Our looks, our intelligence, our temperament, our circumstances,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 242, 18, 44, 'our education, the openings we have got in life (which others call');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 242, 19, 44, '"lucky breaks"), our desire for God, our spiritual development, the type');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 242, 20, 44, 'of home-upbringing we got, etc., are all gifts of God to us. Since that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 242, 21, 44, 'is the case, Paul asks, how we can ever consider ourselves as superior');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 242, 22, 44, 'to another. It is when we forget this fact, that thoughts of superiority');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 242, 23, 44, 'begin to arise in our minds and we begin to despise others - perhaps');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 242, 24, 44, 'someone who is not so intelligent, or not so cultured, or not so sharp,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 242, 25, 44, 'or not so spiritual etc.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 242, 26, 44, 'Jesus criticised the Pharisees with the strongest words possible ("');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 242, 27, 44, 'whitewashed graves", "generation of vipers" etc.) not because of any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 242, 28, 44, 'other sin but because they " considered themselves as righteous and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 243, 1, 44, 'looked down on others" (Lk.18:9). This is the sin that is Number One in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 243, 2, 44, 'God''s list of sins - far above murder and adultery. When our minds are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 243, 3, 44, 'renewed to see sin as God sees it, we will re-arrange the order of sins');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 243, 4, 44, 'to make it in line with His.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 243, 5, 44, 'In the breaking of bread we receive the bread and receive the wine. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 243, 6, 44, 'did not make either of them. They are both God''s free gifts to us -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 243, 7, 44, 'symbolising the truth of the words in the hymn, "Rock of ages..."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 243, 8, 44, '"Nothing in my hands I bring,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 243, 9, 44, 'Simply to Thy cross I cling."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 243, 10, 44, 'It is when we recognize that we have received everything from God that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 243, 11, 44, 'our lives will be filled with deep thankfulness to God for every small');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 243, 12, 44, 'mercy that we have received from His kind hand. And we will be thankful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 243, 13, 44, 'for the brothers and sisters whom God has given us in our fellowship -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 243, 14, 44, 'even if they are not perfect.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 243, 15, 44, 'Spiritual or Religious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 243, 16, 44, 'You must learn to distinguish between religiosity and spirituality.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 243, 17, 44, 'Religiosity consists of taking part in many Christian activities. But to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 243, 18, 44, 'be spiritual is to allow the Holy Spirit to change our attitude');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 243, 19, 44, '(concerning everything) to the same attitude that Jesus had (Phil.2:5, "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 243, 20, 44, 'Have the same attitude that Christ had..."). We must never deceive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 243, 21, 44, 'ourselves that we are growing spiritually if that change of attitude -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 243, 22, 44, 'towards women, money, people, circumstances, earthly honour etc., - is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 243, 23, 44, 'not taking place. Religious activity by itself will only make us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 243, 24, 44, 'whitewashed graves like the Pharisees. We must do everything to work out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 243, 25, 44, 'our own salvation from wrong attitudes, through the help of the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 243, 26, 44, 'Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 243, 27, 44, 'There is a vast difference between being religious and being spiritual.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 243, 28, 44, 'Under the old covenant, many who pursued righteousness became religious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 244, 1, 44, 'Pharisees. They were the greatest enemies of Jesus. Even today, it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 244, 2, 44, 'possible to receive the truths of the new covenant in the spirit of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 244, 3, 44, 'Law, and to become just religious. Then we will be the greatest enemies');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 244, 4, 44, 'of God even today.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 244, 5, 44, 'A person, who is more interested in an academic study of God''s Word than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 244, 6, 44, 'in being filled with the Holy Spirit, and pleasing God, is in danger of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 244, 7, 44, 'ending up as a religious Pharisee, and not a spiritual Christian. In the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 244, 8, 44, 'Old Testament they were commanded to meditate on the Law of the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 244, 9, 44, '(Psa.1:2). But in the New Testament we are to meditate on the glory of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 244, 10, 44, 'the Lord Jesus that we see in the gospels (2 Cor.3:18). The letter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 244, 11, 44, 'kills. The spirit gives life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 244, 12, 44, 'The kingdom of God is righteousness along with peace and joy in the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 244, 13, 44, 'Spirit (Rom.14:17). Religiosity may have a human righteousness, but it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 244, 14, 44, 'won''t have peace and joy. There will be grumblings and murmurings, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 244, 15, 44, 'fears and anxieties. True Christianity is a faith that brings fullness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 244, 16, 44, 'of peace - peacewith God (a clear conscience concerning all matters),');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 244, 17, 44, 'peace with men (as far as it lies with us), and peace within (freedom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 244, 18, 44, 'from anxiety and tension). It also brings fullness of joy - a life of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 244, 19, 44, 'overflowing thanksgiving and praise under all circumstances. We sing:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 244, 20, 44, '"He had no tears for His own griefs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 244, 21, 44, 'But sweat drops of blood for mine"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 244, 22, 44, 'That was how Jesus lived. He never once felt sorry for Himself. Even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 244, 23, 44, 'when bleeding and carrying the cross, He told others, " Don''t weep for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 244, 24, 44, 'Me" (Lk.23:28). There was no self-pity in Him. He rejoiced constantly -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 244, 25, 44, 'even when badly treated by others, because He lived before His Father''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 244, 26, 44, 'face. That is how we must be too - with no tears for our own griefs.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 244, 27, 44, 'Religiosity may have a lot of activity. But it is proud and it despises');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 244, 28, 44, 'others. When we look down on others, or are proud of our righteousness,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 245, 1, 44, 'then we are religious not spiritual. (Humility is not spoken of much in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 245, 2, 44, 'the Old Testament, because it is a new-covenant virtue). We must ensure,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 245, 3, 44, 'that along with all our growth in Bible-knowledge, we are becoming');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 245, 4, 44, 'spiritual and not just more religious.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 245, 5, 44, 'Forgive everyone who has harmed you, set everything right with God and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 245, 6, 44, 'men, earnestly seek to be filled with the Holy Spirit, and determine by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 245, 7, 44, 'God''s grace to walk the way of the dying of Jesus daily. Then you will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 245, 8, 44, 'become a spiritual man.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 245, 9, 44, 'Faith and Confidence');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 245, 10, 44, 'Abraham " grew strong in faith, giving glory to God, being fully assured');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 245, 11, 44, 'that what He had promised, He was able also to perform " (Rom.4:20,21).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 245, 12, 44, 'We also bring great glory to God, when we trust Him in the midst of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 245, 13, 44, 'impossible situations. We know that there is no problem that God cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 245, 14, 44, 'handle. He can solve every problem that Satan creates - anywhere. Even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 245, 15, 44, 'the President''s heart is in His hand, and He can turn it in our favour');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 245, 16, 44, '(Prov.21:1).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 245, 17, 44, 'So you must always trust God, no matter what happens, and confess your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 245, 18, 44, 'faith that God will crush Satan under your feet. Then you will triumph');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 245, 19, 44, 'over Satan, no matter what he does. I have seen this happen again and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 245, 20, 44, 'again in my own life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 245, 21, 44, 'Since God wants to give you a spiritual education here on earth, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 245, 22, 44, 'should anticipate that your problems will become more and more difficult');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 245, 23, 44, 'as time goes on, just as in school your math problems became tougher and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 245, 24, 44, 'tougher, as you advanced to higher classes. But you would never have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 245, 25, 44, 'wanted to go back to a lower class, just to avoid the challenge of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 245, 26, 44, 'tougher math problem! So also you must not be surprised when God allows');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 245, 27, 44, 'you to face tougher situations as you grow in grace. Thus you will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 245, 28, 44, 'become a stronger, bolder and more confident Christian.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 246, 1, 44, 'Be careful at all times that your conscience does not condemn you about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 246, 2, 44, 'anything. Only then can you come boldly before God (1 Jn.3:21, 22) and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 246, 3, 44, 'ask Him to solve your problems. To ask God for wisdom in trial (See');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 246, 4, 44, 'James 1:1-7), is to ask Him for the solution to any problem you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 246, 5, 44, 'facing. Since God has a solution to every problem, James says that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 246, 6, 44, 'must count it as joy when you encounter various types of trials -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 246, 7, 44, 'because you can have a new experience of God thereby, as He solves the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 246, 8, 44, 'problem for you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 246, 9, 44, 'Seeing the Glory of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 246, 10, 44, 'When Isaiah saw the glory of God (Isa.6), he heard the angels singing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 246, 11, 44, 'that "the whole earth was full of the glory of God". That is an amazing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 246, 12, 44, 'statement, because most people cannot see the glory of God around them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 246, 13, 44, 'on this earth. They only see corruption and evil. But we need to have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 246, 14, 44, 'our eyes opened like Elisha''s servant to see the angels of God all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 246, 15, 44, 'around us (2 Kings 6:17).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 246, 16, 44, 'When we see that, we will also say, " If God be for us, who can be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 246, 17, 44, 'against us?" We will fear no situation, for there is no situation that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 246, 18, 44, 'God cannot handle.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 246, 19, 44, 'We are seated in the heavenly places (Eph.2:6), even when we are on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 246, 20, 44, 'earth. God has made it such that we live on earth, in a heavenly capsule');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 246, 21, 44, '(space-suit) (like the astronauts who walked in their space-suits on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 246, 22, 44, 'moon) with the atmosphere of heaven inside the capsule. Thus, even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 246, 23, 44, 'though we walk on this earth, we can be preserved from impurity,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 246, 24, 44, 'murmuring and fear - for none of these things are found in heaven. This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 246, 25, 44, 'is what the Holy Spirit has come to give us. This is why we need to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 246, 26, 44, 'filled with the Holy Spirit constantly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 246, 27, 45, 'Chapter 44 Chapter 44');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 246, 28, 45, 'The Blessing of Rejection');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 247, 1, 45, 'If I had still been in the Navy I would have retired today on completing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 247, 2, 45, '58 years (5 November 1997). But I thank God that I left the Navy 31');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 247, 3, 45, 'years ago, so that I could spend my life usefully for God in this world.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 247, 4, 45, 'Last month (October 1997), the Lord told me specifically that I would be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 247, 5, 45, 'facing more opposition, persecution and rejection in the coming days. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 247, 6, 45, 'don''t know what that means or involves. But I think He was giving me an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 247, 7, 45, 'advance warning of what lies ahead for me in the coming years.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 247, 8, 45, 'I know that my opposition will come from Christians who reject my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 247, 9, 45, 'message - just like Jesus faced from the Jews who rejected Him. But I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 247, 10, 45, 'rejoice in the Lord and press on, regardless.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 247, 11, 45, '(*Note: This prophecy was fulfilled from 1998 to 2007 - during which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 247, 12, 45, 'period, I faced great opposition from men, but great comfort and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 247, 13, 45, 'deliverance from the Lord as well. It was so good of God to warn me and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 247, 14, 45, 'prepare me for that, ahead of time ).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 247, 15, 45, 'Within our own churches however, it is getting more and more glorious.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 247, 16, 45, 'God has raised up many wholehearted brothers and sisters in our midst.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 247, 17, 45, 'This is a great joy for me. And there are many open doors for ministry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 247, 18, 45, 'now.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 247, 19, 45, 'Paul wrote (in 1 Cor.16:8, 9) " A wide door for effective service has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 247, 20, 45, 'opened to me, and there are many adversaries ". These two things - open');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 247, 21, 45, 'doors and opposition - seem to go together, ever since apostolic times.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 247, 22, 45, 'God has made our own family a living demonstration to many around us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 247, 23, 45, 'that the happiest life anyone can live is one where we seek God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 247, 24, 45, 'kingdom and His righteousness first. The way God has blessed our family');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 247, 25, 45, 'has provoked some to jealousy - and that is the main reason for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 247, 26, 45, 'antagonism of some people against us: They cannot bear to see a poor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 247, 27, 45, 'Christian worker''s sons doing well spiritually, as well as otherwise, in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 247, 28, 45, 'the world.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 248, 1, 45, 'Let me share with you something else that the Lord told me some years');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 248, 2, 45, 'ago: He told me "I have made you a tester among My people to test them"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 248, 3, 45, '(Jeremiah 6:27). I haven''t shared this with many others, because it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 248, 4, 45, 'would sound like boasting. But I have seen the fulfilment of this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 248, 5, 45, 'through the years, as I have dealt with many people who have joined CFC.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 248, 6, 45, 'Believers who are not straightforward, who have come into a close');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 248, 7, 45, 'association with me or with our churches have invariably got exposed,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 248, 8, 45, 'especially if there is any sin or Phariseeism in them that they continue');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 248, 9, 45, 'to live in, and that they have not repented of. I have seen this happen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 248, 10, 45, 'numerous times. God reveals the secret sins of people to them in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 248, 11, 45, 'hope that they will repent. But He does not force anyone to repent.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 248, 12, 45, 'I hope all of you will be guided all your life by the example we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 248, 13, 45, 'set for you as your parents - even if the Lord delays His coming, and we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 248, 14, 45, 'have gone home to our eternal reward with Him. I hope I can be alive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 248, 15, 45, 'until the Lord returns, because there is so much work to be done in His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 248, 16, 45, 'vineyard. But God knows what is best for each of us - and He has already');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 248, 17, 45, 'numbered our days.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 248, 18, 45, 'Give No Place to Satan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 248, 19, 45, 'In Revelation 12:8, we learn two things about Satan:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 248, 20, 45, '(1) Satan and his demons are not strong enough to face God''s angels - or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 248, 21, 45, 'us, God''s sons;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 248, 22, 45, '(2) There is no place for Satan in heaven - or in our hearts.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 248, 23, 45, 'The Holy Spirit warns us that Satan gets an advantage over people who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 248, 24, 45, 'retain either anger (Eph.4:26, 27) or an unforgiving attitude in their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 248, 25, 45, 'hearts towards anyone (2 Cor.2:10, 11). So be especially careful to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 248, 26, 45, 'avoid these two sins.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 248, 27, 45, 'Satan cannot live in heaven because it is a place where they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 248, 28, 45, 'praising God all the time. Satan will not be able to find an entry into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 249, 1, 45, 'our hearts either when we have that same spirit of praise to God - and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 249, 2, 45, 'we can have that spirit of praise at all times.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 249, 3, 45, 'The Israelites could praise God only after they saw their enemies');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 249, 4, 45, 'drowned in the Red Sea (See Psalm 106:8-12). But today, we walk by faith');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 249, 5, 45, 'and can praise God even before we see our deliverance. He spreads a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 249, 6, 45, 'table for us and anoints us with joy in the presence of our enemies');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 249, 7, 45, '(Psa.23:5).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 249, 8, 45, 'When Jonah was in the whale''s belly, he struggled to get out during the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 249, 9, 45, 'first three days. Only after three days, did he begin to pray (See Jonah');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 249, 10, 45, '1:17 and the word "Then" in 2:1). We too, when we are caught in a tight');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 249, 11, 45, 'situation, don''t usually think of praying first. Usually, we pray only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 249, 12, 45, 'after all our other efforts have failed. But there was still no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 249, 13, 45, 'deliverance for Jonah, until he started praising God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 249, 14, 45, 'When Jonah said "Salvation (deliverance) comes only from the Lord"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 249, 15, 45, '(Jon.2:9), then the Lord told the fish to vomit Jonah out on to the land');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 249, 16, 45, '(Jon.2:10). Our deliverance from a tight situation also will come when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 249, 17, 45, 'we begin to praise the Lord. This is not a technique to be practised but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 249, 18, 45, 'an expression of faith in the almighty power of God. God says, "He who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 249, 19, 45, 'offers a sacrifice of thanksgiving honours Me and makes a way thereby');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 249, 20, 45, 'for me to show him my deliverance" (Psa. 50:23 -Paraphrase). Jonah');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 249, 21, 45, 'experienced that - and so can you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 249, 22, 45, 'What Does Jesus Marvel At?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 249, 23, 45, 'There are only two times that we read that "Jesus marvelled" (KJV) -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 249, 24, 45, 'once when he saw faith, and the other when he saw unbelief. When the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 249, 25, 45, 'Roman centurion said that Jesus could speak a word and his servant (who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 249, 26, 45, 'was many miles away) would be healed, Jesus marvelled at his faith');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 249, 27, 45, '(Matt.8:10). Then when Jesus came to his own hometown, and they would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 249, 28, 45, 'not believe in Him, He marvelled at their unbelief (Mark 6:6). The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 250, 1, 45, 'centurion was so humble that he told the Lord that he did not consider');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 250, 2, 45, 'himself worthy that Jesus should even enter his house.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 250, 3, 45, 'A Canaanite woman who also once asked the Lord to heal her daughter (who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 250, 4, 45, 'was many miles away) was another person Jesus commended highly for her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 250, 5, 45, 'faith (Matt.15:28). When Jesus used the illustration of dogs not being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 250, 6, 45, 'given the children''s bread, she promptly accepted her place in all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 250, 7, 45, 'humility as that of a dog at the foot of the table. She was not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 250, 8, 45, 'offended. In both these incidents, we see one thing in common: That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 250, 9, 45, 'there is a very close connection between humility and faith. The humbler');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 250, 10, 45, 'we are, the less confidence we have in ourselves, and the less we think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 250, 11, 45, 'of our own talents and accomplishments, the more we can have faith. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 250, 12, 45, 'prouder we are, the less we will have faith.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 250, 13, 45, 'We must always realize that we are not worthy to stand before the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 250, 14, 45, 'It is God''s tremendous grace that He allows us to do so. We must never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 250, 15, 45, 'take that for granted. So pursue humility with all your heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 250, 16, 45, 'Faith That Doesn''t Fail');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 250, 17, 45, 'God has promised to be an enemy to our enemies (Exodus 23:22). In the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 250, 18, 45, 'old covenant Israel''s enemies were all human. Today we have only Satan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 250, 19, 45, '(and his evil spirits) and the lusts in our flesh as our enemies. We do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 250, 20, 45, 'not wrestle with flesh and blood (Eph.6:12). If you decide never to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 250, 21, 45, 'fight with human beings, then alone will God fight for you. Remember');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 250, 22, 45, 'that God is always on your side against Satan.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 250, 23, 45, 'Satan was given permission to sift Peter, because God had such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 250, 24, 45, 'confidence in Peter and had a great ministry for him. But Jesus prayed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 250, 25, 45, 'for Peter that his faith would not fail, when he was being sifted. It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 250, 26, 45, 'a great comfort to know that Jesus will be praying for you, whenever you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 250, 27, 45, 'are being sifted by Satan.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 250, 28, 45, 'When a house is on fire, people will want to save the most valuable item');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 251, 1, 45, 'inside that house. If there is a baby inside, the parents will want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 251, 2, 45, 'save it and not the old newspapers. Even so, Jesus prayed that when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 251, 3, 45, 'Peter went through the fire, his faith would be saved. That was the most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 251, 4, 45, 'and only valuable thing. All the rest were like old newspapers -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 251, 5, 45, 'worthless.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 251, 6, 45, 'Your faith must never fail when you are being sifted by Satan. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 251, 7, 45, 'have faith, then in the midst of the severest trial, you will confess: "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 251, 8, 45, 'My heavenly Father loves me intensely and He rules on earth and in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 251, 9, 45, 'heaven. Jesus Christ has defeated Satan on the cross. Satan is a liar');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 251, 10, 45, 'and has no claim on my life. God is making everything work together for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 251, 11, 45, 'my good ". That is the confession of one whose faith has not failed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 251, 12, 45, 'Jesus told Peter that after he was sifted, he would be converted and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 251, 13, 45, 'could then strengthen his brothers (Lk.22:31, 32). We cannot strengthen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 251, 14, 45, 'others if our faith fails when we are tested.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 251, 15, 45, 'Jesus could do much with Peter because he did not get offended, even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 251, 16, 45, 'when he was called "Satan" (Matt.16:23). But Jesus never prayed for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 251, 17, 45, 'Judas because he was offended by a small correction that Jesus gave him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 251, 18, 45, 'in Bethany (Read Jn.12:4-8 coupled with Matt.26:8-15).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 251, 19, 45, 'You must not be offended when the Lord corrects you. God has a great');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 251, 20, 45, 'purpose to fulfil through each of you. The greater the purpose, the more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 251, 21, 45, 'God will allow you to be sifted by Satan. But you will come out as more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 251, 22, 45, 'than conquerors in every trial.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 251, 23, 45, 'Things Lawful But Not Edifying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 251, 24, 45, 'Paul told the Hebrew Christians that there was much that he wanted to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 251, 25, 45, 'share with them concerning Christ coming in the flesh, but which he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 251, 26, 45, 'could not do, because they were dull of hearing and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 251, 27, 45, 'immature.(Heb.5:7-14).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 251, 28, 45, 'Jesus said that when the Holy Spirit came He would take the things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 252, 1, 45, 'concerning Him and show them to us (Jn.16:14). He shows us the glory of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 252, 2, 45, 'God in the life of Christ. Then we realize what it means to live a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 252, 3, 45, 'Divine life - a life like the one that Jesus lived on earth. Then we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 252, 4, 45, 'won''t only avoid evil, but also avoid those things that Jesus Himself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 252, 5, 45, 'would avoid.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 252, 6, 45, 'Paul said twice in 1 Cor.6:12 and 10:23 that even though all things are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 252, 7, 45, 'lawful, all things were not profitable or edifying. We can live the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 252, 8, 45, 'Christian life at two levels - one is the level of avoiding all unlawful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 252, 9, 45, 'things and doing only the lawful things. The second level is higher');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 252, 10, 45, 'where we avoid even some lawful things because they are unprofitable,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 252, 11, 45, 'unedifying and might master us. You must apply that test to everything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 252, 12, 45, 'that you do, including your legitimate activities. Ask yourself whether');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 252, 13, 45, 'you can do them in fellowship with Jesus. Only thus will you become');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 252, 14, 45, 'spiritual. Otherwise you will be just a good human being, but without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 252, 15, 45, 'Divine life. There are many Christians like that. Here then are the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 252, 16, 45, 'three levels at which you can live:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 252, 17, 45, 'SPIRITUAL: Doing only profitable and edifying things SOULISH : Doing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 252, 18, 45, 'everything that is lawful CARNAL : Doing even unlawful things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 252, 19, 45, 'May the Lord give you grace to exercise your senses through the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 252, 20, 45, 'temptations that you encounter every day, to discern between what the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 252, 21, 45, 'Divine reaction to that situation or temptation should be, and what is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 252, 22, 45, 'only human and soulish (Heb.5:14).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 252, 23, 45, 'Living Entirely for the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 252, 24, 45, 'God is greatly encouraging us everywhere we go in India these days. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 252, 25, 45, 'need is great in this land and I for one, am extremely thankful that God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 252, 26, 45, 'has given me life until now so that I could do something for Him, before');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 252, 27, 45, 'I meet Him face to face.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 252, 28, 45, 'God has a plan for each of your lives. Seek Him for that plan each day,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 253, 1, 45, 'and don''t allow anything to rob you of the privilege and honour of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 253, 2, 45, 'living for Him. Life is too short to express our gratitude to Jesus for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 253, 3, 45, 'all that He did for us on Calvary. I pray that all of you, my sons, will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 253, 4, 45, 'spend your lives in a worthwhile way, living 100% for the Lord, until He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 253, 5, 45, 'comes again.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 253, 6, 45, 'We pray for you daily that you will be filled with the Holy Spirit and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 253, 7, 45, 'that you will walk the way of discipleship, and that the Lord will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 253, 8, 45, 'preserve you to live only for Him, and also help you with your academic');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 253, 9, 45, 'studies. May the Lord give you grace to follow Him more closely this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 253, 10, 45, 'year than you have ever done thus far in your life. Life is short, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 253, 11, 45, 'was not given for trifling. May the seriousness of being called to be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 253, 12, 45, 'child of God and His witness on earth, grip your heart greatly this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 253, 13, 45, 'coming new year. May you have a year over which you will be able to look');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 253, 14, 45, 'back with satisfaction when you come to the end of it. Time slips by so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 253, 15, 45, 'quickly and soon we will all stand before the Lord to give an account of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 253, 16, 45, 'our lives to Him, Who created us for His glory. May you have great');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 253, 17, 45, 'rejoicing in that day over how you lived.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 253, 18, 45, 'No time for trifling in this life of mine');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 253, 19, 45, 'Not this the path our blessed Master trod;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 253, 20, 45, 'But strenuous toil - each hour and power employed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 253, 21, 45, 'Always and all for God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 253, 22, 45, 'Time swiftly flies - eternity is near,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 253, 23, 45, 'And soon my dust may lie beneath the sod.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 253, 24, 45, 'How dare I waste my life, or cease to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 253, 25, 45, 'Always and all for God. (A.B.Simpson)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 253, 26, 45, 'You are living there in a country where people are so unashamedly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 253, 27, 45, 'immoral and corrupt, and in the midst of believers who are generally');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 253, 28, 45, 'speaking not radical or wholehearted in turning away from this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 254, 1, 45, 'worldliness in the society around them. It is easy in such a situation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 254, 2, 45, 'to sink to the level of the Christians around you, and to do what they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 254, 3, 45, 'do. This is the greatest danger that you are facing right now. So be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 254, 4, 45, 'watchful for the enemy''s wiles and let Jesus alone be your Example. May');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 254, 5, 45, 'your eyes be fixed on Jesus alone. What you cannot do in fellowship with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 254, 6, 45, 'Jesus, you should never do, even if every other Christian around you is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 254, 7, 45, 'doing it. Make that the rule for your life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 254, 8, 45, 'Live in the presence of Jesus always, looking up to Him. This will lead');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 254, 9, 45, 'to a life of constant self-judgment. And that is the way of all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 254, 10, 45, 'spiritual progress. This is not a message that you will hear in any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 254, 11, 45, 'church that you go to, over there. So you have to be a preacher to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 254, 12, 45, 'yourself. You must not be introspective - for that will lead to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 254, 13, 45, 'condemnation and discouragement. But look unto Jesus - and as you look');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 254, 14, 45, 'at Him, you will see your own corruption, just like Isaiah and Job and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 254, 15, 45, 'John (on Patmos) saw. Then you can judge yourself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 254, 16, 45, 'I never look inside myself. I only look at Jesus constantly - at His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 254, 17, 45, 'perfect purity (as a man, tempted like me), His love and His humility.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 254, 18, 45, 'That keeps me aware of my need all the time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 254, 19, 46, 'Chapter 45 Chapter 45');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 254, 20, 46, 'Seeking God''s Kingdom Alone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 254, 21, 46, 'God has a plan for your life and we want Him to fulfil that 100%. As');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 254, 22, 46, 'parents we have sought to honour God, and not sought to live for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 254, 23, 46, 'ourselves. So we believe that our children will reap what we have sown,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 254, 24, 46, 'since this is a law of God that God honours those who honour Him - and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 254, 25, 46, 'that the children of the righteous are blessed (See Prov.20:7). So God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 254, 26, 46, 'will provide all of you boys with the right openings when it comes to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 254, 27, 46, 'employment and also in marriage. We pray for you regularly - and those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 254, 28, 46, 'prayers will not fall to the ground. However we don''t expect answers to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 255, 1, 46, 'our prayers because of any merit of our own, but only because we pray in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 255, 2, 46, 'Jesus'' Name - in His merit alone.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 255, 3, 46, 'We want the Lord''s perfect plan for your life to be fulfilled. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 255, 4, 46, 'depends on just one thing: Whether you seek the kingdom of God and His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 255, 5, 46, 'righteousness first in your life or not. It does not depend on any other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 255, 6, 46, 'factor. That is what I have proved in the last 35 years ( *Note: And now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 255, 7, 46, 'for 57 years). So make sure you get an `A'' in that course from God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 255, 8, 46, 'consistently, and all will be well.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 255, 9, 46, 'The whole world lives by the principle of " seeking their own interests"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 255, 10, 46, '(Phil.2:21) in all things. Everyone born of the race of Adam, in every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 255, 11, 46, 'nation, in every generation has lived by that principle. Jesus came into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 255, 12, 46, 'such a world and lived a life where He never once sought His own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 255, 13, 46, 'interests, but only the interests of God His Father at all times. To be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 255, 14, 46, 'a disciple of Jesus is to follow Him in this radical way - where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 255, 15, 46, 'everything that you do or say is governed by the glory of God and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 255, 16, 46, 'interests of God''s kingdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 255, 17, 46, 'In Revelation 3:21, Jesus tells us to overcome , even as He also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 255, 18, 46, 'overcame. This teaches us clearly that He had something to fight and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 255, 19, 46, 'overcome. In times when we are tempted and tested, we must allow the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 255, 20, 46, 'Holy Spirit to show us how Jesus overcame and thus be strengthened to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 255, 21, 46, 'overcome even as He also overcame.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 255, 22, 46, 'God''s Love Overrules Our Mistakes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 255, 23, 46, 'We are really proud of all of you - especially of your desire to follow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 255, 24, 46, 'the Lord, your total honesty and your helpfulness and hardworking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 255, 25, 46, 'nature. Those are very important qualities.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 255, 26, 46, 'I believe in God and in the power of prayer that has kept all of you in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 255, 27, 46, 'line with God''s will thus far. Even if you make a mistake in a decision,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 255, 28, 46, 'I pray that God will overrule it and still work out His perfect will for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 256, 1, 46, 'you in the future. Life is short and I only pray that you won''t make any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 256, 2, 46, 'serious mistakes in your life. May you put God and His righteousness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 256, 3, 46, 'first in all that you do. Then all will be well. I couldn''t wish');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 256, 4, 46, 'anything better for you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 256, 5, 46, 'You really require the wisdom of God to be shrewd as a serpent in this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 256, 6, 46, 'world and harmless as a dove, while pursuing an earthly profession and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 256, 7, 46, 'yet keeping an eternal perspective all the time. So ask God for wisdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 256, 8, 46, 'constantly. He is interested in your academic studies as well as your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 256, 9, 46, 'earthly work well - for He is the One Who has taught us to pray for our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 256, 10, 46, 'daily bread, and we have to get a job to earn our daily bread. All of us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 256, 11, 46, 'owe our very lives to Him, because He has saved us all from many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 256, 12, 46, 'accidents and an early death, besides having saved us from eternal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 256, 13, 46, 'death.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 256, 14, 46, 'Praise the Lord for His goodness to you in enabling you to be free from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 256, 15, 46, 'debt throughout your college life. There are so many students who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 256, 16, 46, 'weighed down with debt, by the time they finish their undergraduate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 256, 17, 46, 'college studies.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 256, 18, 46, 'Many things can happen to us contrary to our expectations and to what we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 256, 19, 46, 'think is best for us. We may not always understand why God allows such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 256, 20, 46, 'things to happen. But we will know the reasons for them in eternity -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 256, 21, 46, 'and when we see the reasons clearly, we will agree with the Lord and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 256, 22, 46, 'say, "Lord, You did all things well". God never makes a mistake. I am');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 256, 23, 46, 'certain of that. The children of the godly have an inheritance. So you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 256, 24, 46, 'will all be blessed in the long run - certainly. " Eye has not seen nor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 256, 25, 46, 'ear heard neither has it entered into the heart of man what God has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 256, 26, 46, 'prepared for those who love Him " (1 Cor.2:9).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 256, 27, 46, 'All that I write, I do only because I long that you might be even more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 256, 28, 46, 'effective for the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 257, 1, 46, 'Get rid of all artificiality and let your Christianity always be natural');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 257, 2, 46, '- from your heart. May the Lord preserve you and keep you - spiritually');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 257, 3, 46, 'and physically.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 257, 4, 46, 'Obedience to Parents');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 257, 5, 46, 'God gave only one commandment to Adam and he disobeyed that (Gen.2, 3).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 257, 6, 46, 'Jesus gave only one commandment to Christians - to love one another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 257, 7, 46, '(Jn.13:34, 35) - and most of them disobey that. In the same way God gave');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 257, 8, 46, 'only one commandment to children - to honour their parents (Eph.6:1-3) -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 257, 9, 46, 'and most of them disobey that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 257, 10, 46, 'It is the duty of parents to teach their children to honour them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 257, 11, 46, 'Children must speak respectfully to their parents at all times,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 257, 12, 46, 'throughout their lives. And when children are living at home, they must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 257, 13, 46, 'also obey their parents in all matters. This is the example that Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 257, 14, 46, 'has set for us. He obeyed Mary up to the age of 30 (while at home) and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 257, 15, 46, 'after that made clear to her at Cana that He was no longer obligated to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 257, 16, 46, 'listen to her, but only to His Father directly thereafter. But He still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 257, 17, 46, 'cared for her when hanging on the cross, in His last moments. It will go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 257, 18, 46, 'well with all children who obey and follow Jesus'' example.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 257, 19, 46, 'As your parents we have had to represent God to you. And this is where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 257, 20, 46, 'we have seen our desperate need for God''s grace and help.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 257, 21, 46, 'Some Helpful Quotes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 257, 22, 46, 'Here are some good quotes that I read recently:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 257, 23, 46, '"In the beginning it took God to make a man. It still does."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 257, 24, 46, 'Concerning suffering: " If I''m told that I''m in for a hard journey, then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 257, 25, 46, 'every hard jolt along the way only reminds me that I''m on the right road');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 257, 26, 46, '."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 257, 27, 46, '"The good news sounds good only when delivered with good manners."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 257, 28, 46, '" Lot chose land (Sodom) and lost everything. Abraham chose God and got');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 258, 1, 46, 'everything forever ."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 258, 2, 46, 'True Marks of Faith');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 258, 3, 46, 'In Galatians 5:6 we are told that " in Christ Jesus, neither');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 258, 4, 46, 'circumcision nor uncircumcision means anything, but only faith that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 258, 5, 46, 'works through love ". This teaches us that all our understanding of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 258, 6, 46, 'doctrine (whether that doctrine be `circumcision'', `speaking in tongues''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 258, 7, 46, 'or `victory over sin'' or whatever) is worthless, if it does not produce');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 258, 8, 46, 'in usa faith that works through love in our actions. One meaning of "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 258, 9, 46, 'faith" is "a helpless dependence on God". It is only when we have come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 258, 10, 46, 'to an end of ourselves that we can depend on God and have faith. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 258, 11, 46, 'faith should then manifest itself in love for others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 258, 12, 46, 'Another mark of faith in God is that we believe that what He has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 258, 13, 46, 'commanded is always the best for us, as opposed to what our own reason');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 258, 14, 46, 'tells us. Seeking His kingdom first, keeping our hearts pure, humbling');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 258, 15, 46, 'ourselves at all times, forgiving all who harm us, overcoming evil with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 258, 16, 46, 'good - all are the very best for us. We are called to humble ourselves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 258, 17, 46, 'under the mighty hand of God. The mighty hand of God refers to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 258, 18, 46, 'people and circumstances that God in His sovereignty arranges for us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 258, 19, 46, 'be pushed down by.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 258, 20, 46, 'We can then wonder whether people will take advantage of us if we humble');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 258, 21, 46, 'ourselves and don''t assert ourselves. But we don''t need to have any such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 258, 22, 46, 'fears, for " God is always thinking about us and watching everything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 258, 23, 46, 'that concerns us " (1 Pet.5:6,7 - Living). He will never allow us to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 258, 24, 46, 'tried beyond our ability. So we don''t have to fear that people might');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 258, 25, 46, 'take advantage of us, if we love those who are ungrateful and evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 258, 26, 46, 'towards us (as God commands us to).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 258, 27, 46, 'God has also taught me not to be fussy about people forgetting to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 258, 28, 46, 'something they should have done, but to leave room for the sovereignty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 259, 1, 46, 'of God even there! God has ways of using even such undisciplined actions');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 259, 2, 46, 'for His highest purposes - even as He used the forgetfulness of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 259, 3, 46, 'Pharaoh''s cupbearer to bring Joseph to the throne at the right time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 259, 4, 46, '(Gen.40:23; 41:1). It is only deliberate sin that God hates. Everything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 259, 5, 46, 'else He overlooks - and even uses for His glory.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 259, 6, 46, 'Death to Self and Building Christ''s Body');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 259, 7, 46, 'If we die with Jesus we will certainly live with Him. If we have faith');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 259, 8, 46, 'in God, we will consent to this "dying of Jesus" - dying to our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 259, 9, 46, 'self-will (that seeks our own pleasure, our honour, our prestige etc.)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 259, 10, 46, 'in the situations that God arranges for us, fully believing that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 259, 11, 46, 'Divine life that God will give us in exchange will be far superior to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 259, 12, 46, 'the rotten Adamic life that we consign to death.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 259, 13, 46, 'The resurrection life of Jesus is certainly far superior to the life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 259, 14, 46, 'that we have all inherited from our parents. But we must be willing to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 259, 15, 46, 'give up that Adamic life to death, before God will give us the life of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 259, 16, 46, 'Jesus (2 Tim.2:11; 2 Cor.4:10). To use an illustration, it is like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 259, 17, 46, 'exchanging the few coins in our beggar''s tin-can for a million rupees');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 259, 18, 46, 'offered by God. Only a fool will reject such an exchange. But the world');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 259, 19, 46, 'is full of such fools. So they end their lives still clinging to their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 259, 20, 46, 'few coins (the rotten Adamic life), when they could have used the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 259, 21, 46, 'temptations they faced on earth to become spiritually wealthy (with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 259, 22, 46, 'Divine nature), before they ended their earthly lives. No wonder the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 259, 23, 46, 'Bible calls our lusts deceitful (Eph.4:22), because they fool us that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 259, 24, 46, 'they are going to make us happy!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 259, 25, 46, 'We cannot build the Body of Christ unless we are gripped by the way of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 259, 26, 46, 'the cross (of death to self) as the way that we are to walk till the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 259, 27, 46, 'very end of our lives. This is not an additional option, but central to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 259, 28, 46, 'building the Body of Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 260, 1, 46, 'God''s Goal for Us - To Be Christlike');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 260, 2, 46, 'God''s goal is to make us like Jesus. Here are three important verses in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 260, 3, 46, 'that connection:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 260, 4, 46, '(a) Romans 8:28, 29 : Our Father makes all things work together');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 260, 5, 46, 'outwardly to enable us to reach this goal.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 260, 6, 46, '(b) 2 Corinthians 3:18 : The Holy Spirit fills us inwardly to lead us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 260, 7, 46, 'towards this goal.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 260, 8, 46, '(c) 1 John 3:2,3 : All who have the hope of Christ''s coming will work');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 260, 9, 46, 'towards this goal.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 260, 10, 46, 'Two marks of God''s love for us is that He rebukes us and chastens us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 260, 11, 46, 'when we go wrong, even if it be in just a small matter (Heb.12:5-8;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 260, 12, 46, 'Rev.3:19). That proves that He is treating us as His sons. And God works');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 260, 13, 46, 'steadfastly towards the goal of making us like Jesus, when we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 260, 14, 46, 'serious about the same goal ourselves.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 260, 15, 46, 'God has a plan for our lives that can be fulfilled only if we seek Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 260, 16, 46, 'with all our hearts - not otherwise (Read Jeremiah 29:11-13 in this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 260, 17, 46, 'connection). God is a rewarder of those who seek Him diligently');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 260, 18, 46, '(Heb.11:6 - KJV). So you should seek him diligently from now itself - in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 260, 19, 46, 'your youth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 260, 20, 47, 'Chapter 46 Chapter 46');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 260, 21, 47, 'Death is the Gateway to the Life of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 260, 22, 47, 'In 1 Corinthians 11, we are told to remember the Lord''s death when we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 260, 23, 47, 'break bread. Jesus came and showed us by His life and by His teaching');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 260, 24, 47, 'that "death is the gateway to the life of God" (See 2 Cor.4:10). So it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 260, 25, 47, 'is good for us to meditate on every aspect of the death of Christ and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 260, 26, 47, 'understand more clearly what it means to share in that dying (eat the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 260, 27, 47, 'broken bread) and to be crucified with Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 260, 28, 47, 'One aspect of the death of Christ is that He took the blame on the cross');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 261, 1, 47, 'for what He never did (" I am punished for what I never did and I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 261, 2, 47, 'to restore what I never stole " - Psa.69:4 - Living, NASB). This was the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 261, 3, 47, 'exact opposite of what Adam did - who refused to take the blame for what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 261, 4, 47, 'he did do. He blamed his wife (Gen.3:12). These are two entirely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 261, 5, 47, 'different ways in which the children of Adam and the children of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 261, 6, 47, 'walk.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 261, 7, 47, 'Adam''s children justify themselves like their father. " You are those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 261, 8, 47, 'who justify yourselves", Jesus told the Pharisees (Lk.16:15). Adam could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 261, 9, 47, 'not see his own need or his own sin. He could only see the sin of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 261, 10, 47, 'another. When anyone blames others and sees nothing wrong in himself, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 261, 11, 47, 'is actually in fellowship with Satan the Accuser.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 261, 12, 47, 'The dying thief was saved, not just because he said, " Lord, remember');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 261, 13, 47, 'me." It was because he took the blame for his own sins before saying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 261, 14, 47, 'those words.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 261, 15, 47, 'God doesn''t need our help to judge others. He is quite capable of doing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 261, 16, 47, 'that all by Himself! He wants us to judge only ourselves. Such believers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 261, 17, 47, 'will be the happiest people in the world.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 261, 18, 47, 'The Lord told the nation of Judah through Jeremiah, that they had not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 261, 19, 47, 'learnt any lessons for themselves from the failure of the northern');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 261, 20, 47, 'kingdom of Israel (Jer.3:6-8). And then He said that Israel was better');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 261, 21, 47, 'than Judah. Many Christian groups that have come out of dead');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 261, 22, 47, 'denominations have not learnt a lesson from what God did to those dead');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 261, 23, 47, 'denominations. Therefore they have ended up as more Pharisaical and dead');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 261, 24, 47, 'than those denominations.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 261, 25, 47, 'God calls us to do only one thing: " Acknowledge your own iniquity"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 261, 26, 47, '(Jer.3:13).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 261, 27, 47, 'True Happiness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 261, 28, 47, 'All people in the world are in the pursuit of happiness. But they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 262, 1, 47, 'all pursuing it in the wrong way. They think that happiness can be found');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 262, 2, 47, 'in illicit sexual pleasure, or in plenty of money, or in fame and honour');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 262, 3, 47, 'and position and power etc. There is no doubt, a certain amount of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 262, 4, 47, 'sensual excitement in all of these. But the happiness doesn''t last.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 262, 5, 47, 'God also wants us to be happy. But He says, " Happy are those whose');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 262, 6, 47, 'hearts are pure" (Matt.5:8 - Living). It is only by being holy that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 262, 7, 47, 'can be really happy. As a Christian, you are called to demonstrate to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 262, 8, 47, 'the world around you that you are supremely happy, because you are holy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 262, 9, 47, 'And you must show others that you don''t need any of the sinful things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 262, 10, 47, 'that God has forbidden, to make you happy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 262, 11, 47, 'We don''t find our happiness even through the pursuit of legitimate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 262, 12, 47, 'things - like marriage or a job. We can have these, but we can''t become');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 262, 13, 47, 'happy through them. We can be happy only in the Lord. Only then can we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 262, 14, 47, 'be effective witnesses for the truth of the gospel.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 262, 15, 47, 'When our hearts are impure, we cannot be really happy. Secret sins and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 262, 16, 47, 'wrong attitudes towards others have a way of making us long-faced, like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 262, 17, 47, 'Cain, whom God asked, "Why is your face fallen?" (Gen.4:6). God warned');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 262, 18, 47, 'Cain about the danger that was facing him. Sin was crouching at the door');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 262, 19, 47, 'of his heart waiting to swallow him up and God told him to master it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 262, 20, 47, 'Sin is very, very close to us at all times. Blessed are those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 262, 21, 47, 'realize this at all times - for they will be alert and vigilant in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 262, 22, 47, 'hour of temptation. The one who realizes the weakness of his flesh and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 262, 23, 47, 'constantly cries out to God for help will not fall.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 262, 24, 47, 'God''s Blessing Leads to Fellowship');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 262, 25, 47, 'The cross of Calvary not only tells us how much God loves the sinner,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 262, 26, 47, 'but also how much He hates sin. We must see both these truths at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 262, 27, 47, 'Calvary''s cross - and not just the first.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 262, 28, 47, 'Adam at least replied to God when God confronted him. But Cain just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 263, 1, 47, 'walked away from God''s presence without even bothering to reply to God,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 263, 2, 47, 'and went out and killed his brother immediately! When God confronted him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 263, 3, 47, 'again, he had the audacity to tell God a lie that he did not know where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 263, 4, 47, 'his brother was. Then God cursed Cain.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 263, 5, 47, 'Adam was not cursed, but Cain was. In Genesis 3, we read that God cursed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 263, 6, 47, 'the ground, but not Adam. Cain was the first man to be cursed by God,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 263, 7, 47, 'because he despised God''s warnings. The curse was that Cain would be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 263, 8, 47, 'vagrant and a wanderer and a tramp on the earth. This is the condition');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 263, 9, 47, 'of many who call themselves Christians too - they have no fellowship');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 263, 10, 47, 'with anyone or in any church. They are wanderers and tramps, going from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 263, 11, 47, 'one church to another as visitors, without becoming a part of any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 263, 12, 47, 'fellowship. When God blesses us we get fellowship. " God places the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 263, 13, 47, 'lonely ones in a family" (Psa.68:6). Otherwise, we become wanderers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 263, 14, 47, 'Salvation from the World System');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 263, 15, 47, 'Jesus came to save us not only from sin but also from this world system.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 263, 16, 47, 'Satan is the ruler of this world. He is behind the fashions, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 263, 17, 47, 'entertainment, the educational system and many, many other apparently');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 263, 18, 47, 'neutral things that we see in this world. For example, if we spend all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 263, 19, 47, 'our spare time listening to good Christian music, that could be Satan''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 263, 20, 47, 'way of preventing us from being still enough at times, to listen to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 263, 21, 47, 'voice of God. The good then becomes the enemy of the best!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 263, 22, 47, 'The Lord does not take us out of this world. He prayed to the Father in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 263, 23, 47, 'John 17:15 not to take His disciples out of the world, but to keep them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 263, 24, 47, 'from evil. It is only in the world that we can be trained to be holy. A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 263, 25, 47, 'ship is tested for its water-tightness in the midst of the sea, and not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 263, 26, 47, 'in a dry-dock!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 263, 27, 47, 'Jesus said that in the days of Noah and Lot, people were taken up with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 263, 28, 47, 'eating, drinking, buying, selling, building, planting, marrying and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 264, 1, 47, 'giving in marriage (Lk.17:26-28) - all legitimate activities. We can be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 264, 2, 47, 'so taken up with these "cares of the world" that we have no time for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 264, 3, 47, 'God. That is the danger in the last days. And we are living in those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 264, 4, 47, 'days now. When we prosper financially, and start living lavishly, we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 264, 5, 47, 'easily drift away from God. The Bible says, " Godliness with frugality');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 264, 6, 47, 'is a means of real spiritual profit" (1 Tim.6:6 - paraphrase).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 264, 7, 47, 'The day of salvation is now. We need to repent of our preoccupation with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 264, 8, 47, 'things other than God Himself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 264, 9, 47, 'One Eyed Denomination');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 264, 10, 47, 'When Jesus asked the two blind men whether they had faith that He could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 264, 11, 47, 'heal them, if one of them had replied that he had faith only for one eye');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 264, 12, 47, 'to be opened, that is all that he would have got. The principle "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 264, 13, 47, 'According to your faith" applies to all people (Matt.9:29). He could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 264, 14, 47, 'then have started the "one-eye denomination" and called those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 264, 15, 47, 'claimed to have both eyes open as heretics! Here is what I mean:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 264, 16, 47, 'ONE EYE OPENED MEANS 1. Receiving forgiveness of sins');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 264, 17, 47, '2. Being kept from God''s judgment');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 264, 18, 47, '3. Having faith that Christ died for me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 264, 19, 47, '4. Having "life"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 264, 20, 47, '5. Seeking God''s blessing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 264, 21, 47, '6. Living an individual Christian life in a Body');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 264, 22, 47, '1. Getting victory over sin as well');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 264, 23, 47, '2. Being kept from falling into sin as well');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 264, 24, 47, '3. Having faith that I died with Christ as well');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 264, 25, 47, '4. Having "abundant life"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 264, 26, 47, '5. Seeking God''s approval as well');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 264, 27, 47, '6. Living in fellowship with others');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 264, 28, 48, 'Chapter 47 Chapter 47');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 265, 1, 48, 'No Profit without Risk');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 265, 2, 48, 'In the parable of the three men who were given talents (Matt.25:14-30),');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 265, 3, 48, 'we see how important it is to invest our lives in a wise way that will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 265, 4, 48, 'yield maximum returns for eternity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 265, 5, 48, 'In fixed deposits in banks, you can make 100% profit only in about 11');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 265, 6, 48, 'years (at 7% interest). The man with the one talent did not even get his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 265, 7, 48, 'annual interest. But the men who had five and two talents made 100%');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 265, 8, 48, 'profit in a very short period of time. Therefore they must have taken');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 265, 9, 48, 'some risks. One definition of "profit" is "the reward for taking a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 265, 10, 48, 'risk". Those who play it safe usually get very little returns.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 265, 11, 48, 'Peter and Matthew took a risk, humanly speaking, when they threw away');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 265, 12, 48, 'their jobs in order to serve the Lord. To do that, without their Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 265, 13, 48, 'calling them to do so, would have been foolish. Many foolish Christians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 265, 14, 48, 'have done that - being stirred just by the call of men or by the call of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 265, 15, 48, 'sacrifice. It is the Lord alone Who can call. But when the Lord called');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 265, 16, 48, 'these men, they obeyed at once. And their lives yielded tremendous');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 265, 17, 48, 'returns.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 265, 18, 48, 'The principle is that we must obey at once as soon as God calls us to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 265, 19, 48, 'something - whatever the cost. You must never jump off the pinnacle of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 265, 20, 48, 'the temple to test God or to show off your faith. But you must be quick');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 265, 21, 48, 'to jump out of the boat if the Lord calls you to walk on the water.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 265, 22, 48, 'To stand up for the truth and keep your conscience clean, in an office,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 265, 23, 48, 'even if that costs you your job is taking a risk. But the returns are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 265, 24, 48, 'hundredfold according to the Lord''s promise (10,000%). To be rejected by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 265, 25, 48, 'friends, because you won''t compromise or laugh at their dirty jokes or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 265, 26, 48, 'lower God''s standards may make you unpopular. But such risks give you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 265, 27, 48, 'large returns.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 265, 28, 48, 'To love others also involves risks. They may prove ungrateful, or even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 266, 1, 48, 'turn against you. That is the risk that Jesus took when He came to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 266, 2, 48, 'earth. You may have shown love to someone who proved ungrateful. Then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 266, 3, 48, 'you can decide to stop showing love to others thereafter. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 266, 4, 48, 'foolish. Never clam up, just because you had some bad experiences with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 266, 5, 48, 'ungrateful or evil people. God specialises in loving and being good to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 266, 6, 48, 'such people. As long as we are on earth, let us continue to take the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 266, 7, 48, 'risks involved in obeying God''s Word - loving those who hate us, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 266, 8, 48, 'overcoming evil with good - until the very end. Then we will have the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 266, 9, 48, 'joy of hearing the Lord say to us one day, " Well done, good and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 266, 10, 48, 'faithful servant."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 266, 11, 48, 'Those who hold on in a miserly way to what God gives them will lose even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 266, 12, 48, 'what they have. Those who shower goodness on others will become richer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 266, 13, 48, 'in the process - because "God waters those who water others" (See');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 266, 14, 48, 'Prov.11:24, 25). The way of giving goodness and love is the way of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 266, 15, 48, 'blessedness (Acts 20:35). When a word of God blesses us, if we keep it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 266, 16, 48, 'to ourselves, we become poorer. But if we share it with others, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 266, 17, 48, 'become richer, and that word will stay in our memory forever. Use your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 266, 18, 48, 'life, your gifts and your possessions to bless others. This is what the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 266, 19, 48, 'man with the one talent never learnt.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 266, 20, 48, 'I have always said that the work in our CFC churches in India is God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 266, 21, 48, 'work and not mine. I only make myself available for Him to send me here');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 266, 22, 48, 'or there and to speak what He tells me to. It is His job to sort out the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 266, 23, 48, 'problems and to deal with the difficult people. It is so much easier');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 266, 24, 48, 'when we are only servants (only having to do what we are commanded), and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 266, 25, 48, 'not the proprietor (having to worry about what to do)! " God is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 266, 26, 48, 'Blessed Controller of all things" (1 Tim.6:15 - J. B. Phillips');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 266, 27, 48, 'translation).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 266, 28, 48, 'Deception - One Mark of the End Times');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 267, 1, 48, 'The first thing that Jesus warned His disciples about, in relation to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 267, 2, 48, 'His second coming was the possibility of their being deceived if they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 267, 3, 48, 'were not careful (Matt.24:4). There are many counterfeits in Christendom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 267, 4, 48, 'today, and we must not swallow everything that takes the name of Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 267, 5, 48, 'or that claims to be the working of the Holy Spirit. Test everything by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 267, 6, 48, 'God''s Word. Otherwise you will be deceived. There will also be plenty of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 267, 7, 48, 'hatred and wars - in homes and between nations. That is why you must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 267, 8, 48, 'never allow hatred to dwell in your heart - for that would be like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 267, 9, 48, 'having a little bit of hell inside your heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 267, 10, 48, 'If we walk in the light, we will get more and more light on the sins');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 267, 11, 48, 'that dwell within our flesh, and then we can seek God for grace to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 267, 12, 48, 'overcome them. The one clear, unmistakable mark that we are walking in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 267, 13, 48, 'God''s light is that we discover more and more of the unconscious sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 267, 14, 48, 'within us . This is the plain teaching of 1 John 1:7: " If we walk in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 267, 15, 48, 'the light, the blood of Jesus cleanses us from all the sin (that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 267, 16, 48, 'discover within us as we walk in God''s increasing light)". Then we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 267, 17, 48, 'in fellowship with God - not otherwise.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 267, 18, 48, 'The last days will be like the days of Noah. There will be an abundance');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 267, 19, 48, 'of perverse sexual sin and of violence in the world. The world is moving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 267, 20, 48, 'in that direction today. But there will also be people like Noah and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 267, 21, 48, 'families like Noah''s in the last days. Praise God. We should therefore');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 267, 22, 48, 'seek to be like Noah - bold, uncompromising, righteous, and standing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 267, 23, 48, 'erect and unbent for our convictions, whatever the cost. We may be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 267, 24, 48, 'considered odd and even insane. But it will be worth it all when we see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 267, 25, 48, 'Jesus one day.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 267, 26, 48, 'The essence of Babylonian Christianity is found in the words of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 267, 27, 48, 'people when they built the tower of Babel, " Let us make a name for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 267, 28, 48, 'ourselves" (Gen.11:4). God shares His power, His nature and His gifts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 268, 1, 48, 'with us - but never His glory (See Isa.42:8). To touch the glory that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 268, 2, 48, 'belongs to God - to take credit for what we are by nature (beauty,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 268, 3, 48, 'intelligence, talents, wealth etc.,) or by grace (our spirituality,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 268, 4, 48, 'knowing God''s truth, gifts) - is a very great sin. We must repent of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 268, 5, 48, 'this constantly - for we touch the glory of God unknowingly, so often.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 268, 6, 48, 'The Church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 268, 7, 48, 'One of the wonderful blessings that God has provided for us in His true');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 268, 8, 48, 'church ("Zion" - Jer.3:14) is the blessing of " shepherds after His own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 268, 9, 48, 'heart" (Jer.3:15). We should pray that God will raise up more such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 268, 10, 48, 'shepherds in our land, as Jesus commanded us to pray (Matt.9:36-38). You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 268, 11, 48, 'can also be such shepherds, if you seek to help those younger than you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 268, 12, 48, 'You must make friends with those younger than you wherever you go and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 268, 13, 48, 'use that friendship to draw them to the Lord in a natural way. Thus you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 268, 14, 48, 'can be a shepherd after God''s own heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 268, 15, 48, 'The church must be a miniature representation on earth right now of what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 268, 16, 48, 'the kingdom (government) of God will be like one day, when the world is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 268, 17, 48, 'ruled by the Lord Jesus, and of what heaven is like right now. That''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 268, 18, 48, 'why we constantly speak in the church of death to all that we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 268, 19, 48, 'inherited from Adam, since that is the only way to cleanse out the old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 268, 20, 48, 'Adamic life, so that there might be room for the life of the Spirit in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 268, 21, 48, 'us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 268, 22, 48, 'In Revelation 3:20, we read that Jesus knocks at the door waiting for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 268, 23, 48, 'entrance to dine with us. He longs to eat and drink with us. In the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 268, 24, 48, 'breaking of bread, we testify of our need of Him and of His body (the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 268, 25, 48, 'church) at all times. It is a confession of our need, and not of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 268, 26, 48, 'worthiness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 268, 27, 48, 'There are three antidotes for Phariseeism: 1. Concentrate more on your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 268, 28, 48, 'inner life than your outward life. 2. Never despise or look down on any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 269, 1, 48, 'human being at any time. 3. Stay devoted to Jesus.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 269, 2, 48, 'If you do these constantly, you will never be a Pharisee.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 269, 3, 49, 'Chapter 48 Chapter 48');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 269, 4, 49, 'Offering Our Bodies - A Spiritual Act of Worship');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 269, 5, 49, 'Paul told Timothy, " Guard through the Holy Spirit Who dwells in us, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 269, 6, 49, 'treasure which has been entrusted to you" (2 Tim.1:14). God has given us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 269, 7, 49, 'our bodies as a sacred treasure that we must preserve for Him during our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 269, 8, 49, 'earthly journey. We are to present these to Him every day so that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 269, 9, 49, 'can be cleansed of all sin and preserved in holiness, until one day we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 269, 10, 49, 'complete life''s journey. To use an illustration: It is like a company');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 269, 11, 49, 'having given us five million rupees to carry safely from one place to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 269, 12, 49, 'another. But we have wasted some of it and lost the rest of it along the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 269, 13, 49, 'way. Now we repent and come back to the Lord in failure. What does He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 269, 14, 49, 'do? He does not reject us. Instead He forgives us and gives us another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 269, 15, 49, 'five million rupees and tells us to carry that safely till the end of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 269, 16, 49, 'our lives. How good God is.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 269, 17, 49, 'Our testimony as Christians must be far above the standard of the world.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 269, 18, 49, 'We must not do anything that has even the appearance of evil. It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 269, 19, 49, 'better when in doubt to err on the side of caution and discretion rather');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 269, 20, 49, 'than on the opposite side.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 269, 21, 49, 'Longing after God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 269, 22, 49, 'Live before God''s face in the secret place and let there be a constant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 269, 23, 49, 'cry in your heart after Him. Christianity becomes a dry, empty religion');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 269, 24, 49, 'when this longing after God is gone. So preserve that longing after God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 269, 25, 49, 'at any cost. That is the most important part of your faith. We must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 269, 26, 49, 'constantly long after God like the thirsty deer pants for water.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 269, 27, 49, 'God''s education for us includes many things that the world calls "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 269, 28, 49, 'disappointments". But these are "His-appointments" for something better');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 270, 1, 49, 'for us. If we don''t face such disappointments, we will never be able to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 270, 2, 49, 'counsel others. Life''s education includes failing as well, for failure');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 270, 3, 49, 'is necessary if we are to help others in a world in which 99.9% of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 270, 4, 49, 'people are failures. Two purposes of failure are (1) to humble us (break');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 270, 5, 49, 'us) and (2) to make us compassionate towards others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 270, 6, 49, 'Your spiritual battles are also part of your education. If you work so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 270, 7, 49, 'hard for temporal earthly degrees, how much harder you must be willing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 270, 8, 49, 'to battle for an eternal, heavenly one. The time is short and the days');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 270, 9, 49, 'are evil. We must keep the eternal perspective in mind, in all our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 270, 10, 49, 'earthly pursuits. Live in a constant judgment of yourself and in a pure');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 270, 11, 49, 'inner walk with the Lord at all times.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 270, 12, 49, 'May the Lord preserve you in the centre of His will at all times -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 270, 13, 49, 'concerning your further education - and also in other matters like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 270, 14, 49, 'marriage etc., that are far more important. One fundamental principle to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 270, 15, 49, 'be borne in mind at all times is that you must never be in haste when it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 270, 16, 49, 'comes to major decisions in life .');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 270, 17, 49, 'Mercy and Legalism');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 270, 18, 49, 'I was speaking in our church-meeting yesterday about the prostitute who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 270, 19, 49, 'brought an expensive vial of perfume to pour on Jesus'' feet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 270, 20, 49, '(Lk.7;37,38). She had obviously bought that perfume with her earnings as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 270, 21, 49, 'a prostitute. Jesus knew that the Law had forbidden the earnings of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 270, 22, 49, 'prostitute to be offered to God (Deut.23:18). Yet He accepted her gift');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 270, 23, 49, 'gladly, because He was not a legalist. He saw her heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 270, 24, 49, 'It is your heart that God sees more than your actions. It is in such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 270, 25, 49, 'situations that the Pharisees (both in the 1st and 20th centuries) are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 270, 26, 49, 'exposed and made manifest by the way they criticise sincere believers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 270, 27, 49, 'The Pharisees would never have accepted such a gift from a prostitute.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 270, 28, 49, 'The Lord''s heart was obviously much wider than theirs! Like we sing in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 271, 1, 49, 'that hymn of Frederick Faber''s:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 271, 2, 49, 'There''s a wideness in God''s mercy, like the wideness of the sea;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 271, 3, 49, 'There''s a kindness in His justice, which is more than liberty.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 271, 4, 49, 'For the love of God is broader than the measure of our mind;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 271, 5, 49, 'And the heart of the Eternal is most wonderfully kind.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 271, 6, 49, 'But we make His love too narrow by false limits of our own;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 271, 7, 49, 'And we magnify His strictness with a zeal He will not own.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 271, 8, 49, 'We must never forget that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 271, 9, 49, 'Freedom from the Pursuit of Money and Sex');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 271, 10, 49, 'There are two sides to "proclaiming the Lord''s death" - one is that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 271, 11, 49, 'Christ died for us, and the other that we died with Christ. It is only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 271, 12, 49, 'as we accept both facts and seek to live each day in the reality of them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 271, 13, 49, 'that we can meaningfully take part in "the bread and the cup". Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 271, 14, 49, 'died because of our sins. So we must take every sin seriously. If we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 271, 15, 49, 'read the sermon on the mount carefully, we will see that Jesus taught');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 271, 16, 49, 'that those who retained anger against others and those who lusted after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 271, 17, 49, 'women were both in danger of hellfire. This latter sin was so serious,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 271, 18, 49, 'that Jesus said that it would be better to become blind. Of course there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 271, 19, 49, 'is forgiveness of sins in Christ''s blood if we repent and confess these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 271, 20, 49, 'sins. But that should not prevent us from realising the seriousness of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 271, 21, 49, 'these sins. We can never have victory over these sins until we realize');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 271, 22, 49, 'that these sins are serious enough to take us to hell. And these are the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 271, 23, 49, 'sins for which our Saviour suffered and died on the cross. Only when we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 271, 24, 49, 'take such sins seriously can we say that we have begun to take God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 271, 25, 49, 'Word seriously.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 271, 26, 49, 'I pray that you will take the sin of lusting after women seriously, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 271, 27, 49, 'seek for grace from God to overcome it permanently. If you kill this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 271, 28, 49, 'Goliath, you will find that the other Philistines run away (as in 1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 272, 1, 49, 'Samuel 17:51).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 272, 2, 49, 'I also pray that you will never make money your god - for that can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 272, 3, 49, 'destroy you finally. Almost everyone in the world is in the mad pursuit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 272, 4, 49, 'of money and sex and honour nowadays. If you are to be a light for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 272, 5, 49, 'Lord, you have to be free from this pursuit yourself. Be careful in all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 272, 6, 49, 'your thoughts about the future that you seek the kingdom of God first.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 272, 7, 49, 'Your first calling is to be a witness for Christ - not to be rich or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 272, 8, 49, 'great in this world. Leave it to God to determine how much of this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 272, 9, 49, 'world''s wealth and honour to entrust you with. He decides that - and it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 272, 10, 49, 'is different for each of His children. Some of God''s children are rich');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 272, 11, 49, 'and honoured while others are poor and dishonoured.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 272, 12, 49, 'Live with eternity''s perspective always.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 272, 13, 49, 'The Father always heard Jesus'' prayers, because Jesus was always careful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 272, 14, 49, 'never to allow sin to enter His heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 272, 15, 49, 'The progress of temptation to sin is like this: 1. Temptation begins as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 272, 16, 49, 'a thought flashed into the mind. (From there it seeks to descend into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 272, 17, 49, 'the heart). 2. It descends into the heart. (Then it becomes sin). (From');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 272, 18, 49, 'here sin seeks to express itself through the body). 3. Sin expresses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 272, 19, 49, 'itself through the tongue, eyes, hands etc. (This is when others can see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 272, 20, 49, 'it).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 272, 21, 49, 'Jesus was tempted. But He always prevented Step 2. So He never sinned.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 272, 22, 49, 'We must pray that God will pour out on us " the Spirit of grace and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 272, 23, 49, 'supplication so that we look at Jesus Whom we have hurt - and mourn ".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 272, 24, 49, 'We mourn for having hurt Him in the past, by allowing temptation to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 272, 25, 49, 'progress to Step 2 and become sin (Zech.12:10). May the Lord give you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 272, 26, 49, 'the comfort that He gives to all who mourn for their sins.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 272, 27, 49, 'Calvinism and Arminianism');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 272, 28, 49, 'Here are some notes on Calvinism and Arminianism (for your information).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 273, 1, 49, 'The Calvinists (followers of John Calvin, a Swiss Christian - 1509-1564)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 273, 2, 49, 'emphasise the sovereign choice of God in salvation. Their five points');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 273, 3, 49, 'are summed up by the acronym T-U-L-I-P:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 273, 4, 49, '(1) Total depravity: They say that man cannot repent, without God''s help');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 273, 5, 49, '- and so we should not ask anyone to repent!! What would Peter and Paul');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 273, 6, 49, 'have thought of that??');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 273, 7, 49, '(2) Unconditional election: They say that God sovereignly chooses His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 273, 8, 49, 'children, without any condition being fulfilled on man''s part. If so,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 273, 9, 49, 'then no-one can be blamed for going to hell!!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 273, 10, 49, '(3) Limited atonement: They say that Christ died ONLY for the `elect'',');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 273, 11, 49, 'and not for all men. But 1 John 2:2 says clearly that Jesus died " for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 273, 12, 49, 'the whole world".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 273, 13, 49, '(4) Irresistible grace: They say that those who are chosen by God WILL');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 273, 14, 49, 'NOT be able to resist God''s call and His grace, but WILL definitely be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 273, 15, 49, 'saved. This would make man into a robot and contradicts everything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 273, 16, 49, 'taught about freedom of choice in the New Testament.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 273, 17, 49, '(5) Perseverance of the saints: They say that once a person is saved, he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 273, 18, 49, 'can never be lost. But Hebrews 3:14 says we have to hold fast until the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 273, 19, 49, 'end to become a partaker of Christ. And in Revelation 3:5, Jesus warns');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 273, 20, 49, 'believers that their names will be erased from the book of life if they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 273, 21, 49, 'do not overcome.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 273, 22, 49, 'Those who believe the above teachings to an extreme are called');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 273, 23, 49, 'hyper-Calvinists. As you can see, I don''t agree with any of these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 273, 24, 49, 'points, because they are all contrary to the word of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 273, 25, 49, 'The Arminians (followers of Jacob Arminius, a Dutch Christian -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 273, 26, 49, '1560-1609) emphasise the freewill of man - and refute all the above 5');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 273, 27, 49, 'points.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 273, 28, 49, 'The Bible does teach the sovereignty of God - but not to the extreme');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 274, 1, 49, 'that the hyper-Calvinists teach it. Truth when carried to such a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 274, 2, 49, 'ridiculous extreme becomes error. Does God choose us or do we choose');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 274, 3, 49, 'God? The answer is: Both! God chose us according to His foreknowledge (1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 274, 4, 49, 'Pet.1:1,2). What that means is: God knew from eternity past all who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 274, 5, 49, 'would choose Him - and He chose them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 274, 6, 49, 'Charles Simeon (a godly Christian in England in the 18th century) said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 274, 7, 49, 'concerning this matter: " The truth does not lie in one extreme nor in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 274, 8, 49, 'the other. Much less does it lie in the middle! The truth lies in both');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 274, 9, 49, 'extremes held together simultaneously. " That is a beautiful way of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 274, 10, 49, 'expressing it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 274, 11, 49, 'So I believe in the sovereignty of God as well as in the free will that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 274, 12, 49, 'God has given all men. So, when I preach, I challenge people to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 274, 13, 49, 'surrender their free will to God. But when I pray, I believe that God in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 274, 14, 49, 'His absolute sovereignty can do everything - and that nothing is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 274, 15, 49, 'impossible for Him. God has indeed chosen us before the worlds were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 274, 16, 49, 'created. That is a fact that humbles us. We also believe what Jesus said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 274, 17, 49, 'that only " he who endures until the end will be saved" (Matt.24:13). We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 274, 18, 49, 'don''t have to unravel the mysteries of His sovereign choice of us and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 274, 19, 49, 'our freedom of choice. We just believe it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 274, 20, 49, 'John Wesley was primarily an Arminian, whereas his contemporary George');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 274, 21, 49, 'Whitefield was primarily a Calvinist. Even though they never worked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 274, 22, 49, 'together, they still respected each other. They were both blessed by God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 274, 23, 49, 'and brought revival to 18th-century England, each of them preaching to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 274, 24, 49, 'thousands of people at open-air meetings. When George Whitefield died,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 274, 25, 49, 'John Wesley spoke at his funeral (as per Whitefield''s specific request');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 274, 26, 49, 'before his death). After the funeral, one of Wesley''s followers asked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 274, 27, 49, 'him whether he expected to meet Whitefield in heaven. Wesley said " No "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 274, 28, 49, '- and the reason he gave was, " George Whitefield was so bright a star');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 275, 1, 49, 'in the firmament of God''s glory, and will stand so near the throne, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 275, 2, 49, 'one like me, who am less than the least, will never catch a glimpse of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 275, 3, 49, 'him." That is Christian humility . John Wesley knew that God was not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 275, 4, 49, 'going to examine our doctrines at His judgment-seat, but our hearts and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 275, 5, 49, 'the way we lived.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 275, 6, 50, 'Chapter 49 Chapter 49');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 275, 7, 50, 'Growing in Discernment');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 275, 8, 50, 'I am glad to see that the Lord is giving you discernment on what is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 275, 9, 50, 'genuine and what is superficial in the so-called "revivals" that many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 275, 10, 50, 'Christians speak about. You must always be discerning as to what is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 275, 11, 50, 'psychological and what is spiritual in Christian preaching and in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 275, 12, 50, 'Christian meetings. You must not blindly follow what appears to be good.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 275, 13, 50, 'We are commanded to " examine everything carefully and hold fast to what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 275, 14, 50, 'is good" (that is, to what comes from God Himself" (1 Thess.5:21).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 275, 15, 50, 'We had a brothers'' meeting last Monday at which we were speaking about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 275, 16, 50, 'the great need to grow in discernment. Paul prayed for the Philippians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 275, 17, 50, 'that their "love would grow in discernment" (Phil.1:9). Those who boast');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 275, 18, 50, 'nowadays about "having seen angels in visions", should remember that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 275, 19, 50, '"Satan disguises himself as an angel of light (2Cor.11:14)!! So what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 275, 20, 50, 'they actually saw may have been demons pretending to be angels - which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 275, 21, 50, 'is nothing to boast about!! We must be alert, lest we be deceived. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 275, 22, 50, 'can fall into sin easily, if we don''t keep our spiritual senses alert at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 275, 23, 50, 'all times.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 275, 24, 50, 'Many girls are flirtatious, and you must be able to discern such ones');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 275, 25, 50, 'quickly, otherwise you will fall into their traps. You must discern who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 275, 26, 50, 'is spiritual and who is not. If you spend a lot of time fellowshipping');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 275, 27, 50, 'with unspiritual Christians, you will find that your spiritual life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 275, 28, 50, 'deteriorates gradually. This is something that you have to be especially');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 276, 1, 50, 'careful about, since you don''t receive the powerful exhortations there,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 276, 2, 50, 'that you used to receive regularly when you were here in our church in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 276, 3, 50, 'Bangalore. So you must now learn to receive those exhortations directly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 276, 4, 50, 'from the Holy Spirit from the Bible. I have found that those who learn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 276, 5, 50, 'to live by the inner witness of the Spirit save themselves from many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 276, 6, 50, 'calamities that those who live by their reason fall into. May the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 276, 7, 50, 'preserve you until the end of your days, and make you useful servants of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 276, 8, 50, 'His in His kingdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 276, 9, 50, 'Valuing Your Birthright');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 276, 10, 50, 'Be very careful when you find yourself with not much work to do or when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 276, 11, 50, 'you are bored. Those are the times when you will find sexual temptation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 276, 12, 50, 'to be strong. Then you must get away and seek fellowship with other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 276, 13, 50, 'believers or even go for a walk.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 276, 14, 50, 'Don''t ever travel alone with any girl in a car, unless absolutely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 276, 15, 50, 'essential and unavoidable, and even then only on very short trips. A few');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 276, 16, 50, 'precautions like this can preserve you from lifelong regrets.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 276, 17, 50, 'Jesus was tempted by Satan to go to the edge of the temple-top and jump');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 276, 18, 50, 'off, and to believe that the angels would protect Him. But Jesus refused');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 276, 19, 50, 'to test God foolishly like that (Matt.4:7). You also must not test God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 276, 20, 50, 'by foolishly going near the edge of any "female-cliff". Don''t imagine');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 276, 21, 50, 'that the angels of God will keep you from falling if you move around');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 276, 22, 50, 'foolishly with a girl! Many who fall from the edges of these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 276, 23, 50, '"female-cliffs" fall accidentally - and not deliberately. So the best');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 276, 24, 50, 'thing to do is to stay far away from the edges of such female-cliffs.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 276, 25, 50, 'Consider what I am saying and the Lord will give you understanding of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 276, 26, 50, 'what I mean.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 276, 27, 50, 'All young people should meditate much on the example of Esau. Think of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 276, 28, 50, 'the birthright he lost - the privilege of being the ancestor of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 277, 1, 50, 'Messiah. And what did he gain in its place? A bowl of porridge! No');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 277, 2, 50, 'wonder he wept later, when he saw the bottom line of the "balance sheet"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 277, 3, 50, 'of his life clearly - what he had gained and what he had lost. But it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 277, 4, 50, 'was too late. These things are written for our instruction. Put');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 277, 5, 50, 'spiritual values first in all matters. The world and all its honours and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 277, 6, 50, 'its pleasures and its wealth and intelligence will pass away. The one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 277, 7, 50, 'who does the will of God will remain forever (1 John 2:17).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 277, 8, 50, 'There are many bowls of porridge that Satan offers young people these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 277, 9, 50, 'days. Those who are wise will refuse all of them, because there is so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 277, 10, 50, 'much to lose. You have a specific task to fulfil in God''s will. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 277, 11, 50, 'don''t take that seriously, you will easily fall for Satan''s wiles.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 277, 12, 50, 'In Hebrews 12:17, we are told that "afterwards", Esau wanted the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 277, 13, 50, 'birthright, but he could not get it. There will be an "afterwards" in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 277, 14, 50, 'all of our lives. Make sure that in that "afterwards", you have joy over');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 277, 15, 50, 'having taken the right decisions, and no regrets.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 277, 16, 50, 'Rest and Humility');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 277, 17, 50, 'In Matthew 11:28 to 30, Jesus spoke about having rest and having a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 277, 18, 50, 'burden. To paraphrase Jesus'' words there, He was telling us to be at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 277, 19, 50, 'rest concerning all earthly burdens and to take His burden (yoke) upon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 277, 20, 50, 'our hearts. We can''t carry the Lord''s burdens until we give Him all our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 277, 21, 50, 'earthly burdens (" Cast your burden on the Lord - let Him have all your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 277, 22, 50, 'worries" - Psalm 55:22; " Don''t be concerned about food and clothing. If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 277, 23, 50, 'you do want to be concerned about something, be concerned about the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 277, 24, 50, 'kingdom of God and His righteousness " - Matt.6:31, 33 - Paraphrase).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 277, 25, 50, 'If your minds are full of anxieties and worries concerning earthly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 277, 26, 50, 'matters, you will be ineffective for the Lord. No doubt, you have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 277, 27, 50, 'think about earthly matters, but you must not worry about any of them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 277, 28, 50, 'Only those things that have eternal value should be a concern on your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 278, 1, 50, 'hearts. That is how we are different from the people of this earth. Even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 278, 2, 50, 'the results of the examinations that you do on earth have no eternal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 278, 3, 50, 'value. You must of course, do your best. But you must never worry about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 278, 4, 50, 'the result.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 278, 5, 50, 'If you seek for 100% marks in seeking God''s kingdom and His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 278, 6, 50, 'righteousness first, then you will be first in eternity. That is what I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 278, 7, 50, 'myself chose many years ago.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 278, 8, 50, 'The paraphrase of Zephaniah 3:17 says, "God is silently planning for you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 278, 9, 50, 'in love", in everything that happens. And the Lord also reminds us ,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 278, 10, 50, '"What I do, you do not understand now, but you will understand later on"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 278, 11, 50, '- (Jn.13:7).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 278, 12, 50, 'I am convinced that because we your parents have sown God''s Word into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 278, 13, 50, 'your lives for many years, we will see a rich harvest in your lives in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 278, 14, 50, 'the coming years. God will reward you with the best - spiritually first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 278, 15, 50, 'and then with whatever you need of earthly things as well. So I don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 278, 16, 50, 'have any fear for any of the four of you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 278, 17, 50, 'Finally, let me encourage you once again (as I am encouraging people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 278, 18, 50, 'everywhere) to pursue after humility and to dwell in low thoughts of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 278, 19, 50, 'yourself. That does not mean low self-esteem or an underestimation of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 278, 20, 50, 'your worth to God as His child or of the gifts and abilities that God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 278, 21, 50, 'has given you. You are children of God - and so there is no place for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 278, 22, 50, 'low self-esteem. But it is only as you recognize that you are nothing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 278, 23, 50, 'before God, that God can become everything in your life. Others who know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 278, 24, 50, 'you must glorify God for what they see in you. This will involve your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 278, 25, 50, 'giving up your own choices in order to do God''s will alone. It means');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 278, 26, 50, 'giving God the glory at all times for whatever He h­as given you and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 278, 27, 50, 'determining to use all that He has given you for His glory alone.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 278, 28, 50, 'Never, never look down or make fun of any human being, whatever his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 279, 1, 50, 'faults or defects may be. God gives abundant grace to the humble - and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 279, 2, 50, 'their spiritual progress will be phenomenal. May you walk in humility,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 279, 3, 50, 'all your days, as Jesus did.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 279, 4, 50, 'God''s Help in Examinations');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 279, 5, 50, 'We are praying that the Lord will give you intelligence over and above');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 279, 6, 50, 'what you have naturally, for your final examinations. Remember the verse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 279, 7, 50, 'I used to give you to claim, when you were studying for your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 279, 8, 50, 'examinations in school here: Daniel 1:17, " God gave the four young men');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 279, 9, 50, 'great ability to learn, and they soon mastered all the literature and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 279, 10, 50, 'science of the time ".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 279, 11, 50, 'You can''t experience God''s promises unless you claim them in faith. " If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 279, 12, 50, 'anyone lacks wisdom (or intelligence), let him ask God Who gives to all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 279, 13, 50, 'liberally. But let him ask in faith " (James 1:5,6) " If you being evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 279, 14, 50, 'know how to give good gifts to your children, how much more shall your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 279, 15, 50, 'Heavenly Father give good gifts to those who ask him ."(Matt.7:11). So');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 279, 16, 50, 'claim your Father''s promises for all things - little and big.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 279, 17, 50, 'Victorious Christian Life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 279, 18, 50, 'We have just finished an excellent conference in Bangalore - the best we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 279, 19, 50, 'ever had so far. Some of the messages have been on the following themes:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 279, 20, 50, '(a) We must adorn the doctrine we preach with a Christlike life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 279, 21, 50, '(b) We must emphasize Divine Life and Fellowship always - which is what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 279, 22, 50, 'the Father, Son & Holy Spirit had from the beginning - and not be taken');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 279, 23, 50, 'up with peripheral truths (1 John 1:3).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 279, 24, 50, '(c) We must trust God to raise us up from the dead, like He raised Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 279, 25, 50, 'from the dead, if we give ourselves up to die to Self daily.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 279, 26, 50, '(d) Young people must overcome the `Goliaths'' of sexual lust and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 279, 27, 50, 'spiritual pride, if they are to be preserved for God in these evil days.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 279, 28, 50, 'The world is flooded with unclean spirits (Rev.16:13) like the frogs in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 280, 1, 50, 'Egypt. But there must be no frogs in our bedrooms or in our minds.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 280, 2, 50, '(e) Money is a tremendous power that draws people away from God very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 280, 3, 50, 'subtly. If we love it, we will definitely hate God. If we hold on to it,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 280, 4, 50, 'we will despise God (Lk.16:13). Those who long to get rich will pierce');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 280, 5, 50, 'themselves with many sorrows and suffer in many ways - not those whoare');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 280, 6, 50, 'rich or who become rich but those who are longing to become rich. So we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 280, 7, 50, 'must fear the power of Money constantly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 280, 8, 50, '(f) The only work that Jesus asked us to do to satisfy God is to believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 280, 9, 50, 'in Him (Jn.6:28, 29). That means that in every situation and in every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 280, 10, 50, 'moment, the only thing that God wants us to do is to believe in Jesus,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 280, 11, 50, 'that He can handle everything that is happening in the world and to us,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 280, 12, 50, 'and can help us with everything that we need at any moment. Human');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 280, 13, 50, 'reasoning says that we must always be good enough for God to work on our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 280, 14, 50, 'behalf. But we will never ever be good enough even in 10,000 years. So');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 280, 15, 50, 'God gives His promises to those who believe in Him. Anyone who preaches');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 280, 16, 50, 'another gospel is accursed - even if he is as holy as an angel from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 280, 17, 50, 'heaven (Gal.1:8, 9). Therefore, by simply believing, we can receive the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 280, 18, 50, 'Holy Spirit - and every other spiritual blessing too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 280, 19, 50, '(g) God chose us before the foundation of the world - before we had done');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 280, 20, 50, 'anything good or bad (Rom.9:11) - and decided to bless us with every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 280, 21, 50, 'blessing of the Spirit in Christ. Therefore He is not going to change');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 280, 22, 50, 'His mind about us now.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 280, 23, 50, 'I often think of what you are missing by not being able to be in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 280, 24, 50, 'Bangalore to attend our wonderful conferences here. I have wished many a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 280, 25, 50, 'time that you were here at home. But the Lord was the One Who opened the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 280, 26, 50, 'door for you to study in your colleges. So I pray that you will get your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 280, 27, 50, 'portion even there. The Lord can give you your portion, right where you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 280, 28, 50, 'are, if you seek Him - even though you are far away from us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 281, 1, 50, 'geographically - just like He sent His Spirit on Eldad and Medad even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 281, 2, 50, 'though they were far away from the tent where God was meeting with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 281, 3, 50, 'others (Numbers 11:24-30). May the Lord bless you and preserve you in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 281, 4, 50, 'life and spiritual freshness at all times, until He returns.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 281, 5, 51, 'Chapter 50 Chapter 50');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 281, 6, 51, 'God Has Planned Every Detail of Your Life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 281, 7, 51, 'When we get to heaven, we will see the angels who protected us as we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 281, 8, 51, 'travelled on the roads here on earth. When we see the video-tape replay');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 281, 9, 51, 'of our whole life in the final day, we will discover that there were a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 281, 10, 51, 'few thousand angels who protected us whom we have to thank. We may now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 281, 11, 51, 'be aware of only a few "near misses" that we had on the roads. But in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 281, 12, 51, 'that day, we will discover that there were many more such "misses" from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 281, 13, 51, 'which we were saved. So be thankful.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 281, 14, 51, 'All things work together for our very best. After the accident I had a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 281, 15, 51, 'few years ago, I said, "Lord I haven''t yet expressed my gratitude fully');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 281, 16, 51, 'for what you did for me on Calvary. So please give me a little more time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 281, 17, 51, 'to say `Thank You''". Then I thought of this phrase: "Our lives must be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 281, 18, 51, 'constant expression of gratitude to the Lord for what He did for us on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 281, 19, 51, 'the cross."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 281, 20, 51, 'God has a purpose in everything. It says about Jacob that " by faith he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 281, 21, 51, 'worshipped God leaning on his staff (which actually was a crutch,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 281, 22, 51, 'because he could not walk without it any longer, since God had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 281, 23, 51, 'dislocated his thigh), and Jacob blessed others" (Heb.11:21). That staff');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 281, 24, 51, '(crutch) became a constant reminder to strong self-sufficient Jacob that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 281, 25, 51, 'he had to lean helplessly on God for everything. It was thus that he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 281, 26, 51, 'became Israel - a prince of God who had power with God and with men. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 281, 27, 51, 'was when he had come to that weak state that he could bless others (as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 281, 28, 51, 'that verse says). I pray that you too will know something of that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 282, 1, 51, 'experience - of being broken of your human strength, so that you lean');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 282, 2, 51, 'upon God alone, and become a far greater blessing to others than you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 282, 3, 51, 'could ever have been otherwise.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 282, 4, 51, 'God has planned your life perfectly - every detail. He allows Satan to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 282, 5, 51, 'attack you, just as He allowed Satan to attack Jesus. But Jesus kept his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 282, 6, 51, 'spirit pure and you can keep your spirit pure too. " God knows every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 282, 7, 51, 'detail of what is happening to you" (Job 23:10 - Living), even when you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 282, 8, 51, 'are in trying circumstances; and He plans every detail too (Rom.8:28).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 282, 9, 51, 'So find your comfort in that. It is good to experience a leaning upon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 282, 10, 51, 'God alone, in circumstances where you find that "the help of man is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 282, 11, 51, 'vain". That is the only way to grow spiritually. C. T. Studd once said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 282, 12, 51, '" I love the luxury of a tight spot, so that I can see what miracle God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 282, 13, 51, 'will do for me there ".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 282, 14, 51, 'It will bring a tremendous release in us when we realize that God the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 282, 15, 51, 'Father chose us, the Son of God purchased us with his blood and the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 282, 16, 51, 'Spirit has now sealed us to be God''s own (Eph.1:1-13). Our salvation was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 282, 17, 51, 'entirely of God''s grace. God just waited for us to say "Yes" and then He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 282, 18, 51, 'did it all (Eph.2:1-8). He couldn''t have saved us without getting our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 282, 19, 51, 'permission, for we are not robots.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 282, 20, 51, 'Distinguishing Between the Voice of God and the Voice of Satan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 282, 21, 51, 'It was with a good heart that Peter told Jesus not to go to the cross.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 282, 22, 51, 'But Jesus immediately recognized that suggestion as being the voice of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 282, 23, 51, 'Satan and told Peter, "Get behind Me, Satan. Your mind is set on man''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 282, 24, 51, 'interests and not on God''s interests" (Matt.16:23). We see there that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 282, 25, 51, 'can distinguish between the voice of God and the voice of Satan in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 282, 26, 51, 'hearts only if our minds are set on God''s interests. If our minds are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 282, 27, 51, 'set on our own interests primarily, then we can mistake the voice of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 282, 28, 51, 'Satan for the voice of God. So it is good in all that we do - even in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 283, 1, 51, 'your study, work and play - to have a heavenly perspective. Do all for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 283, 2, 51, 'the glory of God. Study well at college and play well on the field, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 283, 3, 51, 'glorify God always - like Eric Liddell, who never compromised his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 283, 4, 51, 'convictions even when it meant the loss of an Olympic gold medal!! Never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 283, 5, 51, 'be ashamed to let others know that you have certain standards as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 283, 6, 51, 'Christian. May the Lord help you to do so.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 283, 7, 51, 'We are proud of you because of your earnest desire to honour God, in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 283, 8, 51, 'midst of the battles you face there in college. We are praying for you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 283, 9, 51, 'regularly. We believe that the Lord will give you grace and strength to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 283, 10, 51, 'face and overcome every attack of the enemy by which he would try to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 283, 11, 51, 'make you compromise. The Lord is always on your side against Satan and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 283, 12, 51, 'He will enable you to overcome the evil one.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 283, 13, 51, 'God has allowed many things on this earth to be attractive, so that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 283, 14, 51, 'can prove when we are tempted by them, that we love God more than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 283, 15, 51, 'everything else on earth. Thus we put Satan to shame. The Creator is far');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 283, 16, 51, 'greater, far more wonderful and far more satisfying than all of His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 283, 17, 51, 'creation. This is true and that is why we believe it. This faith of ours');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 283, 18, 51, 'is what makes us overcome the attractions of the world. When we live by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 283, 19, 51, 'this faith blindly , our feelings will follow along, in due course. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 283, 20, 51, 'must not look for feelings first.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 283, 21, 51, 'Battling against Satan is good for our spirits. Only thus can we become');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 283, 22, 51, 'strong. Be a good soldier of Christ. The Lord is depending on you. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 283, 23, 51, 'too are depending on you to keep the flag of the Lord flying high and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 283, 24, 51, 'triumphant - so that the Lord''s Name is never put to shame!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 283, 25, 51, 'Living a Worthwhile Life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 283, 26, 51, 'If soldiers can sacrifice so much for the sake of their country in order');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 283, 27, 51, 'to keep their country independent and free, how much more we should be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 283, 28, 51, 'willing to sacrifice everything (even our lives), so that the Lord is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 284, 1, 51, 'honoured through our lives in every way, and Satan put to shame.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 284, 2, 51, 'I hope you are finding grace from God supernaturally in your tasks. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 284, 3, 51, 'can ask God to give you ideas for your study and work. God will help');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 284, 4, 51, 'you. Ask in faith - and see what miracles He can do for you. It is as we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 284, 5, 51, 'prove Him in such circumstances that our faith gets strengthened. Honour');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 284, 6, 51, 'God at all times. Those who honour Him always get the best in life in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 284, 7, 51, 'every area. I have proved that since the time I was born again, and to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 284, 8, 51, 'such an extent that I wish I could go around this world telling the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 284, 9, 51, 'following to people everywhere:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 284, 10, 51, '- Honour God in every area.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 284, 11, 51, '- Put God first in your affections at all times.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 284, 12, 51, '- Keep your conscience clean at all times.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 284, 13, 51, '- Only then will you be able to live a worthwhile life".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 284, 14, 51, 'The biggest fools in this world are those who don''t give importance to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 284, 15, 51, 'these matters, who think that they can live a worthwhile life with their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 284, 16, 51, 'talents and their earthly accomplishments. None of these can satisfy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 284, 17, 51, 'anyone ultimately.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 284, 18, 51, 'John 15 is a wonderful chapter. Abiding is a picture of perfect rest (as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 284, 19, 51, 'the branch in the vine) without anxiety or tension - which is the result');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 284, 20, 51, 'of faith that God cares for every detail of our life. There will be toil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 284, 21, 51, 'and hard work, but no anxiety or tension. The constant flow of sap from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 284, 22, 51, 'the tree to the branch illustrates the need for the constant infilling');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 284, 23, 51, 'of the Holy Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 284, 24, 51, 'Phariseeism and Legalism');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 284, 25, 51, 'We had a very blessed New Year''s conference. The theme was " Freedom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 284, 26, 51, 'from Phariseeism and Legalism". I think it liberated many of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 284, 27, 51, 'brothers and sisters from petty rules and regulations such as " Touch');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 284, 28, 51, 'not, taste not, handle not..." etc., that they had been labouring under.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 285, 1, 51, 'We thought of two good practices for the new year: (1) Judge yourself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 285, 2, 51, 'every day and (2) Be merciful to others every day. These two things will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 285, 3, 51, 'make the final day of judgment easy for everyone (See James 2:13).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 285, 4, 51, 'Everything that you have gone through (and that you will go through in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 285, 5, 51, 'the coming days) is designed by God to give you a ministry to others in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 285, 6, 51, 'the world who have blundered and failed (which comprises 100% of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 285, 7, 51, 'people in the world), to give them great hope. Even your personality,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 285, 8, 51, 'your I.Q., your grades, your upbringing and your education are all part');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 285, 9, 51, 'of that perfect plan of God. So praise the Lord!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 285, 10, 51, 'I want to suggest something to all of you as you begin this new year.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 285, 11, 51, 'Seek the Lord for two things: (1) That He will show you from His Word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 285, 12, 51, 'how powerful His justification is that He actually sees you as if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 285, 13, 51, 'had never sinned up until today. (2) To be totally free from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 285, 14, 51, 'opinions of all men. We don''t realize how much we are enslaved to what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 285, 15, 51, 'people think of us. If you work on these two things, you can be a very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 285, 16, 51, 'effective vessel in the Lord''s hands. Satan often tries to make us think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 285, 17, 51, 'we are humble when we grovel in the memory of our past failures. But the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 285, 18, 51, 'only time we should think of our past failures is when we are tempted to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 285, 19, 51, 'be hard on someone else (2 Pet.1:9) - not otherwise.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 285, 20, 51, 'If you are clear on these two points, your life will take off like a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 285, 21, 51, 'rocket without anything to hold you down. Don''t try to reason these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 285, 22, 51, 'matters out rationally or intellectually. Just believe God''s Word and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 285, 23, 51, 'trust it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 285, 24, 52, 'Chapter 51 Chapter 51');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 285, 25, 52, 'Three Marriages');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 285, 26, 52, 'Here is a simple illustration of our being free from sin and free from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 285, 27, 52, 'the Law.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 285, 28, 52, 'Marriage Number One : In our unconverted days, we were all married to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 286, 1, 52, 'the old man, as our husband. He was an evil husband who always asked us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 286, 2, 52, 'to do sinful things. But God killed that husband when we were born again');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 286, 3, 52, '(" Your old man was crucified with Christ" - Rom.6:6) so that we could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 286, 4, 52, 'be free from him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 286, 5, 52, 'Marriage Number Two : But then instead of marrying Christ, we married');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 286, 6, 52, 'the Law thinking that he was Christ. Unlike the old man, the Law is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 286, 7, 52, 'perfect husband who demands perfection in all areas (and so his demands');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 286, 8, 52, 'can''t be questioned), This husband''s demands are all righteous, but he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 286, 9, 52, 'never lifts a finger to help us! And we are miserable. Our life is one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 286, 10, 52, 'of perpetual struggle to please God, but we never succeed for too long.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 286, 11, 52, 'This is life under the Law. And there appears to be no possibility of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 286, 12, 52, 'escape from this marriage, because the Law is perfect and can never die.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 286, 13, 52, 'But yet God makes a way for us to be set free from this marriage. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 286, 14, 52, 'kills the wife (we die) and thus the marriage is dissolved (Rom.7:1-4).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 286, 15, 52, 'Thus we are free from legalism and the Law.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 286, 16, 52, 'Marriage Number Three : Then God raises the wife (us) from the dead and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 286, 17, 52, 'we now gladly choose to be united to Christ (Rom.7:4). This is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 286, 18, 52, 'abundant life Jesus came to give us. Christ too is as perfect as the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 286, 19, 52, 'Law. But He is a helpful husband. In fact He does 99% of the work. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 286, 20, 52, 'He never compels us. What a wonderful husband! This is the real');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 286, 21, 52, 'Christian life - a partnership where Christ and you are under a common');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 286, 22, 52, 'yoke (Matt.11:29). This is the overcoming life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 286, 23, 52, 'The sin of adultery (physical adultery) crouches very close to every man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 286, 24, 52, 'at all times - exactly as God told Cain, " Sin is crouching at your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 286, 25, 52, 'door, waiting to conquer you. But you must master it " (Gen.4:7). So the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 286, 26, 52, 'only way of escape is: (1) By having a great fear of God (like Joseph');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 286, 27, 52, 'had - Gen.39:9) and (2) By avoiding all provocative situations where you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 286, 28, 52, 'are alone with a girl (like Joseph did) (Gen.39:10; 1 Cor.6:18; 2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 287, 1, 52, 'Tim.2:22). You must also be alert to recognize where your conversation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 287, 2, 52, 'with a girl becomes flippant. Then you are in danger. You must be very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 287, 3, 52, 'sensitive to hear the voice of the Holy Spirit when He tells you to stop');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 287, 4, 52, 'a conversation with a girl, or to go away immediately from her presence.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 287, 5, 52, 'Only thus can you survive in the wicked atmosphere that there is in many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 287, 6, 52, 'colleges. Keep this in mind at all times, and you will be saved from a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 287, 7, 52, 'lifetime of regret.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 287, 8, 52, 'Jesus demonstrated in His life, the inner rest that there can be in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 287, 9, 52, 'life where God is the only Person Who matters. God is seeking for people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 287, 10, 52, 'now who will show through their lives that this world''s value system is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 287, 11, 52, 'wrong - that money is not everything, that education and sex, human love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 287, 12, 52, 'and marriage are also not everything, and that even comfortable living');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 287, 13, 52, 'is not everything. All these things are good in their place. But we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 287, 14, 52, 'called to demonstrate to the world that God alone is everything. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 287, 15, 52, 'true Christianity. All the other good things can find their proper place');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 287, 16, 52, 'in our lives only when God becomes everything to us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 287, 17, 52, 'Being a Perfect Guest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 287, 18, 52, 'As I celebrate my birthday today, I think of the four of you, my sons,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 287, 19, 52, 'as the birthday gifts God has given me. It has been a real joy to be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 287, 20, 52, 'father to all of you. You have made my task very easy. And as you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 287, 21, 52, 'grown up, I have been proud to see you all take a stand for the Lord on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 287, 22, 52, 'your own - quite apart from us, your Dad and Mom. That is how I wanted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 287, 23, 52, 'it to be. I wanted you all to grow up to become my brothers in Christ -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 287, 24, 52, 'for that is what we will be for all eternity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 287, 25, 52, 'And here is a bit of advice concerning your conduct, when you stay in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 287, 26, 52, 'other people''s homes. It is probably unnecessary for me to tell you all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 287, 27, 52, 'this, because I have said all this to you before. But I will still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 287, 28, 52, 'repeat myself:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 288, 1, 52, '(1) Make friends with the children in the home. This is one of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 288, 2, 52, 'primary things that distinguishes the followers of Jesus from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 288, 3, 52, 'followers of the Pharisees. The first principle of all effective');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 288, 4, 52, 'ministry is: "Jesus was made in all things like His brethren"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 288, 5, 52, '(Heb.2:17). So when you are with children in their home, be like them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 288, 6, 52, 'Come down to their level and talk with them and play with them. Let them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 288, 7, 52, 'see Jesus in you. Paul said, "I have become all things to all men so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 288, 8, 52, 'that by all means I may save some" (1 Cor.9:22). Play with the children.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 288, 9, 52, 'Jesus must have done this when He walked on this earth. I read of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 288, 10, 52, 'handicapped child who had a vision once where he saw himself in heaven');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 288, 11, 52, 'playing with a bat and ball with Jesus. I can believe that vision more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 288, 12, 52, 'than many other visions that people speak of. When Jesus reigns on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 288, 13, 52, 'earth, the children will be playing - not praying but playing - on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 288, 14, 52, 'streets (Zech.8:5)!!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 288, 15, 52, '(2) Be considerate of others at the dining table. Don''t be gluttonous.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 288, 16, 52, 'Be disciplined in your eating.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 288, 17, 52, '(3) Help with the washing-up of the dishes after each meal.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 288, 18, 52, '(4) Do your bed each morning, and keep your things and your room neat');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 288, 19, 52, 'and tidy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 288, 20, 52, '(5) Spend the minimum time in the bathroom and toilet, as an act of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 288, 21, 52, 'consideration for others who will also want to use it. When I stay in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 288, 22, 52, 'homes where there is only one bathroom or toilet, I find out at what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 288, 23, 52, 'time the others usually use these rooms. So I use them either before or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 288, 24, 52, 'after that time, so as to make it available for the others when they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 288, 25, 52, 'need to use them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 288, 26, 52, '(6) Don''t forget to express your sincere gratitude to your hosts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 288, 27, 52, '(especially to the lady of the house), when you are leaving. And, leave');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 288, 28, 52, 'a small cash-gift behind and ask them to get something for their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 289, 1, 52, 'children.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 289, 2, 52, 'I know that you are already doing all these things, for I have heard');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 289, 3, 52, 'excellent reports about you from every house you have visited so far.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 289, 4, 52, 'And I am proud of you. I am repeating these simple guidelines here only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 289, 5, 52, 'for emphasis.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 289, 6, 52, 'Little Eagles Must Learn to Fly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 289, 7, 52, 'It is good to be cast upon God alone for the future, and not on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 289, 8, 52, 'changing laws of employment in different companies and nations. If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 289, 9, 52, 'seek God''s kingdom first, you will find all the other things you need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 289, 10, 52, 'for life added to you. No-one can frustrate God''s perfect plan for your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 289, 11, 52, 'life, if God''s plan is all that you want - and His plan is always the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 289, 12, 52, 'best.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 289, 13, 52, 'Jesus lived in dependence on the witness of the Spirit and did not lean');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 289, 14, 52, 'on His own reason, when He decided to be baptized by John. That is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 289, 15, 52, 'way we are to live too. We must certainly use our mind and reason. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 289, 16, 52, 'the Spirit''s witness must always be supreme.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 289, 17, 52, 'I have often wished that all of you were closer to Bangalore so that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 289, 18, 52, 'could meet together more often. But the nest has to be stirred up so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 289, 19, 52, 'that the little eaglets learn to fly on their own. That is God''s order');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 289, 20, 52, 'for His creation and so we submit to it (Deut.32:11). We only pray that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 289, 21, 52, 'all of you will learn to fly, even if you do fall to the ground, now and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 289, 22, 52, 'then, while learning to fly. God will always be faithful to pick you up.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 289, 23, 52, '" Underneath you are the everlasting arms. God will thrust out your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 289, 24, 52, 'enemies before you saying, `Destroy them'' " (Deut.33:27).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 289, 25, 52, '" If you fall, it won''t be fatal, for the Lord will hold you up with His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 289, 26, 52, 'hand. The Lord never forsakes a man who loves Him, and the children of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 289, 27, 52, 'the godly will never go hungry. Instead, the godly are able to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 289, 28, 52, 'generous with their gifts, and their children are a blessing "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 290, 1, 52, '(Psa.37:24-26 - Living).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 290, 2, 52, 'You all have been a blessing to many here in Bangalore, and especially');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 290, 3, 52, 'to the children in the church. And so, it is not just we, but many in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 290, 4, 52, 'the church too, who miss you, now that you have left Bangalore. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 290, 5, 52, 'children in the church really enjoyed your recent visit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 290, 6, 52, 'The Danger of Being Religious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 290, 7, 52, 'Don''t let anything that happens ever discourage you, because if you hold');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 290, 8, 52, 'on to the Lord, He will help you overcome every situation - whatever it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 290, 9, 52, 'be. Every trial is designed by Him to enable you to get to know Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 290, 10, 52, 'better. This is where both unbelievers and worldly believers fail.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 290, 11, 52, 'Instead of turning to God, they turn to the world and experiment with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 290, 12, 52, 'forbidden substances in order to get relaxation and peace in their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 290, 13, 52, 'failure or distress. Don''t ever try such things. It is very easy to get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 290, 14, 52, 'addicted even to things that look harmless initially.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 290, 15, 52, 'Perfection is attained not by those who never fail, but by those who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 290, 16, 52, 'honest about their failures and who jump up immediately as soon as they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 290, 17, 52, 'fall, and press on.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 290, 18, 52, 'We always face the danger of becoming `religious'' and thinking that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 290, 19, 52, '`spirituality''. Religious people are taken up with the externals -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 290, 20, 52, 'external sacrifices for the Lord, external rituals connected with their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 290, 21, 52, 'understanding of what the minimum is that they must do in order to keep');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 290, 22, 52, 'in good standing in their church, in church activities, in external');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 290, 23, 52, 'details of their dress, in intellectual study of the Word (without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 290, 24, 52, 'practical application), and in emotional meetings (imagining such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 290, 25, 52, 'emotionalism to be evidence of the power of the Spirit) etc. None of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 290, 26, 52, 'these things are wrong or even unimportant. But for religious people,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 290, 27, 52, 'these activities are primary and they imagine these to be the marks of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 290, 28, 52, 'spirituality, and are thus deceived.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 291, 1, 52, 'Truly spiritual people however, are taken up with wanting to know God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 291, 2, 52, 'better, seeking to preserve themselves in a fervent love for Jesus and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 291, 3, 52, 'for their fellow-believers, seeking to find out what God wants them to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 291, 4, 52, 'do (rather than `doing something for God''), seeking for the power of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 291, 5, 52, 'Holy Spirit, and cleansing themselves of selfish motives in their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 291, 6, 52, 'actions. Religious people build congregations. Spiritual people build');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 291, 7, 52, 'the Body of Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 291, 8, 52, 'God is looking across the world for men who will stand up for Him;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 291, 9, 52, 'unlike the Pharisees who had truth warped and out of proportion and who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 291, 10, 52, 'strained out mosquitoes and swallowed camels. God is looking for men who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 291, 11, 52, 'will stand for the principles of His Word, men like Elijah, John the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 291, 12, 52, 'Baptist and Paul, Martin Luther, John Wesley and Eric Liddell, who stood');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 291, 13, 52, 'for what they believed, whatever the cost might be. God is going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 291, 14, 52, 'populate heaven with such people of principle. I pray that you will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 291, 15, 52, 'in that number. You will have ample opportunity to stand up for the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 291, 16, 52, 'in college. May you do so on every occasion.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 291, 17, 52, 'Many godly men have given their lives to translate the Bible into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 291, 18, 52, 'English and to preserve the pure message of the gospel in past');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 291, 19, 52, 'centuries. But unfortunately, today, many believers do not spend even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 291, 20, 52, 'five minutes to read the Bible in their homes, and much less to study');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 291, 21, 52, 'it. Many godly men in past centuries may not have had the clear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 291, 22, 52, 'understanding of doctrine that we have today. But they had a fervent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 291, 23, 52, 'devotion to Christ such as is rarely found these days - and that is what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 291, 24, 52, 'matters most in the final analysis - not just correctness of doctrine.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 291, 25, 53, 'Chapter 52 Chapter 52');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 291, 26, 53, 'Perplexity and Wisdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 291, 27, 53, 'I want you to know that being perplexed when we are seeking to find the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 291, 28, 53, 'will of God about something is perfectly normal. It is the way God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 292, 1, 53, 'trains us to walk by faith - for certainty can be the equivalent of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 292, 2, 53, 'walking by sight.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 292, 3, 53, 'Even the apostle Paul was perplexed many a time, not knowing the will of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 292, 4, 53, 'God. He says he was " perplexed because we don''t know why things happen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 292, 5, 53, 'as they do. But we don''t give up and quit " (2 Cor.4:8 - Living Bible).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 292, 6, 53, 'One reason why God allows us to be perplexed and to make mistakes is so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 292, 7, 53, 'that "no man will boast before Him" (1 Cor.1:29). No one will be able to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 292, 8, 53, 'say in eternity that because he did all the right things, he fulfilled');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 292, 9, 53, 'God''s perfect will. Our glorying in eternity will only be this - that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 292, 10, 53, 'God fulfilled His perfect will in us, even though we made so many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 292, 11, 53, 'mistakes and even though we committed so many blunders. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 292, 12, 53, 'certainly my testimony. Thus God alone will get all the glory, and we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 292, 13, 53, 'get nothing. It is because many believers have not seen this ultimate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 292, 14, 53, 'purpose of God that they feel discouraged whenever they fail or whenever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 292, 15, 53, 'they are perplexed concerning God''s ways and His will. God''s ways are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 292, 16, 53, 'not our ways. They are as different as heaven is from earth (Is.55:8,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 292, 17, 53, '9).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 292, 18, 53, 'Divine wisdom is a great thing to have. One aspect of wisdom is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 292, 19, 53, 'ability to order our priorities aright - how much time to spend in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 292, 20, 53, 'academic studies, in God''s Word, for work, for sleep, and for relaxation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 292, 21, 53, 'etc. It is in ordering their priorities that most believers fail,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 292, 22, 53, 'especially after they are married and have a family. So it is good to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 292, 23, 53, 'acquire some of that wisdom now, when you are young and single. James');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 292, 24, 53, 'says that if you lack wisdom (and we all lack it), you can ask God for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 292, 25, 53, 'it, and He will give it to you liberally. So ask!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 292, 26, 53, 'I want to encourage you all to read Chapter 6 of my book FINDING GOD''S');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 292, 27, 53, 'WILL. There I have spoken about deliverance from indecision, freedom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 292, 28, 53, 'from regret over past decisions and freedom from the fear of making');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 293, 1, 53, 'mistakes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 293, 2, 53, 'The man who never makes a mistake is the man who never does anything.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 293, 3, 53, 'Apart from Jesus Himself, no-one ever learned to walk in God''s perfect');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 293, 4, 53, 'will without making mistakes." The steps of good men are directed by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 293, 5, 53, 'Lord.....If they fall it isn''t fatal, for the Lord holds them with His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 293, 6, 53, 'Hand " (Psa. 37:23,24-Living). So don''t be afraid of making mistakes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 293, 7, 53, 'God will protect you from making serious mistakes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 293, 8, 53, 'Fulfilling the Perfect Will of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 293, 9, 53, 'I read today about how God is going to shake everything that is founded');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 293, 10, 53, 'on "created things" (Heb.12:27) - and that refers to all who have valued');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 293, 11, 53, 'created things more than their Creator. This was the sin of Adam and Eve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 293, 12, 53, 'and also of Esau (Heb.12:16) who is called `godless'' (meaning one who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 293, 13, 53, 'does not give God His rightful place in his life). Romans 1:25 speaks of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 293, 14, 53, 'those who "worship and serve the creature more than the Creator". I pray');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 293, 15, 53, 'that all of you will live all your lives as those who give God His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 293, 16, 53, 'rightful place in your lives - more than your job, or girls, or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 293, 17, 53, 'pleasure, or comfort, or money, or honour.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 293, 18, 53, 'There is nothing greater that we, your parents, could ever pray for you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 293, 19, 53, 'than this, that you fulfil the perfect will of God in your life in every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 293, 20, 53, 'area. The most important steps in life after becoming a disciple of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 293, 21, 53, 'Jesus, are the steps of marriage and employment - in that order. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 293, 22, 53, 'continuously pray that you will be in His perfect will in these two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 293, 23, 53, 'matters. All other matters are trivial compared to these two. Even which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 293, 24, 53, 'college you study in and what courses you take are trivial compared to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 293, 25, 53, 'marriage and employment. So seek the will of God earnestly in these two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 293, 26, 53, 'important matters.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 293, 27, 53, 'We will be praying that you will find the right opening for employment');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 293, 28, 53, 'that the Lord has reserved for you. You must claim the promise in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 294, 1, 53, 'Numbers 10:33, " The ark (presence) of the Lord went ahead of them to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 294, 2, 53, 'search out a resting place for them - a place where you will be at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 294, 3, 53, 'perfect rest and not restless (as many are in the offices that they work');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 294, 4, 53, 'in)! " If the Lord did that for them under the old covenant, how much');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 294, 5, 53, 'more He will do it for us who are under the new covenant. I have no fear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 294, 6, 53, 'for any of you, my sons, as long as you are seeking God''s kingdom and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 294, 7, 53, 'His righteousness first in all things and seeking to honour Him in all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 294, 8, 53, 'matters. Nothing can go wrong then. I have proved that for over 34 years');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 294, 9, 53, 'now. (*Note: And now for 57 years).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 294, 10, 53, '"What have you got that you did not receive from God?" (1 Cor.4:7).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 294, 11, 53, 'Nothing at all. It was God Who gave you your intelligence, your health');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 294, 12, 53, 'and opportunities to study and work and Who " supplied you richly with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 294, 13, 53, 'every good thing to enjoy" (1 Tim.6:17). We have prayed for you at each');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 294, 14, 53, 'step along your life''s pathway - and God has answered our prayers. For');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 294, 15, 53, 'this we are very grateful. We rejoice to see how God has matured you all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 294, 16, 53, 'spiritually, mentally, emotionally and physically. God has prepared you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 294, 17, 53, 'to face life. In the tough immoral environment of college-life, you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 294, 18, 53, 'struggled and overcome. Praise the Lord!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 294, 19, 53, 'Remember that "God is the Blessed Controller of all things" (1 Tim.6:15');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 294, 20, 53, '- JB Philips paraphrase). Daniel 4:35 is also a good verse to bear in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 294, 21, 53, 'mind: " All the inhabitants of the earth are accounted as nothing, God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 294, 22, 53, 'does according to His will in heaven and among all the inhabitants of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 294, 23, 53, 'earth. No-one can ward off His hand or say to Him, ''What are You doing?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 294, 24, 53, '''"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 294, 25, 53, 'A little time with God in the mornings can make all the difference to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 294, 26, 53, 'your day - the way things go. Don''t forget that. So, getting out of bed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 294, 27, 53, '10 minutes earlier is worth the effort. You save much more than 10');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 294, 28, 53, 'minutes thereby during the day - for the efficiency-conscious. Although');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 295, 1, 53, 'it is not for greater efficiency that we spend time with God. We do so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 295, 2, 53, 'because we acknowledge thereby that He is most important in our daily');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 295, 3, 53, 'lives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 295, 4, 53, 'Work Out Your Salvation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 295, 5, 53, 'Philippians 2:12, 13 says, " Work out your salvation with fear and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 295, 6, 53, 'trembling, since it is God who is at work within you to will and to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 295, 7, 53, 'of His good pleasure ".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 295, 8, 53, 'Here are a couple of points concerning this verse:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 295, 9, 53, '(i) Salvation (in the past tense) is first of all salvation from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 295, 10, 53, 'wrath and judgment of God. This salvation is a free gift from God and we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 295, 11, 53, 'can never work to get it. Jesus has "finished" it for us on the cross.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 295, 12, 53, 'But salvation also refers to being saved ( present tense) from Adam''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 295, 13, 53, 'nature (the flesh) and our sinful, worldly behaviour (tone of voice,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 295, 14, 53, 'irritation, impurity, materialism, etc.). This is the salvation spoken');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 295, 15, 53, 'of in the above verse. Here are the three tenses of our salvation:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 295, 16, 53, 'We have been saved from the penalty of sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 295, 17, 53, 'We are being saved from the power of sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 295, 18, 53, 'We will be saved from the presence of sin one day, when Christ returns.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 295, 19, 53, '(ii) Whenever God''s Word speaks about God working in us, it always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 295, 20, 53, 'refers to the ministry of the Holy Spirit. And His primary task is to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 295, 21, 53, 'sanctify us (set us apart from sin and the world) and to make us holy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 295, 22, 53, 'So what God "works in " us, we have to "work out". When God speaks to us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 295, 23, 53, 'pointing out some attitude or thought or behaviour in us that needs to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 295, 24, 53, 'change, that is God "working in us". When we accept that correction and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 295, 25, 53, '" cleanse ourselves from that particular filthiness of flesh or spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 295, 26, 53, 'that He points out " (see 2 Cor.7:1) - that particular habit in our life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 295, 27, 53, '- then we are " working out our salvation".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 295, 28, 53, 'The Greatest Thing is to be A Disciple Of Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 296, 1, 53, 'The Lord takes us all through some difficult experiences as part of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 296, 2, 53, 'spiritual education. For example, He may allow others to ridicule us for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 296, 3, 53, 'our faith. Most people who tease us are riddled with an " inferiority');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 296, 4, 53, 'complex", and are jealous of us. So we have to feel sorry for them. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 296, 5, 53, 'the good that their ridicule works in us, is that we become more free');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 296, 6, 53, 'from the opinions of men. Looking back over my life I now see that all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 296, 7, 53, 'the ridicule that I faced for my faith from my fellow-officers on ships');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 296, 8, 53, 'in the Navy (when I was young) and what I have faced thereafter - has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 296, 9, 53, 'all helped me to be free from seeking to please men. And thus the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 296, 10, 53, 'prepared me for my ministry.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 296, 11, 53, 'When you are without fellowship, as you sometimes are, you should look');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 296, 12, 53, 'at that as a "desert experience" like Paul had in Arabia for three years');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 296, 13, 53, '(Gal.1:17,18) where he got to know the Lord more intimately and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 296, 14, 53, 'personally.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 296, 15, 53, 'Remember that our Lord Jesus has all authority in heaven and earth. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 296, 16, 53, 'has not abdicated His throne. Everything that He allows in your life has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 296, 17, 53, 'been designed with a purpose - even the desert experiences. David said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 296, 18, 53, '" I have been young and now am old; yet have I not seen the godly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 296, 19, 53, 'forsaken nor his seed begging for bread " (Psa.37:25). We live by faith');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 296, 20, 53, 'and not by sight - knowing perfectly well that one day we will sing in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 296, 21, 53, 'heaven, "My Jesus has done all things well" (Mark 7:37).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 296, 22, 53, 'Getting a good job is not the greatest thing in life. The greatest thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 296, 23, 53, 'is to be a disciple of Jesus. God has made me supremely happy, because I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 296, 24, 53, 'know He called me to be in India. But I have never asked anyone else to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 296, 25, 53, 'stay on in India - not even you, my own sons - because I know that each');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 296, 26, 53, 'person is called by God to his own unique ministry. Your calling and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 296, 27, 53, 'ministry is different from mine - because each part of Christ''s Body has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 296, 28, 53, 'a different task. However what I do wish for you all is that you should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 297, 1, 53, 'seek only the glory of God and be in the perfect will of God at all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 297, 2, 53, 'times - wherever that may be - because I know that that is the very best');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 297, 3, 53, 'way for anyone to live.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 297, 4, 53, 'God " works around the world on behalf of those whose hearts are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 297, 5, 53, 'completely His " (2 Chron.16:9). And so He will work on your behalf too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 297, 6, 53, 'May you all be a powerful testimony for the Lord in your generation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 297, 7, 53, 'Spiritual Growth through Blessing Others');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 297, 8, 53, 'Try and look for opportunities to start a Bible-study for a few');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 297, 9, 53, 'believers somewhere - maybe once a fortnight or once a week. Ask the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 297, 10, 53, 'Lord and He will guide you. We must look for such opportunities to serve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 297, 11, 53, 'the Lord and bless others. Those who attend must become interested. So');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 297, 12, 53, 'keep the meeting brief and don''t let it drag on to the point of boredom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 297, 13, 53, 'Make the study practical and never theoretical. You all know the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 297, 14, 53, 'Scriptures fairly well and you have heard so much in CFC Bangalore and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 297, 15, 53, 'in our home for many years. So it will be easy to lead such a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 297, 16, 53, 'Bible-study for many who are ignorant of the Scriptures. Ask God to help');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 297, 17, 53, 'you. The whole exercise of leading a Bible-study can help you to grow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 297, 18, 53, 'spiritually too. This is what I found when I did that in my youth - when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 297, 19, 53, 'I was 23 years old.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 297, 20, 53, 'Seek the Lord to be constantly anointed with His Spirit and for the gift');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 297, 21, 53, 'of prophecy (" the ability to speak the Word according to the need of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 297, 22, 53, 'your hearers "). Don''t imagine that asking for the gift of prophecy is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 297, 23, 53, 'pride. That is how Satan fools people. The Holy Spirit urges every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 297, 24, 53, 'believer to eagerly seek for the gift of prophecy (1 Cor.14:1). So seek');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 297, 25, 53, 'for this gift. If you don''t ask God for something that you need - in any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 297, 26, 53, 'area - you won''t get it. You must be bold to ask - for material');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 297, 27, 53, 'necessities, for intelligence, for a solution for some problem at work,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 297, 28, 53, 'or for any problem in general. God allows us to encounter problems so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 298, 1, 53, 'that we may go to Him and find the solution. How boring life would be,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 298, 2, 53, 'if we never encounter any storms that Jesus stills! So, ask - and keep');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 298, 3, 53, 'on asking so that your joy may be full.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 298, 4, 53, 'Seek God for Wisdom and Help');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 298, 5, 53, 'Don''t ever let anything discourage you - nothing physical, material,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 298, 6, 53, 'academic or spiritual or whatever. Discouragement is always from Satan -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 298, 7, 53, 'yes, always - and never from God. And Satan''s purpose is to lead you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 298, 8, 53, 'into sin by getting you discouraged first. Loneliness and homesickness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 298, 9, 53, 'can also become sources of discouragement - if you are not careful. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 298, 10, 53, 'must battle them and overcome. God will give you grace. As you know we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 298, 11, 53, 'are praying for you daily.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 298, 12, 53, 'May the Lord warn you in advance of dangers that He sees ahead o you,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 298, 13, 53, 'that you cannot see, and of factors that you have not considered. May');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 298, 14, 53, 'the Lord give you wisdom and protect you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 298, 15, 53, 'God has promised wisdom to those who ask Him in faith (James 1:5). You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 298, 16, 53, 'won''t get it if you don''t ask or if you ask but don''t believe that God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 298, 17, 53, 'will definitely give you the wisdom you need.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 298, 18, 53, 'Remember however that God''s aim is not to help you to make more money');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 298, 19, 53, 'but to make you more like Christ. Whatever earthly prosperity God sees');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 298, 20, 53, 'fit to give you, He will give you. But that won''t be primary - because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 298, 21, 53, 'the task of accumulating money has been given by God to worldly people -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 298, 22, 53, 'and not to us (See Eccl.2:26b).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 298, 23, 54, 'Chapter 53 Chapter 53');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 298, 24, 54, 'Managing Finances and the Right Balance in Life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 298, 25, 54, 'One of the disciplines you must learn as a student is to manage your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 298, 26, 54, 'finances.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 298, 27, 54, 'You have seen how we have lived at home: We have never ever given anyone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 298, 28, 54, 'the impression that we needed their financial help, even when we were in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 299, 1, 54, 'need. We trusted God even when we had very little. God has blessed the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 299, 2, 54, 'little that we invested many years ago and has made it grow into much. "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 299, 3, 54, 'The bowl of flour has never been exhausted and the jar of oil has never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 299, 4, 54, 'become empty " (1 Kings 17:14-16). That is how Mom and I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 299, 5, 54, 'experienced God''s faithfulness in providing all our earthly needs, ever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 299, 6, 54, 'since we were married.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 299, 7, 54, 'You must never give anyone the impression that you are the sons of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 299, 8, 54, 'poor preacher. No. You are the sons of a rich Heavenly Father. But that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 299, 9, 54, 'does not mean that you should waste money like rich people do, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 299, 10, 54, 'God teaches us to be frugal in the way we live. However, we don''t want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 299, 11, 54, 'to boast about the way we have lived as a family. At the same time, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 299, 12, 54, 'don''t want to judge other preachers who are parasites on their churches.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 299, 13, 54, 'But we do want to live the way Jesus wants us to live in financial');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 299, 14, 54, 'matters.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 299, 15, 54, 'As you start earning money, you must learn to be frugal andcareful (both');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 299, 16, 54, 'are good qualities), without being stingy and miserly (which are bad');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 299, 17, 54, 'qualities). Be careful to avoid all unnecessary expenditure - and God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 299, 18, 54, 'will reward you with spiritual riches. You need wisdom from God to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 299, 19, 54, 'differentiate between how to be frugal without being miserly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 299, 20, 54, 'And now a word about your work and study. The important thing is to get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 299, 21, 54, 'your priorities right - and to ensure that you spend your time on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 299, 22, 54, 'most important things first and then do other things on a descending');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 299, 23, 54, 'scale of priorities. Thus you can make the most of your youthful years.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 299, 24, 54, 'May the Lord give you wisdom to work out that priority-order.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 299, 25, 54, 'Your studies and your profession (through which you have to earn your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 299, 26, 54, 'living finally) will naturally be one of your top priorities, for God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 299, 27, 54, 'has designed that we spend most of our time in a secular occupation. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 299, 28, 54, 'is the One Who taught us to pray for our daily bread - and your studies');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 300, 1, 54, 'and your work are all means to that end. Doing well in your studies and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 300, 2, 54, 'your work is therefore a way for you to glorify God - even as Jesus did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 300, 3, 54, 'for 12 to 15 years in the carpenter-shop at Nazareth. However, like Him,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 300, 4, 54, 'you must do everything with eternity''s perspective in view at all times.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 300, 5, 54, 'Standing True to the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 300, 6, 54, 'Remember that one man with God is a majority. There is much that God can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 300, 7, 54, 'do through just you - if you keep yourself pure, loving, good and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 300, 8, 54, 'humble. So preserve yourself in these virtues at all times. Like the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 300, 9, 54, 'hymn says, " There''s a work for Jesus that none but you can do ".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 300, 10, 54, 'May you always have a hunger after God and may you live by faith and not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 300, 11, 54, 'by sight. I hope you will always be good and gracious to all people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 300, 12, 54, 'Thus you can make many friends. And that is also a good testimony for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 300, 13, 54, 'the Lord. Ask God to give you grace to overcome bad moods, so that your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 300, 14, 54, 'friends will be glad to be with you. May many people be thankful in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 300, 15, 54, 'eternity that your path crossed theirs on earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 300, 16, 54, 'I pray that you will always have a large heart towards the needy and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 300, 17, 54, 'towards those who are sincerely serving the Lord. The Lord will repay');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 300, 18, 54, 'you abundantly for your goodness towards them. But beware of crooked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 300, 19, 54, 'preachers (there are many of them) and of those who are always looking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 300, 20, 54, 'for a gift. Stay away from such people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 300, 21, 54, '"Flee youthful lusts" is an exhortation that you should never tire of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 300, 22, 54, 'hearing as long as you live in this world. Someone has said. "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 300, 23, 54, 'Temptation is like fire. It can burn you even if you are 100 years old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 300, 24, 54, '." The way in which you respond to the call of the Holy Spirit to flee');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 300, 25, 54, 'from youthful lusts at all times will determine to a great extent, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 300, 26, 54, 'measure of your joy or regret in eternity. I pray that it will be only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 300, 27, 54, 'joy for all of you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 300, 28, 54, 'God Honours Those Who Honour Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 301, 1, 54, 'Whenever you greet us on our birthdays, we see it as an indication that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 301, 2, 54, 'you truly value us as your parents - and so we rejoice in it. We are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 301, 3, 54, 'always deeply touched by your expressions of appreciation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 301, 4, 54, 'I am thankful for the grace that the Lord has given us to go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 301, 5, 54, 'triumphantly through every trial that we have faced as a family. Satan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 301, 6, 54, 'inspired many people to trouble us, because they were jealous of us. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 301, 7, 54, 'we received grace from God to overcome Satan, and to keep a good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 301, 8, 54, 'attitude toward all who spoke evil of us and who sought to harm us -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 301, 9, 54, 'although none of them could actually harm us. Everything people did has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 301, 10, 54, 'only worked for our good, as promised in Romans 8:28.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 301, 11, 54, 'Remember that all the evil things that others say about us cannot make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 301, 12, 54, 'us evil, and all the good things that others say about us cannot make us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 301, 13, 54, 'good . We ourselves decide what we become - and that depends on our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 301, 14, 54, 'taking up our cross daily and following Jesus, and reacting in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 301, 15, 54, 'Christlike way to others, whatever they may say or do to us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 301, 16, 54, 'Even our past failures - however deep and great they may be - cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 301, 17, 54, 'hinder God''s purpose for our lives from being fulfilled, if we determine');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 301, 18, 54, 'that we are going to make up for our past by being even more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 301, 19, 54, 'wholehearted in the future. I let down the Lord in many ways after I was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 301, 20, 54, 'born again. But I decided in 1975 (when I was nearly 36 years old, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 301, 21, 54, 'we started meeting together as a church in our home), that I would be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 301, 22, 54, 'more wholehearted than others who had not failed the Lord like I had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 301, 23, 54, 'done. And today after all these years, I can say that God has honoured');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 301, 24, 54, 'my decision by giving me grace in greater and greater measure, year');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 301, 25, 54, 'after year. So I know from personal experience that God does not choose');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 301, 26, 54, 'those who have a blameless record or those who have never slipped up and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 301, 27, 54, 'failed. In fact He often uses the most, those who have failed the most.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 301, 28, 54, 'This is what has given me great hope for the worst of sinners who have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 302, 1, 54, 'come to our church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 302, 2, 54, 'The Shunemite woman when asked by Elisha whether all was well with her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 302, 3, 54, 'and her child, said, "Yes, all is well", even though her child had just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 302, 4, 54, 'died (2 Kings 4:8, 26)! That was amazing faith - that she could say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 302, 5, 54, 'that. God honoured her faith, by raising her son from the dead! God does');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 302, 6, 54, 'amazing things for those who trust in Him. Such people will never be put');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 302, 7, 54, 'to shame, in any situation. May you live with such a faith in God always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 302, 8, 54, '- in the tight spots that you may find yourselves in, at times, or when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 302, 9, 54, 'you fail God miserably (which can also happen). Remember that the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 302, 10, 54, 'can bring a resurrection out of any "dead" situation. All you have to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 302, 11, 54, 'is to be honest with Him. (You don''t have to confess your sins to any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 302, 12, 54, 'man, but you must be totally honest with the Lord).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 302, 13, 54, 'Blessed to Bless Others');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 302, 14, 54, 'We are called to be blessed by the Lord and thus to be a blessing to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 302, 15, 54, 'every family (and person) that we meet on earth. Galatians 3:14 says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 302, 16, 54, 'that Christ became a curse for us on the cross so that Abraham''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 302, 17, 54, 'blessing might be ours through the gift of the Holy Spirit. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 302, 18, 54, 'blessing is found in Genesis 12:2, 3 where God told Abraham, " I will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 302, 19, 54, 'bless you and all the families of the earth shall be blessed through you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 302, 20, 54, '". That is why we ask God that we might be continually filled with His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 302, 21, 54, 'Holy Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 302, 22, 54, 'This is your inheritance. So claim it and live in it in the coming new');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 302, 23, 54, 'year and always. Keep your conscience clear at all times, through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 302, 24, 54, 'repentance and confession of sin, so that the channel is not choked for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 302, 25, 54, 'the blessing to flow.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 302, 26, 54, 'First of all , God wants to bless you in everything you do - spiritual,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 302, 27, 54, 'material, physical, academic, professional and everything else. God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 302, 28, 54, 'promises are: "Whatever you do will prosper " (Psa.1:3) " You will have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 303, 1, 54, 'success in everything you do" (Josh.1:8). In this new covenant age, God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 303, 2, 54, 'wants to bless and prosper you and make you successful, first of all in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 303, 3, 54, 'your spiritual life, and then in material things as well - unlike in old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 303, 4, 54, 'covenant times when they were blessed only with material blessings.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 303, 5, 54, 'Secondly , God wants to bless others through your life. They should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 303, 6, 54, 'taste something of God''s life in you. The result will be that to some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 303, 7, 54, 'you will be "an aroma of life" and to others (who reject God), you will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 303, 8, 54, 'be an "aroma of death" (2 Cor.2:16).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 303, 9, 54, 'For all this to be fulfilled, you must seek with great eagerness to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 303, 10, 54, 'filled with the Holy Spirit constantly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 303, 11, 54, 'Our earthly work is only a means to earn our living, so that we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 303, 12, 54, 'serve the Lord, without being dependent on anyone financially. But we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 303, 13, 54, 'must long to be a blessing to as many people on earth as possible in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 303, 14, 54, 'one short life on earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 303, 15, 54, 'The famous preachers in India usually preach only in the big cities.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 303, 16, 54, 'They hardly ever take time to sit down with the simple, poor (and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 303, 17, 54, 'illiterate) people in the villages. So I am glad that God has given us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 303, 18, 54, 'the privilege and honour of serving the poor people in the villages in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 303, 19, 54, 'India. I preach the gospel of an overcoming life there - and the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 303, 20, 54, 'plants churches there. And Mom conducts medical clinics for the poor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 303, 21, 54, 'women and children there. We are both immensely blessed by our service');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 303, 22, 54, 'to these people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 303, 23, 54, 'It is amazing to see the places that God has taken our tapes and our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 303, 24, 54, 'literature to. They have gone to every continent - to the uttermost');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 303, 25, 54, 'parts of the earth (Acts 1:8). Many preachers are also using the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 303, 26, 54, 'material from our books and tapes in their own messages in their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 303, 27, 54, 'churches. Thus the Word goes even further, into churches where I could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 303, 28, 54, 'never go. Praise the Lord. We have encouraged people to use our material');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 304, 1, 54, 'freely, as long as they live it and don''t seek to make money through it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 304, 2, 54, 'Two Inspiring Poems');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 304, 3, 54, 'Here are a couple of inspiring poems that have blessed me recently:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 304, 4, 54, 'I''M DRINKING FROM THE SAUCER');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 304, 5, 54, 'I''ve never made a fortune - and I''ll never make one now.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 304, 6, 54, 'But it really doesn''t matter, ''cause I''m happy anyhow.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 304, 7, 54, 'As I go along my journey, I''m reaping better than I sowed;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 304, 8, 54, 'I''m drinking from the saucer, ''cause my cup has overflowed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 304, 9, 54, 'I don''t have a lot of riches and sometimes the going''s rough');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 304, 10, 54, 'BUT WHILE I''VE GOT MY KIDS TO LOVE ME, I THINK I''M RICH ENOUGH.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 304, 11, 54, 'I''ll just thank God for the blessings that His mercy has bestowed;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 304, 12, 54, 'I''m drinking from the saucer, ''cause my cup has overflowed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 304, 13, 54, 'If God gives me strength and courage when the way grows steep and rough');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 304, 14, 54, 'I''ll not ask for other blessings, I''m already blessed enough');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 304, 15, 54, 'May I never be too busy to help bear another''s load;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 304, 16, 54, 'Then I''ll be drinking from the saucer, ''cause my cup has overflowed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 304, 17, 54, '(Author Unknown)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 304, 18, 54, 'GOD''S VERY BEST');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 304, 19, 54, 'God has His best things for the few who dare to stand the test;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 304, 20, 54, 'God has His second choice for those who will not have His best.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 304, 21, 54, 'It is not always open sin that risks the promised rest;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 304, 22, 54, 'The `Better'' often is the foe that keeps us from the `Best''.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 304, 23, 54, 'There''s scarcely one but vaguely wants in some way to be blessed;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 304, 24, 54, '"''Tis not Thy blessing, Lord, I seek; I want Thy very best."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 304, 25, 54, 'Some seek God''s highest choice, but then - when they''re by trials');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 304, 26, 54, 'pressed,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 304, 27, 54, 'They shrink, they yield, they shun the cross and so they miss God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 304, 28, 54, 'best.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 305, 1, 54, 'I want in this short life of mine as much as can be pressed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 305, 2, 54, 'Of service true for God and man. I want God''s very best.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 305, 3, 54, '"Give me, O Lord, Thy highest choice, let others take the rest;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 305, 4, 54, 'Their good things have no charm for me, I want Thy very best."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 305, 5, 54, 'I want amid the victors'' throng to have my name confessed;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 305, 6, 54, 'And hear my Master say at last, "Well done! You got My best."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 305, 7, 54, '(A.B.Simpson)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 305, 8, 54, 'May you all be the very best for our Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 305, 9, 55, 'Chapter 54 Chapter 54');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 305, 10, 55, 'Make God the Ruler of Your Lives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 305, 11, 55, 'I always pray that you will seek the kingdom of God and His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 305, 12, 55, 'righteousness first at all times. Then you will prosper in everything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 305, 13, 55, 'you do and God will work on your behalf like a Mighty Champion');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 305, 14, 55, '(Jerem.20:11). This is what I have experienced all through my life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 305, 15, 55, 'Seeking God''s kingdom does not refer primarily to evangelism or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 305, 16, 55, 'missionary work. It means to make God the Ruler of your life, to live at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 305, 17, 55, 'all times under God''s authority, and to allow His heavenly values to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 305, 18, 55, 'take precedence over the pull of money, earthly pleasures and man''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 305, 19, 55, 'honour.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 305, 20, 55, 'To seek God''s righteousness first means to long for His nature to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 305, 21, 55, 'manifested in your inner life and in every part of your external');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 305, 22, 55, 'behaviour.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 305, 23, 55, 'May this truth grip you all your days. I can leave this earth happily,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 305, 24, 55, 'if I see that you are all gripped by this truth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 305, 25, 55, 'And when you have children, you must teach your children also this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 305, 26, 55, 'truth, so that they too can find the same result in their lives. Thus,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 305, 27, 55, 'generation after generation the Lord will have a witness on earth,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 305, 28, 55, 'through our family-line, until He returns.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 306, 1, 55, 'It is Not about Doctrine but Life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 306, 2, 55, 'Paul speaks about "the holiness which is no illusion" (Eph.4:24 - J.B.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 306, 3, 55, 'Philips translation). This does not come through understanding doctrine');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 306, 4, 55, 'but through Jesus Himself living His life through us. The secret of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 306, 5, 55, 'godliness mentioned in 1 Timothy 3:16 is not thedoctrine of Jesus having');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 306, 6, 55, 'come in our flesh, butJesus Himself Who came in our flesh. It is by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 306, 7, 55, 'looking unto Jesus and not at any doctrine that we are going to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 306, 8, 55, 'transformed into His likeness (2 Cor.3:18). Remember this all your life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 306, 9, 55, 'Every doctrine can lead you astray: (1) if you don''t keep your eyes on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 306, 10, 55, 'the Lord Himself, and (2) if you do not love all who love Him, whichever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 306, 11, 55, 'group they are in, and whatever doctrine they may hold. Jesus Himself is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 306, 12, 55, 'the Head of the church which is His Body. But if a doctrine becomes the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 306, 13, 55, 'Head, then people will become Pharisees - and the purer the doctrine,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 306, 14, 55, 'the greater the Pharisees that will be produced! Remember the words of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 306, 15, 55, 'the hymn: "Once it was the blessing, now it is the Lord".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 306, 16, 55, 'The image we present as a church must be consistent with the image Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 306, 17, 55, 'presented of the Father - especially what we see in John 8:1-12, where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 306, 18, 55, 'He was on the side of the repentant adulteress against the religious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 306, 19, 55, 'Pharisees. Jesus preached the highest standard of holiness ever preached');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 306, 20, 55, 'on earth, and yet He mingled with the worst of sinners (e.g. Mary');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 306, 21, 55, 'Magdalene, who was given the privilege to be the first to see the risen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 306, 22, 55, 'Lord). He never once criticised such sinners or reminded them about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 306, 23, 55, 'their past. This is our calling as a church too - to preach the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 306, 24, 55, 'standard of holiness that Jesus preached, and yet to be warm to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 306, 25, 55, 'worst of sinners and backsliders, to draw them to Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 306, 26, 55, 'Our church is like a hospital, where the worst cases are welcome. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 306, 27, 55, 'can all be cured. No-one need feel that he or she is too wretched to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 306, 28, 55, 'helped. Some churches are like clubs where the rich and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 307, 1, 55, 'self-satisfied meet together. But we want to be a hospital for the worst');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 307, 2, 55, 'of sinners.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 307, 3, 55, 'No Discouragement or Condemnation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 307, 4, 55, 'Let me now share a few thoughts on the importance of discipline in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 307, 5, 55, 'Christian life. Discipline is not an easy matter, but it is essential if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 307, 6, 55, 'you are to be spiritual men. If you are undisciplined now, don''t let');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 307, 7, 55, 'thatdiscourage you or make you feel condemned - because discouragement');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 307, 8, 55, 'and self-condemnation are worse than being indisciplined. Turn around');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 307, 9, 55, 'from the past and ask the Lord to help you to be a disciplined man in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 307, 10, 55, 'the coming days.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 307, 11, 55, 'The Lord has taken all of us just as we are, and accepted us in Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 307, 12, 55, 'So we must press on regardless - even when we discover that our past');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 307, 13, 55, 'indisciplined way of life has made us me suffer loss. There is nothing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 307, 14, 55, 'really important in this world except (1) to avoid sin and (2) to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 307, 15, 55, 'God''s will. If we are all right in these two areas, then we have got');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 307, 16, 55, '99.9% right. Those are the areas where we must press on to perfection.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 307, 17, 55, 'Even loss of money is secondary. When we fail, we must seek for grace');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 307, 18, 55, 'from God to do things better the next time - even if the next time is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 307, 19, 55, 'the one-thousandth time that we are trying to do the same thing better!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 307, 20, 55, 'God is so good - and He will certainly help us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 307, 21, 55, 'Wisdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 307, 22, 55, 'The greatest need in the Christian life is for wisdom. And thefirst');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 307, 23, 55, 'qualification to get it is to acknowledge that we lack it (James 1:5).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 307, 24, 55, 'That is not easy to acknowledge when we are young or even when we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 307, 25, 55, 'old. But to the one who constantly acknowledges it, wisdom will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 307, 26, 55, 'granted in abundance! So the greatest wisdom for us is to acknowledge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 307, 27, 55, 'that we lack Divine wisdom! May you have grace to acknowledge this lack');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 307, 28, 55, 'and thus be filled with the wisdom of God for every situation and for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 308, 1, 55, 'every relationship. God''s ways are not our ways. His ways are perfect -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 308, 2, 55, 'and He will make our ways perfect too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 308, 3, 55, 'Don''t waste the trials and sorrows that come your way. Get some glory');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 308, 4, 55, 'out of each of them. And remember what we have always said in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 308, 5, 55, 'church, that we never talk about the past except as it will make us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 308, 6, 55, 'wiser and more careful and more wholehearted in the future. But we must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 308, 7, 55, 'never let our past make us discouraged or make us wish, "If only I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 308, 8, 55, 'had....." or "If only I hadn''t". God works in mysterious ways and uses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 308, 9, 55, 'even our failures and blunders to glorify His Name. These are all a part');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 308, 10, 55, 'of His ways to break us and make us like Jesus. If we have learnt the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 308, 11, 55, 'lessons, then we must leave the past behind us and press on. There is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 308, 12, 55, 'much to thank God for in every trial that we face. So praise the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 308, 13, 55, 'There is no mountain that stands in the way of your doing the will of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 308, 14, 55, 'God that can remain there if you command it to be removed in Jesus'' name');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 308, 15, 55, '(Mark 11:22-25). Remember that. Every such mountain is a challenge to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 308, 16, 55, 'your faith and not a signal to retreat.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 308, 17, 55, 'Salvation is by Grace');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 308, 18, 55, 'We all need the assurance of God''s acceptance. If you read through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 308, 19, 55, 'Romans and Galatians particularly, you will see how fiercely Paul fought');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 308, 20, 55, 'to preserve the gospel in its pure form - describing eternal life as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 308, 21, 55, 'free gift from God (Rom.6:23), and not something that is earned. He says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 308, 22, 55, 'that if anyone preaches another gospel, he is accursed (Gal.1:8).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 308, 23, 55, 'Salvation is only by grace through faith. Because many have misused this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 308, 24, 55, 'truth, others have reacted and preached the law again to keep believers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 308, 25, 55, 'in line. But I have seen that that is not the answer, because what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 308, 26, 55, 'happens then is that the devil wins both groups - those who abuse grace');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 308, 27, 55, 'and those who live in perpetual insecurity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 308, 28, 55, 'Feelings of insecurity may not be as bad as misusing grace, because we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 309, 1, 55, 'do not lose our salvation through such feelings. But they render us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 309, 2, 55, 'totally ineffective for God on earth. It is unbelief (and not humility)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 309, 3, 55, 'to imagine that we are still unclean after the blood of Christ has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 309, 4, 55, 'cleansed our sins. That is actually insulting God, for that is exalting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 309, 5, 55, 'our sins over Christ''s blood.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 309, 6, 55, 'Grace first forgives our sins and then keeps us from falling into sin as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 309, 7, 55, 'well (Rom.6:14). This is the "the true grace of God" (1 Pet.5:12). Those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 309, 8, 55, 'who believe in this full grace of God are the most effective in reaching');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 309, 9, 55, 'out to unbelievers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 309, 10, 55, 'Christ Working Through Us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 309, 11, 55, 'Here is a well-known statement - but slightly modified by me in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 309, 12, 55, 'second line.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 309, 13, 55, '"Only one life - it will soon be past -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 309, 14, 55, 'Only what Christ does through us will last."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 309, 15, 55, 'The second line is my adaptation of the usual, " Only what is done for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 309, 16, 55, 'Christ will last", because a lot that is done for Christ today is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 309, 17, 55, 'according to God''s will. It is man doing things in his own zeal, without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 309, 18, 55, 'any leading from God - for example, going out into full-time Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 309, 19, 55, 'work, just because there is a need, without a specific call from God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 309, 20, 55, 'That may be sacrificial, but God wants obedience more than sacrifice (1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 309, 21, 55, 'Sam.15:22).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 309, 22, 55, 'When people leave our church, it has never disturbed me, because I see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 309, 23, 55, 'that heaven also was once emptied of one-third of its angels (See');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 309, 24, 55, 'Rev.12:3,4 where the "stars" are angels - Job 38:7). But that sifting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 309, 25, 55, 'made heaven purer! Jesus'' preaching also made many people leave Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 309, 26, 55, 'until only eleven were left behind who were sincere (John 6:60,66,70).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 309, 27, 55, 'Those eleven were not perfect but they were sincere!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 309, 28, 55, 'Never Tread Into the Forbidden');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 310, 1, 55, 'Most believers don''t understand the difference between temptation and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 310, 2, 55, 'sin. They don''t also understand that the more faithful we are in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 310, 3, 55, 'battling against temptation, the easier the struggle against temptation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 310, 4, 55, 'will become.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 310, 5, 55, 'That is why among believers there are different degrees of struggle with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 310, 6, 55, 'temptation - because they have yielded in different degrees to those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 310, 7, 55, 'very temptations in their past lives. For example, those believers who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 310, 8, 55, 'smoked cigarettes, or drank alcohol or used bad language extensively in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 310, 9, 55, 'their unconverted days struggle with those habits even after conversion,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 310, 10, 55, 'when tempted in those areas. But why is it that you don''t have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 310, 11, 55, 'struggle in those matters? Because you did not indulge in those habits');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 310, 12, 55, 'in the past.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 310, 13, 55, 'We know that Jesus never yielded even once to any temptation. So we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 310, 14, 55, 'cannot analyze or understand how the struggle against temptation was for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 310, 15, 55, 'Him. And we should never try to analyze His inner life. The people of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 310, 16, 55, 'Beth-shemesh "looked inside the ark of the Lord" - and God killed many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 310, 17, 55, 'of them for their irreverence (1 Sam.6:19). It is equally irreverent for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 310, 18, 55, 'us to try and analyze the inner life of Jesus. "The secret things belong');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 310, 19, 55, 'to the Lord our God, but the things that are revealed belong to us"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 310, 20, 55, '(Deut.29:29).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 310, 21, 55, 'The second epistle of John reveals two cliffs of error. Here is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 310, 22, 55, 'first one: " Many deceivers have gone out into the world, those who do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 310, 23, 55, 'not acknowledge Jesus Christ as coming in the flesh " (2 John 7). And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 310, 24, 55, 'here is the cliff on the other side: " Anyone who goes too far and does');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 310, 25, 55, 'not abide in the teaching of Christ, does not have God '' (2 John 9).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 310, 26, 55, 'We know only what is revealed -that Jesus was tempted like us in all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 310, 27, 55, 'points, but did not sin (Heb.4:15). It is enough for us to know that -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 310, 28, 55, 'and stop there - and follow His example.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 311, 1, 55, 'One thing we do know clearly is that Jesus'' inner being was totally');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 311, 2, 55, 'pure. The Bible says He was a spotless Lamb - without any blemish.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 311, 3, 55, 'Otherwise He could not have become a sinless sacrifice for our sins.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 311, 4, 55, 'Jesus did not come in sinful flesh but only " in the likeness of sinful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 311, 5, 55, 'flesh " (Rom.8:3). He had no sin in Him. He was born as "a holy Child"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 311, 6, 55, 'as the angel told Mary (Luke 1:35).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 311, 7, 56, 'Chapter 55 Chapter 55');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 311, 8, 56, 'Justified in Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 311, 9, 56, 'When we confess our sins (however many and however great they may have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 311, 10, 56, 'been) to God, He forgives us and cleanses us immediately (1 John 1:9).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 311, 11, 56, 'And let me repeat what I have often told you: God will not then remember');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 311, 12, 56, 'our sins any more (See Heb.8:12). He blots out all our sins in Christ''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 311, 13, 56, 'blood. And if God doesn''t remember our sins any more, there is no need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 311, 14, 56, 'for us to remember them any more either. We never need to confess our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 311, 15, 56, 'sins to any human being at any time. We should never exalt the greatness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 311, 16, 56, 'of our sins over the power of Christ''s blood that has cleansed them all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 311, 17, 56, 'away completely. The blood of Christ also justifies us (Rom.5:9). That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 311, 18, 56, 'means that God declares us to be righteous in His sight now. We should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 311, 19, 56, 'believe that, confess it and live accordingly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 311, 20, 56, 'I encourage everyone to stand on the Word of God that says: "What God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 311, 21, 56, 'has cleansed you are no longer to consider unholy" (Acts 10:15, 16).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 311, 22, 56, 'Peter needed to see that vision thrice to be convinced of it. He still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 311, 23, 56, 'stumbled later on this matter (Gal.2:11-13). But we need not stumble');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 311, 24, 56, 'even once. The Accuser of the brethren must be given no room by our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 311, 25, 56, 'giving anyone even a chance to discuss matters that God has cleansed -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 311, 26, 56, 'because that is an insult both to a righteous God Who has justified us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 311, 27, 56, 'as well as to the blood of Christ that has cleansed us. And we should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 311, 28, 56, 'not insult either of these - even in our thoughts - even once. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 312, 1, 56, 'the stand that you must take. Let others fellowship with the Accuser, if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 312, 2, 56, 'they want to. But we will not.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 312, 3, 56, 'Confess Your Sins Only to God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 312, 4, 56, 'In the Roman Catholic church, they have a practice of people confessing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 312, 5, 56, 'their sins to the priest. Some Protestant churches also encourage');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 312, 6, 56, 'believers to confess their sins to one another and teach that every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 312, 7, 56, 'believer must have an "accountability partner" to whom he confesses all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 312, 8, 56, 'his sins regularly, as a way to overcome sin. Such a teaching is never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 312, 9, 56, 'found anywhere in the New Testament. It is the teaching of human');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 312, 10, 56, 'psychology and not of the Holy Spirit. Yet, many believers have blindly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 312, 11, 56, 'accepted this false teaching and practise it. The Bible never speaks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 312, 12, 56, 'anywhere of having an accountability partner.That way of avoiding sin is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 312, 13, 56, 'actually pursuing holiness through the fear of man - avoiding sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 312, 14, 56, 'because of the shame of having to confess it to one''s "accountability');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 312, 15, 56, 'partner". But the Bible commands us to perfect holiness in the fear of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 312, 16, 56, 'God - not in the fear of man (2 Cor.7:1). We are accountable to God - "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 312, 17, 56, 'He is the only One with Whom we have to do" (Heb.4:13).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 312, 18, 56, 'We must confess our sins only to the Lord. The command in James 5:16 "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 312, 19, 56, 'Confess your sins to one another" has often been taken out of context.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 312, 20, 56, 'In its context, it is clear that it is referring to a sick believer who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 312, 21, 56, 'is being prayed for by the elders of his church. Since sickness at times');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 312, 22, 56, 'is caused by sin (as we see in John 5:14), the sick person is told there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 312, 23, 56, 'to confess his sins (which may be the cause of his sickness) "so that he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 312, 24, 56, 'can be healed". That is NOT teaching believers to confess their sins to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 312, 25, 56, 'other believers. It is very dangerous when any verse is taken out of its');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 312, 26, 56, 'context. A verse taken out of context often becomes a pretext for false');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 312, 27, 56, 'teaching. So be careful that you study all verses in their immediate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 312, 28, 56, 'context and compare them with other verses on the same subject in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 313, 1, 56, 'Bible.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 313, 2, 56, 'The only sin that we must confess to a human being is the sin that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 313, 3, 56, 'committed against him - for example, if we have cheated him or hurt him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 313, 4, 56, 'in any way, etc., (Matt.5:23,24). Remember this always.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 313, 5, 56, 'We should never talk about our past sins in detail, to anyone, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 313, 6, 56, 'that glorifies Satan (who made us commit those sins) and also pollutes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 313, 7, 56, 'the minds of those who hear our confessions. We glorify God now by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 313, 8, 56, 'declaring that we are cleansed and justified ( just as if I''d never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 313, 9, 56, 'sinned ) by Christ''s blood. You must remember this all your life. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 313, 10, 56, 'must of course, always acknowledge that we are sinners saved by God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 313, 11, 56, 'grace. But we must never confess the details of our sins to anyone but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 313, 12, 56, 'God. This is the new covenant way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 313, 13, 56, 'Our Testimony Must Glorify God Alone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 313, 14, 56, 'All believers when they give their testimony should always glorify God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 313, 15, 56, 'for the work He has done in them (the positive part), and never glorify');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 313, 16, 56, 'Satan by mentioning details of what all he made them do in their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 313, 17, 56, 'unconverted past. It is enough if we say that we were sinners,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 313, 18, 56, 'backsliders or rebellious etc.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 313, 19, 56, 'I have been personally encouraged to see that Peter spoke about the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 313, 20, 56, 'mount of transfiguration experience in his letters and not about his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 313, 21, 56, 'denying the Lord (2 Pet.1:17,18). Likewise, when Paul gives his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 313, 22, 56, 'testimony to the Jews (Acts 22) and to Agrippa (Acts 26), he speaks in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 313, 23, 56, 'great detail about his encounter with the Lord and only a little bit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 313, 24, 56, 'about his persecuting the Christians. Confessing specific sins I see is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 313, 25, 56, 'a Roman Catholic and heathen idea, which unfortunately some Protestant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 313, 26, 56, 'writers are also encouraging nowadays. This has " the appearance of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 313, 27, 56, 'wisdom in self-made religion and self-abasement, but actually is of no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 313, 28, 56, 'value " (Col.2:23). Self-abasement is not humility - and it is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 314, 1, 56, 'wisdom either. Wisdom is our greatest need.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 314, 2, 56, 'Great Passion to Please The Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 314, 3, 56, 'We need to keep our devotion to Christ fresh and fervent. I want to urge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 314, 4, 56, 'all of you to keep your love for Christ - with all your heart, soul,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 314, 5, 56, 'strength and mind - fervent at all times. That is what will take away');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 314, 6, 56, 'from you the love of other forbidden things. That is the force that will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 314, 7, 56, 'drive out other loves - the expulsive power of this new affection.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 314, 8, 56, 'The Bible says, " Whether you eat or drink, do all to the glory of God"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 314, 9, 56, '(1 Cor.10:31). Remember that verse when you are tempted to drink');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 314, 10, 56, 'something like alcohol that can harm your body (which is the temple of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 314, 11, 56, 'the Holy Spirit). " All things may be lawful, but don''t be mastered by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 314, 12, 56, 'anything" (1 Cor.6:12, 13).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 314, 13, 56, 'My greatest joy is that all of you are walking with the Lord. I don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 314, 14, 56, 'care how many academic degrees you get, or what salaries you earn or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 314, 15, 56, 'even where you live. If I can only know that your greatest passion in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 314, 16, 56, 'life is to please the Lord Who gave His life for you, then I can always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 314, 17, 56, 'walk with my head held high - and also die in peace when the Lord calls');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 314, 18, 56, 'me home. The only life worth living is one lived 100% for God - but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 314, 19, 56, 'earning your own living, so that you are not financially dependent on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 314, 20, 56, 'anyone. May you live like that always.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 314, 21, 56, 'Outline for The Book Of Romans');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 314, 22, 56, 'Here is an outline of the book of "Romans" that could be titled "FREEDOM');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 314, 23, 56, 'IN CHRIST":');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 314, 24, 56, '(1) Freedom from condemnation and guilt (chaps. 1 to 5)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 314, 25, 56, '(2) Freedom from sin''s power (chap.6)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 314, 26, 56, '(3) Freedom from legalistic righteousness (chap.7)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 314, 27, 56, '(4) Freedom in the Holy Spirit (Rom.8:1-14)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 314, 28, 56, '(5) Freedom from fear (Rom.8:15-39)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 315, 1, 56, '(6) Freedom from boasting (Rom.9 to 11)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 315, 2, 56, '(7) Freedom from worldliness (Rom.12:1, 2)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 315, 3, 56, '(8) Freedom from individualism (Rom.12:3-21)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 315, 4, 56, '(9) Freedom from exclusivism (Rom.14, 15)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 315, 5, 56, 'Study Romans like this. It is a wonderful book.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 315, 6, 56, 'Things That Jesus Hated Most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 315, 7, 56, 'Here are five things that Jesus hated the most:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 315, 8, 56, '1. Hypocrisy (includes dishonesty, lying etc.)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 315, 9, 56, '2. Pride');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 315, 10, 56, '3. Selfishness (includes lack of concern for others, despising others');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 315, 11, 56, 'etc.)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 315, 12, 56, '4. Hatred (includes anger, jealousy, bitterness etc.)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 315, 13, 56, '5. Unbelief');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 315, 14, 56, 'These sins don''t figure in the 10 commandments - because the Law dealt');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 315, 15, 56, 'only with the fruit of sin, whereas grace deals with the root of sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 315, 16, 56, 'The Law used a pair of scissors to cut off the bad fruit. But grace uses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 315, 17, 56, 'an axe and lays it to the root of the tree.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 315, 18, 56, 'Jealousy is the opposite of pride. Both pride and jealousy come through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 315, 19, 56, 'comparing ourselves with others. Jealousy leads to anger which leads to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 315, 20, 56, 'hard words which may lead to murder (as with Cain). No jealous man will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 315, 21, 56, 'ever enter the kingdom of God. We must deal with it before we leave this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 315, 22, 56, 'earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 315, 23, 57, 'Chapter 56 Chapter 56');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 315, 24, 57, 'The Lord is our Defence');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 315, 25, 57, 'Let me share something with you now on submitting to authority at home');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 315, 26, 57, 'and in the church: Think of how the sun keeps the planets on an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 315, 27, 57, 'invisible leash (of gravity) while at the same time giving the planets');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 315, 28, 57, 'freedom to fly around at such tremendous speed, without inhibiting them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 316, 1, 57, 'in any way. But because of that leash the planets do not go flying off');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 316, 2, 57, 'into space and colliding with one another and destroying themselves and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 316, 3, 57, 'others. So also children in a home can be given freedom to fly around');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 316, 4, 57, 'but must be held by an invisible leash by the father. This is for their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 316, 5, 57, 'protection even though they are often too immature to understand it. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 316, 6, 57, 'same principle applies in the church family too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 316, 7, 57, 'Mom and I are thankful that we have had the privilege of spending our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 316, 8, 57, 'lives leading people to righteousness and making things physically good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 316, 9, 57, 'for them too - especially for the poor people who have come to Christ in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 316, 10, 57, 'the villages of India. In 1975, I decided to quit being an international');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 316, 11, 57, 'conference-speaker in the big cities around the world (as I had been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 316, 12, 57, 'from 1971 to 1975) and to go to the poor people in India - especially in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 316, 13, 57, 'the villages where the big preachers hardly ever go. As we have sought');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 316, 14, 57, 'the good of these poor people, God has rewarded us by blessing the four');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 316, 15, 57, 'of you, our sons, in so many ways. He has been amazingly good to you in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 316, 16, 57, 'the past and He will be so in the future too - for God is no man''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 316, 17, 57, 'debtor.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 316, 18, 57, 'There is still some opposition to our work from other Christians - again');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 316, 19, 57, 'out of jealousy. It is beginning to be well-known now, that the Lord is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 316, 20, 57, 'blessing our work. There are also many open doors for my ministry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 316, 21, 57, 'everywhere. So Satan is furious with us - which is a good sign! I just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 316, 22, 57, 'ignore all this and press on to accomplish what the Lord has called me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 316, 23, 57, 'to do for Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 316, 24, 57, 'I have some advice for you as to what to do when anyone criticizes you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 316, 25, 57, 'concerning any matter. Say nothing in your own defence. Let the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 316, 26, 57, 'Himself defend you according to Isaiah 54:17: " ''No weapon that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 316, 27, 57, 'formed against you will prosper; and every tongue that accuses you in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 316, 28, 57, 'judgment will be condemned. Their vindication is from Me,'' declares the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 317, 1, 57, 'Lord". It is pointless trying to clarify matters with most people. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 317, 2, 57, 'is Almighty and His truth is like a fire that needs no defence from puny');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 317, 3, 57, 'people like us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 317, 4, 57, 'Love and Wisdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 317, 5, 57, 'Here is one of my proverbs: " A wise man will learn from the mistakes of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 317, 6, 57, 'others. An ordinary man will learn from his own mistakes. But a fool');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 317, 7, 57, 'will not learn even from his own mistakes."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 317, 8, 57, 'As a father, I want to learn from the mistakes that I have seen in other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 317, 9, 57, 'fathers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 317, 10, 57, 'So I ask myself what sort of example I have set for you boys - which you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 317, 11, 57, 'will follow. I hope it is this: To seek God''s kingdom first and to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 317, 12, 57, 'endure in wise love toward all people, until the end of your lives .');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 317, 13, 57, 'Wisdom means keeping a good distance from troublesome people - and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 317, 14, 57, 'wisdom must govern your love. Your petrol (gas) tank (your heart) must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 317, 15, 57, 'be full of love, but wisdom must be in the driver''s seat. Otherwise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 317, 16, 57, 'human love can do many foolish things. Your love must " abound in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 317, 17, 57, 'discernment (wisdom)" (Phil.1:9). You must never hate anyone or be rude');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 317, 18, 57, 'to anyone. Greet those who don''t greet you. Speak respectfully to all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 317, 19, 57, 'men at all times (as it says in 1 Peter 2:17). Be good to those who do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 317, 20, 57, 'evil to you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 317, 21, 57, 'When the Pharisees called Jesus "Beelzebub", He forgave them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 317, 22, 57, '(Matt.12;24,32). When they dragged Him to court and accused Him falsely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 317, 23, 57, 'there, He never threatened them, but committed His cause to His Father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 317, 24, 57, '(1 Pet.2:23). We must follow in Jesus'' steps.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 317, 25, 57, 'So if some Pharisee accuses you (or even takes you to court one day),');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 317, 26, 57, 'remember what Jesus said: " You will be hated by all....they will drag');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 317, 27, 57, 'you to court .....but be wise as serpents and harmless as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 317, 28, 57, 'doves........you will be given words to speak then (so you don''t have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 318, 1, 57, 'be silent there!) ....Don''t fear people, for everything covered up will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 318, 2, 57, 'be revealed.... but he who endures (in love to everyone) until the end');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 318, 3, 57, 'will be saved......The time will even come when those who kill you will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 318, 4, 57, 'think that they are serving God " (Matt.10:16-30; Matt.24:9-13; John');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 318, 5, 57, '16:2).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 318, 6, 57, 'So, always:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 318, 7, 57, '(1) Seek God''s kingdom and his righteousness first. and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 318, 8, 57, '(2) Always be rooted and grounded in a wise love toward others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 318, 9, 57, 'Every group in Christendom holds up their Bibles and says, "We are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 318, 10, 57, 'right. God is with us." Who among them is right? I got a clear answer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 318, 11, 57, 'from the Lord: "God is with those who always speak the truth (even if it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 318, 12, 57, 'goes against them) and who always remain in a wise love towards others');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 318, 13, 57, '(that is, those who never do or wish any harm to others)."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 318, 14, 57, 'May you all spend your lives seeking the kingdom of God first always.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 318, 15, 57, 'That means for you, right now, to do well in your studies (or work) and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 318, 16, 57, 'to show that Christians do well in all fields, in uprightness of life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 318, 17, 57, 'and with unselfish love to others. We are praying that for you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 318, 18, 57, 'constantly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 318, 19, 57, 'God is Able');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 318, 20, 57, '" God is able to make all grace abound toward you so that you always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 318, 21, 57, 'having all sufficiency in all things will have abundance for every good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 318, 22, 57, 'deed " (2 Cor.9:8).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 318, 23, 57, 'We often stress what we should do. But this verse begins with "God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 318, 24, 57, 'able....." This should be our major emphasis - what God can do for us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 318, 25, 57, 'and in us. We must be balanced.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 318, 26, 57, 'Many who joined CFC had been "driving a car" that had gone far off the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 318, 27, 57, 'road to the left (in worldliness). They realized that when they joined');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 318, 28, 57, 'CFC, and turned their steering wheel to the right (towards holiness) to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 319, 1, 57, 'come back to the road. But after coming to the road, many did not hold');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 319, 2, 57, 'the wheel in the "centre" position to go straight on the road. They kept');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 319, 3, 57, 'steering to the right and crossed the road and went far off to the right');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 319, 4, 57, '(in legalism). So now they need to turn left and come back to the main');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 319, 5, 57, 'road - and then stay steady.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 319, 6, 57, 'We must all think much about God having accepted us and God being able');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 319, 7, 57, 'to make all grace available to us to accomplish all His will .');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 319, 8, 57, 'Remember too that God has a solution for every problem. If you believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 319, 9, 57, 'that and seek Him for that solution and for grace to overcome, then your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 319, 10, 57, 'future will be glorious.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 319, 11, 57, 'Fear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 319, 12, 57, 'One of Satan''s chief weapons is "fear". He uses it constantly. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 319, 13, 57, 'believers try to frighten others or threaten others, they are (albeit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 319, 14, 57, 'unconsciously) in fellowship with Satan, because they are using a weapon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 319, 15, 57, 'from Satan''s armoury. "God does not give us the spirit of fear"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 319, 16, 57, '(2Tim.1:7). Fear is always a weapon of Satan. So we should not be afraid');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 319, 17, 57, 'of the threats and intimidatory tactics that men use against us. Such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 319, 18, 57, 'men are all agents of Satan, even if they call themselves "believers".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 319, 19, 57, 'This is a lesson for us to learn for our whole life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 319, 20, 57, 'We should not even preach in such a way as to "frighten" people. There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 319, 21, 57, 'is a difference between warning people about hell and trying to frighten');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 319, 22, 57, 'them. Jesus never tried to frighten anyone. We also must never be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 319, 23, 57, 'intimidated by preachers who try to bring us under guilt and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 319, 24, 57, 'condemnation by quoting various verses. Preachers threaten believers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 319, 25, 57, 'with God''s judgment if they leave their church or if they don''t pay');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 319, 26, 57, 'their tithes to them, etc. These are all Satan''s tactics.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 319, 27, 57, 'It is important to be "quick of scent in the fear of the Lord" (Isaiah');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 319, 28, 57, '11:3 literal rendering). Like a police-dog can pick up the scent of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 320, 1, 57, 'criminal, even at a junction of many roads, the Holy Spirit wants to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 320, 2, 57, 'make us so sensitive as to what pleases the Lord, that at any junction,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 320, 3, 57, 'where we hear many voices, we will know which is the path that glorifies');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 320, 4, 57, 'God. May you all become quick of scent in this area. You are living in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 320, 5, 57, 'an evil land with sin and corruption all around. Keep yourselves pure.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 320, 6, 57, 'Prayer - A Two-Way Communication');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 320, 7, 57, 'The Lord wants us to fellowship with Him just like a husband deeply in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 320, 8, 57, 'love with his wife, wants to communicate with her. He says, " My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 320, 9, 57, 'dove...let me hear your voice, for your voice is sweet...." (Song of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 320, 10, 57, 'Sol.2:14).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 320, 11, 57, 'This is why He wants us to pray. Prayer is a two-way matter - listening');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 320, 12, 57, 'and talking, as in a telephone. You would certainly spend more time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 320, 13, 57, 'listening, if the person at the other end of the phone was far more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 320, 14, 57, 'godly than you. Even so, it is more important for you to listen to what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 320, 15, 57, 'God has to say to you, than for you to tell Him your needs. He knows');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 320, 16, 57, 'your needs in any case! So your heart''s ears must be open all the time -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 320, 17, 57, 'when driving the car, when working in the office, when things go wrong');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 320, 18, 57, 'and when unexpected things happen.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 320, 19, 57, 'But we must still tell God what we want, because He is a Father Who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 320, 20, 57, 'loves to hear His children asking for things.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 320, 21, 57, 'Can we ask God for material things? Certainly. In fact, Jesus taught us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 320, 22, 57, 'to ask for "our daily bread..." even before asking for " forgiveness for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 320, 23, 57, 'our sins..." and "deliverance from evil ...". That doesn''t sound');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 320, 24, 57, 'spiritual to some people. But Jesus is realistic. He knows what all is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 320, 25, 57, 'needed for you to get your daily bread. In college-days, He knows that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 320, 26, 57, 'you need to get good grades in order to get a job, so that you can earn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 320, 27, 57, 'your daily bread, Once you start working, he knows that you have to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 320, 28, 57, 'healthy and that your car needs to be in good shape as well, for you to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 321, 1, 57, 'go to work, so that you can earn your daily bread. So there are many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 321, 2, 57, 'material things that you can ask for, that are necessities for life on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 321, 3, 57, 'earth - things related to " Give us this day our daily bread..."??');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 321, 4, 57, 'And don''t forget that Jesus used the word " us " and " our " in this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 321, 5, 57, 'prayer - give us our daily bread, forgive us our sins, deliver us from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 321, 6, 57, 'evil. So we must pray not just for ourselves, but also for our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 321, 7, 57, 'fellow-believers who are in need.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 321, 8, 58, 'Chapter 57 Chapter 57');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 321, 9, 58, 'Satan is a Defeated Foe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 321, 10, 58, 'Here is an important truth that you must always keep in mind: All');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 321, 11, 58, 'quotations from the Old Testament must be checked to see if there is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 321, 12, 58, 'some New Testament truth that overrides it. For example, slaying lambs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 321, 13, 58, 'has been overridden by the Lamb of God already slain for us. In the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 321, 14, 58, 'way, we must remember that Daniel prayed at a time when Satan and his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 321, 15, 58, 'hosts had not yet been defeated on Calvary . That is why there was a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 321, 16, 58, 'conflict then with Satan (in the heavenlies) for three weeks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 321, 17, 58, '(Dan.10:12,13). But we are now living on this side of the cross, where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 321, 18, 58, 'Satan has been defeated. So we don''t have to struggle with him for three');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 321, 19, 58, 'weeks now. We stand on Christ''s victory. This is a truth that very few');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 321, 20, 58, 'are teaching.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 321, 21, 58, 'We read clearly in Col.2:14, 15 and Heb.2:14 that Satan was defeated');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 321, 22, 58, '(not destroyed but disarmed) on the cross. So today, we first submit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 321, 23, 58, '(give ourselves) to God totally and then stand on the victory of Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 321, 24, 58, 'and resist Satan in Jesus'' Name. And Satan will flee from us at once');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 321, 25, 58, '(James 4:7). He will flee from us at the speed of lightning, which is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 321, 26, 58, '186,000 miles (or 300,000 kilometres) per second - because Jesus said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 321, 27, 58, 'that He saw " Satan falling from heaven like lightning" (Luke 10:18).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 321, 28, 58, '(This, by the way, is a good question to ask in a Bible quiz on James');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 322, 1, 58, '4:7: "At what speed does Satan flee from us when we resist him?")');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 322, 2, 58, 'But if your lives are not cleansed in Christ''s blood constantly by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 322, 3, 58, 'regular confession of sin (as and when you are pricked in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 322, 4, 58, 'conscience), then you won''t have power over Satan. So keep your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 322, 5, 58, 'conscience clean by confessing your sins to the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 322, 6, 58, 'God is a loving Father. You must always find your security in Him. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 322, 7, 58, 'best earthly father is but a faint replica of God. So you can imagine');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 322, 8, 58, 'how much God loves you. You must be secure in His love always and love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 322, 9, 58, 'Him in return deeply. You must never do anything that displeases Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 322, 10, 58, 'And when you fall (as will happen now and then), repent immediately and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 322, 11, 58, 'come back to Him in sorrow, and keep your heart clean through Jesus''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 322, 12, 58, 'blood at all times.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 322, 13, 58, 'Many charismatic preachers major in their preaching on faith for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 322, 14, 58, 'material things and healing and on casting out demons, and then pressure');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 322, 15, 58, 'people to give them their money. Some other preachers major on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 322, 16, 58, 'psychological methods of comforting Christians, rather than getting them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 322, 17, 58, 'to have faith in God''s promises. So be careful to avoid the false');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 322, 18, 58, 'teachings about "inner healing", "the power of positive thinking", and "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 322, 19, 58, 'generational curses", etc., which are widely prevalent these days. It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 322, 20, 58, 'best to stick to the language of the New Testament in spiritual matters.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 322, 21, 58, 'Study God''s Word and then you won''t be deceived.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 322, 22, 58, 'The Limitations of Human Reasoning');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 322, 23, 58, 'To keep you abreast of things happening with us here in India: The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 322, 24, 58, '"heresy" charges that have been thrown at us since 1975 (when CFC was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 322, 25, 58, 'born) continue to be heard even now, but not so frequently. All of God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 322, 26, 58, 'prophets were called "heretics" during the last 2000 years - Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 322, 27, 58, 'Himself to begin with; and then Paul, Martin Luther, John Wesley and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 322, 28, 58, 'many others (See Matt.5:11,12). They were all called heretics in their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 323, 1, 58, 'lifetime but recognized as prophets after they died! So we are in good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 323, 2, 58, 'company!! Life however continues in triumph in Christ - and there is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 323, 3, 58, 'never a dull moment! As I have often said, "The godly man''s life is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 323, 4, 58, 'exciting"! (Prov.14:14 - Living). Praise the Lord!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 323, 5, 58, '" Some people said that Jesus was a good man. Others said that He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 323, 6, 58, 'leading people astray " (John 7:12). The same controversy continues even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 323, 7, 58, 'today in relation to men of God. Paul said to Felix " I admit to you,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 323, 8, 58, 'that according to what they call heresy, I serve God...... believing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 323, 9, 58, 'everything that is in accordance with the Scriptures " (Acts 24:14). We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 323, 10, 58, 'say the same thing. We are bold to preach all that the Bible teaches.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 323, 11, 58, 'But we are also careful not to teach anything that the Bible does not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 323, 12, 58, 'teach clearly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 323, 13, 58, 'For example: The dispute in relation to the sovereignty of God and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 323, 14, 58, 'free will of man has been going on for 20 centuries - but especially in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 323, 15, 58, 'the last 4 centuries between the Calvinists and the Arminians. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 323, 16, 58, 'because the human mind cannot resolve this apparent paradox. Some teach');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 323, 17, 58, 'that it is God Who holds on to the believer permanently such that he can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 323, 18, 58, 'never fall away (like the mother-cat holds its kittens in its mouth).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 323, 19, 58, 'Others say that it is the believer who must hold on to God (like the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 323, 20, 58, 'baby-monkey that clings on to its mother). The fact is that these two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 323, 21, 58, 'truths are not contradictory but complementary. They appear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 323, 22, 58, 'contradictory only because we think according to human reason. We are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 323, 23, 58, 'eternally secure in God. But we don''t want to do anything that will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 323, 24, 58, 'displease God. We don''t fear that God will hurt us (for He never will,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 323, 25, 58, 'since we are eternally His children), but we do fear that we might hurt');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 323, 26, 58, 'God! No-one can pluck us out of God''s hand. But we can jump out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 323, 27, 58, 'ourselves. If that were not possible, then we would have to conclude');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 323, 28, 58, 'that we become robots as soon as we are converted!!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 324, 1, 58, 'This limitation of our reason is also seen in the argument as to whether');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 324, 2, 58, 'Jesus could have sinned or not. Here is what I say:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 324, 3, 58, 'Could Jesus have sinned? As God, certainly not. But as a Man, certainly,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 324, 4, 58, 'yes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 324, 5, 58, 'This is called " the great mystery of godliness - that Christ came in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 324, 6, 58, 'the flesh " (1 Tim.3:16).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 324, 7, 58, 'As God, he could not even have been tempted (God cannot be tempted -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 324, 8, 58, 'Jas.1:13). But Jesus was tempted (Matt.4:1-10) - and He was tempted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 324, 9, 58, 'exactly as we are, in all points (Heb.4:15). So, could He have sinned as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 324, 10, 58, 'a Man? Yes. Otherwise, He was not tempted like us - for we can certainly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 324, 11, 58, 'sin when we are tempted. His victory is actually even greater when we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 324, 12, 58, 'see that He could have sinned, but yet never sinned in thought or word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 324, 13, 58, 'or deed or attitude or motive or in any other way for a period of 33½');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 324, 14, 58, 'years, even though He was surrounded by evil men, demons and temptations');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 324, 15, 58, 'of every sort. We know how difficult it is for us to keep ourselves pure');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 324, 16, 58, 'even for a single day. Jesus lived in total purity for 33½ years!! What');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 324, 17, 58, 'a mighty, consistent victory that was - far greater than if He had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 324, 18, 58, 'holiness handed to Him on a platter, because He was God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 324, 19, 58, 'Did Jesus then give up His Deity, when He came to earth? No. Certainly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 324, 20, 58, 'not! He accepted worship from many people and He forgave people their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 324, 21, 58, 'sins. He could do these only as God. But He did not use His resources as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 324, 22, 58, 'God in any way for Himself, when He was on earth. He lived as a Man with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 324, 23, 58, 'only the resources that we have. That is why He is an Example and a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 324, 24, 58, 'Forerunner for us, as a Man. And that is why He can say to us "Deny');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 324, 25, 58, 'yourself daily and follow Me (= follow My example every day)" (Luke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 324, 26, 58, '9:23). He denied Himself daily for 33½ years.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 324, 27, 58, 'A dog cannot fully understand a man. Much less can a man fully');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 324, 28, 58, 'understand God. It is wise therefore for us to humble ourselves and to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 325, 1, 58, 'acknowledge that the small cup of our human intellect cannot fully');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 325, 2, 58, 'contain the ocean of God''s wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 325, 3, 58, 'It is enough for us to know that we can look at Jesus as our Example and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 325, 4, 58, 'follow Him in daily life - and thus " overcome even as Jesus overcame"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 325, 5, 58, 'whenever we are tempted (Rev.3:21). Praise the Lord! Those who attempt');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 325, 6, 58, 'to reason this out with their puny minds will fall into a pit of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 325, 7, 58, 'confusion that they dig for themselves. But those who are seeking to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 325, 8, 58, 'live a godly life will rejoice in this truth - for even if they cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 325, 9, 58, 'explain it, they can experience the reality of an overcoming life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 325, 10, 58, 'Enduring in Divine Love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 325, 11, 58, 'We are living in days of great deception and in the times of which Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 325, 12, 58, 'warned us that people would grow cold in love and betray one another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 325, 13, 58, '(brother against brother). So we must not only endure in love to all,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 325, 14, 58, 'but also be wise to avoid people who are perpetually bent on strife and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 325, 15, 58, 'controversy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 325, 16, 58, 'As Christians, we will never do evil to anyone and we will never fight');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 325, 17, 58, 'with human beings. But we will continue to expose wrong doctrines.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 325, 18, 58, 'We must also " open our mouth for the rights of all the unfortunate and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 325, 19, 58, 'defend the rights of the afflicted and needy " (Prov.31:8, 9). David');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 325, 20, 58, 'prayed that God would cause confusion in the camp of rebellious Absalom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 325, 21, 58, 'through Ahithophel''s counsel (2 Sam.15:31) and God answered that prayer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 325, 22, 58, '(2 Sam.17:23). Jesus prayed that the Father would forgive those who hurt');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 325, 23, 58, 'Him. But He ruthlessly condemned those who hurt others (see his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 325, 24, 58, 'condemnation of the Pharisees in Matt.23).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 325, 25, 58, 'And now a word about the parable of the wise virgins:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 325, 26, 58, 'Once we have heard one interpretation of a parable, it is easy for our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 325, 27, 58, 'minds to be so fixed on that interpretation, that the Lord can never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 325, 28, 58, 'give us another interpretation of it. Some time ago, I sought the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 326, 1, 58, 'to break out of this fixation to understand the parable in its context -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 326, 2, 58, 'which is always the best way to interpret any parable:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 326, 3, 58, 'In Matthew 24:12, Jesus said that the love of many would die out in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 326, 4, 58, 'last days, but those who endured to the end (without their love dying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 326, 5, 58, 'out) would be saved (or, enter in to God''s house) (Matt.24:13). Then He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 326, 6, 58, 'spoke the parable of the virgins - five whose lamps died out and five');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 326, 7, 58, 'who endured until the end and entered into the house (Matt.25). So one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 326, 8, 58, 'meaning of the oil he spoke of must be referring to Divine love given to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 326, 9, 58, 'us by the Holy Spirit. So we have to endure until the end in Divine love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 326, 10, 58, 'if we are to enter God''s house when the Bridegroom comes. This is what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 326, 11, 58, 'it means to have " an extra flask of oil" that will keep our lamps');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 326, 12, 58, 'burning until the end.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 326, 13, 58, 'Jesus said, "They hated Me without a cause" (John 15:25) But in return,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 326, 14, 58, 'He loved them without any cause. Let us follow His example and love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 326, 15, 58, 'until the end. Otherwise "dying to self" can become an empty doctrine -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 326, 16, 58, 'as it has become for many who preach about it. I find that many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 326, 17, 58, '"believers" who talk about walking the way of the cross, are not only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 326, 18, 58, 'lacking in love, but lacking in plain human decency and courtesy as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 326, 19, 58, 'well. They glory in their so-called "pure doctrine", but their life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 326, 20, 58, 'stinks. If our doctrine is truly pure, then the fragrance of the love of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 326, 21, 58, 'Christ will radiate from our lives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 326, 22, 58, 'The 19th century Quaker missionary, Stephen Grellet once said, " I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 326, 23, 58, 'expect to pass through this world but once. Any good thing therefore');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 326, 24, 58, 'that I can do, or any kindness that I can show to any fellow-creature,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 326, 25, 58, 'let me do it now. Let me not defer or neglect it - for I shall not pass');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 326, 26, 58, 'this way again ." Let me encourage you to follow that advice.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 326, 27, 58, 'Our Reactions Indicate Our Spiritual Level');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 326, 28, 58, 'The Bible says that " the wicked are like the troubled sea that cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 327, 1, 58, 'rest, but constantly throw up mud and dirt " (because there is an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 327, 2, 58, 'endless amount of mud and dirt at the bottom - Isa.57:20). And one can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 327, 3, 58, 'never say when such a sea will start tossing up all that dirt again.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 327, 4, 58, 'Such people are totally unpredictable. The sea is affected by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 327, 5, 58, 'seasonal forces of nature, such as the moon - and so also are such men.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 327, 6, 58, 'They get angry and throw out their diatribes and then remain quiet for a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 327, 7, 58, 'while. Then all of a sudden, they toss up another pile of dirt!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 327, 8, 58, 'Proverbs 26:4 says, " Do not answer a fool according to his folly lest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 327, 9, 58, 'you also be like him ". But there are some fools whom we must answer, as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 327, 10, 58, 'the next verse says. But we must discern which type of fool each person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 327, 11, 58, 'is. Those who are bitter and angry fall in Category 1 and must never be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 327, 12, 58, 'answered. That is one guideline I go by. Just as we ignore dogs that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 327, 13, 58, 'bark along the roadside and don''t go anywhere near them, we should avoid');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 327, 14, 58, 'such human beings too. Let them bark to their heart''s content. The fools');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 327, 15, 58, 'we should give an answer to however (Prov.26:5), are the ignorant,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 327, 16, 58, 'sincere fools who are eager to know the truth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 327, 17, 58, 'While our actions are an important indicator of our spiritual state, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 327, 18, 58, 'is more by our reactions to the actions of others that we discover where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 327, 19, 58, 'we stand spiritually. I evaluate myself by my reaction to the many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 327, 20, 58, 'criticisms against me. (I never reply to them). The reaction of Jesus to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 327, 21, 58, 'the opposition He faced in His lifetime is the example we follow.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 327, 22, 58, 'As we grow older, every year, we become wiser in our speech and in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 327, 23, 58, 'way we write our letters - but growth in wisdom is something that will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 327, 24, 58, 'keep on taking place in us throughout our lives, if we walk in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 327, 25, 58, 'light. So at any given time, we can do things only according to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 327, 26, 58, 'wisdom we have at that moment.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 327, 27, 59, 'Chapter 58 Chapter 58');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 327, 28, 59, 'Maturity and Stability Take Time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 328, 1, 59, 'I praise God for pressures - because we get to know the Lord better in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 328, 2, 59, 'such situations and thus are equipped to face life. It is not that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 328, 3, 59, 'never fall or fail. But it takes time and maturity to come to a stable');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 328, 4, 59, 'Christian life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 328, 5, 59, 'I gave my life to the Lord when I was 19½. But I fell and got up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 328, 6, 59, 'numerous times thereafter. Things became relatively easier 16 years');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 328, 7, 59, 'later, when I began to learn how to live the Spirit-filled life and to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 328, 8, 59, 'rest in God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 328, 9, 59, 'Miles Stanford writes in his book, Principles of Spiritual Growth: "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 328, 10, 59, 'Consider some familiar names of believers whom God brought to maturity');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 328, 11, 59, 'and used for His glory - such as D.L.Moody, Jonathan Goforth, George');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 328, 12, 59, 'Mueller, Hudson Taylor, Charles Trumbull, F.B.Meyer, Andrew Murray,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 328, 13, 59, 'Frances Havergal, Madam Guyon, John Hyde, Robert McCheyne, Amy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 328, 14, 59, 'Carmichael and Evans Hopkins. The average for these was 15 years after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 328, 15, 59, 'they entered their life work before they began to know the Lord Jesus as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 328, 16, 59, 'their Life and ceased trying to work for Him and began allowing Him to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 328, 17, 59, 'be their All in all and to do His work through them . "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 328, 18, 59, 'So be encouraged. Growth and stability take time in the Christian life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 328, 19, 59, 'I have seen that every trial is a test of whether I can stay in love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 328, 20, 59, 'when the pressure increases. With God''s grace enabling me, I plan to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 328, 21, 59, 'endure until the end. Every test we pass will result in our being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 328, 22, 59, 'promoted to a higher class! Jesus was tested in love until they killed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 328, 23, 59, 'Him. He died loving them until the end. This is the new and living way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 328, 24, 59, 'that He has opened for us to walk in. By God''s grace we can live like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 328, 25, 59, 'that. The devil says, "Impossible". But we say, "Possible by God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 328, 26, 59, 'grace". Don''t ever confess the Devil''s lie. We can overcome and remain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 328, 27, 59, 'in love until the end.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 328, 28, 59, 'As I said earlier, I failed the Lord numerous times. But God has been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 329, 1, 59, 'merciful to me and has now given me a ministry to failing men and women.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 329, 2, 59, 'So don''t let Satan condemn you because you haven''t yet " entered into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 329, 3, 59, 'God''s rest"! You will enter in one day.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 329, 4, 59, 'Discipline is not something that comes overnight. For some people it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 329, 5, 59, 'comes naturally. For others it is more difficult. Actually you have far');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 329, 6, 59, 'more discipline than you think. Otherwise you all would be unemployed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 329, 7, 59, 'drop-outs from school today, like many others in the world today. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 329, 8, 59, 'seek to be a more disciplined Christian.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 329, 9, 59, 'Make the following confessions frequently, because they are always true,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 329, 10, 59, 'irrespective of whether you believe them or not, whether you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 329, 11, 59, 'disciplined or not, and whether you have succeeded or failed:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 329, 12, 59, '" God rules the world from his throne... Jesus died for all my sins and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 329, 13, 59, 'has forgiven all of them....');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 329, 14, 59, 'Satan was defeated on the cross....');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 329, 15, 59, 'Jesus is coming back for me....');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 329, 16, 59, 'This world is not my permanent home....');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 329, 17, 59, 'God will crush Satan under my feet" (Rom.16:20).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 329, 18, 59, 'Gratitude for Mom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 329, 19, 59, 'I am so glad that all of you have learnt to appreciate Mom while she is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 329, 20, 59, 'still alive - unlike some children who sing their mother''s praises only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 329, 21, 59, 'at her funeral. None of you will ever know the extent to which Mom has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 329, 22, 59, 'suffered and denied herself and given up everything - including her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 329, 23, 59, 'career - for the sake of the four of you. I have seen a little bit of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 329, 24, 59, 'her sacrifice. But even I do not know the full extent of all that she');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 329, 25, 59, 'has sacrificed and suffered in secret, just because she married me, a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 329, 26, 59, 'servant of the Lord. But she did everything for the Lord''s sake and so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 329, 27, 59, 'she will have her reward one day, for all that she sacrificed and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 329, 28, 59, 'suffered.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 330, 1, 59, 'You are what you are today in a large measure due to her:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 330, 2, 59, '- spiritually, because she has constantly prayed for you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 330, 3, 59, '- intellectually, because she persisted in making you all study, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 330, 4, 59, 'even devised ways and means to help you study every subject.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 330, 5, 59, '- physically, because she gave you the best of food and medical care');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 330, 6, 59, 'that we could afford.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 330, 7, 59, 'I am deeply grateful to God for Mom. I have learnt to appreciate her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 330, 8, 59, 'more and more.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 330, 9, 59, 'Exhortations for a Godly Life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 330, 10, 59, 'Let me give you a few practical exhortations:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 330, 11, 59, '(1) First of all: Love the LIGHT and hate all hypocrisy and acting. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 330, 12, 59, 'can fool all people to a great extent, about your spiritual state, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 330, 13, 59, 'you can''t fool God. May the Lord enable you always to see yourself as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 330, 14, 59, 'God sees you and not as men see you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 330, 15, 59, '(2) Secondly: Avoid all physical contact with girls. Shake their hands');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 330, 16, 59, 'and stop there. Don''t ever go out alone with any girl - especially in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 330, 17, 59, 'the late evenings. And don''t let any girl get any " ideas" (by your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 330, 18, 59, 'words) if you are not seriously considering her as a prospective wife.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 330, 19, 59, 'That is not fair to her. If all of you live at least by the Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 330, 20, 59, 'Testament standard of moral purity - keeping a respectable distance from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 330, 21, 59, 'girls - and "fleeing from youthful lusts" as Paul told the 45-year-old,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 330, 22, 59, 'wholehearted Timothy to do - that itself would be great. But I would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 330, 23, 59, 'urge you to press on to the new-covenant standard and to fight the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 330, 24, 59, 'battle faithfully in the "lusting-with-the-eyes" area. But this is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 330, 25, 59, 'lifelong battle and a very tough one for every man who is not effeminate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 330, 26, 59, '(and none of you are effeminate!). May the Lord give you grace in these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 330, 27, 59, 'your unmarried days to fight this battle wholeheartedly. Those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 330, 28, 59, 'recognize this as a tough battle, acknowledge their failures, mourn over');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 331, 1, 59, 'them and seek for God''s power, will definitely get the victory.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 331, 2, 59, 'Be careful of sympathizing with suffering girls. I have seen what has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 331, 3, 59, 'happened to young men who have sought to help "damsels in distress ".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 331, 4, 59, 'Some have been deceived by damsels who "pretended" to be in distress. An');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 331, 5, 59, 'unwise human sympathy in such cases is always the first step downwards.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 331, 6, 59, 'Some girls have even given boys something to eat or drink in order to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 331, 7, 59, '"capture" them. A child of God who is walking in the light and cleansed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 331, 8, 59, 'in Jesus'' blood, can never be affected by such ''love-potions''; but they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 331, 9, 59, 'can affect anyone who is walking in darkness. So the safest course is to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 331, 10, 59, 'walk in the light always. Others capture men with `love-charms'' that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 331, 11, 59, 'they give the men to wear on their bodies.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 331, 12, 59, 'Some men visit a girl and then find themselves alone in a room or a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 331, 13, 59, 'house with her - and they don''t run away like Joseph did. The girl then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 331, 14, 59, 'becomes pregnant and then she has a hold on the man forever. The girls');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 331, 15, 59, 'are thrilled when they capture men like this. But such men are foolish -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 331, 16, 59, 'and they ruin their whole lives. I want to warn all of you: Be careful.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 331, 17, 59, 'If you want to help others, help only needy men, not needy women (unless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 331, 18, 59, 'they are over 70 years old!).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 331, 19, 59, '(3) Thirdly: Be poor in spirit. Have a sense of your own spiritual need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 331, 20, 59, 'always - and live in a constant judgment of yourself. Brokenness is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 331, 21, 59, 'secret of true spirituality. We must live with a constant sense of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 331, 22, 59, 'own inability to live an overcoming life and a constant desire to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 331, 23, 59, 'filled with the Holy Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 331, 24, 59, '(4) Fourthly: Spend 10 minutes meditating on the Word of God daily. Let');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 331, 25, 59, 'that be part of your daily routine - any time of the day. Get a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 331, 26, 59, 'devotional commentary and study the Word with it. Or use my Bible-study');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 331, 27, 59, 'tapes for this purpose. Read some verses from the book of Proverbs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 331, 28, 59, 'daily. Disciplined study of the Word saved me from many a calamity in my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 332, 1, 59, 'younger days.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 332, 2, 59, '(5) Fifthly: Honour the Lord everywhere. One example: If you host a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 332, 3, 59, 'party, you should honour God by praying and sharing a brief word from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 332, 4, 59, 'Scripture. Don''t be apologetic when praying or sharing the Word on such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 332, 5, 59, 'occasions. Unfortunately, most believers are ashamed to acknowledge the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 332, 6, 59, 'Lord at a party that they host, because they don''t want to offend the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 332, 7, 59, 'unbelievers present. But unbelievers never seek to please believers at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 332, 8, 59, 'their parties! The children of Satan are bolder than the children of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 332, 9, 59, 'God!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 332, 10, 59, 'Music and Full-Time Ministry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 332, 11, 59, 'Music, like sport, is primarily meant to be a form of relaxation and an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 332, 12, 59, 'extra-curricular activity in our lives. I don''t believe anyone should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 332, 13, 59, 'make music the main thing in his life. We don''t read of anyone in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 332, 14, 59, 'New Testament having an exclusive ministry of music.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 332, 15, 59, 'Christian music as a full-time ministry is popular in the West because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 332, 16, 59, 'those with a gift of music have seen that secular musicians make a lot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 332, 17, 59, 'of money. And the abundance of wealth among Christians there enables');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 332, 18, 59, 'Christian musicians also to make a lot of money through a music');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 332, 19, 59, 'ministry. This practice is unfortunately coming up in India as well now.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 332, 20, 59, 'But Jesus said that no-one can serve God and money.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 332, 21, 59, 'A Christian should never seek for financial profit through his preaching');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 332, 22, 59, 'or musical ability. We should not be dependent on gifts from others for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 332, 23, 59, 'our livelihood. Christian ministry must be a voluntary service that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 332, 24, 59, 'render to the Lord first of all and then to His people. We must offer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 332, 25, 59, 'our ministry freely to all people (especially to the poor who cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 332, 26, 59, 'pay) - and support ourselves by other means. This is what I have done');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 332, 27, 59, 'ever since CFC started, and that is why I have been able to visit the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 332, 28, 59, 'poor believers in the villages in India who are really needy. Paid');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 333, 1, 59, 'preachers and musicians can serve only the rich. That was not how Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 333, 2, 59, 'ministered.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 333, 3, 59, 'It is a heathen concept that sacrificing earthly comforts (like a sadhu)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 333, 4, 59, 'means one is serving God. Serving God full-time requires a call from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 333, 5, 59, 'God, because such people are living off money given for God''s work');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 333, 6, 59, '(whether the amount is little or much). No-one can choose such a calling');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 333, 7, 59, 'on his own, because no-one has the right to receive money given by God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 333, 8, 59, 'people for God''s work, who has not been specifically called by God to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 333, 9, 59, 'His servant. It would amount to stealing God''s money - and there is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 333, 10, 59, 'lot of that going on all over the world today. No-one can be paid by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 333, 11, 59, 'army if he has not first been selected to serve in the army.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 333, 12, 59, 'Further, there are so many pressures in Christian ministry that it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 333, 13, 59, 'impossible to survive without compromising, unless one has a clear call');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 333, 14, 59, 'from God. In my own case, if I had not known all along that God had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 333, 15, 59, 'called me, I would have "gone under" long ago, either through "begging');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 333, 16, 59, 'for money through prayer-letters" (during years of financial hardship,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 333, 17, 59, 'especially when my family''s needs increased), or through compromise in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 333, 18, 59, 'my message (when I faced rejection from all of Christendom in India');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 333, 19, 59, 'because of my message), or through discouragement (when I faced other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 333, 20, 59, 'forms of opposition). But God has preserved me through all these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 333, 21, 59, 'circumstances - and that too, not just by "keeping my head above water"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 333, 22, 59, '(bare survival), but by "making me walk on water" (in triumph). I give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 333, 23, 59, 'all the glory to God for that, because better men than me have sunk in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 333, 24, 59, 'the quagmire. So although I firmly believe that full-time Christian work');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 333, 25, 59, 'is the greatest work anyone can ever do in this world, no-one can enter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 333, 26, 59, 'it and be a success in it, in God''s eyes, without a clear call from God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 333, 27, 59, 'There is ample evidence in Christendom around us to prove this.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 333, 28, 59, 'Hebrews 5:4, 5 (Living) says, " No-one can enter (God''s service) just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 334, 1, 59, 'because he wants to. He has to be called by God for this work in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 334, 2, 59, 'same way that God chose Aaron. Christ Himself did not choose this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 334, 3, 59, 'honour. No, He was called by God ".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 334, 4, 59, 'Since that is so, how can we ever enter into God''s work without His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 334, 5, 59, 'calling us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 334, 6, 60, 'Chapter 59 Chapter 59');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 334, 7, 60, 'The Three-Fold Hedge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 334, 8, 60, 'We have a right to many things. But Jesus said that because His kingdom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 334, 9, 60, 'was not of this world, His servants would not fight for their rights.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 334, 10, 60, 'Godly men give up their rights instead of getting into a fight. Abraham');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 334, 11, 60, 'refused to fight with Lot and gave up his rights (Gen.13). Lot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 334, 12, 60, 'immediately grabbed Sodom for himself and lost it all. Abraham however');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 334, 13, 60, 'allowed God to choose for him - and so his descendants possessed the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 334, 14, 60, 'whole land of Canaan. Isaac also refused to fight with the herdsmen of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 334, 15, 60, 'Gerar and allowed them to take the wells he had dug. So God gave him a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 334, 16, 60, 'better place - and people around him began to see that God was with him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 334, 17, 60, '(Gen.26:17-30).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 334, 18, 60, 'One day, we will see that the meek (the gentle) will inherit the whole');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 334, 19, 60, 'earth (Matt.5:5).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 334, 20, 60, 'Some people are paranoid about Satan and seem to see him everywhere.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 334, 21, 60, 'That is foolish. I know that Satan can bring bondage, confusion,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 334, 22, 60, 'impurity and strife. But I also know that he cannot stand when resisted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 334, 23, 60, 'in the Name of Jesus. He will literally flee. But he will not flee, if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 334, 24, 60, 'we are ignorant of his schemes, or if we don''t resist him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 334, 25, 60, 'Satan has never succeeded thus far against our family - and he won''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 334, 26, 60, 'succeed in the future either. Because God has placed a three-fold hedge');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 334, 27, 60, 'around (1) me, (2) my family-members and (3) my property and finances');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 334, 28, 60, '(as we read in Job 1:10). In every single instance where Satan has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 335, 1, 60, 'attacked us, so far, God has turned the tables on him and frustrated his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 335, 2, 60, 'plans. As long as we live, we will continue to resist Satan - and God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 335, 3, 60, 'will continue to frustrate Satan''s plans again and again. One day when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 335, 4, 60, 'the Lord comes, you will see the battles that we fought for all of you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 335, 5, 60, '(Eph.6:12), that you may be unaware of today (1 Cor.4:5). Then you will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 335, 6, 60, 'realize how much you were protected and how many times God delivered');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 335, 7, 60, 'you, in answer to our prayers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 335, 8, 60, 'Our prayer for all of you is that you will become wholehearted disciples');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 335, 9, 60, 'of the Lord Jesus, overcome Satan and live in God''s perfect plan for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 335, 10, 60, 'your lives. It doesn''t matter to me where you live. The best place is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 335, 11, 60, 'always the centre of God''s will.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 335, 12, 60, 'I have no doubt that all of you went to the right college, in God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 335, 13, 60, 'will, because I prayed specifically for each of you before you joined');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 335, 14, 60, 'those colleges. I see that each of you have become mature men after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 335, 15, 60, 'leaving home. And the Lord has preserved you all these years. You have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 335, 16, 60, 'been preserved from accidents miraculously. You have also been delivered');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 335, 17, 60, 'and protected from terrible evils that you are quite unaware of. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 335, 18, 60, 'addition, you have also been active in your churches, serving the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 335, 19, 60, 'and have been a blessing to many. We are proud of you. The believers in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 335, 20, 60, 'CFC thank God for you - and we do too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 335, 21, 60, 'Show your gratitude to Jesus for what He did for you on Calvary - by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 335, 22, 60, 'living a life of sacrifice, self-denial and service.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 335, 23, 60, 'Fighting a Constant Battle');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 335, 24, 60, 'I am delighted to see that you all are not spiritual babes any more, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 335, 25, 60, 'pressing on to maturity. I always wanted you to grow up to become my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 335, 26, 60, 'brothers in Christ - which is what we shall be for all eternity. All the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 335, 27, 60, 'discussions we have had together have been mature and healthy and have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 335, 28, 60, 'proved the fact that even when we disagree (on unimportant matters), we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 336, 1, 60, 'still love one another and stand by each other. This really shows me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 336, 2, 60, 'that you have become mature! Praise the Lord!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 336, 3, 60, 'Let me encourage all of you to fight the battle in the sexual area,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 336, 4, 60, 'especially in your thoughts and with your eyes (movies and magazines).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 336, 5, 60, 'Never give up battling in this area, because you will have this battle');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 336, 6, 60, 'until you are at least 60 years old, if not longer. David sinned with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 336, 7, 60, 'Bathsheba when he was 52. And his fall began when he was careless with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 336, 8, 60, 'his eyes. This battle was just as strong for me in my youth, as it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 336, 9, 60, 'now for you. But externally, the environment I lived in was not as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 336, 10, 60, 'explosive as the one you are now living in. So your battle will be more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 336, 11, 60, 'difficult. But the Lord will therefore give you more grace to overcome');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 336, 12, 60, 'this - until the end. If you fall, get up and continue fighting. Even if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 336, 13, 60, 'you are not a daily overcomer, be a survivor, at any cost. Then one day,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 336, 14, 60, 'you will become an overcomer and you will sail in triumph into heaven.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 336, 15, 60, 'Psalm 112 is beautifully paraphrased in the Living Bible as follows :');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 336, 16, 60, 'All who fear God and trust in him are blessed beyond expression. Happy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 336, 17, 60, 'is the man who delights in doing his commands. His children shall be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 336, 18, 60, 'honoured everywhere, for good men''s sons have a special heritage. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 336, 19, 60, 'himself shall be wealthy, and his good deeds will never be forgotten.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 336, 20, 60, 'When darkness overtakes him, light will come bursting in. Such a man is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 336, 21, 60, 'kind and merciful. All goes well for the generous man who conducts his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 336, 22, 60, 'business fairly. Such a man will not be overthrown by evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 336, 23, 60, 'circumstances. God''s constant care of him will make a deep impression on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 336, 24, 60, 'all who see it . He does not fear bad news, nor live in dread of what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 336, 25, 60, 'may happen. For he is settled in his mind that the Lord will take care');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 336, 26, 60, 'of him. That is why he is not afraid but can calmly face his foes. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 336, 27, 60, 'gives generously to those in need. His deeds will never be forgotten. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 336, 28, 60, 'shall have influence and honour. Evil-minded men will be infuriated when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 337, 1, 60, 'they see all this. They will gnash their teeth in anger and slink away,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 337, 2, 60, 'their hopes thwarted.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 337, 3, 60, 'Managing Personal Finances');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 337, 4, 60, 'Financial freedom is something that makes it easier for us to go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 337, 5, 60, 'wherever the Lord wants us to go, without being dependent on anyone and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 337, 6, 60, 'also seems to fit in with the teaching in Proverbs 6 about learning from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 337, 7, 60, 'the ant to save for the future, and with Jesus'' parable of the man who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 337, 8, 60, 'invested his talents and produced ten times more (1000% increase) and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 337, 9, 60, 'the master''s suggestion that the second best method was to put the money');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 337, 10, 60, 'into the bank and get interest (Lk.19:16, 23).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 337, 11, 60, 'Whenever you decide to give some money for the work of the Lord, don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 337, 12, 60, 'give it to rich pastors and churches and organizations, but rather to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 337, 13, 60, 'the poor CFC churches in India''s villages.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 337, 14, 60, 'You must also get into the saving habit now itself. As a help to this,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 337, 15, 60, 'initially you should keep an account of all your major expenditure. Then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 337, 16, 60, 'at the end of each month, you will see where you have overspent and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 337, 17, 60, 'where you can cut down. My suggestion would be that you save at least');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 337, 18, 60, '25% (or more) of your net income each year, after deducting tax, rent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 337, 19, 60, 'and car-payments. Thus you will have something to fall back on for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 337, 20, 60, 'emergencies - and also something to start your married life with, later');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 337, 21, 60, 'on.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 337, 22, 60, 'A little discipline now will pay rich dividends later on. You will not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 337, 23, 60, 'regret it in the long run. It will give you financial independence and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 337, 24, 60, 'thus greater freedom. This is God''s will. " Gather up the fragments that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 337, 25, 60, 'nothing be lost", Jesus said, after feeding the 5000 (John 6:12). In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 337, 26, 60, 'other words, "Avoid all wastage". You have to learn to manage your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 337, 27, 60, 'finances before you get married. So make this a priority. Jesus spoke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 337, 28, 60, 'many parables about those who were faithful in managing money and about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 338, 1, 60, 'those who were unfaithful. This applies both spiritually and materially.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 338, 2, 60, 'It is good to make it a habit to make all paymentswell before they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 338, 3, 60, 'due, and also never to get into any type of debt - not even credit-card');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 338, 4, 60, 'debt, where you have to pay a huge interest on payments that lag behind.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 338, 5, 60, 'It is best to use only debit cards. Use the credit-card only in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 338, 6, 60, 'emergencies. If you are not careful in this habit, it will get worse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 338, 7, 60, 'when you get married when you will have more expenses, and you will end');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 338, 8, 60, 'up with serious problems one day. Please develop this as a way of life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 338, 9, 60, 'now itself. When you are using your credit card, you have to be careful,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 338, 10, 60, 'because you are spending what you do not see. Never get into credit-card');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 338, 11, 60, 'debt. Pay your bills every month. Do that as religiously as you pay your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 338, 12, 60, 'car-insurance.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 338, 13, 60, 'Put some amount of what you save each month into a fixed deposit,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 338, 14, 60, 'because " money that you don''t see in your account, you will not spend".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 338, 15, 60, 'Jesus did not spend everything that He received, immediately. Otherwise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 338, 16, 60, 'there would have been no need for a treasurer and a money-bag. The money');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 338, 17, 60, 'that Judas kept was a "savings account".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 338, 18, 60, 'Speculating in the stock market is very risky, and so I would not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 338, 19, 60, 'recommend that. But long term investment in reputed companies is good.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 338, 20, 60, 'That is what I did many years ago - and I have supported our family all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 338, 21, 60, 'these years from that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 338, 22, 60, 'You must ensure that you pay all taxes that are due to the government,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 338, 23, 60, 'on time. But at the same time, find out all the provisions that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 338, 24, 60, 'arelegally available toavoid paying tax ( not evade taxes but legally');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 338, 25, 60, 'avoid taxes). That will reduce your tax burden, so that you can maximise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 338, 26, 60, 'your savings. That is wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 338, 27, 60, 'To balance out what I have said, let me add this: Remember that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 338, 28, 60, 'prosperity is not a proof of God''s blessing or even an indication that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 339, 1, 60, 'you are in the centre of God''s will. Jesus had no place to lay His head');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 339, 2, 60, 'and Paul speaks of not having enough to eat at times and even not having');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 339, 3, 60, 'enough warm clothes to keep himself warm (2 Cor.11:27). Yet no-one was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 339, 4, 60, 'more in God''s perfect will than them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 339, 5, 60, 'It is often material loss that brings people closer to the Lord - just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 339, 6, 60, 'like cancer, snake-bites and other apparently evil things have drawn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 339, 7, 60, 'people to the Lord. So we must never measure our spiritual growth by how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 339, 8, 60, 'well we are doing financially.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 339, 9, 60, 'Francis Bacon once said that " Prosperity was the blessing of the Old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 339, 10, 60, 'Testament, while adversity is the blessing of the New ."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 339, 11, 60, 'Busy-ness - Satan''s Evil Scheme');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 339, 12, 60, 'Here is something that I read recently on how people can become busy,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 339, 13, 60, 'busy, busy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 339, 14, 60, '"Satan called a world-wide convention. In his opening address to his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 339, 15, 60, 'demons he said: ''We can''t keep Christians from going to church. We can''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 339, 16, 60, 'keep them from reading their Bibles. But we can do something else. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 339, 17, 60, 'can keep them from having an intimate relationship with Christ. If they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 339, 18, 60, 'gain that connection with Jesus, our power over them will be broken. So');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 339, 19, 60, 'let them go to church, let them have their fundamental doctrines, let');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 339, 20, 60, 'them have their conservative lifestyles, but steal their time, so they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 339, 21, 60, 'can''t develop that intimate experience in Jesus Christ. This is what I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 339, 22, 60, 'want you demons to do. Distract them from getting hold of their Saviour.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 339, 23, 60, 'His demons asked: ''How shall we do this?''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 339, 24, 60, 'Satan said, ''Keep them busy in the nonessentials of life. Invent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 339, 25, 60, 'numerous schemes to occupy their minds. Tempt them to spend and spend');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 339, 26, 60, 'and borrow and borrow. Convince the wives to go to work and the husbands');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 339, 27, 60, 'to work 6 or 7 days a week, 10-12 hours a day, so they can keep up their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 339, 28, 60, 'high-living lifestyles. Keep them from spending time with their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 340, 1, 60, 'children. As their families fragment, very soon their homes will offer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 340, 2, 60, 'no escape from the pressures of work.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 340, 3, 60, 'Over stimulate their minds so that they cannot hear Jesus talk to them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 340, 4, 60, 'Entice them to play the radio or cassette player with music whenever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 340, 5, 60, 'they drive, and to keep the TV or their video-tapes or their CDs playing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 340, 6, 60, 'constantly, in their homes. And see to it that every store and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 340, 7, 60, 'restaurant in the world plays music constantly .');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 340, 8, 60, 'Fill their coffee tables with magazines and newspapers. Pound their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 340, 9, 60, 'minds with the news, 24 hours a day. Invade their driving moments with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 340, 10, 60, 'bill boards. Flood their mailboxes with junk mail: sweepstakes, mail');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 340, 11, 60, 'order catalogues, and every kind of newsletter and promotion offering ''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 340, 12, 60, 'free'' products, services, and false hopes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 340, 13, 60, 'Even in their recreation let them be excessive. Have them return from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 340, 14, 60, 'their family vacation exhausted and unprepared for the coming week.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 340, 15, 60, 'Don''t let them go out for a walk in nature. Send them to amusement');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 340, 16, 60, 'parks, sporting events, concerts and movies instead. And when they meet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 340, 17, 60, 'for spiritual fellowship, involve them in gossip and small talk so that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 340, 18, 60, 'they leave with troubled consciences and unsettled emotions.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 340, 19, 60, 'Allow them to witness for Christ. But crowd their lives with so many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 340, 20, 60, 'good causes that they have no time to seek for power from Christ. Soon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 340, 21, 60, 'they will be working in their own strength, sacrificing their health and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 340, 22, 60, 'family unity - all for the good of their cause.''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 340, 23, 60, 'And the demons went eagerly to their assignments, causing Christians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 340, 24, 60, 'everywhere to become busy, busy, busy and to rush here and there.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 340, 25, 60, 'Has the devil been successful at his scheme? You be the judge."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 340, 26, 61, 'Chapter 60 Chapter 60');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 340, 27, 61, 'Phariseeism');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 340, 28, 61, 'Two types of believers are mentioned in 2 Corinthians 3:6: (1) Those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 341, 1, 61, 'are led by the Spirit. (2) Those who are slaves of the letter.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 341, 2, 61, 'Those led by the Spirit are those who have gone through many trials and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 341, 3, 61, 'testings and thus come to know God personally, and to know His mind and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 341, 4, 61, 'His ways. Thus they have discernment in spiritual matters.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 341, 5, 61, 'Those who are slaves of the letter however are those who have only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 341, 6, 61, 'studied the Bible and understood the doctrine. They may be living');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 341, 7, 61, 'upright lives, but because they live by the letter of the Word, and not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 341, 8, 61, 'the spirit, they tend to be Pharisaical in their attitude to others. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 341, 9, 61, 'is such people who constitute the strength of all cults . They don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 341, 10, 61, 'know God personally, but only the doctrine of their particular group.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 341, 11, 61, 'They study how their group''s leaders behaved in different situations and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 341, 12, 61, 'try to imitate them when they themselves are in such situations. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 341, 13, 61, 'accumulate a lot of data on the conduct of their leaders in order to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 341, 14, 61, 'imitate them and to become (as they imagine) "spiritual"!! But they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 341, 15, 61, 'never become spiritual. They just become greater Pharisees.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 341, 16, 61, 'There are groups in Christendom that are not cults but are cultistic in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 341, 17, 61, 'nature. I have often warned you and others about such groups. And I will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 341, 18, 61, 'keep on doing so until our Lord returns - because there are going to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 341, 19, 61, 'many more such groups in the last days.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 341, 20, 61, 'The Opposition of Pharisees');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 341, 21, 61, 'God will allow you to face rebuke and hatred and " the contradiction of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 341, 22, 61, 'sinners" (Heb.12:3) - just as our church also has faced for many years.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 341, 23, 61, 'Jesus and Paul and all godly men in Christian history have faced this.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 341, 24, 61, 'So you are in good company. When you encounter it, you must be meek as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 341, 25, 61, 'Jesus was. Thus you will one day reach the goal of " Perfection" (total');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 341, 26, 61, 'likeness to Christ).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 341, 27, 61, 'Where believers don''t live in a constant judgment of themselves, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 341, 28, 61, 'result will always be a steep decline into Phariseeism of the worst');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 342, 1, 61, 'order. When you see such a decline in some believers who you know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 342, 2, 61, 'started out well, then you should be thankful that the Lord''s mercy has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 342, 3, 61, 'saved you from such self-righteousness and such "delusions of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 342, 4, 61, 'spirituality". You should take that as a solemn warning for yourself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 342, 5, 61, 'Many of these Pharisees are "busybodies in other people''s matters" (1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 342, 6, 61, 'Pet.4:15-KJV) and " self-appointed censors and reprovers of others"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 342, 7, 61, '(James 3:1-Amplified). Thus God exposes them as a warning to everyone,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 342, 8, 61, 'not to follow in their steps.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 342, 9, 61, 'Victory with Humility');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 342, 10, 61, 'How tragic it would be to live a whole life without light on Phariseeism');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 342, 11, 61, '- the worst of all sins! To get victory over lustful thoughts and anger');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 342, 12, 61, 'and then to fall into self-righteousness and pride is like being pulled');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 342, 13, 61, 'out of a 20-foot deep pit and then falling into a 2000-foot deep pit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 342, 14, 61, 'Many are lying in those 2000-foot deep pits and preaching about victory');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 342, 15, 61, 'over sin to others who are lying in 20-foot deep pits!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 342, 16, 61, 'The most difficult part of the life of victory is to be humble about it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 342, 17, 61, 'and to acknowledge that it is the Lord alone Who keeps us from falling');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 342, 18, 61, 'into sin. If you recognize this fact at all times, you will remain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 342, 19, 61, 'humble always.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 342, 20, 61, 'When I went sailing in sailing-boats in my Naval days, I used to lower');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 342, 21, 61, 'the keel of my boat, when the winds were strong. (The keel is a heavy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 342, 22, 61, 'metal plate that is lowered below the boat to lower its centre of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 342, 23, 61, 'gravity, to prevent the boat from toppling over in heavy winds.) A deep');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 342, 24, 61, 'humility in our hearts (unseen by men) should be the keel that we should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 342, 25, 61, 'all have at all times. Sailing boats that don''t lower the keel topple');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 342, 26, 61, 'over easily if a sudden gust of wind (the slightest admiration or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 342, 27, 61, 'approval of men) hits them. But when we have this keel, we are safe even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 342, 28, 61, 'if strong storms hit us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 343, 1, 61, 'If we live constantly looking at Jesus and as a result judging ourselves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 343, 2, 61, 'constantly, we will not despise even the worst of sinners or backsliders');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 343, 3, 61, '- for we will be convinced (as the apostle Paul was) that we ourselves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 343, 4, 61, 'are " the foremost of sinners" (1 Tim.1:15). If God can convert a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 343, 5, 61, 'self-righteous Saul into the humble Paul, He can do the same with all of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 343, 6, 61, 'us who submit to Him (like Paul did) to be broken and humbled under His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 343, 7, 61, 'mighty hand.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 343, 8, 61, 'Then we will have "the holiness which is no illusion" (Eph.4:24 - JB');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 343, 9, 61, 'Philips paraphrase).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 343, 10, 61, 'Soul-Power and Cultists');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 343, 11, 61, 'Cultist Christians may try to browbeat you into submission to them, with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 343, 12, 61, 'their soul-power. So you have to beware of them. One way by which they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 343, 13, 61, 'seek to have power over people is by making them confess their sins to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 343, 14, 61, 'them! They do not consider it sufficient that a prodigal son has settled');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 343, 15, 61, 'matters with his heavenly Father. They cannot bear to see a prodigal son');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 343, 16, 61, 'singing and leaping for joy, without joining their group. Their attitude');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 343, 17, 61, 'is exactly like that of the ''elder brother'' in Luke 15. They require');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 343, 18, 61, 'that the prodigal must confess his sins to the elder brother also, to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 343, 19, 61, 'satisfy the elder brother''s ego! Otherwise the prodigal must be kept on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 343, 20, 61, 'probation in the servant''s quarters until he agrees to confess! This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 343, 21, 61, 'the technique of every cult in the world. They get people to confess the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 343, 22, 61, 'failures of their unconverted life to them, so that the cult leaders can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 343, 23, 61, 'have a permanent hold on them, through the fear of blackmail. It is sad');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 343, 24, 61, 'to see cultists using the methods used by the secret police in Communist');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 343, 25, 61, 'countries! This is 100% demonic. Such ''elder-brothers'' do not have the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 343, 26, 61, 'heart of the father (in Luke 15). Thank God that it is to our heavenly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 343, 27, 61, 'Father''s house that we have to return, and not to some "elder brother''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 343, 28, 61, 'house"!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 344, 1, 61, 'These cultists may also try to frighten you into submission to them by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 344, 2, 61, 'saying that " it always goes badly with those who oppose them or leave');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 344, 3, 61, 'their group ". That is an age-old threat of all cult-groups.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 344, 4, 61, 'Cultists will make those who disagree with them feel guilty and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 344, 5, 61, 'condemned, and make weak-minded believers helplessly dependent on them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 344, 6, 61, 'They will tell everybody how wonderfully God is moving in their midst -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 344, 7, 61, 'so as to convince people that God is with them, and thus to draw');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 344, 8, 61, 'unsteady believers into their fold. These are all evidences of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 344, 9, 61, 'insecurity of such cultists. Make sure that you steer clear of all such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 344, 10, 61, 'cult-groups.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 344, 11, 61, 'When the Lord is your Shepherd, goodness and mercy will follow you all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 344, 12, 61, 'the days of your life and you will dwell in the house of the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 344, 13, 61, 'forever (and not in the house of any Pharisaical cult) (Psa.23:6). So');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 344, 14, 61, 'thank God for His tremendous goodness and mercy to you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 344, 15, 61, 'Cultists are Bullies');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 344, 16, 61, 'Cultists are invariably bullies. There is a passage in Isaiah 14:3-6');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 344, 17, 61, '(Living) that is appropriate for them: " In that wonderful day when the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 344, 18, 61, 'Lord gives His people rest from sorrow and fear, from the slavery and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 344, 19, 61, 'chains (of cultists), you will jeer at the king of Babylon (Satan and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 344, 20, 61, 'his cultist-agents) and say, `You bully, you persecuted God''s people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 344, 21, 61, 'with unceasing blows of rage and held them in your angry grip. You were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 344, 22, 61, 'unrestrained in tyranny. At last the Lord has crushed your wicked power''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 344, 23, 61, '".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 344, 24, 61, 'God has His agents (the true spiritual fathers, who have partaken of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 344, 25, 61, 'Jesus'' humility and gentleness Matt.11:29); and Satan has his agents');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 344, 26, 61, '(the Pharisees, who constantly seek to bully young believers).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 344, 27, 61, 'We have to be careful of spirits that fake the work of the Holy Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 344, 28, 61, 'Don''t be fooled by all the external goodness of cultists. There is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 345, 1, 61, 'Phariseeism at their core. And as with all cults, once you are caught in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 345, 2, 61, 'their spider-web, it will require a strong mind to break free.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 345, 3, 61, 'One thing to note about most cults is that they all have some good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 345, 4, 61, 'people and good families among them - with some of them living a better');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 345, 5, 61, 'life than that found even among evangelical believers. There are sincere');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 345, 6, 61, 'people - who are misled - in every cult. But one thing common to all who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 345, 7, 61, 'are misled is that they place the word of man above the word of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 345, 8, 61, 'They do not quote Scripture exactly; and they do not compare Scripture');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 345, 9, 61, 'with Scripture to arrive at a correct understanding of the truth. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 345, 10, 61, 'is why they go astray. Undiscerning believers are often deceived by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 345, 11, 61, 'presence of good people in these cults. One of the best ways to test a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 345, 12, 61, 'group is to check whether the main leaders and preachers of the group');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 345, 13, 61, 'are self-righteous, or legalistic, or proud. Thus it becomes fairly easy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 345, 14, 61, 'to identify a cult. If you look only at the good people among them, you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 345, 15, 61, 'may even foolishly join a cult!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 345, 16, 61, 'Cultism''s Imbalanced Teaching');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 345, 17, 61, 'Most cults quote Luke 14:26 to those who come to them, saying that Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 345, 18, 61, 'said: "If anyone comes to Me, and does not hate his own father and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 345, 19, 61, 'mother and wife and children and brothers and sisters, yes, and even his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 345, 20, 61, 'own life, he cannot be My disciple".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 345, 21, 61, 'But they will not quote the full verse. They will only quote the part');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 345, 22, 61, 'about "hating father and mother" - in order to turn people away from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 345, 23, 61, 'their parents. If any of them use that technique on you, tell them that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 345, 24, 61, 'Jesus said in the same verse, that they should also hate their wife and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 345, 25, 61, 'children and the brothers and sisters in their group as well. None of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 345, 26, 61, 'them will ever do that. Thus you will expose their hypocrisy. True');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 345, 27, 61, 'discipleship is to put Christ first - above parents, wife, children and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 345, 28, 61, 'fellow-believers in one''s group as well.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 346, 1, 61, 'This is just one example of how cults will quote only a part of a verse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 346, 2, 61, 'and mislead people to promote their own ends. Beware of such people and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 346, 3, 61, 'don''t be deceived by them. Although you are young, you have received the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 346, 4, 61, 'balanced teaching of God''s Word in the church at Bangalore through many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 346, 5, 61, 'years. Keep that always in mind.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 346, 6, 61, 'Cultists Follow Men More Than Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 346, 7, 61, 'Cultists have a great devotion to their leader and follow Him blindly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 346, 8, 61, 'His teaching is more important to them than the Scriptures.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 346, 9, 61, 'Our loyalty must never be to a group or to any man - but only to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 346, 10, 61, 'Lord Himself and to the whole Body of Christ. Our fellowship with God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 346, 11, 61, 'children must always be through Christ the Head and not through an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 346, 12, 61, 'attachment to a doctrine or a person.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 346, 13, 61, 'Ezekiel 21:27 (Living Bible) states that "God will keep on overturning');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 346, 14, 61, 'everything, until He comes Whose right it is to reign" . This is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 346, 15, 61, 'overturning that God will do in a believer who does not accept the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 346, 16, 61, 'Lordship of Christ, but puts some human leader on an equal pedestal with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 346, 17, 61, 'the Son of God, or puts some created thing like money or a profession');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 346, 18, 61, 'ahead of the Creator - for all this is equivalent to idolatry of created');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 346, 19, 61, 'beings and things.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 346, 20, 61, 'Coming into close contact with a cult can be like touching a live');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 346, 21, 61, 'electric wire. One can be stuck to it for one''s whole life, unless one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 346, 22, 61, 'is bold enough to stand against it and break free.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 346, 23, 61, 'Cultists are Arrogant and Exclusive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 346, 24, 61, 'Peter said in the house of Cornelius, " Now I know for certain that God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 346, 25, 61, 'does not show any partiality, but in every nation (and denomination),');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 346, 26, 61, 'the one who fears God and does what is right is welcome to Him " (Acts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 346, 27, 61, '10:34, 35). If we see the truth in that statement, we will be saved from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 346, 28, 61, 'all conceit and Phariseeism.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 347, 1, 61, 'In Jesus'' time, the Jews thought that they alone were the ones whom God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 347, 2, 61, 'had chosen. Since then, in the last 2000 years, there have been many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 347, 3, 61, 'exclusive groups in Christendom who have also had the same conceited');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 347, 4, 61, 'opinion about themselves. Such Pharisees have ruined themselves and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 347, 5, 61, 'their followers by their cultism and their exclusivism.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 347, 6, 61, 'Beware of such cultists. Stay far away from them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 347, 7, 61, 'Read my article on ''The Marks Of Cultism'' (in my book New Wine In New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 347, 8, 61, 'Wineskins).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 347, 9, 62, 'Chapter 61 Chapter 61');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 347, 10, 62, 'Foundational Principles in Choosing a Life partner');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 347, 11, 62, 'When looking for a wife, you must ask these four fundamental questions');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 347, 12, 62, 'first of all:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 347, 13, 62, '(1) Is the girl born-again? (1 Jn.3:10)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 347, 14, 62, '(2) Does she fear God? (Prov.31:30)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 347, 15, 62, '(3) Does she have that gentle (meek) and quiet spirit that God values');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 347, 16, 62, 'most highly? (1 Pet.3:4).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 347, 17, 62, '(4) Does she have the same spiritual values that you have? (2 Cor.6:14)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 347, 18, 62, 'Anyone who neglects these factors can find himself in serious problems');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 347, 19, 62, 'in his marriage. He may find his wife dragging him in the way she wants');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 347, 20, 62, 'to go, so that he cannot go the way the Lord wants him to go. Like Esau,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 347, 21, 62, 'such a believer would then have sold his spiritual birthright for a bowl');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 347, 22, 62, 'of porridge.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 347, 23, 62, 'God tests Christian young men today by allowing them to meet girls who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 347, 24, 62, 'are pretty and clever but who are not born again - or who claim to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 347, 25, 62, 'born again, but are worldly. And God observes what each young man''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 347, 26, 62, 'reaction is going to be? A believer''s entire future can be ruined if he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 347, 27, 62, 'is foolish or hasty in his decision at such a time. Many may imagine');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 347, 28, 62, 'that they can convert or change their wives after marriage. But things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 348, 1, 62, 'don''t work out that way. Even if some type of `conversion'' does take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 348, 2, 62, 'place in the wife, in most cases, it turns out to be superficial.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 348, 3, 62, 'What is even more dangerous is the professed `conversion'' that a girl');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 348, 4, 62, 'may make, when she sees that that is the only way she can get to marry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 348, 5, 62, 'you. Beware of that most of all. There must be clear evidence that a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 348, 6, 62, 'girl has put Jesus first in her life - and not just gone through "a form');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 348, 7, 62, 'of conversion" for the sake of getting married to you. If you don''t take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 348, 8, 62, 'this issue seriously, you are denying God''s ownership of your life. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 348, 9, 62, 'have come across cases where girls who professed to be converted in this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 348, 10, 62, 'superficial way, manifest their un-converted nature within a very short');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 348, 11, 62, 'time after they are married.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 348, 12, 62, 'That is why Scripture is totally uncompromising on this point, saying, "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 348, 13, 62, 'Do not be bound together with unbelievers; for what partnership have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 348, 14, 62, 'righteousness and lawlessness, or what fellowship has light with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 348, 15, 62, 'darkness? " (2 Cor.6:14).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 348, 16, 62, 'Some young brothers feel that with a certain amount of right Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 348, 17, 62, 'teaching, any girl will get converted or become wholehearted. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 348, 18, 62, 'totally wrong. They don''t realize that choosing to follow Jesus is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 348, 19, 62, 'decision involving the most radical change in one''s life and outlook. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 348, 20, 62, 'is not a question of slightly altering one''s perspective or viewpoint.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 348, 21, 62, 'It is total allegiance to a new Master. Few are willing to choose this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 348, 22, 62, 'way of life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 348, 23, 62, 'Why am I mentioning all this to you now, when marriage is still a long');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 348, 24, 62, 'way off for you? Only so that you can develop mature attitudes and be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 348, 25, 62, 'prepared to take the right decision, long before you come to the time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 348, 26, 62, 'when you have to make that choice. It is good to be established on sound');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 348, 27, 62, 'Christian principles, well in advance.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 348, 28, 62, 'Trusting the Lord for a Life-partner');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 349, 1, 62, 'God has a plan for your life, and especially in this, the most important');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 349, 2, 62, 'decision of your life after new birth - marriage. And He alone can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 349, 3, 62, 'direct you in this matter, because of two factors : (1) You cannot see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 349, 4, 62, 'the true condition of any girl''s heart, no matter how much you know her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 349, 5, 62, 'externally; (2) You cannot see what the future is going to be like.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 349, 6, 62, 'Therefore your only hope is to lean heavily upon God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 349, 7, 62, 'You need a submissive woman to be your wife - one with a meek and quiet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 349, 8, 62, 'spirit. So beware of the proud, domineering, bossy type of girl. A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 349, 9, 62, 'pretty girl is not worth it, if the price you have to pay for her good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 349, 10, 62, 'looks is unending strife at home. Marital happiness is far more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 349, 11, 62, 'important than good looks. At the same time, I do believe that you must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 349, 12, 62, 'feel physically attracted towards the girl, and that she must look up to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 349, 13, 62, 'you and admire you .');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 349, 14, 62, 'We desire the best for you, and you know we won''t put any pressure on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 349, 15, 62, 'you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 349, 16, 62, 'Here are three essentials that should be found in any girl that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 349, 17, 62, 'consider:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 349, 18, 62, '(1) She must have a fervent devotion to the Lord. This needs no further');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 349, 19, 62, 'comment.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 349, 20, 62, '(2) She must be willing to accept her husband as the head of the home.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 349, 21, 62, 'She must be able to look up to you and be willing to submit to you as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 349, 22, 62, 'her head, throughout your life. She must gladly accept you, from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 349, 23, 62, 'outset, as the leader in the home. A girl like that is difficult to find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 349, 24, 62, 'in these days, especially among those who are highly educated. But God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 349, 25, 62, 'has His chosen girl somewhere for you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 349, 26, 62, '(3) She must be willing to go the way of self-denial. Self-denial and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 349, 27, 62, 'dying to self every day is a major secret of a happy married life. As');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 349, 28, 62, 'you observe a girl''s actions, you will be able to see whether she is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 350, 1, 62, 'self-denying type or not. It is by observing the little things that a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 350, 2, 62, 'girl does or does not do, that you can know whether she is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 350, 3, 62, 'self-indulgent or self-denying.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 350, 4, 62, 'We pray constantly for you all concerning your marriage. So we know the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 350, 5, 62, 'Lord will preserve you from making a wrong choice. We believe the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 350, 6, 62, 'will guide you all aright in this vital matter, whenever the time comes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 350, 7, 62, 'for each of you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 350, 8, 62, 'A sense of your own helplessness to find the right person will cast you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 350, 9, 62, 'upon the Lord - and this is vital for faith. " Those who hopefully wait');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 350, 10, 62, 'upon the Lord will never be put to shame" (Isa.49:23) - because " eye');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 350, 11, 62, 'has not seen nor ear heard neither has it entered man''s mind the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 350, 12, 62, 'wonderful things (a wife) that God has prepared for those who wait for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 350, 13, 62, 'him " (Isa.64:4) - that is, for those who trust Him to guide them,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 350, 14, 62, 'because they recognize their utter helplessness. So don''t get impatient');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 350, 15, 62, 'or discouraged if you see younger men around you marrying in haste. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 350, 16, 62, 'will give you the very best if you honour Him and wait for His time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 350, 17, 62, 'Here are two important bits of advice therefore:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 350, 18, 62, '(1) Don''t lean on your own wisdom: " Trust in the Lord with all your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 350, 19, 62, 'heart and don''t lean on your own understanding " (Prov.3:5). God will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 350, 20, 62, 'guide those who humbly acknowledge their weakness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 350, 21, 62, '(2) Don''t be hasty. " Do you see a man hasty in his matters? There is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 350, 22, 62, 'more hope for a fool than for him " (Prov.29:20-KJV). Don''t decide on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 350, 23, 62, 'the spur of the moment. I know you will be wise in this matter.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 350, 24, 62, 'Surrender all your own preferences on the altar, and give up your own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 350, 25, 62, 'will to God. Say that you are willing to accept whoever He decides is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 350, 26, 62, 'best for you. Then He will guide you aright.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 350, 27, 62, 'A Godly Life-partner');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 350, 28, 62, 'The girl you consider must not be the noisy, boisterous type, but one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 351, 1, 62, 'who has a meek and quiet spirit. She should not be one who is attracted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 351, 2, 62, 'to you because of your job, or your education, or your potential to earn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 351, 3, 62, 'money. A marriage founded on money will be a disaster. She must be one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 351, 4, 62, 'who chooses you because you love the Lord like she does. And you must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 351, 5, 62, 'choose her because she loves the Lord like you do. Her level of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 351, 6, 62, 'spirituality should be approximately the same as yours - not far above');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 351, 7, 62, 'yours or far below yours. When you are both on about the same plane');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 351, 8, 62, 'spiritually , each of you will respect the other as being more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 351, 9, 62, 'spiritual.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 351, 10, 62, 'She must have a personal knowledge of the Lord, that has come through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 351, 11, 62, 'experience and not through hearsay. She must be a lover of God''s Word.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 351, 12, 62, 'Her convictions must be her own, and not just those handed down from her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 351, 13, 62, 'parents, or by her church. It is good to have a heritage of a godly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 351, 14, 62, 'home; but that does not guarantee that a girl knows the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 351, 15, 62, 'Spirituality comes as a result of making godly choices in the rough and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 351, 16, 62, 'tumble of life, and through taking a stand for the Lord, even if it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 351, 17, 62, 'makes one unpopular.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 351, 18, 62, 'She should be one who has taken water-baptism after her conversion. This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 351, 19, 62, 'will ensure that there are no conflicts on this issue, when children are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 351, 20, 62, 'born - that she will not want to get them christened. Even if she is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 351, 21, 62, 'baptized in (filled with) the Holy Spirit, she must be open to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 351, 22, 62, 'baptism (fullness) of the Spirit, and not prejudiced against it. To be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 351, 23, 62, 'against the extremes of Pentecostal-ism and charismatic-ism is all right');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 351, 24, 62, '- for God Himself is against such extremes. But she must not be against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 351, 25, 62, 'the genuine fullness of the Spirit that transformed the apostles on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 351, 26, 62, 'day of Pentecost from timid, fearful men into flaming witnesses for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 351, 27, 62, 'Christ. And she must not be a legalistic, nit-picking, religious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 351, 28, 62, 'Pharisee.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 352, 1, 62, 'Since you are educated, the girl you choose should be intellectually');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 352, 2, 62, 'compatible. Such compatibility will help towards ease in conversation,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 352, 3, 62, 'which is a major part of married life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 352, 4, 62, 'She must be physically attractive in your eyes - and you must be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 352, 5, 62, 'physically attractive in her eyes. If she has had boy-friends in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 352, 6, 62, 'past, she should have broken off from them completely, and be having no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 352, 7, 62, 'more contact with any of them. She must be the fun-loving type, and must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 352, 8, 62, 'have a sense of humour. By that I mean that she must be able to laugh -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 352, 9, 62, 'even at herself - even if she does not have the ability to make others');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 352, 10, 62, 'laugh!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 352, 11, 62, 'I would not insist that the girl''s parents should be born-again. I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 352, 12, 62, 'seen many God-fearing girls come from non-Christian homes. But whichever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 352, 13, 62, 'family the girl is from, she must have a great respect for family');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 352, 14, 62, 'values. She must be 100% opposed to divorce as an option under any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 352, 15, 62, 'circumstances - even under the worst of circumstances. She must realize');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 352, 16, 62, 'the importance of motherhood, and must value children and be willing to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 352, 17, 62, 'devote her whole life to bringing up her children. If she has a career,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 352, 18, 62, 'she must be one who places family above her career.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 352, 19, 62, 'Following Our Example');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 352, 20, 62, 'You have seen an excellent example in your own Mom, who gave up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 352, 21, 62, 'everything - her career, her comforts, her health and her personal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 352, 22, 62, 'choices - in order to bring you all up in a godly way. She has loved you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 352, 23, 62, 'under all circumstances and denied herself and devoted herself to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 352, 24, 62, 'bringing you all up as godly young men.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 352, 25, 62, 'Before I chose Mom to be my wife, I asked the Lord to give me some sign');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 352, 26, 62, 'that she was truly devoted to Him. Then I saw that she had chosen (after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 352, 27, 62, 'graduating from India''s top medical college, Christian Medical College,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 352, 28, 62, 'Vellore) to work among people afflicted with leprosy. Why would a young');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 353, 1, 62, 'girl like her, choose such a career? That was enough to convince me. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 353, 2, 62, 'have never once regretted my choice (even for a moment) since I married');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 353, 3, 62, 'her on June 19, 1968. We are not a perfect married couple. But I can say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 353, 4, 62, 'this that we love one another deeply and respect each other highly. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 353, 5, 62, 'in all my travels, I have never seen anyone else who would have been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 353, 6, 62, 'more suited for me; and I know I never will. My prayer for you is that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 353, 7, 62, 'you too will have a similar testimony concerning your wife, throughout');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 353, 8, 62, 'your married life. That is why I am writing so much about this matter.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 353, 9, 62, 'Ask the Lord to show you clearly, whether a particular girl is His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 353, 10, 62, 'choice for you or not. The very fact that you cast yourself upon the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 353, 11, 62, 'Lord acknowledging your helplessness, is the way you honour Him and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 353, 12, 62, 'acknowledge that He alone can guide you aright.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 353, 13, 62, 'Remember always that you owe your very life to Him. You are not your own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 353, 14, 62, 'any more. You cannot live the rest of your life for yourself but only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 353, 15, 62, 'for the Lord and His perfect will.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 353, 16, 62, 'All the warnings and advice I give will only be before your marriage.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 353, 17, 62, 'Once you are married, my acceptance of your wife will be total,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 353, 18, 62, 'unreserved and wholehearted. You can be sure of that. But I trust you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 353, 19, 62, 'will realize that we, your parents, have some years of experience and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 353, 20, 62, 'some wisdom to warn you beforehand of the inadequacy of all human');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 353, 21, 62, 'methods in assessing a girl''s true nature. You cannot afford to go by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 353, 22, 62, 'appearances, or even by spending much time together, in determining');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 353, 23, 62, 'whether a girl is suitable to be your life-partner. Only God can show');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 353, 24, 62, 'you the right person. So pray much before you decide.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 353, 25, 62, 'The Unchangeable Principles Of God''s Word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 353, 26, 62, 'There is only one marriage in the Bible (after Adam''s) in which we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 353, 27, 62, 'told clearly how God led the man and woman together - Isaac''s. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 353, 28, 62, 'method God used there was the accepted one in the culture of that time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 354, 1, 62, 'But God is sovereign and is well able to operate within the context of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 354, 2, 62, 'any culture. The method God used in Abraham''s day in the 20th century BC');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 354, 3, 62, 'may be different from the method God uses today, in the 20th century AD,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 354, 4, 62, 'in a different culture. The important thing is the leading of God, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 354, 5, 62, 'not the method by which He leads you to a girl. So I am not concerned');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 354, 6, 62, 'about the method. But I do pray that each of you will be certain that it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 354, 7, 62, 'is God Himself Who is leading you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 354, 8, 62, 'In the beginning, only God could provide a suitable helper for Adam.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 354, 9, 62, 'Even today, only God can provide the ideal helper for you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 354, 10, 62, 'Since God was the One who made woman, He is the One Who can tell us best');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 354, 11, 62, 'about His `product''. The Manufacturer''s opinion is certainly the best!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 354, 12, 62, 'And therefore, it is good to read Proverbs 31:10-31 and meditate on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 354, 13, 62, 'type of wife whom God commends.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 354, 14, 62, 'That portion of Scripture was written by King Lemuel''s mother. We don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 354, 15, 62, 'know who Lemuel was. But he certainly had a godly mother (Most books of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 354, 16, 62, 'the Bible were written by men. But this is one of the rare portions of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 354, 17, 62, 'Scripture that came through a woman, inspired by the Holy Spirit!!).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 354, 18, 62, 'This mother gave her son a lot of sound advice about the type of girl he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 354, 19, 62, 'should marry. From this we conclude that it is God''s will that all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 354, 20, 62, 'parents should advise their sons about the type of girl they should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 354, 21, 62, 'marry!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 354, 22, 62, 'The girl should be one who has a soft tongue (v.26) and rough hands -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 354, 23, 62, 'not vice-versa (Prov.31:13,15,17,19,22)! No-one is born with a soft');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 354, 24, 62, 'tongue. It has to be acquired. And no-one is born hard-working. That too');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 354, 25, 62, 'has to be learnt. The girl should be frugal and wise in financial');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 354, 26, 62, 'matters (v.16,22,24). She should be generous and compassionate,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 354, 27, 62, 'especially towards the poor (v.20). She should be a home-lover (v.27).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 354, 28, 62, 'Above all, she should fear the Lord (v.30). Lemuel''s mother concluded');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 355, 1, 62, 'her advice saying, " Charm can be deceptive and beauty doesn''t last, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 355, 2, 62, 'a woman who fears and reverences God shall be greatly praised "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 355, 3, 62, '(Prov.31:1, 30- Living).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 355, 4, 62, 'I agree with all that Lemuel''s mother was inspired by God to tell her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 355, 5, 62, 'son. Such a wife will do you good all the days of her life (Prov.31:12).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 355, 6, 62, 'I believe that God has reserved such a girl somewhere in the world, for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 355, 7, 62, 'each of you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 355, 8, 62, 'Don''t ever consider a lazy girl or one obsessed with fashion as a wife,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 355, 9, 62, 'for such a woman will be a constant drain on your bank account, and will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 355, 10, 62, 'drive you to poverty. And don''t consider a quarrelsome, nagging type,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 355, 11, 62, 'for she will be a constant drain on your emotional resources and drive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 355, 12, 62, 'you to despair.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 355, 13, 62, 'Wisdom is to allow God''s Word to guide you while making your choice.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 355, 14, 62, 'Remember that a woman who reverences God will make a much better wife');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 355, 15, 62, 'than one who is merely pretty or charming (Prov.31:30). Please believe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 355, 16, 62, 'what God says here and don''t discover the truth of it by the painful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 355, 17, 62, 'route of experimenting and finding out for yourself. That will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 355, 18, 62, 'disastrous. The Holy Spirit says that a pretty girl who does not hunger');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 355, 19, 62, 'after God is like "a pig (her character) with a golden ring (her beauty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 355, 20, 62, ') in its nose" (Pro.11:22). Strong language - but true. So don''t ever go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 355, 21, 62, 'after some golden-ringed pig!!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 355, 22, 62, 'Please remember that a good marriage has three elements in it -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 355, 23, 62, 'Spiritual fellowship, intellectual communication and family values . So');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 355, 24, 62, 'look for a girl:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 355, 25, 62, '(a) who has a passion for the Lord and who talks about spiritual matters');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 355, 26, 62, '(not just to impress you) and not one who just "goes to church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 355, 27, 62, 'regularly". You discover what is in a girl''s heart by what she longs to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 355, 28, 62, 'speak about, because Jesus said that everyone speaks about that which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 356, 1, 62, 'fills their heart (Matt.12:34);');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 356, 2, 62, '(b) who is intellectually compatible, because communication is a major');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 356, 3, 62, 'part of family life; and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 356, 4, 62, '(c) who values family and motherhood.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 356, 5, 62, 'In God''s eyes, a girl is "spirit , soul and body" (1 Thess.5:23) - not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 356, 6, 62, 'body, soul and spirit. So in your evaluation of a girl, put spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 356, 7, 62, 'values first, soul-values (intellectual etc.,) second, and body-values');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 356, 8, 62, '(physical) third - and then you won''t make a mistake.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 356, 9, 62, 'Please read Chapter Five of my book SEX, LOVE & MARRIAGE once again.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 356, 10, 62, 'Human Considerations');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 356, 11, 62, 'There are many human factors also that must be considered when choosing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 356, 12, 62, 'a wife. After having observed many marriages over the past many decades,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 356, 13, 62, 'here is my considered opinion:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 356, 14, 62, 'Before getting married, you should definitely get a job to support a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 356, 15, 62, 'family (as it says in Prov.24:27).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 356, 16, 62, 'It is not good to wait too long, because the days are evil, and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 356, 17, 62, 'Bible says that to avoid fornication, you should get married (1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 356, 18, 62, 'Cor.7:2). `Burning'' with desire can very easily lead to sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 356, 19, 62, 'A pleasant conversationalist will save you from a boring marriage.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 356, 20, 62, 'Equality in socio-economic status must be considered, ­since that will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 356, 21, 62, 'make adjustment to each other much easier in your home-life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 356, 22, 62, 'You should never marry anyone out of sympathy or pity for her plight.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 356, 23, 62, 'Many a disastrous marriage has been entered into by sincere and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 356, 24, 62, 'idealistic (but foolish) young men, on that foundation. They are now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 356, 25, 62, 'reaping at leisure the fruits of what they sowed in haste.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 356, 26, 62, 'Spiritual Values');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 356, 27, 62, 'A happy marriage can be found only where two people make Christ Lord of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 356, 28, 62, 'their lives. That means where God''s kingdom, His righteousness and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 357, 1, 62, 'standards of His Word are foremost, and where Christ is first in every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 357, 2, 62, 'area of their lives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 357, 3, 62, 'God created you and saved you to live for Him. We have not been created');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 357, 4, 62, 'to do what pleases us. We were created to please God. When we bow down,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 357, 5, 62, 'humble our pride and acknowledge that truth, then we would have found');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 357, 6, 62, 'the true reason for living. Otherwise we are doomed to a life of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 357, 7, 62, 'emptiness. So don''t ever seek what pleases you. Seek what pleases God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 357, 8, 62, 'Those who go to the Bible merely to get a sanction for what they have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 357, 9, 62, 'already decided to do (for example, to marry someone they want), will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 357, 10, 62, 'easily "find verses" to suit their desire - because man''s heart is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 357, 11, 62, 'deceitful. But God uses the Scriptures to guide only those who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 357, 12, 62, 'intent on pleasing Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 357, 13, 62, 'Many marriages that appear to be happy in public, have a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 357, 14, 62, 'unhappiness in private. God blesses many Christian marriages (because He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 357, 15, 62, 'is a good God), but He does not approve of many of them. God''s approval');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 357, 16, 62, 'is what you should seek for in your marriage, and not merely God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 357, 17, 62, 'blessing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 357, 18, 62, 'Never take a major decision like marriage, when you are disappointed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 357, 19, 62, 'with something or when you are discouraged. Always pull back from any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 357, 20, 62, 'friendship that can tempt you unnecessarily. The one who thinks he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 357, 21, 62, 'stands will be the first to fall. Remain humbly dependent on God at all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 357, 22, 62, 'times. There can be no lasting happiness if we violate His instructions.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 357, 23, 62, 'As I have said repeatedly, if you place beauty and conversational');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 357, 24, 62, 'ability above spiritual values, you will miss God''s best that He has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 357, 25, 62, 'reserved for you. Don''t even give any weight to Bible-knowledge -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 357, 26, 62, 'because a woman who is a preacher or a Bible-scholar may neglect her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 357, 27, 62, 'home and her children.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 357, 28, 62, 'I would urge you to give more consideration to the girl''s family values.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 358, 1, 62, 'I am referring to down-to-earth practical matters such as the way a home');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 358, 2, 62, 'is kept, the importance given to motherhood and the bringing up of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 358, 3, 62, 'children. A girl need not have had believing parents in order to acquire');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 358, 4, 62, 'these values. Even a girl coming from a divorced home can acquire godly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 358, 5, 62, 'home-values. So the faith of her parents is not the criterion, but her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 358, 6, 62, 'own faith. I have seen girls who have come from broken homes, who by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 358, 7, 62, 'grace of God, have acquired godly values and become excellent wives and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 358, 8, 62, 'mothers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 358, 9, 62, 'Practical Considerations');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 358, 10, 62, 'I would urge on you the utmost caution in mingling with girls. Remember');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 358, 11, 62, 'that discretion is the mother of virtue. Be wise. Always keep a distance');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 358, 12, 62, 'from girls who want to cling to you or who appear eager to grab you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 358, 13, 62, 'quickly to be their husbands. And never become too friendly with any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 358, 14, 62, 'girl who is not a wholehearted disciple of Jesus. Keep yourself pure.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 358, 15, 62, 'There are many good brothers who are trapped into marriage by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 358, 16, 62, '"sob-sob" stories that young girls tell them. They are drawn to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 358, 17, 62, 'girls through sympathy and then enticed into "petting" first and then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 358, 18, 62, 'fornication and finally trapped into marriage. So be extremely careful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 358, 19, 62, 'of any girl who tells you sad stories that make you feel sorry for her.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 358, 20, 62, 'Don''t ever allow yourself to be drawn into any type of physical contact');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 358, 21, 62, 'with any girl. As the Holy Spirit has said, "It is good for a man not to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 358, 22, 62, 'touch a woman" (1 Cor.7:1). That is because one step will lead to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 358, 23, 62, 'another......and that can end in calamity. We pray for you all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 358, 24, 62, 'constantly and believe that the Lord will protect you from such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 358, 25, 62, 'calamities. The Lord constantly asks each of us if we love Him more than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 358, 26, 62, 'everything and everyone else. If you can­­ say "Yes" to that question at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 358, 27, 62, 'all times, that will be your protection and your salvation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 358, 28, 62, 'When meeting with any girl, it should always be without any expectati­on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 359, 1, 62, 'of marriage on either side. But remember that women are different from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 359, 2, 62, 'men. Men tend to be independent and don''t look for security in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 359, 3, 62, 'relationship, whereas women tend to be dependent and look for security -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 359, 4, 62, 'especially when they come to marriageable age. So when meeting with any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 359, 5, 62, 'girl, be careful that you don''t give her any idea that marriage is even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 359, 6, 62, 'being considered, until you feel that the girl may possibly be the one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 359, 7, 62, 'whom God has chosen for you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 359, 8, 62, 'As your parents, we are concerned for you - naturally. But we only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 359, 9, 62, 'desire what God wants you to have. God feeds the birds, but He doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 359, 10, 62, 'drop food into their nests. As they fly around, God helps them to find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 359, 11, 62, 'the food they need. And so, as you move about, the Lord will help you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 359, 12, 62, 'also to find the right girl - at the right time. And when you meet the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 359, 13, 62, 'girl the Lord has chosen for you, He will give you a spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 359, 14, 62, 'attraction for her.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 359, 15, 62, 'So pray seriously about your future life-partner. When you pray, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 359, 16, 62, 'shows that you are depending on God to guide you. You can miss a lot in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 359, 17, 62, 'life if you don''t learn the habit of helpless dependence on God for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 359, 18, 62, 'everything. The important thing is not how long you pray, but having an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 359, 19, 62, 'attitude of faith - a helpless dependence on God and a total confidence');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 359, 20, 62, 'in God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 359, 21, 62, 'Regarding the right age for marriage: There is no rule in God''s Word on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 359, 22, 62, 'this. Our life is in God''s hands. But here is a simple guideline that I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 359, 23, 62, 'would give: By the time you retire from your job, all your children');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 359, 24, 62, 'should have finished their 4-years of college and become capable of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 359, 25, 62, 'earning their own living. That will reduce your financial burden. So');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 359, 26, 62, 'don''t wait too long to get married and have children. This may sound');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 359, 27, 62, 'like looking at things from a human perspective. But it is not. We must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 359, 28, 62, 'never be anxious about the future, because our trust is in our heavenly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 360, 1, 62, 'Father Who provides all our needs. But God has also commanded us to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 360, 2, 62, 'wise like the ant when thinking about the future (Prov.6:6-8). And He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 360, 3, 62, 'has also commanded parents to provide for their children''s present');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 360, 4, 62, 'earthly needs (food, clothing, housing, health and education) (1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 360, 5, 62, 'Tim.5:8), and also to save money for their future earthly needs (2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 360, 6, 62, 'Cor.12:14).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 360, 7, 62, 'Finally and most importantly : Train yourself in these single years to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 360, 8, 62, 'be free from selfishness - so that one day, you can be an unselfish');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 360, 9, 62, 'husband who will love your wife as Christ loved the Church, laying down');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 360, 10, 62, 'your life for her everyday as Christ did for you, and loving her as you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 360, 11, 62, 'would our own body. Read and meditate on Ephesians 5:25 to 33 as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 360, 12, 62, 'preparation for marriage. May the Lord help you in this matter.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 360, 13, 62, 'God Will Answer Prayer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 360, 14, 62, 'So pray about your marriage - and God will guide you to the right person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 360, 15, 62, 'at the right time. Somewhere in this world, He is already shaping the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 360, 16, 62, 'person who will be the perfect life partner for you. You will never be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 360, 17, 62, 'able to find a better one than the one He has chosen and shaped');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 360, 18, 62, 'specifically for you. Believe that - and trust Him to bring her to you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 360, 19, 62, 'We are praying for you. You know very well that we will never thrust a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 360, 20, 62, 'girl whom we choose, on you. But remember that we (your parents) have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 360, 21, 62, 'acquired some wisdom in the many years that we have lived on this earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 360, 22, 62, 'So, if you consult us when deciding, you can be saved from making a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 360, 23, 62, 'mistake. I have seen so-called "Christian" marriages that can at best be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 360, 24, 62, 'described only as "a calamity"! But because we are praying for you in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 360, 25, 62, 'faith, we are sure that God will never let that happen to you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 360, 26, 62, 'We pray for you constantly that as God gave Adam a person totally suited');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 360, 27, 62, 'for him in every respect, He will do so even for you. We are sure that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 360, 28, 62, 'the Lord will preserve you from making a wrong choice in this vital');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 361, 1, 62, 'matter and lead you to the person of His choice in His time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 361, 2, 62, 'Amen. That means "It will be so"!! Praise the Lord!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 361, 3, 63, 'Chapter 62 Chapter 62');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 361, 4, 63, 'Boasting In The Lord Alone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 361, 5, 63, 'The two main regrets I have as a father are:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 361, 6, 63, '1. That I did not spend enough time with each of you individually. I was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 361, 7, 63, 'often so busy doing many things. I have asked the Lord to forgive me for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 361, 8, 63, 'that. When you become fathers, my biggest recommendation to you would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 361, 9, 63, 'be: Make time to spend with your wife and your children individually.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 361, 10, 63, '2. That on some occasions, I punished you unjustly or too severely. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 361, 11, 63, 'have asked the Lord to forgive me for that also. And I want you to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 361, 12, 63, 'forgive me too. But I am thankful that in spite of my failures, all of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 361, 13, 63, 'you have turned out to become children of God - saved not by your works');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 361, 14, 63, 'or mine, but by God''s grace alone.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 361, 15, 63, 'Our true wealth is not to be counted in money or property, but in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 361, 16, 63, 'knowledge of the Lord that comes through failures and deep trials.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 361, 17, 63, 'Jeremiah 9:23, 24 (Living) reads thus: The Lord says, " Let the wise man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 361, 18, 63, 'not bask in his wisdom, nor the mighty man in his might, nor the rich');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 361, 19, 63, 'man in his riches. Let them boast in this alone: That they truly know Me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 361, 20, 63, 'and understand that I am the Lord whose love is steadfast, and that I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 361, 21, 63, 'love to be this way ". That is the only thing that has value ultimately.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 361, 22, 63, 'Every accomplishment in the world is garbage compared with that. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 361, 23, 63, 'sooner we discover that truth, the wiser we will become.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 361, 24, 63, 'David and Joseph both started their ministry when they were 30 years of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 361, 25, 63, 'age. So you should become rock-steady in your relationship with the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 361, 26, 63, 'by the time you are 30. Before that age, we will all have ups and downs.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 361, 27, 63, 'And God tends to overlook those ups and downs as being the result of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 361, 28, 63, 'immaturity. We may even despise our parents'' advice between the ages of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 362, 1, 63, '13 and 30. That also God understands. And wise parents will understand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 362, 2, 63, 'that too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 362, 3, 63, 'I had many ups and downs too. But things have been different since 1975');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 362, 4, 63, '(I was 35½ then), when we started the meetings of the church in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 362, 5, 63, 'home. Fellowship with good brothers made a tremendous difference in my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 362, 6, 63, 'life. Such fellowship is what all of you need. I feel all of you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 362, 7, 63, 'missing this in your colleges, even if you are getting good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 362, 8, 63, 'Bible-teaching in the church there. It is the fellowship that we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 362, 9, 63, 'among the brothers in the church at Bangalore that makes our church such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 362, 10, 63, 'a good church. I pray that all of you will also find some good believers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 362, 11, 63, 'there who are serious about following the Lord and with whom you can be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 362, 12, 63, 'part of a new-covenant church one day. We all need that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 362, 13, 63, 'God Loves Us Unconditionally');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 362, 14, 63, 'Satan asked permission from God to sift Peter as wheat. And God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 362, 15, 63, 'permitted him to do so - because Peter had a more important ministry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 362, 16, 63, 'than all the others who were not thus sifted. Jesus only prayed that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 362, 17, 63, 'Peter''s faith would not fail. Peter denied the Lord thrice. But, as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 362, 18, 63, 'result, he was thoroughly broken and humbled and wept bitterly and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 362, 19, 63, 'repented. Thus God''s plan was accomplished and all the chaff of pride in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 362, 20, 63, 'him was sifted away. God used Satan to accomplish that. That is one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 362, 21, 63, 'reason why God has not destroyed Satan as yet. Praise the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 362, 22, 63, 'After the resurrection, God sent a special message through the angel at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 362, 23, 63, 'the tomb saying, " Go and tell His disciples and Peter that Jesus is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 362, 24, 63, 'risen and going in front of you " (Mark 16:7). That phrase "...and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 362, 25, 63, 'Peter...." is so typical of our Lord. Wasn''t Peter also a disciple? Why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 362, 26, 63, 'did the Lord make special mention of him? Because Peter was the one who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 362, 27, 63, 'might have felt that the phrase "His disciples" could not possibly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 362, 28, 63, 'include him any longer, because of his terrible failure. So that phrase');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 363, 1, 63, 'was meant to tell him that the Lord still considered him as His apostle.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 363, 2, 63, 'But in spite of that message, Peter was still so discouraged that he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 363, 3, 63, 'decided to go back permanently to his old profession of fishing (John');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 363, 4, 63, '21:3). So the Lord went and called Peter back to his apostleship,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 363, 5, 63, 'personally. Such is the love of the Lord. He will keep on coming after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 363, 6, 63, 'us. It was thus that Peter came back and his "faith did not fail". It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 363, 7, 63, 'was not because Peter never failed or made a mistake.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 363, 8, 63, 'So, if we are truly born again and have become disciples of Jesus, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 363, 9, 63, 'must believe that God has accepted us in Christ and loves us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 363, 10, 63, 'unconditionally - because God IS LOVE. There are two types of believers:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 363, 11, 63, '(1) Those who believe that their heavenly Father''s love is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 363, 12, 63, 'unconditional.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 363, 13, 63, '(2) Those who believe that their heavenly Father''s love is conditional.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 363, 14, 63, 'Those in Category 1 will be at rest because they believe the truth . The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 363, 15, 63, 'others will remain in perpetual unrest because they believe they must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 363, 16, 63, 'perform well in order for God to continue to love them. Every false');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 363, 17, 63, 'religion in the world teaches that God''s love is conditional - that His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 363, 18, 63, 'love is "performance-love" - a love that is based on how well we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 363, 19, 63, 'perform! Jesus came and taught the opposite. Yet most believers are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 363, 20, 63, 'still heathen in their thinking. We must expose Satan''s lie. Because the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 363, 21, 63, 'truth is that God loves His children unconditionally. We can reject that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 363, 22, 63, 'love and fall away from God and be lost. But His love for His children');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 363, 23, 63, 'is still unconditional. The story of the father''s love for the prodigal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 363, 24, 63, 'son illustrates this perfectly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 363, 25, 63, 'It is true that there are different degrees in God''s love for people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 363, 26, 63, 'God loves all the people in the world to a certain degree (John 3:16).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 363, 27, 63, 'But God loves His born-again children to a greater degree. And among His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 363, 28, 63, 'children, He loves some more than others, because they fulfil certain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 364, 1, 63, 'conditions - as Jesus said in John 14:21: " He who has My commandments');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 364, 2, 63, 'and keeps them is the one who loves Me; and he who loves Me will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 364, 3, 63, 'loved by My Father". And beyond those, God loves to the highest degree,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 364, 4, 63, 'those disciples who have forsaken everything to follow Jesus - God loves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 364, 5, 63, 'them as much as He loved Jesus Himself (See John 17:23).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 364, 6, 63, 'But yet God''s love itself is unconditional.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 364, 7, 63, 'God Alone Is Everything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 364, 8, 63, 'Our trust and confidence must always be in God alone - and never in men,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 364, 9, 63, 'lest the curse mentioned in Jeremiah 17:5, 6 wither us up: " Thus says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 364, 10, 63, 'the Lord, ''Cursed is the man who trusts in mankind and makes flesh his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 364, 11, 63, 'strength, and whose heart turns away from the Lord. For he will be like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 364, 12, 63, 'a bush in the desert and will not see when prosperity comes, but will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 364, 13, 63, 'live in stony wastes in the wilderness"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 364, 14, 63, 'God could use an influential believer like Joseph of Arimithea to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 364, 15, 63, 'contact Pilate (the top ruler in the land) to get "the body of Christ"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 364, 16, 63, 'down from the cross so that even though " Jesus'' grave was assigned with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 364, 17, 63, 'wicked men, yet He was with a rich man in his death " as Isaiah had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 364, 18, 63, 'prophesied (Isa.53:9). Ordinary fishermen like Peter could never have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 364, 19, 63, 'accomplished that. So we thank God today also for every influential');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 364, 20, 63, 'believer who helps members of "the body of Christ" in practical ways.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 364, 21, 63, 'You can be at rest always, only if you have no idol in your life. Good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 364, 22, 63, 'jobs, houses and earthly comforts have become idols to many Christians.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 364, 23, 63, 'That is no better than worshipping an idol of wood or stone! But many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 364, 24, 63, 'Christians don''t realize this. Even the spiritual gifts God gives (like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 364, 25, 63, 'a ministry) can become an idol, like Isaac became to Abraham. When God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 364, 26, 63, 'alone is everything to us and if we can truly say to the Lord, from our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 364, 27, 63, 'hearts, " Lord, there is nothing and no-one I desire on earth beside');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 364, 28, 63, 'you" (Psa.73:25), then alone can we say we are free from idolatry and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 365, 1, 63, 'begin to worship the Lord. I pray that all of you will break free from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 365, 2, 63, 'every idol and worship the Lord alone.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 365, 3, 63, 'Nothing can stop God''s will from being fulfilled in your lives - in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 365, 4, 63, 'every detail - if you seek God''s kingdom first and if you desire to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 365, 5, 63, 'please God alone, because all authority on earth is in the hands of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 365, 6, 63, 'Lord. Jesus made two important statements before Pilate: (1) " My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 365, 7, 63, 'kingdom is not of this world and so I don''t fight for earthly things "');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 365, 8, 63, '(John 18:36). (2) " You can have no authority over Me except what My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 365, 9, 63, 'Father permits you to exercise over me " (John 19:11). This double');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 365, 10, 63, 'confession is what Paul reminded Timothy of, when he told Timothy to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 365, 11, 63, 'a good witness for the Lord (1 Tim.6:13, 14).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 365, 12, 63, 'This is the confession I also have made to God and to Satan and to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 365, 13, 63, 'people, when faced with difficult situations and difficult people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 365, 14, 63, 'Living In The Present');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 365, 15, 63, 'It makes no difference to God how we have lived in the past - if we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 365, 16, 63, 'repented now - because the Name of our God is "I AM" (Exod.3:14), not "I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 365, 17, 63, 'was". Our God lives in the present and not in the past. That is why God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 365, 18, 63, 'does not remember our past against us, once we have confessed our sins.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 365, 19, 63, 'Satan and most men remember our past against us because they live in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 365, 20, 63, 'past (and remember the past of others in order to accuse them). Men also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 365, 21, 63, 'remember their own past and get discouraged. They live in the future');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 365, 22, 63, 'too, fearing future calamities that never occur. We however are to live');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 365, 23, 63, 'in the present with our God "I AM". We have nothing to boast about in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 365, 24, 63, 'relation to our past, except that Jesus died for our sins.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 365, 25, 63, 'Our Father seats repentant prodigals at His right hand, despite the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 365, 26, 63, 'protestations of self-righteous, religious people who remain outside in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 365, 27, 63, 'the cold. And our Father also uses the greatest sinners who have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 365, 28, 63, 'repented as His greatest apostles - that it might be made manifest that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 366, 1, 63, 'Jesus came to call, not the righteous, but sinners to repentance.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 366, 2, 63, 'Unbelief is an Insult to God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 366, 3, 63, 'All things will work together for our good when we love God - whether we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 366, 4, 63, 'get a good job or not. This is how we should live all our days. All');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 366, 5, 63, 'countries are equally good for God''s children. Only God''s will is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 366, 6, 63, 'important. Then we can say at all times, as Madam Guyon did:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 366, 7, 63, '"To me remains nor place nor time - My country is in every clime. I can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 366, 8, 63, 'be calm and free from care On any shore since God is there. While place');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 366, 9, 63, 'we seek or place we shun The soul finds happiness in none. But with my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 366, 10, 63, 'God to guide my way, ''Tis EQUAL JOY to go or stay. Could I be cast where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 366, 11, 63, 'Thou are not - That were indeed a dreadful lot; But regions none remote');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 366, 12, 63, 'I call, Secure of finding God in all."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 366, 13, 63, 'Then whatever happens, we will live in JOY, PEACE and REST. May these be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 366, 14, 63, 'your portion at all times.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 366, 15, 63, 'It is not true that in this world everything will succeed materially for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 366, 16, 63, 'those who are faithful to the Lord. The words "prosper, success,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 366, 17, 63, 'succeed" are never found in the teachings of Jesus or of the apostles .');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 366, 18, 63, 'You can look up a concordance and verify this.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 366, 19, 63, '- "Success" occurs 7 times in the Old Testament, but never in the New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 366, 20, 63, 'Testament.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 366, 21, 63, '- "Succeed" occurs 14 times in the Old Testament, but never in the New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 366, 22, 63, 'Testament.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 366, 23, 63, '- "Prosper" occurs 29 times in the Old Testament, but only once in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 366, 24, 63, 'New Testament - and that too in a casual way in 3 Jn.2 - just as we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 366, 25, 63, 'would wish others "All the best" when writing to them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 366, 26, 63, 'So these are Old Testament words really. The New Testament speaks much');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 366, 27, 63, 'more about the love of God to fallen man, of fellowship with God and of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 366, 28, 63, 'abundant life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 367, 1, 63, 'God''s sovereignty and power are absolute over all people and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 367, 2, 63, 'circumstances on earth. It is therefore an insult not to have faith in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 367, 3, 63, 'such a God. Unbelief says that God is too weak and powerless to help');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 367, 4, 63, 'sort out our small problems on earth. Faith is merely giving God His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 367, 5, 63, 'rightful place and acknowledging Him as Sovereign Creator and Ruler of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 367, 6, 63, 'the earth. That is all. Our Father is in heaven. Those who trust in Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 367, 7, 63, 'will never be disappointed. He does not explain all His actions to us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 367, 8, 63, 'But He cares about every detail of our lives us - intensely.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 367, 9, 63, '"The steps of a good man are ordered by the Lord" (Psa.37:23).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 367, 10, 63, 'Ebenezer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 367, 11, 63, 'Mom wanted me to send you these verses from DAILY LIGHT (that she was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 367, 12, 63, 'reading today), which coincidentally speaks a lot about waters - and she');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 367, 13, 63, 'thought about the waters on the road on which your car skidded');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 367, 14, 63, 'yesterday: " The Lord on high is mightier than many waters....When you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 367, 15, 63, 'pass through the waters I will be with you...they will not overflow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 367, 16, 63, 'you.....Peter walked on the water to go to Jesus. When he was beginning');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 367, 17, 63, 'to sink, he cried saying, `Lord save me''. Immediately Jesus stretched');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 367, 18, 63, 'forth His hand and caught him.....Whenever I am afraid I will trust in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 367, 19, 63, 'You, Lord " (Psa.93:4; Isa.43:2; Matt.14:29-31; Psa.56:3). Praise the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 367, 20, 63, 'Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 367, 21, 63, 'I always felt whenever I had a small toss from my scooter, that God was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 367, 22, 63, 'warning me to slow down and to be more alert so that I would not be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 367, 23, 63, 'involved in a more serious accident later. If your brakes had failed on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 367, 24, 63, 'the highway, the results could have been disastrous. Praise the Lord for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 367, 25, 63, 'His mercy. We all owe our life to the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 367, 26, 63, 'I was thinking about the word "Ebenezer" (meaning " stone of help" -1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 367, 27, 63, 'Sam.7:12). The Philistines were threatening to swallow up Israel and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 367, 28, 63, 'Israelites cried out to the Lord and He thundered from heaven and saved');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 368, 1, 63, 'them. Samuel then placed a stone there and named it " Ebenezer" saying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 368, 2, 63, '"Thus far the Lord helped us". We must frequently review our past');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 368, 3, 63, '"Ebenezer" moments, where the Lord saved us from accidents, death etc.,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 368, 4, 63, 'so that our faith is strengthened in the fact that God loves us and has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 368, 5, 63, 'a definite plan for our lives. He Who cared for us thus far will care');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 368, 6, 63, 'for us until the very end.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 368, 7, 63, '"His love in times past forbids us to think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 368, 8, 63, 'He will leave us at last in trouble to sink.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 368, 9, 63, 'Each sweet `Ebenezer'' we have in review');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 368, 10, 63, 'Confirms His good pleasure to carry us through."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 368, 11, 63, 'Praise the Lord for every prayer that He has answered through the years.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 368, 12, 63, 'The Lord will carry you through every situation and you will be able to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 368, 13, 63, 'raise many "Ebenezers".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 368, 14, 63, 'What God Did For Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 368, 15, 63, 'Here is a song that I wrote 20 years ago, when I was gripped by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 368, 16, 63, 'truth that God loved me as He loved Jesus and that He sent Jesus in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 368, 17, 63, 'flesh to be my Forerunner:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 368, 18, 63, 'When bowed with burdens and with care');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 368, 19, 63, 'Your soul is in despair,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 368, 20, 63, 'You don''t have to fear,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 368, 21, 63, 'God is very near.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 368, 22, 63, 'He loves you as He loved His Son');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 368, 23, 63, 'And He will help you too,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 368, 24, 63, 'Just trust His word of promise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 368, 25, 63, 'And He will see you through.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 368, 26, 63, 'This is the good news - what God can do:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 368, 27, 63, 'What He did for Jesus, He''ll do for you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 368, 28, 63, 'With mighty power He''ll strengthen you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 369, 1, 63, 'There is no end to what God can do.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 369, 2, 63, 'Though sin and evil fill this world');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 369, 3, 63, 'And you are overcome,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 369, 4, 63, 'Yet God''s word is true');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 369, 5, 63, '"Sin can''t reign o''er you".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 369, 6, 63, 'And when temptation''s pull is strong');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 369, 7, 63, 'God''s grace will be your stay,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 369, 8, 63, 'So you can walk like Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 369, 9, 63, 'In vict''ry every day.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 369, 10, 63, 'When pain and sickness come to you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 369, 11, 63, 'And touch your loved ones too,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 369, 12, 63, 'God knows how you feel,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 369, 13, 63, 'He has power to heal.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 369, 14, 63, 'Your Father will provide your need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 369, 15, 63, 'He''s faithful and He''s true,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 369, 16, 63, 'And as He cared for Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 369, 17, 63, 'He will care for you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 369, 18, 63, 'O what a glorious comfort this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 369, 19, 63, 'If you have come to know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 369, 20, 63, 'Jesus as your Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 369, 21, 63, 'And Elder Brother too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 369, 22, 63, 'For all God has is now your own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 369, 23, 63, 'And He won''t let you go.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 369, 24, 63, 'And now that God is for you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 369, 25, 63, 'Who can be your foe?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 369, 26, 63, '" God is your refuge and strength. He is a tested help in times of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 369, 27, 63, 'trouble " (Psa.46:1-Living).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 369, 28, 63, '"The Lord Himself has said, "I will never desert you, nor will I ever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 370, 1, 63, 'forsake you. So you can boldly say at all times, ''The Lord is my Helper.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 370, 2, 63, 'I will not be afraid. What can any man do to me?''"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 370, 3, 63, '(Hebrews 13:5,6)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 370, 4, 63, 'Amen. Amen.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 370, 5, 63, 'Share');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 370, 6, 63, 'Who Am I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 370, 7, 63, 'Our Message');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 370, 8, 63, 'Resources');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 370, 9, 63, 'Study Series');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 370, 10, 63, 'About us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('hear_o_my_sons', 370, 11, 63, 'CHRISTIAN FELLOWSHIP CHURCH');
INSERT INTO books VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 'Encouragement For Mothers', 'Zac Poonen', 'God is our heavenly Father who is interested in helping us to be a better parent and a better wife. Read and be encouraged by the truths that helped Annie Poonen in building a Godly home.', 'encouragement_for_mothers.jpg', 22, 603, '2026-09-01T09:55:52.020Z');
INSERT INTO book_chapters VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 1, 'Chapter 1 Building A Holy Temple For God', 1, 1, 6, 8);
INSERT INTO book_chapters VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 2, 'Chapter 2 Knowing God As My Father', 6, 9, 9, 8);
INSERT INTO book_chapters VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 3, 'Chapter 3 Unity With My Husband', 9, 9, 13, 19);
INSERT INTO book_chapters VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 4, 'Chapter 4 The Glory Of Submission', 13, 20, 17, 6);
INSERT INTO book_chapters VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 5, 'Chapter 5 Teaching And Disciplining Children', 17, 7, 22, 15);
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 1, 1, 1, 'Chapter 1 Building A Holy Temple For God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 1, 2, 1, 'Many years ago when my children were young, I faced many challenges.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 1, 3, 1, 'Deep down in my heart was a longing to be a better wife, a better mother');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 1, 4, 1, 'and a better person. I heard a beautiful story then that helped me.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 1, 5, 1, 'Someone was walking by a large construction-site and saw many people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 1, 6, 1, 'working there. It looked like they were building something big there.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 1, 7, 1, 'Some were digging the ground, others were carrying logs and bricks, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 1, 8, 1, 'some others were mixing cement and sand together, and so on. Everybody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 1, 9, 1, 'was busy doing something or the other. He asked some of the workers,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 1, 10, 1, '"What are you doing here?" One said, "I am carrying bricks". Another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 1, 11, 1, 'said, "I am doing the woodwork." Another said, "I''m mixing the cement');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 1, 12, 1, 'and sand". Finally, one of them said, "I am the engineer working here.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 1, 13, 1, 'We are building a cathedral".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 1, 14, 1, 'When we think of the mundane things we do as wives and mothers, we may');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 1, 15, 1, 'also say, "I am just changing the diapers", or "I am just cleaning the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 1, 16, 1, 'house", or "I am just cooking and washing the dishes". But God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 1, 17, 1, 'building His holy temple within us. It is a wonderful work that God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 1, 18, 1, 'doing in us. Not only are we bringing up our children for Him, with His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 1, 19, 1, 'help, but He is also building His temple within us at the same time. Our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 1, 20, 1, 'home life and our family life are being built for the glory of Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 1, 21, 1, 'Christ. And we can present our children to Him, so that they can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 1, 22, 1, 'experience the same glorious work in their lives as well. Our family');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 1, 23, 1, 'will then be a beautiful temple for the glory of God - and our children');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 1, 24, 1, 'will be a part of that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 1, 25, 1, 'God encouraged me then to be faithful in the little things I do at home,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 1, 26, 1, 'and to be content with my life, and not to think that I should be doing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 1, 27, 1, 'something great in the eyes of the world, as a career-woman (since by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 1, 28, 1, 'profession, I was a medical doctor). Then I found a delight in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 2, 1, 1, 'ordinary chores I did at home, knowing that God had planned every detail');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 2, 2, 1, 'of my life and that He knew me and appreciated everything I did for Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 2, 3, 1, 'Sometimes, as mothers, when we have not had enough sleep or are tired');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 2, 4, 1, 'and drained out emotionally and physically, we may lose this vision.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 2, 5, 1, 'Then we must focus our spiritual lens and see this vision clearly once');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 2, 6, 1, 'again - and we will see that the Lord is doing a beautiful work in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 2, 7, 1, 'lives, which will be perfected one day!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 2, 8, 1, 'When you are doing a piece of embroidery and you look at the under-side');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 2, 9, 1, 'of it, there will be nothing beautiful there. All that you see will be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 2, 10, 1, 'lot of knots and stitches. In our lives too, we may often see many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 2, 11, 1, 'things that we can''t understand. One day God will show us (and the whole');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 2, 12, 1, 'world) the upper-side - the beautiful ''embroidery'' that He wove into our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 2, 13, 1, 'lives, transforming us and our children through all that we went through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 2, 14, 1, 'on earth. It will all be His handiwork and so it will all be for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 2, 15, 1, 'praise of His glory alone.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 2, 16, 1, 'Even though we are struggling with our children now, let us believe that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 2, 17, 1, 'they will turn out all right finally, as children of God. God is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 2, 18, 1, 'keeping a record of the little disobediences that they did. None of us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 2, 19, 1, 'is perfect. God will help us and He will help them too. When we realize');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 2, 20, 1, 'that it is God Who is doing the work in us, we will not imagine that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 2, 21, 1, 'have been wonderful mothers or that we have done anything perfectly. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 2, 22, 1, 'we will not imagine that we can teach others. Everything is for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 2, 23, 1, 'glory of God alone. He will reveal His mighty power in the final day and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 2, 24, 1, 'show that, in-spite of all our weaknesses, shortcomings and failures, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 2, 25, 1, 'still partook of Christ''s nature.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 2, 26, 1, 'Yet another illustration comes to my mind. Someone said that if you take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 2, 27, 1, 'a rupee-coin and put it close enough to your eye, you won''t even be able');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 2, 28, 1, 'to see the sun. In the same way, some of the anxieties we face with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 3, 1, 1, 'regard to material things and earning and saving money, can so cloud our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 3, 2, 1, 'spiritual vision, that we don''t see the light of God any more.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 3, 3, 1, 'We often had shortage of water in Bangalore. So we had to be careful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 3, 4, 1, 'with the use of water and I was often busy with storing water for our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 3, 5, 1, 'needs. I was preoccupied with so many little things like that at home.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 3, 6, 1, 'But I knew that Jesus had said that the one thing needful for us was to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 3, 7, 1, 'be still at His feet and to listen to Him, as Mary did (Luke 10:42). But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 3, 8, 1, 'where did I have the time to do that in the midst of my hectic day''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 3, 9, 1, 'work? I discovered then that even in the midst of my daily work, my mind');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 3, 10, 1, 'could still be on the Lord. I could have a Mary''s heart while having a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 3, 11, 1, 'Martha''s hands. While we go about our daily chores, our hearts can still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 3, 12, 1, 'be attuned to listen to the Lord always.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 3, 13, 1, 'My great desire as a mother was to bring up my children in godly ways.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 3, 14, 1, 'Children are all different. Each culture and each parent is different');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 3, 15, 1, 'too. We can get good ideas on parenting from Christian books. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 3, 16, 1, 'ultimately, it is the Lord alone who can help us to bring up our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 3, 17, 1, 'children in His ways.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 3, 18, 1, 'At one time, I was tempted to imitate godly mothers whom I had met or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 3, 19, 1, 'read about who used to discipline their children in different ways. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 3, 20, 1, 'I realized that those were just different methods. My goal was to lead');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 3, 21, 1, 'my children to true godliness - and I saw that there were many ways by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 3, 22, 1, 'which I could reach that goal. So I did not have to blindly imitate a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 3, 23, 1, 'method that I saw others using. Neither did I have to get discouraged if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 3, 24, 1, 'I could not follow that method myself. Some of our children may respond');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 3, 25, 1, 'to a quiet word. Then we don''t need to raise our voice with them. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 3, 26, 1, 'our other children may be different. The important thing is to hear the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 3, 27, 1, 'voice of God. He will guide us as we seek to help our children.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 3, 28, 1, 'In my own case, there were some other factors too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 4, 1, 1, 'The meetings of the church were held in our home for 6 years. We had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 4, 2, 1, 'meetings every Sunday morning and on three evenings of the week as well.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 4, 3, 1, 'In addition to that, people from the church would drop in at home every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 4, 4, 1, 'now and then, for some practical or medical help, or for prayer. At');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 4, 5, 1, 'times, we even had to accommodate some people in our home for the night,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 4, 6, 1, 'because they came from far away.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 4, 7, 1, 'Yet another factor was that my husband was often away from home,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 4, 8, 1, 'travelling in his ministry. So I could not get his help at such times.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 4, 9, 1, 'During such times, I would think how easy it was for other women who had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 4, 10, 1, 'their husbands at home every day. I learnt a lesson in those days: Never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 4, 11, 1, 'compare your lot with that of others who have it easier than you; but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 4, 12, 1, 'rather compare your lot with those who have it tougher than you. If we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 4, 13, 1, 'do that, we will be thankful to the Lord for everything and at all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 4, 14, 1, 'times.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 4, 15, 1, 'God had called my husband to preach the gospel. So I did not want him to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 4, 16, 1, 'be tied down doing many things for me at home. He would then have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 4, 17, 1, 'limit his ministry, stop traveling to the different churches and be less');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 4, 18, 1, 'available to help needy people. I realized that God''s plan for my life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 4, 19, 1, 'and for my family was different from what He had planned for others. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 4, 20, 1, 'helped me to accept my situation as He had planned it. I can see now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 4, 21, 1, 'that His plan for my life was perfect.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 4, 22, 1, 'At times, when my husband was away from home, my children would be sick.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 4, 23, 1, 'At such times, I thanked the Lord that He had given me enough medical');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 4, 24, 1, 'knowledge to know what to do for my children. I did not have to take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 4, 25, 1, 'them to the hospital every time they were sick. I could handle their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 4, 26, 1, 'little sicknesses myself. The Lord always came alongside me and helped');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 4, 27, 1, 'me to cope with those situations. He even enabled me at times, to take a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 4, 28, 1, 'short nap during the day, on days when I had lost sleep at night.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 5, 1, 1, 'I realized that I had to cut out some non-essential activities and some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 5, 2, 1, 'of my own social life and recreation if I was to have time to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 5, 3, 1, 'concentrate on important matters like my children''s needs. I could catch');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 5, 4, 1, 'up on my personal ambitions after my children had grown up and left home');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 5, 5, 1, 'and were standing on their own feet. But right then they needed my help');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 5, 6, 1, 'with their studies and with other matters in their lives. I needed to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 5, 7, 1, 'a friend to them and be available for them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 5, 8, 1, 'My part in the Lord''s ministry, I felt, was to support my husband by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 5, 9, 1, 'taking care of the home, so that he would be free to travel and preach');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 5, 10, 1, 'undisturbed. I wanted to try and preserve a peaceful and harmonious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 5, 11, 1, 'atmosphere at home at all times, so that it would be easier for him to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 5, 12, 1, 'go and speak. He should never be in any unrest because of anything that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 5, 13, 1, 'happened in our home - and especially with our children. I did not want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 5, 14, 1, 'anything that happened in my home to be a hindrance for the Lord''s work');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 5, 15, 1, 'through him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 5, 16, 1, 'There are three Biblical truths that helped me in my married life - and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 5, 17, 1, 'that have become increasingly important for me in these past years.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 5, 18, 1, 'I came to realize these truths more clearly only after I was gripped by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 5, 19, 1, 'the New Covenant. Before God opened my eyes to see the New Covenant, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 5, 20, 1, 'was just a born again Christian who knew that my sins were forgiven.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 5, 21, 1, 'Like other believers, I would regularly ask for forgiveness each time I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 5, 22, 1, 'slipped up and fell into some sin. Sometimes my spiritual life was dry.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 5, 23, 1, 'But, when I began to seek for a life of victory over sin, I realized how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 5, 24, 1, 'much I needed the Holy Spirit''s power every day.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 5, 25, 1, 'The Lord Jesus had baptized me with the Holy Spirit. But I saw that I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 5, 26, 1, 'needed to be filled with the Spirit daily. Only thus could His power,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 5, 27, 1, 'strength, and freshness be ever present in my life. The daily fullness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 5, 28, 1, 'of the Holy Spirit is the promise of our heavenly Father for all of us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 6, 1, 1, 'None of us should miss out on it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 6, 2, 1, 'The three truths that have become important to me are:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 6, 3, 1, '1. I can know God as my Father.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 6, 4, 1, '2. The importance of being united with my husband.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 6, 5, 1, '3. The glory of submission to my husband.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 6, 6, 1, 'In all these three areas, I could see Jesus as my example. The New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 6, 7, 1, 'Testament became alive to me. It was not a text-book for me, but the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 6, 8, 1, 'living words of Jesus.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 6, 9, 2, 'Chapter 2 Knowing God As My Father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 6, 10, 2, 'Knowing God as my own Father was the first truth that became really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 6, 11, 2, 'important for me.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 6, 12, 2, 'Many wives face a lot of problems, because they are insecure. They long');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 6, 13, 2, 'for a friend or someone whom they can turn to, in a time of need, to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 6, 14, 2, 'share their problems with. Women especially have to adjust to many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 6, 15, 2, 'changes when they get married. And they long at times for someone who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 6, 16, 2, 'can give them a listening ear, one who can understand them, to whom they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 6, 17, 2, 'can pour out their heart - a friend or a sister or a parent. But all of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 6, 18, 2, 'these people have their limitations in their ability to help us. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 6, 19, 2, 'cannot burden our parents or siblings too much, because they have their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 6, 20, 2, 'own problems. And not all our friends have the time to listen to our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 6, 21, 2, 'problems. But we don''t have to turn to man. We can turn to our Father in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 6, 22, 2, 'heaven.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 6, 23, 2, 'Jeremiah 17:5-8 says, "Cursed is the man who trusts in mankind…..But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 6, 24, 2, 'blessed is the man who trusts in the Lord. He will be like a tree');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 6, 25, 2, 'planted by the water. His roots will go deep and he will not fear the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 6, 26, 2, 'heat or the drought. His leaves will be green and always fresh and he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 6, 27, 2, 'will not cease from yielding fruit."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 6, 28, 2, 'The blessed life is one where we lean upon God Himself as our Father and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 7, 1, 2, 'not on any human being. Then we will never be dry. We will be perfectly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 7, 2, 2, 'secure.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 7, 3, 2, 'Jesus told us in John 14:17, 18 that once He sent the Holy Spirit to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 7, 4, 2, 'dwell within us, we would no longer be orphans, because God Himself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 7, 5, 2, 'would then be our Father.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 7, 6, 2, 'Jesus told us that we must address God as our Father when we pray.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 7, 7, 2, 'When I came to be gripped with this wonderful truth, that I have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 7, 8, 2, 'Loving Father in heaven, my insecurities began to disappear.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 7, 9, 2, 'Under the Old Covenant, people knew God as Jehovah and they trembled');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 7, 10, 2, 'before Him with awe and fear. But now, we know Him as our Father - if we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 7, 11, 2, 'have truly turned from our sins and made Jesus Lord of our lives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 7, 12, 2, 'There are both privileges and responsibilities when we become God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 7, 13, 2, 'children. We have the privilege of knowing Him as our Father. Our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 7, 14, 2, 'responsibility is to let Him have total authority over our lives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 7, 15, 2, 'We need to learn many things from our heavenly Father.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 7, 16, 2, 'In Isaiah 30:30, we read, "The Lord will cause His voice of authority to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 7, 17, 2, 'be heard". Applying that to our lives as parents, our children must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 7, 18, 2, 'recognize our loving authority, as their parents.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 7, 19, 2, 'Our Father guides us. In Psalm 32:8, "I will instruct you and teach you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 7, 20, 2, 'in the way which you should go". And in Isaiah 30:21, He says, "Your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 7, 21, 2, 'ears will hear a word behind you saying, ''This is the way, walk in it,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 7, 22, 2, 'whenever you miss the way and turn to the right or to the left ".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 7, 23, 2, 'Applying that to our lives, we see that we also need to guide our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 7, 24, 2, 'children along the right way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 7, 25, 2, 'Our Father forgives us when we have failed. We also must be quick to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 7, 26, 2, 'forgive our children and all others when they fail.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 7, 27, 2, 'Our Father has compassion on us. In Psalm 103:13, we read " Just as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 7, 28, 2, 'father has compassion on his children, so the LORD has compassion on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 8, 1, 2, 'those who fear Him, for He knows what we are made of. He is mindful that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 8, 2, 2, 'we are but dust." We too need to be compassionate towards our children');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 8, 3, 2, 'and not be hard on them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 8, 4, 2, 'Our Father speaks to us through His word and through the circumstances');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 8, 5, 2, 'we face. And He corrects and disciplines us for our good, as we read in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 8, 6, 2, 'Hebrews 12:7-10. Our Father is loving as well as strict. We also need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 8, 7, 2, 'teach our children through our instruction and the circumstances they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 8, 8, 2, 'face. And we must be loving and strict in our dealings with them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 8, 9, 2, 'Our Father is always consistent and keeps His promises. This is another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 8, 10, 2, 'thing we have to learn from our Father - to keep our word to our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 8, 11, 2, 'children.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 8, 12, 2, 'We can talk to our Heavenly Father and tell Him everything that bothers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 8, 13, 2, 'us - our fears, our weaknesses, our failures and our longings. We need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 8, 14, 2, 'never fear anything in this world. How many times Jesus told His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 8, 15, 2, 'disciples, ''Fear not, your heavenly Father cares for you''! Our children');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 8, 16, 2, 'also must always feel free to tell us their fears and their problems.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 8, 17, 2, 'What a great privilege it is to have such a loving and all-powerful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 8, 18, 2, 'Father. We must respect Him, honour Him, love Him, obey Him, and live to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 8, 19, 2, 'please Him alone.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 8, 20, 2, 'In John 17:3, we read that eternal life is to know God personally - and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 8, 21, 2, 'especially to know that He loves us as much as He loves Jesus (John');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 8, 22, 2, '17:23). This is an amazing truth. Our Heavenly Father is not partial. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 8, 23, 2, 'will do everything for us that He did for Jesus. He will care for us as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 8, 24, 2, 'He cared for Jesus. We too, as parents, must be impartial in the way we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 8, 25, 2, 'deal with all our children.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 8, 26, 2, 'When we believe this wonderful truth that our Father loves us just as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 8, 27, 2, 'much as He loves Jesus, we will be free from our insecurities and we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 8, 28, 2, 'will be strong when facing the trials of life. As time goes on, we will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 9, 1, 2, 'get to know our Father more and more intimately and we will learn to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 9, 2, 2, 'depend on Him more and more. We will trust His wisdom even in times when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 9, 3, 2, 'we do not understand why things happen a certain way. We will be fully');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 9, 4, 2, 'assured that everything He allows in our lives will be for our good. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 9, 5, 2, 'can trust Him to provide a solution to our problems. We will not see Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 9, 6, 2, 'as a God who seeks to punish us, but as a loving Father who is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 9, 7, 2, 'interested in helping us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 9, 8, 2, 'Our Heavenly Father can help us to be better parents to our children.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 9, 9, 3, 'Chapter 3 Unity With My Husband');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 9, 10, 3, 'The importance of unity with my husband is the second truth that has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 9, 11, 3, 'guided me in my married life. In the Gospel of John there are many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 9, 12, 3, 'verses which say that the Father and Jesus are one.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 9, 13, 3, 'In John 17:21, Jesus tells us that He wants us to be one as the Father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 9, 14, 3, 'and Son are one.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 9, 15, 3, 'If we apply that to married life, we must have a strong bond of unity');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 9, 16, 3, 'with our husbands. These days the devil is destroying the unity in many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 9, 17, 3, 'families. Homes are falling apart. So we must be watchful and alert.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 9, 18, 3, 'Many wives are more attached to their parents or their siblings than to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 9, 19, 3, 'their husbands. This is one reason why they face many problems in their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 9, 20, 3, 'married life. If our unity with our husbands is not strong, the devil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 9, 21, 3, 'will easily get into our homes. When parents are not united, their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 9, 22, 3, 'children will feel insecure, and this can manifest itself in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 9, 23, 3, 'eating-disorders, bad behavior and sleep-problems, etc.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 9, 24, 3, 'In John 1:1, we read that Jesus was in the beginning with God, and that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 9, 25, 3, 'He is God Himself. This is something that our finite minds cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 9, 26, 3, 'understand. There is a deep and strong unity between the three Persons');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 9, 27, 3, 'of the Godhead that we will understand fully only when we see God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 9, 28, 3, 'Himself. It is a very precious unity. Jesus prayed in John 17 that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 10, 1, 3, 'Father would show us a little bit of that unity, so that we too could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 10, 2, 3, 'have such a unity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 10, 3, 3, 'When God unites a man and wife in marriage it is His will that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 10, 4, 3, 'should be one. What God has joined together, no-one should separate.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 10, 5, 3, 'In Amos 3:3 (KJV), we read, "Can two walk together unless they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 10, 6, 3, 'agreed?"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 10, 7, 3, 'In Matthew 18:18, 19, we read that when two believers are united and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 10, 8, 3, 'agreed they can bind Satan''s activities and release those whom he has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 10, 9, 3, 'bound. This can apply to a husband and wife praying for problems in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 10, 10, 3, 'their home. Satan knows that there is power when a husband and wife are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 10, 11, 3, 'united, for the Lord will be in their midst (Matt.18:19,20). So he tries');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 10, 12, 3, 'his best to break up that unity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 10, 13, 3, 'What a privilege it is, as husband and wife, to be able to taste a small');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 10, 14, 3, 'measure of the unity that Jesus and His Father had. Jesus came down to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 10, 15, 3, 'earth to give us such a unity in our homes. It is our birthright. Our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 10, 16, 3, 'minds cannot fathom it - but it is possible.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 10, 17, 3, 'What are some of the causes of disunity in a family? A husband and wife');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 10, 18, 3, 'can have differences between them, because of their background, their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 10, 19, 3, 'culture, their upbringing and because they see things in different ways.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 10, 20, 3, 'But such differences need not bring disunity. God''s grace can make two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 10, 21, 3, 'people one, even when they are different from each other.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 10, 22, 3, 'I asked the Lord to make this true in my own married life. I did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 10, 23, 3, 'want a life full of quarrels and unhappiness and loneliness caused by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 10, 24, 3, 'any distance coming between me and my husband. So I asked the Lord to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 10, 25, 3, 'help me to become so united with my husband that our differences would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 10, 26, 3, 'not bother me. I wanted to do all that I could to make that oneness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 10, 27, 3, 'happen in my married life. That became my goal.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 10, 28, 3, 'As human beings, we have a tendency to blame someone else even when we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 11, 1, 3, 'ourselves have made a mistake. This can happen even in a marriage. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 11, 2, 3, 'should remember then that we are separating what God has joined');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 11, 3, 3, 'together. God''s will is that we should be united and so we should do all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 11, 4, 3, 'we can to preserve that unity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 11, 5, 3, 'We must ask the Lord to help us to be patient with one another and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 11, 6, 3, 'forgiving each other, just as the Lord has been patient with us and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 11, 7, 3, 'forgiven us in Christ (Eph 4:2, 32).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 11, 8, 3, 'Suspicion of one another is yet another factor that can disrupt unity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 11, 9, 3, 'So beware of that. And remember that most suspicions are finally found');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 11, 10, 3, 'to be baseless.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 11, 11, 3, 'If you have had friendships with other men in the past, you must bury');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 11, 12, 3, 'the memory of those events and never think about them. And don''t ever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 11, 13, 3, 'renew old contacts through Facebook . This may appear harmless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 11, 14, 3, 'initially. But you will be opening yourself to unnecessary temptation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 11, 15, 3, 'Remember that even when your relatives are far away, they may still try');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 11, 16, 3, 'to control you and rule you - which can bring a distance between your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 11, 17, 3, 'husband and you. Don''t ever allow that to happen.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 11, 18, 3, 'Sometimes money, material things, and earthly goals can cause division');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 11, 19, 3, 'between a husband and wife. So have your priorities right.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 11, 20, 3, 'Unity with our husband is a high goal, but it possible to achieve it, if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 11, 21, 3, 'we strongly desire it, because God is on our side to help us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 11, 22, 3, 'Every time a small problem comes up between you and your husband, think');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 11, 23, 3, 'of it as a little thorn or splinter getting into your hand. If you allow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 11, 24, 3, 'it to remain, it will become an infected abscess. Be quick to turn to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 11, 25, 3, 'the Lord then and seek His forgiveness immediately; and be focused once');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 11, 26, 3, 'again on preserving your unity with your husband. Acknowledge your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 11, 27, 3, 'error, ask forgiveness from your husband, repent and seek with all your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 11, 28, 3, 'heart to remain united. That is what it means to judge oneself and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 12, 1, 3, 'cleanse oneself. A small misunderstanding can be like a wedge that Satan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 12, 2, 3, 'uses to bring a separation between you and your husband. We have to work');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 12, 3, 3, 'hard and be alert at all times, if we are to preserve this unity with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 12, 4, 3, 'our husbands. You will not regret the effort when you come to the end of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 12, 5, 3, 'your life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 12, 6, 3, 'When you find that you and your husband have a different opinion');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 12, 7, 3, 'regarding dealing with a situation at home, talk together in a mature');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 12, 8, 3, 'way. And be prepared to change your mind, if he insists on his way. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 12, 9, 3, 'it is also possible that after you have talked together, he may change');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 12, 10, 3, 'his mind or you may come up with a new way of dealing with the problem.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 12, 11, 3, 'But we must work towards dealing with differences in a mature way,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 12, 12, 3, 'without quarrelling about it. The differences we have can also be used');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 12, 13, 3, 'by the Lord to broaden our own views about different situations.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 12, 14, 3, 'Church matters are the province of the elders of the church. As wives,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 12, 15, 3, 'we should not be interfering in such matters. We can always give a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 12, 16, 3, 'woman''s point of view to our husbands. But be careful that you don''t try');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 12, 17, 3, 'to become an ''Assistant Elder'' in the church. In Revelation 2:20, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 12, 18, 3, 'read of the Lord calling the elder''s wife a Jezebel, a false prophetess,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 12, 19, 3, 'who was harming the church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 12, 20, 3, 'Where there are strong families in a church, that church will be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 12, 21, 3, 'strong church. The gates of hell will not be able to prevail against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 12, 22, 3, 'such a church because the families in it are united. So let us do all we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 12, 23, 3, 'can to preserve the unity of the church. It takes years to build such a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 12, 24, 3, 'unity but we must work towards it - day by day. God will help us through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 12, 25, 3, 'His Holy Spirit to attain it. Remember the story of the cathedral. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 12, 26, 3, 'may take years to be completed, but it will be done.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 12, 27, 3, 'We will not always see things the same way as our husbands do. But when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 12, 28, 3, 'we disagree, we must make sure that we discuss our disagreements');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 13, 1, 3, 'privately and not in the presence of our children or others. It is best');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 13, 2, 3, 'to discuss such matters when our children are asleep and no-one else is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 13, 3, 3, 'around. And when we do discuss our disagreements in private, let us do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 13, 4, 3, 'so in a mature way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 13, 5, 3, 'When there is unrest between husband and wife, the children will sense');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 13, 6, 3, 'it and they will become insecure. Then they will demand more attention');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 13, 7, 3, 'from us and become demanding in many other ways as well.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 13, 8, 3, 'One good rule is to try and keep quiet, when you are upset. Ask God to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 13, 9, 3, 'help you to be calm and to get over the agitation in your heart before');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 13, 10, 3, 'you speak.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 13, 11, 3, 'Once your children are married, it is best to let them run their homes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 13, 12, 3, 'as they like, without your constantly giving them advice. That way, they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 13, 13, 3, 'will respect you. You will also need a lot of wisdom in dealing with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 13, 14, 3, 'their children - your grandchildren. Remember that you already had your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 13, 15, 3, 'turn in bringing up children - in your way. Now let them have their turn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 13, 16, 3, 'to bring up their children -in their way, without your interference.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 13, 17, 3, 'Thus you will preserve yourself in love and unity with them. But be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 13, 18, 3, 'available to help them whenever they need your help. Give them advice');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 13, 19, 3, 'only when they ask for it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 13, 20, 4, 'Chapter 4 The Glory Of Submission');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 13, 21, 4, 'Submission to my husband was the third important principle which the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 13, 22, 4, 'Lord opened my eyes to see.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 13, 23, 4, 'People don''t like to hear the word "submission" because they think it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 13, 24, 4, 'means that you should just give in to your husband always and do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 13, 25, 4, 'whatever he wants you to do. But that is not what it means. I see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 13, 26, 4, 'submission as something that Jesus did throughout His life, to His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 13, 27, 4, 'Father and to whatever His Father told Him to do. He submitted to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 13, 28, 4, 'imperfect Joseph and Mary for 30 years, just because His Father told Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 14, 1, 4, 'to do so. He submitted to His Father''s will, because He loved His Father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 14, 2, 4, 'so greatly. We are to have the same attitude that Jesus had (Phil 2:5).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 14, 3, 4, 'In Philippians 2: 5-11, we read that Jesus did not consider equality');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 14, 4, 4, 'with God as something to be held on to. He gave it up willingly. And He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 14, 5, 4, 'did not come down just one level below God and become an angel. He came');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 14, 6, 4, 'down even lower and became a man. And then he came down lower still and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 14, 7, 4, 'became a slave. A slave is one who has no rights and who cannot question');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 14, 8, 4, 'anything done to him. Slaves could be starved or killed in the first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 14, 9, 4, 'century, and there was no law to protect them. Then Jesus went still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 14, 10, 4, 'lower and was counted as a criminal and died on the cross for us. There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 14, 11, 4, 'we see the amazing love of Jesus for us fallen human beings.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 14, 12, 4, 'If our Lord chose to come down like that, we too should be willing to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 14, 13, 4, 'come down from our high positions. It is from Jesus'' example that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 14, 14, 4, 'learn submission and meekness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 14, 15, 4, 'Satan was cast out heaven because of his pride and insubordination. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 14, 16, 4, 'Jesus saved us by His submitting to the Father all His earthly life and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 14, 17, 4, 'finally even to the death on the cross. Thus He made a way for us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 14, 18, 4, 'fellowship with His Father eternally in heaven. Such is the power of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 14, 19, 4, 'submission.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 14, 20, 4, 'The Bible tells us in 1 Peter 3:1-4 that a wife who has a humble and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 14, 21, 4, 'quiet spirit can win even an unconverted husband to the Lord without a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 14, 22, 4, 'word. God can do amazing miracles through a submissive wife.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 14, 23, 4, 'And if God has given you a good husband, then it should be the easiest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 14, 24, 4, 'thing in the world to submit to him joyfully.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 14, 25, 4, 'We must also see submission as a command from God to us wives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 14, 26, 4, '(Eph.5:22). When we see that command in God''s Word, if we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 14, 27, 4, 'God-fearing, we will do just that and not question God. Every command in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 14, 28, 4, 'the Bible comes with the promise of help from God. So He will help us in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 15, 1, 4, 'this area too. Then we will discover that submission is not a difficult');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 15, 2, 4, 'matter at all.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 15, 3, 4, 'Some people may feel sorry for us and say, "Oh you poor Christians. How');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 15, 4, 4, 'sad that you have to submit to your husbands. How can you do that? Why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 15, 5, 4, 'don''t you speak up and stand up for your rights?''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 15, 6, 4, 'But what they don''t realize is that it is the happiest thing in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 15, 7, 4, 'world to obey God. Nothing can give us greater joy than living the way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 15, 8, 4, 'Jesus lived on this earth. "One who says he abides in Christ must walk');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 15, 9, 4, 'in the same manner as He walked" (1John 2:6).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 15, 10, 4, 'What a wonderful opportunity we wives have. We can do something that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 15, 11, 4, 'Jesus did throughout His entire earthly life - live a life of total');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 15, 12, 4, 'submission to the will of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 15, 13, 4, 'The Lord gives us a peace and joy that the world can never give, when we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 15, 14, 4, 'seek to live a life pleasing to Him. I have experienced this more and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 15, 15, 4, 'more as I have sought to live such a life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 15, 16, 4, 'It is 46 years now (2014), since I got married and I can honestly say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 15, 17, 4, 'that the happiest life I can live as a married woman is a life of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 15, 18, 4, 'obedience to the laws of God, including the law of submission to my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 15, 19, 4, 'husband. My only regret is that I have failed at times to submit as I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 15, 20, 4, 'should have. Praise the Lord for the power of the Holy Spirit that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 15, 21, 4, 'enables us to live such a life. And praise the Lord also for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 15, 22, 4, 'forgiveness He gives us readily, whenever we slip up and fail Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 15, 23, 4, 'In 1Peter 3:1-6, the Holy Spirit gives us the example of Sarah, who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 15, 24, 4, 'trusted the Lord to guide her husband Abraham. So she followed him. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 15, 25, 4, 'must have been difficult for her many times. For example, when Abraham');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 15, 26, 4, 'said she was his sister and put her life in danger with a heathen king.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 15, 27, 4, 'But God protected her. The same God will protect us too. And when Sarah');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 15, 28, 4, 'knew that God had asked Abraham to offer up her son on the altar, how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 16, 1, 4, 'difficult that would have been for her, if she did not trust God? She');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 16, 2, 4, 'could have made it very difficult for Abraham to obey God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 16, 3, 4, 'When we submit to our husbands we are actually expressing our trust in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 16, 4, 4, 'the Lord to lead our family through the headship of our husband.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 16, 5, 4, 'God''s line of authority is described in 1 Corinthians 11:3 thus: "Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 16, 6, 4, 'is the head of every man, and the man is the head of a woman, and God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 16, 7, 4, 'the head of Christ".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 16, 8, 4, 'Even though the Father and Jesus are equal to each other, yet Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 16, 9, 4, 'chose to be subject to the Father. In the same way, even though we wives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 16, 10, 4, 'are equal to our husbands we still choose to be under their headship,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 16, 11, 4, 'because this is God''s order. When we follow God''s order, we can expect');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 16, 12, 4, 'God''s blessing in our homes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 16, 13, 4, 'We can certainly express our views frankly to our husbands. But when it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 16, 14, 4, 'comes to making the final decision, we must trust the Lord to overrule');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 16, 15, 4, 'and make our husbands take the right decision. Even if I have a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 16, 16, 4, 'different view, I still let my husband take the final decision. It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 16, 17, 4, 'good for my children to see that I respect God''s order in my home.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 16, 18, 4, 'In Ephesians 5:22,32, we are told that the relationship between a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 16, 19, 4, 'husband and wife is like that of Christ and the church. This is called a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 16, 20, 4, 'great mystery there. When a wife submits to her husband, she is actually');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 16, 21, 4, 'showing the world the truth of the church being subject to Christ. So a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 16, 22, 4, 'godly home is actually a miniature church. When we see a miniature');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 16, 23, 4, 'replica of the Statue of Liberty or of the Taj Mahal somewhere, we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 16, 24, 4, 'see what those structures looks like. We may then have a longing to go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 16, 25, 4, 'and see those structures. Even so our home life should draw people to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 16, 26, 4, 'the church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 16, 27, 4, 'In 1 Peter 3:4 wives are exhorted to have a gentle and quiet spirit,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 16, 28, 4, 'because that is very precious in God''s eyes. And Jesus told us to learn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 17, 1, 4, 'gentleness and humility from Him (Matt .11:28,29).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 17, 2, 4, 'In Proverbs 31:26, we read that a godly woman speaks according to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 17, 3, 4, 'law of kindness. As wives, we must cultivate the habit of speaking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 17, 4, 4, 'respectfully to our husbands. Whenever we slip up and speak harshly or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 17, 5, 4, 'in an un-Christ-like way, we must apologize. It is often from mothers,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 17, 6, 4, 'that many children learn to speak rudely.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 17, 7, 5, 'Chapter 5 Teaching And Disciplining Children');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 17, 8, 5, 'One of the most important things we have to teach our children is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 17, 9, 5, 'obedience to parents (Eph 6:1). As mothers, we can teach them obedience');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 17, 10, 5, 'by their observing our attitude to our husbands. For example, if they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 17, 11, 5, 'see us going against Daddy''s rules for the home, when he is away from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 17, 12, 5, 'the home, that can make our children rebel against us also one day. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 17, 13, 5, 'when we are respectful to our husbands, our children will learn to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 17, 14, 5, 'respect us as well as others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 17, 15, 5, 'We need to teach our children to be truthful at all times. Our children');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 17, 16, 5, 'will easily know it, if we are not speaking the truth at any time. Even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 17, 17, 5, 'at a young age they are able to discern dishonesty.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 17, 18, 5, 'Let us also teach our children to be neat and tidy. If we are tidy and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 17, 19, 5, 'we keep our homes also in a tidy way, then our children will learn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 17, 20, 5, 'tidiness. When they have finished playing with their toys, they should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 17, 21, 5, 'be taught to put them away.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 17, 22, 5, 'We must also teach our children not to be wasteful. At food-time, it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 17, 23, 5, 'best to serve them small portions initially. When they have finished');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 17, 24, 5, 'that, then serve them a second helping. That way we can teach them to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 17, 25, 5, 'finish everything on their plate, and not to waste food.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 17, 26, 5, 'If we ourselves are disciplined in the matters of time, speech,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 17, 27, 5, 'tidiness, eating habits etc., then our children will learn to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 17, 28, 5, 'disciplined too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 18, 1, 5, 'Our children must also be taught to share their things with others, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 18, 2, 5, 'not to be selfish. When we ourselves are considerate to others, they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 18, 3, 5, 'will learn to be considerate too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 18, 4, 5, 'Contentment is yet another precious virtue to be taught. Many children');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 18, 5, 5, 'are discontented with their clothes and their toys, because they compare');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 18, 6, 5, 'themselves with children from wealthier homes. Teach them the value of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 18, 7, 5, 'contentment by the way you live - and then they will always remember');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 18, 8, 5, 'your example.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 18, 9, 5, 'The first thing that comes to most people''s minds whenever we talk about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 18, 10, 5, 'bringing up children is the matter of discipline. How are we to correct');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 18, 11, 5, 'our children?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 18, 12, 5, 'If you do positive things like spending time with them, talking with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 18, 13, 5, 'them, telling them stories from the Bible and other good books, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 18, 14, 5, 'teach them to put away their things, and help you in the home, you can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 18, 15, 5, 'build them up in a constructive way. Then you won''t have to do much');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 18, 16, 5, 'correction. But if you leave them alone frequently, because you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 18, 17, 5, 'always busy doing your own things, then you will find that they get into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 18, 18, 5, 'trouble easily and end up doing many wrong things - and need to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 18, 19, 5, 'disciplined. So spend time with your children, especially when they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 18, 20, 5, 'young. If your top priority is your children, then correction will not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 18, 21, 5, 'often be needed. You will then discover that they will be able to handle');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 18, 22, 5, 'pressures in their adolescent years and make the right decisions,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 18, 23, 5, 'because you worked hard to lay a good foundation in their younger years.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 18, 24, 5, 'The golden rule about correction is: Never correct your children in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 18, 25, 5, 'anger. If you are angry when spanking your children, you will end up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 18, 26, 5, 'spanking them much harder than they deserve. If there are marks on your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 18, 27, 5, 'child''s body, then your spanking has been too hard. I know that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 18, 28, 5, 'overcoming anger is easier said than done. But we can ask the Lord to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 19, 1, 5, 'help us to overcome it and to discipline our children in a godly way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 19, 2, 5, 'Spanking however must be reserved as final form of punishment, when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 19, 3, 5, 'every other method has not worked. Withholding privileges from them is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 19, 4, 5, 'good way to discipline too - for example, by giving them a "Time out"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 19, 5, 5, 'period, when they are told to sit quietly somewhere, or to lie down in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 19, 6, 5, 'their bed for 10 or 15 minutes. When this period is over, and they have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 19, 7, 5, 'calmed down, you can explain to them why you gave them that ''Time-out''.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 19, 8, 5, 'We must also bear in mind that children forget instructions very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 19, 9, 5, 'quickly. So we will have to keep on reminding them. Don''t scold them and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 19, 10, 5, 'blame them unnecessarily, imagining that they have the mind of an adult.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 19, 11, 5, 'We must also be consistent. For example, if you tell them not to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 19, 12, 5, 'something, and they disobey you, and they find that you don''t take note');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 19, 13, 5, 'of their disobedience, then you are being inconsistent. Then they will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 19, 14, 5, 'continue to do such wrong things. They must know that you are aware of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 19, 15, 5, 'their disobedience and that you take it seriously. Children will try and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 19, 16, 5, 'take advantage of us, when there are visitors in the home. You should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 19, 17, 5, 'take the children aside at such times, and talk to them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 19, 18, 5, 'We should not keep on reminding our children about their past mistakes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 19, 19, 5, 'The Lord''s mercies are new every morning - and our mercies should also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 19, 20, 5, 'be likewise.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 19, 21, 5, 'Don''t always be a stickler for laws and rules. At times, you must be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 19, 22, 5, 'willing to compromise and say, "I will let you go this time. I will give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 19, 23, 5, 'you another chance".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 19, 24, 5, 'When my husband was away from home (sometimes for five weeks at a time),');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 19, 25, 5, 'there were many different issues I had to deal with in my children. Some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 19, 26, 5, 'of their disobediences were not serious and so I talked with them and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 19, 27, 5, 'dealt with them, then and there. But others were more serious. So I kept');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 19, 28, 5, 'a note-book in which I would write down those disobediences - matters');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 20, 1, 5, 'that I felt I needed to speak to them a little more about later. I told');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 20, 2, 5, 'them that that I would have to tell their Dad about those matters when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 20, 3, 5, 'he returned. But I didn''t want them to look forward to Dad''s return with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 20, 4, 5, 'dread, as if a policeman was coming to deal with them. I wanted them to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 20, 5, 5, 'look forward to his return with joy, knowing that he would be coming');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 20, 6, 5, 'back with chocolates and gifts for them. So I would take out the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 20, 7, 5, 'note-book a few days before my husband returned and talk individually to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 20, 8, 5, 'them, and describe all their disobediences to them. Then I would explain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 20, 9, 5, 'to them the seriousness of each offence. They would always say they were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 20, 10, 5, 'sorry for each item of disobedience. So I would strike out those items');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 20, 11, 5, 'one by one. Finally, there were no items left! Although these were not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 20, 12, 5, 'major matters of disobedience, I went through the items one by one with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 20, 13, 5, 'them, because I wanted them to take the matter of obedience more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 20, 14, 5, 'seriously thereafter.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 20, 15, 5, 'After they had learnt to write, when they were disobedient, I would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 20, 16, 5, 'sometimes ask them to write down 20 times (or 100 times) on a sheet of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 20, 17, 5, 'paper, that they would not commit that particular act of disobedience');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 20, 18, 5, 'again. I hoped thereby that they would recognize that I was not going to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 20, 19, 5, 'ignore their acts of disobedience. As a by-product, I think their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 20, 20, 5, 'handwriting also improved!!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 20, 21, 5, 'If some matter of disobedience was important for my husband to know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 20, 22, 5, 'about, then when we were all sitting around the dinner table, I would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 20, 23, 5, 'bring it up and relate the incident, without saying who did it! Then my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 20, 24, 5, 'husband would speak words of correction and reinforce what I had said to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 20, 25, 5, 'them earlier. That helped a lot. I wanted to maintain discipline in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 20, 26, 5, 'home; and I wanted my children to know that disobedience was a serious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 20, 27, 5, 'matter. But I didn''t want to be like a strict school-teacher or judge. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 20, 28, 5, 'wanted them to experience forgiveness just as God has forgiven us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 21, 1, 5, 'Sometimes, my husband would discipline the children by restricting them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 21, 2, 5, 'from playing cricket for a day - and cricket was their favourite game!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 21, 3, 5, 'Children are under law but they must also taste grace from us. If we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 21, 4, 5, 'govern them only by the rule of law, they can end up being rebellious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 21, 5, 5, 'against us, when they are older. They will wait to leave home and be on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 21, 6, 5, 'their own and then they will do whatever they like. I wanted my children');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 21, 7, 5, 'to love our home and to see it as a place of refuge in a cruel world,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 21, 8, 5, 'and to always look forward eagerly to coming home to be with us, their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 21, 9, 5, 'parents.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 21, 10, 5, 'Our greatest need as parents is for wisdom. We must ask the Lord to show');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 21, 11, 5, 'us where we have been too strict with our children and where we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 21, 12, 5, 'been too lenient. And in their adolescent years especially, we must deal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 21, 13, 5, 'with them always with great wisdom, patience and love.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 21, 14, 5, 'The most important requirement to build a godly home is for husband and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 21, 15, 5, 'wife to pray -individually and together, seeking God''s help in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 21, 16, 5, 'everything. We should pray whenever possible - and we can do so at all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 21, 17, 5, 'times of the day, silently in our hearts. We need to pray especially');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 21, 18, 5, 'when our children are facing problems. When we are united with our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 21, 19, 5, 'husbands, our prayers will be answered. My husband and I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 21, 20, 5, 'experienced many wonderful answers to our prayers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 21, 21, 5, 'Family prayer must never be turned into a ritual that our children do as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 21, 22, 5, 'a routine matter. That can become boring and they can get fed up with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 21, 23, 5, 'it. They must see that prayer is talking to our Heavenly Father just as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 21, 24, 5, 'freely and as joyfully as they talk to us, their parents.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 21, 25, 5, 'And finally: Whenever there is unrest in your heart due to any cause -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 21, 26, 5, 'and that can be often - ask the Lord to help you overcome it quickly and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 21, 27, 5, 'to come to rest. If you don''t deal with it quickly, disunity and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 21, 28, 5, 'disharmony will come into your home - and that will open the door for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 22, 1, 5, 'Satan to come in and cause confusion. And then it will be your children');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 22, 2, 5, 'who will suffer most of all. So, if you love your children, be quick to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 22, 3, 5, 'deal with disunity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 22, 4, 5, 'It is only the Lord Who can help us build godly homes. And He stands');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 22, 5, 5, 'ever ready to help us build such homes - homes that are a foretaste of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 22, 6, 5, 'heaven itself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 22, 7, 5, 'May it be so for all of us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 22, 8, 5, 'All praise and glory be to Him alone.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 22, 9, 5, 'Share');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 22, 10, 5, 'Who Am I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 22, 11, 5, 'Our Message');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 22, 12, 5, 'Resources');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 22, 13, 5, 'Study Series');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 22, 14, 5, 'About us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('encouragement_for_mothers', 22, 15, 5, 'CHRISTIAN FELLOWSHIP CHURCH');
INSERT INTO books VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 'A Good Foundation', 'Zac Poonen', 'A Guide to lay a good and strong foundation before you start your life journey, foundation which will not be shaken in storms and rain.', 'a_good_foundation.jpg', 48, 1327, '2026-09-01T09:55:52.043Z');
INSERT INTO book_chapters VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 1, 'Chapter 0 Introduction', 1, 1, 2, 4);
INSERT INTO book_chapters VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 2, 'Chapter 1 Repentance', 2, 5, 10, 13);
INSERT INTO book_chapters VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 3, 'Chapter 2 Faith', 10, 14, 14, 2);
INSERT INTO book_chapters VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 4, 'Chapter 3 Election and Justification', 14, 3, 16, 18);
INSERT INTO book_chapters VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 5, 'Chapter 4 Discipleship', 16, 19, 20, 18);
INSERT INTO book_chapters VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 6, 'Chapter 5 Baptism in water', 20, 19, 24, 20);
INSERT INTO book_chapters VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 7, 'Chapter 6 Baptism in the Holy Spirit', 24, 21, 28, 24);
INSERT INTO book_chapters VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 8, 'Chapter 7 Sanctification', 28, 25, 35, 8);
INSERT INTO book_chapters VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 9, 'Chapter 8 God''s Word and Prayer', 35, 9, 38, 21);
INSERT INTO book_chapters VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 10, 'Chapter 9 Fellowship and the Church', 38, 22, 43, 18);
INSERT INTO book_chapters VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 11, 'Chapter 10 The End of this Age', 43, 19, 48, 11);
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 1, 1, 1, 'Chapter 0 Introduction');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 1, 2, 1, 'The gospel is the good news that man can now live as God originally');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 1, 3, 1, 'intended him to. The one who surrenders totally to the claims of Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 1, 4, 1, 'can live a life of constant triumph. Yet many who have accepted Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 1, 5, 1, 'as their Saviour do not enter into this glorious life that the gospel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 1, 6, 1, 'offers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 1, 7, 1, 'Why not? The reason very often is that a good foundation was not laid at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 1, 8, 1, 'the beginning of their Christian life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 1, 9, 1, 'Our life after we are born again can be compared to a house being built.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 1, 10, 1, 'We all know that the most important part of a house is its foundation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 1, 11, 1, 'If there is a crack on the third floor, the cause can usually be traced');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 1, 12, 1, 'to a faulty foundation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 1, 13, 1, 'It is the same with our lives. Years after we have trusted in Christ, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 1, 14, 1, 'can suffer the consequences of a faulty foundation laid at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 1, 15, 1, 'beginning.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 1, 16, 1, 'The New Testament promises us a life of triumph over sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 1, 17, 1, 'See God''s promise in Romans 6:14:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 1, 18, 1, 'It also commands us to live a life of continual joy, and one totally');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 1, 19, 1, 'free from anxiety. See Philippians 4:4, 6');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 1, 20, 1, 'Remember that God commands only what He will enable us to do.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 1, 21, 1, 'So His commands are in a sense promises of what He can give us grace to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 1, 22, 1, 'achieve! The above commands are therefore a promise that God can enable');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 1, 23, 1, 'us to live a life of perpetual joy and one totally free from anxiety.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 1, 24, 1, 'There are many more glorious promises like these in the New Testament.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 1, 25, 1, 'But the ones we''ve mentioned will suffice to show that the gospel is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 1, 26, 1, 'good news indeed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 1, 27, 1, 'Yet the sad truth is that most Christians who claim to have accepted the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 1, 28, 1, 'gospel do not live the type of life described in the above verses.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 2, 1, 1, 'The purpose of this book is to enable you to lay a good foundation in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 2, 2, 1, 'your life, so that God''s full purpose for your life can be accomplished.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 2, 3, 1, 'Read on then and let the Holy Spirit speak to your heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 2, 4, 1, 'This could be the beginning of a new chapter in your life altogether....');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 2, 5, 2, 'Chapter 1 Repentance');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 2, 6, 2, 'Jesus said that the right way to enter His sheepfold (His kingdom) was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 2, 7, 2, 'through the door. But He said that some would try to come in by climbing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 2, 8, 2, 'over the wall (John 10:1).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 2, 9, 2, 'The way that God has laid down for man to be saved is by repentance and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 2, 10, 2, 'faith in the Lord Jesus Christ. That is the only way. God can never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 2, 11, 2, 'accept a man who tries to climb in any other way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 2, 12, 2, 'John the Baptist who came to prepare the way of the Lord preached');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 2, 13, 2, 'repentance. That was the only way that the nation of Israel could be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 2, 14, 2, 'prepared to receive Jesus as their Saviour. There is no other way for us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 2, 15, 2, 'either.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 2, 16, 2, 'Most of today''s believers don''t seem to have the depth or the dedication');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 2, 17, 2, 'or the power that the early Christians had.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 2, 18, 2, 'What do you think is the reason for this?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 2, 19, 2, 'The primary reason is that they haven''t repented properly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 2, 20, 2, 'They have believed in Christ all right. But they have believed without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 2, 21, 2, 'repenting first. And so their conversion has been shallow.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 2, 22, 2, 'Just look at these words of a well-known hymn:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 2, 23, 2, '"The vilest offender who truly believes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 2, 24, 2, 'Is that really true - that the vilest offender can receive a pardon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 2, 25, 2, 'merely by "truly believing?"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 2, 26, 2, 'Doesn''t he need to repent first?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 2, 27, 2, 'You may say that true faith involves repentance too. But unless that is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 2, 28, 2, 'explained to the vilest offender, he can go away thinking that he is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 3, 1, 2, 'born again just because he believed. And he can go away deceived.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 3, 2, 2, 'The message Jesus Himself preached was: "Repent and believe in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 3, 3, 2, 'gospel" (Mark 1:15). He commanded His apostles to preach the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 3, 4, 2, 'message (Luke 24:47). And that''s exactly what they did (Acts 20:21).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 3, 5, 2, 'The Word of God is very clear on this. Repentance and faith cannot be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 3, 6, 2, 'separated if you want to be well and truly converted. God has joined');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 3, 7, 2, 'these two together. And what God has joined together no man should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 3, 8, 2, 'separate.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 3, 9, 2, 'Repentance and faith are actually the first two elements of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 3, 10, 2, 'foundation of the Christian life (Hebrews 6:1). If you haven''t repented');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 3, 11, 2, 'properly, then your foundation is bound to be faulty. And then, of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 3, 12, 2, 'course, the whole of your Christian life will be shaky.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 3, 13, 2, 'The Bible says that "the fear of the Lord is the beginning (or the ABC)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 3, 14, 2, 'of wisdom" (Proverbs 9:10). And if we really fear the Lord, we''ll "turn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 3, 15, 2, 'away from sin" (Proverbs 3:7).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 3, 16, 2, 'So those who haven''t repented and turned from sin, haven''t learnt even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 3, 17, 2, 'the ABC of the Christian life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 3, 18, 2, 'If you have repented, you must ensure that you have repented genuinely.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 3, 19, 2, 'For Satan has his counterfeit repentance too, with which he deceives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 3, 20, 2, 'people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 3, 21, 2, 'Satan knows that most people live by just one commandment that says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 3, 22, 2, '"You shall not get caught!" And so he teaches them ways and means to sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 3, 23, 2, 'without getting caught by anyone.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 3, 24, 2, 'Even a thief will feel sorry if he is caught. But that''s not repentance.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 3, 25, 2, 'We see some examples in the Bible of those whose repentance was false.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 3, 26, 2, 'When King Saul disobeyed God, he admitted to Samuel that he had sinned.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 3, 27, 2, 'But he didn''t want the people to know that. He still sought man''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 3, 28, 2, 'honour. He hadn''t really repented. He was just sorry that he was caught');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 4, 1, 2, '(1 Samuel 15:24-30). That was the difference between him and King David');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 4, 2, 2, 'who openly acknowledged his sin when he fell (Psalm 51).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 4, 3, 2, 'King Ahab was another like Saul. He felt really sorry for himself when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 4, 4, 2, 'Elijah warned him that God was going to judge him. He even put sackcloth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 4, 5, 2, 'on himself and mourned for his sins (1 Kings 21:27-29). But he didn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 4, 6, 2, 'really repent. He was just afraid of God''s judgement.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 4, 7, 2, 'Judas Iscariot''s case is a clear example of false repentance. When he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 4, 8, 2, 'saw that Jesus had been condemned to death he felt bad and said, "I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 4, 9, 2, 'sinned" (Matthew 27:3-5). But he made his confession to the priests -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 4, 10, 2, 'just like some do even today! He didn''t repent - even though he may have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 4, 11, 2, 'felt sad about what he had done. If he had truly repented, he would have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 4, 12, 2, 'gone to the Lord in brokenness and asked for forgiveness. But he didn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 4, 13, 2, 'do that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 4, 14, 2, 'There''s a lot that we can learn from these examples - as to what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 4, 15, 2, 'repentance is not!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 4, 16, 2, 'True repentance is a "turning to God from idols" (1 Thessalonians 1:9).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 4, 17, 2, 'Idols are not just those made of wood and stone found in heathen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 4, 18, 2, 'temples. There are equally dangerous idols that people worship that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 4, 19, 2, 'don''t look so ugly. These are the idols of pleasure, comfort, money,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 4, 20, 2, 'one''s reputation, wanting one''s own way etc.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 4, 21, 2, 'All of us have worshipped these for many years. To repent means to stop');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 4, 22, 2, 'worshipping these idols, and to turn away from them to God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 4, 23, 2, 'True repentance will involve our whole personality - our mind, our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 4, 24, 2, 'emotions and our will.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 4, 25, 2, 'First of all, repentance means that we change our mind about sin and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 4, 26, 2, 'world. We realise that our sin has separated us from God. We also see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 4, 27, 2, 'that the whole way of life of this world is anti-God. And we want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 4, 28, 2, 'turn away from that God-dishonouring way of life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 5, 1, 2, 'Secondly, repentance involves our emotions. We feel sorrowful about the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 5, 2, 2, 'way we''ve lived (2 Corinthians 7:10). We hate ourselves for our past');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 5, 3, 2, 'actions; and more than that, we detest the greater evil that we see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 5, 4, 2, 'within us that no one else can see (Ezekiel 36:31).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 5, 5, 2, 'We weep and mourn that we have hurt God so much by the way we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 5, 6, 2, 'lived. That was the reaction of many great men in the Bible when they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 5, 7, 2, 'became aware of their sins. David (Psalm 51), Job (Job 42:6) and Peter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 5, 8, 2, '(Matthew 26:75) - all wept bitterly when they repented of their sins.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 5, 9, 2, 'Both Jesus and the apostles have encouraged us to weep and mourn for our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 5, 10, 2, 'sins (Matthew 5:4; James 4:9). That is the way back to God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 5, 11, 2, 'Finally, repentance involves our will. We have to yield our stubborn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 5, 12, 2, 'self-will - ''wanting our own way'' - and make Jesus Lord of our lives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 5, 13, 2, 'That means that we are willing to do whatever God wants us to do from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 5, 14, 2, 'now on, whatever the cost and however humiliating it may be.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 5, 15, 2, 'The prodigal son came back home to his father as a broken, yielded young');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 5, 16, 2, 'man who was willing to do anything that his father told him to. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 5, 17, 2, 'true repentance (Luke 15:11-24).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 5, 18, 2, 'We don''t have to confess to God every single sin that we''ve ever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 5, 19, 2, 'committed. It would be impossible to remember all of them in any case.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 5, 20, 2, 'The prodigal son didn''t do that. All that he said was, "Father, I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 5, 21, 2, 'sinned." And that''s all we need to say too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 5, 22, 2, 'But remember that Judas Iscariot also said, "I have sinned." There was a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 5, 23, 2, 'world of difference however, between his confession and the prodigal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 5, 24, 2, 'son''s confession. God doesn''t listen only to the words we say. He senses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 5, 25, 2, 'the spirit behind the words, and deals with us accordingly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 5, 26, 2, 'John the Baptist told the Pharisees to bring forth fruit in keeping with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 5, 27, 2, 'repentance (Matthew 3:8). If we have truly repented, it will change our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 5, 28, 2, 'whole way of life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 6, 1, 2, 'One of the first things that we should do, after we have repented is to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 6, 2, 2, 'make restitution for the wrongs that we have done in our life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 6, 3, 2, 'We read of Zaccheus in the gospels, that he was convicted of his sins as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 6, 4, 2, 'soon as Jesus entered his house (Luke 19:1-10). Zaccheus was a man who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 6, 5, 2, 'loved money. But he understood what repentance involved. He knew that if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 6, 6, 2, 'he was going to be a disciple of Jesus he would have to make amends for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 6, 7, 2, 'all the wrongs that he had done in his life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 6, 8, 2, 'That meant a great loss of money to him, for he had cheated so many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 6, 9, 2, 'people. But he decided to be wholehearted in his repentance. And so he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 6, 10, 2, 'told the Lord that he would give away half his money to the poor and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 6, 11, 2, 'then give back four times what he had cheated others of.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 6, 12, 2, 'It was only when Zaccheus said that he would make restitution, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 6, 13, 2, 'Jesus said that salvation had come to that home. A willingness to make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 6, 14, 2, 'restitution is one of the evidences of true salvation (Luke 19:1-10).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 6, 15, 2, 'The wise man, in the parable that Jesus spoke, dug deep and laid his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 6, 16, 2, 'foundation on the rock beneath the layers of sand (Luke 6:48). The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 6, 17, 2, 'foolish man also built his house in the same area. But he didn''t dig');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 6, 18, 2, 'deep enough. He laid his foundation superficially on the sand.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 6, 19, 2, 'We could apply this parable to true and false repentance. Only when we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 6, 20, 2, 'take pains to make a thorough restitution in our life do we dig deep.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 6, 21, 2, 'When we come to Christ, it is good to take time right at the beginning,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 6, 22, 2, 'to sort out all matters relating to our unconverted life that need to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 6, 23, 2, 'settled. If we are superficial here, and gloss over some matters, we''ll');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 6, 24, 2, 'find that our foundation remains weak and our house collapses one day.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 6, 25, 2, 'What does restitution involve?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 6, 26, 2, 'It means that if you have cheated the government of taxes etc., you must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 6, 27, 2, 'now repay those taxes. Sometimes it may not be possible to repay the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 6, 28, 2, 'amount to the department concerned. But where there is a will, there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 7, 1, 2, 'will always be a way - if we want to obey God! We can buy Post Office');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 7, 2, 2, 'stamps or railway tickets and destroy them, to ensure that the money we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 7, 3, 2, 'owe to the government does indeed go back to it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 7, 4, 2, 'If you''ve cheated people, you should also apologise to them while making');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 7, 5, 2, 'the repayment. Tell them also how the change came in your life! If you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 7, 6, 2, 'find you don''t have the courage to do this all by yourself, take a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 7, 7, 2, 'brother along with you, while making the restitution.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 7, 8, 2, 'If you are not able to settle all your debts at once, never mind. Do it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 7, 9, 2, 'in instalments. But make a beginning - even if it be with only five');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 7, 10, 2, 'rupees! God accepted Zaccheus the day he decided to pay back his debts -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 7, 11, 2, 'not after he had completed all his repayments!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 7, 12, 2, 'If you have cheated someone and you don''t know where he is living now,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 7, 13, 2, 'then you should return the money to God - the original Owner of all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 7, 14, 2, 'money. That was the rule that God laid down for the Israelites (Numbers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 7, 15, 2, '5:6-8).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 7, 16, 2, 'We should in any case, never have any money with us that has been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 7, 17, 2, 'obtained unlawfully. God can never bless that sort of money.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 7, 18, 2, 'If we have hurt or injured someone, in some way that doesn''t involve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 7, 19, 2, 'money, then we should go and apologise to him and ask for his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 7, 20, 2, 'forgiveness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 7, 21, 2, 'I know of brothers who have saved money for months and then emptied out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 7, 22, 2, 'their bank accounts in order to make restitution to the government for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 7, 23, 2, 'taxes and customs duties that they had cheated on. And God has blessed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 7, 24, 2, 'them with something better than a large bank account!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 7, 25, 2, 'I also know of others who have carefully calculated the fares for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 7, 26, 2, 'times when they travelled without purchasing tickets on buses and trains');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 7, 27, 2, 'and who have paid the amounts back. Those who are faithful in the small');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 7, 28, 2, 'things are the ones who will do great things for God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 8, 1, 2, 'I also know of some who have gone to university authorities with their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 8, 2, 2, 'degree certificates and acknowledged that they had cheated in their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 8, 3, 2, 'final examinations. They were ready to sacrifice their degrees if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 8, 4, 2, 'necessary, in order to have a clear conscience. God has usually given');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 8, 5, 2, 'such believers favour in the eyes of the authorities, so that they have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 8, 6, 2, 'been pardoned.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 8, 7, 2, 'But it may not always work out like that. In your case, God may allow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 8, 8, 2, 'the university to take away your certificate! But then that will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 8, 9, 2, 'God''s perfect will for you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 8, 10, 2, 'I know of one brother who wrote a letter of apology to someone from whom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 8, 11, 2, 'he had stolen a small stamp many years earlier. A theft is a theft,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 8, 12, 2, 'however small the value of the stolen article may be. It is in little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 8, 13, 2, 'matters that our faithfulness is tested.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 8, 14, 2, 'I am not suggesting that you now torture yourself, trying to rake up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 8, 15, 2, 'from your memory the little wrongs that you''ve done in your past life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 8, 16, 2, 'No. You don''t have to do that. God will remind you of what needs to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 8, 17, 2, 'settled; and you need to settle only what God reminds you of.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 8, 18, 2, 'There will also be cases where you can do absolutely nothing, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 8, 19, 2, 'the wrong done is so complicated. In such cases, all you can do is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 8, 20, 2, 'express your sorrow to God and ask for His mercy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 8, 21, 2, 'We shouldn''t in any case, allow Satan to keep us feeling guilty and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 8, 22, 2, 'condemned forever, just because we can''t set a certain matter right. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 8, 23, 2, 'understands our situation fully - and He doesn''t torture us. If you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 8, 24, 2, 'a willing mind, God will accept whatever you are able to do - even if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 8, 25, 2, 'that be nothing (2 Corinthians 8:12).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 8, 26, 2, 'Praise God that He is so merciful!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 8, 27, 2, 'God will honour those who honour Him (1 Samuel 2:30). And one way that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 8, 28, 2, 'we honour Him is by being faithful in the little things.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 9, 1, 2, 'If we don''t make restitution, we''ll be dragging a chain with us, all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 9, 2, 2, 'through our life. God will test us to see if we value a clear conscience');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 9, 3, 2, 'more than our money, our honour, our degrees and even our job.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 9, 4, 2, 'Many fail the test. But, praise God, that there is a remnant, in every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 9, 5, 2, 'generation, of those who love God more than anything on earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 9, 6, 2, 'Repentance also includes forgiving others who have harmed us in any way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 9, 7, 2, 'Jesus said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 9, 8, 2, 'He went on to say that we must forgive others from our heart, and not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 9, 9, 2, 'just superficially (Matthew 18:35).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 9, 10, 2, 'It is impossible to be forgiven by God if we don''t forgive others');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 9, 11, 2, 'wholeheartedly and completely.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 9, 12, 2, 'We may not be able to forget what others have done to us. But we can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 9, 13, 2, 'certainly refuse to think about the evil they did, whenever we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 9, 14, 2, 'tempted to do so.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 9, 15, 2, 'Perhaps someone has harmed you so badly that you really find it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 9, 16, 2, 'difficult to forgive him wholeheartedly. Ask God to help you to forgive;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 9, 17, 2, 'and you''ll find that He is more than willing to give you both the desire');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 9, 18, 2, 'and the power to forgive anyone.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 9, 19, 2, 'When we think of the millions of sins that God has forgiven us so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 9, 20, 2, 'freely, it shouldn''t be difficult for us to forgive others in the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 9, 21, 2, 'way. It''s when we don''t forgive others that Satan gets power over us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 9, 22, 2, '"Forgive," says Paul, "so that no advantage be taken of us by Satan" (2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 9, 23, 2, 'Corinthians 2:10, 11).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 9, 24, 2, 'There''s one more area where matters need to be settled - and that''s the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 9, 25, 2, 'area of contact with Satan and evil spirits.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 9, 26, 2, 'If you have dabbled in astrology, idol worship, palm-reading, black');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 9, 27, 2, 'magic etc., or if you have been interested in rock-music and harmful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 9, 28, 2, 'drugs, you need to renounce these contacts with Satan - even though some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 10, 1, 2, 'of these contacts may have been unconsciously made.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 10, 2, 2, 'The first thing you should do is destroy (not sell, but destroy) all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 10, 3, 2, 'idols, occult books and amulets etc., that you may have (See Acts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 10, 4, 2, '19:19). Then you should pray saying,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 10, 5, 2, 'Then tell Satan directly,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 10, 6, 2, 'James 4:7 says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 10, 7, 2, 'Thus Satan won''t have a hold on you any longer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 10, 8, 2, 'If we continue to walk with the Lord, He''ll give us more and more light');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 10, 9, 2, 'on different areas of our life. It could be in the worldliness of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 10, 10, 2, 'dress or speech or in the harshness of our tone of voice, or in the way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 10, 11, 2, 'we are being defiled through our reading habits etc. Thus we''ll discover');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 10, 12, 2, 'new areas constantly where we need to repent and be cleansed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 10, 13, 2, 'We should walk this way of constant repentance all our days.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 10, 14, 3, 'Chapter 2 Faith');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 10, 15, 3, 'Repentance is the first part of the foundation of the Christian life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 10, 16, 3, 'Faith is the second.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 10, 17, 3, 'To have faith in God means to trust Him and to believe what He has said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 10, 18, 3, 'in His Word, in spite of what our feelings may tell us or what other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 10, 19, 3, 'people may tell us. It''s as simple as that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 10, 20, 3, 'Here are three facts concerning God:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 10, 21, 3, 'Is it difficult to believe these facts? No. Well, then it shouldn''t be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 10, 22, 3, 'difficult for us to trust God with all our hearts.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 10, 23, 3, 'When Eve listened to the voice of Satan in the garden of Eden, it was a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 10, 24, 3, 'failure of faith. She didn''t believe that God''s commands were for her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 10, 25, 3, 'good. She disobeyed God because she didn''t have faith in His perfect');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 10, 26, 3, 'love for her.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 10, 27, 3, 'God has many wonderful things to give us. All His gifts are gifts of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 10, 28, 3, 'grace. But we need faith to receive those gifts.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 11, 1, 3, 'The Bible says we are saved "by grace through faith" (Ephesians 2:8).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 11, 2, 3, 'Grace is God''s Hand reaching down to us loaded with the blessings of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 11, 3, 3, 'heaven. Faith is our hand reaching up and taking those blessings from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 11, 4, 3, 'God''s Hand.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 11, 5, 3, 'God offers us the forgiveness of our sins first of all. If we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 11, 6, 3, 'repented, then all we have to do now is reach out our hand and take what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 11, 7, 3, 'God offers us freely. We don''t have to work for it or pay for it. It has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 11, 8, 3, 'already been paid for at Calvary. All we have to do now is to say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 11, 9, 3, '"Thank You, Father" and take it. That''s faith.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 11, 10, 3, 'When we don''t take what God offers, we are actually insulting Him. We''re');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 11, 11, 3, 'despising His gifts. Perhaps we think that God is teasing us, the way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 11, 12, 3, 'some people tease children by stretching out their hands with gifts and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 11, 13, 3, 'then pulling their hand back just when the children reach out to take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 11, 14, 3, 'those gifts! But God isn''t mean or evil, like such people. He is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 11, 15, 3, 'loving Father. He really longs to give us good gifts.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 11, 16, 3, 'That''s why the Bible says that "without faith it is impossible to please');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 11, 17, 3, 'God" - whatever else we may do (Hebrews 11:6).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 11, 18, 3, 'If we trust God, He will not only forgive our sins, He''ll set us free');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 11, 19, 3, 'from sin''s power as well.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 11, 20, 3, 'How do we get faith? There''s only one way. The Bible says that "faith');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 11, 21, 3, 'comes from hearing, and hearing by the Word of Christ" (Romans 10:17).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 11, 22, 3, 'In other words, as we allow God to speak to us through His Word, we''ll');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 11, 23, 3, 'get faith. That''s how our faith increases too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 11, 24, 3, 'Through God''s Word, we know that Christ died for our sins and rose');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 11, 25, 3, 'again; and that if we repent and trust in Him we can immediately receive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 11, 26, 3, 'a full and free forgiveness for our sins. The Holy Spirit then bears');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 11, 27, 3, 'witness to our heart that this is true. Through this two-fold witness of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 11, 28, 3, 'God''s Word and the Holy Spirit we can be absolutely sure that God has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 12, 1, 3, 'forgiven us and that we are indeed His children.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 12, 2, 3, 'God wants us to have perfect assurance in our hearts that we are indeed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 12, 3, 3, 'His children. He never wants us to be in doubt about that fact.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 12, 4, 3, 'Satan will try his best to keep us in doubt. But we need never be in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 12, 5, 3, 'doubt, for God has given us many promises in His Word to assure us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 12, 6, 3, 'Just look at these promises: Jesus said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 12, 7, 3, 'The Lord says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 12, 8, 3, 'To put our faith in God''s promises can be likened to our putting our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 12, 9, 3, 'feet on a strong bridge while crossing a river. If the bridge is strong,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 12, 10, 3, 'it doesn''t matter even if our feet are weak. What is strong faith then?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 12, 11, 3, 'It is trusting in a strong God and in His promises.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 12, 12, 3, 'Our feelings are often very deceptive. We should never trust them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 12, 13, 3, 'There''s a parable of three men called Fact, Faith and Feeling who were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 12, 14, 3, 'walking one behind the other on a narrow wall. Fact walked in front and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 12, 15, 3, 'Faith walked behind him and Feeling came along at the rear. As long as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 12, 16, 3, 'Faith kept his eyes on Fact in front of him, everything went smoothly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 12, 17, 3, 'Feeling followed behind him perfectly. But as soon as Faith turned');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 12, 18, 3, 'around to see how Feeling was coming along, he tumbled and fell to his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 12, 19, 3, 'death; and Feeling fell to his death too. Fact, however kept walking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 12, 20, 3, 'along the wall undisturbed!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 12, 21, 3, 'The lesson in the parable is obvious. God''s Word consists of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 12, 22, 3, 'unchangeable facts. If our faith looks steadfastly at God''s Word alone,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 12, 23, 3, 'there is no danger of our ever falling; and feelings will follow in due');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 12, 24, 3, 'course. But if we begin to look at our feelings, then we can easily');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 12, 25, 3, 'tumble and fall into discouragement and condemnation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 12, 26, 3, 'The Bible says that we must confess what we believe.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 12, 27, 3, 'The confession of our mouth is important. To confess God''s Word means to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 12, 28, 3, 'say the same thing that God says. That shouldn''t be difficult for it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 13, 1, 3, 'just means saying "Amen" ("It shall be so") to God''s promises.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 13, 2, 3, 'The first time the word ''believe'' is used in Scripture is in Genesis');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 13, 3, 3, 'chapter 15. There we read that God told Abram, when he was childless,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 13, 4, 3, 'that he would have as many children as the stars in the sky. And it says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 13, 5, 3, 'that "Abram believed the LORD" (verse 6). The Hebrew word for "believe"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 13, 6, 3, 'there, is "aman" from which we get the word "Amen", meaning "It shall be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 13, 7, 3, 'so." So all that Abram did was to say "Amen" to God''s promise.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 13, 8, 3, 'That is what true faith is - saying "Amen" to God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 13, 9, 3, 'We read later that Abram called himself by the new name that God gave');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 13, 10, 3, 'him - Abraham (which meant "the father of a multitude"). Sarah, his wife');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 13, 11, 3, 'was still childless. But that didn''t make any difference to Abraham. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 13, 12, 3, 'still called himself the father of a multitude, because he believed what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 13, 13, 3, 'God had said (Genesis 17:5).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 13, 14, 3, 'That is the confession of faith - confessing what God has said, even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 13, 15, 3, 'when we haven''t seen the fulfilment of the promise.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 13, 16, 3, 'That''s all that God asks us to do - to say the same thing that He has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 13, 17, 3, 'said in His Word. When we confess God''s promises, we express our faith');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 13, 18, 3, 'in God; and then God is able to work on our behalf.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 13, 19, 3, 'It''s by the "word of our testimony" that we overcome Satan (Revelation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 13, 20, 3, '12:11). Satan, the accuser, is always trying to rob us of the assurance');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 13, 21, 3, 'of our salvation and of our boldness before God. We must quote the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 13, 22, 3, 'promises of God directly to Satan if we want to overcome him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 13, 23, 3, 'Jesus Himself overcame Satan by quoting Scripture to him, saying "It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 13, 24, 3, 'written....It is written....It is written" (Matthew 4:1-11).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 13, 25, 3, 'If we doubt God''s Word, we make God a liar. But when we confess God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 13, 26, 3, 'Word to Satan, we take sides with God and His Word against Satan and his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 13, 27, 3, 'lies. In that way we also tell Satan that we believe that what God has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 13, 28, 3, 'said is true, in spite of what our circumstances and our feelings may be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 14, 1, 3, 'telling us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 14, 2, 3, 'This is the confession of faith.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 14, 3, 4, 'Chapter 3 Election and Justification');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 14, 4, 4, 'God''s election of His children and His justifying them are two glorious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 14, 5, 4, 'truths that the New Testament teaches us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 14, 6, 4, 'The Bible says that God elected us to be His children according to his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 14, 7, 4, 'foreknowledge (1 Peter 1:1, 2). This means that He knew from all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 14, 8, 4, 'eternity past those who were going to be His children.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 14, 9, 4, 'The Bible also says that God chose us in Christ "before the foundation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 14, 10, 4, 'of the world" (Ephesians 1:4). Long before Adam was even created, God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 14, 11, 4, 'knew each of us by name as His children, and our names were there in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 14, 12, 4, '"the book of life" (Revelation 13:8).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 14, 13, 4, 'These are facts that should give us tremendous security.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 14, 14, 4, 'The Bible says that the foundation of God on which we stand has a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 14, 15, 4, 'twofold seal. On the God-ward side, it reads, "The Lord knows those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 14, 16, 4, 'are His." On the man-ward side, it reads, "Let everyone who names the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 14, 17, 4, 'name of the Lord abstain from wickedness" (2 Timothy 2:19).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 14, 18, 4, 'God knew His children from before the foundation of the world. But WE');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 14, 19, 4, 'know that we are His children only when we actually repent and turn to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 14, 20, 4, 'Him. Our finite minds cannot grasp how God elects His children and yet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 14, 21, 4, 'gives man freedom to choose Him or not. These are like two parallel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 14, 22, 4, 'lines that don''t seem to meet in our understanding. But as the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 14, 23, 4, 'mathematical definition of parallel lines is, they meet at infinity - in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 14, 24, 4, 'the infinite mind of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 14, 25, 4, 'Someone has expressed it like this: As you walked along the road of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 14, 26, 4, 'life, you found an open door one day, with these words written over it,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 14, 27, 4, '"Whoever repents and believes in Christ may enter in here and obtain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 14, 28, 4, 'eternal life." You entered in. On looking back, you saw written over the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 15, 1, 4, 'very door through which you had just entered, the words "You were chosen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 15, 2, 4, 'by God in Christ, before the foundation of the world."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 15, 3, 4, 'Forgiveness of our sins takes away the guilt of the past. But that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 15, 4, 4, 'doesn''t make us perfectly holy. And so, we still can''t stand before a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 15, 5, 4, 'perfectly holy God. And so God had to do something more for us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 15, 6, 4, 'He had to justify us!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 15, 7, 4, 'Justification means that God has put the perfect righteousness of Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 15, 8, 4, 'to our credit. The result is that our standing before God is now as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 15, 9, 4, 'perfect as Christ''s! That''s an astounding fact! And its true! It''s like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 15, 10, 4, 'millions of rupees being put into a bank account in the name of a beggar');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 15, 11, 4, '- money that he didn''t earn or deserve, but that has been given to him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 15, 12, 4, 'as a free gift.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 15, 13, 4, 'To be justified is to be accepted by God just as if we had never sinned');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 15, 14, 4, 'in our whole life and just as if we were perfectly righteous in our life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 15, 15, 4, 'at present.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 15, 16, 4, 'God''s Word says, "Therefore being justified by faith, we have obtained');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 15, 17, 4, 'our introduction by faith into this grace in which we stand" (Romans');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 15, 18, 4, '5:2). Now we can come boldly into God''s presence without any fear or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 15, 19, 4, 'hesitation at any time. God Himself has opened the way for that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 15, 20, 4, 'In the garden of Eden, as soon as Adam and Eve sinned, they felt guilty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 15, 21, 4, 'and ashamed and covered themselves with fig-leaves. God took away their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 15, 22, 4, 'fig-leaves, killed an animal and clothed them with its skin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 15, 23, 4, 'Those fig-leaves are a picture of our own good works. Like fig-leaves,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 15, 24, 4, 'our good works cannot cover our nakedness before God; for the Bible says');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 15, 25, 4, 'that even our best works are like filthy rags in God''s sight (Isaiah');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 15, 26, 4, '64:6).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 15, 27, 4, 'That slain animal was a picture of Christ put to death for our sins. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 15, 28, 4, 'skin was a picture of the perfect righteousness of Christ given to cover');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 16, 1, 4, 'us (Genesis 3:7, 21).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 16, 2, 4, 'Justification is a free gift of God. No man can be justified before God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 16, 3, 4, 'on the basis of his own works. One extreme of error therefore is to say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 16, 4, 4, '"Let us seek to be righteous in order to be justified by God."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 16, 5, 4, 'There is however an opposite extreme of error too. And that is to say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 16, 6, 4, '"If we are elected and justified, then it doesn''t matter even if we sin');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 16, 7, 4, 'now." Those who take sin lightly, because they think that God has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 16, 8, 4, 'elected and justified them, would thereby prove that they are not among');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 16, 9, 4, 'God''s elect at all. (Compare Romans 4:5 with James 2:24).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 16, 10, 4, 'Once we are sure that we have been elected and justified, Satan''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 16, 11, 4, 'accusations will lose their effect on us. For if "God is for us, who can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 16, 12, 4, 'be against us?" (Romans 8:31). Never again in our life need we feel that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 16, 13, 4, 'we are condemned or rejected by God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 16, 14, 4, '"Who will bring a charge against God''s elect? God is the One Who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 16, 15, 4, 'justifies" (Romans 8:33). Hallelujah!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 16, 16, 4, 'Such is the good news of the gospel! It is not surprising then that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 16, 17, 4, 'Satan has kept many believers from knowing that they have been elected');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 16, 18, 4, 'and justified by God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 16, 19, 5, 'Chapter 4 Discipleship');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 16, 20, 5, 'When Jesus told His apostles to go into every nation and to make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 16, 21, 5, 'disciples, they had no doubt in their minds as to what He meant.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 16, 22, 5, '(Matthew 28:19). For He had already explained what it meant to be His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 16, 23, 5, 'disciple.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 16, 24, 5, 'Luke 14:25-35 reveals most clearly the three conditions of discipleship.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 16, 25, 5, 'There Jesus speaks about a man who having laid a foundation for a tower,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 16, 26, 5, 'couldn''t complete it, because he was unable to pay the cost of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 16, 27, 5, 'construction (verses 28-30). That proves that it does cost something to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 16, 28, 5, 'be a disciple. Jesus told us to sit down first and count that cost');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 17, 1, 5, 'before even starting to build.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 17, 2, 5, 'God doesn''t want us to wait for many years after our sins are forgiven,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 17, 3, 5, 'before understanding what discipleship really means. Jesus told people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 17, 4, 5, 'about the cost of discipleship as soon as they came to Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 17, 5, 5, 'He said that a believer who was unwilling to be a disciple was as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 17, 6, 5, 'useless to God as salt that had lost its savour (Luke 14:35).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 17, 7, 5, 'The first condition of discipleship is that we must cut off the natural,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 17, 8, 5, 'inordinate love that we have for our relatives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 17, 9, 5, 'Jesus said "If anyone comes to Me, and does not hate his own father and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 17, 10, 5, 'mother and wife and children and brothers and sisters, yes and even his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 17, 11, 5, 'own life, he cannot be My disciple " (Luke 14:26).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 17, 12, 5, 'Those are strong words. What does it mean to ''hate''? To hate is the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 17, 13, 5, 'as to kill (1 John 3:15). What we are asked to put to death here is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 17, 14, 5, 'natural affection that we have for our relatives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 17, 15, 5, 'Does that mean that we are not to love them? No. It certainly doesn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 17, 16, 5, 'mean that. When we give up our human affection for them, God will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 17, 17, 5, 'replace it with Divine love. Our love for our relatives will then be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 17, 18, 5, 'pure - in the sense that God will always be first in our affections, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 17, 19, 5, 'not our relatives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 17, 20, 5, 'Many don''t obey God because they are afraid to offend their father,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 17, 21, 5, 'mother or wife etc. The Lord demands first place in our life. And if we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 17, 22, 5, 'don''t give Him that place, we can''t be His disciples at all.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 17, 23, 5, 'Look at Jesus'' own example. Although He loved His widowed mother, yet He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 17, 24, 5, 'never allowed her to influence Him away from the perfect will of His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 17, 25, 5, 'Father, even in small matters. We see an example of this at the marriage');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 17, 26, 5, 'at Cana where Jesus refused to act on His mother''s prompting (John 2:4).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 17, 27, 5, 'Jesus also taught us how to ''hate'' our brothers. When Peter tried to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 17, 28, 5, 'turn Him away from going to the cross, He turned around and rebuked him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 18, 1, 5, 'with some of the sharpest words that He ever uttered. He said, "Get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 18, 2, 5, 'behind Me, Satan! You are a stumbling-block to Me" (Matthew 16:23).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 18, 3, 5, 'Peter had made his suggestion with a lot of human love. But Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 18, 4, 5, 'rebuked him, because what he had suggested was contrary to the Father''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 18, 5, 5, 'will.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 18, 6, 5, 'The Father was always supreme in Jesus'' affections. He expects us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 18, 7, 5, 'have the same attitude too. After His resurrection He asked Peter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 18, 8, 5, 'whether he loved Him more than everything else on earth (John 21:15-17).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 18, 9, 5, 'Only those who love the Lord supremely are given responsibilities in His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 18, 10, 5, 'church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 18, 11, 5, 'The leader of the Ephesian church was in danger of being rejected');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 18, 12, 5, 'because he had lost his initial devotion for the Lord (Revelation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 18, 13, 5, '2:1-5).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 18, 14, 5, 'If we can say, like the psalmist, "Whom have I in heaven, Lord, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 18, 15, 5, 'Thee? And besides Thee I desire nothing on earth," then we have truly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 18, 16, 5, 'fulfilled the first condition of discipleship (Psalm 73:25).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 18, 17, 5, 'The love that Jesus demands from us is not the emotional, sentimental,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 18, 18, 5, 'human affection that expresses itself in singing stirring songs of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 18, 19, 5, 'devotion to Him. No. If we love Him, we''ll obey Him (John 14:21).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 18, 20, 5, 'The second condition of discipleship is that we must hate our own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 18, 21, 5, 'self-life. Jesus said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 18, 22, 5, 'He amplified that further by saying,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 18, 23, 5, 'This is one of the least understood of all of Jesus'' teachings.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 18, 24, 5, 'He said that a disciple would have to "deny himself and take up his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 18, 25, 5, 'cross daily" (Luke 9:23). More important than reading our Bible or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 18, 26, 5, 'praying daily, we have to deny ourselves and take up our cross daily. To');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 18, 27, 5, 'deny our Self is the same as to hate our own life - the life that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 18, 28, 5, 'have inherited from Adam. To take up the cross is to put that Self-life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 19, 1, 5, 'to death. We have to hate that life first, before we can slay it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 19, 2, 5, 'Our self-life is the main enemy of the life of Christ. The Bible calls');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 19, 3, 5, 'this ''the flesh''. The flesh tempts us to seek our own gain, our own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 19, 4, 5, 'honour, our own pleasure, our own way etc. If we are honest, we''ll have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 19, 5, 5, 'to admit that many of our best actions are corrupted by evil motives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 19, 6, 5, 'that arise from our Self-life. Unless we hate this flesh, we will never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 19, 7, 5, 'be able to follow the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 19, 8, 5, 'This is why Jesus spoke so much about hating (or losing) our life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 19, 9, 5, 'In fact, this phrase is repeated six times in the gospels (Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 19, 10, 5, '10:39; 16:25; Mark 8:35; Luke 9:24; 14:26; John 12:25). This is the one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 19, 11, 5, 'saying of our Lord that is repeated most often in the gospels. Yet it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 19, 12, 5, 'the least preached about and the least understood!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 19, 13, 5, 'To hate your own life is to give up seeking your own rights and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 19, 14, 5, 'privileges, to stop seeking your own reputation, to give up your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 19, 15, 5, 'ambitions and interests, and to stop seeking your own way etc. You can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 19, 16, 5, 'be a disciple of Jesus, only if you are willing to go this way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 19, 17, 5, 'The third condition of discipleship is that we must give up all our own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 19, 18, 5, 'possessions. Jesus said, "No one of you can be My disciple who does not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 19, 19, 5, 'give up all his own possessions" (Luke 14:33).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 19, 20, 5, 'Our possessions are what we possess as our own. To give them all up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 19, 21, 5, 'means that we no longer consider anything as our own.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 19, 22, 5, 'We see an illustration of this in the life of Abraham. Isaac was his own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 19, 23, 5, 'son - his possession. One day God asked him to offer Isaac as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 19, 24, 5, 'sacrifice. And Abraham laid Isaac on the altar and was ready to slay');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 19, 25, 5, 'him. But God intervened and told him that the sacrifice was not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 19, 26, 5, 'necessary, because he had proved his willingness to obey (Genesis 22).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 19, 27, 5, 'After that, Abraham recognised that even though he had Isaac in his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 19, 28, 5, 'house, he no longer possessed him as his own. Isaac now belonged to God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 20, 1, 5, 'This is what it means to give up all our possessions. All that we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 20, 2, 5, 'must be laid on the altar and given up to God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 20, 3, 5, 'God may allow us to use some of those things. But we can''t think of them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 20, 4, 5, 'as our own any more. Even if we are living in our own house, we must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 20, 5, 5, 'think of the house as God''s; and that He has allowed us to stay in it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 20, 6, 5, 'rent-free! This is true discipleship.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 20, 7, 5, 'Have we done that with all our possessions? Our possessions include our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 20, 8, 5, 'bank-account, property, job, qualifications, gifts and talents, wife and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 20, 9, 5, 'children and everything else that we value on this earth. We have to lay');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 20, 10, 5, 'them all on the altar if we want to be true disciples.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 20, 11, 5, 'God wants us to love Him with all our heart. That''s the meaning of ''the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 20, 12, 5, 'pure heart'' mentioned in Matthew 5:8. It''s not enough to have a clean');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 20, 13, 5, 'conscience. A clean conscience only means that we have given up sin. A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 20, 14, 5, 'pure heart is one that has given up everything!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 20, 15, 5, 'And so we see that true discipleship involves a radical change of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 20, 16, 5, 'attitude towards:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 20, 17, 5, 'Unless we face these issues squarely right at the beginning of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 20, 18, 5, 'Christian life, it will be impossible to lay a good foundation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 20, 19, 6, 'Chapter 5 Baptism in water');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 20, 20, 6, 'One of the last things Jesus commanded His disciples before ascending up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 20, 21, 6, 'to heaven was to:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 20, 22, 6, 'Only those who were willing to become disciples were to be baptized. No');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 20, 23, 6, 'one else.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 20, 24, 6, 'When babies were brought to Jesus, He laid His hands on their heads and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 20, 25, 6, 'blessed them (See Mark 10:13-16). However, when repentant adults came to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 20, 26, 6, 'Him, He baptized them through His disciples (See John 4:1, 2).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 20, 27, 6, 'But today what do we see in many ''churches''? Quite the opposite. Babies');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 20, 28, 6, 'are baptized; and hands are laid on the heads of the adults');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 21, 1, 6, '(''confirmation'')! This is the exact opposite of what Jesus did.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 21, 2, 6, 'On the day of Pentecost, when many were convicted of their sin, Peter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 21, 3, 6, 'told them to "repent and be baptized." The record goes on to say that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 21, 4, 6, '"those who received his word were baptized" (Acts 2:38, 41).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 21, 5, 6, 'It is clear that only those who were capable of intelligently receiving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 21, 6, 6, 'God''s Word and of repentance were baptized. And that''s how it was in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 21, 7, 6, 'every single instance recorded in the ''Acts of the Apostles''.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 21, 8, 6, 'Romans 6:1-7 clearly explains the meaning of baptism. There we are told');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 21, 9, 6, 'that our old man was crucified with Christ and that in baptism we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 21, 10, 6, 'buried with Christ into death. The old man is the mind that we had in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 21, 11, 6, 'our unconverted days that wanted to sin. That has been crucified with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 21, 12, 6, 'Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 21, 13, 6, 'We don''t have to understand this first, before we live in the reality of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 21, 14, 6, 'it. We can just believe what God says. If God''s Word says that our old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 21, 15, 6, 'man was crucified with Christ, then we believe it, just as surely as we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 21, 16, 6, 'believe God''s Word when it says that Christ Himself was crucified on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 21, 17, 6, 'Calvary''s hill. Both these truths are accepted by faith.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 21, 18, 6, 'The old man and the flesh are not the same. The flesh is the Self-life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 21, 19, 6, 'within us, that opposes the will of God. We all have to carry this with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 21, 20, 6, 'us until our dying day. We could compare the flesh to a gang of robbers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 21, 21, 6, 'seeking to enter our house. The old man is like an unfaithful servant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 21, 22, 6, 'inside our house who constantly opened the door for the robbers to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 21, 23, 6, 'enter. It is the unfaithful servant who has now been killed. The robbers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 21, 24, 6, 'however are hale and hearty! But now we have a new servant, the new man,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 21, 25, 6, 'who seeks to keep the door shut, against these robbers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 21, 26, 6, 'In baptism, we testify to the death and burial of the old man (the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 21, 27, 6, 'desire to sin), and to being raised up with Christ so that we might');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 21, 28, 6, 'henceforth "walk in newness of life" (Romans 6:4).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 22, 1, 6, 'The flood in Noah''s day is a type of baptism too (1 Peter 3:20, 21). The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 22, 2, 6, 'whole world was destroyed by God through that flood. Noah went through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 22, 3, 6, 'it in the ark and came out of it into a brand new world. The old world');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 22, 4, 6, 'and everything in it were all buried under the flood. This is what we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 22, 5, 6, 'testify to in baptism as well - that our old relationship with the world');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 22, 6, 6, '(and that includes worldly fashions and worldly friends etc.), has all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 22, 7, 6, 'now been cut off and that we are now coming out of the water into a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 22, 8, 6, 'brand new world.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 22, 9, 6, 'We now come to the question: HOW should we be baptized?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 22, 10, 6, 'The word ''baptism'' is not an English word. The New Testament was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 22, 11, 6, 'originally written in Greek; and the word ''baptism'' is derived from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 22, 12, 6, 'Greek word ''bapto'', which means ''to cover wholly with a fluid'' or ''to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 22, 13, 6, 'immerse''. And this is exactly what baptism meant to the early apostles -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 22, 14, 6, 'an immersion in water. Sprinkling water on someone''s head is certainly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 22, 15, 6, 'not baptism.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 22, 16, 6, 'When Philip baptized the Ethiopian eunuch, it is written that "they both');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 22, 17, 6, 'went down into the water and....came up out of the water" (Acts 8:38,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 22, 18, 6, '39).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 22, 19, 6, 'At Jesus'' baptism too, we read similar words - that He came up out of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 22, 20, 6, 'the water, after being baptized (Mark 1:10).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 22, 21, 6, 'In the New Testament, baptism was always done by immersion. Since');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 22, 22, 6, 'baptism is a burial, it is obvious that only immersion can typify that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 22, 23, 6, 'accurately. For, after all, we don''t bury people by sprinkling sand on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 22, 24, 6, 'their heads, but by putting them under the ground completely!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 22, 25, 6, 'This also makes it clear that only those in whom the old man is dead');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 22, 26, 6, 'qualify for baptism - those who do not want to sin any more. For after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 22, 27, 6, 'all, only dead people can be buried! It''s a crime to bury a man who is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 22, 28, 6, 'not dead!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 23, 1, 6, 'Jesus commanded us to baptize "in the Name of the Father, Son and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 23, 2, 6, 'Holy Spirit" (Matthew 28:19). The Name is singular because God is One.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 23, 3, 6, 'But Jesus revealed that although God is One, He exists in Three Persons,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 23, 4, 6, 'Who are distinct from each other.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 23, 5, 6, 'It wasn''t the Father who died for our sins, nor was it the Holy Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 23, 6, 6, 'It was the Son. When Jesus ascended up to heaven, He sat on the right');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 23, 7, 6, 'hand of the Father, not the right hand of the Holy Spirit. Likewise, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 23, 8, 6, 'One He sent to His disciples to be their Helper was the Holy Spirit, not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 23, 9, 6, 'the Father. All this may sound elementary. But it is essential that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 23, 10, 6, 'don''t confuse the three Persons in the Godhead and their unique');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 23, 11, 6, 'ministries in our redemption.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 23, 12, 6, 'In the Acts of the Apostles, we read again and again that the apostles');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 23, 13, 6, 'baptized people in the Name of Jesus Christ (Acts 2:38 etc.). How does');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 23, 14, 6, 'this fit in with Jesus'' command in Matthew 28:19?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 23, 15, 6, 'When two apparently contradictory statements are found in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 23, 16, 6, 'Scriptures, we''ll find on a closer study that both statements are true.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 23, 17, 6, 'In order to make plain that the Father, Son and Holy Spirit are not a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 23, 18, 6, 'heathen trinity, the apostles identified the Son as Jesus Christ. So');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 23, 19, 6, 'they baptized people in the name of "the Father, the Son the Lord Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 23, 20, 6, 'Christ and the Holy Spirit." This was called baptism in the Name of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 23, 21, 6, 'Jesus Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 23, 22, 6, 'Baptism should be the first step of obedience in the life of a disciple,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 23, 23, 6, 'leading on to a lifetime of obedience - and this obedience must be the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 23, 24, 6, 'obedience of faith and not the obedience of reason.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 23, 25, 6, 'If Jesus had leaned upon His own reason, He would never have gone to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 23, 26, 6, 'John the Baptist for baptism. For His reason would have given Him many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 23, 27, 6, 'arguments against being baptized - especially since He had never sinned.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 23, 28, 6, 'John himself could not understand why Jesus needed to be baptized. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 24, 1, 6, 'Jesus laid aside the arguments of reason and simply obeyed the voice of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 24, 2, 6, 'the Holy Spirit (Matthew 3:15).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 24, 3, 6, '"Trust in the Lord with all your heart and do not lean on your own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 24, 4, 6, 'understanding," says the Word (Proverbs 3:5). Reason is the Number One');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 24, 5, 6, 'enemy of faith - because human reason cannot grasp spiritual truths.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 24, 6, 6, 'When we get baptized, the last part of our body to go under the water is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 24, 7, 6, 'the upper part of our head. That is symbolic! The authority of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 24, 8, 6, 'reason is the part of us that is most difficult to put to death! The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 24, 9, 6, 'children of Adam live by what their reason tells them. In baptism, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 24, 10, 6, 'testify that we have died to that way of life (of leaning on our own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 24, 11, 6, 'reason) and now live by faith in every word that proceeds from the mouth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 24, 12, 6, 'of God (Matthew 4:4; Romans 1:17).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 24, 13, 6, 'Baptism is slighted by some Christians as a trivial matter. Naaman');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 24, 14, 6, 'initially despised Elisha''s command to go and dip himself seven times in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 24, 15, 6, 'the River Jordan to be healed of his leprosy. But it was when he obeyed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 24, 16, 6, 'that simple command that he was healed (2 Kings 5:10-14). It is in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 24, 17, 6, 'little things that God tests our obedience.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 24, 18, 6, 'Obedience to God must never be delayed. If your old man has indeed died,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 24, 19, 6, 'then he must be buried straight-away. It''s a crime not to bury a man who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 24, 20, 6, 'is dead!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 24, 21, 7, 'Chapter 6 Baptism in the Holy Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 24, 22, 7, 'There are two needs that we all have. The first relates to the past -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 24, 23, 7, 'the forgiveness of our sins. The second relates to the future -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 24, 24, 7, 'enablement to live a life that pleases God. Our first need is taken care');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 24, 25, 7, 'of by the death of Christ. To meet the second, God gives us the power of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 24, 26, 7, 'His Holy Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 24, 27, 7, 'We could never have met that first need by ourselves. God had to meet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 24, 28, 7, 'it. It''s likewise with the second. We cannot live a life that pleases');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 25, 1, 7, 'God or that fulfils all His will, in our own strength. Some are wise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 25, 2, 7, 'enough to acknowledge this right at the beginning of their Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 25, 3, 7, 'life and so they seek for God''s power straight-away. Others discover it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 25, 4, 7, 'the hard way - by trying and failing repeatedly for many years and then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 25, 5, 7, 'turning to God for His power.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 25, 6, 7, 'Unfortunately there are still others who after falling and failing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 25, 7, 7, 'repeatedly, finally resign themselves to a life of defeat, believing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 25, 8, 7, 'that it is impossible to live victoriously in this life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 25, 9, 7, 'This also applies to our serving the Lord and being a witness for Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 25, 10, 7, 'Most believers realise, immediately after their conversion, that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 25, 11, 7, 'should be witnesses for the Lord. But they often find themselves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 25, 12, 7, 'tongue-tied and powerless. Some accept this as an unfortunate trait of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 25, 13, 7, 'their personality, and give up all hope of ever becoming powerful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 25, 14, 7, 'witnesses for Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 25, 15, 7, 'Others realise that God has promised them the power of the Holy Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 25, 16, 7, 'And so they seek God for this power and receive it. And they are filled');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 25, 17, 7, 'with boldness and endued with supernatural gifts to be fiery, unashamed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 25, 18, 7, 'and effective witnesses for Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 25, 19, 7, 'It is one thing to be born of the Spirit. That''s how we become children');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 25, 20, 7, 'of God. But it''s quite another thing to be baptized (immersed) in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 25, 21, 7, 'Holy Spirit. That''s how we become empowered to be what God wants us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 25, 22, 7, 'be and to do what God wants us to do.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 25, 23, 7, 'Under the old covenant, the Holy Spirit came only upon certain people,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 25, 24, 7, 'to enable them to fulfil a specific task for God. Under the new');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 25, 25, 7, 'covenant, however, the Holy Spirit can be received by all. He has come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 25, 26, 7, 'to show us the glory of Jesus and to transform us into His likeness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 25, 27, 7, 'John the Baptist pointed to two ministries that Jesus would fulfil - one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 25, 28, 7, 'was to take away sins and the other was to baptize people in the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 26, 1, 7, 'Spirit (John 1:29, 33). We need to experience both of these.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 26, 2, 7, 'The first promise in the New Testament is:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 26, 3, 7, 'The second promise in the New Testament is:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 26, 4, 7, 'It''s significant that the New Testament opens with these two promises.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 26, 5, 7, 'This was the beginning of a new era in God''s dealings with man - the new');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 26, 6, 7, 'covenant. This is then our double birthright as children of God - to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 26, 7, 7, 'saved from our sins and to be baptized in the Holy Spirit. And God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 26, 8, 7, 'certainly wants to give us our full birthright - not just half of it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 26, 9, 7, 'The first five books of the New Testament each begin with the promise of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 26, 10, 7, 'the baptism in the Holy Spirit (Matthew 3:11; Mark 1:8; Luke 3:16; John');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 26, 11, 7, '1:33; Acts 1:5). Yet so many Christians have neglected to claim this for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 26, 12, 7, 'themselves.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 26, 13, 7, 'The Holy Spirit is pictured in the New Testament as a river flowing from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 26, 14, 7, 'the throne of God and falling to earth (Revelation 22:1; Acts 2:33). To');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 26, 15, 7, 'be baptised in the Holy Spirit is to be immersed under this waterfall.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 26, 16, 7, 'Jesus said that all those who thirsted could come to Him and receive the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 26, 17, 7, 'Holy Spirit so that rivers of living water could flow out from their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 26, 18, 7, 'innermost being (John 7:37).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 26, 19, 7, 'The experience of the average believer, however, is more akin to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 26, 20, 7, 'hand-pump - a life of struggling and pumping up a few drops of blessing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 26, 21, 7, 'from a dry heart. Yet it need not be like that. If our dryness would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 26, 22, 7, 'only drive us to the Lord, things could be different. To have rivers of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 26, 23, 7, 'blessing flowing out from us to all who come in touch with us is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 26, 24, 7, 'will of God for our lives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 26, 25, 7, 'The first step towards this is to acknowledge our need. Many believers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 26, 26, 7, 'are caught up in foolish arguments about words. But it is power that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 26, 27, 7, 'need, not correct terminology. What is the use having our terminology');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 26, 28, 7, 'right, if we are as dry as a bone? It''s far better to be honest and to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 27, 1, 7, 'come to God, confessing that rivers of blessing are not flowing out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 27, 2, 7, 'through us. Having taken that first step, we can then trust God to grant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 27, 3, 7, 'us what we ask for.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 27, 4, 7, 'All we need in order to be baptized in the Holy Spirit are thirst (an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 27, 5, 7, 'intense desire, born out of a great longing to glorify God) and faith');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 27, 6, 7, '(the absolute confidence that God will give us what He has promised).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 27, 7, 7, 'Let us ask then, with thirst and with faith, for this power, and God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 27, 8, 7, 'will not deny us our request.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 27, 9, 7, 'The first apostles had forsaken everything to follow Jesus. But they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 27, 10, 7, 'still had to wait until they were baptized in the Holy Spirit before');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 27, 11, 7, 'they could go out and fulfil their God-ordained ministry.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 27, 12, 7, 'Jesus Himself needed to be anointed with the Holy Spirit and power');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 27, 13, 7, 'before He could begin His public ministry (Acts 10:38). If even He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 27, 14, 7, 'needed this anointing, how much more we need it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 27, 15, 7, 'Jesus told His apostles to wait in Jerusalem until they were ''clothed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 27, 16, 7, 'with power'' (Luke 24:49). And just before He ascended up to heaven, He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 27, 17, 7, 'told them again that when the Holy Spirit came upon them they would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 27, 18, 7, '''receive power'' (Acts 1:8). On the day of Pentecost, the Holy Spirit was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 27, 19, 7, 'poured out on them. And those cowardly men were immediately transformed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 27, 20, 7, 'into bold, fiery witnesses for the Lord (Acts 2:1-4). What they received');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 27, 21, 7, 'was exactly what Jesus had told them that they would receive - power.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 27, 22, 7, 'What we need in order to live the Christian life is not just a doctrine');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 27, 23, 7, 'but the power of God in our life. The baptism in the Holy Spirit gives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 27, 24, 7, 'us power for godliness as well as power for service.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 27, 25, 7, 'The Holy Spirit is likened to the wind in the Scriptures; and the wind');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 27, 26, 7, 'blows in different ways at different times. "So is everyone who is born');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 27, 27, 7, 'of the Spirit", Jesus said (John 3:8). Each believer''s experience will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 27, 28, 7, 'therefore be different in the external details of being baptised in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 28, 1, 7, 'Holy Spirit. The inner enduement with power however, is what really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 28, 2, 7, 'matters.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 28, 3, 7, 'God gives us ''gifts of power'' through the Spirit so that we can serve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 28, 4, 7, 'Him effectively in building up the church as the body of Christ. He is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 28, 5, 7, 'the One however Who determines which gift each of us should have.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 28, 6, 7, 'Prophecy (the ability to preach powerfully to challenge, encourage and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 28, 7, 7, 'comfort) is the most useful of these gifts (1 Corinthians 14:1-5). There');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 28, 8, 7, 'are also gifts of serving, teaching, healing, exhorting, giving money,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 28, 9, 7, 'leadership, etc., (Romans 12:6-8; 1 Corinthians 12:8-10). The ability to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 28, 10, 7, 'speak in unknown languages (''the gift of tongues'') is another gift that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 28, 11, 7, 'God gives, to enable us to pray and praise Him, without the limitations');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 28, 12, 7, 'of our mind and our mother-tongue.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 28, 13, 7, 'If you have not been baptised in the Spirit, seek God and claim your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 28, 14, 7, 'birthright. Ask Him also to give you an assurance of this. "If you being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 28, 15, 7, 'evil know how to give good gifts to your children, how much more shall');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 28, 16, 7, 'your heavenly Father give the Holy Spirit to those who ask him....You do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 28, 17, 7, 'not have because you do not ask" (Luke 11:13; James 4:2).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 28, 18, 7, 'Let us then cry out to God with all our hearts, and say like Jacob said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 28, 19, 7, 'to God at Peniel, "I will not let You go until You bless Me" (Genesis');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 28, 20, 7, '32:26).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 28, 21, 7, 'There is no partiality with God. What He has done for others He will do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 28, 22, 7, 'for you. Even today, He is a rewarder of those who diligently seek Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 28, 23, 7, '(Hebrews 11:6). He is more than eager to give the Holy Spirit in His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 28, 24, 7, 'fullness to all who desire to glorify Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 28, 25, 8, 'Chapter 7 Sanctification');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 28, 26, 8, 'The twofold message of the gospel is summed up in the words of Jesus to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 28, 27, 8, 'the woman caught in sin:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 28, 28, 8, 'Justification is the starting line of the Christian race and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 29, 1, 8, 'sanctification is the track on which the race is run. The word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 29, 2, 8, '''sanctify'' means to be set apart. And so sanctification is the process');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 29, 3, 8, 'of being set apart increasingly from sin, the world and our own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 29, 4, 8, 'self-life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 29, 5, 8, 'The whole purpose of our coming to Christ is in order that we might be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 29, 6, 8, 'sanctified - just as the whole purpose of an athlete coming to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 29, 7, 8, 'starting line of a race is to take part in the race. It''s pointless an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 29, 8, 8, 'athlete joining others at the starting line if he doesn''t intend taking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 29, 9, 8, 'part in the race itself!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 29, 10, 8, 'Most of us came to Christ at first with some selfish motive - to get');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 29, 11, 8, 'some benefit for ourselves - perhaps healing, or deliverance from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 29, 12, 8, 'hellfire. But God still received us, in spite of that selfish motive.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 29, 13, 8, 'The father of the prodigal son loved him so much, that he welcomed him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 29, 14, 8, 'back, even though the son had come home only to fill his stomach. That''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 29, 15, 8, 'how good God is!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 29, 16, 8, 'But it would be really sad if we continued in the Christian life, only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 29, 17, 8, 'because we wanted to go to heaven. As we understand more of God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 29, 18, 8, 'purpose for our lives, we should long to fulfil that totally. Paul''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 29, 19, 8, 'prayer for the Christians at Ephesus was that they would have the eyes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 29, 20, 8, 'of their heart opened to see ''the hope of His calling'' (Ephesians 1:18).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 29, 21, 8, 'Romans 8:29, 30 tells us what the hope of His calling is.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 29, 22, 8, 'God''s purpose is that we might be transformed into the likeness of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 29, 23, 8, 'Jesus. That is what sanctification is all about - to become like Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 29, 24, 8, 'increasingly. This is the Christian race that we are exhorted to run,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 29, 25, 8, 'fixing our eyes on Jesus Who has run the same race ahead of us (Hebrews');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 29, 26, 8, '12:1, 2).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 29, 27, 8, 'The first step in this race is to stop sinning consciously. Under the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 29, 28, 8, 'Law, there was no exhortation to stop sinning. But under the new');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 30, 1, 8, 'covenant, all the apostles are agreed that the twofold message of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 30, 2, 8, 'gospel is exactly as Jesus put it: freedom from condemnation and ceasing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 30, 3, 8, 'from sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 30, 4, 8, 'After explaining justification by faith in Romans 5, Paul asks this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 30, 5, 8, 'question, "What shall we say then? Are we to continue in sin that grace');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 30, 6, 8, 'may increase?" (Romans 6:1). And again (with greater force this time),');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 30, 7, 8, '"What then? Shall we sin even once?" (Romans 6:15 - Literal). The answer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 30, 8, 8, 'in both cases is a resounding ''No''. We should seek not to sin even once,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 30, 9, 8, 'any more.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 30, 10, 8, 'Does that sound like a heavy, burdensome message? It can be burdensome');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 30, 11, 8, 'only to those who want to keep on sinning! But it''s a joyful message of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 30, 12, 8, 'liberation to those who are sick and tired of sin''s captivity. Any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 30, 13, 8, 'prisoner would be delighted if he heard a message that he could be free.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 30, 14, 8, 'That wouldn''t sound burdensome to him, would it?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 30, 15, 8, 'Jesus was anointed to proclaim "release to the captives (of sin) and to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 30, 16, 8, 'set free those who are trodden down (by Satan)" (Luke 4:18).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 30, 17, 8, 'The glorious new-covenant promise is:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 30, 18, 8, 'The first step to victory is to believe that such a life is possible for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 30, 19, 8, 'you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 30, 20, 8, 'There is a difference between being tempted and sinning. The Bible says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 30, 21, 8, '"Each one is tempted when he is enticed by his own lust. Then when lust');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 30, 22, 8, 'has conceived, it gives birth to sin" (James 1:14, 15). Sin is not born');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 30, 23, 8, 'in our heart, until the desire of our flesh has been allowed to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 30, 24, 8, 'conceive. When Satan or the flesh flash a suggestion into our mind, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 30, 25, 8, 'are tempted. If our mind agrees with that temptation, then a conception');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 30, 26, 8, 'takes place and sin is born.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 30, 27, 8, 'To be tempted doesn''t make us evil. Even Jesus Himself was tempted. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 30, 28, 8, 'He never sinned even once in any way, and so He was totally pure.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 31, 1, 8, 'The Scripture says that Jesus was "made like His brethren in all things"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 31, 2, 8, 'and "tempted in ALL THINGS as we are" (Hebrews 2:17; 4:15). He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 31, 3, 8, 'tempted exactly like us, yet He never sinned.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 31, 4, 8, 'That may not sound very wonderful to some of us, because we may feel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 31, 5, 8, 'that Jesus, being God, could naturally overcome sin easily. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 31, 6, 8, 'remember, He had "emptied Himself" of the prerogatives of equality with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 31, 7, 8, 'God, when He came to earth (Philippians 2:6, 7). Although He was God,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 31, 8, 8, 'yet while He lived on earth as a man, He had access only to the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 31, 9, 8, 'power of the Holy Spirit that He offers us today. That''s why we are told');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 31, 10, 8, 'to run the race, "fixing our eyes on Jesus." In our "striving against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 31, 11, 8, 'sin" today, we can look at His example and be encouraged (Hebrews');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 31, 12, 8, '12:2-4). That''s because He overcame each temptation that we face, as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 31, 13, 8, 'Man too. Thus He has become a Forerunner and an Example for us to follow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 31, 14, 8, '(Hebrews 6:20).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 31, 15, 8, 'This is "the secret of godliness....- Christ came in the flesh ....and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 31, 16, 8, 'was declared righteous in the spirit" (1 Timothy 3:16). Although He had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 31, 17, 8, 'our flesh, He kept His spirit pure throughout His life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 31, 18, 8, 'This is what gives us hope that we too can overcome as He overcame. For');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 31, 19, 8, 'He has "inaugurated a new and living way through the flesh" for us, in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 31, 20, 8, 'which we can follow Him (Hebrews 10:20). This is the way of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 31, 21, 8, 'sanctification.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 31, 22, 8, 'We have already seen how the old man was like an unfaithful servant who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 31, 23, 8, 'allowed the thieves to enter the home. That old man however has been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 31, 24, 8, 'crucified, put off and buried. There is a new man now within us, who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 31, 25, 8, 'says, "Behold I have come to do Thy will, O God" (Hebrews 10:7).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 31, 26, 8, 'Yet we know that it''s possible for a disciple of Jesus to sin. But there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 31, 27, 8, 'is a difference between a disciple sinning and an unbeliever sinning,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 31, 28, 8, 'just as there is a difference between a cat falling into dirty water and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 32, 1, 8, 'a pig choosing to jump into the dirty water! The cat hates the dirty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 32, 2, 8, 'water, but may fall into it accidentally. The pig, however, loves it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 32, 3, 8, 'It''s all a question of nature. The disciple of Jesus has a new nature');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 32, 4, 8, 'that loves purity and hates sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 32, 5, 8, 'The old man wants to sin. The new man never wants to sin. But if the new');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 32, 6, 8, 'man is not strong enough, he may not be able to keep the door of his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 32, 7, 8, 'heart shut against the desires of the flesh. That''s not because he wants');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 32, 8, 8, 'those desires. No. But because he is not strong enough to resist them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 32, 9, 8, 'This may be, because he has not fed himself sufficiently on the Word of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 32, 10, 8, 'God, or because he has not strengthened himself through prayer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 32, 11, 8, 'So, there''s a difference between committing sin and falling into sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 32, 12, 8, 'It''s important to know this difference; for we can then avoid a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 32, 13, 8, 'unnecessary feelings of condemnation in our heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 32, 14, 8, 'The Bible says that "the one who practises sin (that is, one who keeps');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 32, 15, 8, 'on committing sin deliberately) is of the devil" (1 John 3:8). On the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 32, 16, 8, 'other hand, he writes to believers saying, "If anyone sins (that is, if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 32, 17, 8, 'one falls into sin accidentally), we have an Advocate with the Father,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 32, 18, 8, 'Jesus Christ the righteous; and He is the propitiation for our sins" (1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 32, 19, 8, 'John 2:1, 2).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 32, 20, 8, 'There is also a difference between falling into sin and having sin. To');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 32, 21, 8, 'have sin is to have unconscious sin in our personality - sin that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 32, 22, 8, 'ourselves are unaware of, even though others who are more mature than us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 32, 23, 8, 'may be able to notice it in us. But such unconscious sin need never make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 32, 24, 8, 'us feel guilty. For God''s Word says, "sin is not imputed when there is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 32, 25, 8, 'no law" (Romans 5:13). (This also means that God does not impute sin to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 32, 26, 8, 'us when there is no awareness of sin in our conscious mind).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 32, 27, 8, 'We shall have unconscious sin in us, until our dying day - to a lesser');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 32, 28, 8, 'and lesser degree, however, if we walk in the light. The Bible says, "If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 33, 1, 8, 'we say that we have no sin, we are deceiving ourselves," (1 John 1:8).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 33, 2, 8, 'One who says that he has no sin is actually claiming that he has already');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 33, 3, 8, 'become perfect like Christ. But God''s Word says that we shall "be like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 33, 4, 8, 'Him," only when He returns - not before that (1 John 3:2). Those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 33, 5, 8, 'claim to be totally sanctified and perfect already are therefore only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 33, 6, 8, 'deceiving themselves.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 33, 7, 8, 'Unconscious sin however needs to be cleansed; and "the blood of Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 33, 8, 8, 'Christ cleanses us from all (unconscious) sin" too, as long as we walk');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 33, 9, 8, 'in the light of God (1 John 1:7). So we can stand boldly now, in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 33, 10, 8, 'presence of an infinitely Holy God, without any fear.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 33, 11, 8, 'Such is the power of the blood of Christ to justify us. Hallelujah!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 33, 12, 8, 'We are told to come boldly "to the throne of grace, that we may receive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 33, 13, 8, 'mercy, and find grace to help in time of need" (Hebrews 4:16). Mercy and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 33, 14, 8, 'grace are not the same. Mercy refers to the forgiveness of our sins.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 33, 15, 8, 'That relates to our past. But we also need grace - for our time of need,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 33, 16, 8, 'in the future.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 33, 17, 8, 'Our time of need is when we are tempted, when we are about to fall -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 33, 18, 8, 'just like Peter, when he was about to sink in the sea of Galilee');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 33, 19, 8, '(Matthew 14:30). That''s when we should cry out for grace; and just as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 33, 20, 8, 'Jesus stretched out His hand immediately to hold Peter, we''ll find that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 33, 21, 8, 'we get grace too, so that we stand and don''t fall.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 33, 22, 8, 'There are wonderful promises in God''s Word that assure us that God will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 33, 23, 8, 'keep us from falling. Just look at some of these:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 33, 24, 8, 'First of all, God promises that He will never allow us to be tempted by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 33, 25, 8, 'any temptation that is too strong for us to overcome:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 33, 26, 8, 'God''s Word also says:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 33, 27, 8, 'With these and many other wonderful promises given us in God''s Word,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 33, 28, 8, 'there is no need for us to sin any more. Our life can henceforth be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 34, 1, 8, 'lived to do the will of God alone (as it says in 1 Peter 4:2).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 34, 2, 8, 'Jesus told His apostles to teach others to obey all that He had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 34, 3, 8, 'commanded (Matthew 28:20). One who loves the Lord will first of all seek');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 34, 4, 8, 'with all his heart to find out what those commandments are; and then he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 34, 5, 8, 'will seek to obey them (John 14:21).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 34, 6, 8, 'Under the Law, God gave man commandments, but not the power to obey');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 34, 7, 8, 'them. Why then did God give the Law? Only in order that man might');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 34, 8, 8, 'discover that he''s unable to come up to God''s standards, and thus see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 34, 9, 8, 'his need of a Saviour and a Helper. "The Law has become our tutor to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 34, 10, 8, 'lead us to Christ" (Galatians 3:24).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 34, 11, 8, 'But now God has made a new covenant with man. And He has given us, not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 34, 12, 8, 'only commandments, but also an Example in the person of our Lord Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 34, 13, 8, 'Christ. Jesus demonstrated by His earthly life that it is possible for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 34, 14, 8, 'us to obey all of God''s commandments.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 34, 15, 8, 'God has also promised under the new covenant to put His Laws into our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 34, 16, 8, 'minds and to write them upon our hearts (Hebrews 8:10). He does this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 34, 17, 8, 'through the Holy Spirit dwelling in us. The Holy Spirit is our Helper');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 34, 18, 8, 'Who not only shows us what the will of God is, but also gives us a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 34, 19, 8, 'desire to do that will and grace to obey all of it too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 34, 20, 8, 'God is the One Who is going to sanctify us entirely (1 Thessalonians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 34, 21, 8, '5:23). We can''t do it on our own. We have to depend on Him - for He is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 34, 22, 8, 'the One Who works in us giving us both the desire as well as the ability');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 34, 23, 8, 'to do His will. But we have to "work out our salvation with fear and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 34, 24, 8, 'trembling" (Philippians 2:12, 13). We have to work out what God works');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 34, 25, 8, 'in, for He hasn''t turned us into robots!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 34, 26, 8, 'God cleanses us from the guilt of sin. But we are commanded to "cleanse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 34, 27, 8, 'ourselves from all defilement of flesh and spirit, perfecting holiness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 34, 28, 8, 'in the fear of God" (2 Corinthians 7:1). We have to do this, as and when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 35, 1, 8, 'we get light on any defilement within us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 35, 2, 8, 'It is thus, as we "by the Spirit, put to death the deeds of the body"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 35, 3, 8, '(Romans 8:13) that the fruit of the Spirit - love, joy, peace, patience,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 35, 4, 8, 'kindness, goodness, faithfulness, gentleness and self-control - will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 35, 5, 8, 'become more and more manifest in us. This is what it means to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 35, 6, 8, 'transformed into the likeness of Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 35, 7, 8, 'Thus our path will become one of increasing light (Proverbs 4:18). This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 35, 8, 8, 'is the glorious way of sanctification that God has made for us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 35, 9, 9, 'Chapter 8 God''s Word and Prayer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 35, 10, 9, 'The two things that a new-born baby needs on birth, are food and air.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 35, 11, 9, 'It''s exactly the same with those who experience a spiritual birth. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 35, 12, 9, 'newborn child of God needs to eat and to breathe.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 35, 13, 9, 'God''s Word is to be his food, and prayer is to be his vital breath.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 35, 14, 9, 'A child needs milk to start with, but he needs solid food later on. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 35, 15, 9, 'Bible contains both milk and solid food. The milk is called "the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 35, 16, 9, 'elementary teaching about the Christ" (Hebrews 6:1); and the solid food');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 35, 17, 9, 'is called "the word of righteousness" (Hebrews 5:13).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 35, 18, 9, 'How soon we move on to solid food, depends on how quickly we obey any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 35, 19, 9, 'light that God gives us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 35, 20, 9, 'Our spiritual growth is dependent on faith and obedience.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 35, 21, 9, 'God has given us promises in His Word so that we can trust Him. He has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 35, 22, 9, 'also given us commands to obey. If we meditate on God''s Word regularly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 35, 23, 9, 'and trust and obey Him we will find that we are deeply rooted in God,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 35, 24, 9, 'like an evergreen tree that never withers. God will then be able to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 35, 25, 9, 'bless us in such a way that we prosper in everything we do (Psalm 1:2,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 35, 26, 9, '3).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 35, 27, 9, 'We can''t understand God''s Word by intellectual study alone. We need the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 35, 28, 9, 'revelation of the Holy Spirit. Jesus said that spiritual truths were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 36, 1, 9, 'hidden from the clever and the intelligent and revealed to babes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 36, 2, 9, '(Matthew 11:25).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 36, 3, 9, 'What do babes have, that clever, intelligent people don''t have?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 36, 4, 9, 'A pure heart!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 36, 5, 9, 'God looks at the heart and not at the head. He gives revelation to those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 36, 6, 9, 'who are humble and who tremble at His Word (Isaiah 66:2).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 36, 7, 9, 'Jesus said that only those who were willing to do the will of God would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 36, 8, 9, 'understand God''s Word (John 7:17).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 36, 9, 9, 'God''s Word is also the weapon that we use in our warfare against Satan.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 36, 10, 9, 'It is called "the sword of the Spirit" in Ephesians 6:17.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 36, 11, 9, 'Jesus Himself used this weapon with great effect, during the last three');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 36, 12, 9, 'temptations in the wilderness. Each time, he countered Satan''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 36, 13, 9, 'temptations with "It is written.... (Matthew 4:4, 7, 10).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 36, 14, 9, 'That''s how He overcame; and that''s how we can overcome too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 36, 15, 9, 'Satan is the Accuser. We must distinguish between his accusations and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 36, 16, 9, 'the conviction of the Holy Spirit. Satan always seeks to harass us and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 36, 17, 9, 'make us feel condemned by his accusations. The Holy Spirit''s conviction,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 36, 18, 9, 'on the other hand, is always gentle and full of hope.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 36, 19, 9, 'We can overcome the Accuser only by "the blood of the Lamb and the word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 36, 20, 9, 'of our testimony" (Revelation 12:11). His accusations concerning our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 36, 21, 9, 'past sins can be overcome only as we give him our testimony that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 36, 22, 9, 'blood of Christ has cleansed us and justified us thoroughly. We have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 36, 23, 9, 'use the same weapon that Jesus used: "It is written.....');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 36, 24, 9, 'Confessing God''s Word to Satan is the way to overcome not only Satan''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 36, 25, 9, 'accusations, but also discouragement and anxiety and a host of other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 36, 26, 9, 'temptations with which Satan assails our mind.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 36, 27, 9, 'That''s why it is important to know God''s Word well, so that the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 36, 28, 9, 'Spirit can bring to our mind the right Scripture at the time of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 37, 1, 9, 'need.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 37, 2, 9, 'It is good therefore to have a time every day when we meditate on God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 37, 3, 9, 'Word asking Him to speak to us. As we hide God''s Word in our heart, it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 37, 4, 9, 'will keep us from sinning against Him (Psalm 119:11).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 37, 5, 9, 'God has a perfect plan for our lives. And He wants to guide us into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 37, 6, 9, 'fulfilling it. The most blessed life that we can ever live on earth is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 37, 7, 9, 'one in which we fulfil that plan completely. In choosing a career or in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 37, 8, 9, 'marriage, how wonderful it is to know that God has already charted a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 37, 9, 9, 'course for us to take! If we choose His way, we can avoid the many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 37, 10, 9, 'pitfalls that Satan has lined up for us. It is through His Word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 37, 11, 9, 'primarily, that God guides us into that plan.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 37, 12, 9, 'Finding the will of God is an exhaustive subject and has been covered');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 37, 13, 9, 'more fully in my book entitled ''FINDING GOD''S WILL''.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 37, 14, 9, 'Approaching marriage in a spiritual way has been covered in another book');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 37, 15, 9, 'of mine entitled ''SEX, LOVE & MARRIAGE - The Christian Approach''.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 37, 16, 9, 'Communication with God is a two-way matter. We hear God speaking to us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 37, 17, 9, 'through His Word first. And then we speak to Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 37, 18, 9, 'But prayer is not just making requests to God. A primary part of prayer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 37, 19, 9, 'should be having fellowship with God, like a bride with her bridegroom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 37, 20, 9, 'There are no rules on how a bride should speak to her bridegroom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 37, 21, 9, 'But as a discipline, it''s good for our prayers to consist of:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 37, 22, 9, 'Jesus told us to "pray at all times" (Luke 18:1).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 37, 23, 9, 'A good habit to develop is to learn to speak to God about the little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 37, 24, 9, 'things of daily life - and thus to be in a spirit of prayer throughout');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 37, 25, 9, 'the day. Thus, speaking to God will become a joy for us and not a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 37, 26, 9, 'ritual. We''ll also find that God speaks to us in our hearts in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 37, 27, 9, 'surprising ways.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 37, 28, 9, 'But these are just the kindergarten-lessons in the school of prayer. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 38, 1, 9, 'can progress further if we are faithful.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 38, 2, 9, 'In any case, prayer should never be allowed to degenerate into a dry,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 38, 3, 9, 'empty ritual. Prayer is like breathing. When our breathing becomes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 38, 4, 9, 'difficult for us, then we know that something is wrong! Prayer was never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 38, 5, 9, 'meant by God to be dry or boring.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 38, 6, 9, 'But as we progress, we will find that prayer becomes hard work. If we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 38, 7, 9, 'are faithful with the little burdens God lays on our heart to pray');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 38, 8, 9, 'about, we''ll find that God gives us more and more of His burdens. Thus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 38, 9, 9, 'we can become co-workers with God, in His work of blessing others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 38, 10, 9, 'Jesus prayed ''with loud crying and tears'' (Hebrews 5:7). Once when He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 38, 11, 9, 'prayed in Gethsemane, His sweat became like great drops of blood (Luke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 38, 12, 9, '22:44). His praying was so intense.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 38, 13, 9, 'Once He spent a whole night in prayer (Luke 6:12). He had a habit of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 38, 14, 9, 'slipping off frequently into the wilderness to pray (Luke 5:16). As');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 38, 15, 9, 'someone has said "Like tourists look for sights to see, whenever they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 38, 16, 9, 'come to a new place, Jesus always looked for a quiet place to pray');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 38, 17, 9, 'wherever He went."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 38, 18, 9, 'Jesus'' example shows us how important prayer is. If He needed to pray so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 38, 19, 9, 'much, how much more you and I need to.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 38, 20, 9, 'Fight the battle against laziness then, and determine to be a man/woman');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 38, 21, 9, 'of prayer at any cost.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 38, 22, 10, 'Chapter 9 Fellowship and the Church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 38, 23, 10, 'We have already seen that God wants to transform us into the likeness of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 38, 24, 10, 'Christ. But this transformation doesn''t take place in us in isolation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 38, 25, 10, 'from other disciples of Jesus. It is only along with them that we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 38, 26, 10, 'transformed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 38, 27, 10, 'God wants us to live, not only in dependence on Him, but in fellowship');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 38, 28, 10, 'with one another as well. In Old Testament times, God worked through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 39, 1, 10, 'individuals - a Moses or an Elijah or a John the Baptist etc.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 39, 2, 10, 'But under the new covenant what God wants is a Body of disciples who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 39, 3, 10, 'have become one under the headship of Christ. This is what ''the church''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 39, 4, 10, 'is - the Body of Christ (Ephesians 1:22, 23; 2:14-16).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 39, 5, 10, 'The church is not a building, nor is it a denomination. The English word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 39, 6, 10, '''church'' in the New Testament is a translation of the Greek word');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 39, 7, 10, '''ekklesia'', which means an assembly of people who are called out - in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 39, 8, 10, 'this case, called out of the world to be God''s own possession.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 39, 9, 10, 'All over the world, those who have responded to God''s call to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 39, 10, 10, 'separated from sin and the world, form the church - the Body of Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 39, 11, 10, 'In every locality, these members of Christ''s Body should together become');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 39, 12, 10, 'a local expression of that body.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 39, 13, 10, 'The first body of Christ was the physical body in which Jesus came to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 39, 14, 10, 'earth. In that body God showed Himself to the world. Jesus yielded');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 39, 15, 10, 'Himself so perfectly to the Father, that at the end of His life He could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 39, 16, 10, 'say, "He who has seen Me has seen the Father" (John 14:9).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 39, 17, 10, 'Now our calling is to represent Jesus together, to the world around us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 39, 18, 10, 'No one can represent Jesus adequately, all by himself. We need one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 39, 19, 10, 'another. The best among us are still imbalanced. We have our strong');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 39, 20, 10, 'points, but we have our weak points too. We may be able to reflect');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 39, 21, 10, 'Christ well in one area, but very poorly in another area. But together,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 39, 22, 10, 'we will find that the strong points of one balance out the weak points');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 39, 23, 10, 'of the other. And if we live in love and submission to one another,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 39, 24, 10, 'Christ can be reflected in His totality through us, to an unbelieving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 39, 25, 10, 'world. This is God''s purpose for the church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 39, 26, 10, 'As soon as you''re converted, you need to seek out and join a fellowship');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 39, 27, 10, 'of disciples who are eager to obey God''s Word and to follow in Jesus''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 39, 28, 10, 'footsteps.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 40, 1, 10, 'This is where the new convert can be bewildered by the numerous groups');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 40, 2, 10, 'and denominations that he sees in Christendom. From one end of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 40, 3, 10, 'doctrinal spectrum to the other, there are unfortunately, many, many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 40, 4, 10, 'groups that lay claim to be the only true representatives of Christ on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 40, 5, 10, 'earth!!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 40, 6, 10, 'Many of these groups would thump their Bibles and prove to you that you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 40, 7, 10, 'cannot be a part of the Body of Christ unless you join them!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 40, 8, 10, 'It would be almost impossible to convince most of them that God has many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 40, 9, 10, 'children who are not in their ''group'' and who don''t hold exactly to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 40, 10, 10, 'their peculiar forms of doctrine! Such is the power of prejudice! You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 40, 11, 10, 'must be careful that you don''t get entangled in this web of Pharisaism');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 40, 12, 10, 'and cultism, that plagues much of Christendom today.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 40, 13, 10, 'Keep your heart open to all who love the Lord and who seek to follow Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 40, 14, 10, 'in sincerity. They may not dot their doctrinal ''i''s or cross their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 40, 15, 10, 'doctrinal ''t''s in exactly the same way as you do. But that''s not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 40, 16, 10, 'serious, if they''re walking in the light that God has given them. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 40, 17, 10, 'cannot demand that they should walk in the light that God has given us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 40, 18, 10, 'We must have as many brothers and sisters as God has children.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 40, 19, 10, 'We should wholeheartedly welcome and receive all whom God Himself has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 40, 20, 10, 'received (Romans 14:1; 15:7). If Jesus is not ashamed to call someone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 40, 21, 10, 'His brother, we shouldn''t be ashamed either (Hebrews 2:11).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 40, 22, 10, 'There are two extremes to which believers can go, in this matter of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 40, 23, 10, 'fellowship. One is to compromise truth itself in order to maintain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 40, 24, 10, 'fellowship. The other is to demand uniformity in all matters before');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 40, 25, 10, 'fellowship is offered. If you are wise, you''ll steer clear of both these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 40, 26, 10, 'extremes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 40, 27, 10, 'It''s obvious that we can''t work together with those who are not agreed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 40, 28, 10, 'as to how God''s work is to be done. But we don''t have to demand that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 41, 1, 10, 'someone believes exactly as we do, down to the last little detail,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 41, 2, 10, 'before we have fellowship with him. There is a difference between');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 41, 3, 10, 'working together with someone and having fellowship with him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 41, 4, 10, 'However, you must look for a church in your locality, that can be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 41, 5, 10, 'spiritual home for you, and to which you can be committed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 41, 6, 10, 'In the midst of many ''churches'' in your locality, you should look for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 41, 7, 10, 'one that conforms most closely to the New Testament, as you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 41, 8, 10, 'understood it thus far. As time goes on, and you understand more of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 41, 9, 10, 'New Testament, you may feel that you have to leave that ''church'' and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 41, 10, 10, 'join another which is more in line with God''s Word.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 41, 11, 10, 'That will only be natural for one who is growing spiritually and who is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 41, 12, 10, 'determined to press on to God''s highest and best for His life. Never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 41, 13, 10, 'settle for anything less than God''s best in every area - and then you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 41, 14, 10, 'won''t have any regrets in eternity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 41, 15, 10, 'A New Testament church will not have any denominational label. It is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 41, 16, 10, 'fellowship of people who have been gathered by the Holy Spirit into the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 41, 17, 10, 'Name of Jesus Christ. The Lord has promised to be present only in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 41, 18, 10, 'midst of such a gathering (Matthew 18:20).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 41, 19, 10, 'The church that you become a part of, should be one that accepts the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 41, 20, 10, 'Bible as God''s Word and as the ONLY foundation for faith and life. Many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 41, 21, 10, 'cultistic groups, though claiming to accept the Bible alone as their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 41, 22, 10, 'authority, are often found quoting the writings of their leaders with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 41, 23, 10, 'equal authority. As you get close to them you''ll find that they are more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 41, 24, 10, 'bound to the teachings of their leaders than to God''s Word. There may be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 41, 25, 10, 'many good things in them. But if you join them, you will soon find that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 41, 26, 10, 'their cultistic attitudes enslave you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 41, 27, 10, 'In God''s church, all believers are equally priests of God - for God has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 41, 28, 10, 'made us all priests (1 Peter 2:9). A ''church'' that has a special class');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 42, 1, 10, 'of priests or ''pastors'', who alone are considered qualified to minister');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 42, 2, 10, 'the Word, is contrary to the will of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 42, 3, 10, 'God has ordained the leadership of the church to be in the hands of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 42, 4, 10, 'elders (always more than one). But these elders need not be ''full-time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 42, 5, 10, 'workers'' (Acts 14:23; Titus 1:5).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 42, 6, 10, 'In the meetings of a New Testament church, the main emphasis will be on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 42, 7, 10, 'preaching God''s Word. All believers will have freedom in such a church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 42, 8, 10, 'to share God''s Word according to their maturity and their spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 42, 9, 10, 'gift.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 42, 10, 10, 'If the Word spoken is truly inspired by the Holy Spirit, you''ll find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 42, 11, 10, 'that it comforts and challenges and builds up and exposes ''the secrets');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 42, 12, 10, 'of men''s hearts'' compelling those who hear to acknowledge that God is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 42, 13, 10, 'speaking (1 Corinthians 14:3, 24-31).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 42, 14, 10, 'The main thrust of a truly New Testament church will be to make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 42, 15, 10, 'disciples and to teach them total obedience to Jesus'' commandments');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 42, 16, 10, '(Matthew 28:19, 20). The distinguishing feature of such a church will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 42, 17, 10, 'mutual love between its members - as Jesus stated in John 13:35, "By');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 42, 18, 10, 'this all men will know that you are my disciples, if you have love for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 42, 19, 10, 'one another."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 42, 20, 10, 'Such a church where the Word is spoken powerfully, and where the love of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 42, 21, 10, 'God reigns and where the presence of the Lord can be sensed, is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 42, 22, 10, 'church that you should be a part of, in your locality.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 42, 23, 10, 'It''s when we try to live together in loving fellowship with others that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 42, 24, 10, 'we''ll find how much we need to deny ourselves and take up the cross');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 42, 25, 10, 'every day, if we want to maintain fellowship.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 42, 26, 10, 'Satan is always busy driving wedges between God''s children. If we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 42, 27, 10, 'mature we''ll always be alert to prevent those wedges from being driven');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 42, 28, 10, 'in between us and others. There is great loss when fellowship is broken');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 43, 1, 10, 'in Christ''s Body - both to God as well as to us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 43, 2, 10, 'There is tremendous power in unity in the church. Satan can be overcome');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 43, 3, 10, 'only by a united church. Jesus said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 43, 4, 10, 'That''s why Satan brings division between believers and that''s why he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 43, 5, 10, 'forms cliques and groups in a church. He wants to preserve his own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 43, 6, 10, 'kingdom from being attacked by a united church. We must be alert to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 43, 7, 10, 'Satan''s schemes and not be ignorant of them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 43, 8, 10, 'Just think what limitation there would have been in Christ''s physical');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 43, 9, 10, 'body if his limbs had been unable to work together. He would not then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 43, 10, 10, 'have been able to manifest the glory of God to this world as He did.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 43, 11, 10, 'This is the limitation that Christ faces today as Head of His spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 43, 12, 10, 'Body, the church, when believers are divided.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 43, 13, 10, 'We lose too. If you cut yourself off from even one of God''s children,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 43, 14, 10, 'you deprive yourself of something of God''s riches that could have come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 43, 15, 10, 'to you only through that other child of God. We can know the love of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 43, 16, 10, 'Christ only along "with all the saints" (Ephesians 3:17-19).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 43, 17, 10, '(For a further in-depth study of the importance of Christian fellowship,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 43, 18, 10, 'you could read my book entitled, ONE BODY IN CHRIST.)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 43, 19, 11, 'Chapter 10 The End of this Age');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 43, 20, 11, 'There was no clear understanding in Old Testament times about life after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 43, 21, 11, 'death and about God''s plan for the future. But Jesus taught very clearly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 43, 22, 11, 'about both these matters. It''s good for us to know about these matters');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 43, 23, 11, 'too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 43, 24, 11, 'Death has no terror for a disciple of Christ, for Jesus has conquered');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 43, 25, 11, 'death. Death is a defeated enemy. Jesus died and made Satan powerless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 43, 26, 11, 'thereby so that we need no longer have any fear of death (Hebrews 2:14,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 43, 27, 11, '15). The keys of death are now in the hand of Jesus (Revelation 1:18).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 43, 28, 11, 'Only He can open the door of death for any of His disciples now. Satan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 44, 1, 11, 'can''t touch them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 44, 2, 11, 'What happens when a man dies? Jesus answered this question clearly when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 44, 3, 11, 'He spoke about the rich man and Lazarus. It would be good if you read');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 44, 4, 11, 'Luke 16:19-31 right now, before proceeding any further....');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 44, 5, 11, 'This is not a parable - for in no parable did Jesus ever use a man''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 44, 6, 11, 'name as he did here. Both the rich man and Lazarus were real people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 44, 7, 11, 'Man is a threefold being, consisting of spirit, soul and body (1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 44, 8, 11, 'Thessalonians 5:23). At death the soul and spirit are separated from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 44, 9, 11, 'body, and go either to paradise or to hell.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 44, 10, 11, 'While on the cross, Jesus told the repentant thief that he would be with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 44, 11, 11, 'Him in paradise that very day. Both Jesus and that thief went to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 44, 12, 11, 'paradise as soon as their souls left their bodies. Jesus had said that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 44, 13, 11, 'after His death, He would be in ''the heart of the earth'' for 3 days and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 44, 14, 11, '3 nights (Matthew 12:40). From this we know that paradise, at that time,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 44, 15, 11, 'must have been in the heart of the earth. But when Christ was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 44, 16, 11, 'resurrected "from the lower parts of the earth....and ascended on high.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 44, 17, 11, 'He led captive a host of captives" (Ephesians 4:8, 9). He took paradise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 44, 18, 11, 'and all the souls in it up to the third heaven.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 44, 19, 11, 'In 2 Corinthians 12, when we compare verses 2 & 4 together, we see that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 44, 20, 11, 'paradise is now located in the third heaven. This is where the disciple');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 44, 21, 11, 'of Jesus goes as soon as he dies (Philippians 1:23).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 44, 22, 11, 'The Bible tells us of a number of events that would take place');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 44, 23, 11, 'immediately before Christ''s return to earth. Here are some of them:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 44, 24, 11, 'It is exciting to see what is happening in the world today. The signs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 44, 25, 11, 'are all pointing to the coming of Christ very soon.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 44, 26, 11, 'When Christ comes, all who belong to Him will be transformed in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 44, 27, 11, 'twinkling of an eye. We will receive new bodies that can never age or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 44, 28, 11, 'die (1 Corinthians 15:51-53). Our new bodies will be just like the body');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 45, 1, 11, 'that Jesus Himself had after His resurrection (Philippians 3:20, 21).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 45, 2, 11, 'Those who died in Christ will also arise from their graves in their new');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 45, 3, 11, 'bodies and along with the living disciples of Jesus at that time, will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 45, 4, 11, 'rise into the air to meet the Lord (1 Thessalonians 4:13-17).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 45, 5, 11, 'Then Christ will set up His judgment seat, at which we will be judged');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 45, 6, 11, '(assessed) and rewarded individually for our faithfulness in our earthly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 45, 7, 11, 'lives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 45, 8, 11, 'The Bible speaks of crowns being awarded in that day for those who have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 45, 9, 11, 'been faithful. You could read 2 Corinthians 5:10; 1 Corinthians 3:11-15');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 45, 10, 11, '& 4:5; 2 Timothy 4:8 & 1 Peter 5:4 for more details of the rewards that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 45, 11, 11, 'will be given by the Lord to His disciples at that time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 45, 12, 11, 'In that day, we will see that "many who are first will be last and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 45, 13, 11, 'last, first" (Matthew 19:30). Many who appeared to us to be very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 45, 14, 11, 'spiritual on earth, will then be seen as not having been so faithful in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 45, 15, 11, 'God''s eyes. Others whom we may not have thought too highly of, will then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 45, 16, 11, 'be seen as having been faithful in God''s eyes. In that day, the unknown');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 45, 17, 11, 'but faithful widow will take precedence over the world-famous but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 45, 18, 11, 'unfaithful preacher.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 45, 19, 11, 'In that day, we will discover that many things such as money and fame,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 45, 20, 11, 'that men considered valuable on earth have no value before God; and that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 45, 21, 11, 'many virtues that men did not value, such as purity, humility,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 45, 22, 11, 'unselfishness, mercy and goodness are valued greatly by God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 45, 23, 11, 'Then will take place what the Bible calls ''the marriage of the Lamb of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 45, 24, 11, 'God'' - the spiritual marriage of Jesus Christ with His Bride - the ones');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 45, 25, 11, 'who were faithful in denying themselves and taking up the cross daily');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 45, 26, 11, 'and following Him as His disciples on earth (Revelation 19:8-10). In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 45, 27, 11, 'that day we will see that it was worth it all to have suffered');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 45, 28, 11, 'misunderstanding, shame, persecution and even death itself for the sake');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 46, 1, 11, 'of our Lord and His gospel.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 46, 2, 11, 'A reign of peace will then begin for 1000 years, when Garden of Eden');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 46, 3, 11, 'conditions will prevail on the earth, with the lion lying down');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 46, 4, 11, 'peacefully with the lamb and the child playing with the harmless cobra');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 46, 5, 11, 'etc., (Isaiah 11:6-9).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 46, 6, 11, 'Jesus will then reign from Jerusalem as King over the whole earth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 46, 7, 11, '(Zechariah 14:9-21). Satan will be bound during those years so that he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 46, 8, 11, 'has no access to earth as he has now. At the end of those 1000 years,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 46, 9, 11, 'Satan will be released for a short period to test the unconverted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 46, 10, 11, 'inhabitants of earth once more. Again a great multitude will follow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 46, 11, 11, 'after Satan. This will be God''s demonstration to angels and men that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 46, 12, 11, 'these people do not want Christ to reign over them, even after they have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 46, 13, 11, 'seen the 1000 years of peace. Such is man''s blindness and stubbornness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 46, 14, 11, 'and wickedness. But God will come down in judgment on that rebellious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 46, 15, 11, 'multitude; and Satan will be cast into the lake of fire (which is just a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 46, 16, 11, 'larger version of hell - Revelation 20:7-10).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 46, 17, 11, 'God will then set up His judgment seat to judge all unbelievers. This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 46, 18, 11, 'will be the second resurrection. The dead will be raised from their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 46, 19, 11, 'graves. The souls of all unbelievers will return from hell into their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 46, 20, 11, 'earthly bodies to stand before God to be judged. They will then be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 46, 21, 11, 'judged "from the things which were written in the books, according to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 46, 22, 11, 'their deeds" (Revelation 20:12).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 46, 23, 11, 'Memory is like a video-tape that faithfully records everything that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 46, 24, 11, 'have thought, said and done and also our attitudes and motives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 46, 25, 11, 'throughout our earthly life. God will in that day play back this tape');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 46, 26, 11, 'for the whole world to see the hidden lives of everyone. This will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 46, 27, 11, 'God''s way of showing that He is perfectly righteous in sending people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 46, 28, 11, 'into eternal judgment.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 47, 1, 11, 'Those whose names are not found in the book of life will be cast into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 47, 2, 11, 'the lake of fire to join Satan whom they served on earth (Revelation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 47, 3, 11, '20:15).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 47, 4, 11, 'Then time will cease and eternity will begin. Redeemed men and women');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 47, 5, 11, 'will enter into the new heaven and the new earth and the bride of Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 47, 6, 11, 'will then shine forth in all her glory (as described in Revelation 21).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 47, 7, 11, 'Satan and all unbelievers will have been removed from that perfect');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 47, 8, 11, 'heaven and earth. In that glorious new universe, sin will never raise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 47, 9, 11, 'its ugly head any more and there won''t be any lusts in our flesh. Heaven');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 47, 10, 11, 'will be filled with people who have joyfully chosen the will of God for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 47, 11, 11, 'all eternity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 47, 12, 11, 'Peter says, "Since all these things (the existing heavens and earth) are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 47, 13, 11, 'to be destroyed, what sort of people ought you to be in holy conduct and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 47, 14, 11, 'godliness" (2 Peter 3:11, 12).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 47, 15, 11, 'The message of the Spirit in these last days, can be summed up in one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 47, 16, 11, 'word: "OVERCOME" (See Revelation 2:7, 11, 17, 26; 3:5, 12, 21; 21:7).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 47, 17, 11, 'We began this book by emphasising the missing element in much of today''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 47, 18, 11, 'preaching to unbelievers - REPENT.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 47, 19, 11, 'We conclude this book by emphasising the missing element in much of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 47, 20, 11, 'today''s preaching to believers - OVERCOME.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 47, 21, 11, 'The call of God to man, ever since he fell into sin has been to be an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 47, 22, 11, 'overcomer. God told Cain,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 47, 23, 11, 'In the last book of the Bible that call is repeated,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 47, 24, 11, 'Nothing on earth can be compared with the glory of a life lived in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 47, 25, 11, 'fellowship with God and in the fulfilment of His purposes. The life that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 47, 26, 11, 'Jesus lived on earth was the most wonderful, the most glorious and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 47, 27, 11, 'happiest life that any man ever lived. He wasn''t world-famous or rich.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 47, 28, 11, 'But He radiated the glory of God through His life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 48, 1, 11, 'The good news of the gospel is that you can radiate that glory too. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 48, 2, 11, 'can be an overcomer all the days of your earthly life. May you be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 48, 3, 11, 'faithful then and live with eternity''s values in view at all times.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 48, 4, 11, 'Amen.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 48, 5, 11, 'Share');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 48, 6, 11, 'Who Am I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 48, 7, 11, 'Our Message');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 48, 8, 11, 'Resources');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 48, 9, 11, 'Study Series');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 48, 10, 11, 'About us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_good_foundation', 48, 11, 11, 'CHRISTIAN FELLOWSHIP CHURCH');
INSERT INTO books VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 'A Heavenly Home', 'Zac Poonen', 'Guide to the young married couples', 'a_heavenly_home.jpg', 34, 939, '2026-09-01T09:55:52.074Z');
INSERT INTO book_chapters VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 1, 'Chapter 0 Introduction', 1, 1, 2, 13);
INSERT INTO book_chapters VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 2, 'Chapter 1 A heavenly home on earth', 2, 14, 9, 20);
INSERT INTO book_chapters VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 3, 'Chapter 2 Make three choices in your marriage', 9, 21, 19, 13);
INSERT INTO book_chapters VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 4, 'Chapter 3 A marriage like a garden', 19, 14, 24, 14);
INSERT INTO book_chapters VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 5, 'Chapter 4 The home – a sanctuary for God', 24, 15, 34, 15);
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 1, 1, 1, 'Chapter 0 Introduction');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 1, 2, 1, 'All of Zac Poonen''s four sons respect their father as their hero and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 1, 3, 1, 'wanted him to preach at their weddings.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 1, 4, 1, 'This book contains the transcripts of the messages Zac preached at those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 1, 5, 1, 'weddings.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 1, 6, 1, 'It is being sent forth with the prayer that it will challenge many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 1, 7, 1, 'married couples to raise the standard of their own married lives to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 1, 8, 1, 'God''s standard.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 1, 9, 1, 'Zac and Annie Poonen have been married for 44 years and have served the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 1, 10, 1, 'Lord together in many countries of the world and encouraged many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 1, 11, 1, 'families to build godly homes. Their four sons (and their wives) are all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 1, 12, 1, 'born again and now seek to be witnesses for the Lord as families in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 1, 13, 1, 'their generation - as their parents have been in theirs.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 1, 14, 1, 'We must remember that marriage was God''s idea and not man''s. He was the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 1, 15, 1, '"Manufacturer" of this product, so to speak. So the Manufacturer''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 1, 16, 1, 'instructions are more to be depended on, than our own ideas on how this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 1, 17, 1, '"product" should work!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 1, 18, 1, 'Here are some extracts from the "Manufacturer''s instructions":');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 1, 19, 1, '"Be subject to one another in reverence for Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 1, 20, 1, 'Wives , be subject to your own husbands, as to the Lord, because the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 1, 21, 1, 'husband is the head of the wife, as Christ is the head of the church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 1, 22, 1, 'Husbands , love your wives, just as Christ also loved the church and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 1, 23, 1, 'gave Himself up for her.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 1, 24, 1, 'Husbands ought also to love their own wives as their own bodies. (Then)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 1, 25, 1, 'The two shall become one " (Ephesians 5:20-31).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 1, 26, 1, '"Wives, fit in with your husbands'' plans. Be beautiful inside, in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 1, 27, 1, 'hearts, with the lasting charm of a gentle and quiet spirit that is so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 1, 28, 1, 'precious to God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 2, 1, 1, 'You husbands must be careful of your wives, being thoughtful of their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 2, 2, 1, 'needs and honoring them as the weaker sex. Remember that you and your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 2, 3, 1, 'wife are partners in receiving God''s blessings, and if you don''t treat');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 2, 4, 1, 'her as you should, your prayers will not get ready answers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 2, 5, 1, 'And now this word to both of you: You should be a happy family, full of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 2, 6, 1, 'sympathy toward each other, loving one another with tender hearts and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 2, 7, 1, 'humble minds."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 2, 8, 1, '(1 Peter 3:1-8 - Living Bible)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 2, 9, 1, '"Be patient with each other, making allowance for each other''s faults');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 2, 10, 1, 'because of your love"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 2, 11, 1, '(Ephesians 4:2 - Living Bible).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 2, 12, 1, 'The "product" will work perfectly, if the "Manufacturer''s instructions"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 2, 13, 1, 'are followed exactly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 2, 14, 2, 'Chapter 1 A heavenly home on earth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 2, 15, 2, 'Message given at the wedding of Sanjay (my eldest son) and Kathy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 2, 16, 2, 'It''s a great joy for me to speak at my eldest son''s wedding. We have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 2, 17, 2, 'been looking forward to this day for many years.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 2, 18, 2, 'I want to share a phrase with Sanjay and Kathy that is found in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 2, 19, 2, 'Deuteronomy 11:18-21 (in the King James Version). There God says,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 2, 20, 2, '"Impress My words upon your heart so that your days may be as the days');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 2, 21, 2, 'of heaven upon earth."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 2, 22, 2, 'What an expression that is: "That your days may be as the days of heaven');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 2, 23, 2, 'upon earth".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 2, 24, 2, 'Think what the days of heaven are like. There is no strife or conflict');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 2, 25, 2, 'in heaven, but only peace and joy. And above all, love - everywhere. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 2, 26, 2, 'can have a home like that - where everyday is like a day of heaven upon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 2, 27, 2, 'earth. That is the way God intended every home to be.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 2, 28, 2, 'The Bible begins with the marriage of Adam and Eve and ends with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 3, 1, 2, 'marriage of Christ to His people, the Church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 3, 2, 2, 'When God conducted that first wedding - of Adam and Eve - He wanted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 3, 3, 2, 'their days to be like days of heaven upon earth. Their first home was a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 3, 4, 2, 'paradise - Eden. But Satan came and made their home into a hell. And now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 3, 5, 2, 'we have homes like hell all over the world, today.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 3, 6, 2, 'But praise God that was not the end of the story. The Bible tells us,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 3, 7, 2, 'how right there in Eden, as soon as Adam sinned, God promised to send');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 3, 8, 2, 'His Son to solve the problem Satan had created. That''s where we see this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 3, 9, 2, 'great truth: That God is always on our side against the Devil. Before');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 3, 10, 2, 'God cursed the earth for Adam''s sin, He told Adam and Eve that a seed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 3, 11, 2, 'would come through the woman Who would bruise the head of the Devil. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 3, 12, 2, 'was only after that, that God pronounced their punishment.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 3, 13, 2, 'Even though the Devil had come and messed up things, God wanted Adam and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 3, 14, 2, 'Eve to know that He was on their side against the Devil. No matter what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 3, 15, 2, 'the Devil may ever do in any home, God is in the business of redeeming');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 3, 16, 2, 'homes. He wants to bring our homes back to His original plan where our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 3, 17, 2, 'days will be as the days of heaven upon earth. And now that Christ has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 3, 18, 2, 'come and the work of redemption has been accomplished, this is a real');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 3, 19, 2, 'possibility for every one of us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 3, 20, 2, 'Some time ago, I bought a digital camera. Before that, I used the simple');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 3, 21, 2, '"point and click" cameras that used a roll of film. But with this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 3, 22, 2, 'expensive digital camera, I discovered that the pictures were not better');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 3, 23, 2, 'but worse. They were fuzzy and out of focus. After spending all that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 3, 24, 2, 'money, I got pictures that were fit only to be thrown in the trash -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 3, 25, 2, 'just like many marriages.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 3, 26, 2, 'And why was this so? Because I had not read the manufacturer''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 3, 27, 2, 'instructions. We know that every expensive piece of equipment always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 3, 28, 2, 'comes with an instruction-booklet that the maker supplies. Is it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 4, 1, 2, 'possible then that God Who ordained marriage could have left us without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 4, 2, 2, 'any instructions? Of course not. He has given us instructions. It is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 4, 3, 2, 'because we don''t follow those instructions (as I did with my digital');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 4, 4, 2, 'camera) that our marriages turn out fuzzy, out of focus and fit for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 4, 5, 2, 'trash-can.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 4, 6, 2, 'And so I read the manufacturer''s booklet and followed his instructions');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 4, 7, 2, 'exactly on how to use my digital camera. I did not dare to imagine that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 4, 8, 2, 'I knew better than the maker of that camera. It would have been foolish');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 4, 9, 2, 'to have thought like that. But that is the foolishness found in many who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 4, 10, 2, 'ignore their "Maker''s Instructions" when it comes to marriage - and who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 4, 11, 2, 'imagine that they can produce a better marriage by listening to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 4, 12, 2, 'psychologists and human tradition than to God Himself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 4, 13, 2, 'God has given us very clear instructions on marriage. When I finally');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 4, 14, 2, 'followed the digital camera-maker''s instructions, my pictures came out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 4, 15, 2, 'perfect. And that''s exactly what will happen in a marriage, when the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 4, 16, 2, 'husband and wife follow the Makers Instructions.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 4, 17, 2, 'There is only one book in the world that contains the Maker''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 4, 18, 2, 'Instructions on marriage - the Bible. I started studying it many years');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 4, 19, 2, 'before I got married. And my wife and I studied it together after we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 4, 20, 2, 'were married. And in the 37 years of our marriage we have tasted a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 4, 21, 2, 'little bit of what it means to have "days of heaven upon earth".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 4, 22, 2, 'The message of the gospel is this, that we can have two heavens - one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 4, 23, 2, 'right now, as our days on earth become like the days of heaven. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 4, 24, 2, 'finally a physical heaven, when Christ returns.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 4, 25, 2, 'The other alternative is to have two hells - one right now, and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 4, 26, 2, 'other in eternity. The Lord Jesus Christ came to save us from that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 4, 27, 2, 'Sanjay and Kathy are going to be living in a two-storey-house. And we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 4, 28, 2, 'can look at that as a picture of marriage. That house has a foundation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 5, 1, 2, 'first of all, on which the first and second storeys are built.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 5, 2, 2, 'The most important part of any house is its foundation. What every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 5, 3, 2, 'marriage needs first of all, is also a good foundation. And the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 5, 4, 2, 'foundation for a good marriage is God''s perfect and unconditional love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 5, 5, 2, 'for us. The truth of God''s unconditional love is the greatest truth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 5, 6, 2, 'found in the whole Bible. Even when we falter and blunder and fail and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 5, 7, 2, 'make a mess of our lives, God''s love for us never changes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 5, 8, 2, 'When God wanted to illustrate His love for us, He used the example of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 5, 9, 2, 'mother''s love for her newborn child. We know that a mother expects');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 5, 10, 2, 'nothing in return from her baby.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 5, 11, 2, 'On the other hand, the love that is portrayed over television and in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 5, 12, 2, 'movies is a selfish love. A young man may say that he "loves" a girl.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 5, 13, 2, 'But he wants something from her for his own pleasure. And she wants');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 5, 14, 2, 'something from him for herself too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 5, 15, 2, 'God''s love however is different. It is like a mother''s love for a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 5, 16, 2, 'newborn baby. The mother does not want a single thing from her child. In');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 5, 17, 2, 'fact, her little baby can''t give her anything at all. A mother''s love is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 5, 18, 2, 'the most unselfish love on the face of the earth. That is the example');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 5, 19, 2, 'God uses in Isaiah 49:15, when He explains His love for us - it is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 5, 20, 2, 'love that is totally unselfish and expects nothing in return. Like a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 5, 21, 2, 'mother, God serves and suffers for the sake of His children. Have you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 5, 22, 2, 'seen how a mother looks after a sick child? That is how God loves us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 5, 23, 2, 'too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 5, 24, 2, 'Being aware of this perfect love of God for you both is what you need as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 5, 25, 2, 'the foundation for your new home. On that foundation you can build the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 5, 26, 2, 'two floors. If each of you is not individually secure in God''s love,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 5, 27, 2, 'then you will have many problems between yourselves.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 5, 28, 2, 'I am convinced that many of our problems are caused by our insecurity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 6, 1, 2, 'We have not found security in the unconditional love of a heavenly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 6, 2, 2, 'Father. And when we are not secure in the love of our heavenly Father,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 6, 3, 2, 'we will not be able to love others as we should. We will have jealousy,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 6, 4, 2, 'a competitive spirit and many other problems in our relationships. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 6, 5, 2, 'once we are secure in God''s love, we become free - and then we can start');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 6, 6, 2, 'building.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 6, 7, 2, 'When someone asked Jesus what the greatest commandment was, He replied');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 6, 8, 2, 'that there were two commandments that were the greatest - not just one.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 6, 9, 2, 'The first was to love God with all one''s heart, soul and strength; and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 6, 10, 2, 'the second was to love others, as He loved us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 6, 11, 2, 'And those are the two floors of the house. You can''t build the second');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 6, 12, 2, 'floor before you build the first. A lot of people make that mistake -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 6, 13, 2, 'they try to love others without first loving God with all their hearts.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 6, 14, 2, 'They haven''t read the Maker''s instructions - and so their love for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 6, 15, 2, 'others withers away after a while. We''ve got to love God first, before');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 6, 16, 2, 'we can love others the way we should love.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 6, 17, 2, 'When God made Adam and Eve, He didn''t make them together - at the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 6, 18, 2, 'time. He could have done that easily if He wanted to. He could have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 6, 19, 2, 'taken two lumps of clay instead of one, and made both man and woman at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 6, 20, 2, 'the same time, and breathed into both of them. But why did He make Adam');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 6, 21, 2, 'alone? So that when Adam opened his eyes, the first person he would see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 6, 22, 2, 'would be God - and not Eve! Then God put Adam to sleep. Why? Not just to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 6, 23, 2, 'take a rib out of his side. But so that when God made Eve separately in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 6, 24, 2, 'some other corner of the garden, and she opened her eyes, the first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 6, 25, 2, 'person she would see would also be God and not Adam. She didn''t even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 6, 26, 2, 'know of the existence of Adam. She only saw God at first.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 6, 27, 2, 'That was the first lesson God wanted to teach Adam and Eve: "I, your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 6, 28, 2, 'God, must be first in your lives always." That is the lesson that all of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 7, 1, 2, 'us must learn too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 7, 2, 2, 'You have heard of the well-known industrial glue, Fevicol, which is used');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 7, 3, 2, 'to stick wood together. I saw an advertisement for that once, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 7, 4, 2, 'showed two pieces of wood stuck together with Fevicol, and two elephants');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 7, 5, 2, 'trying to pull them apart. And those elephants are unable to separate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 7, 6, 2, 'those two pieces of wood. That is how a truly Christian marriage becomes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 7, 7, 2, 'too, when Christ is in the centre, between husband and wife, holding');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 7, 8, 2, 'them together. No force on earth or in heaven will then be able to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 7, 9, 2, 'separate such a husband and wife from each other. If however Christ is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 7, 10, 2, 'not first and the binding factor between husband and wife, then such a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 7, 11, 2, 'marriage will be like two pieces of wood just put together without any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 7, 12, 2, 'glue. They will fall apart, even without anyone pulling them apart. No');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 7, 13, 2, 'wonder, we see so much of divorce in the world today. Those couples');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 7, 14, 2, 'truly imagined that they loved each other deeply, on the day they were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 7, 15, 2, 'married. But what they did not realize was that theirs was a selfish');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 7, 16, 2, 'love, because Christ was not Lord of their lives. Thus, a few months');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 7, 17, 2, 'later, they found themselves snapping at each other.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 7, 18, 2, '"Love one another" is a nice, over-used expression. But you can''t really');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 7, 19, 2, 'do it, if you don''t love God first. You won''t be able to endure to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 7, 20, 2, 'end in love for your spouse, if Christ is not Lord of your personal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 7, 21, 2, 'life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 7, 22, 2, 'But once you have built the first floor - loving God - then you can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 7, 23, 2, 'build the second - loving one another.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 7, 24, 2, 'I want to say three things about loving one another.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 7, 25, 2, 'First of all love expresses appreciation. There is a whole book on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 7, 26, 2, 'married love that God has included in the Bible - the Song of Solomon.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 7, 27, 2, 'All married couples should read that book - to each other! It''s amazing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 7, 28, 2, 'to see there how Almighty God expects a husband and wife to talk to each');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 8, 1, 2, 'other! And that book is inspired Scripture just as much as the other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 8, 2, 2, 'books in the Bible!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 8, 3, 2, 'Let me read you a few extracts from this book, so that we can all learn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 8, 4, 2, 'to appreciate each other as husbands and wives. We are all misers when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 8, 5, 2, 'it comes to expressing appreciation. We are quick to criticize, but very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 8, 6, 2, 'slow to appreciate. We look at people and find so many faults in them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 8, 7, 2, 'That is human nature. And that is how the Accuser, the Devil gets a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 8, 8, 2, 'foothold within us. On the other hand, God gets a foothold within us,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 8, 9, 2, 'when we look at others and find something to appreciate in them. Each of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 8, 10, 2, 'us can examine our own conduct here.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 8, 11, 2, 'See what the husband says to his wife here in Song of Solomon (from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 8, 12, 2, 'Message Bible):');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 8, 13, 2, '(I am not inventing all this. It is all there in Scripture.)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 8, 14, 2, '(How I wish that were true of every husband.)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 8, 15, 2, '(God permits a little poetic license there. It is not a question of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 8, 16, 2, 'scientific accuracy here, but of how the husband feels.)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 8, 17, 2, 'And now listen to what the wife says. This is her response:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 8, 18, 2, 'How did God put something like that in Scripture? Because God Himself is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 8, 19, 2, 'a Lover.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 8, 20, 2, 'Sanjay and Kathy, be lovers like that. God wants you to love one another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 8, 21, 2, 'like that. Your days can be as the days of heaven on earth if you learn');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 8, 22, 2, 'to appreciate one another like that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 8, 23, 2, 'Jesus is the Great Example for us all in this area. How lavishly He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 8, 24, 2, 'expressed His appreciation for people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 8, 25, 2, 'The second thing about true love is: Love is quick to forgive. Love is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 8, 26, 2, 'slow to blame but quick to forgive. There will be problems between');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 8, 27, 2, 'husband and wife in every marriage. But if you put those problems on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 8, 28, 2, 'back-burner, they are sure to boil over. So be quick to forgive and be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 9, 1, 2, 'quick to ask for forgiveness. Don''t wait until the evening to do that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 9, 2, 2, 'If you get a thorn in your foot in the morning, you will take it out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 9, 3, 2, 'immediately. You won''t wait until the evening. If you hurt your spouse,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 9, 4, 2, 'you poked him/her with a thorn. Take it out immediately. Ask for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 9, 5, 2, 'forgiveness immediately and be quick to forgive.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 9, 6, 2, 'And finally, love is eager to do things together with one''s partner -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 9, 7, 2, 'and not alone. How different the history of man would have been, if when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 9, 8, 2, 'the Devil came to tempt Eve in the garden, she had just said "Let me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 9, 9, 2, 'consult my husband first before I take a decision". Oh what a different');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 9, 10, 2, 'story it would have been then.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 9, 11, 2, 'Remember that all the problems in the world arose because one woman took');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 9, 12, 2, 'a decision on her own, when God had given her a companion whom she could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 9, 13, 2, 'have consulted, before taking that decision.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 9, 14, 2, 'True love does things together. Two are always better than one.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 9, 15, 2, 'In conclusion, let me read again from God''s word in Song of Solomon -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 9, 16, 2, 'Chapter 8, verses 6 & 7 (from the Message Bible):');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 9, 17, 2, 'Only God''s love is like this. That''s why this love is called "the flame');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 9, 18, 2, 'of the Lord" in verse 6.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 9, 19, 2, 'Only God can give us such love.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 9, 20, 2, 'Sanjay and Kathy, ask God to give you such a love for each other.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 9, 21, 3, 'Chapter 2 Make three choices in your marriage');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 9, 22, 3, 'Message given at the wedding of Santosh (my second son) and Meghan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 9, 23, 3, 'God has given us only one Book. If we really believe that, we will look');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 9, 24, 3, 'in that Book for instruction for everything in life. We read in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 9, 25, 3, 'Bible that it was God Who ordained marriage for man. He was the One who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 9, 26, 3, 'first thought of it and He was the one who created man and woman with a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 9, 27, 3, 'desire to be united together. And He has given us warnings and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 9, 28, 3, 'instructions in His Book on how a married couple should live.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 10, 1, 3, 'In Genesis 3, we read about the marriage of Adam and Eve. As soon as God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 10, 2, 3, 'united them in marriage He sent them into a beautiful garden. In three');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 10, 3, 3, 'things that happened in that garden, we see three choices that you,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 10, 4, 3, 'Santosh and Meghan, must make - and that all married couples must make -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 10, 5, 3, 'if you want to have the happy marriage that God planned for man.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 10, 6, 3, 'Such happy marriages are rarely seen on this earth, because most people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 10, 7, 3, 'don''t read the Scriptures, and many who do, don''t meditate on them, to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 10, 8, 3, 'find out exactly how God wants them to live as married people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 10, 9, 3, 'When God sent Adam and Eve into this garden, although He gave them ample');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 10, 10, 3, 'freedom, He did make one restriction. He forbade them from eating of one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 10, 11, 3, 'tree. There was a reason for that. Without choice, no-one can be a son');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 10, 12, 3, 'of God. No-one can be holy without personal choice. So when God sent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 10, 13, 3, 'Adam into that garden, if He had not given Adam the opportunity to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 10, 14, 3, 'choose, Adam could never have become the son that God had wanted him to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 10, 15, 3, 'become. We don''t realize how important the choices we make are - for our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 10, 16, 3, 'life on earth and even more for eternity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 10, 17, 3, 'One of the greatest gifts God has given us is the power to choose. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 10, 18, 3, 'He will never take that power away from anyone. You can choose to be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 10, 19, 3, 'son of God or you can choose to live for yourself. But whatever you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 10, 20, 3, 'choose, at the end of your life, you will reap the consequences of your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 10, 21, 3, 'choice.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 10, 22, 3, 'The Bible says, "What a man sows, that will he also reap". The Bible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 10, 23, 3, 'also says that "it is appointed unto men once to die and after this the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 10, 24, 3, 'judgment". But God will not judge men arbitrarily on that final day. His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 10, 25, 3, 'judgments will be based on the choices that each man has made.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 10, 26, 3, 'This principle applies in marriage too. You can choose whether you want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 10, 27, 3, 'to have a happy marriage or a miserable one. That choice is yours, not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 10, 28, 3, 'God''s. Adam could choose whether to yield his life to the devil or to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 11, 1, 3, 'God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 11, 2, 3, 'So I want to speak to you, Santosh and Meghan, about three choices that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 11, 3, 3, 'you must make in your marriage:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 11, 4, 3, 'First of all, choose to be centred in God in all areas of your life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 11, 5, 3, 'There were two trees in the garden of Eden - and they represented two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 11, 6, 3, 'ways of life. The tree of life symbolized a life centred in God - where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 11, 7, 3, 'God would be the centre of every decision made by man. The tree of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 11, 8, 3, 'knowledge of good and evil on the other hand, symbolized a life where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 11, 9, 3, 'Self would be the centre, and where man would live without consulting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 11, 10, 3, 'God and would determine himself what was good and what was evil. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 11, 11, 3, 'sent Adam and Eve into that garden and told them, as it were, "You can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 11, 12, 3, 'choose now which of these two ways you want to live by". And we all know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 11, 13, 3, 'what Adam chose. He chose to live a life centred in himself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 11, 14, 3, 'All the misery, sorrow and murders and every other wretched thing that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 11, 15, 3, 'we see in the world around us, is due to man having decided to choose');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 11, 16, 3, 'for himself what is good and what is evil. He doesn''t want God to tell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 11, 17, 3, 'him. And that is the reason for every unhappy marriage as well - even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 11, 18, 3, 'among Christians. Multitudes of Christians live with Self as the centre');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 11, 19, 3, 'of their life - and they reap what they sow.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 11, 20, 3, 'When God made Adam He wanted him to rule over the earth. Adam was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 11, 21, 3, 'created to be a king, not a slave. And God wanted Eve to be a queen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 11, 22, 3, 'beside Adam. But what do we see today? Men and women are slaves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 11, 23, 3, 'everywhere - slaves to their passions and to the corruptible things of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 11, 24, 3, 'earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 11, 25, 3, 'When God created this earth He made everything beautiful. The forbidden');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 11, 26, 3, 'tree was also beautiful. When Adam and Eve stood in front of that tree,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 11, 27, 3, 'they had to make a choice: Would they choose the beautiful things God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 11, 28, 3, 'had created, or would they choose God Himself?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 12, 1, 3, 'That is the choice all of us have to make every day. If our life is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 12, 2, 3, 'centred in ourselves, we will pursue after God''s gifts (the things He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 12, 3, 3, 'has created) and not after God Himself. Most of the quarrels that take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 12, 4, 3, 'place in homes are over earthly things. Such quarrels arise because the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 12, 5, 3, 'husband and wife choose created things instead of God Himself - and they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 12, 6, 3, 'reap the consequences of their choice. They sow to the flesh and so they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 12, 7, 3, 'reap corruption. Man becomes a slave when he chooses created things over');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 12, 8, 3, 'his Creator.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 12, 9, 3, 'Jesus came to deliver us from this slavery. Man is a slave today to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 12, 10, 3, 'power of money, to illegitimate sexual pleasure, to the opinions of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 12, 11, 3, 'others, and to many other things. He is not free. God created him to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 12, 12, 3, 'like the eagle that flies high in the sky. But everywhere we find man in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 12, 13, 3, 'chains, unable to conquer his temper, unable to control his tongue,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 12, 14, 3, 'unable to control his lustful eyes. Jesus came, not just to die for our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 12, 15, 3, 'sins, but also to deliver us from this slavery.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 12, 16, 3, 'I want to say to you, Santosh and Meghan, you can have a supremely happy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 12, 17, 3, 'marriage if you refuse to make the choice that Adam made, and if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 12, 18, 3, 'will say to God, "Self will never be the centre of our lives, Lord. You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 12, 19, 3, 'alone will be the Centre. Everything in our lives will be centred in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 12, 20, 3, 'You."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 12, 21, 3, 'The Bible says that God is Light and God is Love. God''s Love is His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 12, 22, 3, 'Light. In a dark room, the power of light drives away the darkness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 12, 23, 3, 'God''s power is like that. Life without God''s power, without His love,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 12, 24, 3, 'will only be darkness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 12, 25, 3, 'Our whole life on earth is a period of testing and probation, to prepare');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 12, 26, 3, 'us for a kingdom in eternity, where everything will be ruled by the law');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 12, 27, 3, 'of love. Every situation and circumstance that God takes us through now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 12, 28, 3, 'is therefore designed by Him to test us in one area - whether we will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 13, 1, 3, 'live by the law of love. And that is why God allows so many trials and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 13, 2, 3, 'difficulties in our lives. God is Almighty and He could have made life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 13, 3, 3, 'on earth such that we never had any trials at all. But God in His great');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 13, 4, 3, 'wisdom has ordained trials as a means by which we learn to love. If we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 13, 5, 3, 'overcome our selfishness and determine that love alone will guide our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 13, 6, 3, 'life, God will be able to prepare us to be rulers in His coming kingdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 13, 7, 3, 'We have to think about that now, or else we will find in eternity that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 13, 8, 3, 'we missed the opportunities that God gave us on earth - and never learnt');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 13, 9, 3, 'what we were supposed to learn.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 13, 10, 3, 'So the choice you have to make in your marriage is this: Will you live');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 13, 11, 3, 'by the law of love or by the law of selfishness? If God is the Centre of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 13, 12, 3, 'your life, His love will guide every single thing that you say and do.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 13, 13, 3, 'The second thing I want to say is this: Accept one another and don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 13, 14, 3, 'wear any masks.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 13, 15, 3, 'Before sin came, "Adam and Eve were naked and were not ashamed". They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 13, 16, 3, 'were open and honest with each other and had nothing to hide. But as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 13, 17, 3, 'soon as they sinned, things changed. They covered themselves with fig');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 13, 18, 3, 'leaves immediately. Why did they do that? There were no "peeping Toms"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 13, 19, 3, 'in that garden. And they were certainly not covering themselves from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 13, 20, 3, 'animals. Why then did they need to cover themselves with fig leaves?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 13, 21, 3, 'They were covering themselves from each other.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 13, 22, 3, 'One of the results of sin is that we hide from one another. All people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 13, 23, 3, 'hide the parts of their personality that they feel are ugly. They would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 13, 24, 3, 'be embarrassed if others knew those details about them. And so they wear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 13, 25, 3, 'masks. They put up a front, appearing to be relaxed, cool and happy,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 13, 26, 3, 'when all the while, they are miserable and defeated beneath the surface.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 13, 27, 3, 'You must determine in your marriage to be yourself with each other -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 13, 28, 3, 'never wearing any masks. Let there be no pretence and no fig leaves.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 14, 1, 3, 'Inside everyone is a desire to find someone who will love him even when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 14, 2, 3, 'the other person knows him fully. We wear masks because we have had bad');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 14, 3, 3, 'experiences with other people. We know that people will not accept us if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 14, 4, 3, 'they know everything about us. And so we put up a front before people,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 14, 5, 3, 'so that they will accept us. This is true among Christians too. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 14, 6, 3, 'Jesus was on earth, He found many religious people wearing masks - and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 14, 7, 3, 'that was why He could not help them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 14, 8, 3, 'I want to urge you both to make a decision today - never to wear a mask,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 14, 9, 3, 'but to accept each other always just as you are. Santosh, will you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 14, 10, 3, 'accept Meghan when you see faults in her? Meghan, will you accept');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 14, 11, 3, 'Santosh when you see faults in him?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 14, 12, 3, 'The wonderful thing about God is that He accepts all of us just as we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 14, 13, 3, 'are. A religion that teaches that you''ve got to improve, before God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 14, 14, 3, 'accepts you, is a false religion. Jesus did not come with such a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 14, 15, 3, 'religion. He came with the message that God loves us just as we are. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 14, 16, 3, 'knows that we cannot change ourselves. And so He receives us just as we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 14, 17, 3, 'are - and He changes us Himself. The Bible urges both of you, Santosh');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 14, 18, 3, 'and Meghan, to "receive one another just as Christ received you."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 14, 19, 3, 'I read an article some time ago that addressed this issue. I don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 14, 20, 3, 'remember the author''s name. The article said:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 14, 21, 3, 'All of us go through life playing a ''hiding game''. Because we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 14, 22, 3, 'ashamed of what we are, we hide from each other. We wear masks so that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 14, 23, 3, 'others won''t be able to see the real person living inside us. We look at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 14, 24, 3, 'each other through our masks and call that ''fellowship''. We give people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 14, 25, 3, 'the impression that we are secure and undisturbed, but that is only a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 14, 26, 3, 'mask. Underneath that mask we are confused, afraid and lonely. We fear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 14, 27, 3, 'lest others see through us. We are afraid that if they saw the real');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 14, 28, 3, 'person inside, they would reject us and perhaps laugh at us - and their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 15, 1, 3, 'laugh would kill us. So we play the ''pretending game'' - appearing to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 15, 2, 3, 'confident and assured, but all the while trembling like a child within.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 15, 3, 3, 'Our whole life becomes a front. We talk and joke with others, telling');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 15, 4, 3, 'them all the un-important things about ourselves and nothing about that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 15, 5, 3, 'which is really crying out within us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 15, 6, 3, 'We long to be accepted, understood and loved by others. But we have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 15, 7, 3, 'found in experience, that whenever we expose our real selves to others,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 15, 8, 3, 'they reject us. We keep searching for someone who will accept us, even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 15, 9, 3, 'when they know everything about us. But we never find such a person. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 15, 10, 3, 'hear of born-again Christians talking about love, and hope rises within');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 15, 11, 3, 'our hearts that perhaps they might accept us. But when we join them, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 15, 12, 3, 'discover very soon that they too are wearing masks. And they only find');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 15, 13, 3, 'fault with us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 15, 14, 3, 'What is the solution to this? We need to see ourselves accepted and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 15, 15, 3, 'loved by God just as we are. God is Love. To experience the love of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 15, 16, 3, 'will make us bold. And we will no longer need to pretend. We will then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 15, 17, 3, 'be ourselves - with God as well as with man. The love of God will never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 15, 18, 3, 'force us to do anything. God recognizes all our imperfections and He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 15, 19, 3, 'still accepts us without condemning us. On the other hand, He wants to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 15, 20, 3, 'perfect us. To know that we have been accepted by God in spite of all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 15, 21, 3, 'that He sees in us and knows about us, is the root of a happy Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 15, 22, 3, 'life. This is the abundant life that Jesus came to give.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 15, 23, 3, 'Knowing the love of God will also bring a permanent end to our seeking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 15, 24, 3, 'for acceptance from man. We will be filled with confidence. Our guilt');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 15, 25, 3, 'will be gone and our fears will be driven away. We may be alone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 15, 26, 3, 'sometimes, but never lonely, for God has promised never to leave us or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 15, 27, 3, 'forsake us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 15, 28, 3, 'There is something crying out within your marriage-partner - a longing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 16, 1, 3, 'to be accepted. And so it is important that you give a listening ear,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 16, 2, 3, 'not only to the words that your partner speaks, but also to the words');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 16, 3, 3, 'that remain unspoken - to the silent words in the heart that are never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 16, 4, 3, 'spoken.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 16, 5, 3, 'The great tragedy is that we don''t believe that even God will accept us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 16, 6, 3, 'as we are. And so we hide from Him as well. That is what Adam and Eve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 16, 7, 3, 'did. They ran behind a tree to try and hide from God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 16, 8, 3, 'Many husbands and wives cannot love each other because they have not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 16, 9, 3, 'found the joy of being accepted by God, themselves. They have got');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 16, 10, 3, 'religion but not Christ. One of the devil''s masterpieces has been to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 16, 11, 3, 'give people an empty shell of a Christian religion without Christ - and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 16, 12, 3, 'that has made people miserable. Multitudes turn away from such a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 16, 13, 3, 'religion, which is not true Christianity. True Christianity is Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 16, 14, 3, 'Himself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 16, 15, 3, 'Every home where Jesus Christ is the Centre will be a peaceful home. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 16, 16, 3, 'will be a home where husband and wife understand each other, where they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 16, 17, 3, 'accept one another because they are secure and confident in the fact');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 16, 18, 3, 'that God has accepted them both. That is the type of home you must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 16, 19, 3, 'build.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 16, 20, 3, 'Jesus loved you when you were ugly and ruined - not when you pleased');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 16, 21, 3, 'Him, but when you were evil, not when you gave Him pleasure, but when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 16, 22, 3, 'you gave Him pain. God is now calling you to love your partner in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 16, 23, 3, 'same way - freely, without looking for any grounds in your partner for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 16, 24, 3, 'your love.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 16, 25, 3, 'As you live with each other, you will soon discover faults in each other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 16, 26, 3, 'that you don''t see right now. And the thing that will help you to love');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 16, 27, 3, 'each other then, will be the assurance that God accepted you in spite of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 16, 28, 3, 'all that He saw in you. God sees things in you today that you still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 17, 1, 3, 'can''t see in yourself - and He still accepts you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 17, 2, 3, 'If you love each other like this, you will break down every prison-wall');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 17, 3, 3, 'that each of you may be hiding behind. God''s love in you is stronger');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 17, 4, 3, 'than those walls and it will gently break them all down. And then both');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 17, 5, 3, 'of you will become truly one.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 17, 6, 3, 'And now let me read the concluding words of that article:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 17, 7, 3, 'Your kindness and gentleness and the fact that you care enough to try');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 17, 8, 3, 'and understand your partner''s feelings, will make your partner grow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 17, 9, 3, 'wings - small wings and feeble wings initially, but wings. And if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 17, 10, 3, 'don''t give up, those wings will grow, so that one day both of you will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 17, 11, 3, 'fly up into the sky as eagles - the way God intended you to.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 17, 12, 3, 'The third choice you must make is to do things together.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 17, 13, 3, 'When Adam and Eve went into the garden, God sent them there together.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 17, 14, 3, 'But Satan came along and separated Eve and talked to her alone. Adam');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 17, 15, 3, 'stood there and allowed his wife to make a fatal choice all by herself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 17, 16, 3, 'He should have said, "Wait, darling. You remember what God told us. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 17, 17, 3, 'are not supposed to eat from that tree". What a different story it would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 17, 18, 3, 'have been, if he had only said that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 17, 19, 3, 'It is when husband and wife begin to act independent of each other that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 17, 20, 3, 'many problems arise. You cannot confront Satan alone. Satan is looking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 17, 21, 3, 'for opportunities to mess up your life and your home. The home is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 17, 22, 3, 'place where he attacked first - and that is where he attacks even today.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 17, 23, 3, 'As Jesus said, Satan comes to steal, to kill and to destroy. But if both');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 17, 24, 3, 'of you stand together, you can overcome Satan.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 17, 25, 3, 'Ecclesiastes 4:9-12 says:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 17, 26, 3, 'These verses are closely connected to an amazing promise in Matthew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 17, 27, 3, '18:18-20. Most husbands and wives are unable to claim this promise,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 17, 28, 3, 'because it requires that they be united with each other. I want to pass');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 18, 1, 3, 'on this promise to both of you - because it has brought wonderful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 18, 2, 3, 'answers to prayer to Annie and me in the 38 years that we have been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 18, 3, 3, 'married.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 18, 4, 3, 'It says here that if the two of you are united and agreed in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 18, 5, 3, 'spirit, you can ask for anything, and your Father in Heaven will grant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 18, 6, 3, 'your request (verse 19), because Jesus Himself is in your midst (verse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 18, 7, 3, '20). The two of you (along with Jesus as the Third Person in your midst)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 18, 8, 3, 'can also bind Satan''s activities and they will be bound (verse 18). The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 18, 9, 3, 'three of you will then be like a triple-braided cord that cannot be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 18, 10, 3, 'broken.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 18, 11, 3, 'God can solve every problem in your life. You may come across numerous');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 18, 12, 3, 'problems that man cannot solve. But there is no problem that God cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 18, 13, 3, 'solve. But both of you have to be united if God is to solve your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 18, 14, 3, 'problems. So do everything together.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 18, 15, 3, 'Forgive one another as soon as you realize that you have hurt your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 18, 16, 3, 'partner. Don''t wait. Ask for forgiveness immediately. Preserve your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 18, 17, 3, 'unity at any cost - no matter what else you may have to lose on this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 18, 18, 3, 'earth. Keep your unity, and then when you pray, you will get answers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 18, 19, 3, 'from God - quickly. And Satan will never be able to enter your home.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 18, 20, 3, 'That is God''s promise.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 18, 21, 3, 'Let me say one more thing in conclusion: Every thought, word and action');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 18, 22, 3, 'in your marriage that was not done in love will be destroyed one day.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 18, 23, 3, 'God''s love in you will enable you to overcome every difficulty. It will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 18, 24, 3, 'open closed doors and break down walls. If you pursue after this love,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 18, 25, 3, 'yours will be the happiest marriage in the whole world.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 18, 26, 3, 'It is not enough to choose the right person - you have done that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 18, 27, 3, 'already. Now you have to make the right choices, all through your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 18, 28, 3, 'married life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 19, 1, 3, 'If you adopt this principle of love today, that will be finest start');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 19, 2, 3, 'that you can make for your marriage. And if you continue along this way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 19, 3, 3, 'each day, you will prove to an ungodly generation that the love of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 19, 4, 3, 'can overcome all things and will never fail. And God will be glorified');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 19, 5, 3, 'in your life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 19, 6, 3, 'I pray that your home will be a great testimony for the Lord. I pray');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 19, 7, 3, 'that these words will not be mere words that you have heard, but words');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 19, 8, 3, 'that become flesh in your life, so that your home can be a light unto');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 19, 9, 3, 'others.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 19, 10, 3, 'The world is full of needy people. If God can work out something in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 19, 11, 3, 'life and manifest His love through you, He will use you - mark my words');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 19, 12, 3, '- He will use you to help many needy homes in the world around you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 19, 13, 3, 'May God bless you both. Amen.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 19, 14, 4, 'Chapter 3 A marriage like a garden');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 19, 15, 4, 'Message given at the wedding of Sandeep (my third son) and Laura');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 19, 16, 4, 'The first marriage was conducted by God - in a garden. So it is good for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 19, 17, 4, 'us to be in surroundings like we have here, at this wedding. Eden was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 19, 18, 4, 'something like this garden we see here, but a lot prettier. So we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 19, 19, 4, 'very thankful to God that we can meet here for this wedding.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 19, 20, 4, 'Sandeep and Laura, I want to give you a promise from Isaiah 58:11: "You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 19, 21, 4, 'will be like a watered garden". And I would add "Your marriage will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 19, 22, 4, 'like a watered garden."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 19, 23, 4, 'It says in Genesis 2 that "the Lord God planted a garden and He put the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 19, 24, 4, 'man and woman there to cultivate it". But there was another garden that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 19, 25, 4, 'God gave Adam and Eve to cultivate too - and that was their mutual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 19, 26, 4, 'relationship. That was the garden they did not cultivate. They allowed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 19, 27, 4, 'the devil to come between them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 19, 28, 4, 'The Lord has given you both a garden today, to cultivate. A garden can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 20, 1, 4, 'very easily become a wilderness if it is neglected. In Proverbs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 20, 2, 4, '24:30-34, we read about the garden of a lazy man that had become such a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 20, 3, 4, 'wilderness. That is what has happened in many marriages. But it need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 20, 4, 4, 'never happen in yours. God''s promise to both of you is, "Your marriage');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 20, 5, 4, 'will be like a watered garden."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 20, 6, 4, 'I want to speak to you today about three gardens found in Scripture.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 20, 7, 4, 'Sin came in a garden. Salvation also came in a garden. And your marriage');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 20, 8, 4, 'can be like a garden that glorifies Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 20, 9, 4, 'How did sin come in that garden? It was basically because of two wrong');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 20, 10, 4, 'attitudes that Adam and Eve had.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 20, 11, 4, 'The first was pride. They thought they knew better than God. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 20, 12, 4, 'thought they could disobey God and get away with it. That''s how many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 20, 13, 4, 'people in the world think today too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 20, 14, 4, 'The second was selfishness. They thought of what they would get for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 20, 15, 4, 'themselves if they ate of that fruit. It says there that "the woman');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 20, 16, 4, 'looked at the fruit and saw that it was good, that it would satisfy her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 20, 17, 4, 'desire and make her wise."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 20, 18, 4, 'Pride and selfishness were the causes of sin in the beginning. And these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 20, 19, 4, 'are the root-causes of all the sin in the human race today - and there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 20, 20, 4, 'are many manifestations of these.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 20, 21, 4, 'Basically, man is centred in himself and wants to live a life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 20, 22, 4, 'independent of God. That is how sin comes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 20, 23, 4, 'Sin came in a garden. And Jesus wrought our salvation in a garden too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 20, 24, 4, 'Many know about the garden of Gethsemane. But they don''t know that Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 20, 25, 4, 'was crucified in a garden too and that He was buried in a garden as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 20, 26, 4, 'well.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 20, 27, 4, 'John 19:41 says:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 20, 28, 4, 'Jesus was betrayed in a garden, He was crucified in a garden, He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 21, 1, 4, 'buried in a garden and He was raised from the dead in a garden.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 21, 2, 4, 'Salvation has now come for both of you in that garden. The benefit of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 21, 3, 4, 'all that Jesus did in that garden can be yours today.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 21, 4, 4, 'When we look at the earthly life of Jesus, we see in it, the exact');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 21, 5, 4, 'opposite of the pride and selfishness that we see in Adam''s race.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 21, 6, 4, 'In Christ''s life we see a humility that was willing to do exactly what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 21, 7, 4, 'His Father wanted Him to do - even if it was to die on a cross. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 21, 8, 4, 'readily chose that way - without any reservation whatsoever.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 21, 9, 4, 'Christ also selflessly thought of the needs of others and not His own -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 21, 10, 4, 'and was willing to sacrifice Himself in order to help them. This is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 21, 11, 4, 'attitude He wants both of you to have as well.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 21, 12, 4, 'The third garden I want to mention is one which is not so well known to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 21, 13, 4, 'most Christians. This garden is mentioned in the Song of Solomon (which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 21, 14, 4, 'is a song that describes the relationship between a Bridegroom and a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 21, 15, 4, 'Bride, between a husband and a wife).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 21, 16, 4, 'In Song of Solomon 4:12, the Bridegroom says, "My bride is like a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 21, 17, 4, 'private garden". The bridegroom here is Christ. And we, His bride, are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 21, 18, 4, 'to be a garden reserved exclusively for Him. This is what you need to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 21, 19, 4, 'recognize first of all: You are to plant a garden together in your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 21, 20, 4, 'marriage. But that garden is not primarily for your benefit, or even for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 21, 21, 4, 'the benefit of others, but for the Lord. Keep this in mind always - that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 21, 22, 4, 'your marriage is to be a private garden for the Lord. Then, as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 21, 23, 4, 'by-product, others will also be blessed through it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 21, 24, 4, 'This is what Jesus taught. When somebody asked Him what the greatest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 21, 25, 4, 'commandment in the law was, He said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 21, 26, 4, 'Our life must always begin with God first. That was why God created Adam');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 21, 27, 4, 'and Eve separately and not together - so that when Adam opened his eyes,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 21, 28, 4, 'the first person he would see would be God and not Eve. And when Eve was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 22, 1, 4, 'created later and she opened her eyes, the first person she saw was God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 22, 2, 4, 'and not Adam. That''s the way it must be in your life always, if your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 22, 3, 4, 'marriage is to be like a watered garden.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 22, 4, 4, 'Every garden needs rain. And in the new covenant, we have the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 22, 5, 4, 'opportunity to be filled with the Holy Spirit - the rain of heaven. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 22, 6, 4, 'want to encourage you to seek God wholeheartedly for this. To be filled');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 22, 7, 4, 'with the Holy Spirit means to have every area of your life under the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 22, 8, 4, 'control of the Holy Spirit. Open yourself to heaven''s rain then, every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 22, 9, 4, 'day of your life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 22, 10, 4, 'I find there is a lot of difference between Eastern culture and Western');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 22, 11, 4, 'culture. But pride is the same in both cultures! In Eastern culture - in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 22, 12, 4, 'marriages in India - they don''t sing, "Here comes the bride". They sing,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 22, 13, 4, '"Here comes the bridegroom". In some Indian marriages, the bridegroom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 22, 14, 4, 'comes riding in on a horse because he is the important person in an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 22, 15, 4, 'Eastern wedding. And the bride just walks behind the horse, because she');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 22, 16, 4, 'is considered inferior. That is Eastern culture.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 22, 17, 4, 'In Western culture however things are the opposite. Here everybody');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 22, 18, 4, 'stands up for the bride during the service, but no-one stands up for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 22, 19, 4, 'bridegroom! Because the emphasis here is on the bride: "Here comes the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 22, 20, 4, 'bride"!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 22, 21, 4, 'But in a Christian culture it should be, "Here comes the Lord". Both');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 22, 22, 4, 'Eastern culture and Western culture have been defiled by sin. In one,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 22, 23, 4, 'the man is prominent, and in the other, the woman is prominent. But when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 22, 24, 4, 'the Lord is given first place, then you can say "Here comes the Lord".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 22, 25, 4, 'Further: in Eastern culture, the man glories in saying, "I didn''t go and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 22, 26, 4, 'ask for her. Her father came and asked for me." Do you see the pride');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 22, 27, 4, 'there? In Western culture however, it is the girl who says "I didn''t go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 22, 28, 4, 'seeking for him. He came and wooed me and won me". There is pride there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 23, 1, 4, 'too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 23, 2, 4, 'In Christian culture however, we humbly say, "The Lord brought us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 23, 3, 4, 'together. We love the Lord and we are both equal in His eyes."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 23, 4, 4, 'I want to encourage both of you to rise above the pride of your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 23, 5, 4, 'respective cultures and to be Christian. Let your song each morning be,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 23, 6, 4, '"Here comes the Lord" - and may both of you be His humble servants. Then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 23, 7, 4, 'your marriage will be like a watered garden.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 23, 8, 4, 'Along with pride, selfishness also is common to all cultures. When a man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 23, 9, 4, 'looks for a girl to marry, he selfishly looks for beauty - for a pretty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 23, 10, 4, 'girl. And when a girl looks for a man to marry, she selfishly looks for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 23, 11, 4, 'money - for a rich man. This is true all over the world.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 23, 12, 4, 'But in a Christian culture, you choose a person primarily because He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 23, 13, 4, 'loves the Lord and honours Him. And so I want to urge you both to rise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 23, 14, 4, 'above the selfishness of the human race too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 23, 15, 4, 'Since both of you are from different cultures originally, I thought I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 23, 16, 4, 'would make it clear that no culture is superior to the other. Easterners');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 23, 17, 4, 'think they are superior to the Westerners, and Westerners think they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 23, 18, 4, 'superior to the Easterners. But they are both wrong. Christian culture');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 23, 19, 4, 'is the highest - and that is what God wants you to follow.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 23, 20, 4, 'I did a ''Google'' search, to find out how to plant a good garden, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 23, 21, 4, 'here are five rules that I found:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 23, 22, 4, 'These are the laws that God Himself has made for gardens all over the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 23, 23, 4, 'world. So make your family your first priority.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 23, 24, 4, 'And now let me turn to Song of Solomon 4:16.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 23, 25, 4, 'In every marriage, we will face the cold north wind of adversity, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 23, 26, 4, 'the warm south wind of prosperity. But when Jesus is our Head and we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 23, 27, 4, 'allow Him to control our lives, then whether we face adversity or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 23, 28, 4, 'prosperity, trial or comfort, both these winds will spread abroad the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 24, 1, 4, 'fragrance of Christ through us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 24, 2, 4, 'In the world, they are unable to do that. In the world, they complain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 24, 3, 4, 'about everything. They complain even against God in times of adversity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 24, 4, 4, 'Everyone in the world can handle the south wind of prosperity. But they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 24, 5, 4, 'cannot handle the north wind of adversity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 24, 6, 4, 'But the Bride of Christ can handle both adversity and prosperity');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 24, 7, 4, 'triumphantly. It can be like that for both of you - and for all of us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 24, 8, 4, 'who are married.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 24, 9, 4, 'And finally: We read here, "May my Beloved come into his garden and eat');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 24, 10, 4, 'its choice fruits!" Your triumphs in times of adversity are for the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 24, 11, 4, 'alone to see - and not for you to show-off to others. The Lord sees your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 24, 12, 4, 'life in secret, at times when others do not. And when He comes into His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 24, 13, 4, 'garden, He should find something there always, that delights His heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 24, 14, 4, 'May God bless you both. Amen.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 24, 15, 5, 'Chapter 4 The home – a sanctuary for God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 24, 16, 5, 'Message given at the wedding of Sunil (my fourth son) and Anugrah');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 24, 17, 5, 'God''s Word is the foundation for our life, for our home and for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 24, 18, 5, 'everything else in this world - because God created this world by His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 24, 19, 5, 'Word. And so if we keep God''s Word alone as our foundation, nothing can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 24, 20, 5, 'go wrong.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 24, 21, 5, 'In Exodus 25, we see for the first time, God revealing His will that He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 24, 22, 5, 'wants to dwell with man. God says there in Exodus 25:8, "Let them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 24, 23, 5, 'construct a sanctuary that I may dwell among them." That was referring');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 24, 24, 5, 'to the tabernacle upon which the fire of God rested - the glory of God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 24, 25, 5, 'that marked those Israelites out as different from all the other people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 24, 26, 5, 'in the world.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 24, 27, 5, 'It is easy to make a tabernacle exactly like the one we read of in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 24, 28, 5, 'Exodus, because all its dimensions are given there. We can make an exact');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 25, 1, 5, 'replica of that tabernacle, but there is one thing there that we will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 25, 2, 5, 'not be able to duplicate - the glory of God that rested upon it. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 25, 3, 5, 'most important thing about that sanctuary was the glory of God that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 25, 4, 5, 'rested upon it - and this indicated His presence among His people.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 25, 5, 5, 'Sunil and Anugrah, now that you are getting married, the most important');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 25, 6, 5, 'thing you must do is to make your home a sanctuary for God - not a place');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 25, 7, 5, 'where you seek to please each other, although you should seek to please');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 25, 8, 5, 'each other; not even a place to bless other people, although your home');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 25, 9, 5, 'should bless other people; but primarily a place where God can manifest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 25, 10, 5, 'His presence, and where Jesus feels at home. God says "Let them make a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 25, 11, 5, 'place for Me to live".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 25, 12, 5, 'And I want to say to both of you: God is commanding you to build a home');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 25, 13, 5, 'for Him to live in.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 25, 14, 5, 'We all know how when we go into some homes that we don''t feel at home');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 25, 15, 5, 'there. Whereas in other homes, right from the moment we enter, they make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 25, 16, 5, 'us feel completely at home. It is difficult to explain this feeling, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 25, 17, 5, 'we all know it. A Christian home must be a place where Jesus feels');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 25, 18, 5, 'completely at home. That means that He is happy about everything He sees');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 25, 19, 5, 'there. He is happy about the books you read, the magazines you get, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 25, 20, 5, 'conversation between husband and wife, the things you talk about, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 25, 21, 5, 'programs you watch on TV and everything else. In many Christian homes,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 25, 22, 5, 'they have Bible-verses hanging on the wall. But Jesus does not feel at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 25, 23, 5, 'home there.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 25, 24, 5, 'Can you imagine with what tremendous anticipation God brought Adam and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 25, 25, 5, 'Eve together. What wonderful plans He had for them as a Father. I am a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 25, 26, 5, 'father, and I know with what anticipation I see my son getting married');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 25, 27, 5, 'today. But what I feel is only a fraction of what God felt when He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 25, 28, 5, 'brought Adam and Eve together. He hoped that they would have a wonderful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 26, 1, 5, 'home where He would always be first. But how soon God was disappointed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 26, 2, 5, 'He was not angry with them, He was sad. I believe there is a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 26, 3, 5, 'sadness in God''s heart today when He sees the condition of many a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 26, 4, 5, 'Christian home, where there is no peace, but only quarrelling and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 26, 5, 5, 'fighting. They turn to Him only when they are in trouble. The people of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 26, 6, 5, 'the world turn to God only when they face some problems. But as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 26, 7, 5, 'Christians we are to be different. God is not an emergency number that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 26, 8, 5, 'we are to call when we are in some difficulty. No. God must be the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 26, 9, 5, 'Centre of our lives at all times.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 26, 10, 5, 'God''s Word has been given to us exactly like the "Manufacturer''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 26, 11, 5, 'Instructions" that we get with any gadget that we buy. All of us are so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 26, 12, 5, 'careful after buying an electronic gadget to follow those instructions');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 26, 13, 5, 'exactly. If your gadget has some problem and you take it to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 26, 14, 5, 'manufacturer, the first question he will ask you will be, "Did you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 26, 15, 5, 'follow the Manufacturer''s instruction-booklet exactly?" In fact, in most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 26, 16, 5, 'guarantee cards it is clearly written that the guarantee becomes invalid');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 26, 17, 5, 'if you don''t follow the instructions exactly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 26, 18, 5, 'The wonderful thing about God however is that when we go to Him with our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 26, 19, 5, 'messed-up life at any time, He is still willing to rectify it. His is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 26, 20, 5, 'not a one-year guarantee! It''s a life-long one! If you come to Him with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 26, 21, 5, 'your broken life, He will straighten it out. That''s the wonderful thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 26, 22, 5, 'about God - He is a loving Father. And it''s very important that you know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 26, 23, 5, 'that the One Who is asking you to make a sanctuary for Him in your home');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 26, 24, 5, 'is a loving Father. He is very, very interested in your lives, right');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 26, 25, 5, 'from this very first day, and He wants you to be happy until the day');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 26, 26, 5, 'that Jesus returns.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 26, 27, 5, 'I have tasted a little bit of that happiness with my wife for many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 26, 28, 5, 'decades in our married life. And I can tell you that the most wonderful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 27, 1, 5, 'life you can ever live is one where Jesus is the Centre of your life,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 27, 2, 5, 'and where everything in your home is determined by whether it makes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 27, 3, 5, 'Jesus happy or not - the way you spend your time, the way you spend your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 27, 4, 5, 'money, and the way you do everything else. If you live like that, then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 27, 5, 5, 'when you come to the end of your life, or if Christ returns before that,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 27, 6, 5, 'and you stand before Him, He will say, "Well done". It won''t matter then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 27, 7, 5, 'what others thought about you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 27, 8, 5, 'One characteristic of man is that he judges by the outward appearance. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 27, 9, 5, 'did that myself for many years, when I was a legalist. But I now see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 27, 10, 5, 'more clearly that it is the heart that God looks at. I want you both to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 27, 11, 5, 'remember that it''s your heart that should always be pure. Whether your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 27, 12, 5, 'home is a palace or a hut is secondary - the outward appearance is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 27, 13, 5, 'secondary. It''s your heart that God sees. So make sure that your hearts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 27, 14, 5, 'are together a sanctuary - a holy place - for God to dwell in.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 27, 15, 5, 'Where does God dwell? First of all in a home where there is peace. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 27, 16, 5, 'Jesus sent His disciples out to different places to preach, He told them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 27, 17, 5, 'in Luke 10:5-7, to look for a home where there was peace. And when they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 27, 18, 5, 'found a home like that, they were to stay only there and not look for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 27, 19, 5, 'another home. Why did He say that? Because He knew that they would not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 27, 20, 5, 'find many homes where there was peace.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 27, 21, 5, 'God dwells in a home where there is no fighting. What do husbands and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 27, 22, 5, 'wives fight about in any case? Mostly about material things - some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 27, 23, 5, 'earthly matter that went wrong. Things will go wrong in this world. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 27, 24, 5, 'when something goes wrong, remember that the only thing that is serious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 27, 25, 5, 'is sin. All other matters are secondary and unimportant. I hope both of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 27, 26, 5, 'you will see this clearly: That the only thing that is serious is sin.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 27, 27, 5, 'If you have bitterness at any time and won''t talk to each other because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 27, 28, 5, 'of earthly problems, that will grieve God''s heart. Let me share this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 28, 1, 5, 'little bit of wisdom with you: Hate sin - because that is the only thing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 28, 2, 5, 'that can destroy your marriage.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 28, 3, 5, 'Remember that your home is to be a sanctuary for God. And if anything');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 28, 4, 5, 'comes up that disturbs the peace in your home, it won''t be a sanctuary');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 28, 5, 5, 'any longer. I am not saying that the Lord will be angry with you or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 28, 6, 5, 'curse you. No. He will never curse you or be angry with you, at any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 28, 7, 5, 'time. But He will be unhappy. And I am sure you want Jesus to be happy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 28, 8, 5, 'in your home from Day One.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 28, 9, 5, 'I pray that in everything you do, you will say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 28, 10, 5, 'Can you imagine what your home will be like then? It will have the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 28, 11, 5, 'glory of God that shone on the tabernacle. And people will be drawn to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 28, 12, 5, 'the living God through your home.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 28, 13, 5, 'God dwells where both husband and wife are willing to give up their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 28, 14, 5, 'rights for the sake of peace. Once a young couple came to me, who were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 28, 15, 5, 'on their way to catch a train and they said, "Brother Zac, can you give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 28, 16, 5, 'us an exhortation in two minutes?" I said, "Sure. Here it is: Always be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 28, 17, 5, 'ready to ask forgiveness from one another; and always be ready to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 28, 18, 5, 'forgive one another."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 28, 19, 5, 'If you''re ready to ask forgiveness as soon as you have done something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 28, 20, 5, 'wrong and you''re ready to forgive immediately, as soon as the other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 28, 21, 5, 'person asks for forgiveness, I can give you a written guarantee that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 28, 22, 5, 'your home will be a home of peace, everyday.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 28, 23, 5, 'Your home can be like that. But you have got to be very sensitive in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 28, 24, 5, 'this matter. If you get a thorn in your foot, you won''t wait even for a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 28, 25, 5, 'second to remove it. In the same way, as soon as you sense some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 28, 26, 5, 'disturbance in your heart, you must remove it at once. It''s a thorn; and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 28, 27, 5, 'it will destroy you. It will infect your heart more than any thorn can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 28, 28, 5, 'infect your foot. Pursue peace at any cost. Never mind whatever else you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 29, 1, 5, 'may lose - money or whatever. Those things are not as important as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 29, 2, 5, 'peace. I hope you both will recognize that if you were to weigh peace');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 29, 3, 5, 'and money in a balance, peace will be found to be much heavier than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 29, 4, 5, 'money. Remember that!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 29, 5, 5, 'Did something go wrong at home one day? Did the food get burnt? Never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 29, 6, 5, 'mind. What does it matter if you can''t eat one meal because the food was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 29, 7, 5, 'burnt. That will probably keep you fitter and healthier and perhaps even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 29, 8, 5, 'make you more spiritual! But if you get upset over it, then the devil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 29, 9, 5, 'would have won the victory.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 29, 10, 5, 'Remember what happened to the first home that God established. The devil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 29, 11, 5, 'was just waiting on the sidelines trying to come between Adam and Eve.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 29, 12, 5, 'And he succeeded. He succeeded in coming between Job and his wife too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 29, 13, 5, 'And he succeeded in coming between Isaac and Rebekah as well.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 29, 14, 5, 'It is never God''s will that Satan should come between a husband and a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 29, 15, 5, 'wife. So may it never happen to you. May God be happy with your home');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 29, 16, 5, 'always and may He grant you peace at all times.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 29, 17, 5, 'The second thing I want to say is found in Isaiah 57:15:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 29, 18, 5, 'God dwells with those who are contrite and broken in spirit. A broken');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 29, 19, 5, 'person is one who is more aware of his own lack and failure than anyone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 29, 20, 5, 'else''s. The world is full of people who are aware of the failures of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 29, 21, 5, 'other people. In the average home today, the conversation is mostly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 29, 22, 5, 'about the failures of other people and their families. We are quick to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 29, 23, 5, 'notice failures in others. But often, we don''t see the good points in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 29, 24, 5, 'those people. We have all been guilty of this. I have been guilty of it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 29, 25, 5, 'myself in the past. But God has given me light on this evil, and I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 29, 26, 5, 'repented.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 29, 27, 5, 'We have no right to throw stones at anyone, for we ourselves are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 29, 28, 5, 'sinners, saved by God''s grace. But hopefully, we are people who don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 30, 1, 5, 'want to keep on committing the same sin again and again - especially the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 30, 2, 5, 'sin of speaking about the faults of other people. We all know the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 30, 3, 5, 'difference between a bathroom mirror and a driving mirror. In a bathroom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 30, 4, 5, 'mirror we see our own face. In a driving mirror we see someone else''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 30, 5, 5, 'face. It says in James 1:23-25 that God''s word is like a mirror. But is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 30, 6, 5, 'it a bathroom mirror or a driving mirror? Whose face do you see in it?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 30, 7, 5, 'Do you see in it a word to preach to someone else? Or do you see in it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 30, 8, 5, 'something that you are not obeying. It says in Hebrews 10:7, "In the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 30, 9, 5, 'Book, it is written about me."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 30, 10, 5, 'I spent many years of my life foolishly, looking at God''s word like a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 30, 11, 5, 'driving mirror, looking for verses to preach at other people. And in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 30, 12, 5, 'those years I was miserable, and I brought others into bondage too. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 30, 13, 5, 'I have been liberated from all that now. I still have my convictions,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 30, 14, 5, 'but I never impose them on others. I share them with others, but I never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 30, 15, 5, 'impose them on others, because that is not my business. I have to live');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 30, 16, 5, 'before God''s face alone.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 30, 17, 5, 'And now I know this wonderful truth, that the other person may not have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 30, 18, 5, 'as much light as God has given me. This truth has helped me so much in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 30, 19, 5, 'the past 20 years and more. Before that, I expected everyone around me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 30, 20, 5, 'to have the same light and understanding of sin that I had. But I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 30, 21, 5, 'discovered through the years that each person has only got a certain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 30, 22, 5, 'amount of light and understanding. And Almighty God expects each person');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 30, 23, 5, 'to live only according to the light that he himself has, and not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 30, 24, 5, 'according to the light that someone else has. We know how much light God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 30, 25, 5, 'has given us. But we don''t know how much light God has given that other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 30, 26, 5, 'person. So we must be merciful.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 30, 27, 5, 'Did you see the way that light went off just now! That''s an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 30, 28, 5, 'illustration. Recognize that some people see things clearly in a very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 31, 1, 5, 'bright light, whereas others see things in a dimmer light. It was good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 31, 2, 5, 'of God to give us a demonstration of this truth before our eyes right');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 31, 3, 5, 'now - with that light going off!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 31, 4, 5, 'So Sunil: Recognize that Anugrah may not have as much light as you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 31, 5, 5, 'in some areas.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 31, 6, 5, 'And Anugrah: Recognize that Sunil may not have as much light as you have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 31, 7, 5, 'in some areas.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 31, 8, 5, 'Each of you must live by the light that you have, and leave the other to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 31, 9, 5, 'live according to the light he or she has.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 31, 10, 5, 'A sixth standard student knows more than a second standard student. So');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 31, 11, 5, 'if a sixth standard expects a second standard student to know as much as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 31, 12, 5, 'he does, then he is being foolish. And if I, at the age of 65, expect a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 31, 13, 5, '26-year-old to have as much light and understanding on God''s ways as I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 31, 14, 5, 'have, then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 31, 15, 5, 'I am being foolish. But I won''t be foolish.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 31, 16, 5, 'Many Christians are foolish. They expect others to acquire in one year');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 31, 17, 5, 'the wisdom that they themselves have acquired in thirty years.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 31, 18, 5, 'How much wisdom then do I expect this young couple to have? Only the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 31, 19, 5, 'wisdom of people in their twenties.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 31, 20, 5, 'And Sunil and Anugrah: I''ll tell you something to encourage you: You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 31, 21, 5, 'will probably do ten times less foolish things than I did when I was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 31, 22, 5, 'your age! I hope you are encouraged by that. But God has been merciful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 31, 23, 5, 'with me, and He has encouraged me in spite of all my mistakes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 31, 24, 5, 'Let me say something to you both as a father. And by the way Anugrah, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 31, 25, 5, 'am not your father-in-law. I decided a long time ago, that since I was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 31, 26, 5, 'not under law but under grace, I would never have a daughter-in-law, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 31, 27, 5, 'only daughters. You can test me out on that in the next few years and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 31, 28, 5, 'see whether I treat you like a daughter or a daughter-in-law. And if I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 32, 1, 5, 'slip up at any time, please remind me of what I said today that I would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 32, 2, 5, 'treat you like a daughter. I will.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 32, 3, 5, 'What I want to say to both of you as your father, is that I will never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 32, 4, 5, 'expect either of you to have the light or the wisdom that I have. I hope');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 32, 5, 5, 'you will have as much wisdom as I have, before you reach the age of 65 -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 32, 6, 5, 'perhaps by the time you are 45. And by the time you are 65, I hope you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 32, 7, 5, 'will have a lot more wisdom than I have right now.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 32, 8, 5, 'So when you meet people who expect you to have the wisdom that they have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 32, 9, 5, 'acquired in 40 years, just ignore them. There is a lovely verse in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 32, 10, 5, 'Isaiah 42:19 that says a true servant of the Lord is both blind and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 32, 11, 5, 'deaf. Be blind and deaf to the opinions of people around you. That verse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 32, 12, 5, 'has helped me tremendously. It will help you too. It is only as you are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 32, 13, 5, 'blind and deaf to the opinions of people around you, that you can live');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 32, 14, 5, 'before God''s face as His servants.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 32, 15, 5, 'So seek to find out what''s wrong with yourself and not with the others');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 32, 16, 5, 'who criticize you. If others want to destroy themselves, by criticizing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 32, 17, 5, 'you, let them destroy themselves. But I decided years ago that I was not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 32, 18, 5, 'going to destroy myself like that. I did many foolish things in my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 32, 19, 5, 'younger days. But I have a little more wisdom now. Paul said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 32, 20, 5, 'I want to encourage both of you also to grow up quickly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 32, 21, 5, 'God dwells in a home where the husband and wife walk in holiness every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 32, 22, 5, 'day.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 32, 23, 5, 'It says in Ezekiel 43:12:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 32, 24, 5, 'The tabernacle had three parts - the outer court, the holy place and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 32, 25, 5, 'most holy place. And of the three, the Most Holy place was the smallest.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 32, 26, 5, 'But here we read that in the new covenant, there will be no outer court');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 32, 27, 5, 'or holy place. The whole area will be the Most Holy Place. That means');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 32, 28, 5, 'that the glory of God under the new covenant will rest not just in one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 33, 1, 5, 'corner like in the tabernacle, but over the whole compound.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 33, 2, 5, 'What that means for your life is that you are going to be holy all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 33, 3, 5, 'time - not just on Sundays but every day. You are going to be holy not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 33, 4, 5, 'just when you read the Bible, but when doing anything. Every nook and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 33, 5, 5, 'corner of your life and of your home is going to be holy. And holiness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 33, 6, 5, 'is not a matter of following certain religious rituals, but of avoiding');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 33, 7, 5, 'everything that displeases God - according to the light that you have.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 33, 8, 5, 'May this be true in both your lives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 33, 9, 5, 'God has a wonderful plan for your lives together. When God first made');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 33, 10, 5, 'Adam, there was no Eve. God breathed life into Adam and when Adam opened');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 33, 11, 5, 'his eyes, the first person he saw was God. And I hope, Sunil, that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 33, 12, 5, 'first person you see every day in your life will be God Himself. Then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 33, 13, 5, 'God put Adam to sleep and took out one of his ribs and made Eve. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 33, 14, 5, 'when Eve opened her eyes, the first person she saw was God too. And I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 33, 15, 5, 'hope, Anugrah, that the first person you see every day in your life will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 33, 16, 5, 'be God Himself. Eve didn''t even know that Adam existed when she saw God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 33, 17, 5, 'It was only after that, that God brought Eve to Adam and said, "OK. Now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 33, 18, 5, 'both of you can get married." They really loved each other then -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 33, 19, 5, 'because they had both seen God first. That is the secret of a continuing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 33, 20, 5, 'love in marriage - both must see God first.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 33, 21, 5, 'And what God did for Adam, He also did for you, Sunil. 26 years ago when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 33, 22, 5, 'you were born, we were happy as your parents. But God knew about your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 33, 23, 5, 'birth long before that day. Your name was written in the book of life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 33, 24, 5, 'long before your Mum and I were even married. The wonderful truth is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 33, 25, 5, 'that God had planned for your marriage too, before you were born. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 33, 26, 5, 'so, a few years after you were born, God brought a little girl to birth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 33, 27, 5, 'in another part of India - with a plan that you didn''t know about and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 33, 28, 5, 'that Anugrah didn''t know about either. God is a great Matchmaker and He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 34, 1, 5, 'had this wonderful plan for both of you that neither of you knew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 34, 2, 5, 'anything about. And as this little girl grew up, all the time God had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 34, 3, 5, 'you in mind for her. And then one day, He brought you both together,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 34, 4, 5, 'exactly like He brought Adam and Eve together. How good God has been to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 34, 5, 5, 'you.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 34, 6, 5, 'And so my prayer for both of you is that God will be really happy with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 34, 7, 5, 'your life and that you will build your home as a sanctuary.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 34, 8, 5, 'May God bless you both. Amen.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 34, 9, 5, 'Share');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 34, 10, 5, 'Who Am I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 34, 11, 5, 'Our Message');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 34, 12, 5, 'Resources');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 34, 13, 5, 'Study Series');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('a_heavenly_home', 34, 14, 5, 'About us');
