INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 1, 1, 1, 'Chapter 0 Introduction');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 1, 2, 1, 'The first part of this book describes a number of events in the life of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 1, 3, 1, 'Zac Poonen - from the time he was converted as an officer in the Indian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 1, 4, 1, 'Navy to the time when he left the Navy to serve the Lord full-time. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 1, 5, 1, 'describes some of the ways in which the Lord trained and prepared him to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 1, 6, 1, 'be His servant.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 1, 7, 1, 'The second part of this book describes something of the ministry that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 1, 8, 1, 'God gave him and the lessons that he and his coworkers learnt as they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 1, 9, 1, 'sought to serve the Lord and build the church - the Body of Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 1, 10, 1, 'This is not an autobiography nor a record of Zac''s ministry, but rather');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 1, 11, 1, 'an account of the lessons learnt and the principles followed as he did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 1, 12, 1, 'the Lord''s work.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 1, 13, 1, 'Zac has written this book primarily to challenge young people to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 1, 14, 1, 'faithful to the Lord, so that they can be trained and prepared by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 1, 15, 1, 'Lord for His service and to build the church according to New-Testament');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 1, 16, 1, 'principles.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 1, 17, 2, 'Chapter 1 Listening to God’s Voice');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 1, 18, 2, 'Large doors swing on small hinges. God tests us in many areas many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 1, 19, 2, 'times, before He commits any important ministry to us. He tests us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 1, 20, 2, 'see if we are faithful in the little things before He commits greater');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 1, 21, 2, 'things to us. As with Adam and Eve, God asks for obedience to His voice');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 1, 22, 2, 'first of all.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 1, 23, 2, 'One of my earliest memories of obeying the voice of the Lord was when I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 1, 24, 2, 'was 15 years old, soon after I had joined the National Defence Academy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 1, 25, 2, 'at Khadakvasla (Pune) for training to be a Naval officer. The year was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 1, 26, 2, '1955 and I was on vacation (from the Academy), with my parents who lived');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 1, 27, 2, 'in New Delhi. One Sunday evening, my younger brother and I had gone to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 1, 28, 2, 'attend a church service. After the service, at about 8 pm, both of us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 2, 1, 2, 'were waiting at the bus stand to catch the bus to return home. Suddenly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 2, 2, 2, 'a thought began to grow in my mind that I should witness to someone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 2, 3, 2, 'about Christ. I had heard the good news of the gospel again that evening');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 2, 4, 2, 'and felt I must share it with someone, before going to bed that night.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 2, 5, 2, 'But I was not sure whether this was a prompting from the Lord or just my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 2, 6, 2, 'own thought. In any case it was getting late - and I needed to get back');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 2, 7, 2, 'home soon.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 2, 8, 2, 'In the distance, I saw the lights of a bus coming towards us. I told the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 2, 9, 2, 'Lord silently, "If that is NOT the bus to my home, then I will take it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 2, 10, 2, 'as a sign from You that I should witness to someone before going home.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 2, 11, 2, 'If it IS the bus for my home, then I will take the bus and go home." The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 2, 12, 2, 'bus drew near and I saw that it was NOT the bus I had to take. The sign');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 2, 13, 2, 'I had asked for was fulfilled. So I told my younger brother that I had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 2, 14, 2, 'to go somewhere else before coming home and asked him to go home alone.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 2, 15, 2, 'I then walked to a nearby park hoping that I would meet someone there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 2, 16, 2, 'whom it would be easy to witness to - because this was the first time I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 2, 17, 2, 'was venturing out to witness for the Lord in a public place, alone.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 2, 18, 2, 'I saw an old man sitting on a bench in the park and went and sat next to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 2, 19, 2, 'him. I made casual conversation with him for a few minutes in Hindi and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 2, 20, 2, 'soon became bold enough to talk to him about eternal things. I told him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 2, 21, 2, 'about the love of God for man and how Christ died for our sins and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 2, 22, 2, 'simple gospel message that I knew. He listened to me patiently. Since it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 2, 23, 2, 'was God Who had put an urge within me to witness that night, I assume');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 2, 24, 2, 'that He must have had this man in mind to reach with the gospel. I hope');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 2, 25, 2, 'I shall meet this man in heaven one day. That was my first venture at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 2, 26, 2, 'witnessing openly and all by myself in a public place. God tested me to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 2, 27, 2, 'see if I would obey the inner promptings of His Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 2, 28, 2, 'That was "the day of small beginnings" (Zechariah 4:10). Since then God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 3, 1, 2, 'has given me the opportunity to preach His Word to crowds of many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 3, 2, 2, 'thousands of people in many parts of the world. But it all began with a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 3, 3, 2, 'small act of obedience one Sunday evening in New Delhi.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 3, 4, 2, 'Be sensitive to the voice of the Holy Spirit. You will never know until');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 3, 5, 2, 'you stand before the Lord how much you missed whenever you did NOT obey');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 3, 6, 2, 'that voice.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 3, 7, 3, 'Chapter 2 Assurance of Salvation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 3, 8, 3, 'Some believers can remember very clearly the exact date and time when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 3, 9, 3, 'they were born again. But I cannot. In fact I don''t even know in which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 3, 10, 3, 'year I was born again. That does not mean that being born again is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 3, 11, 3, 'gradual process. It is not. Passing from death to life in Christ takes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 3, 12, 3, 'place in an instant. But many people like me who were born and brought');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 3, 13, 3, 'up in God-fearing Christian homes, cannot pinpoint the exact moment when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 3, 14, 3, 'that miracle took place. That is because many who are like me, ask the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 3, 15, 3, 'Lord to come into their heart, many, many times and we can''t say which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 3, 16, 3, 'of those times was the real one.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 3, 17, 3, 'If I remember rightly, I asked the Lord to come into my heart for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 3, 18, 3, 'first time, when I was about 13. But I did not know whether He had come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 3, 19, 3, 'in or not, because I did not feel or experience anything, when I prayed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 3, 20, 3, 'So I kept on asking the Lord to come into my heart again and again -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 3, 21, 3, 'perhaps over a hundred times during the next few years - but each time I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 3, 22, 3, 'felt nothing! And so I did not know whether I was saved or not.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 3, 23, 3, 'As long as I was at home, the restraints imposed on me by my parents');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 3, 24, 3, 'kept me from many worldly forms of entertainment like the cinema etc.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 3, 25, 3, 'But once I joined the military academy and the Indian Navy, I was on my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 3, 26, 3, 'own and such restraints were gone. Gradually I became a worldly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 3, 27, 3, 'Christian who went to church only as a matter of habit - and not out of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 3, 28, 3, 'any conviction.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 4, 1, 3, 'But one good thing came out of my trying out the world''s entertainments.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 4, 2, 3, 'I discovered that everything the world had to offer was empty and hollow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 4, 3, 3, '- incapable of satisfying me in a lasting way. One day, in July 1959, as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 4, 4, 3, 'I was sitting in my room in the Naval Base at Cochin and thinking about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 4, 5, 3, 'all this and reading the Bible, I came to John 6:37, where Jesus said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 4, 6, 3, '"I will certainly not cast out anyone who comes to me". I had read that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 4, 7, 3, 'verse many times before. But that day it struck me forcefully - and I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 4, 8, 3, 'believed it. I knew that I had come to the Lord many times. I suddenly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 4, 9, 3, 'realized that if I had done my part, Jesus must have done His part - He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 4, 10, 3, 'must have received me. It was then that I realized that unbelief was the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 4, 11, 3, 'greatest sin (See John 16:9). For if I did not believe God''s word, I was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 4, 12, 3, 'then making Him out to be a liar - and that was the greatest insult');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 4, 13, 3, 'anyone could give to God. So, after 6 years of being tossed about, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 4, 14, 3, 'believed - and I was sure that I was saved. What did I learn from my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 4, 15, 3, 'experience? Two things.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 4, 16, 3, 'First of all, that when you are not sure of your salvation, it is very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 4, 17, 3, 'easy to get discouraged and to backslide.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 4, 18, 3, 'Secondly, that faith is a gift of God. I was 19 years old when I first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 4, 19, 3, 'got assurance of my salvation. More than 66 years have passed since that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 4, 20, 3, 'day, but I have never once doubted my salvation. I have doubted many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 4, 21, 3, 'other things in these years, but I have never doubted my salvation. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 4, 22, 3, 'dropped an anchor that day on the ground of God''s infallible Word and my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 4, 23, 3, 'ship has never drifted since then. I have been battered by many fierce');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 4, 24, 3, 'storms in these years, and my ship has swung wildly at times, but my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 4, 25, 3, 'anchor has held. How can I explain that? I can only say that God gave me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 4, 26, 3, 'the grace to "believe" His Word that day. Even faith is a gift of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 4, 27, 3, 'So we cannot glory even in our faith. All we can do is humbly glorify');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 4, 28, 3, 'God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 5, 1, 4, 'Chapter 3 A Help In Time Of Need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 5, 2, 4, 'In July 1959, I was living in the Naval Base at Cochin. I had just been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 5, 3, 4, 'commissioned as a Naval Officer. I had also received the assurance of my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 5, 4, 4, 'salvation in the same month, and had decided to live totally for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 5, 5, 4, 'Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 5, 6, 4, 'One evening, two of my fellow-Naval-officers came to me and told me that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 5, 7, 4, 'a good movie was going to be shown that evening in the Naval Base cinema');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 5, 8, 4, 'theatre, and suggested that we all go together to see it. I had often');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 5, 9, 4, 'gone with them to the movies previously. But now that I had been born');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 5, 10, 4, 'again, I had decided that I would not go to such movies any more. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 5, 11, 4, 'Lord had also taken away from my heart the desire to go to the cinema.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 5, 12, 4, 'But I did not have the courage to tell my friends that I was now a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 5, 13, 4, 'born-again Christian. So I went with them. But all along the way to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 5, 14, 4, 'theatre, a constant cry was going up from my heart to the Lord to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 5, 15, 4, 'somehow save me from this situation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 5, 16, 4, 'When we reached the cinema theatre, we saw a notice pasted on the front');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 5, 17, 4, 'wall, saying that because the reel of the movie had not arrived, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 5, 18, 4, 'movie scheduled for that evening was cancelled. My friends were utterly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 5, 19, 4, 'disappointed as we returned home, but I was thrilled. I was overjoyed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 5, 20, 4, 'that God had done a miracle for me. This incident strengthened my faith');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 5, 21, 4, 'greatly and I realized that I did indeed have a Father in heaven who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 5, 22, 4, 'would be "a very present help to me in my time of need" (Psalm 46:1). He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 5, 23, 4, 'answered a cry that was only in my heart and that I had not even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 5, 24, 4, 'expressed with my lips.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 5, 25, 4, 'That was my first experience of a miraculous answer to prayer. God is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 5, 26, 4, 'Father Who does miracles for His children. The Bible says, "Delight');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 5, 27, 4, 'yourself in the Lord and He will give you the desires of your heart". I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 5, 28, 4, 'was delighting myself in the Lord alone that day and wanted nothing but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 6, 1, 4, 'Him. The desire of my heart was that I should be kept from seeing that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 6, 2, 4, 'movie. And God granted it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 6, 3, 4, 'But after I came back to my room, the Lord told me that He would not do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 6, 4, 4, 'that for me a second time. Next time, He wanted me to say "No" to my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 6, 5, 4, 'friends myself - for only thus could I grow strong in His grace. If God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 6, 6, 4, 'did a miracle like that for me every time, I would never become bold or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 6, 7, 4, 'spiritually strong. The next time my friends invited me to the movies I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 6, 8, 4, 'told them boldly that I was now a Christian and would not go with them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 6, 9, 4, 'to the movies any more.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 6, 10, 4, 'I understood then why God does not grant many of our prayer-requests -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 6, 11, 4, 'because they are actually asking God to do miracles that will make life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 6, 12, 4, 'easy for us. But if God granted all those requests, we would become fat');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 6, 13, 4, 'and lazy Christians and not strong, vigorous and bold as He wants us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 6, 14, 4, 'be. God will encourage us by giving us miraculous answers to prayer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 6, 15, 4, 'occasionally. But many a time, He does not grant our request, lest we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 6, 16, 4, 'remain weak and cowardly. Understanding this truth has solved many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 6, 17, 4, 'mysteries about prayer for me.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 6, 18, 4, 'In these past 66 years, God has answered ALL my prayers - yes, 100% of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 6, 19, 4, 'them. Are you surprised to hear that? Let me explain. Like the three');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 6, 20, 4, 'colours in traffic lights, God''s answer to me has, at times been "Yes"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 6, 21, 4, '(Green), sometimes "Wait" (Orange) and at times "No" (Red). But He has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 6, 22, 4, 'answered every prayer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 6, 23, 4, 'There is great safety in obeying the traffic lights. I have found great');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 6, 24, 4, 'safety in accepting God''s answers as well - whatever they be.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 6, 25, 5, 'Chapter 4 Step-By-Step Obedience');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 6, 26, 5, 'I have discovered through the years that God leads us one step at a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 6, 27, 5, 'time. His promise is: "As you go, step by step I will open up the way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 6, 28, 5, 'before you" (Proverbs 4:12 - Literal translation). The pillar of cloud');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 7, 1, 5, 'led the Israelites day by day. So does the Holy Spirit lead us today.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 7, 2, 5, 'Soon after I received the assurance of salvation, I was told that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 7, 3, 5, 'next step for me was to be baptized in water. I had been christened as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 7, 4, 5, 'baby in the Syrian Orthodox church - a ceremony that they called');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 7, 5, 5, '"baptism". And I knew that there were born-again Christians on both');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 7, 6, 5, 'sides of this theological fence - those who were "baptized" only as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 7, 7, 5, 'babies like me and those who were baptized as believers. I decided');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 7, 8, 5, 'therefore to study the Word of God on this subject to see what it said.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 7, 9, 5, 'As I studied the Word, I discovered a number of truths: First of all,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 7, 10, 5, 'there was not a single mention of child-baptism in the entire New');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 7, 11, 5, 'Testament. A few instances of baptism of entire families were there, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 7, 12, 5, 'there was no mention of whether there were any babies in those families');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 7, 13, 5, '- and we cannot prove any doctrine from the silences of Scripture. John');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 7, 14, 5, 'the Baptist baptized only adults. Jesus Himself was baptized only when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 7, 15, 5, 'He was an adult. Jesus baptized adults but only laid hands on (blessed)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 7, 16, 5, 'children. (Many churches however do the exact opposite: they baptize');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 7, 17, 5, 'children and lay hands on adults (confirmation)!) When God blotted out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 7, 18, 5, 'my past completely, that included my unscriptural child-baptism as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 7, 19, 5, 'well!! The first step of obedience that every believer took in Acts of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 7, 20, 5, 'the Apostles was water-baptism.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 7, 21, 5, 'All this convinced me that I needed to be baptized. But some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 7, 22, 5, 'child-baptized believers told me that there was a far greater need for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 7, 23, 5, 'preaching the gospel in the Orthodox churches than in the believers''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 7, 24, 5, 'assemblies; and if I got baptized, I would be expelled from the Orthodox');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 7, 25, 5, 'church and would then lose opportunities to give the gospel to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 7, 26, 5, 'unbelievers there. This seemed a very convincing argument - and so I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 7, 27, 5, 'decided not to be baptized.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 7, 28, 5, 'I remained thus for 18 months. But every time I knelt down to pray, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 8, 1, 5, 'felt as if God was saying to me: "If you are not listening to Me, why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 8, 2, 5, 'should I listen to you." And in all those 18 months I made NO spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 8, 3, 5, 'progress at all. This began to disturb me. Finally I told the Lord that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 8, 4, 5, 'I would obey Him, even if I was thrown out of every church in the world.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 8, 5, 5, 'And so in January 1961 I got baptized.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 8, 6, 5, 'After that, I began to grow in my Christian life by leaps and bounds. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 8, 7, 5, 'then realized that I could not possibly be a blessing to others, if I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 8, 8, 5, 'was disobedient to God''s commands myself. I decided thereafter that I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 8, 9, 5, 'would obey God''s Word immediately in every matter - big or small -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 8, 10, 5, 'whatever men or churches may say. How much spiritual loss we suffer when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 8, 11, 5, 'we to listen to the arguments of human reason and disobey God''s Word.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 8, 12, 5, 'Since that first step of obedience 63 years ago, God has shown me many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 8, 13, 5, 'more steps of obedience. But each time, He showed me the next step, only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 8, 14, 5, 'after I had taken the step He had already shown me. God''s Word is "a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 8, 15, 5, 'lamp to our feet" (Psalm 119:105), meaning that it shows us only the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 8, 16, 5, 'next step for our feet and not the whole road in front of us. This is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 8, 17, 5, 'like holding a torch and walking along a dark road. We can see only a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 8, 18, 5, 'little bit of the road at a time - just enough for the next step. To see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 8, 19, 5, 'more of the road ahead, we have to move forward.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 8, 20, 5, 'If I had not taken that first step of obedience, I might never have seen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 8, 21, 5, 'another step in God''s will for my life - and I would have wasted my days');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 8, 22, 5, 'on earth, even if I did go to heaven. If God has clearly shown you some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 8, 23, 5, 'step of obedience now, obey Him immediately, lest you miss the will of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 8, 24, 5, 'God for your life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 8, 25, 5, 'Obedience is a step-by-step matter.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 8, 26, 6, 'Chapter 5 Clearing My Debts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 8, 27, 6, 'In early 1961, immediately after my baptism, the Lord showed me the next');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 8, 28, 6, 'step that I had to take in my walk with Him. My debt to God had been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 9, 1, 6, 'cleared - completely. It was now time to clear my debts to man - equally');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 9, 2, 6, 'completely.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 9, 3, 6, 'I remembered that I had cheated the government of money in the past.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 9, 4, 6, 'Jesus said that we had to "give to Caesar what was Caesar''s" first,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 9, 5, 6, 'before we could "give to God what was God''s" (Matthew 22:21). Otherwise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 9, 6, 6, 'we will be giving God money that we have stolen from "Caesar". So I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 9, 7, 6, 'calculated how much I had to pay back to the government. I hesitated');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 9, 8, 6, 'between two figures - one of them 20% more than the other. Finally, true');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 9, 9, 6, 'to human nature, I chose the lower figure. One day I read in Numbers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 9, 10, 6, '5:6, 7, that God had commanded the Israelites that when making');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 9, 11, 6, 'restitution, they were to add 20% to what they owed!! This was a clear');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 9, 12, 6, 'and direct word from God to my heart: He wanted me to pay back the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 9, 13, 6, 'higher amount. This amount came to about four times my monthly salary!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 9, 14, 6, 'So I began to save as much as possible each month, so that I could repay');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 9, 15, 6, 'my debt as soon as possible.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 9, 16, 6, 'When I had finally saved up the amount, I faced another problem. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 9, 17, 6, 'government did not have any department where honest people who wanted to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 9, 18, 6, 'make restitution could repay their debts!! So I went to the railway');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 9, 19, 6, 'station and bought a number of tickets for a long train journey to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 9, 20, 6, 'other end of India (that covered the amount that I had to make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 9, 21, 6, 'restitution for). Then I tore up those tickets. That way I ensured that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 9, 22, 6, 'the money went to the government''s coffers. My bank account was now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 9, 23, 6, 'empty, but my heart was full - with the joy of the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 9, 24, 6, 'It was only when Zaccheus decided to repay all those whom he had cheated');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 9, 25, 6, 'that the Lord said, "Salvation has come - for the Son of Man has come to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 9, 26, 6, 'seek and to save that which was lost" (Luke 19:9, 10). Like all human');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 9, 27, 6, 'beings, Zaccheus was lost in the love of money and Jesus saved him from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 9, 28, 6, 'it. I too was lost in the love of money, and Jesus saved me from it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 10, 1, 6, '"The love of money is a root of all sorts of evil" (1 Timothy 6:10), and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 10, 2, 6, 'the Lord wants to save us from it. Only then can He say that "salvation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 10, 3, 6, 'has come". He alone can root out this evil completely from our hearts.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 10, 4, 6, 'But He will do it only for those who ask Him to do it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 10, 5, 6, 'Debts are not only financial. Sometimes, what we owe may be an apology.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 10, 6, 6, 'When I was a young boy, I used to collect stamps, and I had once stolen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 10, 7, 6, 'a stamp (of almost no value) from a friend''s collection. The Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 10, 8, 6, 'reminded me of this small matter and told me to confess this sin (that I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 10, 9, 6, 'had committed more than 10 years earlier) to that person and to ask his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 10, 10, 6, 'forgiveness. This was even more difficult for me to do than repaying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 10, 11, 6, 'money to the government - for this involved my having to humble myself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 10, 12, 6, 'before another person. But I decided to write that letter of apology.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 10, 13, 6, 'Again the joy of the Lord filled my heart.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 10, 14, 6, 'In some cases, it may be impossible for us to make restitution for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 10, 15, 6, 'wrongs that we have committed. In such cases, we must not allow Satan to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 10, 16, 6, 'harass us perpetually, but accept God''s forgiveness and be at rest. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 10, 17, 6, 'will show us the matters that we need to set right. And when He shows us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 10, 18, 6, 'some matter, He will test us to see whether we will humble ourselves and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 10, 19, 6, 'obey Him immediately - whatever the cost.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 10, 20, 6, 'If I had not obeyed God promptly in these two matters, I would have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 10, 21, 6, 'dragged a chain behind me, these 63 years. And I would have missed God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 10, 22, 6, 'calling for my life. And the Lord would not have given me the ministry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 10, 23, 6, 'that He did. What regret would then have plagued my mind for all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 10, 24, 6, 'eternity in heaven.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 10, 25, 6, 'God wants His children to be free from debt to all men. Is there some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 10, 26, 6, 'debt from your past that needs to be settled? Settle it immediately,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 10, 27, 6, 'lest you miss your calling in life and have many regrets in eternity.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 10, 28, 6, 'Now is the time for total obedience! Large doors swing on small hinges!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 11, 1, 7, 'Chapter 6 To Buy Or Not To Buy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 11, 2, 7, 'In early 1961, when working at the Naval Base at Bombay, I saw an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 11, 3, 7, 'accordion in a shop-window of a music shop. I thought of buying it to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 11, 4, 7, 'learn how to play it. I knew however, that as a child of God I should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 11, 5, 7, 'seek God''s will in all matters - both great and small. So I prayed and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 11, 6, 7, 'sought God''s will. But I did not know how to find God''s will in such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 11, 7, 7, 'matters. So I asked God for a sign. I told Him that if the price of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 11, 8, 7, 'accordion was within a certain amount, then I would assume that it was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 11, 9, 7, 'His will for me to buy it. If it cost more than that amount, then I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 11, 10, 7, 'would assume that God did not want me to buy it. Since I was very eager');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 11, 11, 7, 'to buy the accordion, I eagerly hoped that it would cost less than the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 11, 12, 7, 'figure I had quoted to the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 11, 13, 7, 'But the lowest price the shop was willing to sell it for, was slightly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 11, 14, 7, 'above the amount I had quoted to God. I began to think of a number of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 11, 15, 7, 'factors. First of all, I did have enough money with me to buy it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 11, 16, 7, 'Secondly, the government had banned the import of accordions and so this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 11, 17, 7, 'was probably the last accordion available in any shop in Bombay.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 11, 18, 7, 'Thirdly, I wanted to learn the instrument only for use in Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 11, 19, 7, 'meetings.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 11, 20, 7, 'But all these factors were overruled by the fact that I had asked God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 11, 21, 7, 'for a sign and the sign was not fulfilled. So I decided not to buy the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 11, 22, 7, 'accordion - and walked out of the shop. I was disappointed that I could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 11, 23, 7, 'not get the accordion but happy that I had obeyed the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 11, 24, 7, 'A few days later, I was witnessing about Christ to one of my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 11, 25, 7, 'non-Christian colleagues. He asked me a question from the Bible for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 11, 26, 7, 'which I did not know the answer. I was ashamed that as a Christian, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 11, 27, 7, 'did not know the answer to something from the Bible. I went back to my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 11, 28, 7, 'room and decided to study the Word thoroughly, so that thereafter, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 12, 1, 7, 'would know the answer to every question for which there was an answer in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 12, 2, 7, 'the Bible.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 12, 3, 7, 'From the time I received assurance of my salvation in 1959, I had found');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 12, 4, 7, 'a desire within me to read God''s Word daily. First of all, I had decided');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 12, 5, 7, 'to read through the whole Bible quickly - and had done so in about 6');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 12, 6, 7, 'months. I understood very little of what I read - but my faith was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 12, 7, 7, 'strengthened by whatever I read. But I was not a deep student of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 12, 8, 7, 'Word.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 12, 9, 7, 'But now, the study of God''s Word became my passion. I began to spend');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 12, 10, 7, 'hours with the Bible, day and night, in my spare time. I saved some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 12, 11, 7, 'money and bought a Young''s Concordance and used it to study the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 12, 12, 7, 'occurrence of different words in the Bible. Very soon I, who knew almost');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 12, 13, 7, 'nothing of the Bible, began to understand deep truths from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 12, 14, 7, 'Scriptures.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 12, 15, 7, 'Then I realized why God had not wanted me to buy the accordion. If I had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 12, 16, 7, 'bought it, I would have spent hours learning to play it more and more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 12, 17, 7, 'perfectly. And as all musicians know very well, there is no end to being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 12, 18, 7, 'perfect in playing any instrument. That is an endless pursuit. I would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 12, 19, 7, 'have become a slave to the accordion.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 12, 20, 7, 'Interestingly enough, six years later, I was able to buy an accordion');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 12, 21, 7, 'from someone who sold his instrument to me. But by then I had become so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 12, 22, 7, 'deeply devoted to the Word that the accordion could not master me. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 12, 23, 7, 'was my slave. I never became an expert musician, because God had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 12, 24, 7, 'something better for me, which I never knew in 1961. Today, how thankful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 12, 25, 7, 'I am, that I am a Bible-teacher and not a musician and that I spent my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 12, 26, 7, 'life studying the Bible and not music. There are many good Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 12, 27, 7, 'musicians but not many anointed Bible-teachers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 12, 28, 7, 'Large doors swing on small hinges.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 13, 1, 8, 'Chapter 7 The Baptism In The Holy Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 13, 2, 8, 'In early 1963 I was posted in the Naval Base at Cochin. I had been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 13, 3, 8, 'studying the Word seriously for more than two years and had developed a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 13, 4, 8, 'fairly good knowledge of it - good enough to be able to preach at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 13, 5, 8, 'meetings in the church. But I found a great lack of power in my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 13, 6, 8, 'ministry. In the church I attended, we studied the Bible, but it was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 13, 7, 8, 'like studying a history book - all intellectual! The messages I heard in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 13, 8, 8, 'the church-meetings too were heavy and boring, lacking the freshness and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 13, 9, 8, 'fire of the Holy Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 13, 10, 8, 'Jesus told the Sadducees once that they did not know the Scriptures or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 13, 11, 8, 'the power of God (Matthew 22:29). In my case, I knew the Scriptures - to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 13, 12, 8, 'some extent - but I certainly did not know the power of God. Jesus told');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 13, 13, 8, 'His disciples that they would receive power only when they were baptized');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 13, 14, 8, 'in the Holy Spirit (Acts 1:5, 8). But I discovered that different');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 13, 15, 8, 'Christian churches taught differently on this subject. Some taught that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 13, 16, 8, 'every born-again Christian was automatically baptized in the Spirit at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 13, 17, 8, 'new birth whether he realized it or not. Others taught that one had to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 13, 18, 8, 'seek the Lord specifically for the baptism in the Spirit after being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 13, 19, 8, 'born again. I was confused. But I saw that Jesus Himself was anointed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 13, 20, 8, 'with the Spirit before He began His ministry (Acts 10:38). Then how much');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 13, 21, 8, 'more I needed this! Jesus also said that everyone who believed in Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 13, 22, 8, 'could have rivers of living water flowing out from him. But I found only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 13, 23, 8, 'a trickle flowing out from me. I realized that I was missing something.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 13, 24, 8, 'And so I decided to seek God for His power, without getting bogged down');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 13, 25, 8, 'in a theological argument about the Holy Spirit. I wanted the rivers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 13, 26, 8, 'I visited a group of assemblies that emphasized the ministry of the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 13, 27, 8, 'Spirit, to see if they could help me. They were very zealous, but I was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 13, 28, 8, 'disappointed with much that I saw in their midst. There was a lot of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 14, 1, 8, 'noise and emotionalism, but hardly any emphasis on victory over sin or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 14, 2, 8, 'Christlikeness of character (which is what the Holy Spirit came to give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 14, 3, 8, 'us primarily). Many of their pastors also seemed to be great lovers of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 14, 4, 8, 'money! One pastor asked me to keep on repeating the word "Hallelujah" if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 14, 5, 8, 'I wanted to be baptized in the Spirit! I refused to do that, since I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 14, 6, 8, 'knew that that was not the way the apostles received the baptism in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 14, 7, 8, 'Spirit. All this was certainly not the fullness of the Spirit that I was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 14, 8, 8, 'looking for. But the counterfeit only proved to me that the genuine');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 14, 9, 8, 'article must be valuable - for people make counterfeits only of valuable');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 14, 10, 8, 'articles! I told God that I did NOT want what I saw in those groups, but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 14, 11, 8, 'I did want the genuine baptism in the Holy Spirit that the apostles');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 14, 12, 8, 'received on the day of Pentecost. And I cried out to God every day for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 14, 13, 8, 'that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 14, 14, 8, 'I saw from the Scriptures that Jesus was anointed with the Spirit when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 14, 15, 8, 'He chose to be baptized in water which symbolized His choosing the way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 14, 16, 8, 'of death to the Self-life. The Lord showed me then that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 14, 17, 8, 'Spirit-filled life was closely connected with the way of the cross. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 14, 18, 8, 'told me that if I chose the way of the cross at all times, I would have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 14, 19, 8, 'His power upon me always too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 14, 20, 8, 'God filled me with His Spirit at that time. There was no physical');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 14, 21, 8, 'manifestation. But I found a freshness, a liberty and a boldness in my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 14, 22, 8, 'ministry thereafter. I began to experience the gift of prophesying - to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 14, 23, 8, 'edify and encourage and challenge others (1 Corinthians 14:3). I loved');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 14, 24, 8, 'Jesus more fervently and I longed to serve Him wholeheartedly. The way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 14, 25, 8, 'of the cross became precious to me. And I had a burning passion to bring');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 14, 26, 8, 'others to Christ. I did not speak in tongues at that time. That came 11');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 14, 27, 8, 'years later.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 14, 28, 8, 'What I experienced then was only a beginning. Since then I have had to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 15, 1, 8, 'be filled with the Spirit again and again and again. (We read in Acts of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 15, 2, 8, 'three times when Peter was filled with the Spirit.) A cup, a well and a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 15, 3, 8, 'river can all be full. Yet the capacity of each is different. As our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 15, 4, 8, 'capacity grows, we need to be re-filled. My capacity at that time was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 15, 5, 8, 'only that of a cup - but it was full and running over! It would grow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 15, 6, 8, 'into a river in later years.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 15, 7, 9, 'Chapter 8 A Wide Open Door');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 15, 8, 9, 'Many young people complain that older brothers hinder them from having a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 15, 9, 9, 'ministry in the church. But ministry comes to us from the Lord and not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 15, 10, 9, 'from man. If the Lord has determined to anoint you and to give you a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 15, 11, 9, 'ministry, no man can hinder God''s purpose for your life. He Himself will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 15, 12, 9, 'open the right door for you - at the right time. You won''t have to push');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 15, 13, 9, 'your way through anywhere and you won''t have to go around asking people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 15, 14, 9, 'to give you a ministry! And you will never have to complain that someone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 15, 15, 9, 'else hindered you from having a ministry. The Lord Jesus is the One Who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 15, 16, 9, 'has the key to every door of ministry (Revelation 3:7, 8) and He can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 15, 17, 9, 'open them for us just like the automatic doors that open by themselves');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 15, 18, 9, 'as soon as we come near them. We don''t have to do anything to open these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 15, 19, 9, 'doors! One reason why God does not give a ministry to many young people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 15, 20, 9, 'is because they are not seeking Him primarily but a ministry - and that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 15, 21, 9, 'too, in order to get honour for themselves.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 15, 22, 9, 'In 1963, I was 23 years old and had been converted for 4 years. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 15, 23, 9, 'elders in my local church would not allow me to speak in our church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 15, 24, 9, 'meetings, because they considered me young and inexperienced. So I used');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 15, 25, 9, 'to visit the homes of nominal Christians and new believers in distant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 15, 26, 9, 'places (where no-one else wanted to go) and conducted Bible-studies for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 15, 27, 9, '3 or 4 people in their homes every week. It was thus that I first learnt');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 15, 28, 9, 'to preach God''s Word.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 16, 1, 9, 'In August 1963, I was on leave from the Navy and decided to visit the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 16, 2, 9, '"Hebron Church" in Hyderabad for some fellowship with God''s people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 16, 3, 9, 'there. Hebron was the headquarters church of Brother Bakht Singh, who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 16, 4, 9, 'was India''s most well-known church-leader. But he himself was not in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 16, 5, 9, 'Hyderabad when I went there. On Sunday morning, the elder brother in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 16, 6, 9, 'Hebron church asked me to give the main message at the meeting. I had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 16, 7, 9, 'spoken at some smaller meetings in their church at Madras and he must');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 16, 8, 9, 'have heard of some blessing that had resulted from those meetings. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 16, 9, 9, 'the church in Hyderabad was a large one with over one thousand members');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 16, 10, 9, 'and I had never ever spoken to such a large crowd.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 16, 11, 9, 'As I sought the Lord for a word, I felt urged to speak on the subject of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 16, 12, 9, 'living a sacrificial life. So I spoke that morning on "offering to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 16, 13, 9, 'Lord that which costs us something" - based on David''s words in 2 Samuel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 16, 14, 9, '24:24. There was an unusual anointing on the message that morning and a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 16, 15, 9, 'spirit of repentance and revival came upon the people in the meeting. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 16, 16, 9, 'was amazed at what I saw. When the elder brother saw what the Lord had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 16, 17, 9, 'done, he immediately announced that there would be two more special');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 16, 18, 9, 'meetings with me as the speaker - one that evening and one the next');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 16, 19, 9, 'evening. The hall was packed full at each of those evening meetings.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 16, 20, 9, 'This was most unusual for weekday meetings. God''s anointing was again');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 16, 21, 9, 'mightily present at both those meetings. I was amazed to see the moving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 16, 22, 9, 'of God, for I had never experienced such revival anywhere before.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 16, 23, 9, 'I left Hyderabad the next day for Madras where I met Brother Bakht');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 16, 24, 9, 'Singh. He had heard about the revival and asked me why I had come away');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 16, 25, 9, 'from Hyderabad at such a time, instead of staying on and continuing with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 16, 26, 9, 'the revival meetings. But I was young and unaccustomed to revival and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 16, 27, 9, 'did not know what to do. However this experience encouraged me to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 16, 28, 9, 'believe that God wanted to use me in His service. And as news about the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 17, 1, 9, 'revival began to spread, many doors began to open for me in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 17, 2, 9, 'different assemblies.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 17, 3, 9, 'I did not go to Hyderabad looking for a ministry. I desired only God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 17, 4, 9, 'Himself. But God had plans to use me in His service and He knew when I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 17, 5, 9, 'was ready for it. And at the right time - the time He had determined -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 17, 6, 9, 'He opened a door of ministry for me, without my making any effort');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 17, 7, 9, 'whatsoever.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 17, 8, 9, 'No-one can hinder God''s plan for your life and your ministry, if you');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 17, 9, 9, 'trust Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 17, 10, 10, 'Chapter 9 Answered Prayer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 17, 11, 10, 'While working in the Naval Base at Cochin, I was very eager to attend');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 17, 12, 10, 'the Spiritual Life Conference (called "Holy Convocation") at "Hebron');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 17, 13, 10, 'Fellowship" in Hyderabad (the headquarters of Brother Bakht Singh''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 17, 14, 10, 'churches) in October 1963. So I applied for leave on October 1, and was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 17, 15, 10, 'granted leave for the period of the conference. But one week later,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 17, 16, 10, 'Naval Headquarters sent an order stating that the Navy had to take part');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 17, 17, 10, 'in an exhibition in Mysore in October. Another officer from my office');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 17, 18, 10, 'had to take part in this exhibition and I had to fill in for him, and so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 17, 19, 10, 'my leave was cancelled. So I gave up all hopes of attending the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 17, 20, 10, 'conference at Hebron.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 17, 21, 10, 'On October 12, in my morning quiet time, I was reading my daily portion');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 17, 22, 10, 'in 2 Samuel chapter 2. The first verse said, "David inquired of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 17, 23, 10, 'Lord, saying, ''Shall I go up into any of the cities of Judah?'' And the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 17, 24, 10, 'Lord said unto him, ''Go up''". I wondered if this was the Lord telling me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 17, 25, 10, 'to go for the conference, or whether it was just my mind finding a verse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 17, 26, 10, 'to satisfy my own desires (as had sometimes happened to me in the past).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 17, 27, 10, 'So I prayed about it and read further. The verse went on to say: "And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 17, 28, 10, 'David said, ''Whither shall I go up?'' And the Lord said, ''Unto Hebron''".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 18, 1, 10, 'The mention of Hebron here amazed me. Perhaps the Lord did indeed want');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 18, 2, 10, 'me to go to the "Hebron Fellowship" for the conference. So I prayed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 18, 3, 10, 'saying, "Lord, if my leave has been cancelled according to Thy will, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 18, 4, 10, 'accept it gladly. But if this is Satan''s attempt to prevent me from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 18, 5, 10, 'going to Hebron, then I resist him in Thy Name". I knew that the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 18, 6, 10, 'had urged us to pray together with other believers when we face');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 18, 7, 10, 'difficult situations (Matthew 18:19). So I did that too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 18, 8, 10, 'Amazingly, two days later, an order came from Naval Headquarters that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 18, 9, 10, 'the Navy would not take part in the exhibition at Mysore. Thus I got my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 18, 10, 10, 'leave to go for the conference. I was amazed at what God would do at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 18, 11, 10, 'highest levels to help one of His young, insignificant children!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 18, 12, 10, 'At that conference, Brother Bakht Singh broke a practice that he had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 18, 13, 10, 'always followed at every conference that he had conducted during the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 18, 14, 10, 'previous 15 years. In every conference, he himself was always the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 18, 15, 10, 'speaker at the evening meetings (where the crowd was the largest and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 18, 16, 10, 'need was the greatest). He never gave that important ministry to even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 18, 17, 10, 'his senior most co-workers. But at this conference he asked me to speak');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 18, 18, 10, 'at one of the evening meetings. I was only 23 years old and it was the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 18, 19, 10, 'first time that I was speaking to such a large crowd of more than 5000');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 18, 20, 10, 'people. God anointed me and gave me great liberty to speak His Word.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 18, 21, 10, 'The message I gave there, "A New Vessel Full Of Salt" can be read at my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 18, 22, 10, 'website: https://www.cfcindia.org/article/a-new-vessel-full-of-salt');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 18, 23, 10, 'The unusual liberty and anointing I had at that meeting and the response');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 18, 24, 10, 'from the people encouraged me greatly. Bakht Singh also recognized this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 18, 25, 10, 'and asked me to speak with him at public meetings thereafter in many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 18, 26, 10, 'other places. I knew now that God had anointed me to be a minister of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 18, 27, 10, 'His Word. I was young and I needed such an assurance from God Himself -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 18, 28, 10, 'by His confirming the word that I spoke. This assurance helped me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 19, 1, 10, 'greatly to be clear concerning the Lord''s call 7 months later, when He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 19, 2, 10, 'called me to leave the Navy to serve Him full-time. I also learnt');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 19, 3, 10, 'through this experience something of the tremendous power there is in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 19, 4, 10, 'the prayer of faith, and in praying together with others. All the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 19, 5, 10, 'authority of Christ comes down to back up His children when they pray');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 19, 6, 10, 'together with each other in unity and in faith.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 19, 7, 10, 'This was a significant event in my life. If the Naval participation in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 19, 8, 10, 'that exhibition had not been cancelled in October 1963, I would not have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 19, 9, 10, 'been able to go that conference. And then I may not have got the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 19, 10, 10, 'assurance that God had planned a wider ministry for me. Further, if I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 19, 11, 10, 'had not had the habit of listening to God each day and praying on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 19, 12, 10, 'basis of His word to me, I might never have prayed that God would change');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 19, 13, 10, 'my circumstances. Thus I might still have missed God''s plan for me at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 19, 14, 10, 'that time. If God had not miraculously opened that door of opportunity');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 19, 15, 10, 'for me at that time to serve Him, I might have ended up being merely an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 19, 16, 10, 'Admiral in the Navy instead of being a servant of the Most High God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 19, 17, 10, 'Large doors swing on small hinges.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 19, 18, 11, 'Chapter 10 Boldness To Witness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 19, 19, 11, 'In the year 1964, I was working in the Naval Base in Cochin. I was a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 19, 20, 11, 'keen student of the Word and when I found truths in the Word that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 19, 21, 11, 'blessed me, I was eager to share them with others in the church I was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 19, 22, 11, 'attending. But since I was young, I was not given many opportunities to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 19, 23, 11, 'preach there. So I decided to preach on the streets, where I did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 19, 24, 11, 'need anyone''s permission to preach. Twice every week, when my work');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 19, 25, 11, 'finished at noon, I would skip lunch, spend 2 to 3 hours in prayer and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 19, 26, 11, 'go and preach on the streets for two hours. I would take another brother');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 19, 27, 11, 'with me to translate my preaching into Malayalam. We would stand on a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 19, 28, 11, 'street-corner and start by singing a chorus. Five or ten people would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 20, 1, 11, 'soon gather around us, and I would preach the gospel to them for about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 20, 2, 11, 'five minutes. We would distribute some tracts and gospels and move on to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 20, 3, 11, 'the next street and do the same there.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 20, 4, 11, 'Initially, I used to go far away from the Naval Base where no-one knew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 20, 5, 11, 'me, because I lacked the boldness to preach before people who knew me.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 20, 6, 11, 'But I kept on asking God to give me this boldness. God answered my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 20, 7, 11, 'prayer in a two-fold way. I had already known a measure of the anointing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 20, 8, 11, 'of the Holy Spirit (as described in an earlier article). But I found');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 20, 9, 11, 'that I needed to be filled with the Spirit again in order to be bold (as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 20, 10, 11, 'the apostles needed, even after the day of Pentecost - See Acts 4:31).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 20, 11, 11, 'Secondly, God gave me a revelation of the total authority of Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 20, 12, 11, 'Interestingly, I saw this wonderful truth through Genesis 41:44, where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 20, 13, 11, 'Pharaoh tells Joseph: "Without your permission, no-one shall raise his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 20, 14, 11, 'hand or foot in all the land." I saw Joseph there as a type of Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 20, 15, 11, 'So the message I got from that verse was that without Christ''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 20, 16, 11, 'permission, no-one could lift a hand or a tongue to mock me or hurt me.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 20, 17, 11, 'When people called me a devil for the first time on the streets, I knew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 20, 18, 11, 'they did so because God had permitted them to do so. This revelation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 20, 19, 11, 'helped me immensely to face opposition later in my ministry.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 20, 20, 11, 'Then I understood why Jesus first told His apostles that He had "all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 20, 21, 11, 'authority in heaven and on earth" before He told them to go and make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 20, 22, 11, 'disciples in every nation (Matthew 28:18-20). So I knew then that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 20, 23, 11, 'Christ''s authority would back me, wherever I went to preach for Him. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 20, 24, 11, 'anointing of the Holy Spirit and the assurance of Christ''s authority');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 20, 25, 11, 'backing me, finally gave me the boldness to stand near the Naval Base');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 20, 26, 11, 'and to preach. My senior officers and the sailors who worked under me,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 20, 27, 11, 'all saw me there. But that did not disturb me anymore.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 20, 28, 11, 'Then the Lord told me to write two verses on my scooter. So I wrote');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 21, 1, 11, '"PREPARE TO MEET YOUR GOD" on one panel of my scooter and "CHRIST DIED');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 21, 2, 11, 'FOR OUR SINS" on the other (in large letters). When my Naval Commander');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 21, 3, 11, 'saw this, he ordered me to remove the verses "in 24 hours". I told him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 21, 4, 11, 'respectfully that God had told me to write them. The next day, when he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 21, 5, 11, 'saw that the verses were still on my scooter, he "marched me in" before');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 21, 6, 11, 'the Captain of the Base. (This is the first step before a court-martial,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 21, 7, 11, 'for disobedience of orders). I gave the Captain also the same answer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 21, 8, 11, 'respectfully. The Captain was merciful and did not court-martial me. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 21, 9, 11, 'he said that he would not allow me to ride the scooter inside the Naval');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 21, 10, 11, 'Base. So I left my scooter outside the Base in a friend''s house and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 21, 11, 11, 'started riding a bicycle inside the Base.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 21, 12, 11, 'I was disappointed at the turn of events, because I felt the Devil had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 21, 13, 11, 'won by preventing me from proclaiming the gospel through those verses to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 21, 14, 11, 'all in the Naval Base. But God turned the tables on Satan - as He always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 21, 15, 11, 'does. When people in the Base saw me riding a cycle, they were curious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 21, 16, 11, 'to know why, and asked what had happened. Soon the verses written on my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 21, 17, 11, 'scooter began to spread from mouth to mouth and went around the Base');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 21, 18, 11, 'faster than if others had seen them on my scooter. Some of my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 21, 19, 11, 'fellow-officers whom I met many years later, still remembered them! Thus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 21, 20, 11, 'God frustrated Satan''s plan. God also made me a bolder Christian thus -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 21, 21, 11, 'even more free from the opinions of men. And this boldness has helped me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 21, 22, 11, 'immensely in my ministry ever since.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 21, 23, 11, 'The anointing of the Spirit and the authority of Christ have been my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 21, 24, 11, 'strength and support whenever I have stood up to preach, in every part');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 21, 25, 11, 'of the world. But I first learnt the reality of these, on the streets of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 21, 26, 11, 'Ernakulam, more than 60 years ago.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 21, 27, 12, 'Chapter 11 Called to Leave the Navy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 21, 28, 12, 'It was the morning of 6th May 1964. I was on vacation from the Navy and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 22, 1, 12, 'had just finished preaching at a series of special meetings in a small');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 22, 2, 12, 'town near Bangalore, along with Brother Bakht Singh. I was travelling by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 22, 3, 12, 'train from there to Bangalore along with a number of his co-workers. As');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 22, 4, 12, 'I was meditating on my daily Bible-portion for that day (Isaiah 49), I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 22, 5, 12, 'got a strong feeling that God was calling me to leave my job to serve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 22, 6, 12, 'Him full-time. I had been considering full-time service for some time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 22, 7, 12, 'and had told the Lord as early as July 1959 (as soon as I received the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 22, 8, 12, 'assurance of my salvation) that I was willing to resign from the Indian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 22, 9, 12, 'Navy any time He called me. But I decided that I would leave only if the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 22, 10, 12, 'Lord called me.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 22, 11, 12, 'I had already given up my other ambitions - of travelling the seas,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 22, 12, 12, 'seeing the world, earning plenty of money and becoming the Admiral of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 22, 13, 12, 'the Indian Navy. But I needed to know whether God wanted me in full-time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 22, 14, 12, 'service for Him. As I preached God''s Word in different places, I found');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 22, 15, 12, 'the Lord blessing my ministry. I also found a growing burden in my heart');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 22, 16, 12, 'to spread God''s Word throughout India.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 22, 17, 12, 'It was in this state of mind that I read Isaiah 49 that morning. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 22, 18, 12, 'Lord spoke to me through that chapter that He had called me from my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 22, 19, 12, 'mother''s womb to be His servant (verses 1, 5) and that He had made my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 22, 20, 12, 'mouth like a sharp sword (verse 2). I did not give any thought to some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 22, 21, 12, 'of the other promises in that chapter - that God would proclaim His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 22, 22, 12, 'salvation through me to the far ends of the earth (verse 6), that people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 22, 23, 12, 'would come to hear His Word from the Northern and Western countries of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 22, 24, 12, 'the world and from China (verse 12); that God would fight against all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 22, 25, 12, 'those who fought with me and that all my sons would be saved (verse 25).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 22, 26, 12, 'I now see, 60 years later, that God has fulfilled all those promises');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 22, 27, 12, 'too. But on that day (6th May 1964), I saw only one thing in Isaiah 49 -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 22, 28, 12, 'that God was calling me to serve Him full-time. I decided then and there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 23, 1, 12, 'to resign from the Navy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 23, 2, 12, 'A few minutes after I had made this decision, Brother Bakht Singh (who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 23, 3, 12, 'was travelling with us in the train) came to me and asked me, "When are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 23, 4, 12, 'you thinking of leaving the Navy?" I was surprised to hear him ask me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 23, 5, 12, 'that question, for I had never shared my thoughts on this subject with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 23, 6, 12, 'him or with anyone else. Bakht Singh was the one man I respected at that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 23, 7, 12, 'time as a genuine man of God. And his words were a confirmation to me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 23, 8, 12, 'from the Lord, that what I had heard a few minutes earlier in my heart');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 23, 9, 12, 'was indeed the voice of God. I am glad that I heard from the Lord FIRST');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 23, 10, 12, 'before He confirmed His word to me through His servant - just like Paul');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 23, 11, 12, 'and Barnabas got a confirmation of their call from other prophets, only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 23, 12, 12, 'AFTER they had heard God''s call directly (See Acts 13:2).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 23, 13, 12, 'In the succeeding days, God confirmed His call to me again - through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 23, 14, 12, 'another Scripture: The Lord asking Peter to come out of the boat and to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 23, 15, 12, 'walk on the water (Matthew 14:29). The Lord was calling me also to come');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 23, 16, 12, 'out of the boat I worked in, to live a life of faith ("walking on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 23, 17, 12, 'water") - looking to Him alone for all my needs.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 23, 18, 12, 'I submitted my resignation to the Indian Naval authorities promptly,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 23, 19, 12, 'stating that the Lord Jesus Christ had called me for His work. But that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 23, 20, 12, 'made no sense to Naval Headquarters and they rejected my application');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 23, 21, 12, 'immediately. I wondered what to do next. The Lord then reminded me of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 23, 22, 12, 'what Moses did when Pharaoh refused to allow the Israelites to go and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 23, 23, 12, 'serve God: Moses went back to Pharaoh again. So I applied again, giving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 23, 24, 12, 'the same reasons in greater detail. Cadet-entry officers like me were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 23, 25, 12, 'required to serve the Navy for a minimum of 20 years before we could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 23, 26, 12, 'resign, because of the large amount of money that the Defence Ministry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 23, 27, 12, 'had invested on our training. So my application was rejected once again.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 23, 28, 12, 'I continued to pray and applied a third time, some months later.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 24, 1, 12, 'Amazingly, in May 1966, the Navy released me. That was a miracle, for I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 24, 2, 12, 'was the only cadet-entry officer in the history of the Indian Navy who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 24, 3, 12, 'had been permitted to resign on such grounds. That became then a further');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 24, 4, 12, 'confirmation to me of God''s call.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 24, 5, 12, 'The clear assurance that God called me to His service is what has upheld');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 24, 6, 12, 'me in the many trials that I have faced as a servant of the Lord. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 24, 7, 12, 'that is why I have always urged believers never to enter full-time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 24, 8, 12, 'service for the Lord, until they have a clear call from God. If God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 24, 9, 12, 'calls you, He will support you in His service, until the end of your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 24, 10, 12, 'life. Serving the Lord has been a most satisfying experience for me, for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 24, 11, 12, 'more than 58 years now.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 24, 12, 13, 'Chapter 12 Directed by God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 24, 13, 13, 'I left the Indian Navy to serve the Lord full-time in May 1966. I was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 24, 14, 13, 'single and decided to live in Vellore (Tamilnadu) as a base from which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 24, 15, 13, 'to travel around serving the Lord. In October 1967, I was invited to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 24, 16, 13, 'speak at a camp organized for students and graduates by the Evangelical');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 24, 17, 13, 'Graduates Fellowship in Ahmedabad. So I took the train and reached');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 24, 18, 13, 'Ahmedabad early in the morning after a two-day journey. As soon as I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 24, 19, 13, 'arrived there, on the very first day of the camp, I got an urgent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 24, 20, 13, 'telegram from my father (who was also living in Vellore) that he had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 24, 21, 13, 'been diagnosed with cancer by the doctors at CMC Hospital Vellore and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 24, 22, 13, 'needed to be operated on urgently. Since I was his eldest son (and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 24, 23, 13, 'only one of his three children in India), he requested me to come home');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 24, 24, 13, 'immediately to be with him at the time of his operation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 24, 25, 13, 'I wondered what to do. Since there was one more speaker at the camp, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 24, 26, 13, 'organizers of the camp would have understood my situation and allowed me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 24, 27, 13, 'to go, if I had asked them to relieve me of my responsibilities as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 24, 28, 13, 'speaker - although the burden on the other speaker would then have been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 25, 1, 13, 'immense. But I wanted to know whether this was a scheme of Satan to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 25, 2, 13, 'prevent me from speaking at the camp. So I sought the Lord about it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 25, 3, 13, 'I had the habit of reading through the Scriptures, chapter by chapter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 25, 4, 13, 'every morning. My daily reading that day was Deuteronomy Chapter 1. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 25, 5, 13, 'read there in verses 3 & 7: "On the FIRST DAY OF THE ELEVENTH MONTH, God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 25, 6, 13, 'said, Turn and set your journey and go....". I wondered whether God was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 25, 7, 13, 'showing me there as to when I should start my return journey. I did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 25, 8, 13, 'have the habit of finding guidance from verses of Scripture taken out of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 25, 9, 13, 'context, for I knew that that was a dangerous practice. But I also knew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 25, 10, 13, 'that God did guide His servants on rare occasions through such means. So');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 25, 11, 13, 'I prayed and sought the Lord''s will. As I prayed about it, I felt an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 25, 12, 13, 'increasing assurance and peace in my heart that this was indeed guidance');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 25, 13, 13, 'from the Lord. So I went to the railway station and booked my return');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 25, 14, 13, 'journey for the first day of the eleventh month (November) - which was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 25, 15, 13, 'the second-last day of the camp. This meant that I would stay on in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 25, 16, 13, 'Ahmedabad for the entire period of the camp and would miss only one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 25, 17, 13, 'meeting on the last morning of the camp. So I sent a telegram to my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 25, 18, 13, 'father to postpone his operation to the first week of November, since I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 25, 19, 13, 'could come back only by then. [Let me give you a warning here: Don''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 25, 20, 13, 'read spectacular guidance into every verse that you read in the Bible.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 25, 21, 13, 'God has given me such spectacular guidance through a verse, on only two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 25, 22, 13, 'or three occasions in my 66 years as a believer.]');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 25, 23, 13, 'I spoke at the various sessions in the camp throughout the week - and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 25, 24, 13, 'the blessing of the Lord flowed in our midst. Thirty years later, I met');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 25, 25, 13, 'people who told me how they were blessed and challenged by my ministry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 25, 26, 13, 'at that camp. I finally left Ahmedabad on the first of November and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 25, 27, 13, 'reached Vellore two days later.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 25, 28, 13, 'When my father got my telegram and realized that I would not be back for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 26, 1, 13, 'a whole week, he decided to use the time to get the opinion of yet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 26, 2, 13, 'another doctor. So he sent his X-rays to another radiologist (a better');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 26, 3, 13, 'one) for a second opinion. This doctor looked at the X-rays and told my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 26, 4, 13, 'father that he was certain that there was no cancer and that there was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 26, 5, 13, 'no need for any operation. Thus my father was saved from going to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 26, 6, 13, 'operating table. He lived for another 15 years after that and never got');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 26, 7, 13, 'cancer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 26, 8, 13, 'If I had returned to Vellore as soon as I had got my father''s telegram,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 26, 9, 13, 'my aged father would have underwent an unnecessary operation. And who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 26, 10, 13, 'knows what complications that might have led to, at his age. And the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 26, 11, 13, 'young people at the camp would not have heard what the Lord wanted to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 26, 12, 13, 'tell them through me.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 26, 13, 13, 'It is good to seek the will of God in even the smallest matters of life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 26, 14, 13, '- for there may be big doors that turn on those small hinges.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 26, 15, 14, 'Chapter 13 The Importance of Small Decisions');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 26, 16, 14, 'Even small decisions that we take in our younger days are important,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 26, 17, 14, 'because some of those decisions can take us completely out of God''s will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 26, 18, 14, 'for our lives finally. And so we must never be in a hurry when taking a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 26, 19, 14, 'decision, but always wait on the Lord and seek His will in patience,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 26, 20, 14, 'before deciding.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 26, 21, 14, 'After I left the Navy, I did not know how to start doing the Lord''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 26, 22, 14, 'work. I did not know where to begin or even where to stay. Then an elder');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 26, 23, 14, 'brother (whom I knew) invited me to come and stay with him in his church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 26, 24, 14, 'for a short while, to wait on the Lord. So I went to his assembly and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 26, 25, 14, 'spent about a month there in prayer, with some periods of fasting. At');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 26, 26, 14, 'the end of that period of prayer, I was still not sure what to do. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 26, 27, 14, 'my heart was at peace, assured that the Lord would show me His plan for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 26, 28, 14, 'my life, in due course. So I continued to live from day to day, without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 27, 1, 14, 'being anxious about the morrow. I realize now that God allows such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 27, 2, 14, 'periods of uncertainty to test our motives and to teach us patience. So');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 27, 3, 14, 'my time of prayer and fasting was most profitable and God protected me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 27, 4, 14, 'from making mistakes in the decisions that I took in the following weeks');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 27, 5, 14, 'and years.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 27, 6, 14, 'Someone suggested to me at that time that I should join a Bible-college');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 27, 7, 14, 'first of all and get a degree, because that would be a good preparation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 27, 8, 14, 'for my ministry and would also give me many openings for ministry. I had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 27, 9, 14, 'nothing against Bible-schools. But I knew that:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 27, 10, 14, 'So I felt I should be an example to these 99% of God''s people by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 27, 11, 14, 'demonstrating to them that one could serve the Lord effectively without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 27, 12, 14, 'attending a Bible-school. So I decided never to go to a Bible-school,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 27, 13, 14, 'but to trust the Holy Spirit to teach me His word and His ways, just as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 27, 14, 14, 'He taught the disciples in the first century. A top evangelical');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 27, 15, 14, 'Bible-college in Canada then offered me a seat in their college, with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 27, 16, 14, 'full scholarship and airfare fully paid, to study there. This would have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 27, 17, 14, 'been a tempting offer for many Christians, but it was not for me now. So');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 27, 18, 14, 'I rejected their offer. Another friend of mine took that seat in my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 27, 19, 14, 'place, and ended up settling down in Canada!! God saved me from that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 27, 20, 14, 'fate and from missing His will thereby! I am thankful that I never went');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 27, 21, 14, 'to any Bible-school - for God has given me such amazing revelations from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 27, 22, 14, 'His Word that I could never have received, if my mind had been trained');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 27, 23, 14, 'to think the way Bible-schools train their students to think. The men');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 27, 24, 14, 'and women whose lives and writings have influenced me the most, have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 27, 25, 14, 'also been those who never went to a Bible-school themselves - Madam');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 27, 26, 14, 'Guyon, Charles Finney, D.L.Moody, Jessie Penn-Lewis, Watchman Nee,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 27, 27, 14, 'A.W.Tozer, Sadhu Sundar Singh, Bakht Singh etc.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 27, 28, 14, 'Another truth that I saw in God''s Word was that Jesus and His apostles');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 28, 1, 14, 'never made their earthly needs known to any human being - either their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 28, 2, 14, 'personal needs or their ministry needs. They trusted their heavenly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 28, 3, 14, 'Father alone to meet all their needs. I had given away all my earnings');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 28, 4, 14, '(in the 8 years that I worked in the Navy) for the Lord''s work and to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 28, 5, 14, 'poor believers. So I had left the Navy with an empty bank account and no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 28, 6, 14, 'savings. But I believed that if the Indian Navy had been faithful to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 28, 7, 14, 'take care of all my earthly needs when I served them, my heavenly Father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 28, 8, 14, 'would be even more faithful when I served Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 28, 9, 14, 'So I decided never to make my financial needs known to anyone but my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 28, 10, 14, 'heavenly Father, Who knew exactly how and when to meet my needs. I used');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 28, 11, 14, 'to receive occasional gifts from some believers, but that came to only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 28, 12, 14, 'about 15% of what I was earning in the Navy. But I learnt to live simply');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 28, 13, 14, 'and so I never suffered any lack.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 28, 14, 14, 'One day, the Chairman of a large Western organization that was involved');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 28, 15, 14, 'in a wide Christian radio ministry in India invited me to become the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 28, 16, 14, 'Director of their organization. I was offered a large salary plus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 28, 17, 14, 'house-rent, free car, free telephone and other perquisites. I greatly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 28, 18, 14, 'appreciated the work of this organization. But if I joined it, I would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 28, 19, 14, 'be engaged primarily in administrative work and promotional work in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 28, 20, 14, 'different churches. God had however called me to preach his Word, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 28, 21, 14, 'not to sit behind a desk doing administration. Here was a tempting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 28, 22, 14, 'offer. God was probably testing me to see what I would choose - a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 28, 23, 14, 'comfortable life or His perfect will. I rejected the offer and continued');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 28, 24, 14, 'to trust the Lord for my needs. I would not sacrifice my calling for any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 28, 25, 14, 'material benefit or financial gain.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 28, 26, 14, 'For nearly 60 years now, the Lord has taken care of all my needs and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 28, 27, 14, 'needs of my family as well - and I have proved His faithfulness time and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 28, 28, 14, 'again.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 29, 1, 14, 'Young people are often tempted to compromise on the principles of God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 29, 2, 14, 'Word - especially when they see older servants of God doing so. But if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 29, 3, 14, 'you trust in the Lord and stick to the principles of His Word, you will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 29, 4, 14, 'find that God will do many miracles for you. You will know God better');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 29, 5, 14, 'thereby and your ministry too will be enriched.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 29, 6, 14, 'So, let me encourage every young person never to compromise on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 29, 7, 14, 'principles of God''s Word, at any cost.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 29, 8, 15, 'Chapter 14 To Marry Or Not To Marry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 29, 9, 15, 'One day in 1963, when I was still working in the Naval Base at Cochin, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 29, 10, 15, 'was meditating on God''s Word and came to Jeremiah 16:2 which read thus:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 29, 11, 15, '"You shall not take a wife for yourself, nor have sons or daughters in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 29, 12, 15, 'this place". I used to find, in my Bible-reading, at times, that a verse');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 29, 13, 15, 'would stick out and make a deep impression on me. This was one such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 29, 14, 15, 'verse. So I began to wonder if this was a word from the Lord to me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 29, 15, 15, 'personally. As I sought the Lord in prayer, I felt that it was indeed a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 29, 16, 15, 'word for me. So I decided to remain single for the rest of my life in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 29, 17, 15, 'order to serve the Lord. I was already active in the Lord''s work and was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 29, 18, 15, 'delighted that I could spend the rest of my life "in undistracted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 29, 19, 15, 'devotion to the Lord", without any of the distractions that married life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 29, 20, 15, 'can bring (as mentioned in 1 Corinthians 7:32-35).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 29, 21, 15, 'As a 24-year old young man, I had the normal desires that all young men');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 29, 22, 15, 'of that age have. But now that I had received this word from the Lord, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 29, 23, 15, 'totally stopped looking at young sisters as prospective life-partners. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 29, 24, 15, 'came across many attractive young sisters as I travelled around. But I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 29, 25, 15, 'never considered even one of them for a moment, because I wanted to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 29, 26, 15, 'true to God''s call on my life. When speaking at meetings, I would look');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 29, 27, 15, 'only at the brothers and never even look at the sisters!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 29, 28, 15, 'Because I was earning a large salary as a naval officer, I received');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 30, 1, 15, 'marriage proposals even at a young age. But I rejected all of them,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 30, 2, 15, 'without even stopping to consider them. I told everyone that God had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 30, 3, 15, 'called me to remain single. I made this fact known in my local church as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 30, 4, 15, 'well, so that all the young sisters there (and their parents) would also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 30, 5, 15, 'know my calling. I was then able to speak more freely with them, and had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 30, 6, 15, 'no fear that I might be giving ideas to any of them. I was spared from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 30, 7, 15, 'many a temptation too, because of this word that I received from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 30, 8, 15, 'Lord. Thus God kept me in my youthful years in single-minded devotion to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 30, 9, 15, 'Him alone, and I could spend all my spare time praying and studying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 30, 10, 15, 'God''s Word.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 30, 11, 15, 'In May 1966, I left the Navy to serve the Lord full time. Since I was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 30, 12, 15, 'NOT earning any salary now, and was ministering among very poor people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 30, 13, 15, 'in the villages of India, I was sure that no-one would ever again');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 30, 14, 15, 'consider me for marriage. I was also losing my hair and growing balder');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 30, 15, 15, 'every month. This too was an advantage, for I felt that it would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 30, 16, 15, 'disqualify me even further in the eyes of young sisters!! But as I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 30, 17, 15, 'travelled around and spoke at meetings and conferences during the next');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 30, 18, 15, '12 to 15 months, I found that, despite all the above disqualifications,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 30, 19, 15, 'I was still being "eyed" by some parents who were looking for "a gifted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 30, 20, 15, 'servant of the Lord" for their daughter - even if he was bald!! So I had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 30, 21, 15, 'to be careful once more.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 30, 22, 15, 'I had also heard of preachers falling into immorality - and I knew that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 30, 23, 15, 'I had the same flesh that they had. I discovered then that there were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 30, 24, 15, 'many dangers a single young man faced when serving the Lord full-time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 30, 25, 15, 'So I sought the Lord again as to what I should do. As I continued');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 30, 26, 15, 'praying, I felt the Lord urging me to consider marriage. But this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 30, 27, 15, 'appeared to contradict what the Lord had told me four years earlier,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 30, 28, 15, 'from Jeremiah 16:2.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 31, 1, 15, 'So I re-read Jeremiah 16:2 - again and again. All of a sudden, I noticed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 31, 2, 15, 'something in that verse that I had never noticed before. I now saw that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 31, 3, 15, 'the Lord''s command was not to marry "in this place" - that is, while I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 31, 4, 15, 'was in the Navy. That liberated me from the fear that I would be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 31, 5, 15, 'disobeying the Lord if I got married. I wondered then why the Lord had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 31, 6, 15, 'not allowed me to understand this last phrase of the verse in this way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 31, 7, 15, 'for four long years. I saw two reasons:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 31, 8, 15, 'What a privilege it is to be led by God, step by step, as He led His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 31, 9, 15, 'prophets and saints in olden times.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 31, 10, 16, 'Chapter 15 God''s Choice Of A Life-Partner');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 31, 11, 16, 'I had laid marriage on God''s altar as a young man. But God gave marriage');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 31, 12, 16, 'back to me at the right time and gave me the best wife I could possibly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 31, 13, 16, 'have got. I am glad I allowed God to choose for me - for I got the best.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 31, 14, 16, 'I had seen so many unhappy marriages and so many wives who were a drag');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 31, 15, 16, 'on their husband''s ministry, that I was afraid that I too (in a moment');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 31, 16, 16, 'of weakness) might choose the wrong girl. So I used to pray to the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 31, 17, 16, 'desperately that He would even send an earthquake (if necessary), at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 31, 18, 16, 'time of my wedding, if by some mistake I had chosen a girl that was not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 31, 19, 16, 'His choice for me.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 31, 20, 16, 'In the Indian Christian culture of the 1960s, boys and girls were not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 31, 21, 16, 'allowed to converse with each other except formally. So it was not easy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 31, 22, 16, 'to know much about any girl. I prayed therefore that God Himself would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 31, 23, 16, 'give me enough information about any girl I considered so that I could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 31, 24, 16, '"prove His perfect will" (Romans 12:2).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 31, 25, 16, 'In mid-1967 (when I was 27&frac12 years old), Brother Bakht Singh');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 31, 26, 16, 'proposed a girl named "Annie" who had just graduated from the Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 31, 27, 16, 'Medical College at Vellore - and asked me to pray concerning her. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 31, 28, 16, 'didn''t care for the fact that she was a doctor, but I was impressed when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 32, 1, 16, 'I heard that she was very active in the Lord''s work - in the church,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 32, 2, 16, 'among the students in her college and also in witnessing to prisoners in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 32, 3, 16, 'the women''s jail. Around the same time, two staff members of the E.U.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 32, 4, 16, '(Evangelical Union) also came to me (independent of each other) and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 32, 5, 16, 'suggested the same "Annie" to me. I prayed that God would give me more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 32, 6, 16, 'information about her so that I could know if this was His choice. Since');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 32, 7, 16, 'my primary burden was for the poor people in India''s villages, I wanted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 32, 8, 16, 'someone who had the same love and care for the poor.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 32, 9, 16, 'I learnt that Annie had decided to work among lepers in a hospital in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 32, 10, 16, 'North India. From the age of 16, she had visited that hospital every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 32, 11, 16, 'year and done voluntary work there. (No lady-doctor had ever gone to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 32, 12, 16, 'work in that leprosy hospital before this). Annie had been warned by her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 32, 13, 16, 'relatives that working among lepers would hinder her chances of getting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 32, 14, 16, 'a good husband. But what her relatives considered as a disadvantage was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 32, 15, 16, 'the very factor that assured me of Annie''s love for the poor.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 32, 16, 16, 'Then one day, I happened to overhear a conversation between two brothers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 32, 17, 16, 'at the church in Vellore: One was telling the other of a sister named');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 32, 18, 16, '"Annie" who although she was a doctor, had sat beside the bed of a poor,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 32, 19, 16, 'sick sister (from the church), caring for her for many nights, in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 32, 20, 16, 'poor people''s ward of the Vellore hospital. Those brothers did not know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 32, 21, 16, 'that I was considering this very same Annie as a marriage-partner! God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 32, 22, 16, 'had sovereignly arranged for me to hear that conversation, to assure me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 32, 23, 16, 'again of Annie''s concern for the poor.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 32, 24, 16, 'I discovered later that Annie had read the same Christian books and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 32, 25, 16, 'missionary biographies that I had read. She had understood the way of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 32, 26, 16, 'the cross - just as I had. We both had the same passion to serve the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 32, 27, 16, 'Lord among the poor. I waited on the Lord now for a final confirmation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 32, 28, 16, 'of His will. This came to me one day from my daily reading in Ezekiel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 33, 1, 16, '44:15, 22:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 33, 2, 16, 'I was now convinced - and my heart was drawn to her.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 33, 3, 16, 'God had so wonderfully prepared this young girl for 24 years, far away');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 33, 4, 16, 'from me, and finally brought her to me. Just as He had prepared a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 33, 5, 16, 'perfect partner for Adam, He had also prepared a girl perfectly suited');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 33, 6, 16, 'for me. I saw that God was not hindered by the limitations of Indian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 33, 7, 16, 'culture, and that He was still a loving Matchmaker Who brought man and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 33, 8, 16, 'woman together, as He did in Eden.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 33, 9, 16, 'Annie had heard me preach a number of times and so she knew that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 33, 10, 16, 'Lord had gifted me to serve Him. But she knew almost nothing else about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 33, 11, 16, 'me. So I told her plainly that I had no income but was trusting the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 33, 12, 16, 'alone to provide all my needs. I told her that I was not sure as to what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 33, 13, 16, 'my ministry was going to be. All I knew was that God had given me a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 33, 14, 16, 'burden for the poor and for college-students - both of whom had very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 33, 15, 16, 'little money to support me. I had no savings and my father was a retired');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 33, 16, 16, 'pensioner with very little money himself. I painted before her a life of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 33, 17, 16, 'financial struggle and hardships, but coupled at the same time, with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 33, 18, 16, 'immense joy of serving the Lord. I told her to wait on the Lord and to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 33, 19, 16, 'seek His will and not to decide in a hurry. Meanwhile she was receiving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 33, 20, 16, 'proposals from well-placed medical doctors. She prayed and waited on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 33, 21, 16, 'Lord and was convinced that I was God''s choice for her - and told her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 33, 22, 16, 'parents so.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 33, 23, 16, 'Her parents immediately objected to the proposal, because I had no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 33, 24, 16, 'income! They must have thought that I wanted to marry a doctor because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 33, 25, 16, 'of the money she could earn to support me. Little did they know that I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 33, 26, 16, 'would be trusting the Lord for my needs and not in any income that Annie');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 33, 27, 16, 'could earn. (Annie has never earned any income as a doctor during the 57');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 33, 28, 16, 'years of our marriage. She has given medical help to thousands of poor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 34, 1, 16, 'people freely).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 34, 2, 16, 'We decided to honour her parents and to wait until they accepted me -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 34, 3, 16, 'and we continued in prayer. Within six months, God answered our prayer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 34, 4, 16, 'and her father accepted the proposal. Four months later, we were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 34, 5, 16, 'married.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 34, 6, 16, 'Brother Bakht Singh conducted our wedding at Vellore on 19 June 1968 and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 34, 7, 16, 'gave a prophecy at the wedding saying,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 34, 8, 16, 'We did not pay much attention to those words of his and had forgotten');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 34, 9, 16, 'them completely, until we listened to our wedding tape again 30 years');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 34, 10, 16, 'later. Suddenly we realized that his prophecy had been fulfilled.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 34, 11, 16, 'I have met many women in my travels around the world in the last 57');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 34, 12, 16, 'years. But I never yet met one who was more suited for me than Annie -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 34, 13, 16, 'the one God chose for me.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 34, 14, 16, 'How perfect is God''s choice for those who put Him first in all matters!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 34, 15, 16, 'All praise be to His Name alone!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 34, 16, 17, 'Chapter 16 Saved From Death');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 34, 17, 17, '"He delivered us from death and will still deliver us" (2 Corinthians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 34, 18, 17, '1:10)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 34, 19, 17, 'In all of our lives, there must have been occasions where we were saved');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 34, 20, 17, 'from almost certain death by God''s intervention. I can think of a few');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 34, 21, 17, 'such instances myself. God has a purpose in thus saving us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 34, 22, 17, 'The first incident I can think of was when I was about 12 years old in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 34, 23, 17, '1951. My parents and I were sitting outside our home at night with a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 34, 24, 17, 'table lamp for light. Suddenly the lamp went off, while there was still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 34, 25, 17, 'electricity inside the house. I felt this must be due to a break');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 34, 26, 17, 'somewhere in the electrical cord of the lamp. Foolishly, I picked up the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 34, 27, 17, 'cord and felt my way along it to see where the break in the wire was.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 34, 28, 17, 'Suddenly when my fingers touched the broken part, the current ran');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 35, 1, 17, 'through my body and threw me on the grass with the cord still clinging');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 35, 2, 17, 'to my fingers. I screamed. My mother seeing what had happened, had the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 35, 3, 17, 'presence of mind to switch off the electrical main supply immediately.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 35, 4, 17, 'Thus my life was saved. I was not born again at that time. If I had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 35, 5, 17, 'died, I would have certainly gone to hell.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 35, 6, 17, 'A second incident that I can remember was when I was in the Navy. I was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 35, 7, 17, 'posted as the Executive Officer of a minesweeper in Bombay during the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 35, 8, 17, 'war with Pakistan in 1965. Our Naval fleet had planned to bombard');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 35, 9, 17, 'Karachi harbour. My ship''s job was to go ahead of the large ships in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 35, 10, 17, 'fleet and to clear the mines that the enemy would have laid to protect');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 35, 11, 17, 'their harbour. Only thus would our fleet be able to move in. Clearing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 35, 12, 17, 'the mines could be done easily, because we had both the equipment and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 35, 13, 17, 'the expertise in our ship to do the job. But our ship would have been an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 35, 14, 17, 'easy target for the long-range guns from Karachi that would be firing at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 35, 15, 17, 'our fleet. And our ship would almost certainly have been sunk. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 35, 16, 17, 'would be the price we would have to pay for clearing the way for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 35, 17, 17, 'rest of the fleet to bombard the harbour. The war had been going on for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 35, 18, 17, 'about two weeks and we were all set to leave for Karachi, when a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 35, 19, 17, 'ceasefire was suddenly declared - and the war ended. My life was thus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 35, 20, 17, 'saved. If the war had continued for even a few more days, I would almost');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 35, 21, 17, 'certainly have died outside Karachi harbour. But God had made a plan for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 35, 22, 17, 'my life from before the creation of the world - and in that plan I was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 35, 23, 17, 'not to die then. So He stopped that war for my sake. There is nothing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 35, 24, 17, 'that God will not do for His children.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 35, 25, 17, 'A third incident also comes to my mind: This was in August 1993. I was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 35, 26, 17, 'riding my moped in Bangalore returning home from the market and going');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 35, 27, 17, 'past a railway-crossing (about 700 metres from my house). I had crossed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 35, 28, 17, 'one side of the crossing and had gone across the railway lines. Just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 36, 1, 17, 'before crossing the other side, the gateman lowered the bar (without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 36, 2, 17, 'seeing me). The bar hit me squarely on my chest and hands and knocked me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 36, 3, 17, 'and my moped down on to the railway track, where my head hit the ground.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 36, 4, 17, 'I lay there unconscious. (I later found out that the gateman was not the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 36, 5, 17, 'regular gateman but a substitute who was not familiar with the procedure');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 36, 6, 17, 'for opening and closing the gates). I still do not know for how long I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 36, 7, 17, 'lay there unconscious. Someone picked me up and I regained my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 36, 8, 17, 'consciousness. When I was taken to the hospital I discovered that my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 36, 9, 17, 'skull had a hairline crack in it and my shoulder was dislocated. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 36, 10, 17, 'otherwise I was all right. I said to the Lord at that time, "Lord, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 36, 11, 17, 'have not yet finished saying ''Thank You'' to You for dying for me on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 36, 12, 17, 'Calvary. Give me a few more years to express my gratitude to You for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 36, 13, 17, 'that, by serving You." My arm was in a sling for a few weeks and I was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 36, 14, 17, 'soon back to normal health in every way. The Lord has given me 12 more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 36, 15, 17, 'years of perfect health thus far, since that date, to serve Him and to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 36, 16, 17, 'show my gratitude to Him for saving me.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 36, 17, 17, 'Besides these incidents, I can think of numerous occasions, when riding');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 36, 18, 17, 'my scooter in Bangalore, where God saved me from accidents - once when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 36, 19, 17, 'my brake-wire snapped and at other times when the carelessness of other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 36, 20, 17, 'drivers threw me off my scooter. I have driven cars and scooters for 63');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 36, 21, 17, 'years now. But by God''s immense mercy, I have never been seriously hurt');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 36, 22, 17, 'myself and have never hurt anyone else either.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 36, 23, 17, 'These incidents are constant reminders to me that I might not be living');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 36, 24, 17, 'on earth today, if small things had been otherwise at any of the above');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 36, 25, 17, 'times. I have often thought back to these incidents and asked myself why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 36, 26, 17, 'God saved my life. It was certainly not that I might live for myself but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 36, 27, 17, 'that I might live only for Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 36, 28, 17, 'Recollecting these instances now and then has helped me again and again');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 37, 1, 17, 'to devote myself to live for the Lord alone.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 37, 2, 17, 'We should all remember such instances when God has saved us from certain');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 37, 3, 17, 'death and ask ourselves why God spared our lives. Such memories will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 37, 4, 17, 'help us all to re-dedicate our lives to the Lord again and again.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 37, 5, 18, 'Chapter 17 A Time of Breaking and A New Burden');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 37, 6, 18, 'When I left the Navy, I had anticipated that I would be spending the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 37, 7, 18, 'rest of my life ministering among the assemblies connected with Brother');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 37, 8, 18, 'Bakht Singh. But God does not show us the whole future - and I had some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 37, 9, 18, 'unexpected surprises awaiting me, sooner than I had anticipated.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 37, 10, 18, 'In 1969, a young brother (from the Bakht-Singh assemblies) asked me what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 37, 11, 18, 'I felt would happen to those assemblies when Bakht Singh died. I told');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 37, 12, 18, 'him that I felt that the assemblies would split and be divided, since');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 37, 13, 18, 'only Bakht Singh himself could hold them all together. I should not have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 37, 14, 18, 'made such a rash comment about the work of a man of God. But I was only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 37, 15, 18, '30 years old and I was very unwise. Some of Bakht Singh''s co-workers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 37, 16, 18, 'heard about my comment and reported it promptly to Brother Bakht Singh -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 37, 17, 18, 'and he was greatly disturbed. He immediately told his co-workers not to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 37, 18, 18, 'allow me to speak any more in his assemblies. I was not welcome');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 37, 19, 18, 'thereafter in the very assemblies where I had once been a conference');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 37, 20, 18, 'speaker. Through my rash speech I had lost an open door for ministry. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 37, 21, 18, 'repented of what I had done. But I had to sit thereafter at the back of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 37, 22, 18, 'the Bakht-Singh assembly at Vellore, and was never allowed to share the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 37, 23, 18, 'Word there again. God told me in those days not to get offended with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 37, 24, 18, 'this discipline but to keep my mouth shut. He told me to respect the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 37, 25, 18, 'elders of the assembly, and not to criticize them, but to maintain a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 37, 26, 18, 'good attitude towards them at all times. And I did that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 37, 27, 18, 'But I was confused now and wondered where my ministry would lie in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 37, 28, 18, 'future. All the plans that I had made, when I had left the Navy 3 years');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 38, 1, 18, 'earlier, now lay shattered at my feet. I had been married for just one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 38, 2, 18, 'year and my wife and I wondered what we were supposed to do next.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 38, 3, 18, 'For about three years I sat at the back of that assembly in Vellore,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 38, 4, 18, 'with a good attitude towards the elders there. Many people there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 38, 5, 18, 'misunderstood why I was being disciplined - and I did not seek to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 38, 6, 18, 'explain anything to them but kept quiet. Those were the years in which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 38, 7, 18, 'God broke me and tested me to see whether I was satisfied with Him alone');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 38, 8, 18, 'or whether I would hanker after a public ministry, such as I had had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 38, 9, 18, 'until then. In all of my Christian life, I had wanted only the Lord -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 38, 10, 18, 'and I was ready to prove it to Him now.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 38, 11, 18, 'In those quiet years, I took whatever opportunities the Lord gave me to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 38, 12, 18, 'minister among students in the medical college campus at Vellore. As I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 38, 13, 18, 'ministered among them, I discovered a great need for Christian books');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 38, 14, 18, 'written especially for the needs of Indian students. All the books');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 38, 15, 18, 'available in Christian bookshops were written by Westerners, and not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 38, 16, 18, 'from an Indian perspective. Those books were also far too expensive for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 38, 17, 18, 'Indian students to purchase.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 38, 18, 18, 'I had no ambition to write any book, because I knew very well that I was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 38, 19, 18, 'no writer. But I had a great burden for young students. So I decided to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 38, 20, 18, 'put down on paper whatever I had shared with students in my meetings');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 38, 21, 18, 'among them, so that I could circulate it among them, for their private');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 38, 22, 18, 'study.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 38, 23, 18, 'Since I had no invitations to preach anywhere, I had plenty of time on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 38, 24, 18, 'my hands with nothing to do. So I started writing down first of all, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 38, 25, 18, 'notes of a series of four messages I had given to students in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 38, 26, 18, 'Christian Medical College, Vellore. It took me a long time to type those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 38, 27, 18, '60 to 70 pages - and then to correct and re-type them again - on an old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 38, 28, 18, 'typewriter that I had from my Navy days. But I finally finished the job');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 39, 1, 18, 'after many months. I read and re-read my manuscript many times - and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 39, 2, 18, 'found that the Lord had indeed helped me to transcribe my burden');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 39, 3, 18, 'faithfully on to paper. I then wondered how best I could circulate this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 39, 4, 18, 'among the students. But God had something far better in mind for my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 39, 5, 18, 'manuscript that I didn''t know about then - and He was showing me only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 39, 6, 18, 'one step at a time....');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 39, 7, 18, 'Even though it was entirely my fault that I lost the open door of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 39, 8, 18, 'ministry among the Bakht Singh assemblies, I now see that God was able');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 39, 9, 18, 'to bring something glorious even out of my failure. If I had continued');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 39, 10, 18, 'in those assemblies, I might never have entered into a writing ministry.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 39, 11, 18, 'How great and how good is our God!!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 39, 12, 18, 'I can now say like Jeremiah said about his younger days (when he was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 39, 13, 18, 'being broken and trained to be a prophet):');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 39, 14, 18, 'Hallelujah!!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 39, 15, 19, 'Chapter 18 God Pushes Me Into A Writing Ministry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 39, 16, 19, 'Towards the end of 1969, I had just finished writing my first manuscript');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 39, 17, 19, '(as described in the last chapter). But I never sent the manuscript to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 39, 18, 19, 'any publisher for I did not feel that any publisher would publish a book');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 39, 19, 19, 'written by an unknown young man. So I kept it with me.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 39, 20, 19, 'At that time, Angus Kinnear (who compiled Watchman Nee''s books)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 39, 21, 19, '"happened" to come to Vellore and I "happened" to meet him. I see now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 39, 22, 19, 'that God had sent him there at that very time, just for me. Since he was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 39, 23, 19, 'an experienced writer, I showed him my manuscript and asked him if he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 39, 24, 19, 'could read through it and give me some suggestions. He agreed to do so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 39, 25, 19, 'and took it with him to England. In a little while, I got a letter from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 39, 26, 19, 'him stating that he was happy with the manuscript and had got it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 39, 27, 19, 'typeset, got a cover designed for it and sent it on to GLS Bombay to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 39, 28, 19, 'published. That book - "THE SUPREME PRIORITIES - was published in 1970.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 40, 1, 19, 'Thus God nudged me into a writing ministry.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 40, 2, 19, 'The leaders of the Union of Evangelical Students of India saw this book');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 40, 3, 19, 'and "happened" to ask me (in the same year) if I would write two more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 40, 4, 19, 'books - one on guidance and the other on sex and marriage - specifically');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 40, 5, 19, 'designed for Indian students. I sought God earnestly for wisdom and He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 40, 6, 19, 'helped me to complete the initial manuscripts of both books within 3');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 40, 7, 19, 'months. I spent another 4 months correcting the manuscripts and retyping');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 40, 8, 19, 'them on my old typewriter. Finally, one night in 1970, I finished typing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 40, 9, 19, 'the last of the 150 pages of both manuscripts.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 40, 10, 19, 'I had never learnt typing, and so I had to do all my typing by looking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 40, 11, 19, 'at the keys (the "seek and ye shall find" method!!). Besides that, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 40, 12, 19, 'could type with only one finger of each hand!! So my progress was very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 40, 13, 19, 'slow. I still remember that night when those two fingers of mine were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 40, 14, 19, 'thoroughly numb, after many months of typing! But I went to bed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 40, 15, 19, 'rejoicing that night, because God had given me grace and wisdom to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 40, 16, 19, 'complete the task He had assigned me. FINDING GOD''S WILL and SEX, LOVE &');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 40, 17, 19, 'MARRIAGE were published by GLS in 1971.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 40, 18, 19, 'In early 1971, it "happened" that I was invited to speak at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 40, 19, 19, 'Evangelical Fellowship of India''s annual conference at Vellore. I gave');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 40, 20, 19, 'three messages there on Elisha. The Lord gave me an unusual anointing at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 40, 21, 19, 'that conference - and so I felt that I should share these messages with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 40, 22, 19, 'others immediately. God helped me to type out those messages too - and I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 40, 23, 19, 'titled the book "NEEDED - MEN OF GOD".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 40, 24, 19, 'In mid-1971, I was invited to speak at the Keswick Convention in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 40, 25, 19, 'Nilgiri Hills in Tamilnadu. I gave four messages there on "The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 40, 26, 19, 'Christ-Life for the Self-Life". Audio-taping of sermons was not common');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 40, 27, 19, 'in those days. But in the sovereignty of God, someone "happened" to tape');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 40, 28, 19, 'all four messages. Three months later, someone "happened" to come to me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 41, 1, 19, 'and offered to transcribe those messages from tape to paper. Once I got');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 41, 2, 19, 'the transcript, I edited it and titled the book "BEAUTY FOR ASHES". If');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 41, 3, 19, 'those messages had not been taped and transcribed by someone, that book');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 41, 4, 19, 'would never have been written - because I was now getting many more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 41, 5, 19, 'openings for ministry and I just did not have the time, as in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 41, 6, 19, 'previous two years, to sit down and type any manuscripts.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 41, 7, 19, 'In all these instances, I see the amazing sovereignty of God that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 41, 8, 19, 'brought the right people to me at the right time (without any effort on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 41, 9, 19, 'my part), to encourage me to write, to ask me to write on specific');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 41, 10, 19, 'topics, and to tape and transcribe my messages. I also see the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 41, 11, 19, 'sovereignty of God that reduced my preaching ministry considerably');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 41, 12, 19, 'during those three years - so that I would have plenty of time to write');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 41, 13, 19, '- and to type!!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 41, 14, 19, 'Many authors nowadays spend thousands of rupees on computer equipment');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 41, 15, 19, 'and on staying at expensive retreat centres for many months, in order to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 41, 16, 19, 'write just one book! I had nothing but an old typewriter with me. And I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 41, 17, 19, 'lived with my wife and my small son in one small room and did all my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 41, 18, 19, 'work in that room from 1969 to 1971.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 41, 19, 19, 'I had no ability to write and I certainly had no desire to be known as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 41, 20, 19, 'an author. But God had given me a love for young people and a burden to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 41, 21, 19, 'reach them with the truth. And so He pushed me into a writing ministry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 41, 22, 19, 'when I was 30 years old - and I wrote five books in a period of less');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 41, 23, 19, 'than 3 years. I know that it was God Who did it. And I know He did it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 41, 24, 19, 'because He loved the young people of India and wanted them to know the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 41, 25, 19, 'truth about Him and about His Word.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 41, 26, 19, 'I have discovered that writing Christian books does not require money,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 41, 27, 19, 'or convenient surroundings, or even any special natural ability. Peter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 41, 28, 19, 'and John were poor fishermen, not writers. And Paul wrote while he was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 42, 1, 19, 'in a prison. But all of them sought the glory of God alone in their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 42, 2, 19, 'lives and God anointed them with the Holy Spirit. And they wrote from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 42, 3, 19, 'what they had experienced in their lives - not empty theories. That was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 42, 4, 19, 'the secret. And that is why God has used their writings to bless');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 42, 5, 19, 'millions of people all over the world during the past twenty centuries.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 42, 6, 20, 'Chapter 19 A New Location And A House.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 42, 7, 20, 'After my books began to be circulated in 1971, I began to receive many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 42, 8, 20, 'invitations for ministry from all over India. Since it was not easy to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 42, 9, 20, 'travel from an out-of-the-way place like Vellore, my wife and I began');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 42, 10, 20, 'praying about moving to some major city from which travel would be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 42, 11, 20, 'easier. We also wanted to be in a city where we could work among');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 42, 12, 20, 'college-students. We considered Madras and Bangalore as two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 42, 13, 20, 'possibilities. As we prayed about this matter, considering various');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 42, 14, 20, 'factors, we saw that there was plenty of student-ministry going on in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 42, 15, 20, 'Madras, but very little in Bangalore. So we began leaning towards moving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 42, 16, 20, 'to Bangalore. But we wanted some confirmation from the Lord before');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 42, 17, 20, 'moving.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 42, 18, 20, 'At that very time, a missionary (whom we knew well) who was pastoring a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 42, 19, 20, 'Baptist church in Bangalore, knowing nothing about our thinking, asked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 42, 20, 20, 'me if I would fill in for him in his church, while he went on vacation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 42, 21, 20, 'for three months. He told us that we could stay in his house during');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 42, 22, 20, 'those 3 months, when he and his family were away. This seemed to be the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 42, 23, 20, 'confirmation that we had been seeking for. So I accepted his invitation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 42, 24, 20, 'This would also give us three months to look for a house for ourselves.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 42, 25, 20, 'So we moved to Bangalore in April 1972. We had no savings and very few');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 42, 26, 20, 'earthly possessions at that time. All that we owned on earth fitted into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 42, 27, 20, 'one small van (that we rented), with which we moved to Bangalore. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 42, 28, 20, 'preached in the Baptist church there for three months. When the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 43, 1, 20, 'missionary returned, I handed the pulpit back to him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 43, 2, 20, 'This was the first step in God''s plan - because those three months of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 43, 3, 20, 'ministry in Bangalore gave us contacts with a number of people who later');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 43, 4, 20, 'formed the core of the church that the Lord planted three years later.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 43, 5, 20, 'Annie and I had moved to Bangalore in order to work among');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 43, 6, 20, 'college-students. But we ended up never working among students at all.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 43, 7, 20, 'The Lord planted a church instead. God''s ways are mysterious. He does');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 43, 8, 20, 'not show us the whole future, but only one step at a time. He even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 43, 9, 20, 'allows us at times, to imagine that we are going to a place in order to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 43, 10, 20, 'engage in some particular ministry, when all along what He has in mind');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 43, 11, 20, 'for us there is something quite different! "His ways are perfect - and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 43, 12, 20, 'He makes our ways perfect" (Psalm 18:30, 32). Hallelujah!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 43, 13, 20, 'God plans our future in far better ways than we can ever do. When we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 43, 14, 20, 'seek His kingdom and His righteousness first, He gives us all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 43, 15, 20, 'earthly things we need for life in this world too. Christians tend to go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 43, 16, 20, 'to two extremes in this matter. Some imagine that God is interested in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 43, 17, 20, 'blessing us with earthly blessings primarily. Others imagine that God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 43, 18, 20, 'has no interest in our earthly needs at all. Both are wrong. God cares');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 43, 19, 20, 'for us more than any earthly father cares for his child and He wants to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 43, 20, 20, 'provide our every need - spiritual first and earthly next.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 43, 21, 20, 'God knew that housing would become very expensive in Bangalore in future');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 43, 22, 20, 'years. I did not know that. So God made a provision to meet that need');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 43, 23, 20, 'for me. My father was a retired pensioner without much money. But he did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 43, 24, 20, 'have a small ancestral house in Kerala, in which he had not stayed for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 43, 25, 20, '40 years. It had been leased out to a tenant. When my father tried to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 43, 26, 20, 'sell that house, the tenant caused difficulties. The Communist party');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 43, 27, 20, 'that had been ruling Kerala for many years always supported the tenants.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 43, 28, 20, 'So my father gave up all hope of ever being able to sell his house. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 44, 1, 20, 'God had a plan. A little later, the Communist party lost the elections');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 44, 2, 20, 'and a new government came into power. However, in a short time, this new');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 44, 3, 20, 'government also fell and the Communists came back to power again. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 44, 4, 20, 'during that short interval - when the Communists were not in power - God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 44, 5, 20, 'enabled my father to sell his house! He did not get much money for it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 44, 6, 20, 'But he gave me my share from that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 44, 7, 20, 'With that amount, I bought an old house in Bangalore in 1972. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 44, 8, 20, 'negotiating the purchase of this house, I told the owner (a respectable');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 44, 9, 20, 'lady) that I had no "black money" to give her, but that the entire price');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 44, 10, 20, 'of the house would be paid by cheque as "white money". In India, almost');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 44, 11, 20, 'everyone buys and sells houses with a large percentage of the price paid');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 44, 12, 20, 'in "black money" (money kept as cash because it is unaccounted for).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 44, 13, 20, 'This lady had received more attractive offers than mine from her own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 44, 14, 20, 'relatives. But she told them, "Mr. Poonen is a righteous man and I will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 44, 15, 20, 'sell it only to him!" We owned no furniture. But we discovered amazingly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 44, 16, 20, 'that she was selling all her furniture also along with her house! And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 44, 17, 20, 'she sold us that too at a very reasonable price. We used that same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 44, 18, 20, 'furniture for the next FIFTY years!!. God''s care for our needs was so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 44, 19, 20, 'exact! Above all, this house became the birthplace of the church three');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 44, 20, 20, 'years later - in 1975.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 44, 21, 20, 'When I gave away all my earnings for God''s work and left the Navy to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 44, 22, 20, 'serve the Lord, I never thought I would ever own a house in my entire');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 44, 23, 20, 'life. But God had plans that I knew nothing about. He even removed a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 44, 24, 20, 'government in Kerala so as to enable me to buy this house in Bangalore.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 44, 25, 20, 'It is wonderful to see the perfect timing of God in everything He does.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 44, 26, 20, 'As we seek to honour Him, He honours us. Hallelujah!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 44, 27, 21, 'Chapter 20 Forsaking All Possessions');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 44, 28, 21, 'Jesus said that anyone who wanted to be His disciple must "forsake all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 45, 1, 21, 'that he possesses" (Luke 14:33). If we are serious about being His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 45, 2, 21, 'disciples, then God will bring us again and again to the place where we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 45, 3, 21, 'have to forsake all that the world considers valuable.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 45, 4, 21, 'I had already made the decision to forsake honour, position and money,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 45, 5, 21, 'when I gave up my naval career. I was now faced with a new choice -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 45, 6, 21, 'concerning earthly property.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 45, 7, 21, 'I had never expected to own a house in my entire life. But as I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 45, 8, 21, 'mentioned earlier, I now owned a house - albeit an old one. And I began');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 45, 9, 21, 'to wonder whether I would become attached to this bit of earthly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 45, 10, 21, 'property. I never wanted anything to come between me and the Lord and I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 45, 11, 21, 'never wanted to be attached to anything on this earth at any time. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 45, 12, 21, 'wanted to be like the overcomers mentioned in the book of Revelation who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 45, 13, 21, 'had been "set free from the earth" (Revelation 14:3 - paraphrase). So I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 45, 14, 21, 'prayed with all my heart that if this house was going to become an idol');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 45, 15, 21, 'to me, the Lord would burn it down to the ground. It would be quite easy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 45, 16, 21, 'for the Lord to arrange an electrical short-circuit or some accidental');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 45, 17, 21, 'fire to burn the house down, when none of us were inside it. I prayed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 45, 18, 21, 'this prayer many times - quite sincerely. And many a time, when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 45, 19, 21, 'returning to my house from somewhere, I fully expected to see my house');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 45, 20, 21, 'in flames and my wife and son standing outside watching it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 45, 21, 21, 'I had placed this ''Isaac'' on the altar and given it up to God (Genesis');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 45, 22, 21, '22). But God did not destroy my house. He allowed us to keep it for many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 45, 23, 21, 'years until we sold it. But we never possess it. It was never OUR house');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 45, 24, 21, 'from the very first day. It was the Lord''s house always - and was used');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 45, 25, 21, 'for Him and for His people. We lived in that house for more than 35');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 45, 26, 21, 'years. - and we praise the Lord that it was the house of God and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 45, 27, 21, 'gate of heaven for many people during all those years. Lost souls have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 45, 28, 21, 'found the Lord in this house, the sick have been healed, demon-possessed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 46, 1, 21, 'people have been delivered, and the church of the living God has been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 46, 2, 21, 'built there. From this house, books and tapes have gone out into many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 46, 3, 21, 'parts of the world and blessed many people. I now see that that was why');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 46, 4, 21, 'God gave us this house. And that is the reason why God gives us many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 46, 5, 21, 'earthly things - that we might use them to bless others. Earthly things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 46, 6, 21, 'have their maximum value only when they are used to bless and help');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 46, 7, 21, 'others - and not when they are used merely for ourselves and our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 46, 8, 21, 'families.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 46, 9, 21, 'Some time after this, I bought a new scooter - since the old one I had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 46, 10, 21, 'from my Navy days had worn out. I was very careful with this new scooter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 46, 11, 21, '(as we all are with anything new), and did not to allow any scratches to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 46, 12, 21, 'come on it. Within a few days of my purchasing it, I began to hear a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 46, 13, 21, 'rattling sound coming from it, whenever I rode it. I wondered what was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 46, 14, 21, 'wrong. I took it to a mechanic, and he checked it thoroughly and said');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 46, 15, 21, 'that there was nothing wrong with the engine or with any other part of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 46, 16, 21, 'the scooter. I sought the Lord and He told me that I had not placed this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 46, 17, 21, 'new scooter on the altar and given it up to Him as yet. I realized then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 46, 18, 21, 'that I could unconsciously become attached even to a small thing like a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 46, 19, 21, 'scooter - especially if it was a new one! So I placed this also on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 46, 20, 21, 'altar and gave it away to the Lord. It was His scooter from then on and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 46, 21, 21, 'He could do whatever He wanted with it. If He wanted me to lend it to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 46, 22, 21, 'one of His children at some time (or even to give it away), I would do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 46, 23, 21, 'so - because it was His. And if someone borrowed it from me and damaged');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 46, 24, 21, 'it or lost it, I would not allow that to disturb me - for the scooter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 46, 25, 21, 'was the Lord''s. The rattling noise in the scooter stopped immediately.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 46, 26, 21, 'I saw that God wanted me and my wife to be to free from attachment to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 46, 27, 21, 'all earthly things - from big things like a house and from small things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 46, 28, 21, 'like a scooter; and from still smaller things like the electronic');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 47, 1, 21, 'gadgets that we used in our home - and even from the clothes that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 47, 2, 21, 'wore. We were to possess nothing as our own. At times, when a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 47, 3, 21, 'tape-recorder or a mixer in our home was spoilt or stopped working, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 47, 4, 21, 'reminded ourselves that while we were to be careful in the use of all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 47, 5, 21, 'earthly things, we were never to love or possess any of them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 47, 6, 21, 'The Lord was jealous that our spirits should not be defiled by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 47, 7, 21, 'attachment to anything of this earth. This is a prime requirement for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 47, 8, 21, 'being a disciple and for building His church. The Lord wanted me and my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 47, 9, 21, 'wife to be His disciples - who while having earthly things in our house,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 47, 10, 21, 'would possess none of them as our own. Thus our life has been free from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 47, 11, 21, 'anxiety over earthly things and also from greediness and covetousness.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 47, 12, 21, 'We have found our joy in the Lord Himself - and in the Lord alone.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 47, 13, 21, 'Hallelujah!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 47, 14, 22, 'Chapter 21 Hitting Rock Bottom');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 47, 15, 22, 'The period from mid 1971 to end 1974 (when I was 31 to 35 years old) was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 47, 16, 22, 'the period during which my fame grew rapidly in my public ministry. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 47, 17, 22, 'was also the period during which I backslid the most in my personal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 47, 18, 22, 'life. Popularity and backsliding go together in the lives of many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 47, 19, 22, 'preachers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 47, 20, 22, 'My fame as a preacher, author and radio-speaker was spreading far and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 47, 21, 22, 'wide. I had written 6 books by then that were being widely circulated.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 47, 22, 22, 'Some of them had been translated into other Indian languages. Ken Taylor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 47, 23, 22, '(translator of The Living Bible) had met me in 1971 and asked for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 47, 24, 22, 'permission to publish my book Finding God''s Will through his publishing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 47, 25, 22, 'house in the USA. This was published through Tyndale House in 1972. My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 47, 26, 22, 'weekly radio programme was being broadcast across South East Asia. And I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 47, 27, 22, 'was being invited as the main speaker at many deeper life and ''Keswick''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 47, 28, 22, 'conferences in Singapore, United Kingdom, Australia and in many places');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 48, 1, 22, 'in India. I remember one series of revival meetings at which I preached');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 48, 2, 22, 'every day for 21 consecutive days. Many people repented of their sins');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 48, 3, 22, 'and were drawn to the Lord. I was an ascending star in evangelical');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 48, 4, 22, 'Christendom!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 48, 5, 22, 'But during this entire period (mid-1971 to end-1974) I was backsliding');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 48, 6, 22, 'inwardly. My external life before men was spotless throughout this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 48, 7, 22, 'period. I was also upright and honest in all my private financial');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 48, 8, 22, 'matters and paid all my taxes honestly. But I was defeated inwardly in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 48, 9, 22, 'my thought-life and defeated in my home-life by anger etc. No-one who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 48, 10, 22, 'heard me on the radio or in pulpits across the world however knew this,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 48, 11, 22, 'for I was still preaching powerfully. There was no decline in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 48, 12, 22, 'exercise of my preaching gift during this entire period.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 48, 13, 22, 'In fact, when I visited Melbourne (Australia) in December 1973, to speak');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 48, 14, 22, 'at the Keswick Convention, an Australian Christian newspaper proclaimed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 48, 15, 22, 'me as the finest Keswick preacher they had ever heard. Little did they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 48, 16, 22, 'know that I who preached the deeper life of victory over sin was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 48, 17, 22, 'defeated myself in my thought-life. I discovered then that even good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 48, 18, 22, 'believers can be deceived into considering a man to be spiritual if he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 48, 19, 22, 'has a powerful preaching gift. I have preserved a copy of that newspaper');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 48, 20, 22, 'article to remind myself that one can be the finest preacher and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 48, 21, 22, 'greatest backslider at the same time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 48, 22, 22, 'But through my backsliding, God taught me the following lessons:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 48, 23, 22, 'Knowing all this has been a great safeguard for me during the last 50');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 48, 24, 22, 'years.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 48, 25, 22, 'By mid-1974, I became so tired of my hypocritical life that I decided to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 48, 26, 22, 'quit the ministry - because I did not want to go on living a double life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 48, 27, 22, 'and deceive people. So I began to seek the Lord in prayer. I told Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 48, 28, 22, 'that if He wanted me to continue in His service, He must baptize me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 49, 1, 22, 'afresh in the Holy Spirit and make my inner life correspond with what I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 49, 2, 22, 'was preaching. For six months I prayed regularly along with another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 49, 3, 22, 'brother who was equally needy. And then in January 1975, God filled me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 49, 4, 22, 'with His Spirit again and turned my life around completely.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 49, 5, 22, 'I know now that God does not give His Spirit to those who deserve Him,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 49, 6, 22, 'but to those who realize their desperate need of Him. I did not deserve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 49, 7, 22, 'the Holy Spirit then, or now. The Holy Spirit is a free gift - exactly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 49, 8, 22, 'like the forgiveness of sins. Since that day, more than 50 years ago,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 49, 9, 22, 'life for me has been totally different. It has proceeded from "one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 49, 10, 22, 'degree of glory to another". God''s grace has been abundant to a wretched');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 49, 11, 22, 'sinner like me, who deserved only hellfire. I thank God that Jesus came');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 49, 12, 22, '"to call not the righteous, but sinners to repentance".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 49, 13, 22, 'I had to hit rock bottom and go into the depths of defeat and be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 49, 14, 22, 'thoroughly broken, before the Lord could accomplish what He wanted in me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 49, 15, 22, 'and through me.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 49, 16, 22, 'Two results of this breaking have been:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 49, 17, 22, 'Thus God prepared me for building His church six months later.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 49, 18, 22, 'Hallelujah!!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 49, 19, 23, 'Chapter 22 A Fresh Enduement With Power');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 49, 20, 23, 'God allows many things in our lives to break us so that we are driven to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 49, 21, 23, 'cling to Him. By the end of 1974, God had broken me over a period of 15');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 49, 22, 23, 'years in many ways. Many elder brothers of churches had misunderstood');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 49, 23, 23, 'me, had been jealous of my ministry and had suppressed me and rejected');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 49, 24, 23, 'me. I had failed many a time in my personal life. In our home, Annie and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 49, 25, 23, 'I had gone through periods of extreme financial need. And to top it all,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 49, 26, 23, 'when I moved to Bangalore, I became sick.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 49, 27, 23, 'I had always been a healthy young man. But as soon as I moved to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 49, 28, 23, 'Bangalore in 1972, I was severely afflicted by repeated attacks of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 50, 1, 23, 'asthma. This was so bad that I could not sleep at night but had to sit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 50, 2, 23, 'up in a chair most nights. I had to spray asthma-relieving medicines');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 50, 3, 23, 'frequently into my mouth just to be able to breathe freely. People told');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 50, 4, 23, 'me that Bangalore was the worst place for asthma-sufferers in India. Yet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 50, 5, 23, 'I knew that God had led Annie and me to move to Bangalore. So this was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 50, 6, 23, 'obviously an attack from Satan to make me move away from Bangalore - for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 50, 7, 23, 'some reason.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 50, 8, 23, 'In mid-1974, I received an invitation to be the pastor of a Baptist');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 50, 9, 23, 'Church in Bangalore. I told them that I would preach for them every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 50, 10, 23, 'Sunday morning and evening, on two conditions -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 50, 11, 23, 'They agreed to both conditions readily and I started preaching in that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 50, 12, 23, 'Baptist Church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 50, 13, 23, 'But I was in desperate spiritual need in my personal life. So I began to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 50, 14, 23, 'seek God earnestly in prayer along with another brother, who was also in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 50, 15, 23, 'desperate need. Yet nothing seemed to change for us, month after month.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 50, 16, 23, 'In January 1975, a charismatic preacher from England came to Bangalore');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 50, 17, 23, 'for some meetings. I had read his books and been greatly blessed by his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 50, 18, 23, 'balanced teaching on the baptism of the Holy Spirit. I attended his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 50, 19, 23, 'meetings and asked him if he would speak at our church the next Sunday');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 50, 20, 23, 'morning. He readily agreed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 50, 21, 23, 'Before the Sunday morning service, the Lord asked me if I was willing to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 50, 22, 23, 'stand up before my congregation (that respected me so highly) and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 50, 23, 23, 'confess that I was a hypocrite. I said "Yes, Lord". (We don''t have to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 50, 24, 23, 'confess our private sins publicly. But in my case, I was deceiving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 50, 25, 23, 'everyone by my hypocrisy.) I had reached rock-bottom in my life and I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 50, 26, 23, 'was willing to do anything and to pay any price, if only the Lord would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 50, 27, 23, 'meet with me.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 50, 28, 23, 'This charismatic preacher always gave an invitation at the end of his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 51, 1, 23, 'meetings, for those who wanted prayer to come forward. So I planned to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 51, 2, 23, 'be the first one to go forward and confess my hypocrisy, that Sunday');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 51, 3, 23, 'morning. But amazingly, that Sunday morning, he never gave an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 51, 4, 23, 'invitation. So I did not get a chance to make my public confession. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 51, 5, 23, 'felt then that the Lord had seen my willingness to sacrifice my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 51, 6, 23, 'reputation - and that that was all He wanted. I had placed my "Isaac" on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 51, 7, 23, 'the altar and the Lord had returned it to me.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 51, 8, 23, 'I invited the preacher home for lunch after the service. After lunch, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 51, 9, 23, 'went together to an upper room in my house and I told him how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 51, 10, 23, 'desperately I needed God''s power. He told me, "It is unthinkable, Zac,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 51, 11, 23, 'that God will call you to His service and then refuse to give you His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 51, 12, 23, 'power". As he said these words, faith was suddenly born in my heart -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 51, 13, 23, 'and I believed that God had answered my prayer for power. We knelt down');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 51, 14, 23, 'to pray and he prayed for me. Then I prayed and thanked the Lord for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 51, 15, 23, 'answering my prayer. As I did so, I suddenly found myself uttering');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 51, 16, 23, 'strange syllables that I had no intention to utter. I switched back to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 51, 17, 23, 'praying in English and found myself again uttering some strange');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 51, 18, 23, 'syllables that I could not understand. This puzzled me but joy filled my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 51, 19, 23, 'heart. We had prayed only for a few minutes. As I got up from prayer, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 51, 20, 23, 'asked this brother what he had heard. He said he had heard me speaking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 51, 21, 23, 'in tongues! My wife told me later that when she saw me coming back from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 51, 22, 23, 'that time of prayer, she knew something wonderful had happened to me -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 51, 23, 23, 'by the light on my face. God had indeed met with me - and things have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 51, 24, 23, 'never been the same since.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 51, 25, 23, 'It is not that I never made any mistakes or fell, after that day. Nor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 51, 26, 23, 'has it been a straight steady climb upwards since then. But I can say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 51, 27, 23, 'this that the general direction of my life was reversed that day -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 51, 28, 23, 'January 12, 1975. The graph of my life started going upwards and has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 52, 1, 23, 'been going upward ever since. 50 years have passed since that blessed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 52, 2, 23, 'day and life has never been the same for me. But if you look closely at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 52, 3, 23, 'this upward graph, you will find that it is not a straight line but a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 52, 4, 23, 'wavy line. There are little ups and downs along the way, but the graph');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 52, 5, 23, 'moves steadily upwards. And the ripples on the line get less and less as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 52, 6, 23, 'I get closer to the Lord. I am not perfect, but I am pressing on. And as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 52, 7, 23, 'a wonderful by-product of this encounter with God, He healed me of my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 52, 8, 23, 'asthma and I have never had a problem with it since.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 52, 9, 23, 'At last I discovered what "new-covenant life in the Spirit" really was -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 52, 10, 23, 'the life that Jesus purchased on the cross for His church and gave to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 52, 11, 23, 'her on the day of Pentecost.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 52, 12, 23, 'Hallelujah!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 52, 13, 24, 'Chapter 23 Filled With The Spirit And Thereafter');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 52, 14, 24, 'Both my wife Annie and I, were in a Brethren church from the time of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 52, 15, 24, 'conversion. This made it difficult for us to accept the doctrine of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 52, 16, 24, 'baptism in the Holy Spirit and the gift of tongues. I had already');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 52, 17, 24, 'experienced something of the enduement of the Spirit (without "tongues")');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 52, 18, 24, 'in 1963; and I was open to receive the gift of tongues as well if God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 52, 19, 24, 'were to give it to me. So I used to listen to many tapes on the baptism');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 52, 20, 24, 'in the Spirit. But Annie was strongly prejudiced against this doctrine');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 52, 21, 24, 'and did not want me to listen to such tapes, fearing that I might become');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 52, 22, 24, 'a Pentecostal.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 52, 23, 24, 'However, she soon came to a place of desperate need herself. She had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 52, 24, 24, 'been very active as a young college-girl, witnessing for the Lord in her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 52, 25, 24, 'college and in the women''s jail etc. Now she was married to a full-time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 52, 26, 24, 'worker who did not even have a clear understanding of his ministry. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 52, 27, 24, 'did not have enough money to even rent a house and were living in one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 52, 28, 24, 'room of my parents'' home that they had given us to use. Our first son');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 53, 1, 24, 'had just been born; and so Annie had a small baby to look after as well.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 53, 2, 24, 'We had to scrape all the money we had in order to buy milk-powder for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 53, 3, 24, 'our son each month. These pressures reduced Annie to a state of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 53, 4, 24, 'discouragement.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 53, 5, 24, 'One day in late 1969, a sister whom she knew, asked her if she would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 53, 6, 24, 'like to come for a time of prayer to her home. Annie went with her. When');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 53, 7, 24, 'she returned some time later, she was totally transformed. I could see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 53, 8, 24, 'that she was radiant. Something had happened to her. She told me how she');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 53, 9, 24, 'had cried out to God many times in the past months, in her desperate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 53, 10, 24, 'need. Finally God had met with her that afternoon and filled her with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 53, 11, 24, 'the Holy Spirit and given her the gift of tongues as well. She was the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 53, 12, 24, 'one who had been totally opposed to this gift until then. But God had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 53, 13, 24, 'broken down her prejudices and met with her. From that moment she began');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 53, 14, 24, 'to pray that I too would receive this gift. She never told me that she');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 53, 15, 24, 'was praying for me and she never urged me to seek for this gift. All she');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 53, 16, 24, 'did was pray for me in secret.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 53, 17, 24, 'More than five years later, God answered her prayer and met with me too');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 53, 18, 24, '- on January 12, 1975. But the day after the Lord met with me, I began');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 53, 19, 24, 'to doubt my experience. Had I really been filled with the Spirit? Had I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 53, 20, 24, 'really received a genuine gift of "tongues", or had I just made up those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 53, 21, 24, 'syllables that I spoke?');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 53, 22, 24, 'I felt that if I had really been filled with the Holy Spirit, then one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 53, 23, 24, 'proof of it would be that the Bible (that the Holy Spirit had written)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 53, 24, 24, 'would come alive to me in a new way from now on. So I decided to read');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 53, 25, 24, 'the New Testament all over again - and started with Matthew Chapter 1. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 53, 26, 24, 'mediated on the genealogy of Christ with all its "begats" - and didn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 53, 27, 24, 'get any inspiration from them! But when I reached verse 20 I was struck');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 53, 28, 24, 'by the words: "....that which is conceived in her is of the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 54, 1, 24, 'Spirit."! I felt that God was speaking to me directly. That which had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 54, 2, 24, 'been conceived in my heart and which I had delivered through my mouth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 54, 3, 24, 'yesterday was from the Holy Spirit!! I was so delighted that I praised');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 54, 4, 24, 'the Lord for this assurance.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 54, 5, 24, 'The Lord then began to speak to me through this passage. First of all,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 54, 6, 24, 'even as Mary alone knew what the Holy Spirit had done in her and most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 54, 7, 24, 'others misunderstood her, even so, I alone knew what the Holy Spirit had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 54, 8, 24, 'done in me; but most others would misunderstand me. Secondly, as the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 54, 9, 24, 'Spirit came upon Mary to produce Jesus in her, even so the Spirit had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 54, 10, 24, 'come upon me primarily to produce Christ in me. The Lord told me that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 54, 11, 24, 'the gift of tongues had been much misunderstood and evil spoken of in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 54, 12, 24, 'the world; and I was now to adorn this gift with a Christlike life so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 54, 13, 24, 'that people would once again have faith in it. This is what I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 54, 14, 24, 'sought to do during the last 50 years.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 54, 15, 24, 'From that moment, it was as if all hell broke loose around me in India.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 54, 16, 24, 'Word spread like wildfire throughout the churches that "Zac Poonen was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 54, 17, 24, 'speaking in tongues". Today the gift of tongues has become more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 54, 18, 24, 'respectable in Christendom in India, and opposition to it has died down,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 54, 19, 24, 'because thousands of believers have received this gift. But in 1975 in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 54, 20, 24, 'India, things were different. People began to spread false stories about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 54, 21, 24, 'me that I was pulling people''s tongues to make them speak in tongues!!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 54, 22, 24, 'Satan had a field-day with his gossiping co-workers in Christendom!! But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 54, 23, 24, 'I was unfazed. I had not even expected to speak in tongues and was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 54, 24, 24, 'surprised when God gave me the gift. And as He had warned me, most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 54, 25, 24, 'others would misunderstand me.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 54, 26, 24, 'I now began to teach the Biblical basis for the baptism in the Spirit in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 54, 27, 24, 'the Baptist church in which I was preaching. Week after week I taught on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 54, 28, 24, 'it and a few who were conscious of their powerlessness became hungry for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 55, 1, 24, 'this in their lives. We began weekly prayer meetings for these few.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 55, 2, 24, 'Three months later a godly charismatic preacher came to Bangalore, and I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 55, 3, 24, 'asked him to speak at our Baptist church. At his meetings, a number in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 55, 4, 24, 'the church were led into the baptism in the Spirit. And then the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 55, 5, 24, 'Baptists were really disturbed....');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 55, 6, 24, 'Satan was furious, but God was sovereignly working out His purposes and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 55, 7, 24, 'silently planning for me in love.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 55, 8, 25, 'Chapter 24 The End of A Phase And The Beginning Of Another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 55, 9, 25, 'There would have been no Christianity on earth today if it were not for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 55, 10, 25, 'the mighty baptism in the Spirit that the apostles received on the day');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 55, 11, 25, 'of Pentecost, that transformed them into flaming witnesses for Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 55, 12, 25, 'who took the gospel everywhere. It is not surprising therefore that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 55, 13, 25, 'Satan has made the baptism of the Holy Spirit the most controversial');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 55, 14, 25, 'doctrine and the most counterfeited experience in Christendom today.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 55, 15, 25, 'As I preached the baptism in the Spirit in the Baptist church during the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 55, 16, 25, 'first six months of 1975, many people in that church were disturbed,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 55, 17, 25, 'because this did not agree with "their church traditions". Conflict with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 55, 18, 25, 'tradition was something that Jesus and His apostles had also encountered');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 55, 19, 25, 'wherever they preached (Mark 7:13).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 55, 20, 25, 'In July 1975, I was invited to England for some meetings. While I was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 55, 21, 25, 'there, early one morning, the Lord spoke to me in the clearest way that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 55, 22, 25, 'I had ever heard Him speak to me in my entire life. I did not understand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 55, 23, 25, 'the significance then, of all that He told me. But looking back now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 55, 24, 25, 'after 50 years, I can see that the Lord was encouraging me and preparing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 55, 25, 25, 'me for the beginning of a new phase in my life and ministry. I did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 55, 26, 25, 'have a clue however that I would be catapulted into that phase as soon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 55, 27, 25, 'as I returned to Bangalore. How wonderfully the Lord encourages us in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 55, 28, 25, 'advance when he sees that we are going to face rough waters in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 56, 1, 25, 'future.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 56, 2, 25, 'On my return home, I discovered that a lot of murmuring had been going');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 56, 3, 25, 'on in the Baptist Church concerning my preaching. God is not the author');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 56, 4, 25, 'of confusion but of peace - and so I sought the way of peace. I called');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 56, 5, 25, 'the deacons of the church together and told them that I had no desire to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 56, 6, 25, 'cause confusion or to split their church over the issue of the baptism');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 56, 7, 25, 'in the Holy Spirit. If they wanted me to leave, I told them that I would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 56, 8, 25, 'leave quietly. They said they wanted me to leave immediately. I asked if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 56, 9, 25, 'I could give a farewell message to the church the next Sunday. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 56, 10, 25, 'said, "No". The next day, however, they relented and agreed to let me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 56, 11, 25, 'speak.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 56, 12, 25, 'And so I preached my farewell message to that congregation on Sunday,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 56, 13, 25, 'August 17, 1975. I told them that they were facing a crucial decision,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 56, 14, 25, 'just like the Israelites at the borders of the promised land. They could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 56, 15, 25, 'either go forward into a life in the Holy Spirit, or continue to wander');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 56, 16, 25, 'in the wilderness of religious traditions. As soon as I had finished my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 56, 17, 25, 'message, the brother who was the Assistant Pastor in that church got up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 56, 18, 25, 'and said that since the church had rejected my message, he had decided');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 56, 19, 25, 'to resign his position and leave the church too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 56, 20, 25, 'A visiting godly brother (who had preached in that church four months');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 56, 21, 25, 'earlier) had prophesied in his message that if the church rejected what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 56, 22, 25, 'I was teaching about the Holy Spirit''s ministry, then the Lord would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 56, 23, 25, 'remove me from their midst and use me throughout India in a mighty way,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 56, 24, 25, 'apart from them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 56, 25, 25, 'That was the end of a phase of my life and ministry. The Lord had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 56, 26, 25, 'planned something new for me thereafter, but at that time I was confused');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 56, 27, 25, 'and did not know what lay ahead. But I was then at the threshhold of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 56, 28, 25, 'what the Lord had been training me for, all along - making disciples and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 57, 1, 25, 'building the Body of Christ. And that ministry would lead to intense');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 57, 2, 25, 'opposition and persecution - such as I had never experienced in all my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 57, 3, 25, 'life - from almost every group of believers in Christendom. God does not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 57, 4, 25, 'allow us to be tested beyond our ability. So He did not allow me to face');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 57, 5, 25, 'such opposition until then. I needed 16 years of preparation to face it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 57, 6, 25, 'On that Sunday, after the two of us left that Baptist church, we did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 57, 7, 25, 'know what to do next. So we decided to meet for prayer in my home that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 57, 8, 25, 'evening. We certainly had no plan to start a new church. When we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 57, 9, 25, 'finished praying, we agreed to meet again during the week for more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 57, 10, 25, 'prayer and fellowship. I spent the next three days in fasting and prayer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 57, 11, 25, 'seeking the Lord for direction for the future. A couple of families');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 57, 12, 25, 'joined us the next Sunday and we started meeting four times a week and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 57, 13, 25, 'spent many hours in fasting and prayer (on all public holidays). As we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 57, 14, 25, 'look back now, we see that a "baby" was being conceived in those times');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 57, 15, 25, 'of fasting and prayer. It was the beginning of a "body" - a local');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 57, 16, 25, 'expression of the Body of Christ.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 57, 17, 25, 'At that time, an elderly American pastor of a Pentecostal church who was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 57, 18, 25, 'retiring and returning home, came and asked me if I would take over from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 57, 19, 25, 'him as Pastor of his church. I immediately said, "No", for I knew that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 57, 20, 25, 'God did not want me to join a denominational church again. It was a new');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 57, 21, 25, 'wineskin that God now wanted in Bangalore.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 57, 22, 25, 'And so we moved forward - one day at a time - led by the Spirit, as the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 57, 23, 25, 'pillar of cloud led the Israelites in the wilderness. It was an exciting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 57, 24, 25, 'time - of making mistakes and learning from our mistakes. We did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 57, 25, 25, 'know, for example, how to exercise the gifts of the Spirit. Fortunately,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 57, 26, 25, 'none of us had a Pentecostal background. So we got all our teaching from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 57, 27, 25, 'Scripture alone. We learnt through trial and error about prophecy,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 57, 28, 25, 'speaking in tongues, interpretation and healing etc. The numbers at our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 58, 1, 25, 'meetings began to increase slowly to 20 and then 30. Some who came were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 58, 2, 25, 'sincere while others came only to receive financial help. We did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 58, 3, 25, 'have much discernment in those days and were cheated a number of times.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 58, 4, 25, 'But we learnt lessons from our mistakes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 58, 5, 25, 'All of us were far from perfect. But we were determined to press on to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 58, 6, 25, 'perfection. That was the next phase....');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 58, 7, 26, 'Chapter 25 Money And God’s Work');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 58, 8, 26, 'When considering the building of the Body of Christ, why should we start');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 58, 9, 26, 'with a chapter on money??');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 58, 10, 26, 'Because money is the greatest alternate master to God in this world and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 58, 11, 26, 'Jesus said that that no-one could serve both God and Money (Luke 16:13).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 58, 12, 26, 'Grace is the greatest power in God''s kingdom and money is the greatest');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 58, 13, 26, 'power in this world.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 58, 14, 26, 'So I realized, that if I am to build the Body of Christ, it was vital');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 58, 15, 26, 'that I be free from the love of money and that my methods of obtaining');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 58, 16, 26, 'money for my personal needs and for my ministry be godly. Many Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 58, 17, 26, 'workers have not thought through this issue - and so they end up in all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 58, 18, 26, 'sorts of compromises.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 58, 19, 26, 'When I started serving the Lord full-time, I took two decisions in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 58, 20, 26, 'relation to money:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 58, 21, 26, 'By God''s grace I have been able to maintain both those decisions until');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 58, 22, 26, 'today.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 58, 23, 26, 'Most of my ministry in the early days was to poor people in village');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 58, 24, 26, 'churches - and I refused to receive any gifts from them, because their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 58, 25, 26, 'standard of living was much lower than mine. Some others however (who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 58, 26, 26, 'were richer than me) would occasionally give me gifts, and I received');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 58, 27, 26, 'enough for my expenses each month, as long as I was single. But once I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 58, 28, 26, 'was married and had a child, I found that what I received was not enough');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 59, 1, 26, 'for my needs.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 59, 2, 26, 'How could I meet my family''s financial needs now? I did not want to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 59, 3, 26, 'the salaried employee of any Christian organization, lest I become their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 59, 4, 26, 'slave. And of course, I would certainly not send out circular letters');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 59, 5, 26, 'hinting about my needs. I would also not visit rich churches, merely to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 59, 6, 26, 'get gifts from them. The well-known preachers in India preached only in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 59, 7, 26, 'the large cities. The great need for in-depth ministry was therefore');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 59, 8, 26, 'among the poor people in the villages of India. So I asked the Lord to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 59, 9, 26, 'send me to those villages - and He did just that.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 59, 10, 26, 'However, since I had to provide for my family, I found myself frequently');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 59, 11, 26, 'thinking about money. I knew that those who are called to serve the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 59, 12, 26, 'full-time should not be thinking about money frequently - just as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 59, 13, 26, 'person called to be single, should not be occupied with thoughts of sex.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 59, 14, 26, 'One whose mind burns with sexual thoughts is obviously not called to a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 59, 15, 26, 'single life; and one whose mind is always on his financial needs, should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 59, 16, 26, 'not be in full-time ministry. So, in January 1970, I decided before the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 59, 17, 26, 'Lord to wait for another six months. If by the end of that time, my mind');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 59, 18, 26, 'was not freed from preoccupation with my financial needs, that would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 59, 19, 26, 'prove to me that I did not have grace to continue in full-time work. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 59, 20, 26, 'would then take up a secular job, and serve the Lord in my spare time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 59, 21, 26, 'One week before that 6-month deadline expired (in end-June 1970), a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 59, 22, 26, 'Christian group sent me a letter stating that they wanted to support me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 59, 23, 26, 'with a fixed amount that would be enough for my family''s needs. On my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 59, 24, 26, 'part I would have to give them all the gifts I received for my ministry.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 59, 25, 26, 'I could choose whatever ministry I wanted and go wherever I felt led to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 59, 26, 26, 'go - and they would not control me in any way. I was amazed at their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 59, 27, 26, 'offer, because I did not know of any organization in the world that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 59, 28, 26, 'supported Christian workers without controlling them. Those who gave');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 60, 1, 26, 'money always pulled the strings! I saw then that this was the Lord''s way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 60, 2, 26, 'of confirming to me that He had indeed called me to full-time ministry.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 60, 3, 26, 'Once we started our house-church however, I felt I should stop receiving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 60, 4, 26, 'this financial support, in order to be an example to others in India.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 60, 5, 26, 'The Lord then led me to support myself as the apostle Paul did. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 60, 6, 26, 'provided for Paul''s needs mostly through his own occupation as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 60, 7, 26, 'tentmaker, and partly through gifts from the Philippian believers. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 60, 8, 26, 'now changed the mode of my financial support as well - and He did it in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 60, 9, 26, 'such an amazing way that my original desire was still fulfilled: My mind');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 60, 10, 26, 'would NEVER be on money.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 60, 11, 26, 'I was 35 years old when we started our house-church. All I knew was how');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 60, 12, 26, 'to navigate ships and how to fire guns and torpedoes - none of which was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 60, 13, 26, 'of any use in getting a job in Bangalore!! I did not have much skill in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 60, 14, 26, 'working with my hands either. I also needed to find a means of earning');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 60, 15, 26, 'an income that would not tie me down to Bangalore, for I had a burden to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 60, 16, 26, 'spread the good news to many other places in India. I was the Lord''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 60, 17, 26, 'servant first and foremost. The apostle Paul''s example challenged me in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 60, 18, 26, 'this area. Although he supported himself fully with a secular occupation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 60, 19, 26, 'in Corinth, Thessalonica and Ephesus for many years, he never allowed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 60, 20, 26, 'his secular occupation to become primary. He was an apostle first of all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 60, 21, 26, 'and he always made the Lord''s work His top priority.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 60, 22, 26, 'I decided to invest the little money that I had (that I had received as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 60, 23, 26, 'an inheritance from my parents), in companies that would give me a good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 60, 24, 26, 'return for my investment. I did not speculate in the stock market, for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 60, 25, 26, 'then my mind would always be on the market-value of my shares and not on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 60, 26, 26, 'God''s work. I decided instead to invest directly in companies, without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 60, 27, 26, 'going through the stock-market. Amazingly, the Lord made the government');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 60, 28, 26, 'of India also to help me at that time by their passing certain laws that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 61, 1, 26, 'enabled me to invest directly in a number of good multinational');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 61, 2, 26, 'companies. I knew nothing about investing then, just as I knew nothing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 61, 3, 26, 'about preaching or writing, when I started doing those things. But God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 61, 4, 26, 'saw that my desire was not to make money, but only to earn enough for my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 61, 5, 26, 'family''s needs. I had very little money to invest. But God took my five');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 61, 6, 26, 'loaves and blessed them miraculously, so that I have been able to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 61, 7, 26, 'support my family for more than 40 years now, with that. By God''s grace,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 61, 8, 26, 'our family''s "bowl of flour and jar of oil" have always remained full (1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 61, 9, 26, 'Kings 17:16).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 61, 10, 26, 'I had always wanted to be a living demonstration to my generation that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 61, 11, 26, 'there was a loving Father in heaven Who cared for His children. And God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 61, 12, 26, 'has enabled me to be such a testimony for Him. All glory and praise be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 61, 13, 26, 'to Him alone. Amen.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 61, 14, 27, 'Chapter 26 When People Speak Evil Of You');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 61, 15, 27, 'When I left the Indian Navy to serve the Lord full-time in May 1966, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 61, 16, 27, 'one person who encouraged me the most and advised me was Brother Bakht');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 61, 17, 27, 'Singh. He was India''s most outstanding evangelist at that time and I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 61, 18, 27, 'respected him more than anyone else I knew, as a genuine man of God. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 61, 19, 27, 'gave me three bits of Scriptural advice that have proved to be extremely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 61, 20, 27, 'valuable to me during the last 50 years. They were:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 61, 21, 27, 'In the last chapter, I mentioned how the Lord had helped me all these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 61, 22, 27, 'years to keep the first two of those bits of advice. The need for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 61, 23, 27, 'third bit of advice became more evident after 1975-1976.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 61, 24, 27, 'In the years 1975 and 1976, three things happened that suddenly changed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 61, 25, 27, 'the attitude of many Christians in India towards me. They became very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 61, 26, 27, 'negative towards me thereafter.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 61, 27, 27, 'But these were the very three things that made me a joyful, rejoicing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 61, 28, 27, 'Christian who began to experience victory over sin in my personal life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 62, 1, 27, 'and in my family life. And for the first time in my life I had begun to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 62, 2, 27, 'experience fellowship in a local church that was a foretaste of heaven.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 62, 3, 27, 'But all of this infuriated Satan.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 62, 4, 27, 'Whenever the blessing of the Lord increases in our life, Satan''s fury');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 62, 5, 27, 'against us increases too. The Lord allows this, because it is only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 62, 6, 27, 'through such attacks of Satan that the Lord keeps us humble, draws us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 62, 7, 27, 'closer to Himself, leads us into spiritual warfare thus strengthening');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 62, 8, 27, 'us, and makes us a blessing to thousands. Like the rock that was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 62, 9, 27, 'smitten, we too need to be broken, before the rivers of blessing can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 62, 10, 27, 'flow out through us to others. The opposition of men and their false');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 62, 11, 27, 'accusations serve to keep us broken before God. Thus the grain of wheat');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 62, 12, 27, 'falls into the ground, loses its attractiveness before men, and dies.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 62, 13, 27, 'Then fruit comes forth from it in abundance.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 62, 14, 27, 'Satan was quite happy with me as long as I was a famous, but defeated');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 62, 15, 27, 'preacher, hypocritically preaching about the "deeper-life". But once I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 62, 16, 27, 'entered into the new-covenant life and started building new-covenant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 62, 17, 27, 'churches, and began to support myself financially, Satan became furious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 62, 18, 27, 'and stirred up Christian pastors and leaders all over the country');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 62, 19, 27, 'against me - people who were either jealous of my ministry, or whose');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 62, 20, 27, 'hypocrisy, honour-seeking and love of money were being exposed by my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 62, 21, 27, 'preaching. They began to portray me as "a false prophet" who was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 62, 22, 27, 'teaching errors like "sinless perfection", "Christ had sin in His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 62, 23, 27, 'flesh", etc., and other heresies. None of these accusations were true');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 62, 24, 27, 'and none of my accusers could show any evidence of my having taught');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 62, 25, 27, 'these, in any of my books or tapes. But that did not bother them. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 62, 26, 27, 'discovered that many Christian leaders hold hands with "Satan, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 62, 27, 27, 'Accuser of the brothers", and spread stories about God''s children,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 62, 28, 27, 'without any evidence at all. Many Christian magazines and publishers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 63, 1, 27, 'also have no more ethics than secular tabloids - for they too jump on to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 63, 2, 27, 'the "Accusation bandwagon" often and publish "hearsay" without');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 63, 3, 27, 'verification.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 63, 4, 27, 'It was now that I needed the third bit of advice. I had to learn to keep');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 63, 5, 27, 'my mouth shut and to follow the Lord Who was silent as a lamb when He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 63, 6, 27, 'was accused falsely. And the Lord helped me. He has now helped me in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 63, 7, 27, 'this matter for over 50 years. I have refused to defend myself before');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 63, 8, 27, 'any of my accusers. The Lord would often ask me, when I was being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 63, 9, 27, 'mercilessly attacked by false accusations, whether I wanted to justify');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 63, 10, 27, 'myself before my accusers or whether I would allow Him to deal with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 63, 11, 27, 'them. I always told Him that I would let Him deal with them. Such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 63, 12, 27, 'accusations have not stopped even after 50 years. But when God is with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 63, 13, 27, 'us, we can face the whole world being against us. God has given me grace');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 63, 14, 27, 'to love and forgive all my accusers and I have never lifted one finger');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 63, 15, 27, 'to repay evil for evil or to hurt anyone who has tried to harm me.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 63, 16, 27, 'Vengeance is God''s business and not mine. "''Vengeance is Mine and I WILL');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 63, 17, 27, 'repay'', says the Lord" is a new-covenant statement (Romans 12:19) - and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 63, 18, 27, 'God is very exact in making such "repayments"!!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 63, 19, 27, 'Actually no-one has ever succeeded in harming me. I am "the apple of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 63, 20, 27, 'God''s eye" (Zechariah 2:8), and I have experienced the fulfilment of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 63, 21, 27, 'Romans 8:28 in all the attacks I have faced. They have worked together');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 63, 22, 27, 'for the glory of God and for my own good.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 63, 23, 27, 'Here is but one example: Some who were warned against me, read my books');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 63, 24, 27, 'and listened to my tapes, in order to find out what exactly the wrong');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 63, 25, 27, 'doctrine was that I was preaching. As a result, they were gripped by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 63, 26, 27, 'truth - and joined our churches and are glorious brothers and sisters in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 63, 27, 27, 'our midst today!!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 63, 28, 27, 'Thus God has turned the tables on Satan again and again.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 64, 1, 27, 'Praise the Lord!!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 64, 2, 28, 'Chapter 27 Preparation For Building The Church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 64, 3, 28, 'Ever since the year 1965, I had a great burden in my heart to see a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 64, 4, 28, 'local church in India where discipleship, holy living and separation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 64, 5, 28, 'from the world were emphasized, and where the brothers and sisters were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 64, 6, 28, 'identified as Jesus disciples'' by their love for one another (as Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 64, 7, 28, 'said in John 13:35) - and not by the fundamentalism of their doctrines.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 64, 8, 28, 'I now see that God planned to build such a church, when He moved us to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 64, 9, 28, 'Bangalore. But before that church could be built, the Lord had to test');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 64, 10, 28, 'me in two important areas.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 64, 11, 28, 'Two of the biggest sins among preachers in Christendom today are:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 64, 12, 28, 'Failure in these two areas is the main reason why many gifted preachers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 64, 13, 28, 'fail to become God''s "prophets" and genuine "servants of the Lord" in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 64, 14, 28, 'our land.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 64, 15, 28, 'These were two areas in which the Lord had to test me before He could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 64, 16, 28, 'commit His work to me.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 64, 17, 28, 'I have already spoken (in an earlier Chapter) of the Lord''s testing me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 64, 18, 28, 'in the first of these areas and how the Lord led me to support myself in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 64, 19, 28, 'order to be an example to other Christian workers (as Paul was) - in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 64, 20, 28, 'India.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 64, 21, 28, 'In relation to the second area: The Lord asked me twice in my life, to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 64, 22, 28, 'give up fame and honour.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 64, 23, 28, 'The first time was in 1964, when I was advancing rapidly in my Naval');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 64, 24, 28, 'career. I was doing exceptionally well in my career when the Lord asked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 64, 25, 28, 'me to quit the Navy and serve Him full-time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 64, 26, 28, 'The second time was in 1975, when I was becoming more and more famous in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 64, 27, 28, 'Christian circles as an author and radio-preacher and as a speaker at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 64, 28, 28, 'deeper life conventions in many countries worldwide.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 65, 1, 28, 'My father had been the Chairman of the first "Billy Graham Crusade" in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 65, 2, 28, 'India (in Delhi in 1956) and he used to tell me that I too had a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 65, 3, 28, 'preaching gift like Billy Graham and that God could use me all over the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 65, 4, 28, 'world.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 65, 5, 28, 'The Lord however told me in 1975 not to seek for a world-wide ministry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 65, 6, 28, 'but instead to just fall into the ground each day and die. He showed me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 65, 7, 28, 'that the secret of a fruitful ministry did not lie in a spiritual gift');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 65, 8, 28, 'or a worldwide ministry, but in dying as a grain of wheat - as He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 65, 9, 28, 'Himself had done in His earthly days (John 12:24).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 65, 10, 28, 'God wanted me to turn away from the pursuit of fame in the secular world');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 65, 11, 28, 'as well as in the Christian world. Only then would He attest me as His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 65, 12, 28, 'servant. By God''s grace, I yielded to His call in BOTH "worlds".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 65, 13, 28, 'The Lord also assured me that He would give me His power and anointing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 65, 14, 28, 'constantly if I consistently chose the way of the cross. This meant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 65, 15, 28, 'dying to my own choices, dying to men''s opinions about me (whether good');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 65, 16, 28, 'or bad), ignoring the criticisms of my enemies and loving them in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 65, 17, 28, 'return, dying to earthly comforts and conveniences, dying to personal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 65, 18, 28, 'choices as to where to go and where to preach, dying to my own');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 65, 19, 28, 'cleverness and depending on the Lord alone for revelation and guidance');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 65, 20, 28, 'in all matters, dying to my personal attachment to people (which could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 65, 21, 28, 'make me compromise or show partiality to my family members or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 65, 22, 28, 'coworkers), etc. In other words, He was calling me to die to Self and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 65, 23, 28, 'accept the rule of God in every area of my life.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 65, 24, 28, 'The Lord also showed me that there were two sides to the great');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 65, 25, 28, 'commission - one was preaching the gospel to ALL men (as commanded in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 65, 26, 28, 'Mark 16:15 - ff) and the other was making disciples and teaching them to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 65, 27, 28, 'obey ALL that Jesus commanded (as commanded in Matthew 28:18-20) - and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 65, 28, 28, 'the Lord showed me that it was the second side of this great commission');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 66, 1, 28, 'that had been neglected almost everywhere in India, and that needed to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 66, 2, 28, 'be emphasized.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 66, 3, 28, 'And so I chose in 1975, to give up an itinerant worldwide teaching');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 66, 4, 28, 'ministry and to start on the less exciting ministry of making disciples');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 66, 5, 28, 'and building them into local churches. After 50 years of doing this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 66, 6, 28, 'latter ministry, I can say that, although this is a more demanding');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 66, 7, 28, 'ministry, it is far more satisfying. It produces more lasting results -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 66, 8, 28, 'for eternity. It is easy to be a spiritual consultant travelling around');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 66, 9, 28, 'the world giving advice to people. It is more difficult to be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 66, 10, 28, 'spiritual father working patiently with disciples and bringing them to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 66, 11, 28, 'maturity. But at the end of the road, it is far more rewarding to be a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 66, 12, 28, 'spiritual father than to be a spiritual consultant!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 66, 13, 28, 'I have no regret today that I chose the way of the cross instead of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 66, 14, 28, 'worldwide fame as a preacher!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 66, 15, 29, 'Chapter 28 Some Distinctives Of The New Church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 66, 16, 29, 'When we started meeting together in my home in August 1975, we had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 66, 17, 29, 'absolutely no intention of starting a new church. Only apostles planted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 66, 18, 29, 'churches - and I certainly did not feel that I qualified! But as time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 66, 19, 29, 'went on, we found more and more people coming to meet with us and we had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 66, 20, 29, 'no option but to continue meeting together. We never invited anyone to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 66, 21, 29, 'join us. And we did not want anyone to join us merely because he was fed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 66, 22, 29, 'up with his own church - because we knew that such a person would soon');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 66, 23, 29, 'get fed up with us too! Jesus invited only the "weary and heavy laden"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 66, 24, 29, 'to come to Him (Matthew 11:28) - in other words, those who were fed up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 66, 25, 29, 'with their own defeated lives and who were desperately seeking for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 66, 26, 29, 'victory. We wanted only such folks to join us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 66, 27, 29, 'There were already hundreds of denominations in India and we were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 66, 28, 29, 'certain that God did not want to start another denomination through us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 67, 1, 29, 'Ever since the Protestant reformation, every new movement that the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 67, 2, 29, 'started was started by Him to emphasize some features of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 67, 3, 29, 'new-covenant life that the existing churches around them were not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 67, 4, 29, 'emphasizing. Otherwise there would be no need for God to start something');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 67, 5, 29, 'new.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 67, 6, 29, 'Now the Lord was starting a new church in our midst. We wondered what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 67, 7, 29, 'the distinctives were that He wanted to emphasize through us. We were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 67, 8, 29, 'certainly not more spiritual than others. We were all sinners saved by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 67, 9, 29, 'grace and we were aware of our own imperfections in many areas. But we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 67, 10, 29, 'could not agree with many other churches in a number of areas, where we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 67, 11, 29, 'felt they had departed from New Testament teaching and practice. As we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 67, 12, 29, 'continued to meet, some of the areas where we disagreed began to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 67, 13, 29, 'crystallize in our minds:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 67, 14, 29, 'These were the reasons why God was starting a new church in India. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 67, 15, 29, 'could see that God needed such a testimony in our land. So we submitted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 67, 16, 29, 'to God and allowed Him to do as He willed with us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 67, 17, 29, 'Every church has wonderful principles when they start. But time tests');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 67, 18, 29, 'all those principles. How are things a few decades later? As we look');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 67, 19, 29, 'back now after 50 years, although we still see our lack in many other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 67, 20, 29, 'areas, we thank God that He has preserved us without any compromise in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 67, 21, 29, 'the above seven areas.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 67, 22, 29, 'All glory be to his Name alone!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 67, 23, 30, 'Chapter 29 Authority Over Satan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 67, 24, 30, 'Jesus told the Pharisees, "If I cast out demons by the Spirit of God,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 67, 25, 30, 'then the kingdom of God has come upon you" (Matthew 12:28).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 67, 26, 30, 'Jesus casting out demons through the Holy Spirit''s power was proof that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 67, 27, 30, 'the kingdom of God had come there and then. Peter also said, "Jesus was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 67, 28, 30, 'anointed with the Holy Spirit and delivered people who were oppressed by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 68, 1, 30, 'the devil" (Acts 10:38). Jesus had lived a perfectly holy life for 30');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 68, 2, 30, 'years in Nazareth. But it was only after he was anointed with the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 68, 3, 30, 'Spirit at His baptism that He came into direct conflict with Satan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 68, 4, 30, '(Matthew 4:1-10) and delivered people from demons.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 68, 5, 30, 'As a new church in Bangalore, we saw that the Lord''s calling for us was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 68, 6, 30, 'to be a miniature model of the kingdom of God. And this would bring us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 68, 7, 30, 'into direct conflict with the kingdom of Satan. As Christ''s Body on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 68, 8, 30, 'earth, we were called to exercise the same authority that Jesus our Head');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 68, 9, 30, 'had exercised. And we could do that, only as he Himself did it - through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 68, 10, 30, 'the Holy Spirit. None of us in our church had any experience thus far,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 68, 11, 30, 'in binding Satan''s activities in prayer or in casting out demons.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 68, 12, 30, 'Demon-possessed people could not be helped by counselling or by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 68, 13, 30, 'exhortations to repent. They needed deliverance from the evil spirits');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 68, 14, 30, 'that possessed them!!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 68, 15, 30, 'All around us is a spirit-world that our human senses cannot sense. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 68, 16, 30, 'can only observe the manifestations of these spirits. Before I was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 68, 17, 30, 'anointed with the Holy Spirit, I did not know what to do if I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 68, 18, 30, 'encountered a demon-possessed person. But the baptism in the Holy Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 68, 19, 30, 'brought me into an awareness of this spirit-realm.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 68, 20, 30, 'All human beings are afraid of Satan. One of the first things the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 68, 21, 30, 'began to show me was that Satan had been defeated and stripped of all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 68, 22, 30, 'his armour on the cross (Colossians 2:15; Hebrews 2:14). So Satan could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 68, 23, 30, 'not touch a child of God in any way now, except where God permitted him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 68, 24, 30, 'to do so, for that person''s sanctification. The Lord showed me also that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 68, 25, 30, 'He had given His children "authority over ALL the power of the enemy"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 68, 26, 30, '(Luke 10:19).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 68, 27, 30, 'To embolden me against Satan, the Lord began to give me dreams at night,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 68, 28, 30, 'of encounters with Satan. We read in Acts 2:17 that God speaks to us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 69, 1, 30, 'occasionally through dreams:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 69, 2, 30, 'The New Testament itself begins with five incidents (in its first two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 69, 3, 30, 'chapters) where God guided people through dreams (Matthew Chapters 1 &');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 69, 4, 30, '2). Every dream we have is not from God. Many dreams are meaningless;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 69, 5, 30, 'and some dreams are just the result of having eaten too much the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 69, 6, 30, 'previous evening!! But occasionally a dream can be from God. We can know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 69, 7, 30, 'it is from God, if it encourages us and lifts up our spirits.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 69, 8, 30, 'In one dream, I saw myself walking back to my room alone, after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 69, 9, 30, 'preaching my heart out at a public meeting one night. I heard a voice');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 69, 10, 30, 'behind me saying, "That was not good enough. You could have preached');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 69, 11, 30, 'better than that." I thought I had done my best that night - but perhaps');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 69, 12, 30, 'the Lord was still not satisfied - and I was discouraged when I heard');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 69, 13, 30, 'that word. Then I asked the Lord (in my dream), "Why is it Lord, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 69, 14, 30, 'when You speak to me face to face, I am always encouraged. But whenever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 69, 15, 30, 'you speak to me from behind me, it is always so discouraging?" The Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 69, 16, 30, 'said, "Turn around and see who is speaking to you." I turned around and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 69, 17, 30, 'saw that it was the devil who had been speaking. As soon as I recognized');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 69, 18, 30, 'him, he fled and disappeared.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 69, 19, 30, 'I woke up from my sleep and learnt something that day - that the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 69, 20, 30, 'never says, "That was not good enough" - to anyone. He never said it to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 69, 21, 30, 'anyone when He was on earth and He does not say it to anyone now that He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 69, 22, 30, 'is in heaven. Such a word always comes from Satan, who tells us we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 69, 23, 30, 'haven''t done well enough, only in order to discourage us. The Lord, on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 69, 24, 30, 'the other hand, always appreciates our weakest efforts. But we imagine');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 69, 25, 30, 'that words that challenge us to improve could come only from the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 69, 26, 30, 'and never from Satan. And then we get discouraged, because we feel that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 69, 27, 30, 'the Lord will never be satisfied, no matter how hard we try. This is one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 69, 28, 30, 'of Satan''s many lies. He is a master at pretending to speak as an angel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 70, 1, 30, 'of light (2 Corinthians 11:14)!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 70, 2, 30, 'The Lord told me to expose this tactic of Satan in my preaching');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 70, 3, 30, 'everywhere. And that is what I have done ever since. Most believers who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 70, 4, 30, 'know that Christ died for their sins on the cross, do not know that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 70, 5, 30, 'Satan was also totally defeated on the same cross. That is why they are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 70, 6, 30, 'afraid of Satan and therefore often depressed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 70, 7, 30, 'All discouragement and self-condemnation come only from Satan. Our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 70, 8, 30, 'heavenly Father will never tell us anything that discourages us. He is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 70, 9, 30, '"the God Who gives encouragement" (Romans 15:5) and the "One Who so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 70, 10, 30, 'wonderfully comforts and strengthens us in our hardships and trials" (2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 70, 11, 30, 'Corinthians 1:3, 4 - TLB).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 70, 12, 30, 'I had been a slave to depression for many years. But the revelation of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 70, 13, 30, 'Christ''s victory and our authority over Satan, coupled with being filled');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 70, 14, 30, 'with the Holy Spirit, delivered me from all depression and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 70, 15, 30, 'discouragement - totally and permanently.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 70, 16, 30, 'Jesus is "the Author and Perfecter of our faith" (Hebrews 12:2). He was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 70, 17, 30, 'never discouraged or depressed. Because He defeated Satan, we too can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 70, 18, 30, 'now walk on earth as He walked then - free from all discouragement and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 70, 19, 30, 'depression (1 John 1:7).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 70, 20, 30, 'Praise the Lord!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 70, 21, 31, 'Chapter 30 Influencing The Government');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 70, 22, 31, 'The church of Jesus Christ is God''s ambassador in each country. And so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 70, 23, 31, 'we are called to pray for government rulers and for all in authority, so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 70, 24, 31, '"that we may live a quiet and peaceful life with all reverence toward');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 70, 25, 31, 'God" (1 Timothy 2:1). When we started meeting as a church in my house,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 70, 26, 31, 'we saw this as one of our main responsibilities as a new-covenant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 70, 27, 31, 'church. God had placed us in India to influence the government of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 70, 28, 31, 'country and of our city, for good, through our prayers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 71, 1, 31, 'We knew that God was not looking for a great crowd of people to pray but');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 71, 2, 31, 'only a few ("two or three"), who had a pure conscience and who were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 71, 3, 31, 'united (Psalm 66:18; Matthew 18:18-20). We were only a few in number in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 71, 4, 31, 'our church, but we did seek after holiness earnestly and we were united.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 71, 5, 31, 'God used us on a number of occasions to influence the affairs of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 71, 6, 31, 'country and of our city.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 71, 7, 31, 'First Instance');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 71, 8, 31, 'One night, when I was in North India, I woke up suddenly from my sleep');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 71, 9, 31, 'at 2 am and saw a vision. This was perhaps the only vision I have ever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 71, 10, 31, 'seen in my life. (It is difficult at times, at night to distinguish');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 71, 11, 31, 'between a vision and a dream). In the vision, I saw the face of a very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 71, 12, 31, 'senior cabinet minister in the Indian government. I then saw the faces');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 71, 13, 31, 'of a number of Indian people from various parts of the country; and I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 71, 14, 31, 'heard a voice that said, "The power to free these people is in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 71, 15, 31, 'church".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 71, 16, 31, 'I did not know what the vision meant but I knew it was from the Lord. So');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 71, 17, 31, 'I began to pray in unknown tongues. When I returned to Bangalore, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 71, 18, 31, 'shared this vision with the believers in our house-church and they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 71, 19, 31, 'joined me in prayer. Since I did not know what I was to pray for, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 71, 20, 31, 'continued to pray in tongues. Ten days later, this particular minister');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 71, 21, 31, 'had a conflict with others in the party and resigned from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 71, 22, 31, 'parliamentary party. Two months later he resigned from the cabinet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 71, 23, 31, 'itself. This led to two factions emerging within the ruling party - one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 71, 24, 31, 'supporting the prime minister and the other supporting this man who had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 71, 25, 31, 'resigned. In the months thereafter, many efforts were made to bring');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 71, 26, 31, 'these two factions together. Every time I read about such efforts in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 71, 27, 31, 'paper, a burden would come on me to pray. I did not belong to any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 71, 28, 31, 'political party. So I could pray from a neutral standpoint without any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 72, 1, 31, 'bias towards anyone. And since I was praying in tongues, I did not know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 72, 2, 31, 'what I was praying for, but I knew it was in accordance with God''s will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 72, 3, 31, '- whatever that was!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 72, 4, 31, 'About eight months later, an anti-Christian bill was introduced by a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 72, 5, 31, 'member of the ruling party, in India''s parliament. But by then the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 72, 6, 31, 'ruling party was so divided into these two factions that they could not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 72, 7, 31, 'unite to pass the bill and make it a law (to harass Christians). The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 72, 8, 31, 'party itself lost power finally and split into two. It was only then I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 72, 9, 31, 'understood why God had given me this burden of prayer: It was to prevent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 72, 10, 31, 'this bill from becoming law. We are God''s co-workers and He works in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 72, 11, 31, 'answer to our prayers. A few states in India have now passed such a law');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 72, 12, 31, 'forbidding conversions, for their states alone. But this has never been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 72, 13, 31, 'passed as a law for the whole country - and so Christians still have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 72, 14, 31, 'freedom in most places in India, to preach the gospel freely.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 72, 15, 31, 'Second Instance');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 72, 16, 31, 'One evening, during a church prayer-meeting, I found myself having a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 72, 17, 31, 'sudden burden to pray for the country and for the government, so that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 72, 18, 31, 'might live in peace and rest in our land. India was passing through a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 72, 19, 31, 'difficult time, with rumours of corruption at the highest levels of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 72, 20, 31, 'government. I shared my burden with the church at the prayer-meeting,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 72, 21, 31, 'and we prayed for the country with much burden. Within 24 hours, there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 72, 22, 31, 'was a dramatic turn of events in the country. God removed someone from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 72, 23, 31, 'power who was the root-cause of the problems. And as a result, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 72, 24, 31, 'political climate of the country changed totally - for the better. This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 72, 25, 31, 'was a very quick and specific answer to prayer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 72, 26, 31, 'Third Instance');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 72, 27, 31, 'In 1981, the workers of all the public sector companies in Bangalore');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 72, 28, 31, 'went on strike for over two months. Some began to indulge in violence');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 73, 1, 31, 'too. Matters reached a flash point when the police fired at a crowd of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 73, 2, 31, 'striking workers one day. Bangalore was now a powder-keg of explosives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 73, 3, 31, 'ready to blow up. The police could round up the gangsters and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 73, 4, 31, 'hooligans who were causing the problems. But they could not restrain the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 73, 5, 31, 'evil spirits who were instigating these people. That was the job of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 73, 6, 31, 'church. So we called our church to three days of prayer for peace in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 73, 7, 31, 'city. At the end of the third day, we felt that God had answered our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 73, 8, 31, 'prayer. A confirmation of this answer came later from the security staff');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 73, 9, 31, 'of one of the companies, who told one of our church-members that all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 73, 10, 31, 'security staff in that company had been under great suspense wondering');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 73, 11, 31, 'what would happen next - when suddenly on a particular date the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 73, 12, 31, 'situation changed and the tension eased. The date he mentioned was the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 73, 13, 31, 'last day of our prayer meetings!! Very soon the strike too was called');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 73, 14, 31, 'off and peace returned to our city. God used our small church to bring');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 73, 15, 31, 'peace to millions of people in Bangalore.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 73, 16, 31, 'Besides these instances, we have also influenced the elections in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 73, 17, 31, 'country dramatically, more than once. We knew that the Christians in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 73, 18, 31, 'India were too few in number to influence any election results by their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 73, 19, 31, 'voting. But we also knew that we could influence the decision of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 73, 20, 31, 'whole electorate in India by prayer. So we decided to vote for "God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 73, 21, 31, 'perfect will" in prayer meetings!! As we prayed, God could move people''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 73, 22, 31, 'thinking in the direction that He wanted. So we have prayed as a church,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 73, 23, 31, 'for our country, at each election time. We have also prayed against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 73, 24, 31, 'anti-Christian governments whenever they have come to power in India or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 73, 25, 31, 'in our own state. And we have seen again and again, how God has answered');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 73, 26, 31, 'our prayers in amazing ways. (We were not the only church that was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 73, 27, 31, 'praying. There were others too. God answered all our prayers).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 73, 28, 31, 'We were encouraged through these instances to see that God was making us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 74, 1, 31, 'the salt and light of India - salt that gave a taste to its surroundings');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 74, 2, 31, 'and a light that shone brightly for the Lord in the land.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 74, 3, 31, 'Praise the Lord!!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 74, 4, 32, 'Chapter 31 Casting Out Demons');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 74, 5, 32, 'Jesus said to His disciples, ''Go into all the world and preach the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 74, 6, 32, 'gospel to all creation....These signs will accompany those who have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 74, 7, 32, 'believed: In My name they will cast out demons.... (Mark 16:15-17).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 74, 8, 32, 'Men and women have been possessed by demons from the beginning of human');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 74, 9, 32, 'history. But we read of people being delivered from demons only after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 74, 10, 32, 'Jesus came. Now that Christ has defeated Satan on the cross, anyone can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 74, 11, 32, 'be totally delivered from demons in Jesus'' Name - just like anyone can');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 74, 12, 32, 'have his sins totally forgiven in Jesus'' Name. Jesus wanted His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 74, 13, 32, 'disciples to proclaim this dual good news all over the world - that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 74, 14, 32, 'people could be delivered from the guilt of their sins as well as from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 74, 15, 32, 'demons. However, I never had faith to deliver people from demons until I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 74, 16, 32, 'was baptized in the Holy Spirit and was convinced that Jesus had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 74, 17, 32, 'defeated Satan on the cross.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 74, 18, 32, 'One of my first encounters with an evil spirit, interestingly enough,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 74, 19, 32, 'was when I was speaking to students at a Bible-College. (Jesus cast out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 74, 20, 32, 'demons during synagogue-meetings!) I had experienced a great anointing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 74, 21, 32, 'in speaking that morning and had just concluded my message and asked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 74, 22, 32, 'everyone to bow in prayer. Suddenly one of the students in the last row');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 74, 23, 32, 'of the hall got up and started dancing in the aisle. I realized');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 74, 24, 32, 'immediately that this was a demon trying to distract the students from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 74, 25, 32, 'responding to the message. Since everyone was bowed in prayer, I knew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 74, 26, 32, 'that any loud rebuke of the demon would make the students lift their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 74, 27, 32, 'heads and look around and be distracted. So I whispered under my breath');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 74, 28, 32, '(so softly that even those sitting immediately behind me on the platform');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 75, 1, 32, 'did not hear), "In Jesus'' Name, sit down." Immediately the young man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 75, 2, 32, '(who was nearly 40 feet away from me) sat down. I then continued with my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 75, 3, 32, 'closing prayer. I left the Bible-college after the meeting and never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 75, 4, 32, 'discovered who that student was. Some months later, I got a letter from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 75, 5, 32, 'another country. The person wrote saying that he had been possessed by a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 75, 6, 32, 'demon while in a temple some years earlier, and had then become a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 75, 7, 32, 'Christian and joined the Bible-college (at which I had spoken). He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 75, 8, 32, 'identified himself as the student who had stood up at that meeting and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 75, 9, 32, 'then wrote, "I sat down when you told me to sit down"! I was amazed to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 75, 10, 32, 'read that sentence - because his ears certainly did not hear my whisper');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 75, 11, 32, 'that day, for he was too far away. But the demon within him had heard my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 75, 12, 32, 'words - and obeyed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 75, 13, 32, 'The Lord taught me two lessons that day about demons. First of all, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 75, 14, 32, 'demons have very good hearing and so we don''t have to shout at them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 75, 15, 32, '(like many people do) when casting them out! Secondly, that if our life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 75, 16, 32, 'is clean and we have faith in Christ''s victory over Satan at the cross,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 75, 17, 32, 'we need command the demons just once - and they will leave immediately.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 75, 18, 32, 'One does not have to keep on commanding them (as many people do). Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 75, 19, 32, 'cast out demons with a single sentence: "When He spoke a single word,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 75, 20, 32, 'all the demons fled" (Matthew 8:16 - TLB). If demons do not leave after');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 75, 21, 32, 'a single command of ours, it would indicate that our faith is weak. Then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 75, 22, 32, 'we need to go away and fast and pray first (Matthew 17:21).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 75, 23, 32, 'On another occasion, a sister from our church brought a lady to my home');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 75, 24, 32, 'for prayer because she was having some problems. My wife and I spoke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 75, 25, 32, 'with the lady and then I asked her to repent of her sins and to receive');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 75, 26, 32, 'Jesus as her Saviour. I also asked her to speak to Satan and tell him,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 75, 27, 32, '"I don''t belong to you now. Jesus defeated you on the cross". (I ask all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 75, 28, 32, 'who want to be saved to say this to Satan). All of a sudden, she');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 76, 1, 32, 'contorted her face, and looked at me fiercely and changed her voice and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 76, 2, 32, 'said, "I was not defeated on the cross". Until then I had not even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 76, 3, 32, 'suspected that she had a demon, for she had spoken to us gently. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 76, 4, 32, 'when I realized that a demon was there, I immediately said to the demon,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 76, 5, 32, '"You are a liar. You were defeated on the cross. Get out of her in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 76, 6, 32, 'Jesus'' Name." The demon left immediately. I knew that it had left,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 76, 7, 32, 'because when I asked the lady a second time to say the same words to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 76, 8, 32, 'Satan, she said it immediately, without any hesitation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 76, 9, 32, 'That day I learnt a third lesson about Satan and demons - that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 76, 10, 32, 'don''t like to be reminded that they were defeated on the cross. So I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 76, 11, 32, 'decided thereafter, that I would remind Satan frequently that Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 76, 12, 32, 'defeated him on the cross. I also decided to teach this glorious truth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 76, 13, 32, 'to all believers. (We have to speak these words to Satan, since he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 76, 14, 32, 'cannot hear our thoughts or what we say in our mind.) It is because many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 76, 15, 32, 'Christians either don''t know, or don''t believe, in Satan''s total defeat');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 76, 16, 32, 'on the cross (as written in Colossians 2:15 & Hebrews 2:14) that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 76, 17, 32, 'live in fear of him and are afraid that he might harm them in some way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 76, 18, 32, 'The Lord also gave me dreams now and then - dreams in which I saw myself');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 76, 19, 32, 'facing demon-possessed people and casting out the demons from them. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 76, 20, 32, 'also saw dreams where Satan came as a snake or a scorpion etc., to me,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 76, 21, 32, 'but was unable to harm me, even when those creatures touched my body.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 76, 22, 32, 'Jesus told His disciples, "I give you authority, so that you can walk on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 76, 23, 32, 'snakes and scorpions and overcome all the power of the enemy, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 76, 24, 32, 'nothing will hurt you" (Luke 10:19 - TEV). An interesting feature of all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 76, 25, 32, 'these dreams was that I never had a moment of fear - either during the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 76, 26, 32, 'dream or thereafter. Thus, the Lord taught me that I could face Satan');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 76, 27, 32, 'fearlessly at all times - exactly as Jesus Himself had faced him on this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 76, 28, 32, 'earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 77, 1, 32, 'Greater is He Who is in you than he who is in the world - (Satan).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 77, 2, 32, 'Praise the Lord!!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 77, 3, 33, 'Chapter 32 Early Days Of Meeting And Outreach');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 77, 4, 33, 'From the outset (August 1975), we met together three or four times each');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 77, 5, 33, 'week as a church in our home. We did not know what God had in store for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 77, 6, 33, 'us in the future. We were all poor families struggling to make ends');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 77, 7, 33, 'meet. I was the only one who had a scooter. The others had only bicycles');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 77, 8, 33, 'or nothing. And I was also the only one who had a telephone (and that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 77, 9, 33, 'too was allotted to us only because Annie was a doctor). But we had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 77, 10, 33, 'great fellowship with each other and we discovered as a church what it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 77, 11, 33, 'meant to be a family.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 77, 12, 33, 'Annie and I had three boys (aged 6 years, 2 years, and 8 months) when we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 77, 13, 33, 'started meeting as a church in our home. Our fourth son was born 3 years');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 77, 14, 33, 'later. Our children enjoyed arranging the chairs for the meetings, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 77, 15, 33, 'fellowshipping with the young brothers who often ate with us and stayed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 77, 16, 33, 'overnight in our home. We cared for one another in the church and we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 77, 17, 33, 'used to meet someone from the church almost every day. If anyone was in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 77, 18, 33, 'any need, we would all pitch in and help that person or family. When any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 77, 19, 33, 'family had to move to a new rented house, all of us men would go and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 77, 20, 33, 'help them to shift. I was less than 40 years old in those days and I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 77, 21, 33, 'could do many things then that I can''t do today. I remember carrying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 77, 22, 33, 'cupboards down the stairs and scrubbing the floors and cleaning the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 77, 23, 33, 'toilets in the houses of many of my fellow-believers. Some joined us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 77, 24, 33, 'only to take advantage of our goodness and our generosity and we were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 77, 25, 33, 'cheated by a few. But we have no regrets about that today, because we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 77, 26, 33, 'acted in goodness and love to them. And we learnt from our mistakes. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 77, 27, 33, 'continued to emphasize discipleship and the way of the cross. As a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 77, 28, 33, 'result, over a period of time, those who were not gripped by this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 78, 1, 33, 'message dropped away from our midst.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 78, 2, 33, 'We soon felt a burden to share these wonderful truths that had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 78, 3, 33, 'transformed our own lives with others in India. So in January 1977, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 78, 4, 33, 'started an 8-page monthly paper containing the message of the overcoming');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 78, 5, 33, 'life. I used to type the articles on my old typewriter, correct them,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 78, 6, 33, 'retype them and then give the paper to the printer to set up. We did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 78, 7, 33, 'have much money. So we had to use a cheap print-shop that had only a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 78, 8, 33, '"letter press" (with lead types), where they set up the paper, one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 78, 9, 33, 'alphabet at a time!! After a few days, the first proof would be ready');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 78, 10, 33, 'and I would go and pick it up from the printer and check through it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 78, 11, 33, 'There would be numerous mistakes to correct. I would give it back to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 78, 12, 33, 'printer who would correct those mistakes and give it back to me to check');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 78, 13, 33, 'once again. I would check through it again before the final copy was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 78, 14, 33, 'printed. At times, in spite of my checking through the final copy three');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 78, 15, 33, 'or four times, the "printer''s devil" would still be active. In one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 78, 16, 33, 'issue, the words "We should never be anxious", lost one letter and came');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 78, 17, 33, 'out as "We should ever be anxious"!! So some of us sat down and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 78, 18, 33, 'corrected all the printed copies by hand! Over the next few years, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 78, 19, 33, 'gradually built up a mailing list of about 600 addresses. Each month,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 78, 20, 33, 'some of our church-members would gather together on a Sunday and put the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 78, 21, 33, 'paper into envelopes for mailing. One by-product of doing it this way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 78, 22, 33, 'was that it built fellowship between ourselves.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 78, 23, 33, 'We also taped each message that was preached - primarily for the benefit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 78, 24, 33, 'of those in our church who wanted to listen to the message a second time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 78, 25, 33, 'or who wanted to give a copy of it to someone else. Little by little, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 78, 26, 33, 'built up a small library of tapes. To make these copies, I would connect');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 78, 27, 33, 'two tape-recorders together and copy one side of the tape first, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 78, 28, 33, 'then turn the tape over to copy the other side. It would take me 90');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 79, 1, 33, 'minutes to copy one tape!! Sometimes people from other places in India');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 79, 2, 33, 'who had heard about us, would ask for a tape. I would then copy a tape,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 79, 3, 33, 'pack it and go to the post office and mail it. We did not have many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 79, 4, 33, 'requests for tapes those days. So I was able to do this all by myself.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 79, 5, 33, 'The requests for tapes increased slowly - and I was kept quite busy.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 79, 6, 33, 'But God in His foreknowledge, saw that the requests for our tapes would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 79, 7, 33, 'increase enormously in the coming days. And He had a pleasant surprise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 79, 8, 33, 'in store for us, for He "silently plans for us in love" at all times');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 79, 9, 33, '(Zephaniah 3:17 - paraphrase). A family in Germany (whom I had never met');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 79, 10, 33, 'or corresponded with) had got a copy of a tape of mine from someone and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 79, 11, 33, 'heard it and passed it on to others. Because they were all blessed by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 79, 12, 33, 'what they heard, they wrote to me saying that they were led by the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 79, 13, 33, 'to mail us a fast tape-copier. I never even knew that such a machine');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 79, 14, 33, 'existed! When the machine arrived, the postal customs officials made an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 79, 15, 33, 'unreasonable and exorbitant demand for customs duty. They probably');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 79, 16, 33, 'wanted a bribe, which I would not give. So I prayed to the Lord for help');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 79, 17, 33, 'and went and met the senior-most officer in the department. She happened');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 79, 18, 33, 'to be a Christian who had read my books and knew my name, even though we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 79, 19, 33, 'had never met before. I told her that I was willing to pay the legal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 79, 20, 33, 'customs duty on the item - whatever it was. I just didn''t want to pay a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 79, 21, 33, 'bribe or to be unnecessarily harassed. So she spoke to the official');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 79, 22, 33, 'concerned immediately. Thus I got the parcel, after paying just the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 79, 23, 33, 'legal amount of customs duty and without being harassed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 79, 24, 33, 'This machine could copy a tape in 3 minutes. That saved me 87 minutes on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 79, 25, 33, 'every single tape I copied!! The demand for tapes increased by leaps and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 79, 26, 33, 'bounds, shortly thereafter and we copied thousands of tapes on that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 79, 27, 33, 'machine in the ensuing years. How good God was to prompt someone to give');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 79, 28, 33, 'us that gift at just the right time. We have always believed that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 80, 1, 33, 'should never make our needs known to anyone but God. This was yet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 80, 2, 33, 'another proof of His loving provision and care for us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 80, 3, 33, 'We made a decision right at the beginning, that all our literature and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 80, 4, 33, 'tapes would be given out at the lowest possible cost, without our making');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 80, 5, 33, 'any profit on them. No royalties would be paid to me for any book or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 80, 6, 33, 'tape of mine that the church published. And we have stuck to that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 80, 7, 33, 'principle all these years.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 80, 8, 33, 'Over 200,000 tapes of sermons have now (upto 2007) been distributed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 80, 9, 33, 'around the world in many languages - not only by our church but also by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 80, 10, 33, 'many other individuals and churches. These messages are now going out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 80, 11, 33, 'through CDs and DVDs as well - and also being downloaded freely from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 80, 12, 33, 'Internet every day. Thus the new-covenant message has gone to all five');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 80, 13, 33, 'continents from our small church. We rejoice that people are being');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 80, 14, 33, 'challenged to live an overcoming life, all over the world.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 80, 15, 33, 'We give all the glory to God for what He has done!! When we honour Him,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 80, 16, 33, 'He honours us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 80, 17, 33, 'Praise the Lord!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 80, 18, 34, 'Chapter 33 A Meeting Place');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 80, 19, 34, 'Over a period of four years (1975-1979), the church meeting in our house');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 80, 20, 34, 'increased in numbers. Some who came were really sincere and eager to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 80, 21, 34, 'disciples of Jesus. But others came because they were attracted by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 80, 22, 34, 'novelty of joining new group!! We received everyone and left it to God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 80, 23, 34, 'to filter out the chaff in His own time. The rooms in our house were all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 80, 24, 34, 'small and people sat in four rooms on Sundays, with the speaker standing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 80, 25, 34, 'in a central place from where most people could see him!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 80, 26, 34, 'From the very first year, we arranged 4-day conferences in our house,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 80, 27, 34, 'during the holiday season in October, every year. Some who had been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 80, 28, 34, 'blessed by our literature in other parts of India, also attended these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 81, 1, 34, 'conferences. We offered food and accommodation freely to everyone who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 81, 2, 34, 'came and even helped some who were poor with their train-fare. We cooked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 81, 3, 34, 'the food in the backyard of my house. The brothers slept on the floor in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 81, 4, 34, 'the front room of our house at night. We never took any offerings at any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 81, 5, 34, 'time - not even during the conferences. We kept an offering box at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 81, 6, 34, 'entrance for any who wanted to give - secretly and cheerfully. And God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 81, 7, 34, 'provided all our needs. We have followed this policy for 50 years now -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 81, 8, 34, 'and have found that all our needs have always been met. We have never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 81, 9, 34, 'had to borrow money and we''ve never been in debt. God has honoured this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 81, 10, 34, 'policy of ours, as we have sought to honour Him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 81, 11, 34, 'With the increasing numbers coming to our Sunday meetings, we realized');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 81, 12, 34, 'that soon we would not all fit into our house. At the same time we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 81, 13, 34, 'didn''t have the money to buy land anywhere nearby. So we started looking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 81, 14, 34, 'for land that was cheaper, outside the city limits. But we could not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 81, 15, 34, 'find any place there either, that we could afford.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 81, 16, 34, 'Then the Lord did something wonderful for us. My father had purchased a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 81, 17, 34, 'piece of land close to our house and paid the initial down-payment (20%)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 81, 18, 34, 'for it. He had planned to sell his house in Madras and build a house for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 81, 19, 34, 'himself in Bangalore. But he suddenly developed asthma while in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 81, 20, 34, 'Bangalore, and realized that the climate here would not suit him and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 81, 21, 34, 'that the Lord was thus stopping him from moving to Bangalore. So he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 81, 22, 34, 'decided to sell the land. Many were keen on buying it from him, for it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 81, 23, 34, 'was located in a prime area and its value had gone up. But my father');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 81, 24, 34, 'decided to gift the land to our church. (We would have to pay only the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 81, 25, 34, 'balance of the money due and the registration charge).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 81, 26, 34, 'But we had only 50% of the money required for this in our account - and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 81, 27, 34, 'that was what we had saved up in 4 years!! We decided that we would not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 81, 28, 34, 'tell anyone about our needs - not even others in the church, for all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 82, 1, 34, 'brothers were relatively poor, and we did not want anyone sacrificing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 82, 2, 34, 'and giving us their life''s savings. We prayed and told the Lord that if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 82, 3, 34, 'this was the place He had chosen for us, then He must give us the money,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 82, 4, 34, 'without our mentioning our need to anyone.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 82, 5, 34, 'We had to register the land by a certain date - the final date that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 82, 6, 34, 'original owner had set for my father to pay the balance amount, for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 82, 7, 34, 'transfer of the property. Just a few days before this deadline, we got a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 82, 8, 34, 'cheque in the mail. It was sent by a person whom none of us had ever met');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 82, 9, 34, 'or heard of. So he could not possibly have known of our need either. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 82, 10, 34, 'had obtained our address from somewhere. And amazingly, the amount of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 82, 11, 34, 'the cheque was the exact amount that we had needed to complete the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 82, 12, 34, 'land-transaction!! We have never met this donor to this day - and he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 82, 13, 34, 'never sent us any money again, after this one time!! It was obvious to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 82, 14, 34, 'us that God had prompted him to help us. Many would call such events as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 82, 15, 34, '"coincidences". But for us, it was the perfect provision of our loving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 82, 16, 34, 'Father in heaven, confirming to us that the purchase of this land was in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 82, 17, 34, 'His perfect will.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 82, 18, 34, 'We registered the land in the name of "Christian Fellowship Centre". We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 82, 19, 34, 'now needed to build a meeting-hall on it. Again we decided that we would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 82, 20, 34, 'not mention our need to anyone. Little by little over the next two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 82, 21, 34, 'years, money trickled in - from our offering box and from here and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 82, 22, 34, 'there.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 82, 23, 34, 'Then we faced another problem. There was a shortage of cement in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 82, 24, 34, 'country at that time, and a permit had to be obtained from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 82, 25, 34, 'Government to buy cement - 50 bags at a time. We applied for the cement');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 82, 26, 34, 'and I went and saw the clerk in the State government-office for our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 82, 27, 34, 'first permit. He told me to come back the next week. I went back the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 82, 28, 34, 'next week and he told me to come back later. This went on for sometime,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 83, 1, 34, 'until someone who was wiser to the ways of government-offices told me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 83, 2, 34, 'that this was the clerk''s way of asking for a bribe! So we prayed. I met');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 83, 3, 34, 'the Director in the department and kept going back to the office - and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 83, 4, 34, 'acquired a lot of patience thereby! Finally, after many weeks, we got');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 83, 5, 34, 'our first permit. I had applied only for cement. But I got patience as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 83, 6, 34, 'well in the process! God always give us more than we ask for!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 83, 7, 34, 'God used a corrupt official to enable me to partake of the Divine nature');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 83, 8, 34, '- patience! If I had given him a bribe, I would have got the cement');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 83, 9, 34, 'earlier. But I would not have got the patience. God then answered our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 83, 10, 34, 'prayers even more than we had expected. Soon, cement became plentifully');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 83, 11, 34, 'available in India, and the government cancelled the requirement for a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 83, 12, 34, 'permit. Then we could buy all the cement we wanted from the market.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 83, 13, 34, 'We completed the meeting-hall and had our first meeting there in October');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 83, 14, 34, '1981. We arranged a conference also that month - and this time more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 83, 15, 34, 'people came than ever before. God had known that larger numbers would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 83, 16, 34, 'soon start attending our conferences. Seeing that need much before we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 83, 17, 34, 'saw it, He gave us a meeting-hall just in time - just as He gave us many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 83, 18, 34, 'other things, before the need for them arose.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 83, 19, 34, 'God had silently planned for us in love once again - and He continues to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 83, 20, 34, 'do so even today (Zephaniah 3:17)!!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 83, 21, 35, 'Chapter 34 Reaching Out To Other Places');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 83, 22, 35, 'For seven years we did not do any outreach as a church in Bangalore. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 83, 23, 35, 'kept us concentrating on ourselves alone. This may have looked very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 83, 24, 35, 'introverted and selfish to others who observed us, but God knew what He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 83, 25, 35, 'was doing. There is a time and a season for everything in the will of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 83, 26, 35, 'God. We can never build the church of Jesus Christ as and when we like.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 83, 27, 35, 'We have to wait for God''s time and must be led by His Spirit at each');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 83, 28, 35, 'step.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 84, 1, 35, 'God knew that our church needed to be built together as a family first,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 84, 2, 35, 'before we could invite others in India to "Come and see". Under the old');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 84, 3, 35, 'covenant, the emphasis was: "Come and hear". The old-covenant prophet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 84, 4, 35, 'would invite the Israelites to come and hear what God had told him. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 84, 5, 35, 'under the new covenant, the emphasis is on a visible manifestation of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 84, 6, 35, 'the life of Christ through a local body of believers, and not just on a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 84, 7, 35, 'spoken message. Jesus said that all men would know that we are Christ''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 84, 8, 35, 'disciples, when they see our love for one another and not just when they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 84, 9, 35, 'hear us preach (John 13:35).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 84, 10, 35, 'And so God built something into us as a church during those first seven');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 84, 11, 35, 'years (1975 to 1982). He worked a deep work within many of us and taught');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 84, 12, 35, 'us the way of the cross and thus we learnt to love one another.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 84, 13, 35, 'Thereafter, He opened one door after another for us to reach out to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 84, 14, 35, 'other parts of India - and finally to the rest of the world. God''s way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 84, 15, 35, 'is always the best way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 84, 16, 35, 'In 1980, I was invited to speak for 3 days at the annual convention of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 84, 17, 35, 'the largest Pentecostal denomination in India. There must have been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 84, 18, 35, '12,000 people at that convention. I told them that the burden the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 84, 19, 35, 'had laid on my heart was to speak, not to the laymen, but to their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 84, 20, 35, 'pastors and leaders (many of whom were sitting on the platform). I spoke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 84, 21, 35, 'for two days on being righteous in the use of money in Christian work.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 84, 22, 35, 'On the third morning the senior pastors sent me a message saying that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 84, 23, 35, 'they did not want me to preach again. Many of them were offended by my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 84, 24, 35, 'plain speaking. I accepted their decision joyfully, for I felt that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 84, 25, 35, 'Lord must have finished saying whatever He wanted to say in two days -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 84, 26, 35, 'and there was nothing more to be said.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 84, 27, 35, 'After the convention was over I had to go to another place in Kerala.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 84, 28, 35, 'The convention''s organizers could easily have taken me there in one of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 85, 1, 35, 'their cars - but they did not. So I carried my bag and went to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 85, 2, 35, 'bus-stop and looked for a bus that could take me there. I was not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 85, 3, 35, 'familiar with the bus routes in those parts and ended up boarding the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 85, 4, 35, 'wrong bus. I discovered my mistake only after I had travelled for some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 85, 5, 35, 'distance. So I got down from that bus and got into another bus. But the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 85, 6, 35, 'Lord had planned all this with a purpose. The second bus was packed with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 85, 7, 35, 'people and I had to stand. But right in front of me stood a young');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 85, 8, 35, 'brother who was also returning from the same convention. We talked with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 85, 9, 35, 'each other for just about ten minutes and then he had to get off. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 85, 10, 35, 'that encounter was the beginning of a relationship that has lasted until');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 85, 11, 35, 'today. He told me later how he was seeking desperately for a victorious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 85, 12, 35, 'life at that time and was sure that it was God Who had sent me across');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 85, 13, 35, 'his path that day.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 85, 14, 35, 'God used this brother later to open the door for a church to be started');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 85, 15, 35, 'at Kottayam - and from there to many other parts of Kerala. I saw that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 85, 16, 35, 'God had sent me there primarily to meet this one brother and not to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 85, 17, 35, 'speak to 12,000 people. How good it was that the convention''s organizers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 85, 18, 35, 'did not take me by car that day. How good it was that I got into the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 85, 19, 35, 'wrong bus. If it were not for these events, I might have missed meeting');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 85, 20, 35, 'this dear brother altogether. And how good it was that when I met him, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 85, 21, 35, 'was not in a bad mood for the insults and inconveniences I had faced,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 85, 22, 35, 'but in a spirit of thanksgiving for God''s sovereignty. God plans all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 85, 23, 35, 'things perfectly and so we can give him thanks - for all things at all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 85, 24, 35, 'times!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 85, 25, 35, 'In early 1983, this brother invited me to take special meetings for a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 85, 26, 35, 'small church of about 50 people that he was attending in Kottayam. I had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 85, 27, 35, 'also received an invitation to be the main speaker at the annual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 85, 28, 35, 'convention of another large Pentecostal denomination where many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 86, 1, 35, 'thousands would be present - at the very same time. I prayed about these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 86, 2, 35, 'two invitations and felt led by the Lord to turn down the invitation to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 86, 3, 35, 'the large convention and to go instead to the small church. That one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 86, 4, 35, 'decision had far-reaching consequences. A handful of people in this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 86, 5, 35, 'small church were gripped by the truths of the new covenant and decided');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 86, 6, 35, 'to pull out of their denomination and to gather separately. That was the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 86, 7, 35, 'beginning of our work in Kerala. As in Jesus'' time, even so today, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 86, 8, 35, 'Lord is looking, not for large crowds, but for wholehearted disciples.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 86, 9, 35, 'In the same year (early 1983), God opened the doors to Tamilnadu as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 86, 10, 35, 'well. In May 1982 I had been invited to speak at a denominational');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 86, 11, 35, 'convention in Madras. A pastor who heard me there invited me to speak at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 86, 12, 35, 'some special meetings in Madurai. Some born-again young men (who were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 86, 13, 35, 'members of a large denomination in Tuticorin) came to attend those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 86, 14, 35, 'meetings. They were gripped by what they heard. But they did not have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 86, 15, 35, 'the money or the influence to organize a meeting for me in their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 86, 16, 35, 'hometown. But, in the providence of God, someone who was working in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 86, 17, 35, 'another organization arranged a series of public meetings for me in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 86, 18, 35, 'Tuticorin. A number of pastors from the city were present at the very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 86, 19, 35, 'first meeting. But by the end of the very first meeting, they were all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 86, 20, 35, 'offended by my message and never came back. Interestingly, the organizer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 86, 21, 35, 'of the special meetings also got offended and disappeared!!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 86, 22, 35, 'So these young men (who had heard me in Madurai) took over the meetings');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 86, 23, 35, 'and led the singing - and I spoke. I was impressed by the zeal of these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 86, 24, 35, 'young men and met with them privately later. We spent many hours talking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 86, 25, 35, 'together late into the night - past midnight. Then I realized that all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 86, 26, 35, 'the preceding events had been planned by God only to enable me to meet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 86, 27, 35, 'with this group of young men. Later in June 1983, these young men');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 86, 28, 35, 'decided to leave their denomination and started meeting together');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 87, 1, 35, 'separately as a church. They invited me to come and guide them and thus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 87, 2, 35, 'we had our first church conference in Tuticorin in 1983. How good it was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 87, 3, 35, 'that the organizer of the Tuticorin meetings got offended and left me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 87, 4, 35, 'with these fine young men. The ways of God are truly amazing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 87, 5, 35, 'A few weeks later we had some special meetings in Thanjavur and there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 87, 6, 35, 'too, I met some brothers who were gripped by the message of victory over');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 87, 7, 35, 'sin. These meetings opened many doors in Tamilnadu and very soon a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 87, 8, 35, 'number of local churches were planted all over the State.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 87, 9, 35, 'We never did any of this according to our own wisdom or our own plans.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 87, 10, 35, 'God planned and executed His work in His own sovereign way. We just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 87, 11, 35, 'followed "the pillar of cloud" as God led us from one place to another!!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 87, 12, 35, 'Praise the Lord!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 87, 13, 36, 'Chapter 35 Delivering People Oppressed By The Devil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 87, 14, 36, '"God anointed Jesus of Nazareth with the Holy Spirit and with power, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 87, 15, 36, 'He went about doing good and healing all who were oppressed by the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 87, 16, 36, 'devil, for God was with Him." (Acts 10:38).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 87, 17, 36, 'Jesus'' example mentioned here, indicates that those who are anointed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 87, 18, 36, 'will have the power of God (see Acts 1:8) and the presence of God with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 87, 19, 36, 'them. As a result they will go about doing good and delivering people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 87, 20, 36, 'from the oppression of Satan.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 87, 21, 36, 'Delivering people from Satan''s oppression is one of the main ministries');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 87, 22, 36, 'that we have as new-covenant servants. Those under the old covenant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 87, 23, 36, 'could not do this, because Satan had not been defeated in those days.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 87, 24, 36, 'But now that Satan has been defeated on the cross, he has no more power');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 87, 25, 36, 'over any child of God who walks in the light. This was one of the great');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 87, 26, 36, 'truths that the Lord taught me and that He wanted me to proclaim to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 87, 27, 36, 'believers everywhere. He gave me some experiences to prove this too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 87, 28, 36, 'There was a house close to ours in which an aged man was sick. To cure');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 88, 1, 36, 'him they got a witch-doctor who spent some weeks, concocting some potion');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 88, 2, 36, 'in a pot openly in their garage. One morning, we found a small pot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 88, 3, 36, 'containing something, lying inside our compound. We had heard that witch');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 88, 4, 36, 'doctors try to transfer a sickness from one house to another in this way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 88, 5, 36, '- and therefore, many people are afraid even to touch such a pot,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 88, 6, 36, 'fearing that some harm will come to them. But for us, this was a great');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 88, 7, 36, 'opportunity to teach our children the impotence of Satan against God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 88, 8, 36, 'children. So we just picked up the pot and threw it away. And we taught');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 88, 9, 36, 'our children that we need never fear Satan - for he cannot touch us, if');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 88, 10, 36, 'we walk in the light. No harm came to us. But the old man in that house');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 88, 11, 36, 'died. But I gave him the gospel before he died. No weapon formed against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 88, 12, 36, 'us can ever prosper (Isaiah 54:17).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 88, 13, 36, 'Demon-possessed people used to be brought to our house at times for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 88, 14, 36, 'deliverance. Some Christians warned us that we should not cast out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 88, 15, 36, 'demons inside our home, since we had small children in our home. But we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 88, 16, 36, 'had no such fear - for Satan is a defeated enemy. Our calling was to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 88, 17, 36, 'what Jesus did - to deliver people from Satan''s oppression everywhere.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 88, 18, 36, 'God Himself would protect our children. So we continued to cast out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 88, 19, 36, 'demons in our house. And neither we nor our children ever had any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 88, 20, 36, 'problem at any time. It only increased their faith in the power of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 88, 21, 36, 'Once at the end of a conference, someone brought a young girl to me for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 88, 22, 36, 'prayer. As I was talking to her asking her to give her life to the Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 88, 23, 36, 'she turned around to me suddenly, changed her voice and said, "I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 88, 24, 36, 'been here for so long and are you trying to cast me out?" I was taken');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 88, 25, 36, 'aback for a moment by these words. But I knew then that she was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 88, 26, 36, 'possessed by a demon. I prayed in tongues (softly, under my breath) to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 88, 27, 36, 'build up my faith in the Lord''s power and then commanded the demon to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 88, 28, 36, 'leave, in Jesus'' Name. Since I had to rush away to catch a bus, I asked');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 89, 1, 36, 'the local elders there to check that the demon had indeed left her. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 89, 2, 36, 'met the girl later and found that she had been totally freed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 89, 3, 36, 'We had two occasions when demon-possessed people came right into our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 89, 4, 36, 'church-building in Bangalore, while a meeting was going on. On one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 89, 5, 36, 'occasion, as we began our afternoon session at a conference, a man came');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 89, 6, 36, 'crawling up one of the aisles, like a snake, to the front of the hall. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 89, 7, 36, 'had just begun the Bible-study and didn''t want Satan to disturb the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 89, 8, 36, 'study with any side-issues. So I commanded the demon in Jesus'' Name, to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 89, 9, 36, 'lie down where he was. The man went to sleep immediately on the spot. As');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 89, 10, 36, 'soon as the Bible-study was over and we had said the final Amen, the man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 89, 11, 36, 'woke up immediately. Then we counselled him.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 89, 12, 36, 'On another occasion, someone came to our church-hall, just as our Sunday');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 89, 13, 36, 'meeting was getting over and wanted to meet me. I told him to ask Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 89, 14, 36, 'to come into his life and to confess that Jesus Christ is Lord. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 89, 15, 36, 'shouted out in the presence of the whole church, "Jesus Christ is not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 89, 16, 36, 'Lord". Since he was a nominal Christian, I realized that this was not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 89, 17, 36, 'him speaking but a demon. I commanded the demon to leave him, in Jesus''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 89, 18, 36, 'Name. He suddenly took a karate position and then slid down to the floor');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 89, 19, 36, 'like a snake. That was the day I discovered that there were demonic');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 89, 20, 36, 'spirits behind martial arts like karate. I then picked him up and told');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 89, 21, 36, 'him to confess that Jesus Christ is Lord. He did so immediately, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 89, 22, 36, 'told us that the migraine he had been having until then was gone. These');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 89, 23, 36, 'two events strengthened the faith of many in our church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 89, 24, 36, 'In a public meeting in one part of India, many years ago, where 30,000');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 89, 25, 36, 'people were present, as I was speaking from the platform, a man in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 89, 26, 36, 'audience suddenly got up and started dancing in front of the platform. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 89, 27, 36, 'requested him to sit down - more than once. But he kept on dancing,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 89, 28, 36, 'distracting the people. I then realized that this was a demon. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 90, 1, 36, 'commanded him in Jesus'' Name to sit down - and he sat down immediately.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 90, 2, 36, 'There is tremendous power in the Name of Jesus. Demons tremble at that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 90, 3, 36, 'Name and they have to obey instantly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 90, 4, 36, 'In the USA, a young lady was once brought to me for counselling at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 90, 5, 36, 'end of a meeting. I was surprised to see her dressed in very dirty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 90, 6, 36, 'clothes - because that was not the way young American ladies dressed. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 90, 7, 36, 'shared the gospel with her and asked her to repeat the sinner''s prayer');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 90, 8, 36, 'after me, to receive Christ as her Saviour. When I came to the Name of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 90, 9, 36, 'Jesus in the prayer, she was silent. She said she could not say that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 90, 10, 36, 'Name. Only then did I realize that she had a demon. I commanded the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 90, 11, 36, 'demon to leave her and she was delivered immediately. Then I commanded');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 90, 12, 36, 'her in Jesus Name to call upon the Name of Jesus. She did so immediately');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 90, 13, 36, 'and was saved. The transformation in her appearance was so amazing, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 90, 14, 36, 'she was hardly recognizable when she came to the meetings the next');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 90, 15, 36, 'morning smartly dressed! What that dear young lady needed was not some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 90, 16, 36, 'psychiatric counselling but deliverance!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 90, 17, 36, 'I have said all this not to speak about what I have done, but so that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 90, 18, 36, 'believers everywhere might recognize that Christ has defeated Satan on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 90, 19, 36, 'the cross. This ministry of deliverance is being exercised not only by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 90, 20, 36, 'me, but by others in our churches too. Any child of God who walks in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 90, 21, 36, 'light and knows the authority there is in the Name of Jesus can cast out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 90, 22, 36, 'demons.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 90, 23, 36, 'The tragedy however has been that many who were delivered from demons');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 90, 24, 36, 'kept their house (heart) empty, and thus were exposed to more severe');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 90, 25, 36, 'demonic attacks later - exactly as Jesus warned in Matthew 12:43-45.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 90, 26, 36, 'However, some who were delivered have gone on to seek God earnestly, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 90, 27, 36, 'been filled with the Holy Spirit, and become disciples of Jesus. Some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 90, 28, 36, 'are now elders in our churches.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 91, 1, 36, 'Praise the Lord!!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 91, 2, 37, 'Chapter 36 Travelling Mercies');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 91, 3, 37, 'I have been in full-time service for the Lord for nearly 60 years now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 91, 4, 37, '(2025) and I have been travelling constantly. My wife (Annie) and I have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 91, 5, 37, 'travelled many hundreds of thousands of miles all over the world - by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 91, 6, 37, 'cycle, bullock-cart, moped, scooter, bus, auto-rickshaw, car, train,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 91, 7, 37, 'boat and aeroplane. I have been amazed at God''s goodness and protection');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 91, 8, 37, 'over us in all these years.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 91, 9, 37, 'By God''s grace, as far as I can remember, I have not missed a single');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 91, 10, 37, 'series of meetings (that I had committed myself to), in all these 60');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 91, 11, 37, 'years - whether due to sickness, or a missed bus, or a missed train, or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 91, 12, 37, 'a missed flight, or due to any other reason. This has been entirely as a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 91, 13, 37, 'result of God working on our behalf.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 91, 14, 37, 'I am 85 years old now and God has kept me in remarkably good health all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 91, 15, 37, 'these years. He equips our bodies in our mother''s womb itself with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 91, 16, 37, 'whatever abilities are required for the ministry He has planned for us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 91, 17, 37, 'Two very important requirements for those who travel constantly are the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 91, 18, 37, 'ability to sleep anywhere and to eat anything - and God equipped my body');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 91, 19, 37, 'with these two abilities when I was born. As a result, I am able to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 91, 20, 37, 'sleep anywhere even today - on a bed or on the floor, in a car or in a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 91, 21, 37, 'bus, in a train or on an aeroplane. He also equipped my body to eat any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 91, 22, 37, 'type of food - western, eastern or nothing (for a few days!!). This has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 91, 23, 37, 'made travelling to every part of the world much easier for me. I cannot');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 91, 24, 37, 'boast about this, for this is entirely God''s doing, in the way He made');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 91, 25, 37, 'my body. I only praise God for His goodness. The worst thing I have ever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 91, 26, 37, 'experienced in my body has been the loss of my voice on just two or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 91, 27, 37, 'three occasions, after much speaking.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 91, 28, 37, 'For nearly 40 years I went every year to Tuticorin, for the conferences');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 92, 1, 37, 'of our Tamilnadu churches in South India. For many years, no train');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 92, 2, 37, 'service was available to Tuticorin and I had to travel overnight by bus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 92, 3, 37, 'for 16 hours to get there. The roads had numerous potholes - which');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 92, 4, 37, 'ensured that we stayed awake most of the time!! By the time we reached');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 92, 5, 37, 'Tuticorin, the first session of the conference would already have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 92, 6, 37, 'started - and I would have to go straight to the meeting to preach God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 92, 7, 37, 'Word. I would then speak at 9 or 10 one-hour sessions during the next');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 92, 8, 37, 'three days; and immediately after the last meeting, catch the bus for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 92, 9, 37, 'the 16-hour journey back home. Yet by God''s grace, I have never fallen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 92, 10, 37, 'ill or lost my voice at any of those conferences in all those years.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 92, 11, 37, 'Travelling in India gives us some unforgettable experiences too! I had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 92, 12, 37, 'my pocket picked twice - once while travelling in a crowded bus in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 92, 13, 37, 'Madras and a second time when travelling in a crowded train in Bombay.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 92, 14, 37, 'My money was stolen, but not my joy - for I had ensured that my joy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 92, 15, 37, 'would always be in my heart and not in my wallet! I also prayed for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 92, 16, 37, 'two pickpockets. I am sure they needed someone to pray for them. Perhaps');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 92, 17, 37, 'that was why God allowed them to pick my pocket!! God allowed this to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 92, 18, 37, 'happen also to free me a little more from the love of money. God had to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 92, 19, 37, 'liberate me from being calculating in my attitude to money - so that I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 92, 20, 37, 'would not grieve over every rupee lost or rejoice over every rupee');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 92, 21, 37, 'gained! He wanted me to find my joy in Him - and in Him alone - a joy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 92, 22, 37, 'that could not be increased by any material gain or decreased by any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 92, 23, 37, 'material loss.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 92, 24, 37, 'In the early days of my ministry, I had to travel for many hours in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 92, 25, 37, 'crowded, unreserved train-compartments. Most of the time, the benches');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 92, 26, 37, 'would all be occupied and I would have to sit on the floor, or at times');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 92, 27, 37, 'stand for the entire length of the journey. The compartment would be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 92, 28, 37, 'packed with people and luggage from the starting station itself. Things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 93, 1, 37, 'would get worse at each station along the way, with more people and more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 93, 2, 37, 'luggage coming in - and the physical pressure on me would keep on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 93, 3, 37, 'increasing, as also the temptation to complain against the incoming');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 93, 4, 37, 'passengers. It was on one of these occasions that God gave me this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 93, 5, 37, 'revelation: "If I could become the size of an ant here, I would find no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 93, 6, 37, 'pressure on me at all. I find the pressure to be too much only because I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 93, 7, 37, 'am so big. An ant however would find this crowded compartment quite');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 93, 8, 37, 'spacious. There is a spiritual lesson here: If I am always small in my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 93, 9, 37, 'own eyes, I will be free from all pressure and tension and complaints');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 93, 10, 37, 'against others. Then I can always be at rest in God!" I found that I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 93, 11, 37, 'could learn something in every situation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 93, 12, 37, 'Once when I was travelling in an unreserved train-compartment, every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 93, 13, 37, 'bench was fully occupied. But I saw one man sitting cross-legged on one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 93, 14, 37, 'of the benches, occupying the space for two people. Since I had to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 93, 15, 37, 'travel all night on that train, I asked him if he could put his legs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 93, 16, 37, 'down, so that I could get a small space to sit. But he would not oblige.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 93, 17, 37, 'The others who were sitting on the bench sympathized with me and were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 93, 18, 37, 'ready to help me find space to sit; but this man would not move an inch.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 93, 19, 37, 'I prayed then that the Lord would fill his bladder so that he would have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 93, 20, 37, 'to go to the toilet. Within five minutes he got up and went to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 93, 21, 37, 'toilet!! The others on the bench quickly moved over and filled up the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 93, 22, 37, 'extra space that he had been occupying and gave me space to sit down.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 93, 23, 37, 'In many overnight trains in India, reservations have to be made many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 93, 24, 37, 'days earlier (usually 60 days before the journey), to get a sleeping');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 93, 25, 37, 'berth. Once I was invited to a certain place in South India for meetings');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 93, 26, 37, 'and this required an overnight train journey. So, 60 days earlier, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 93, 27, 37, 'asked the brother (who had invited me) to book a sleeping-berth for my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 93, 28, 37, 'return journey to Bangalore. But he forgot to do this and realized his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 94, 1, 37, 'mistake only when I reached his place for the meetings. He apologized');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 94, 2, 37, 'for his carelessness and sent someone immediately to the train-station,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 94, 3, 37, 'to book a berth for me. But I could get only a seat in the 2-tier');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 94, 4, 37, 'compartment on the train. All the sleeping-berths had already been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 94, 5, 37, 'booked. When the meetings were over, I got into the train. I refused to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 94, 6, 37, 'complain but praised the Lord for giving me only a seat and not a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 94, 7, 37, 'sleeping-berth. Next to me sat an old Roman Catholic nun. She asked me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 94, 8, 37, 'if I could do her a favour. She had a sleeping berth on the top bunk,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 94, 9, 37, 'but said that she was too old to climb up to her berth. If I could take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 94, 10, 37, 'her berth, she could curl up and sleep on the lower seats. I told her');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 94, 11, 37, 'that I would be glad to help her in this way!! And thus I got a sleeping');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 94, 12, 37, 'berth for my journey back to Bangalore - and I didn''t even have to pay');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 94, 13, 37, 'for it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 94, 14, 37, 'Such incidents were not major earth-shaking events, but they showed me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 94, 15, 37, 'that my loving heavenly Father cared for even my smallest comforts, as I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 94, 16, 37, 'travelled in His service. God is good - all the time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 94, 17, 37, 'Praise the Lord!!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 94, 18, 38, 'Chapter 37 Planting Churches In Other Countries');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 94, 19, 38, 'Jesus told His disciples that when they were baptized in the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 94, 20, 38, 'Spirit, they would "receive power to be His witnesses in Jerusalem,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 94, 21, 38, 'Judea, Samaria and to the ends of the earth" (Acts 1:8). God does His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 94, 22, 38, 'work slowly and steadily - in ever increasing circles. I have found this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 94, 23, 38, 'to be true in my own ministry too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 94, 24, 38, 'We never planned to start a new church in Bangalore. That was entirely');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 94, 25, 38, 'God''s doing. And then, we never thought God would reach out through us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 94, 26, 38, 'to other parts of India. When we saw churches being planted in different');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 94, 27, 38, 'parts of India, we were thrilled. We then thought that our calling was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 94, 28, 38, 'only for India. But God had other plans for us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 95, 1, 38, 'One of the prayers that I have prayed for many years is this:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 95, 2, 38, 'As we have prayed this prayer, God has shown us many things that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 95, 3, 38, 'needed to set right in our church. One of the main things He showed us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 95, 4, 38, 'was the legalistic and unfriendly spirit that we had, that we needed to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 95, 5, 38, 'get rid of. As we started cleansing ourselves from this, the Lord began');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 95, 6, 38, 'to send hungry people to us - first from Bangalore, then from other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 95, 7, 38, 'parts of India and finally from different parts of the world. We did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 95, 8, 38, 'go looking for these people. God sent them to us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 95, 9, 38, 'Here are five examples of the planting of churches in some countries. (I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 95, 10, 38, 'have not mentioned the names of the people or of the countries - in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 95, 11, 38, 'order to preserve anonymity.)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 95, 12, 38, 'Foreign Country 1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 95, 13, 38, 'A young brother living in this country (but originally from India) came');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 95, 14, 38, 'to India to visit his relatives. While in Madras, a neighbour gave him a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 95, 15, 38, 'copy of the monthly paper that we were publishing, that contained an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 95, 16, 38, 'article of mine. He was challenged by what he read and decided to meet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 95, 17, 38, 'me when he visited Bangalore. I was not in town when he came home. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 95, 18, 38, 'he met Annie and took some of our books and returned to his homeland. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 95, 19, 38, 'was gripped by what he read and came back to India the next year and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 95, 20, 38, 'spent six weeks in Bangalore and fellowshipped with our church. When he');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 95, 21, 38, 'returned to his country, he looked for others who were interested in an');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 95, 22, 38, 'overcoming life - and found one or two. A few years later, he asked me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 95, 23, 38, 'if I would come to his country to meet with just the three of them. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 95, 24, 38, 'agreed and went and shared the Word with them. From that small');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 95, 25, 38, 'beginning, a church was born that is now an expression of Christ''s Body');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 95, 26, 38, 'in that city. I visited them many times for nearly 30 years and had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 95, 27, 38, 'conferences for the church as well as meetings for the public. The Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 95, 28, 38, 'has added some wonderful brothers and sisters to this church and also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 96, 1, 38, 'removed some who were not called to be with us. The brother who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 96, 2, 38, 'contacted us initially is now the elder leading this church. As a result');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 96, 3, 38, 'of visiting this church, God has given me openings to other cities in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 96, 4, 38, 'this country and this has resulted in many being gripped by the truth in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 96, 5, 38, 'those cities too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 96, 6, 38, 'Foreign Country 2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 96, 7, 38, 'In the early 1970s, when speaking at a conference in this country I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 96, 8, 38, 'visited a large church here and become acquainted with a brother. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 96, 9, 38, 'invited me to visit him any time I was passing through. Ten years later,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 96, 10, 38, 'I suddenly felt a burden to visit him - but I didn''t know why. I did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 96, 11, 38, 'have the money for my airfare. So I sold my moped (two-wheeler) and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 96, 12, 38, 'bought an air-ticket and travelled to this country. I arrived on a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 96, 13, 38, 'Saturday and this brother arranged for me to stay in the guest room of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 96, 14, 38, 'their church. On Sunday, the speaker who was supposed to speak at that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 96, 15, 38, 'church''s morning service had not arrived (because his flight had been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 96, 16, 38, 'delayed). The elders heard that I was in town and asked me to speak. God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 96, 17, 38, 'gave me a word for them and I had great liberty as I preached. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 96, 18, 38, 'meeting was so blessed that the elders asked me if I would speak again.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 96, 19, 38, 'I agreed - and they immediately arranged special meetings during the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 96, 20, 38, 'next three evenings. After each evening meeting, I spent many hours');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 96, 21, 38, 'talking to a number of the young brothers. Our talk-sessions would end');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 96, 22, 38, 'at 2 am in the morning - for those young men were all hungry to know the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 96, 23, 38, 'truth. Six months later, these young brothers left their church and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 96, 24, 38, 'started meeting together on their own. They invited me for their first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 96, 25, 38, 'church-conference. Thereafter I visited them every year for a number of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 96, 26, 38, 'conferences. Over time, as in every place, some brothers left the church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 96, 27, 38, 'and new brothers came to take their place. This has been God''s way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 96, 28, 38, 'everywhere.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 97, 1, 38, 'Foreign Country 3');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 97, 2, 38, 'A young Indian brother (originally working in another foreign country)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 97, 3, 38, 'heard some of my tapes on the new wine (Matthew 5, 6 & 7) and the new');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 97, 4, 38, 'wineskin (the new-covenant church). He repented, took baptism and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 97, 5, 38, 'decided to be a disciple. When he came to India on vacation, an Indian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 97, 6, 38, 'pastor told him that I was preaching false doctrines and warned him to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 97, 7, 38, 'avoid all contact with me. Wanting to find out the truth for himself,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 97, 8, 38, 'this brother came to Bangalore and spent some hours with me and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 97, 9, 38, 'discovered that the accusations he had heard were all false - based on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 97, 10, 38, 'ignorance and jealousy. Later he heard me at a public meeting and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 97, 11, 38, 'realized the importance of family life as a disciple. Since he could not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 97, 12, 38, 'take his family to the country where he was working, he resigned his job');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 97, 13, 38, 'there and returned to India, so that he could give priority to his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 97, 14, 38, 'family. The Lord honoured him and gave him a better job in this foreign');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 97, 15, 38, 'country, where he could take his family also with him. He stood for the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 97, 16, 38, 'truth and two other families joined him. (At the first conference we had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 97, 17, 38, 'here, we had 3 days of meetings for just these three families!!) A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 97, 18, 38, 'little later, the other two families got offended and left. But God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 97, 19, 38, 'brought in new families. Since then, I have visited them a number of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 97, 20, 38, 'times and the Lord has added many others. The church here has been used');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 97, 21, 38, 'by God for many years now to spread His Word through tapes and CDs to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 97, 22, 38, 'many thousands of people around the world.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 97, 23, 38, 'Foreign Country 4');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 97, 24, 38, 'Along with the above brother, there was yet another brother working in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 97, 25, 38, 'this country who also heard the same two tapes (mentioned above). He too');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 97, 26, 38, 'was gripped by the truth and broke away from the group he was with and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 97, 27, 38, 'decided to build a new-covenant church. I had the opportunity to visit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 97, 28, 38, 'this country too and we had a few conferences there for the local');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 98, 1, 38, 'church. As in other places, here too, God has added some people and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 98, 2, 38, 'removed some people through the years. But the church continues on.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 98, 3, 38, 'Foreign Country 5');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 98, 4, 38, 'I went to this country just for the purpose of meeting two young');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 98, 5, 38, 'brothers from India who had gone to work there. I had planned to stay');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 98, 6, 38, 'there only for a day or two. No meetings had been planned, for I knew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 98, 7, 38, 'no-one else there. But my departure was unexpectedly delayed for 4 or 5');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 98, 8, 38, 'days, because I could not get a visa for my onward travel to another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 98, 9, 38, 'country - because the immigration offices were all closed for 4 days of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 98, 10, 38, 'holidays. So I decided to have meetings here every day - morning,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 98, 11, 38, 'afternoon and evening. It was an unplanned conference - unplanned by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 98, 12, 38, 'men, but planned by God. God led us during that time to a wonderful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 98, 13, 38, 'brother who was seeking for a godly life. Now there is a flourishing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 98, 14, 38, 'church there under his leadership.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 98, 15, 38, 'Praise the Lord!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 98, 16, 38, 'The Lord is sovereign in the way He leads us in His work. All authority');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 98, 17, 38, 'in heaven and on earth is in His hands and that is why He has told us go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 98, 18, 38, 'to every land and make disciples - and He has promised to be with us as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 98, 19, 38, 'we go (Matthew 28:18-20). In the last 50 years, I have found that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 98, 20, 38, 'Lord has faithfully accompanied me everywhere I have gone to make');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 98, 21, 38, 'disciples. The most amazing thing of all is that He has raised up godly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 98, 22, 38, 'elders to lead His churches in all these countries.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 98, 23, 38, 'Praise the Lord!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 98, 24, 39, 'Chapter 38 No Dependence On The West');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 98, 25, 39, 'I had an encounter with a refined Hindu gentleman in Madras (in 1967),');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 98, 26, 39, 'that I have never forgotten. I was engaged in open-air evangelism and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 98, 27, 39, 'offered the gentleman a book written by an American Christian. He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 98, 28, 39, 'immediately asked me if I was a paid agent of America. I was shocked. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 99, 1, 39, 'was certainly no agent of any country, preacher or organization -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 99, 2, 39, 'Western or Indian. That man did not know that I had quit a well-paying');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 99, 3, 39, 'job in order to serve the Lord Jesus - and I was certainly not preaching');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 99, 4, 39, 'to earn my living!! But I realized that I was giving my countrymen a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 99, 5, 39, 'wrong impression when I promoted books written by Western Christians. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 99, 6, 39, 'is the impression we give to others that is ultimately our message. That');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 99, 7, 39, 'incident challenged me considerably and opened my eyes very early in my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 99, 8, 39, 'ministry as to how I was to serve the Lord in India.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 99, 9, 39, 'Most Indians feel that Christianity is a Western religion. They also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 99, 10, 39, 'feel that Christian workers in India are all paid agents of American');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 99, 11, 39, 'organizations, and preach only because they have to send reports to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 99, 12, 39, 'West, in order to get more dollars (or euros) so that they can live in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 99, 13, 39, 'luxury. So I felt I must do everything possible to remove this false');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 99, 14, 39, 'impression from the minds of my fellow-Indians - if my witness to them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 99, 15, 39, 'was to be effective. As Sadhu Sundar Singh once said, "We must give the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 99, 16, 39, 'water of life to our fellow-Indians in an Indian cup".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 99, 17, 39, 'For nearly 60 years now, I have had the opportunity to travel all over');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 99, 18, 39, 'India and to see the workings of many Christian organizations and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 99, 19, 39, 'churches (of many denominations). Here is what I have seen. (Please note');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 99, 20, 39, 'that I am not judging anyone and that this is only my personal opinion):');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 99, 21, 39, 'All these factors have compromised our witness as Indian Christians in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 99, 22, 39, 'India.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 99, 23, 39, 'Indian money is not holier than Western money. So anyone (Westerner or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 99, 24, 39, 'Indian) can support God''s work in India. But I felt that dependence on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 99, 25, 39, 'the West would present a wrong picture of Christianity to my countrymen.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 99, 26, 39, 'So when we started planting churches in India over 50 years ago, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 99, 27, 39, 'decided that, with God''s help, we would tread a different path: We would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 99, 28, 39, 'not be dependent on the West or on any man - either for our earthly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 100, 1, 39, 'needs or for our theology.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 100, 2, 39, 'I had decided when I left the Navy, that I would discipline myself never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 100, 3, 39, 'to receive more income than what I would have received if I had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 100, 4, 39, 'continued working in the Navy. I had also decided to live at a lower');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 100, 5, 39, 'standard always than what I had in the Navy - because Jesus lived at a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 100, 6, 39, 'lower standard on earth than what He had in heaven. I also decided never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 100, 7, 39, 'to accept gifts from anyone who earned less than what I did, or whose');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 100, 8, 39, 'standard of living was lower than mine - for this was the position that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 100, 9, 39, 'Jesus took too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 100, 10, 39, 'By the grace of God, I have never had to make my personal needs or the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 100, 11, 39, 'needs of my ministry known to any man thus far. My heavenly Father has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 100, 12, 39, 'always provided those needs in one way or the other. He has also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 100, 13, 39, 'sovereignly determined how much I should receive - and I have always');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 100, 14, 39, 'been happy with His decisions. The result has been that, like Jesus, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 100, 15, 39, 'too have never had to borrow money from anyone and I have never been in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 100, 16, 39, 'debt to anyone at any time. When preaching in churches in the West and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 100, 17, 39, 'in the rich Gulf countries, I have been introduced as "the one Indian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 100, 18, 39, 'preacher who never asks for any money either for himself or for his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 100, 19, 39, 'ministry". I am glad to have such a reputation - for that was Jesus''');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 100, 20, 39, 'attitude to money too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 100, 21, 39, 'I also decided that I would question every doctrine taught by men - even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 100, 22, 39, 'by the greatest of Bible-scholars - and accept only what I saw clearly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 100, 23, 39, 'in the Scriptures myself. So I rejected the blind following of Western');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 100, 24, 39, 'theology that was being practised by Indian Christians everywhere. Here');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 100, 25, 39, 'are three examples of what I have rejected:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 100, 26, 39, 'I decided to demonstrate to my countrymen that Christianity came to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 100, 27, 39, 'India from heaven and not from the West. I was convinced that the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 100, 28, 39, 'wanted me to have a clear, unequivocal testimony in this matter before');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 101, 1, 39, 'my fellow-Indians, if I was to be an effective witness for Him in India.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 101, 2, 39, 'I decided to be a living witness and demonstration to my fellow-Indians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 101, 3, 39, 'of the truth that if I sought God''s kingdom and His righteousness first,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 101, 4, 39, 'He would provide all my earthly needs.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 101, 5, 39, 'There must be no earthly explanation for the godliness of our life, or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 101, 6, 39, 'for the effectiveness of our ministry, or for the provision of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 101, 7, 39, 'earthly needs. The explanation must only be that our Father in heaven');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 101, 8, 39, 'supports us and provides all our needs - and not that we have contacts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 101, 9, 39, 'with some rich people in the West. Only thus will God alone get all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 101, 10, 39, 'glory from our lives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 101, 11, 39, 'May it be so with all of us. Amen');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 101, 12, 40, 'Chapter 39 Life At Home');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 101, 13, 40, 'The Bible says that if a man cannot run his home in a way that glorifies');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 101, 14, 40, 'God, he is unfit for any leadership or ministry in the church (1 Timothy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 101, 15, 40, '3:5). The church is God''s family. And our own family is the place where');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 101, 16, 40, 'God tests us to see whether we are fit for ministry in His church. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 101, 17, 40, 'have to build our own family in a godly way first, before we can build');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 101, 18, 40, 'God''s family.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 101, 19, 40, 'Since I was often travelling in the ministry, I sought God for wisdom to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 101, 20, 40, 'balance ministering to the needs of my family with ministering to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 101, 21, 40, 'needs of the church. I often wished in those days, that I had a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 101, 22, 40, 'spiritual father whom I could go to, for practical advice on such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 101, 23, 40, 'matters - but I had none. And so I made lots of mistakes - but I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 101, 24, 40, 'gradually learnt from my mistakes and thus acquired some wisdom.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 101, 25, 40, 'Since my income was small (from my "tentmaking" business), my wife had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 101, 26, 40, 'to be a woman of simple tastes, who was willing to live frugally and to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 101, 27, 40, 'work with her hands at home. She also had to be someone who enjoyed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 101, 28, 40, 'being hospitable, for we often had unexpected visitors in our home. How');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 102, 1, 40, 'thankful I am that God gave me exactly such a wife in Annie. God had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 102, 2, 40, 'prepared Annie from her youth to be the type of wife I needed in my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 102, 3, 40, 'ministry. And she has made my ministry so much richer and so much more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 102, 4, 40, 'effective. After the Sunday meetings, we would often invite people home');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 102, 5, 40, 'for lunch - especially those who had come from distant parts of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 102, 6, 40, 'Bangalore. I discovered later that Annie often went without lunch on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 102, 7, 40, 'many a Sunday, so as to feed those visitors!!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 102, 8, 40, 'Many young brothers used to stay in our house overnight after the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 102, 9, 40, 'evening meetings, because it was too late for them to go home. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 102, 10, 40, 'would have dinner with us and use our kitchen freely in the mornings to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 102, 11, 40, 'make coffee for themselves before going to college. We had a 4-day');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 102, 12, 40, 'conference in our home every year during the early years - and then the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 102, 13, 40, 'house would be filled with visitors throughout the day.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 102, 14, 40, 'Once I was away from home for ministry for five weeks. We had only three');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 102, 15, 40, 'boys then - and all of them fell sick at the same time. Annie prayed for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 102, 16, 40, 'them, took care of them, never burdened me with the problem and did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 102, 17, 40, 'even ask me to come home earlier to help her. When she married me, God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 102, 18, 40, 'had told her, "Your husband is My servant; and I have called you to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 102, 19, 40, 'support him, look after him and free him for My work." And Annie has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 102, 20, 40, 'done that job faithfully for nearly 56 years now.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 102, 21, 40, 'I didn''t have victory over my anger when I first got married. But things');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 102, 22, 40, 'changed after some years, by God''s grace. And now our home relationship');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 102, 23, 40, 'is glorious. Joking with each other every day is a major part of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 102, 24, 40, 'life together. I have believed for a long time that humour between');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 102, 25, 40, 'husband and wife is the clearest proof of a good relationship between');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 102, 26, 40, 'them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 102, 27, 40, 'Since I was travelling frequently, it was Annie who had the major');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 102, 28, 40, 'responsibility of bringing up our four sons in the ways of the Lord. She');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 103, 1, 40, 'prayed for them and with them constantly. From their childhood days, she');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 103, 2, 40, 'was their friend - talking with them when they came back from school');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 103, 3, 40, 'about their experiences during the day. And she would play with them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 103, 4, 40, 'too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 103, 5, 40, 'My task as a father was to provide for them and to instruct them in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 103, 6, 40, 'godly principles. I took them to school on my scooter - until they were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 103, 7, 40, '12, after which age, they started going by bicycles on their own. And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 103, 8, 40, 'God protected all of us from serious accidents on the roads more than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 103, 9, 40, 'once. All of us are alive today because the Lord sent His angels to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 103, 10, 40, 'protect us on Bangalore''s dangerous roads.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 103, 11, 40, 'I encouraged my boys in their education and also to participate in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 103, 12, 40, 'extra-curricular activities at school. Annie and I used to help them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 103, 13, 40, 'with their homework and studies (up to 10th Standard) - Annie much more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 103, 14, 40, 'than me.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 103, 15, 40, 'It was my responsibility to discipline my sons. I followed what was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 103, 16, 40, 'written in Proverbs (and in Hebrews 12), that children should be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 103, 17, 40, 'disciplined. And so I did that, even though I never relished doing it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 103, 18, 40, 'But I reverenced God and knew that His way was the best for my sons.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 103, 19, 40, 'After disciplining them, I would often pray with them. I knew that anger');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 103, 20, 40, 'was a sin, and so I wanted to discipline my children without anger. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 103, 21, 40, 'I didn''t manage that always. And so, whenever I disciplined them in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 103, 22, 40, 'anger, I would get alone with God and repent and ask God to free me from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 103, 23, 40, 'my anger. I must admit that at times, I punished them by mistake too,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 103, 24, 40, 'due to faulty information. If I remember right, I rarely ever');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 103, 25, 40, 'disciplined my boys physically, once they became 13 years of age and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 103, 26, 40, 'probably never after they crossed 15. After that age, if they did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 103, 27, 40, 'something wrong, I would pray with them and ask God to show me where I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 103, 28, 40, 'had failed as a father in bringing them up. And finally, I have to say');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 104, 1, 40, 'that it was not my discipline that kept them in God''s ways, but God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 104, 2, 40, 'mercy alone.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 104, 3, 40, 'If my sons had an event in which they were taking part, at school, Annie');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 104, 4, 40, 'and I would attend it, to encourage them. When they had important public');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 104, 5, 40, 'examinations, I would ensure that I was available in Bangalore to help');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 104, 6, 40, 'them. I did not want any of them to ever say, "Daddy was so busy serving');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 104, 7, 40, 'the Lord that he had no time for us." I would also take my sons out for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 104, 8, 40, 'a personal outing, one by one, once a month, usually on a Saturday or a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 104, 9, 40, 'holiday. We would go out and eat something simple somewhere and talk');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 104, 10, 40, 'together. My sons always looked forward to these "dates". Unfortunately,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 104, 11, 40, 'because of my frequent travelling I did not do this as much as I should');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 104, 12, 40, 'have. One of the greatest regrets I have today is that I did not spend');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 104, 13, 40, 'more time with each of my boys individually - because of the demands of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 104, 14, 40, 'the ministry.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 104, 15, 40, 'I remember vividly how, on the birthday of one of my sons, I had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 104, 16, 40, 'promised to take him out for the evening. He was all dressed up and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 104, 17, 40, 'excited to go. But just then a brother from our church came to see me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 104, 18, 40, 'with a problem and I spent a long time counselling him. By the time I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 104, 19, 40, 'had finished, it had become dark and it was too late to take my boy to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 104, 20, 40, 'the park. My son was terribly disappointed. To this day I remember that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 104, 21, 40, 'incident with great regret. I could have asked that brother to come and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 104, 22, 40, 'meet me the next day, since it was not an urgent matter. But I was not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 104, 23, 40, 'wise then. However, my son forgave me - and when I asked him about this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 104, 24, 40, 'incident much later, he did not even remember it. God is so good!! I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 104, 25, 40, 'would advise fathers to spend more time with their children and to keep');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 104, 26, 40, 'all the promises they make to them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 104, 27, 40, 'I wanted to win the hearts of my boys at any cost - so that they would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 104, 28, 40, 'follow the Lord wholeheartedly. I wanted them to be servants of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 105, 1, 40, 'Lord, ("as tentmakers"), as Paul served the Lord and as I myself was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 105, 2, 40, 'serving Him. Today I am thankful that all of them love the Lord - and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 105, 3, 40, 'also respect and honour Annie and me for what we tried to do for them -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 105, 4, 40, 'as imperfect parents.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 105, 5, 40, 'All glory be to God alone.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 105, 6, 41, 'Chapter 40 My Style Of Preaching');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 105, 7, 41, 'God, in His great wisdom, decided that He would save people by "the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 105, 8, 41, 'foolishness of preaching" (1 Corinthians 1:21 - KJV). Preaching God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 105, 9, 41, 'Word is therefore the greatest work that any human being can be engaged');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 105, 10, 41, 'in. I feel greatly honoured that God called me to this ministry. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 105, 11, 41, 'preaching is also the one ministry that has been abused the most, by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 105, 12, 41, 'money-loving preachers and deceivers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 105, 13, 41, 'We are commanded to seek earnestly for the gift of prophecy (which is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 105, 14, 41, 'the gift of preaching in such a way as to encourage, challenge and build');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 105, 15, 41, 'up people - 1 Corinthians 14:1, 3). So I began to seek God for this gift');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 105, 16, 41, 'as soon as I was baptized in water. And when God anointed me with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 105, 17, 41, 'Holy Spirit, He gave me this gift as well. In the beginning, I was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 105, 18, 41, 'tempted to try and impress people with my preaching and to move them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 105, 19, 41, 'emotionally. But one day the Lord asked me, "Do you want to help people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 105, 20, 41, 'or do you want to impress them." I said I wanted to help them. Then the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 105, 21, 41, 'Lord said, "Then don''t try to impress them." It was not easy to overcome');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 105, 22, 41, 'the temptation to impress people, but I fought against it, and gradually');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 105, 23, 41, 'overcame it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 105, 24, 41, 'Each preacher has his own particular style of preaching. Most Indian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 105, 25, 41, 'preachers imitate American charismatic preachers. I decided that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 105, 26, 41, 'best thing for me would be to pattern my preaching after Jesus'' style of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 105, 27, 41, 'preaching. So I studied the way Jesus preached.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 105, 28, 41, 'The first thing I saw about Jesus was that He preached only what He had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 106, 1, 41, 'already practised. He did first and then taught (Acts 1:1). So His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 106, 2, 41, 'preaching always had a practical application. I knew that the Bible');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 106, 3, 41, 'commanded me to "prophesy only according to the proportion of my faith"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 106, 4, 41, '(Romans 12:6) - in other words, only up to the level of my spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 106, 5, 41, 'experience. But I failed here, because I fell a prey to the temptation');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 106, 6, 41, 'to impress people. And so, I ended up in a backslidden condition for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 106, 7, 41, 'some years. But God was merciful to me and filled me with the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 106, 8, 41, 'Spirit again in January 1975 and restored me. I decided then, that I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 106, 9, 41, 'would preach thereafter only what I had already practiced and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 106, 10, 41, 'experienced, or (at least) what I was earnestly seeking after. God then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 106, 11, 41, 'took me through varied trials in order to teach me His ways and how to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 106, 12, 41, 'trust Him in difficult situations. Thus I grew in faith and wisdom - and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 106, 13, 41, 'I could pass on this faith and wisdom to others through my preaching.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 106, 14, 41, 'Secondly, Jesus always preached in the power of the Holy Spirit. When He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 106, 15, 41, 'walked with the two disciples to Emmaus, He preached to them for two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 106, 16, 41, 'hours and their hearts burned within them throughout those two hours. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 106, 17, 41, 'kept this example before me and wanted to preach like that every time. A');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 106, 18, 41, 'chicken-leg taken out of the freezer is totally unappetizing. But the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 106, 19, 41, 'same leg when cooked on a fire makes everyone''s mouth to water. That is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 106, 20, 41, 'the difference between cold truth and the same truth preached with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 106, 21, 41, 'fire of the Holy Spirit. Utter dependence on the anointing of the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 106, 22, 41, 'Spirit therefore became primary in all my preaching. I depend on God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 106, 23, 41, 'every time I speak to anoint me, so that my words will set people''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 106, 24, 41, 'hearts on fire.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 106, 25, 41, 'Thirdly, Jesus spoke primarily to people''s minds and not to their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 106, 26, 41, 'emotions. His preaching challenged people and convicted them and stirred');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 106, 27, 41, 'them to faith and obedience. He never whipped up their emotions the way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 106, 28, 41, 'many preachers do nowadays. We are told to love God with all our hearts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 107, 1, 41, 'and also with all our minds. I felt that all my messages must be like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 107, 2, 41, 'well-cooked meals - both nourishing and tasty!! So I needed to take more');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 107, 3, 41, 'pains in preparing a sermon than any housewife ever took to prepare a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 107, 4, 41, 'good meal. A good housewife also lays out her meal in an attractive way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 107, 5, 41, 'I also needed to arrange my thoughts clearly, before I preached. Many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 107, 6, 41, 'preachers do not do this - and end up wasting people''s time by wandering');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 107, 7, 41, 'around in their preaching. God is a God of order (1 Corinthians 14:33,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 107, 8, 41, '40) - and He is glorified when a message is presented in an orderly,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 107, 9, 41, 'understandable way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 107, 10, 41, 'Fourthly, Jesus had the right word for each occasion because of two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 107, 11, 41, 'reasons: He listened to His Father constantly (Isaiah 50:4) and He had a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 107, 12, 41, 'great love for people. So I studied God''s Word in all my spare moments');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 107, 13, 41, 'to know God''s mind accurately. To understand the Scriptures, many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 107, 14, 41, 'preachers study Hebrew and Greek. But I saw that what I needed was not a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 107, 15, 41, 'knowledge of these languages, but the revelation of the Holy Spirit,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 107, 16, 41, 'since He was the Author of the Word. The Holy Spirit taught me many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 107, 17, 41, 'glorious truths from His Word that I never heard from any human being.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 107, 18, 41, 'These truths led me to a close walk with God and saved me from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 107, 19, 41, 'deceptions and counterfeits that are flooding Christendom today. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 107, 20, 41, 'Spirit then enabled me to teach these truths to others. The Holy Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 107, 21, 41, 'also flooded my heart with love and compassion for His people (Romans');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 107, 22, 41, '5:5). Thus my ministry gradually became one of encouragement and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 107, 23, 41, 'conviction, and not one of legalism and condemnation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 107, 24, 41, 'Fifthly, Jesus'' preaching was always interesting - and never boring. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 107, 25, 41, 'is a sin to waste people''s time. Most preachers don''t realize that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 107, 26, 41, 'stealing people''s time is just like stealing their money. If we bore a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 107, 27, 41, 'congregation of 200 people for just 15 minutes, we have thereby robbed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 107, 28, 41, 'them of 50 man-hours of their time. If their average wage is Rs. 50 per');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 108, 1, 41, 'hour, we would thus have stolen Rs. 2,500 from them in those 15 minutes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 108, 2, 41, 'So I prayed to God that He would help me to preach in an interesting way');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 108, 3, 41, 'and never bore anyone. In the early days, I could do this only for short');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 108, 4, 41, 'periods of time. So I spoke only briefly then. As I grew in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 108, 5, 41, 'knowledge of the Lord, I could speak for longer periods of time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 108, 6, 41, 'Sixthly, Jesus used many simple illustrations to make His message clear.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 108, 7, 41, 'He spoke about bread, fishes, birds, trees, flowers, pearls, farmers,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 108, 8, 41, 'buildings, etc. His simple illustrations made the deep truths He spoke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 108, 9, 41, 'about, much easier to understand. He did not seek to get a name for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 108, 10, 41, 'himself by using complicated illustrations that only clever people could');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 108, 11, 41, 'understand. I sought to follow Jesus'' example here too. At times, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 108, 12, 41, 'would look at some of the least educated people sitting in my church,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 108, 13, 41, 'and speak at their level. Then I found that my messages could be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 108, 14, 41, 'understood by everyone. I would ask little children after my preaching,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 108, 15, 41, 'whether they had understood what I had said. If they had not, then I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 108, 16, 41, 'knew that my preaching had to become still more simple.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 108, 17, 41, 'Seventhly, Jesus used humour and exaggeration at times. He spoke of a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 108, 18, 41, 'camel going through a needle''s eye, of people straining out mosquitoes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 108, 19, 41, 'and swallowing camels, of those who had big logs in their eyes while');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 108, 20, 41, 'looking for specks in the eyes of others - and thus He exposed hypocrisy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 108, 21, 41, 'and spiritual pride. Humour can sharpen a message and make it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 108, 22, 41, 'interesting, just like spices can add taste to food. Some preachers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 108, 23, 41, 'however go to an extreme in this, and try to make people laugh all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 108, 24, 41, 'time (just to get a reputation for humour). Such preachers become like');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 108, 25, 41, 'circus-clowns! I never use humour in my messages to entertain people -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 108, 26, 41, 'but only to keep them attentive during a long message, or to drive home');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 108, 27, 41, 'a point.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 108, 28, 41, 'Eighthly, Jesus repeated His messages many times. He did not seek for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 109, 1, 41, 'the honour that one can get, by preaching something new or fanciful on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 109, 2, 41, 'each occasion. People need to hear the same truth many times before they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 109, 3, 41, 'can be gripped by it. So I decided that I would not try to impress');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 109, 4, 41, 'people by preaching something new in every message, but would repeat a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 109, 5, 41, 'message many times, until people were gripped by that truth. But every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 109, 6, 41, 'time I repeated a message, I would seek to present it in a fresh way, as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 109, 7, 41, 'led by the Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 109, 8, 41, 'Ninthly, Jesus spoke without using notes. Because His walk with the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 109, 9, 41, 'Father was so close and intimate, the Spirit gave Him words to speak,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 109, 10, 41, 'even while He was preaching. Most preachers cannot speak like that,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 109, 11, 41, 'because they do not walk so close to God. And so it is best for 99% of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 109, 12, 41, 'preachers to prepare their messages carefully and to use written notes,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 109, 13, 41, 'if they want to preach effectively. That was how I started. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 109, 14, 41, 'nowadays, I speak most of the time without using any notes. But when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 109, 15, 41, 'taking a Bible-study, I still use notes and write down the verses so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 109, 16, 41, 'that I don''t forget any point. So I''m not a slave to either using, or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 109, 17, 41, 'not using notes, since neither of these methods is more spiritual than');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 109, 18, 41, 'the other. If anyone wants to speak effectively without using notes:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 109, 19, 41, 'If anyone doesn''t have all these five qualities, then it is better for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 109, 20, 41, 'him to use notes when preaching.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 109, 21, 41, 'Finally, Jesus never shouted while preaching (Matthew 12:19). Nor did He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 109, 22, 41, 'say "Hallelujah" every now and then in His messages. I have followed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 109, 23, 41, 'Jesus'' example here too. When preachers shout in their preaching, it is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 109, 24, 41, 'not the fire of the Holy Spirit usually, but just their soulish attempts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 109, 25, 41, 'to manipulate people; and their "Hallelujah"s are merely a habit or');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 109, 26, 41, '"time-fillers", while they are thinking of what to say next!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 109, 27, 41, 'In my preaching, I sought to get people to obey God''s Word and to take');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 109, 28, 41, 'up the cross daily and follow Jesus - and not just to move them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 110, 1, 41, 'emotionally for a short time. The goal of my preaching has been "to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 110, 2, 41, 'present every man perfect in Christ" (Colossians 1:28, 29; 1 Timothy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 110, 3, 41, '1:5).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 110, 4, 42, 'Chapter 41 God’s Time Is The Best Time');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 110, 5, 42, '"There is an appointed time for everything. And there is a time for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 110, 6, 42, 'every event under heaven" (Ecclesiastes 3:1)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 110, 7, 42, 'Even though man''s need existed from the time of Adam''s sin, yet the Son');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 110, 8, 42, 'of God waited in heaven for 4000 years before He came to save man. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 110, 9, 42, 'He came "at the right time" (Galatians 4:4 - TEV). And after coming to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 110, 10, 42, 'earth, He still waited 30 years in Nazareth for "His hour to come",');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 110, 11, 42, 'before He began His preaching ministry (John 2:4).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 110, 12, 42, 'There is a right time for us too - for every ministry.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 110, 13, 42, 'By 1995, I had preached God''s Word in most of the states in India, but I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 110, 14, 42, 'had never visited Mizoram. An evangelical church in Aizawl (capital of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 110, 15, 42, 'Mizoram) arranged a series of special meetings in October 1995 to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 110, 16, 42, 'celebrate 100 years of Christianity in Mizoram. They made enquiries for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 110, 17, 42, 'a speaker and someone (whom they respected) told them that if they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 110, 18, 42, 'wanted to hear the whole truth, they should invite me!! And so they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 110, 19, 42, 'invited me and I went.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 110, 20, 42, 'When I reached Aizawl, it was raining heavily. I immediately thought of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 110, 21, 42, 'Elijah who asked the Lord to stop the rain 3000 years ago. And I prayed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 110, 22, 42, 'that the Lord would stop the rain here for the next seven days, so that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 110, 23, 42, 'people could come to the meetings more easily. I remembered that Elijah');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 110, 24, 42, 'also prayed saying, "Lord, let these people (who respect Baal''s prophets');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 110, 25, 42, 'and consider me to be a false prophet) know that I am Your servant" (1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 110, 26, 42, 'Kings 18:36). And I prayed Elijah''s second prayer as well - I didn''t');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 110, 27, 42, 'know why!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 110, 28, 42, 'The Lord answered my first prayer and the rain stopped completely before');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 111, 1, 42, 'the first evening meeting started; and we had clear weather for all the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 111, 2, 42, 'seven days of the meetings!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 111, 3, 42, 'It was only after the meetings were all over, that I heard this amazing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 111, 4, 42, 'story: The elders of this church had wanted to invite me many years');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 111, 5, 42, 'prior to this. But they had been told that I was teaching heresy, and so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 111, 6, 42, 'they had not invited me earlier. It had rained heavily in Aizawl for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 111, 7, 42, 'seven consecutive days before the meetings. When the church-elders saw');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 111, 8, 42, 'the heavy rain, they began to wonder whether God was telling them');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 111, 9, 42, 'thereby that they had invited the wrong preacher for their meetings!!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 111, 10, 42, 'The senior elder told me (after all the meetings were over) that on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 111, 11, 42, 'day before the meetings were to begin, he had prayed publicly at their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 111, 12, 42, 'morning prayer-meeting saying, "Lord, if Zac Poonen is really Your');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 111, 13, 42, 'servant Whom You have chosen to speak at our meetings, then give us a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 111, 14, 42, 'sign by stopping the rain and giving us clear weather at the first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 111, 15, 42, 'evening meeting."');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 111, 16, 42, 'God gave those believers more than the sign that they had asked for: The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 111, 17, 42, 'weather was clear for all seven days of the meetings. And to confirm');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 111, 18, 42, 'that it was God Who had done that, it began to rain heavily once again,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 111, 19, 42, 'the very next day after the meetings were all over!! There was also a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 111, 20, 42, 'two-day strike in Aizawl after the meetings were over, that paralysed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 111, 21, 42, 'life in the city. But God had restrained both the forces of nature and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 111, 22, 42, 'the forces of rebellion during the seven days of the meetings!! Then I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 111, 23, 42, 'understood why I had prayed Elijah''s second prayer too. God answered');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 111, 24, 42, 'that as well!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 111, 25, 42, 'I preached 15 messages on "Perfect Freedom in Christ" and "True');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 111, 26, 42, 'Discipleship". And while there was no physical rain during the meetings,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 111, 27, 42, 'there was plenty of spiritual rain at all the meetings!! About 600');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 111, 28, 42, 'people were present at the first meeting. This number increased to about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 112, 1, 42, '1200 on the last day, with many people standing outside the building on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 112, 2, 42, 'the main road. The Holy Spirit moved mightily. On the last two evenings,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 112, 3, 42, 'I asked all those who wanted to repent and surrender everything to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 112, 4, 42, 'Lord, and who wanted to take up the cross daily and follow Jesus, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 112, 5, 42, 'who wanted the baptism in the Spirit, to stand up. Hundreds stood up and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 112, 6, 42, 'I prayed for them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 112, 7, 42, 'The church-leaders were excited to see the work the Lord had done. One');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 112, 8, 42, 'of them told me that they had heard sugar-coated words from other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 112, 9, 42, 'preachers in the past, but now they had heard the pure unadulterated');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 112, 10, 42, 'truth of God, for the first time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 112, 11, 42, 'I understood then why the Lord had allowed people to warn these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 112, 12, 42, 'church-leaders against me earlier. If they had not been warned against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 112, 13, 42, 'me, they would have invited me to Aizawl ten years earlier, when the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 112, 14, 42, 'ground in the hearts there was not ready. And then my labour would have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 112, 15, 42, 'been wasted. God saw that - and so He allowed the church-leaders to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 112, 16, 42, 'prejudiced against me for ten years. Once the ground in those people''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 112, 17, 42, 'hearts was ready, God removed their prejudice and took me there - at the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 112, 18, 42, 'right time - to proclaim the full counsel of God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 112, 19, 42, 'I have seen God working in a similar way in other places too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 112, 20, 42, 'Everyone needs to hear the full gospel - but people''s hearts have to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 112, 21, 42, 'prepared to hear it. The ground has to be ploughed up in their hearts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 112, 22, 42, 'before the seed can be sown. And God alone knows when any group of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 112, 23, 42, 'people is ready to hear His full truth. If we live in the will of God,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 112, 24, 42, 'He will lead us to such people at the right time. God''s ways are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 112, 25, 42, 'perfect. It is best therefore to accept His timing in all our movements');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 112, 26, 42, 'and to give thanks for opposition too - for even that can only fulfil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 112, 27, 42, 'God''s purposes. God uses what Satan does, to further His purposes. Thus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 112, 28, 42, 'He makes a fool of Satan again and again.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 113, 1, 42, 'Praise the Lord!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 113, 2, 43, 'Chapter 42 God Adds To The Church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 113, 3, 43, 'Two proofs that God is still working in a church are that He adds');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 113, 4, 43, 'wholehearted disciples to it and removes from it those who are not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 113, 5, 43, 'interested in following the Lord. We read in the Scriptures:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 113, 6, 43, '"The Lord added to their number those who were being saved" (In those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 113, 7, 43, 'days, only those who accepted the message of discipleship were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 113, 8, 43, 'considered "saved") (Acts 2:47).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 113, 9, 43, 'We have seen our heavenly Father work in both these ways in our church,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 113, 10, 43, 'from the very beginning.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 113, 11, 43, 'In a country like India, with over one billion people, to find those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 113, 12, 43, 'want to be disciples of the Lord Jesus Christ is like looking for a few');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 113, 13, 43, 'needles in a hundred thousand haystacks!! We can spend a lifetime');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 113, 14, 43, 'searching through these haystacks, and even then find only one or two');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 113, 15, 43, 'needles. But a more efficient method would be to put very powerful');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 113, 16, 43, 'magnets outside these haystacks. The needles will then be drawn out of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 113, 17, 43, 'the haystack by the magnets - with minimum effort! This is the best and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 113, 18, 43, 'most efficient way of finding those who are wholehearted. And this is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 113, 19, 43, 'the way God wants it done too. Jesus said that others would know that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 113, 20, 43, 'are His disciples when they see our love for one another. (John');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 113, 21, 43, '13:33-35). It is our witness as a church that is to draw others to us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 113, 22, 43, 'And so we wanted our church (and all the churches the Lord planted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 113, 23, 43, 'through us) to be such magnets that drew disciples out of the thousands');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 113, 24, 43, 'of haystacks in India - and elsewhere too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 113, 25, 43, 'Since the Lord commanded us to make disciples (and not converts)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 113, 26, 43, '(Matthew 28:18-20), we preached the three conditions of discipleship');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 113, 27, 43, '(mentioned in Luke 14:26-33) from the very beginning, - loving Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 113, 28, 43, 'supremely, dying to Self daily and being free from attachment to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 114, 1, 43, 'material things we possessed. We wanted to gather together in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 114, 2, 43, 'churches only those who were interested in fulfilling these conditions');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 114, 3, 43, 'of discipleship.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 114, 4, 43, 'So we prayed that the Lord would add to our number those who wanted to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 114, 5, 43, 'be such disciples. We never invited anyone to join our churches. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 114, 6, 43, 'wanted people to join us on their own. In all these years, since 1975, I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 114, 7, 43, 'have never invited a single person to become a member of any of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 114, 8, 43, 'churches. We have received only those who came to us entirely on their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 114, 9, 43, 'own. We believed that the Lord would send to us those whom we were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 114, 10, 43, 'called to shepherd and minister to. It is the Lord Himself Who adds');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 114, 11, 43, 'people to His church. Jesus said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 114, 12, 43, 'We believed that this would be true of us as Christ''s Body on earth too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 114, 13, 43, 'The Lord used amazing ways to add disciples to us. Here are some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 114, 14, 43, 'examples.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 114, 15, 43, 'In a nearby country, there was a war that led to many people having to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 114, 16, 43, 'leave everything and to flee with their families in little boats. Some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 114, 17, 43, 'of those boats sank in the sea and many drowned and died. But some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 114, 18, 43, 'survived and reached the shores of India. The Indian government housed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 114, 19, 43, 'these refugees in a camp. Two of our churches were located near this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 114, 20, 43, 'camp. So some of our brothers from those churches visited these refugees');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 114, 21, 43, '(who were unconverted nominal Christians) and shared the gospel with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 114, 22, 43, 'them. As a result, a number of them were born again. Our brothers then');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 114, 23, 43, 'visited them regularly in their camp and established them as a church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 114, 24, 43, 'They also attended a number of our conferences in Bangalore and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 114, 25, 43, 'elsewhere, for about two years. Their eagerness to share their testimony');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 114, 26, 43, 'was so great that they would rush to the pulpit at our conferences and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 114, 27, 43, 'testify boldly. Our other church-members hardly got a chance to testify');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 114, 28, 43, 'when they were there!! We were all challenged by their zeal. In one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 115, 1, 43, 'conference, after I had spoken about how the Bible taught that wives');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 115, 2, 43, 'should submit to their husbands, as the church is to Christ, one');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 115, 3, 43, 'newly-married wife from among them, wept and prayed to the Lord and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 115, 4, 43, 'begged Him to give her grace to be a submissive wife right from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 115, 5, 43, 'beginning of her marriage. Never in my life had I heard a wife weep and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 115, 6, 43, 'pray so fervently with such a request!!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 115, 7, 43, 'After about two years, the Indian government decided to send them back');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 115, 8, 43, 'to their homeland. But by then, these believers had been well');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 115, 9, 43, 'established in the faith and we could appoint three among them as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 115, 10, 43, 'elders, before they went back. So God timed their stay in India');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 115, 11, 43, 'perfectly. Some time after they returned to their homeland, there was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 115, 12, 43, 'war again in their area, and they were dispersed into three different');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 115, 13, 43, 'areas. But amazingly, each of these three groups had one of the elders');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 115, 14, 43, 'we had appointed among them! So they could function as three churches');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 115, 15, 43, 'under the leadership of those elders. Many others were also added to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 115, 16, 43, 'these churches through their witness there. One of our brothers visited');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 115, 17, 43, 'them a few times and had meetings among them and encouraged them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 115, 18, 43, 'In another small town, there was not a single church there, since the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 115, 19, 43, 'time of Christ. One of our brothers was transferred there for his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 115, 20, 43, 'official work. He witnessed to others while he lived there and the Lord');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 115, 21, 43, 'saved a number of people. He and another brother (from one of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 115, 22, 43, 'churches) laboured together in this town, and in a few years a fine');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 115, 23, 43, 'church was established there - the first one in that town in 2000 years.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 115, 24, 43, 'Very soon thereafter, we appointed elders to lead this new church. In a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 115, 25, 43, 'few years, this church grew further and reached out to the surrounding');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 115, 26, 43, 'areas and two more churches were planted in those places. We have had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 115, 27, 43, 'conferences there regularly now for some years, when more than 1200');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 115, 28, 43, 'people gather together to praise the Name of Jesus.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 116, 1, 43, 'Another one of our brothers decided to settle down in a new place, to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 116, 2, 43, 'start a small business there. Here too, there was not a single church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 116, 3, 43, 'since the time of Christ. Through this brother''s witness there, some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 116, 4, 43, 'became disciples and there is a fine church there today - for the first');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 116, 5, 43, 'time in 2000 years.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 116, 6, 43, 'The greatest miracle however, that God has done in our midst during the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 116, 7, 43, 'last 50 years, is not the planting of churches where none existed for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 116, 8, 43, '2000 years, but the raising up of godly elders to lead the many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 116, 9, 43, 'churches. To find spiritually-minded leaders who are willing to serve');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 116, 10, 43, 'and shepherd God''s lambs and sheep, without any payment whatsoever, is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 116, 11, 43, 'an amazing miracle in a country like India - where most Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 116, 12, 43, 'workers are salaried workers - with the money coming mainly from foreign');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 116, 13, 43, 'sources. God however, has sent us men who have served in our churches as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 116, 14, 43, 'elders and shepherds, freely - for decades now. Because we don''t pay any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 116, 15, 43, 'elder a salary, we have been protected from many "Christian racketeers"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 116, 16, 43, 'who would have joined us otherwise. This is the problem that many other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 116, 17, 43, 'Christian churches and organizations are facing today.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 116, 18, 43, 'Our magnets scattered across the country have drawn some fine and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 116, 19, 43, 'genuine needles out from the haystack. We hope to draw many more in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 116, 20, 43, 'days to come.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 116, 21, 43, 'Praise the Lord!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 116, 22, 44, 'Chapter 43 God Removes From The Church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 116, 23, 44, 'In the last chapter, we saw how God adds to the church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 116, 24, 44, 'God also removes from the church "the proud, exulting ones" (Zephaniah');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 116, 25, 44, '3:8-17).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 116, 26, 44, 'The apostle John saw this happening in his day. He said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 116, 27, 44, 'The elders of each church determine what spiritual standard they want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 116, 28, 44, 'maintain in their church. Churches that have no standards of holiness');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 117, 1, 44, 'will not have anyone leaving them. But churches that desire to live by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 117, 2, 44, 'the standards that Jesus taught, will find as Jesus Himself found, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 117, 3, 44, 'many will leave them. And we have seen this happening in our midst too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 117, 4, 44, 'Those who left our churches first of all were the rich and the mighty');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 117, 5, 44, 'who were offended because they did not receive the preferential');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 117, 6, 44, 'treatment in our midst that they were used to receiving in the world and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 117, 7, 44, 'in other churches. It was not their wealth or their position that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 117, 8, 44, 'hindered them from becoming disciples of Jesus, but their pride in these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 117, 9, 44, 'things. We never cared for anyone''s earthly wealth or position. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 117, 10, 44, 'honoured only those who were humble and God-fearing - whether they were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 117, 11, 44, 'rich or poor (Psalm 15:4).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 117, 12, 44, 'Some others left us because they wanted to become elders in our churches');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 117, 13, 44, '- and were not appointed as elders! And some who were appointed as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 117, 14, 44, 'elders, left us when they were asked to step down from eldership,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 117, 15, 44, 'because of their unfaithfulness to their charge. Some of them wanted to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 117, 16, 44, 'make money through their preaching abilities (1 Peter 5:2) - and we are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 117, 17, 44, 'commanded to stay away from all who preach the gospel to make money (1');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 117, 18, 44, 'Timothy 6:3). Others ruled over the flock as lords (1 Peter 5:3). And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 117, 19, 44, 'some of them attached people to themselves and not to the Lord (Acts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 117, 20, 44, '20:30)! God replaced all these elders with better men and thus confirmed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 117, 21, 44, 'to us that it was He Himself Who had removed them.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 117, 22, 44, 'Others left us because they wanted to be connected with some rich,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 117, 23, 44, 'Western church - and not to a poor Indian church like ours. Most Indian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 117, 24, 44, 'Christians believe that Western Christians are spiritually superior, and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 117, 25, 44, 'so they are abjectly subservient to them. Many churches in India never');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 117, 26, 44, 'have any special meetings without at least one American or European');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 117, 27, 44, 'preacher as their main speaker. Only thus can they attract people to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 117, 28, 44, 'their meetings! We however, treated people of all races as our equals');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 118, 1, 44, 'and sought to draw people to our churches by the anointing of the Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 118, 2, 44, 'and the message we preached - and not by the colour of the preacher''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 118, 3, 44, 'skin!! Many Indian Christians latch on to Western groups for the sake of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 118, 4, 44, 'financial gain and to get free trips to the West!! We stood against all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 118, 5, 44, 'such "seeking of one''s own".');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 118, 6, 44, 'Then there were a number who left us because they felt that the standard');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 118, 7, 44, 'of holiness we preached was too high! We preached discipleship, the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 118, 8, 44, 'baptism of the Holy Spirit (and His gifts), victory over all conscious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 118, 9, 44, 'sin, the sermon on the mount (Matthew Chapters 5, 6 & 7), pressing on to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 118, 10, 44, 'perfection, walking as Jesus walked, a godly family-life, taking up the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 118, 11, 44, 'cross daily, separation from the spirit of the world, freedom from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 118, 12, 44, 'love of money, fasting and prayer, forgiving everyone from the heart,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 118, 13, 44, 'loving others as Jesus loved us, building the local church as Christ''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 118, 14, 44, 'Body, etc. Such preaching stumbled a number of people and so they left');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 118, 15, 44, 'us. But this did not disturb us - for we knew that many were offended');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 118, 16, 44, 'with Jesus'' message too, and had left Him (John 6:60, 66). But it did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 118, 17, 44, 'amaze us that Christians who chose the best schools for their children''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 118, 18, 44, 'education and the best hospitals for their medical treatment, chose');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 118, 19, 44, 'churches with low standards of holiness for their spiritual fellowship.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 118, 20, 44, 'This only proved that they valued earthly things more than spiritual');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 118, 21, 44, 'things and their bodies more than their souls.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 118, 22, 44, 'But we were more amazed to see that some who had no desire for a godly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 118, 23, 44, 'life still chose to stay in our churches. We discovered however, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 118, 24, 44, 'they stayed on, only because they found a good atmosphere in our midst');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 118, 25, 44, 'for their families. Our church was like a good club that charged no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 118, 26, 44, 'membership fees!! And so a number of "Babylonian" Christians still');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 118, 27, 44, 'stayed on in our churches. Jesus had a Judas Iscariot in His church too!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 118, 28, 44, 'We sought, however, to maintain a high standard among the elders in our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 119, 1, 44, 'churches, with frequent meetings and conferences designed specifically');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 119, 2, 44, 'for them. God raised up some fine men to be elders in our churches. Many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 119, 3, 44, 'of them were not eloquent preachers, but they sought the glory of Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 119, 4, 44, 'and had a genuine concern for the welfare of God''s people (Philippians');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 119, 5, 44, '2:19-21). If we could not find even one such brother in a place, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 119, 6, 44, 'would not start a church there - for without a godly shepherd, we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 119, 7, 44, 'realized that the sheep would only go astray.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 119, 8, 44, 'As we look at our churches today, we see that we are still far short of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 119, 9, 44, 'what God wants us to be. But we are pressing on to perfection and we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 119, 10, 44, 'seek to maintain the standard of holiness that Jesus taught -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 119, 11, 44, 'irrespective of who joins us or who leaves us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 119, 12, 44, 'The church is God''s dwelling place - just like the tabernacle was in the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 119, 13, 44, 'Old Testament. That tabernacle had three parts - outer court, holy place');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 119, 14, 44, 'and most holy place. In the outer court, great numbers of people crowded');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 119, 15, 44, 'around the altar and the laver (symbolizing forgiveness of sins and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 119, 16, 44, 'water-baptism). In the holy place however, the number was much smaller.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 119, 17, 44, 'There, the lampstand, table of bread and altar of incense symbolized the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 119, 18, 44, 'anointing of the Holy Spirit, the study of God''s Word and prayer. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 119, 19, 44, 'into the most holy place, no-one could enter, in Old Testament times. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 119, 20, 44, 'is this sacred area that is open today for all who seek fellowship with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 119, 21, 44, 'God, who surrender their all to Him, and who seek to worship Him in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 119, 22, 44, 'spirit and in truth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 119, 23, 44, 'These three parts of the tabernacle represent three circles of intimacy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 119, 24, 44, 'with God. And every church (including ours) consists of people who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 119, 25, 44, 'choose to live in one of these three areas. The overcomers however are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 119, 26, 44, 'the ones who choose to live in the most holy place all the time, and who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 119, 27, 44, 'will therefore remain faithful to the Lord until the end. They are the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 119, 28, 44, 'ones who constitute the real strength of our churches - and of every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 120, 1, 44, 'church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 120, 2, 45, 'Chapter 44 The New Covenant Pattern Of Ministry');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 120, 3, 45, 'Right from the beginning of our work in India, we decided that we would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 120, 4, 45, 'follow the pattern found in the New Testament in every aspect of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 120, 5, 45, 'ministry - and not what we saw in the churches around us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 120, 6, 45, 'In the first century, the Lord used apostles, prophets, evangelists,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 120, 7, 45, 'shepherds and teachers to build His church (Ephesians 4:11). We prayed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 120, 8, 45, 'that we would have all these five ministries to build the church in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 120, 9, 45, 'India in our day as well.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 120, 10, 45, 'Apostles');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 120, 11, 45, 'Apostles were those who planted churches and appointed their elders');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 120, 12, 45, '(Acts 14:23). They were spiritual fathers to the elders and guided the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 120, 13, 45, 'churches that they planted. They did not make their churches into a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 120, 14, 45, 'denomination, but allowed each church to be self-governing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 120, 15, 45, 'We did not see any apostolic ministry in most of the churches around us.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 120, 16, 45, 'What we saw among them mostly were two man-made systems of church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 120, 17, 45, 'government:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 120, 18, 45, 'In both these systems, there were no spiritual fathers - only elected');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 120, 19, 45, 'and paid leaders. We rejected both these man-made systems and chose to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 120, 20, 45, 'follow the apostolic pattern described in the New Testament.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 120, 21, 45, 'Prophets');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 120, 22, 45, 'Prophets (1 Corinthians 12:28) were those whose ministry revealed the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 120, 23, 45, 'secret sins and failures in a church and who could prescribe the remedy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 120, 24, 45, 'as well (1 Corinthians 14:25). Their ministry was to challenge,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 120, 25, 45, 'encourage and build-up the church (1 Corinthians 14:3). But such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 120, 26, 45, 'prophetic ministry was rarely seen in our day. What we did see were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 120, 27, 45, 'false prophets who deceived the believers by pretending to predict their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 120, 28, 45, 'future (like fortune-tellers do). The Lord protected us from such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 121, 1, 45, 'deceivers and gave us genuine prophetic ministry in our midst.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 121, 2, 45, 'Evangelists');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 121, 3, 45, 'Evangelists were those who brought people to Christ and added them to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 121, 4, 45, 'the local church. But in our day, we saw the emphasis on "evangelistic');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 121, 5, 45, 'crusades", where those who came to Christ were not being gathered');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 121, 6, 45, 'together and built up into local New-Testament churches. Most of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 121, 7, 45, 'conversions recorded in the book of Acts, came through personal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 121, 8, 45, 'evangelism. And God gave us some outstanding personal evangelists, who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 121, 9, 45, 'not only brought people to Christ but added them to the local churches');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 121, 10, 45, 'as well. We also urged our brothers and sisters to pray that the Holy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 121, 11, 45, 'Spirit would lead them to those around them who were seeking for a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 121, 12, 45, 'God-fearing life. The Lord answered those prayers and added many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 121, 13, 45, 'disciples to our churches. We were about four families when we first met');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 121, 14, 45, 'in my house in August 1975. But God added many thousands to us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 121, 15, 45, 'thereafter, from all parts of the world - and most of this was through');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 121, 16, 45, 'personal evangelism.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 121, 17, 45, 'Shepherds');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 121, 18, 45, 'The shepherd (translated as "pastor" in Ephesians 4:11) is a gift given');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 121, 19, 45, 'to the church - and not the title of the leader of a church (as in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 121, 20, 45, 'churches these days). The leaders of the New Testament church were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 121, 21, 45, 'called elders - not pastors - and there was always more than one elder');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 121, 22, 45, 'in every church. So we decided that every church that the Lord planted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 121, 23, 45, 'through us, would have at least two elders. At times, we had to wait for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 121, 24, 45, 'some time before we could find men who qualified to be elders. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 121, 25, 45, 'gradually, the Lord gave us godly elders to lead each church. But we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 121, 26, 45, 'needed many shepherds (pastors) in every church (besides the elders) to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 121, 27, 45, 'help in shepherding the flock. Jesus'' example showed us that one man');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 121, 28, 45, 'could effectively shepherd only 12 adults. So a church with 120 people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 122, 1, 45, 'would need at least 10 shepherds (pastors). God gave us many brothers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 122, 2, 45, 'with a shepherd-heart to care for the lambs and sheep, but we have not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 122, 3, 45, 'attained the proportion of 1 shepherd for 12 people as yet.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 122, 4, 45, 'Teachers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 122, 5, 45, 'The teacher in the New Testament had the task of teaching believers "to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 122, 6, 45, 'do everything that Jesus had commanded" (Matthew 28:20). They did not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 122, 7, 45, 'expound the Scriptures academically. Their teaching was always practical');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 122, 8, 45, 'and designed to lead people to obedience to our Lord''s commands -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 122, 9, 45, 'commands such as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 122, 10, 45, 'We never heard any teaching on these truths in most of the churches');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 122, 11, 45, 'around us. But God gave us teachers who taught the believers how to obey');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 122, 12, 45, 'such commands of the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 122, 13, 45, 'Financial Support for Workers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 122, 14, 45, 'In the New Testament, the Lord''s servants were supported financially in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 122, 15, 45, 'two ways: Some were supported by the gifts of believers, while others');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 122, 16, 45, 'like Paul supported themselves. But in India, almost every Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 122, 17, 45, 'worker was either a salaried worker of a church or supported by gifts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 122, 18, 45, 'from believers. So we saw a great need for some workers in India to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 122, 19, 45, 'support themselves and thereby demonstrate the second method of support');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 122, 20, 45, 'found in the New Testament - and thus restore the balance. So I decided');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 122, 21, 45, 'to support myself and to serve the churches in India freely. I also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 122, 22, 45, 'decided that I would not receive any royalties for my books and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 122, 23, 45, 'audio-tapes that our church published. I encouraged my fellow-elders');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 122, 24, 45, 'also to follow my example. The amazing miracle we have seen is that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 122, 25, 45, 'now have more than 70 elders in the churches in India, who have been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 122, 26, 45, 'serving the Lord freely for many, many years. And some of them are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 122, 27, 45, 'serving in India''s poorest villages.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 122, 28, 45, 'Reports');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 123, 1, 45, 'The New Testament contains many letters written by the apostles. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 123, 2, 45, 'they never gave any reports about their work in those letters. Nor did');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 123, 3, 45, 'they ask for any money to support themselves or their ministry. But');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 123, 4, 45, 'almost every Christian organization (that we knew) sent out reports of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 123, 5, 45, 'their work regularly - and brazenly asked people for money. We decided');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 123, 6, 45, 'to follow the example of the apostles - and never to send out any');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 123, 7, 45, 'reports or photographs of our work, or to hint about our financial needs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 123, 8, 45, 'to anyone but our heavenly Father. We have followed this policy from the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 123, 9, 45, 'time we started the work in 1975 - and God has abundantly supplied all');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 123, 10, 45, 'our needs. Paul shared the reports of his labours only with his');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 123, 11, 45, 'fellow-workers - and we have done likewise.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 123, 12, 45, 'Fellowship');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 123, 13, 45, 'Fellowship and unity among His disciples was the primary burden of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 123, 14, 45, 'Jesus'' prayer in John 17. And this was the goal of the apostles too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 123, 15, 45, 'Most of the churches around us however emphasized activity - meetings');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 123, 16, 45, 'and more meetings - and not fellowship and unity. We valued meetings.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 123, 17, 45, 'But we felt that fellowship was more important. So we organized picnics');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 123, 18, 45, 'and other functions, at which we got to know each other better. We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 123, 19, 45, 'played games at these picnics with our young people and children and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 123, 20, 45, 'thus deepened our fellowship with each other. Thus we built a depth of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 123, 21, 45, 'fellowship among us that was precious and unparalleled.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 123, 22, 45, 'There were many other areas like this, where we did things differently');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 123, 23, 45, 'from the churches around us. It was a battle to pioneer these new ways');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 123, 24, 45, 'of doing things and to return to the practices of the New Testament.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 123, 25, 45, 'Satan opposed us vehemently and many Christians criticized us. But God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 123, 26, 45, 'was with us - and that was all that mattered.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 123, 27, 46, 'Chapter 45 The New Covenant Message');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 123, 28, 46, 'When we first started gathering together as a church, we did not know');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 124, 1, 46, 'victory - either in our personal lives or in our home lives. When we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 124, 2, 46, 'looked at other believers, we found that they too were in the same');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 124, 3, 46, 'condition. So we could not turn to any of them for help. So we fasted');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 124, 4, 46, 'and prayed frequently as a church and sought God for an answer. We spent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 124, 5, 46, 'most of the public holidays in fasting and prayer. Gradually God began');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 124, 6, 46, 'to reveal truths to us about the new covenant from His Word that we had');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 124, 7, 46, 'never known before. As we began to understand these truths, we became');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 124, 8, 46, 'more and more liberated - and our lives and our homes were gradually');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 124, 9, 46, 'transformed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 124, 10, 46, 'I felt a responsibility then to proclaim these truths to others. It');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 124, 11, 46, 'became clear to me that God was calling me to emphasize those truths in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 124, 12, 46, 'the Bible that other Christians were not preaching. So I listened');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 124, 13, 46, 'carefully to what others around me were teaching. Thus I discovered what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 124, 14, 46, 'I was called to emphasize in my teaching ministry.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 124, 15, 46, 'The Full Gospel');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 124, 16, 46, 'I heard some preachers using the expression "the full gospel". But when');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 124, 17, 46, 'I compared what they taught with Scripture, I found that they were not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 124, 18, 46, 'preaching the full gospel at all. In Hebrews 4 the Holy Spirit describes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 124, 19, 46, '"the gospel" (verse 2), as "entering into Canaan" and not just "coming');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 124, 20, 46, 'out of Egypt". I also read there that God''s people were to enter into a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 124, 21, 46, '"Sabbath rest" of victory (verse 9). So I saw that the message of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 124, 22, 46, 'forgiveness of sins was only half the gospel. The full gospel included');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 124, 23, 46, 'overcoming sin as well (slaying the giants in our flesh). As such a life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 124, 24, 46, 'gradually became a reality to me, I began to preach the full gospel.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 124, 25, 46, 'Repentance');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 124, 26, 46, 'Most evangelists were preaching faith in Christ as the only requirement');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 124, 27, 46, 'for forgiveness of sins. Repentance from sin was hardly being preached');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 124, 28, 46, 'at all. And even where repentance was mentioned, the root of sin was not');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 125, 1, 46, 'being clearly defined as selfishness, self-centredness and wanting one''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 125, 2, 46, 'own way. So people did not know what exactly they had to hate and what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 125, 3, 46, 'they had to turn away from. I saw that my calling was to explain the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 125, 4, 46, 'root of sin clearly so that everyone would know what they had to repent');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 125, 5, 46, 'of.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 125, 6, 46, 'Discipleship');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 125, 7, 46, 'Most converts were not being taught that they had also to become');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 125, 8, 46, 'disciples of Christ. The three conditions of discipleship (that Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 125, 9, 46, 'laid down) were not being explained:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 125, 10, 46, 'This therefore became a major emphasis in my preaching.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 125, 11, 46, 'The Baptism in the Holy Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 125, 12, 46, 'Almost every group that preached the baptism in the Holy Spirit taught');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 125, 13, 46, 'that its initial evidence was "speaking in tongues". But I saw that most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 125, 14, 46, 'of those who taught this were worldly-minded and lovers of money. At the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 125, 15, 46, 'other extreme, I saw some believers who were convinced that all speaking');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 125, 16, 46, 'in tongues was from the devil!! But Jesus taught that the evidence of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 125, 17, 46, 'the baptism in the Spirit would be power - power to BE His witnesses');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 125, 18, 46, '(referring to the way we lived) and not merely to bear witness (by what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 125, 19, 46, 'we spoke) (Acts 1:8). And so, I proclaimed that. Speaking in tongues was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 125, 20, 46, 'only one of the gifts of the Spirit that He gave to some. Because of my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 125, 21, 46, 'stand on this issue, the ''Pentecostal'' folk labelled me as ''Brethren''.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 125, 22, 46, 'And the ''Brethren'' folk labelled me as ''Pentecostal''!! I was quite happy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 125, 23, 46, 'to be equidistant from both these extremes.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 125, 24, 46, 'Mercy and Grace');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 125, 25, 46, 'For many years as a believer, I had considered mercy and grace to be the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 125, 26, 46, 'same thing. But I discovered one day that "mercy" referred primarily to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 125, 27, 46, 'the forgiveness of sins, whereas "grace" referred to the power that God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 125, 28, 46, 'gave us to overcome sin and the trials of life (Hebrews 4:16; Romans');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 126, 1, 46, '6:14; 2 Corinthians 12:9). And this ''grace'' came through Christ (John');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 126, 2, 46, '1:17) and became available only after the Holy Spirit came to indwell');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 126, 3, 46, 'man on the day of Pentecost. This also became a major part of my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 126, 4, 46, 'message.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 126, 5, 46, 'The Humanity of Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 126, 6, 46, 'While all Christians worshipped Christ as God very few emphasized that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 126, 7, 46, 'He was also a Man whose example we could follow. Some who did emphasize');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 126, 8, 46, 'His humanity denied that He was God when He was on earth. It was rare to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 126, 9, 46, 'find Christians who proclaimed the balanced Scriptural view that Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 126, 10, 46, 'was fully God and fully Man. But I saw that "the secret of living a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 126, 11, 46, 'godly life" lay in seeing Christ having overcome sin as a Man (1 Timothy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 126, 12, 46, '3:16; Hebrews 4:15, 16). This too became a major emphasis in my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 126, 13, 46, 'preaching.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 126, 14, 46, 'Money');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 126, 15, 46, 'When we started our work in 1975, the prosperity gospel (that we hear so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 126, 16, 46, 'much of today) was not in vogue. But Christians still loved money just');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 126, 17, 46, 'as they do today. Jesus taught that those who loved money hated God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 126, 18, 46, '(Luke 16:13). But I never heard a single preacher preach this message.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 126, 19, 46, 'Most churches only taught their members to pay their tithes. But tithing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 126, 20, 46, 'was part of the old-covenant law that had been abolished in Christ. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 126, 21, 46, 'preached the liberating new covenant message of giving joyfully,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 126, 22, 46, 'secretly and voluntarily to the Lord. Another thing I saw was that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 126, 23, 46, 'hardly any church in India (that I knew of) preached strongly against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 126, 24, 46, 'the evil practice of asking for a dowry in marriages - a practice that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 126, 25, 46, 'degraded women all over India. I preached strongly against this evil');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 126, 26, 46, 'practice; and when conducting weddings, took signed certificates from');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 126, 27, 46, 'both the bride and the bridegroom that stated that no money had been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 126, 28, 46, 'exchanged between them or between their parents.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 127, 1, 46, 'Soul and Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 127, 2, 46, 'This was another subject that was not being preached. In Old Testament');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 127, 3, 46, 'times, there was no clear revelation on the difference between man''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 127, 4, 46, 'soul and his spirit. But the New Testament makes a clear distinction');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 127, 5, 46, 'between the two (Hebrews 4:12). Since most Christians did not know this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 127, 6, 46, 'distinction clearly, they were being deceived by the psychological');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 127, 7, 46, 'gimmicks of clever preachers and by emotional counterfeits of the gifts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 127, 8, 46, 'of the Holy Spirit. So I taught people the difference between what is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 127, 9, 46, 'truly spiritual; and what is merely soulish.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 127, 10, 46, 'The Local Body of Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 127, 11, 46, 'I saw clearly that the final goal of God was to make all His children');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 127, 12, 46, 'into one Body in Christ. The New Testament church was to be a Body and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 127, 13, 46, 'not a congregation. In a Body (as in the human body), every member would');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 127, 14, 46, 'be connected to the other members and each would have a unique function.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 127, 15, 46, 'Christ alone would be the Head and all the others would be equal');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 127, 16, 46, 'members. I saw that this was the type of church that God wanted to see');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 127, 17, 46, 'in every locality on earth. And so I decided to spend my life building');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 127, 18, 46, 'such expressions of Christ''s Body wherever possible on earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 127, 19, 46, 'The New Covenant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 127, 20, 46, 'All these truths were related to the new covenant that God had made with');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 127, 21, 46, 'man through the death and resurrection of Christ. I saw that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 127, 22, 46, 'greatest need among believers was for their eyes to be opened to see the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 127, 23, 46, 'greater glory of the new covenant compared to the old covenant. This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 127, 24, 46, 'therefore became the major thrust of all my preaching - and it continues');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 127, 25, 46, 'to be so.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 127, 26, 46, 'These were some of the major truths that God showed me that I sought to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 127, 27, 46, 'proclaim by every possible means - preaching, books, tapes, etc. - to my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 127, 28, 46, 'fellow-believers. My burden was to spread these truths all over India.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 128, 1, 46, 'But God saw fit to spread these messages even further - to people in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 128, 2, 46, 'many other countries as well.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 128, 3, 46, 'All glory be to His Name alone.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 128, 4, 47, 'Chapter 46 The Mistakes We Made');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 128, 5, 47, 'Just as babies to learn to walk only after falling down often, God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 128, 6, 47, 'allows His children also to learn to walk in the Spirit, only after they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 128, 7, 47, 'fall numerous times. Apart from our Lord Jesus Himself, no man or church');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 128, 8, 47, 'ever avoided making mistakes as they sought to walk with the Lord. As a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 128, 9, 47, 'church, we also made many mistakes - from the very beginning. But we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 128, 10, 47, 'decided to acknowledge our mistakes and to learn lessons from them, so');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 128, 11, 47, 'that we did not repeat them. Thus our blunders became less and less as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 128, 12, 47, 'we went on.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 128, 13, 47, 'The apostle Paul made many mistakes too - circumcising Timothy (Acts');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 128, 14, 47, '16:3), shaving his head to fulfil a Jewish vow (Acts 21:24-26) and even');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 128, 15, 47, 'getting angry with a judge towards the end of his life (Acts 23:3). Luke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 128, 16, 47, '(Paul''s close companion) was the one who wrote Acts. Left to himself,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 128, 17, 47, 'Luke would not have mentioned any of Paul''s mistakes - as is the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 128, 18, 47, 'practice of most biographers. But when Paul knew that Luke was writing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 128, 19, 47, 'about him, he must have compelled Luke to write about his (Paul''s)');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 128, 20, 47, 'mistakes as well, because Paul did not "want anyone to think more highly');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 128, 21, 47, 'of him than he should" (2 Corinthians 12:6 - TLB).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 128, 22, 47, 'We do not want anyone to think too much of us either.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 128, 23, 47, 'Social Work');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 128, 24, 47, 'The first mistake we made was to help everyone who came to us for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 128, 25, 47, 'financial and material help. We were few in number and poor, but we were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 128, 26, 47, 'generous with what we had - and very unwise. In a country like India,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 128, 27, 47, 'there are many who will pretend to be Christians and join a church only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 128, 28, 47, 'to take advantage of its generosity. We helped people with money. My');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 129, 1, 47, 'wife prepared numerous meals for visitors and did day-care for mothers');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 129, 2, 47, 'who left their babies in our home. Numerous families who visited');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 129, 3, 47, 'Bangalore stayed in our home and took advantage of our hospitality. One');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 129, 4, 47, 'of those people even dropped our newborn son on the concrete floor once,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 129, 5, 47, 'while tossing him around, as if he were a ball. We served others to show');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 129, 6, 47, 'them the love of Christ, hoping that some of them would become disciples');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 129, 7, 47, 'of our Lord. My wife and I do not regret any of the sacrifices we made.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 129, 8, 47, 'We knew that we had to pay a price if we wanted to build the Body of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 129, 9, 47, 'Christ. But gradually we realized that God had not called us to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 129, 10, 47, 'social work but to make disciples. We also found that almost every');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 129, 11, 47, 'single person whom we helped thus, left the church as soon as we stopped');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 129, 12, 47, 'helping them. That showed us that they had no interest in becoming');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 129, 13, 47, 'disciples of Christ, but only wanted financial and physical help. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 129, 14, 47, 'world is full of people who are looking for monetary help and for free');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 129, 15, 47, 'service!! So we learnt our lesson and decided thereafter to concentrate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 129, 16, 47, 'on making disciples. We still help the poor where we can, but we do it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 129, 17, 47, 'more wisely now.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 129, 18, 47, 'Legalism');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 129, 19, 47, 'The second serious mistake we made in our pursuit of holiness was to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 129, 20, 47, 'emphasize the letter of Scripture rather than its spirit. This is a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 129, 21, 47, 'mistake made by almost all who pursue holiness and perfection. We knew');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 129, 22, 47, 'that worldliness was to be found in the attitude of our mind and not in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 129, 23, 47, 'externals; but we still emphasized some externals like dress-styles and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 129, 24, 47, 'the length of people''s hair, etc. We were influenced unfortunately, by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 129, 25, 47, 'some of the "holiness" preachers who visited us and preached to us. Some');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 129, 26, 47, 'of their teachings were good but they were mixed with heavy doses of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 129, 27, 47, 'legalism. It was like eating a chicken curry with a dead lizard in it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 129, 28, 47, 'that could poison us and kill us. In time, we realized that external');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 130, 1, 47, 'changes only made people greater Pharisees! Most evangelical Christian');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 130, 2, 47, 'churches are either at one extreme of worldliness or at the other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 130, 3, 47, 'extreme of legalism. It was not easy to find the narrow way to life that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 130, 4, 47, 'lay between these two extremes. But that was what we sought to find. By');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 130, 5, 47, 'God''s grace, we slowly found it and began to experience what it means to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 130, 6, 47, 'walk in the Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 130, 7, 47, 'The Inward Look');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 130, 8, 47, 'Another mistake that we made in our pursuit of holiness was to look');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 130, 9, 47, 'inside constantly and to examine ourselves and dig out all the dirt we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 130, 10, 47, 'could discover in our flesh - and the flesh is a very deep pit (Romans');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 130, 11, 47, '7:18). Even the songs we sang were inward looking. We hardly ever sang a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 130, 12, 47, 'song of pure thanksgiving and praise to God. The result was that we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 130, 13, 47, 'became gloomy and morose ourselves and hard and judgmental toward');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 130, 14, 47, 'others. But God in His great love for us, amazingly removed the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 130, 15, 47, 'legalistic influences and the songs that we were singing, that depressed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 130, 16, 47, 'us. And He led us out into "the glorious liberty of the children of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 130, 17, 47, 'God". We realized then that we are to run the Christian race, looking at');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 130, 18, 47, 'Jesus alone - and not inside ourselves. It is as we see His glory, that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 130, 19, 47, 'we will see our own need more clearly and readily acknowledge it too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 130, 20, 47, 'Then we can trust Him to deliver us from those sins. That way, there');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 130, 21, 47, 'will be neither depression nor gloom in our lives.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 130, 22, 47, 'Gifts of the Spirit');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 130, 23, 47, 'Another mistake we made was the lack of a strong emphasis on the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 130, 24, 47, 'exercise of the gifts of the Holy Spirit. As a church, we started out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 130, 25, 47, 'emphasizing the baptism and the gifts of the Spirit. But then in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 130, 26, 47, 'pursuing the fruit of the Spirit, and in a pendulumitis-reaction to the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 130, 27, 47, 'wild extremes that we had seen among the charismatics and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 130, 28, 47, 'Pentecostals, and due to the influence of preachers who never spoke');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 131, 1, 47, 'about the gifts of the Spirit, we ignored many of the gifts of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 131, 2, 47, 'Spirit. The result was that believers in our midst did not experience');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 131, 3, 47, 'the power and the gifts that the early Christians had. It took many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 131, 4, 47, 'years for us to come back to preaching and emphasizing the power of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 131, 5, 47, 'Spirit and His supernatural gifts.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 131, 6, 47, 'The Ministry of Women');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 131, 7, 47, 'Yet another mistake that many elders in our churches made was caused by');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 131, 8, 47, 'their male chauvinism and the prejudices of Indian culture. They');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 131, 9, 47, 'followed the Brethren-assembly practice of keeping the women silent.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 131, 10, 47, 'Although women were allowed to pray, they were never encouraged to share');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 131, 11, 47, 'God''s Word in the church-meetings or to guide and encourage the younger');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 131, 12, 47, 'sisters. These elders forgot that under the new covenant "God''s sons and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 131, 13, 47, 'daughters could prophesy" (Acts 2:17). As a result, old-covenant');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 131, 14, 47, 'practices continued in almost all our churches for many years and many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 131, 15, 47, 'of our young sisters lacked godly counsel from older sisters and thereby');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 131, 16, 47, 'suffered spiritually. My wife had the gift of prophecy. I knew that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 131, 17, 47, 'because I had been blessed by her prophesying myself - on a number of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 131, 18, 47, 'occasions. But I did not want to push her forward in the church. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 131, 19, 47, 'taught the new covenant privileges of God''s daughters in the churches.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 131, 20, 47, 'But it took many years for some of our elders to change their views and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 131, 21, 47, 'to align their views with Scripture. It is very difficult to break free');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 131, 22, 47, 'from traditions that have been acquired over a period of many years.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 131, 23, 47, 'Consequently, many young people suffer.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 131, 24, 47, 'There were other lesser mistakes that we made. But God was gracious to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 131, 25, 47, 'us and we progressed.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 131, 26, 47, 'All movements decline over a period of time as more and more people');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 131, 27, 47, 'start joining it who are not serious about being disciples of the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 131, 28, 47, 'Elder brothers also can backslide when they experience God''s blessing on');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 132, 1, 47, 'their labours and become financially prosperous. We have seen this');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 132, 2, 47, 'happen in our midst too. We are no different from any other movement');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 132, 3, 47, 'that God has raised up through the centuries. So we walk in humility and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 132, 4, 47, 'brokenness before Him and ask Him to preserve us in faithfulness to Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 132, 5, 47, 'until the end.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 132, 6, 47, 'God has given us an excellent and fantastically loyal group of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 132, 7, 47, 'co-workers, in Bangalore and in other places. And through them, God has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 132, 8, 47, 'built a quality of fellowship amongst us that is unique - a fellowship');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 132, 9, 47, 'that has protected and preserved our children and that has been a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 132, 10, 47, 'foretaste of heaven itself. We have never found anything like it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 132, 11, 47, 'anywhere else. For this we are deeply thankful to the Lord.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 132, 12, 47, 'Our greatest encouragement through all these years has been that God has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 132, 13, 47, 'given us light continually on our errors and mistakes and the imbalances');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 132, 14, 47, 'that we have. The greatest proof of God''s blessing on our lives is His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 132, 15, 47, 'giving us light on the un-Christlike areas in our lives and making us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 132, 16, 47, 'Christlike in those areas by the power of His Spirit. This message needs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 132, 17, 47, 'to be emphasized in a day when many Christians are being taught that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 132, 18, 47, 'financial prosperity and physical health are the primary marks of God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 132, 19, 47, 'blessing.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 132, 20, 47, 'All glory be to God alone for His mercy and His grace that He has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 132, 21, 47, 'showered upon us - day after day and year after year.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 132, 22, 48, 'Chapter 47 Making Disciples In All Nations');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 132, 23, 48, 'Since it was easier to make converts than disciples, most churches in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 132, 24, 48, 'India made only converts. But we decided to take our Lord''s command');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 132, 25, 48, 'seriously, to make disciples (Matthew 28:19). And so we proclaimed the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 132, 26, 48, 'standards of holiness that Jesus proclaimed in the sermon on the mount');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 132, 27, 48, '(Matthew 5 to 7). We taught what Jesus taught - that no-one could follow');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 132, 28, 48, 'Him who did not die to Self daily (Luke 9:23) and that anyone who loved');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 133, 1, 48, 'money could not love God (Luke 16:13).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 133, 2, 48, 'God has a particular calling . Our churches were raised up by God not to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 133, 3, 48, 'do missionary work among the unreached - because many thousands were');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 133, 4, 48, 'already doing this good and necessary work in India. He called us to do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 133, 5, 48, 'what was not being done by the others - to make the converts into');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 133, 6, 48, 'disciples. He told us to teach believers those Biblical truths that');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 133, 7, 48, 'other preachers were not teaching, to lead them into new-covenant life');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 133, 8, 48, '(the new wine) and then to build them together in new-covenant churches');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 133, 9, 48, '(the new wineskin). Many believers criticized us for not engaging in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 133, 10, 48, 'evangelism, but we stuck to our calling. We knew that all parts of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 133, 11, 48, 'Body do not have the same function. The hand takes food from the plate');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 133, 12, 48, 'and puts it into the mouth (a picture of evangelism), while the kidneys');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 133, 13, 48, 'spend all their time just purifying the bloodstream and maintaining the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 133, 14, 48, 'balance of chemicals in the blood (a picture of purifying believers and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 133, 15, 48, 'making them balanced). We stuck to our God-given calling as "kidneys" in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 133, 16, 48, 'the Body.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 133, 17, 48, 'We also followed the financial principles found in the New Testament: We');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 133, 18, 48, 'never paid any of our church-elders a salary. Every elder had to support');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 133, 19, 48, 'himself or trust the Lord for his needs, just like the apostles and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 133, 20, 48, 'elders in the New Testament. And like the apostles, we also never made');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 133, 21, 48, 'our financial needs known to anyone.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 133, 22, 48, 'Most Christian work in India is heavily dependent on Western money and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 133, 23, 48, 'this is why so much of Indian Christianity is so shallow. God''s work');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 133, 24, 48, 'cannot be done through dependence on money. So we decided not to join');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 133, 25, 48, 'any foreign organization. We decided to depend on the Holy Spirit alone.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 133, 26, 48, 'We knew that if we followed these New Testament principles, our growth');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 133, 27, 48, 'would be very slow. But that did not disturb us because we knew that the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 133, 28, 48, 'Lord looked for quality in His work and not quantity. As the Lord''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 134, 1, 48, 'servants, we were responsible for "quality control" in His church. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 134, 2, 48, 'Lord would take care of the "quantity" aspect. And He did that. He added');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 134, 3, 48, 'to our churches those whom we were supposed to shepherd - and He added');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 134, 4, 48, 'them at the right time - when we were able to handle it. God''s ways are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 134, 5, 48, 'perfect.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 134, 6, 48, 'We knew that only few would choose this way of discipleship, for Jesus');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 134, 7, 48, 'had said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 134, 8, 48, 'We knew from these words of our Lord, that if we proclaimed His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 134, 9, 48, 'standards faithfully, very few would join us. We could increase our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 134, 10, 48, 'numbers only by lowering our standards. But we refused to be false');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 134, 11, 48, 'prophets! It was not right to sacrifice even one Biblical principle for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 134, 12, 48, 'the sake of larger numbers.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 134, 13, 48, 'The Message Bible translation of the above verses reads thus:');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 134, 14, 48, 'God keeps His servants hidden and tests them in secret before He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 134, 15, 48, 'entrusts a ministry to them. He kept Moses hidden in the backside of the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 134, 16, 48, 'desert for 40 years and tested him before He sent him to lead Israel out');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 134, 17, 48, 'of Egypt. Jesus was kept hidden for 30 years in Nazareth and tested');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 134, 18, 48, 'before He was sent forth into His ministry. God kept our church also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 134, 19, 48, 'hidden in the same way. For about 20 years (from 1975 to 1995) He kept');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 134, 20, 48, 'our church hidden under a covering of reproach, misunderstanding and');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 134, 21, 48, 'criticism from other Christians. God tested us to see if we would stand');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 134, 22, 48, 'true to Him when faced with such strong opposition from others. He also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 134, 23, 48, 'tested us to see if we would retaliate against our accusers or trust Him');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 134, 24, 48, 'alone to defend us and vindicate us in His time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 134, 25, 48, 'Once we had passed these tests, God began to open one door after another');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 134, 26, 48, 'for us all over the world, to proclaim the glorious gospel of the new');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 134, 27, 48, 'covenant - that had produced such wonderful fruit in our lives and in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 134, 28, 48, 'our homes. The numbers who responded to these truths were still small,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 135, 1, 48, 'but the outreach was worldwide.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 135, 2, 48, 'We did this outreach mainly through literature, cassettes, CDs and the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 135, 3, 48, 'Internet. This was not the work of any one man, but the work of many men');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 135, 4, 48, 'and women in the Body of Christ who worked together to spread God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 135, 5, 48, 'Word.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 135, 6, 48, 'Literature');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 135, 7, 48, 'Sticking to our calling, we published books and magazines about those');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 135, 8, 48, 'subjects in the New Testament that others never wrote about. God gave');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 135, 9, 48, 'some of our brothers a burden to translate and publish these books in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 135, 10, 48, 'other Indian languages - and they worked hard to produce and distribute');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 135, 11, 48, 'these translations. Thus the word of the Lord spread far and wide in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 135, 12, 48, 'South India - and many churches were established. About one million');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 135, 13, 48, 'copies of our books in many languages have now gone into people''s hands.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 135, 14, 48, 'Cassettes and CDs');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 135, 15, 48, 'One of our smaller churches copied and distributed nearly 35,000 tapes');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 135, 16, 48, 'and CDs of our messages to people in their city. Many who got these');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 135, 17, 48, 'tapes made copies of them and distributed them to others in many lands.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 135, 18, 48, '(We encourage people to do that). In the USA, two church-leaders added');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 135, 19, 48, 'our tapes to their church''s tape catalogues. This resulted in about');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 135, 20, 48, '100,000 tapes of our messages being circulated freely by them in many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 135, 21, 48, 'lands. In South India, a mission-leader invited me to take a study of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 135, 22, 48, 'every book of the Bible in his Bible-college in December 2000. God gave');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 135, 23, 48, 'me grace to do this in 70 hours - over a 14-day period, speaking 5 hours');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 135, 24, 48, 'every day. The messages were recorded digitally on a CD. Thus we');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 135, 25, 48, 'produced the first audio CD in the world to contain 70 hours of study');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 135, 26, 48, 'covering every book of the Bible on a single CD. This CD also has been');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 135, 27, 48, 'circulated widely, and has enabled thousands of believers in many lands');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 135, 28, 48, 'to understand the essential message of each book of the Bible.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 136, 1, 48, 'Internet');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 136, 2, 48, 'As the worldwide web became more and more accessible to people all over');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 136, 3, 48, 'the world, we decided to have a website for our church. This website has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 136, 4, 48, 'now become an amazing vehicle to reach people in many countries. At the');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 136, 5, 48, 'right time, God gave us an excellent team of technically-skilled');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 136, 6, 48, 'brothers to develop and maintain this website. Every week, we send out a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 136, 7, 48, 'short written message and put out a new video-message on this website.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 136, 8, 48, 'Many audio messages and all our books in English (and in a few other');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 136, 9, 48, 'languages) are also available on this website. Everything is offered');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 136, 10, 48, 'freely for anyone in the world to read, listen, watch or download. This');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 136, 11, 48, 'has brought us in touch with many believers all over the world who are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 136, 12, 48, 'seeking for a godly life. In some countries, families who do not find a');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 136, 13, 48, 'good church to attend in their hometown, have made our weekly video');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 136, 14, 48, 'message their Sunday morning service at home - every week!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 136, 15, 48, 'All praise be to God alone for what He has done.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 136, 16, 49, 'Chapter 48 Looking Ahead');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 136, 17, 49, 'I face the future with total confidence because what is unknown to me is');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 136, 18, 49, 'fully known to my heavenly Father. And He has planned every detail of my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 136, 19, 49, 'future life and ministry - taking into consideration every circumstance');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 136, 20, 49, 'that I will ever face. Nothing takes Him by surprise - for He is God.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 136, 21, 49, 'And since my only desire in life is to please and glorify Him, I have no');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 136, 22, 49, 'fear or anxiety about the future.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 136, 23, 49, 'The greatest truth that God has taught me from the Bible is that He');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 136, 24, 49, 'loves me as much as He loved Jesus (John 17:23). And so He cares for me');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 136, 25, 49, 'as much as He cared for Jesus too. Everything in Jesus'' life was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 136, 26, 49, 'planned, down to the last detail, from His birth to His death. And God');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 136, 27, 49, 'has planned my life also in exactly the same way.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 136, 28, 49, 'I have a bridal relationship with my Lord (as described in the Song of');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 137, 1, 49, 'Solomon). This is a very personal, intimate and loving relationship. I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 137, 2, 49, 'live my life "leaning upon my beloved Lord" (Song of Solomon 8:5). And');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 137, 3, 49, 'it is out of this relationship that my ministry flows. My Lord and I go');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 137, 4, 49, 'to the harvest fields of the world together (Song of Solomon 7:11, 12).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 137, 5, 49, 'I have no desire to go to any place that He does not lead me to. I say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 137, 6, 49, '"Lord, You lead the way. Tell me where You are going and I''ll come along');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 137, 7, 49, 'with You. I will not choose where to go, on my own. And tell me also');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 137, 8, 49, 'what to preach - and I will preach it." And that is how I have served my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 137, 9, 49, 'Lord for these past many years.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 137, 10, 49, 'My ministry therefore has never been a burden and I have no complaints');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 137, 11, 49, 'about anything, or against anyone - not even against those who have');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 137, 12, 49, 'betrayed me, maligned me or sought to harm me. I love them all, because');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 137, 13, 49, 'my Saviour loves them all. And He has taught me to pray for those who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 137, 14, 49, 'seek to harm me, saying, "Father, forgive them, for they don''t know what');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 137, 15, 49, 'they are doing." My life and my times are in the Lord''s hands. People');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 137, 16, 49, 'could not harm Jesus or arrest Him "until His hour had come" (John 7:30;');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 137, 17, 49, '8:20). And no person or event can harm me "until my hour comes" either -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 137, 18, 49, 'and it is my heavenly Father Who determines that hour.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 137, 19, 49, 'God has never allowed Satan to harass me beyond my ability to overcome,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 137, 20, 49, 'at any time (1 Corinthians 10:13). God has made me "run against men"');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 137, 21, 49, 'first, and only then allowed me to run "against horses" (Jeremiah 12:5).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 137, 22, 49, 'And every trial that I have faced and overcome by God''s grace, has only');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 137, 23, 49, 'made me stronger. Thus I have been prepared to face even greater trials.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 137, 24, 49, 'My Christian walk has been an education - and trials have been the means');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 137, 25, 49, 'by which God has promoted me to a higher class each time! God''s grace');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 137, 26, 49, 'has been sufficient in every situation I have faced thus far. And it');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 137, 27, 49, 'will be sufficient for me in the future too. Thus I will complete my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 137, 28, 49, 'spiritual education on earth.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 138, 1, 49, 'The Lord has given me a specific ministry to fulfil in his Body -');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 138, 2, 49, 'primarily, to preach those particular Biblical truths that others are');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 138, 3, 49, 'not preaching and also to expose the un-Scriptural and un-Christlike');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 138, 4, 49, 'practices prevalent in Christendom today. And by God''s grace, I shall');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 138, 5, 49, 'fulfil that ministry until the very end.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 138, 6, 49, 'I know that I will face opposition in my ministry. That is only to be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 138, 7, 49, 'expected. Paul did not have a persecution-mania when he wrote, "All who');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 138, 8, 49, 'desire to live godly in Christ Jesus will be persecuted (2 Timothy');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 138, 9, 49, '3:12). He was facing reality - and was inspired by the Holy Spirit.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 138, 10, 49, 'Jesus told His disciples that they would be persecuted by the world, as');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 138, 11, 49, 'He was (John 15:18-21) - and Jesus was persecuted more by the Jewish');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 138, 12, 49, 'religious world than by the secular world. So I know that I will be');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 138, 13, 49, 'opposed more by religious Christians than by non-Christians. The');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 138, 14, 49, 'Pharisees were jealous of Jesus'' ministry and criticized Him. Religious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 138, 15, 49, 'Christians will be jealous of my ministry too and will criticize me.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 138, 16, 49, 'Jesus was accused of preaching false doctrine. So will I be. Jesus was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 138, 17, 49, 'taken to court - by the Pharisees. So will I be - by religious');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 138, 18, 49, 'Christians. Jesus'' enemies were the members of His own family (John');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 138, 19, 49, '7:5). So will mine be. Jesus said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 138, 20, 49, 'He also said,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 138, 21, 49, 'The only way a Christian can avoid such persecution is by keeping quiet.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 138, 22, 49, 'However the Lord''s promise to me has been,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 138, 23, 49, 'Some years ago, someone told me that a "Satanist group" in Bangalore was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 138, 24, 49, 'targeting me in their petitions to Satan. I had known for many years');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 138, 25, 49, 'that Satan hated me - because I was a servant of God and a threat to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 138, 26, 49, 'Satan''s kingdom. But I also knew that Satan could not touch me or my');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 138, 27, 49, 'family, because I was living under the headship of a Christ Who defeated');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 138, 28, 49, 'him on the cross. My family and I are surrounded by an army of angels');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 139, 1, 49, 'and we are part of a powerful Body of believers who pray for us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 139, 2, 49, 'constantly.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 139, 3, 49, 'The Lord told me recently, "As you were once afraid of Satan, from now');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 139, 4, 49, 'on Satan will be afraid of you, because I am with you." As Satan was');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 139, 5, 49, 'afraid of Jesus, he will be afraid of us too if we walk in the light,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 139, 6, 49, 'because "as Jesus is, so are we in this world" (1 John 4:17). So we do');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 139, 7, 49, 'not fear Satan at all.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 139, 8, 49, 'The trials and difficult situations that the Lord has allowed me to face');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 139, 9, 49, 'were all planned by Him to enable me to know His power and to experience');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 139, 10, 49, 'His deliverance. It is in the face of opposition from men and demons,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 139, 11, 49, 'that I have tasted and seen the power of God in operation. And such');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 139, 12, 49, 'experiences have enabled me to strengthen the faith of others too.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 139, 13, 49, 'Effective ministry comes not only through Bible-study and the anointing');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 139, 14, 49, 'of the Spirit, but also through facing trials and overcoming them (2');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 139, 15, 49, 'Corinthians 1:3-6).');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 139, 16, 49, 'God has blessed me with an amazing family. He gave me a wonderful wife,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 139, 17, 49, 'who has great spiritual discernment and a very simple lifestyle. She has');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 139, 18, 49, 'stood by me faithfully in my ministry, through all the many years of our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 139, 19, 49, 'married life. God also gave us four wonderful sons who love the Lord,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 139, 20, 49, 'and who love us and love the church too. And they are serving their');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 139, 21, 49, 'generation today, by spreading the truths of God''s Word that they saw in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 139, 22, 49, 'our lives and heard in our church.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 139, 23, 49, 'God has also given me an anointed team of coworkers, who are elders in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 139, 24, 49, 'the churches in India and in other countries. They do an excellent job');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 139, 25, 49, 'of shepherding their churches and have thus relieved me of many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 139, 26, 49, 'responsibilities, so that I can travel to other places and preach God''s');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 139, 27, 49, 'Word.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 139, 28, 49, 'We are living in days of a famine of the prophetic word (as predicted in');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 140, 1, 49, 'Amos 8:11, 12). Fresh revelation on God''s Word is very rare and most');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 140, 2, 49, 'preachers are lovers of money. Believers in many groups are getting fed');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 140, 3, 49, 'up with the boring sermons and the constant demands for money that they');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 140, 4, 49, 'hear from their leaders every week. In such a time, God is raising up');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 140, 5, 49, 'prophetic voices here and there, in many lands - and we praise God for');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 140, 6, 49, 'this.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 140, 7, 49, 'We are thankful for the privilege God has given us also, to have a small');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 140, 8, 49, 'part in proclaiming the prophetic word of life to believers in many');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 140, 9, 49, 'denominations. Some who listen to our messages are preaching those very');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 140, 10, 49, 'same messages in their own churches - churches that would never invite');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 140, 11, 49, 'me to speak! Thus God has penetrated every man-made barrier. Our');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 140, 12, 49, 'ministry is a very small part of the Body of Christ - but we want to');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 140, 13, 49, 'fulfil the particular ministry that God has given us for this time.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 140, 14, 49, 'My future path may be difficult or easy - I don''t know. But God will');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 140, 15, 49, 'choose what is best for me and I know He will "always lead me in His');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 140, 16, 49, 'triumph" (2 Corinthians 2:14). And since He is always on my side against');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 140, 17, 49, 'Satan, He will make me "more than a conqueror" in every situation.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 140, 18, 49, 'Predestination means that my final destination has been pre-determined');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 140, 19, 49, 'by God. That destination is not heaven but total likeness to Christ');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 140, 20, 49, '(Romans 8:29). Every day brings me closer to that destination. Praise');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 140, 21, 49, 'the Lord!! And if the pathway to that destination leads through a little');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 140, 22, 49, 'bit of suffering now on earth, I rejoice in it.');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 140, 23, 49, 'When I see my beloved Lord face to face, I want to hear Him say,');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 140, 24, 49, 'Amen!');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 140, 25, 49, 'Share');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 140, 26, 49, 'Who Am I');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 140, 27, 49, 'Our Message');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 140, 28, 49, 'Resources');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 141, 1, 49, 'Study Series');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 141, 2, 49, 'About us');
INSERT INTO book_content VALUES ('the_day_of_small_beginnings', 141, 3, 49, 'CHRISTIAN FELLOWSHIP CHURCH');
INSERT INTO books VALUES ('the_final_triumph', 'The Final Triumph', 'Zac Poonen', 'Verse by verse through Revelation.', 'the_final_triumph.jpg', 281, 7844, '2026-09-01T09:55:52.728Z');
